information suggested that the Defias were preparing something larger. His note was meant for Stoutmantle.",["sourceHash"]="a4d6117477875fad140f6b8e0ff247e16ba77a801e21fa507d5f13ba22ef4951"},[135]={["conclusion"]="Shaw recognized that the matter was more complicated than it first appeared.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="A mention of the Stonemasons raised a new question. Mathias Shaw in Stormwind might understand what it meant.",["sourceHash"]="e1ae7371fdbffac8dc595f8a3c9de1c50295dd117bbec6ffa630397de4390c99"},[141]={["conclusion"]="Stoutmantle received the report but still sought firmer proof of the connection.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="Shaw’s report connected the Stonemasons’ history to the rebuilding of Stormwind. It named Edwin VanCleef as their former leader.",["sourceHash"]="9762b346dfae57e2ea3e640055fc2c1eacf19cc69e59a17f08b76ad22e59f4ab"},[142]={["conclusion"]="The message confirmed VanCleef’s leadership in Stoutmantle’s account; locating the hideout became the next task.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="A messenger carried information about the Defias. Stoutmantle sought that message to establish where the investigation should lead.",["sourceHash"]="0add70b5459a27ae0d76d402060e41dfb5731a824bd4f4a43a5336ce84b46b0f"},[155]={["conclusion"]="The hideout’s location was reported to Stoutmantle. The expedition against its leader was still a separate undertaking.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="A Defias defector offered to reveal the hideout in exchange for protection. The assignment called for an escort.",["sourceHash"]="6a857e62b6f36f4f150eb902dd3217fd4bf0e287daf57a7e3ef5ccfde3ffa21a"},[166]={["conclusion"]="The militia regarded VanCleef’s defeat as a turning point for Westfall, while peace remained a hope rather than a settled world state.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="The investigation had reached its last charge: confront Edwin VanCleef and return proof to Stoutmantle.",["sourceHash"]="5430c176684c5c728c9b0b0c6958ccf1f6e108b81f92bc9fb8b5a0df3f30ad87"},[26]={["conclusion"]="The introduction opened a path toward two trials, rather than granting mastery of an animal form.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="Druid training turned toward the creatures of the water. The next lesson lay with Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven.",["sourceHash"]="2fc9cc916493b77c543b94d0ef2f7a0deb1d86840954daa49f3e1ff186144d70"},[27]={["conclusion"]="The introduction opened a path toward two trials, rather than granting mastery of an animal form.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="Druid training turned toward the creatures of the water. The next lesson lay with Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven.",["sourceHash"]="564248f30f2f8643885b62d8c5a200955aba7b2a95ec4463a04afc58a1ac6bee"},[272]={["conclusion"]="The joined pendant brought the Trial of the Sea Lion to its conclusion; training in the aquatic form still lay ahead.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="The sea lion’s agility and endurance were embodied in two halves of a pendant. Joining them would express both aspects together.",["sourceHash"]="b55d693beb938612d0ec18aa59825288c32ef9e85c67df4dc035ab9dd2c9155d"},[28]={["conclusion"]="The Trial of the Lake honored the balance preserved by Moonglade’s wardens.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="A bauble hidden in Lake Elune’ara formed the heart of a trial: carry its fading magic to the Shrine of Remulos.",["sourceHash"]="b8e721782ff375985b001d8480610991e9434119f86e3888a9df62b87a48b8bb"},[29]={["conclusion"]="The Trial of the Lake honored the balance preserved by Moonglade’s wardens.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="A bauble hidden in Lake Elune’ara formed the heart of a trial: carry its fading magic to the Shrine of Remulos.",["sourceHash"]="4045629255f288d76a55f85dc285df81b1135e18c82019c9c7d9e7028f760d1c"},[30]={["conclusion"]="The joined pendant brought the Trial of the Sea Lion to its conclusion; training in the aquatic form still lay ahead.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="The sea lion’s agility and endurance were embodied in two halves of a pendant. Joining them would express both aspects together.",["sourceHash"]="5d4aad6a491b54fc4456741a9ea27458aef8b7162046efe794a6044592ec567e"},[31]={["conclusion"]="The trainer’s final lesson centers on the aquatic aspect. The learning of a specific ability remains a separate milestone.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=2,["setup"]="The pendant was to be brought to Turak Runetotem in Thunder Bluff as proof of the druid’s lessons.",["sourceHash"]="66488cfae7d30d9839803e54a025c72f05dbc783bc97e80e40cd52c6f7391c68"},[5061]={["conclusion"]="The trainer’s final lesson centers on the aquatic aspect. The learning of a specific ability remains a separate milestone.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=2,["setup"]="The pendant was to be brought to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus as proof of the druid’s lessons.",["sourceHash"]="c076b97893fb1fccf9e2fd241eb0e8fcdda9959a216917417cd5003a57ed2b10"},[65]={["conclusion"]="Wiley acknowledged Stoutmantle’s request. The larger investigation remained unfinished.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="Gryan Stoutmantle sought the identity and hiding place of the Defias leadership. Wiley in Lakeshire offered a possible lead.",["sourceHash"]="cdb487bd417d2bc3a0619df16e974a5c1c33850d18c326eb5240652e4af30447"},[954]={["conclusion"]="Asterion’s presence emerged from the mystery, but the cause of his confinement was not yet resolved.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="A strange blue aura lingered among Bashal’Aran’s ruins. The mystery began with a search for its source.",["sourceHash"]="5567879d8ba64e634932ed384e7a7bf9807db8ff50f25ebf546ad627fc48c0e3"},[955]={["conclusion"]="The earrings showed recent contact with the binding magic, without supplying the seal itself.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="Asterion described a long magical imprisonment. Grell earrings were sought as clues to what bound him.",["sourceHash"]="1a0170ccbb423e2e56c02d1c03167080405737f1d7e03bdab81e2b9f1a7d4cc6"},[956]={["conclusion"]="The seal was recovered in the quest’s account. Destroying it remained another step.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="Asterion suspected that the satyrs held the seal binding him. The task called for the Ancient Moonstone Seal.",["sourceHash"]="bd5265c78a8d6a94de647f8520ac62ed0d966fd3ea90a511ca1e08f151088c13"},[957]={["conclusion"]="The quest’s conclusion freed Asterion from the binding seal. His later choices were not resolved by that freedom.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="A flame in Ameth’Aran offered a way to break the Ancient Moonstone Seal and release Asterion.",["sourceHash"]="c762bbd20452d4836b2705736e8a17ae2f8a7ceca131b94fbe60628591c954c8"},[958]={["conclusion"]="Thundris intended to destroy the recovered relics; the account did not establish a permanent cleansing of the ruins.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="Relics among Ameth’Aran’s ruins still carried traces of Highborne magic. Thundris Windweaver sought their removal.",["sourceHash"]="59074a550ae016bf9815327728aee076cd6e5a60835ea39b57f56de9b7ad256a"},[982]={["conclusion"]="The recovered effects were entrusted to Auberdine’s care. No personal reaction or reward receipt is inferred.",["proofFields"]={"description","completion"},["revision"]=1,["setup"]="Two wrecked ships off Darkshore held the effects of captains who had not returned. Gorbold Steelhand sought their lockboxes for the surviving crews.",["sourceHash"]="7aab55bfcb887d5bf6a5b6239927aea6f301b0ce9328f73efd2f239946b5c56e"}},["profileCounts"]={["COMPLETE"]=1,["MINIMAL"]=724,["PARTIAL"]=4206,["UNRESOLVED"]=89},["questMeta"]={[10]="DELIVER\03139\03148\031?\031?\0311446\031UNKNOWN\031\0316f42d017d4c43e4e6b15e3b5573d895ca3bea867a7fdad1b190cc6cecbefaadd\0317724:GIVER,7724:FINISHER",[100]="SPEAK\03120\03123\031178\03164\031?\031UNKNOWN\031\031874ea172c46a6cdace820de104962a16fcb876cacce871d195511cbea8fbdcef\0315895:FINISHER",[1000]="SPEAK\03154\03155\031178\031?\0311456\031UNKNOWN\0311004,1018\03150b20ad88b66de5d6e3880e513a9e9822a7b68920858679265b60f08cb6c0d24\03110881:GIVER,5769:FINISHER",[1001]="RECOVER\0317\03112\03177\031?\0311439\031UNKNOWN\031\031b6ee4722ce29c3b92e4290ebcba9895e30f1f06718e95d565370ffd01e3d4034\031",[1002]="RECOVER\0317\03114\03177\031?\0311439\031UNKNOWN\031\0318e61711e7a78157ee89f7f80e8b8809e668cb30a120fedb789975d6e444a0ced\031",[1003]="RECOVER\0317\03116\03177\031?\0311439\031UNKNOWN\031\031a27a1a9496dc48c522d26a438e631b80413b6d5bc7aaa5e8dbd236a174a4cd65\031",[1004]="SPEAK\03154\03155\031178\031?\0311458\031UNKNOWN\0311000,1018\0315a716d801cfc2a793691ad480c569644f768df53f2255b74757460cc25b69c04\03110879:GIVER,5769:FINISHER",[1007]="DELIVER\03119\03120\03177\031?\0311440\031UNKNOWN\031\031f1cb0bc84bac5365f39ba5f208fa08385334ac7d3678290b9f4ba4570a8d1806\0313846:GIVER,3846:FINISHER",[1008]="DELIVER\03114\03119\03177\031?\0311440\031UNKNOWN\031\031477aa646970849b31a416fb3a266897502ea42b23a1b828fe5c548fd20bb6a45\0313845:GIVER,3845:FINISHER",[1009]="DELIVER\03120\03125\03177\031?\0311440\031UNKNOWN\031\031cd8366c7d02152604873277495f6384041404e74abd18aae2b9f4cac181a4b54\0313846:GIVER,3846:FINISHER",[101]="DELIVER\03118\03125\03177\031?\0311431\031UNKNOWN\031\03176a985df4b9476f10e84cc94969a7634b79ce4f1ab89296563dd3d742eccf081\031265:GIVER,265:FINISHER",[1010]="DELIVER\03120\03120\03177\031?\0311440\031UNKNOWN\031\03146c7f301dfa8140a2ca9bf01067888b