ctiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030objectiveLabel3\030objectiveLabel4\030requestItems\030title\031Perfect, $N. While the Highvale work to recover their lost information, we will be able to seal off the lines even further...\030The Quel'Danil Lodge is a center of communication for the high elves of the Hinterlands. Their ambassadors are working to establish relationships with other races, with whom they share their knowledge of the Witherbark trolls that inhabit the area in the southern Hinterlands. All of the documents regarding the communications are kept at the lodge.$B$BWe don't need the Highvale building alliances with others, $N.$B$BDestroy the Highvale documents.  We need to burn their lines of communication... literally.\030Oran Snakewrithe in Undercity wants you to travel to the Hinterlands and burn the Highvale Records, Highvale Report, and Highvale Notes.\030\030Burn the Highvale Records\030Burn the Highvale Notes\030Burn the Highvale Report\030Keeping the Highvale elves isolated is the key. Have you found the lodge?\030Lines of Communication\0312,1,88,2,257,1,7825\0302,90,276,2,257,1,7825\0302,278,349,2,257,1,7825\0302,354,415,2,257,1,7825\0302,420,450,2,261,1,7825\0302,453,499,2,259,1,7825\0302,501,510,2,257,1,7825\0303,1,136,2,386,1,7825\0301,1,12,4,272,1,7825\0301,14,125,4,276,3,7825\0308,1,47,3,256,1,7825\0308,49,73,3,256,2,7825\0305,1,25,3,384,1,7825\0306,1,23,3,384,1,7825\0307,1,24,3,384,1,7825\0317825,2,8,Oran Snakewrithe\0312,1497,1458,0,\0302,0,0,8,Undercity\0302,0,0,8,Hinterlands\031\031OBJECT,144071,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Highvale Records\030OBJECT,144072,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Highvale Notes\030OBJECT,144073,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Highvale Report",[2996]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031A busy day in Ratchet, isn't it? How I enjoy watching the toil of a port city. So much mystery, so much adventure... so much ignorance.$B$BIs that hatred I see in your eyes, $N? Good, we will put that to good use.\030I have taught you skills in the past, but the time has come for another to teach you. He is in Ratchet, and his name is Strahad. He is human, but do not let that fool you into thinking he is weak. He is powerful even though he may be small. He can teach you about more powerful summonings--I feel you are ready. Go to him now. He is in Ratchet... above the port town next to his tower.\030Speak to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.\030\030Seeking Strahad\0312,1,85,2,257,1,5875\0302,87,128,2,257,1,5875\0302,130,196,2,257,1,5875\0302,198,240,2,257,1,5875\0302,242,311,2,257,1,5875\0302,313,326,2,257,1,5875\0302,328,346,2,257,1,5875\0302,348,385,2,257,1,5875\0303,1,35,2,384,1,5875\0301,1,32,4,272,2,6251\0301,34,78,4,272,1,6251\0301,80,116,4,272,1,6251\0301,118,135,4,272,1,6251\0301,140,177,4,272,2,6251\0301,179,213,4,272,3,6251\0316251,2,9,Strahad Farsan\0312,0,0,2,Ratchet\0302,0,0,7,Ratchet\0302,0,0,9,Strahad Farsan\0302,0,0,9,Ratchet\0304,0,0,10,Ratchet\0313001,22,3001,UNKNOWN\0301801,24,1801,UNKNOWN\031",[2997]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Well met, $N. I hope the Light shows you the true path and keeps you safe from evil.\030Hello, $N. I know you're busy helping out the people of Dun Morogh, but when you have the time, you should make your way up to Ironforge to speak to one of our most respected ilk: Tiza Battleforge. She's the one the younger paladins go to when it's time they learn more about the Light and what's expected of ya.$B$BYou can find her upstairs in the Hall of Mysteries. If you've never been there, it's in the Mystic Ward. Good luck to ya, $N.\030Speak to Tiza Battleforge in Ironforge.\030\030Tome of Divinity\0312,1,10,2,257,1,1232\0302,12,197,2,257,1,1232\0302,199,312,2,257,1,1232\0302,317,367,2,257,1,1232\0302,369,420,2,257,4,1232\0302,422,441,2,257,1,1232\0303,1,39,2,384,1,1232\0301,1,13,4,272,1,6179\0301,15,84,4,274,3,6179\0316179,2,2,Tiza Battleforge\0306179,2,7,Tiza Battleforge\0312,0,0,2,Ironforge\0302,0,0,4,Hall of Mysteries\0302,0,0,5,Mystic Ward\0302,0,0,7,Tiza Battleforge\0302,0,0,7,Ironforge\0312999,22,2999,UNKNOWN\0303000,22,3000,UNKNOWN\0301645,23,1645,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[2998]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031It is beautiful here in Stormwind, is it not?$B$BYour timing actually couldn't have been better, $N.\030Greetings, $Gbrother:sister;. Duthorian Rall, one of our most influential paladins, was speaking about you recently. I overheard him talking about how it was time you be put to the test some... along with some very complimentary things about how well you've performed thus far.$B$BIf I were you, I'd head to Stormwind and speak to him when you have time. I'm sure he's in the Cathedral of Light--that's where he spends most of his time.\030Speak to Duthorian Rall in Stormwind.\030\030Tome of Divinity\0312,1,29,2,257,1,927\0302,31,116,2,257,1,927\0302,118,193,2,257,1,927\0302,195,277,2,257,1,927\0302,282,354,2,257,4,927\0302,356,436,2,257,1,927\0303,1,37,2,384,1,927\0301,1,45,4,272,2,6171\0301,50,100,4,272,1,6171\0316171,2,2,Duthorian Rall\0306171,2,7,Duthorian Rall\0312,0,0,5,Stormwind\0302,0,0,6,Cathedral of Light--that's\0302,0,0,7,Duthorian Rall\0302,0,0,7,Stormwind\0304,0,0,8,Stormwind\0313681,22,3681,UNKNOWN\0301641,23,1641,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[2999]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Well met, $N. I hope the Light shows you the true path and keeps you safe from evil.\030Hello, $N. I know you're busy helping out the people of Dun Morogh, but when you have the time, you should go upstairs and speak to one of our most respected ilk: Tiza Battleforge. She's the one the younger paladins go to when it's time they learn more about the Light and what's expected of ya.\030Speak to Tiza Battleforge in Ironforge\030\030Tome of Divinity\0312,1,10,2,257,1,5149\0302,12,180,2,257,1,5149\0302,182,295,2,257,1,5149\0303,1,38,2,384,1,5149\0301,1,13,4,272,1,6179\0301,15,84,4,274,3,6179\0316179,2,2,Tiza Battleforge\0306179,2,4,Tiza Battleforge\0312,0,0,4,Tiza Battleforge\0302,0,0,4,Ironforge\0312997,22,2997,UNKNOWN\0303000,22,3000,UNKNOWN\0301645,23,1645,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[30]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've completed the Trial of the Sea Lion, $N - congratulations.$B$BEach task in acquiring the pendant shows that both agility and endurance are necessary to act in harmony with what you desire to do underwater. Neither can exist without the other, and both cannot be done without your willingness to embrace the aspect of the sea lion.$B$BRemember these lessons well, and count on them once you have gained your aquatic form.\030For the second trial, you'll need the two halves that make the Pendant of the Sea Lion.  One half draws power from the agility of the sea lion aspect, gliding through water; the other draws power from the incredible endurance of the sea lion aspect.  Druids draw on both these traits equally to embody the aspect of their aquatic form.$B$BSpeak with the locals of Moonglade to learn where the parts may lie, and bring both here to join them together.  Once formed, take the pendant to Dendrite Starblaze.\030Find the Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility and the Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance.  Speak with the residents of Moonglade to learn clues as to where these items may be located.$B$BForm the Pendant of the Sea Lion from the two pendant halves.  You need to be in proximity of the Shrine of Remulos to do this.$B$BBring the joined pendant to Dendrite Starblaze in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade.\030Have you formed your pendant for me to inspect, $N? If you need help in locating the parts, try asking the local populace for information. Not only will you find what you seek, but it will give you a reason to explore this wondrous and sacred glade.\030Trial of the Sea Lion\0312,1,87,2,259,1,11799\0302,90,249,2,257,1,11799\0302,252,335,2,257,1,11799\0302,340,450,2,257,1,11799\0302,453,504,2,257,1,11799\0303,1,83,2,384,1,11799\0303,86,177,2,384,1,11799\0303,182,242,2,384,1,11799\0303,245,308,2,386,1,11799\0303,313,399,2,384,1,11799\0301,1,65,4,272,1,11802\0301,70,212,4,274,1,11802\0301,214,337,4,272,1,11802\0301,342,427,4,272,1,11802\0304,1,51,3,256,2,11802\0304,53,138,3,258,4,11802\0304,140,249,3,258,3,11802\03111802,2,5,Dendrite Starblaze\03011802,2,10,Dendrite Starblaze\0312,0,0,5,Dendrite Starblaze\0302,0,0,10,Dendrite Starblaze\03128,19,28,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\03031,23,31,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,15885,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[3000]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I greet you, and bid you welcome, $N.\030Hello, $N. I know you're busy helping out the people of Azeroth, but when you have the time, you should return to Ironforge and speak to one of the most respected paladins of your home: Tiza Battleforge. She's the one the younger dwarven paladins go to when it is time they learn more about the Light and what's expected of all of us.$B$BYou can find her upstairs in the Hall of Mysteries which is located in the Mystic Ward.\030Speak to Tiza Battleforge in Ironforge.\030\030Tome of Divinity\0312,1,10,2,257,1,928\0302,12,203,2,257,1,928\0302,205,334,2,257,1,928\0302,339,425,2,257,1,928\0303,1,39,2,384,1,928\0301,1,37,4,272,1,6179\0316179,2,2,Tiza Battleforge\0306179,2,5,Tiza Battleforge\0312,0,0,2,Ironforge\0302,0,0,4,Hall of Mysteries\0302,0,0,4,Mystic Ward\0302,0,0,5,Tiza Battleforge\0302,0,0,5,Ironforge\0312997,22,2997,UNKNOWN\0302999,22,2999,UNKNOWN\0301645,23,1645,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3001]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031A busy day in Ratchet, isn't it? How I enjoy watching the toil of a port city. So much mystery, so much adventure... so much ignorance.$B$BIs that hatred I see in your eyes, $N? Good, we will put that to good use.\030I have taught you skills in the past, but the time has come for another to teach you. He is in Ratchet, and his name is Strahad. He is human, but do not let that fool you into thinking he is weak, nor is he your enemy... at least for now. He is powerful and should be respected. He can teach you about greater summonings, summonings I feel you are prepared for. Go to him now.$B$BYou can find him in Ratchet... above the port town next to the tower there.\030Find Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.\030\030Seeking Strahad\0312,1,85,2,257,1,5675\0302,87,128,2,257,1,5675\0302,130,220,2,261,1,5675\0302,222,238,2,257,1,5675\0302,240,278,2,257,1,5675\0302,280,361,2,257,1,5675\0302,363,376,2,257,1,5675\0302,381,410,2,257,1,5675\0302,412,455,2,257,1,5675\0303,1,31,2,384,1,5675\0301,1,32,4,272,2,6251\0301,34,78,4,272,1,6251\0301,80,116,4,272,1,6251\0301,118,135,4,272,1,6251\0301,140,177,4,272,2,6251\0301,179,213,4,272,3,6251\0316251,2,10,Strahad Farsan\0312,0,0,2,Ratchet\0302,0,0,8,Ratchet\0302,0,0,10,Ratchet\0304,0,0,11,Ratchet\0312996,22,2996,UNKNOWN\0301801,24,1801,UNKNOWN\031",[3002]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Fascinating, $N...$B$BThis orb is very powerful, but also very dangerous.\030Although I know my enemy well, I am a warrior, $N. I cannot begin to tell you what this orb is capable of.$B$BI know of a mage in Orgrimmar that will be able to tell us more about the orb. Take it to him.\030Bring the Gordunni Orb to Uthel'nay in the Darkbriar Lodge in Orgrimmar.\030What have you brought me, $R?\030The Gordunni Orb\0312,1,50,2,261,1,7777\0302,52,106,2,257,1,7777\0302,111,188,2,257,3,7777\0302,190,204,2,257,1,7777\0303,1,72,2,384,1,7777\0301,1,18,4,272,1,7311\0301,23,73,4,272,1,7311\0304,1,29,3,256,2,7311\0317311,2,5,Uthel'nay\0312,357,1444,0,\0302,0,0,3,Orgrimmar\0302,0,0,5,Uthel'nay\0302,0,0,5,Darkbriar Lodge\0302,0,0,5,Orgrimmar\0312979,19,2979,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[301]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Curse that Ironband! I sent him a load of blastpowder weeks ago, but he's made no mention of it in this report.$B$BSo...where did the blastpowder go?!?\030We'll need approval to get Ironband more blastpowder. You'll have to take his report to the Explorers' League headquarters in Ironforge.$B$BHere's the report. Give it to Prospector Stormpike, and don't forget to duck after you deliver it. Stormpike is hotheaded, and he won't be happy to hear of Ironband's slow progress at the site.$B$BYou'll find Stormpike in the Assembly of Explorers.\030Take Ironband's Progress Report to Prospector Stormpike.\030We Stormpikes don't like being bothered with trivial matters, $C. I hope you brought news worthy of my valuable attention.\030Report to Ironforge\0312,1,53,2,259,1,1105\0302,55,136,2,257,1,1105\0302,141,158,2,257,1,1105\0302,160,238,2,257,1,1105\0302,240,333,2,257,1,1105\0302,338,388,2,257,1,1105\0303,1,56,2,384,1,1105\0301,1,20,4,276,1,1356\0301,22,111,4,272,1,1356\0301,116,151,4,272,2,1356\0304,1,65,3,256,1,1356\0304,67,122,3,258,3,1356\0311356,2,4,Prospector Stormpike\0301356,2,7,Prospector Stormpike\0312,38,1432,0,\0302,0,0,2,Explorers' League\0302,0,0,2,Ironforge\0302,0,0,4,Prospector Stormpike\0302,0,0,6,Assembly of Explorers\0302,0,0,7,Prospector Stormpike\031298,19,298,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030302,23,302,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[302]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031What? Stormpike wants you to personally see the shipment to Ironband?$B$BI... suppose that's fine, the only problem is, I've already sent Huldar with the porters, Miran and Saean. You just missed them, they left just a short while ago.\030If Ironband still needs blastpowder, then by Magni he'll have it!  I sent the approval on ahead with a messenger to Jern Hornhelm in Thelsamar.  He'll prepare the powder and other supplies to take to Ironband.$B$BAnd one more thing: I want you to personally see that the shipment of powder reaches its destination.  The last one didn't, so keep your mind sharp and your eyes open.\030Speak with Jern Hornhelm in Thelsamar.\030\030Powder to Ironband\0312,1,65,2,259,4,1356\0302,68,143,2,257,1,1356\0302,146,209,2,257,1,1356\0302,214,314,2,259,1,1356\0302,317,380,2,257,1,1356\0303,1,38,2,384,1,1356\0301,1,5,4,272,2,1105\0301,7,69,4,274,2,1105\0301,79,179,4,276,1,1105\0301,181,235,4,272,1,1105\0311105,2,2,Jern Hornhelm\0301105,2,6,Jern Hornhelm\0302057,4,9,Huldar\0301379,4,9,Miran\0301380,4,9,Saean\0312,38,1432,0,\0302,0,0,2,Jern Hornhelm\0302,0,0,2,Thelsamar\0302,0,0,3,Ironband\0302,0,0,6,Thelsamar\0304,0,0,8,Ironband\031301,19,301,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030273,23,273,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3022]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you for your help, $N. The hippogryph population simply wouldn't flourish if it weren't for us. Ah, but I am sure you understand all too well, having traveled to Feralas yourself, and seen the devastation of the Gordunni there.$B$BWell, as you can see, I am hard at work here, so you'd best be on your way.$B$BThanks again, $N.\030$N, I can see you yearn to be dedicated to my worthwhile cause. Yes, of course, you can do something for me!$B$BTake this crate of eggs to Erelas Ambersky. He is a druid that cares for these eggs, helping them to hatch and then training the young hippogryphs. You will find him in Teldrassil, in a small village to the south called Rut'theran.\030Bring the Carefully-packed Crate to Erelas Ambersky in Rut'theran Village.\030Another shipment from Curgle, I assume?\030Handle With Care\0312,1,63,2,257,1,7763\0302,65,108,2,257,1,7763\0302,113,155,2,257,1,7763\0302,157,259,2,257,1,7763\0302,261,343,2,257,3,7763\0303,1,74,2,384,1,7763\0301,1,28,4,272,1,7916\0301,30,101,4,272,4,7916\0301,103,233,4,272,1,7916\0301,238,312,4,272,1,7916\0301,317,333,4,272,1,7916\0304,1,39,3,256,4,7916\0317916,2,3,Erelas Ambersky\0307916,2,6,Erelas Ambersky\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,3,Erelas Ambersky\0302,0,0,5,Teldrassil\0302,0,0,6,Erelas Ambersky\0302,0,0,6,Rut'theran Village\0304,0,0,9,Feralas\0303,0,0,12,Curgle\031\031",[303]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You upheld your orders well, $C. You have proven yourself to be a valiant soldier and loyal servant to King Magni and for that I salute you! With the pressure you applied to the Dark Iron encampment, we now stand a chance of driving them off our lands for good. . .if only the damned reserve would show. . . .\030War rages both home and abroad.  While mighty Dwarven soldiers give their lives in far off territories in the name of the Alliance, our own lands fall prey to the evil deeds of the Dark Iron Dwarves.  They laid waste to the Thandol Span.  Dun Modr fell soon after.$B$BWe need you to gather force and push the front back.  If you can kill 10 Dark Iron Dwarves, 5 Tunnelers, 5 Saboteurs and 5 Demolitionists, the reserve might arrive in time to finish the drive.$B$BNow make haste!\030Motley Garmason at Dun Modr wants you to kill 10 Dark Iron Dwarves,  5 Dark Iron Tunnelers, 5 Dark Iron Saboteurs and 5 Dark Iron Demolitionists.\030Roggo has been unable to contact the reserve forces. We need offensive pressure on that Dark Iron encampment, $c. Now get back out there and serve your duty to King Magni!\030The Dark Iron War\0312,1,31,2,261,1,1074\0302,34,199,2,257,1,1074\0302,202,237,2,257,1,1074\0302,240,264,2,257,1,1074\0302,269,320,2,259,1,1074\0302,323,460,2,257,4,1074\0302,465,479,2,257,1,1074\0303,1,145,2,386,1,1074\0301,1,32,4,272,1,1074\0301,34,140,4,272,1,1074\0301,142,261,4,272,1,1074\0301,265,303,4,272,4,1074\0304,1,52,3,256,1,1074\0304,54,113,3,258,1,1074\0304,115,171,3,256,1,1074\0311074,2,8,Motley Garmason\0312,11,1437,0,\0302,0,0,3,Thandol Span\0302,0,0,8,Dun Modr\0304,0,0,10,King Magni\0304,0,0,11,Dark Iron\0303,0,0,15,King Magni\031378,23,378,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,1051,OBJECTIVE,10,13,Dark Iron Dwarf\030NPC,1053,OBJECTIVE,5,13,Dark Iron Tunneler\030NPC,1052,OBJECTIVE,5,13,Dark Iron Saboteur\030NPC,1054,OBJECTIVE,5,13,Dark Iron Demolitionist",[304]="PARTIAL\031loreConnections,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Balgaras the Foul is finally dead. While his death will not bring back the many innocent dwarves who died needlessly by his hand, it will help to restore peace of mind to those who survived. With Balgaras dead, the remaining Dark Iron scum should be easy enough to manage. Now, we must wipe them out before a new leader is sent to these parts.$B$BYou have done well, $C.\030Many of my soldiers died in the battle of Dun Modr. My own brother perished when the West Bridge over the Thandol Span was destroyed.  Aye, the Dark Iron dwarves are a devilish breed.  From what Roggo was able to gather, the leader of the thugs in the Wetlands is a warlock named Balgaras the Foul. He is quite a coward, sending his soldiers to do his bidding but hides in his camp on Direforge Hill, to the southeast.$B$BIf you can find the spineless scum, slay him and bring me his ear. I will reward you, $c.\030Kill Balgaras the Foul and bring his ear to Longbraid the Grim outside of Dun Modr.\030Were you able to locate Balgaras the Foul yet, $C? He has been evading us for quite some time.\030A Grim Task\0312,1,51,2,261,1,1071\0302,53,133,2,261,1,1071\0302,136,183,2,257,1,1071\0302,186,298,2,257,1,1071\0302,300,418,2,257,1,1071\0302,423,488,2,257,4,1071\0302,490,511,2,257,3,1071\0303,1,83,2,384,1,1071\0301,1,34,4,272,1,1071\0301,36,190,4,282,3,1071\0301,192,272,4,304,1,1071\0301,274,343,4,272,1,1071\0301,348,370,4,272,1,1071\0304,1,50,3,256,2,1071\0304,52,94,3,256,1,1071\0311364,2,4,Balgaras the Foul\0301364,2,8,Balgaras the Foul\0301071,2,8,Longbraid the Grim\0301364,4,9,Balgaras the Foul\0301364,3,14,Balgaras the Foul\0312,11,1437,0,\0302,0,0,4,Wetlands\0302,0,0,8,Longbraid the Grim\031\031ITEM,3639,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[3042]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, this is very nice temper indeed! And so much of it! I'll be at work for days before I use it all!$B$BThank you, $N. Please, take this as payment.\030The Sandfury trolls of Zul'Farrak make a tempering agent from sandstones, and I can use that to temper the goods I craft, yes I can!  It is highly prized by connoisseurs, so if you bring me a good supply of the temper, then I'll reward you well.$B$BZul'Farrak is northwest of Gadgetzan.  Good luck.\030Bring 20 Vials of Troll Temper to Trenton Lighthammer in Gadgetzan.\030Did you bring me the temper, $N?\030Troll Temper\0312,1,132,2,257,1,7804\0302,135,245,2,257,4,7804\0302,250,286,2,257,1,7804\0302,289,298,2,257,1,7804\0303,1,67,2,384,1,7804\0301,1,36,4,272,1,7804\0301,38,55,4,272,1,7804\0301,57,101,4,272,1,7804\0301,106,119,4,272,1,7804\0301,121,149,4,272,1,7804\0304,1,32,3,256,2,7804\0317804,2,5,Trenton Lighthammer\0312,978,1446,0,\0302,0,0,5,Trenton Lighthammer\0302,0,0,5,Gadgetzan\031\031ITEM,9523,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[305]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Oh, thank the heavens you are here!\030Oh my, you must be the scout Longbraid said he would send!  You cannot imagine how worried I have been.$B$BMy wife, Merrin, has been sending me letters each week for the past month.  She is part of the Whelgar Excavation team.  But it has been nearly two weeks since her last correspondence.  Surely something is wrong!$B$BLongbraid said that he would send a scout to check up on things if we did not hear from the team soon.  I assume that scout is you, $N.  Find Merrin at the excavation site to the east!\030Tarrel Rockweaver wants you to travel to the Excavation Site and contact Merrin Rockweaver.\030\030In Search of The Excavation Team\0312,1,58,2,257,4,2096\0302,61,103,2,257,1,2096\0302,108,181,2,257,1,2096\0302,184,226,2,257,1,2096\0302,229,291,2,257,1,2096\0302,294,319,2,257,1,2096\0302,324,425,2,257,4,2096\0302,428,458,2,257,4,2096\0302,461,507,2,257,1,2096\0303,1,91,2,386,1,2096\0301,1,35,4,272,1,1076\0312096,2,10,Tarrel Rockweaver\0301076,2,10,Merrin Rockweaver\0312,11,1437,0,\0302,0,0,10,Excavation Site\031306,23,306,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[306]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Such horrible news! At least 3 of them survived. But when will the killing end? I long for the day when King Magni's subjects can live without fear.\030It was horrible!  We were uncovering some rare artifacts and we began to discover these large bones.$B$BBefore we knew what was happening, these Mottled Raptors overwhelmed the dig site.  Many lives were lost.$B$BOrmer here -- so brave -- saved the Prospector and me.  He defended us as we ran for shelter.  Now we are trapped.  And our hard work lies in ruin.$B$BHere, take this note back to my sweet Tarrel.  It will explain the situation to him.\030Return to Tarrel Rockweaver with Merrin's note.\030Were you able to find Merrin? Did she send word?\030In Search of The Excavation Team\0312,1,16,2,257,1,1076\0302,19,100,2,257,1,1076\0302,105,186,2,265,1,1076\0302,189,209,2,261,1,1076\0302,214,267,2,257,1,1076\0302,270,306,2,257,1,1076\0302,309,327,2,257,1,1076\0302,330,360,2,257,1,1076\0302,365,409,2,257,1,1076\0302,412,448,2,257,3,1076\0303,1,47,2,384,1,1076\0301,1,19,4,272,1,2096\0301,21,48,4,272,1,2096\0301,50,79,4,272,2,2096\0301,81,148,4,272,1,2096\0304,1,29,3,256,2,2096\0304,31,48,3,256,2,2096\0312096,2,11,Tarrel Rockweaver\0312,11,1437,0,\0302,0,0,11,Tarrel Rockweaver\031305,19,305,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3062]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Now I know that Edana is truly dead. This heart; I will keep it in memory of what did here for me, $N. Thank you.\030Edana Hatetalon is the queen of the Northspring harpies that reside in the ruins to the west. She is pure evil; I have heard that her heart is one of crystal. She is void of any emotion aside from the hate she feels towards all others. You must face Edana and bring me back her dark heart.$B$BI have heard of a horn that harpies carry -- blowing it by the Hatetalon stones, in the northern part of the ruins, will summon the queen.$B$BImagine her surprise when it is not her kin calling her, but her death.\030Talo Thornhoof in Camp Mojache wants Edana Hatetalon's Dark Heart.\030The hate that Edana spreads across the land must be stopped.\030Dark Heart\0312,1,93,2,321,1,7776\0302,95,158,2,257,1,7776\0302,160,235,2,257,1,7776\0302,237,289,2,257,1,7776\0302,294,431,2,321,3,7776\0302,436,506,2,257,1,7776\0303,1,66,2,386,1,7776\0301,1,36,4,272,1,7776\0301,38,102,4,272,3,7776\0301,104,113,4,272,1,7776\0304,1,60,3,256,1,7776\0318075,2,1,Edana Hatetalon\0307776,2,7,Talo Thornhoof\0308075,2,7,Edana Hatetalon\0312,357,1444,0,\0302,0,0,7,Camp Mojache\031\031ITEM,9528,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[3063]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you, $N. You have put an old tauren's mind at peace.\030In my day, I was a seasoned hunter. There wasn't any creature around that I feared. Until...$B$BI was out in the forest, sharpening my blade after a tough battle, when I was ambushed. Harpies surrounded me, and I barely managed to drag myself to safety.$B$BEven now, I can still hear their cries echoing...$B$BI was never the same after that. But the hate boils inside of me -- I must get even, after all these years.$B$BThe Northspring harpies can be found to the west of here. $N, get my revenge.\030Talo Thornhoof wants you to kill 4 Northspring Harpies, 4 Northspring Roguefeathers, 4 Northspring Windcallers, and 4 Northspring Slayers.\030The wings of the Northspring harpies are black as the night; do not take your eyes off of them, lest they disappear into darkness.\030Vengeance on the Northspring\0312,1,35,2,257,1,7776\0302,37,83,2,257,1,7776\0302,85,92,2,257,1,7776\0302,97,183,2,261,1,7776\0302,185,253,2,265,1,7776\0302,258,306,2,257,1,7776\0302,311,342,2,257,1,7776\0302,344,417,2,257,1,7776\0302,422,478,2,257,1,7776\0302,480,498,2,259,1,7776\0303,1,138,2,386,1,7776\0301,1,14,4,272,1,7776\0301,16,58,4,280,1,7776\0304,1,130,3,256,1,7776\0317776,2,11,Talo Thornhoof\0312,357,1444,0,\031\031NPC,5362,OBJECTIVE,4,13,Northspring Harpy\030NPC,5363,OBJECTIVE,4,13,Northspring Roguefeather\030NPC,5364,OBJECTIVE,4,13,Northspring Slayer\030NPC,5366,OBJECTIVE,4,13,Northspring Windcaller",[3065]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You'll find this place fitting as you continue to train in the warrior ways. If you have any questions, feel free to ask anyone around, and when you feel you're ready, come back to me for training. I've mastered as much as any warrior here in the Valley and can pass that knowledge on to you... for a price.\030Ah, while you were gone a parchment came for you, $N.$B$BRead it when you have time. If I'm not mistaken, it came from the warrior trainer Frang. He would have words with you when you're ready. You'll find him outside the Den, taking cover in the shade.\030Read the Simple Tablet and speak to Frang in the Valley of Trials.\030Another troll to bolster the ranks. Good enough for me.$B$BYou'll probably have a hard time hefting a good weapon like an axe, but a spear's just as good as anything else.$B$BWelcome to the Valley of Trials.\030Simple Tablet\0312,1,53,2,257,1,3143\0302,58,84,2,257,1,3143\0302,86,145,2,257,4,3143\0302,147,193,2,257,4,3143\0302,195,253,2,257,1,3143\0303,1,66,2,384,1,3143\0301,1,76,4,272,1,3153\0301,78,197,4,272,4,3153\0301,199,294,4,272,1,3153\0301,296,307,4,272,1,3153\0304,1,35,3,256,1,3153\0304,37,55,3,256,1,3153\0304,60,171,3,256,1,3153\0304,176,207,3,256,1,3153\0313153,2,3,Frang\0305954,2,5,Shade\0303153,2,6,Frang\0312,0,0,5,Den\0302,0,0,6,Frang\0302,0,0,6,Valley of Trials\0304,0,0,9,Valley\0303,0,0,14,Valley of Trials\031788,19,788,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[307]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Did you see a lot of Kobolds in there? I can't wait for the order to clear them out of the mine. The thought of their grimy hands clawing around our mine makes my stomach rumble!\030The Silver Stream Mine to the east ran dry long ago.  It was converted by the Miners' League into a storage depot, but now Kobolds have moved in, putting their filthy paws on good, Dwarven tools!$B$BWe'll root out those vermin soon enough, but the League wants someone to get their gear out of the mine before we warriors tromp in there and break things.  It'll be a tough delve - you might want cohorts at your side.$B$BThe gear is stored in Miners' League Crates throughout the mine.  Good luck.\030Go to the Silver Stream Mine and collect 4 loads of Miners' Gear.$B$BReturn to Mountaineer Stormpike.\030Do you have that Miners' Gear, $N?\030Filthy Paws\0312,1,52,2,321,1,1343\0302,55,195,2,257,1,1343\0302,200,354,2,267,1,1343\0302,357,417,2,259,4,1343\0302,422,485,2,257,1,1343\0302,488,497,2,257,1,1343\0303,1,65,2,384,1,1343\0303,70,101,2,384,1,1343\0301,1,38,4,272,2,1343\0301,40,96,4,272,1,1343\0301,98,178,4,272,1,1343\0304,1,34,3,256,2,1343\0311343,2,8,Mountaineer Stormpike\0312,38,1432,0,\0302,0,0,5,Miners' League Crates\0302,0,0,7,Silver Stream Mine\0302,0,0,8,Mountaineer Stormpike\031\031ITEM,2640,OBJECTIVE,4,15,",[308]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031For me? You're a true hero, $N!\030\030\030Hmph! There is all this booze down here. but I have strict orders not to touch it. If only I could get a taste of some of our Thunder Ale...that would sharpen my wits, no lying!\030Distracting Jarven\0311,1,7,4,272,2,1373\0301,9,31,4,272,1,1373\0304,1,5,3,256,1,1373\0304,7,40,3,256,1,1373\0304,42,82,3,256,1,1373\0304,84,177,3,256,4,1373\031\0312,1,1426,0,\031\031ITEM,2686,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[3082]="PARTIAL\031conflict,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Now we teach them those things, and they teach us others. We become one race... almost. We be allies for long time now. So you remember to help them. And Jen'shan remember to help you.$B$BJen'shan teach you da ways of the hunter--teach you good. You never forget, $C's be respected greatly by da tribe. You be havin' a large role to play in da future... you never forget that.$B$BWhen you feel da need, come to Jen'shan. She teach you as much as she can when she feel you ready.\030Ah, while you were gone a tablet came for you, $N.$B$BRead it when you have time. If I'm not mistaken, it came from the hunter trainer Jen'shan. She would have words with you when you're ready.\030Speak to Jen'shan in the Valley of Trials.\030Jen'shan see a mighty $C before her and da spirits approve.$B$BDa path of da $C is one of our oldest walks of life. Da Horde turned to us when they be just strugglin' to survive on Azeroth, and they ask us to teach them, to show them the secrets of many tings. They were strong already: strong in shaman ways; strong in warrior ways. But the hunter path not be their path... then.\030Etched Tablet\0312,1,50,2,257,1,3143\0302,55,81,2,257,1,3143\0302,83,144,2,257,4,3143\0302,146,193,2,257,4,3143\0303,1,42,2,384,1,3143\0301,1,57,4,304,1,3154\0301,59,79,4,272,1,3154\0301,81,87,4,272,1,3154\0301,89,119,4,272,1,3154\0301,121,149,4,272,1,3154\0301,151,184,4,272,1,3154\0301,189,245,4,272,1,3154\0301,247,302,4,272,1,3154\0301,304,353,4,272,1,3154\0301,355,376,4,272,1,3154\0301,381,420,4,274,1,3154\0301,422,478,4,272,1,3154\0304,1,59,3,256,1,3154\0304,64,115,3,256,1,3154\0304,117,260,3,264,1,3154\0304,262,333,3,256,1,3154\0304,335,374,3,256,1,3154\0304,376,380,3,256,1,3154\0313154,2,3,Jen'shan\0303154,2,5,Jen'shan\0303154,4,11,Jen'shan\0303154,4,12,Jen'shan\0303154,4,16,Jen'shan\0303154,3,18,Jen'shan\0312,0,0,5,Jen'shan\0302,0,0,5,Valley of Trials\0304,0,0,16,Jen'shan\031788,19,788,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3083]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Until such time comes, you'll be under my tutelage. I will show you the ropes as some folks say. Whenever you feel prepared, come to me and I will see about training you further. Until then, practice your skills and keep them honed to a razor's edge. You'll never know when you'll need even the most insignificant ability.\030Ah, while you were gone a tablet came for you, $N.$B$BRead it when you have time. If I'm not mistaken, it came from the rogue trainer Rwag. He would have words with you when you're ready.\030Read the Encrypted Tablet and speak to Rwag in the Valley of Trials.\030Welcome to the Valley of Trials, Rangrang. You wouldn't be here if you hadn't gotten my tablet, so I will get to the point.$B$BI am Rwag and I am responsible for training the rogues, thieves, and cutpurses here in the Valley. I'm the one the Hand will turn to if you're not ready for what's to come. But don't worry, the Hand won't be controlling everything you do, but it would be wise to work with them if they have need of your talents.\030Encrypted Tablet\0312,1,50,2,257,1,3143\0302,55,81,2,257,1,3143\0302,83,139,2,257,4,3143\0302,141,187,2,257,4,3143\0303,1,68,2,384,1,3143\0301,1,51,4,272,1,3155\0301,53,96,4,272,3,3155\0301,98,178,4,272,3,3155\0301,180,250,4,272,1,3155\0301,252,322,4,274,1,3155\0304,1,42,3,256,1,3155\0304,44,123,3,256,4,3155\0304,128,225,3,256,1,3155\0304,227,299,3,256,4,3155\0304,301,439,3,258,4,3155\0313155,2,3,Rwag\0303155,2,5,Rwag\0303155,3,13,Rwag\0312,0,0,5,Rwag\0302,0,0,5,Valley of Trials\0303,0,0,11,Valley of Trials\0303,0,0,13,Valley\031788,19,788,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3084]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031As you probably know, the elements give us our power. Fire, earth, water and air--these are our tools.$B$BOur strength comes from the spirits of our ancestors. We are the leaders of our people. Like Thrall is to the Horde, so shall we be to the villages and towns we visit. They will look to us for wisdom and protection. To be better prepared, you must train often. When you feel you've gained more power, come to me and I shall teach you what I can.\030Ah, while you were gone a tablet came for you, $N.$B$BRead it when you have time. If I'm not mistaken, it came from the shaman trainer Shikrik. She would have words with you when you're ready.\030Speak to Shikrik in the Valley of Trials.\030Ah, welcome, $N. I'm pleased you have arrived. My days have become long and even busy what with so many students to teach, but the coming of one of your ilk brings me a great sense of accomplishment--I remember the days when I was taught by one of your shamans.\030Rune-Inscribed Tablet\0312,1,50,2,257,1,3143\0302,55,81,2,257,1,3143\0302,83,143,2,257,4,3143\0302,145,192,2,257,4,3143\0303,1,41,2,384,1,3143\0301,1,53,4,272,1,3157\0301,55,102,4,272,1,3157\0301,107,159,4,272,1,3157\0301,161,193,4,272,1,3157\0301,195,273,4,272,3,3157\0301,275,321,4,272,3,3157\0301,323,366,4,272,1,3157\0301,368,451,4,272,3,3157\0304,1,16,3,256,1,3157\0304,18,46,3,256,1,3157\0304,48,261,3,256,1,3157\0313157,2,3,Shikrik\0303157,2,5,Shikrik\0304949,4,10,Thrall\0312,0,0,5,Shikrik\0302,0,0,5,Valley of Trials\0304,0,0,10,Horde\031788,19,788,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3085]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031As ya test yeself, ya'll find ya have better an' better control o'er da spirits--ya'll be callin' on dem fer greata an' greata tings... dat's where ol' Ken'jai come in. You come talk to ole Ken'jai when ya feel yer ready. If da spirits agree, den we see 'bout teachin' ya more powerful abilities... but only if da spirits agree.$B$BGo now, talk to da rest of da Valley's people. Speak to me again later.\030Ah, while you were gone a tablet came for you, $N.$B$BRead it when you have time. If I'm not mistaken, it came from the priest trainer Ken'jai. He would have words with you when you're ready.\030Read the Hallowed Tablet and speak to Ken'jai outside the Den in the Valley of Trials.\030So ya made it... good good! Da spirits tol' me you be comin' to see Ken'jai soon enough. Let me be one o' da first to welcome ya to da Valley of Trials. Dis place not be your home fer long, but while it is, why dontcha make da best o' it.\030Hallowed Tablet\0312,1,50,2,257,1,3143\0302,55,81,2,257,1,3143\0302,83,143,2,257,4,3143\0302,145,191,2,257,4,3143\0303,1,86,2,384,1,3143\0301,1,135,4,272,1,3707\0301,137,168,4,272,1,3707\0301,170,221,4,272,1,3707\0301,223,298,4,272,4,3707\0301,300,328,4,272,4,3707\0301,333,378,4,272,1,3707\0301,380,403,4,272,1,3707\0304,1,16,3,256,1,3707\0304,18,27,3,256,1,3707\0304,29,88,3,256,1,3707\0304,90,152,3,256,1,3707\0304,154,238,3,256,1,3707\031111,2,3,Priest\0303707,2,3,Ken'jai\0303707,2,5,Ken'jai\0303707,4,7,Ken'jai\0303707,4,8,Ken'jai\0303707,3,15,Ken'jai\0312,0,0,5,Ken'jai\0302,0,0,5,Den\0302,0,0,5,Valley of Trials\031788,19,788,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3086]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You be among da most powerful beings on da planet, $N... there no arguin' dat. And everyone know it... know it good, too!$B$BBut ya must be weary! 'cause it not orc, or elf, or dwarf dat you should be scared of... it be da tings you can'na see. Magic be powerful. Make you do tings you may not want to do. Make ya tink you more powerful then you really be. Be patient. Be smart.$B$BWhen ya tink you be ready for trainin', come back to Mai'ah. She teach you what you ready to learn, no problem.\030Ah, while you were gone a tablet came for you, $N.$B$BRead it when you have time. If I'm not mistaken, it came from the mage trainer Mai'ah. She would have words with you when you're ready.\030Read the Glyphic Tablet and speak with Mai'ah near the entrance to the Den in the Valley of Trials.\030Ya look to please Mai'ah already, $N. Dat be good. You give Mai'ah respect, and Mai'ah maybe give you respect back. But enough o' dat, you be here to learn 'bout magic, not hear Mai'ah talk.$B$BThere be only one ting Mai'ah can no teach you 'bout magic, $N, and dat's how to stop da corruptin'.\030Glyphic Tablet\0312,1,50,2,257,1,3143\0302,55,81,2,257,1,3143\0302,83,140,2,257,4,3143\0302,142,189,2,257,4,3143\0303,1,99,2,384,1,3143\0301,1,56,4,272,1,5884\0301,58,78,4,272,1,5884\0301,80,102,4,272,1,5884\0301,104,121,4,272,1,5884\0301,126,146,4,272,1,5884\0301,148,213,4,272,1,5884\0301,215,244,4,272,1,5884\0301,246,263,4,272,1,5884\0301,265,305,4,274,1,5884\0301,307,356,4,272,1,5884\0301,358,368,4,272,1,5884\0301,370,378,4,272,1,5884\0301,383,442,4,272,1,5884\0301,444,493,4,276,1,5884\0304,1,37,3,256,1,5884\0304,39,50,3,256,1,5884\0304,52,115,3,256,4,5884\0304,117,190,3,256,1,5884\0304,195,294,3,256,1,5884\0315884,2,3,Mai'ah\0305884,2,5,Mai'ah\0305884,4,18,Mai'ah\0305884,3,20,Mai'ah\0305884,3,22,Mai'ah\0305884,3,23,Mai'ah\0305884,3,24,Mai'ah\0312,0,0,5,Den\0302,0,0,5,Valley of Trials\0304,0,0,18,Mai'ah\031788,19,788,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3087]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031When we finish speakin', you should talk to da rest of da citizens in da Valley. They ask you to do tings for them... tings that will test your skill and teach you some of da dangers of this land.$B$BAs you grow in experience and wisdom, you be needin' Jen'shan to show you better techniques and skills. Come back to Jen'shan often. I will let you know what I can teach you.\030Ah, while you were gone a parchment came for you, $N.$B$BRead it when you have time. If I'm not mistaken, it came from the hunter trainer Jen'shan. She would have words with you when you're ready.\030Read the Etched Parchment and speak to Jen'shan in the Valley of Trials.\030Ah, so you come at last. Good. Jen'shan be waitin' for you.$B$BMany tink it be an easy path, but Jen'shan tell you dat not true. Mastering da beasts of Durotar and beyond take as much skill as masterin' the arcane arts or speakin' to our ancestors.$B$BFirin' a bow or rifle may not be as dangerous to you as castin' a spell, but it sure be as dangerous to your enemy.\030Etched Parchment\0312,1,53,2,257,1,3143\0302,58,84,2,257,1,3143\0302,86,147,2,257,4,3143\0302,149,196,2,257,4,3143\0303,1,72,2,384,1,3143\0301,1,80,4,272,1,3154\0301,82,117,4,272,1,3154\0301,119,196,4,272,3,3154\0301,201,303,4,272,1,3154\0301,305,332,4,272,1,3154\0301,334,374,4,272,3,3154\0304,1,24,3,256,1,3154\0304,26,30,3,256,1,3154\0304,32,59,3,256,1,3154\0304,64,128,3,256,1,3154\0304,130,248,3,256,1,3154\0304,253,367,3,260,1,3154\0313154,2,3,Jen'shan\0303154,2,5,Jen'shan\0303154,4,9,Jen'shan\0303154,4,10,Jen'shan\0303154,3,14,Jen'shan\0303154,3,15,Jen'shan\0312,0,0,5,Jen'shan\0302,0,0,5,Valley of Trials\0304,0,0,10,Jen'shan of\031788,19,788,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3088]="PARTIAL\031loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Now that you know where I'm holding up, I should let you know: the Shattered Hand's asked me to look out for you. They want me to train you and keep you informed of anything they might need. Even if you're not interested in helping them yet--which you'd be a fool not to be--I'll do what I can to train you... for a small fee. Come back to me anytime you think you're ready, and we'll see what you're ready to learn.\030Ah, while you were gone a parchment came for you, $N.$B$BRead it when you have time. If I'm not mistaken, it came from the rogue trainer Rwag. He would have words with you when you're ready.\030Read the Encrypted Parchment and speak to Rwag in the Valley of Trials.\030Shhh, not so loud. I don't trust Nartok over there. Anyone that has to hide deeper in a cave than I do shouldn't be trifled with.$B$BI trust you had no problem finding your way around?\030Encrypted Parchment\0312,1,53,2,257,1,3143\0302,58,84,2,257,1,3143\0302,86,142,2,257,4,3143\0302,144,190,2,257,4,3143\0303,1,71,2,384,1,3143\0301,1,113,4,304,1,3155\0301,115,190,4,274,4,3155\0301,192,309,4,272,4,3155\0301,311,326,4,272,1,3155\0301,328,416,4,272,1,3155\0304,1,18,3,256,1,3155\0304,20,51,3,256,1,3155\0304,53,129,3,256,1,3155\0304,134,184,3,260,2,3155\0313155,2,3,Rwag\0303155,2,5,Rwag\0303156,3,12,Nartok\0312,0,0,5,Rwag\0302,0,0,5,Valley of Trials\031788,19,788,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3089]="PARTIAL\031consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You will be the conduit in which our ancestors communicate. You will have the power of the elements at your beck and call. Sundering your enemies will be child's play; healing your allies as easy as breathing. Keep these things in mind as you face new challenges, and come back to me as often as you'd like. I will remain here to teach you new spells and set you on the correct path when you are ready.\030Ah, while you were gone a parchment came for you, $N.$B$BRead it when you have time. If I'm not mistaken, it came from the shaman trainer Shikrik. She would have words with you when you're ready.\030Read the Rune-Inscribed Parchment and speak to Shikrik in the Valley of Trials.\030So, you've arrived. I was beginning to wonder when you would show yourself. I sent the parchment some time ago--I wasn't sure if it had arrived.$B$BBut enough chatter... you're here because you have been chosen, chosen to lead the spiritual lives of our people.\030Rune-Inscribed Parchment\0312,1,53,2,257,1,3143\0302,58,84,2,257,1,3143\0302,86,146,2,257,4,3143\0302,148,195,2,257,4,3143\0303,1,79,2,384,1,3143\0301,1,59,4,272,3,3157\0301,61,122,4,272,3,3157\0301,124,209,4,340,3,3157\0301,211,307,4,272,1,3157\0301,309,402,4,272,3,3157\0304,1,19,3,256,1,3157\0304,21,75,3,256,4,3157\0304,77,144,3,256,4,3157\0304,149,169,3,256,1,3157\0304,171,261,3,258,1,3157\0313157,2,3,Shikrik\0303157,2,5,Shikrik\030616,3,14,Chatter\0312,0,0,5,Shikrik\0302,0,0,5,Valley of Trials\031788,19,788,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[309]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030requestItems\030title\031Oh, thank the Light the powder is here. But it is troubling news that you bring as well. To think that the Dark Irons have sympathizers able to procure this sort of material for their dastardly plans.$B$BThat's a matter for someone else to consider, some other time. I must put this powder to good use.\030Ready to go, $n?$B$BFirst, we need to get this powder to Ironband. It'll be a lot for me to carry, and these parts can get dangerous -- and who knows what else the Dark Irons might have in store for me.$B$BI'll feel a lot better with you coming along.\030Ensure Miran and the shipment arrive at the excavation site, then inform Prospector Ironband.\030Escort Miran to the excavation site\030Where is my powder, $N? My need grows more desperate every day.\030Protecting the Shipment\0312,1,16,2,257,2,1379\0302,21,66,2,259,1,1379\0302,68,202,2,257,4,1379\0302,207,251,2,257,1,1379\0303,1,93,2,384,1,1379\0301,1,39,4,272,1,1344\0301,41,88,4,272,1,1344\0301,90,200,4,272,1,1344\0301,205,266,4,272,1,1344\0301,268,302,4,272,1,1344\0305,1,23,3,256,2,1344\0305,25,63,3,258,1,1344\0304,1,35,3,384,1,1379\0311379,2,5,Miran\0301344,2,5,Prospector Ironband\0301379,3,13,Miran\0312,38,1432,0,\0302,0,0,2,Ironband\031454,19,454,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3090]="PARTIAL\031conflict,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031And now you've joined our ranks also. Don't misunderstand, $n. Just because you have access to power that many will be jealous of, it does not mean you will be accepted easily. Thrall allows our kind into Orgrimmar because we are still his fellow kin--he cannot turn his back on us, or we would become as pathetic as the humans who enslaved him. My point is: be careful. You can be powerful, but if you are foolish, then you are as good dead.$B$BIf you need training in spells then return to me.\030Ah, while you were gone a parchment came for you, $N.$B$BI usually avoid dealing with warlocks if I can help it, but I think you should read it when you have time. If I'm not mistaken, it came from your newly-appointed trainer Nartok. He would have words with you when you're ready.\030Read the Tainted Parchment and speak to Nartok inside the Den in the Valley of Trials.\030Finally, you've arrived... and discretely also. Good.$B$BOur world is full of fools, $N. Even the mighty Thrall has greater flaws than most can see. He turns his back on the power needed to make this land ours completely! We're not the same people who were manipulated and used by creatures from the Nether. We are our own people. We are proud... and we are strong.\030Tainted Parchment\0312,1,53,2,257,1,3143\0302,58,163,2,257,4,3143\0302,165,234,2,257,4,3143\0302,236,282,2,257,4,3143\0303,1,86,2,384,1,3143\0301,1,37,4,304,1,3156\0301,39,62,4,272,1,3156\0301,64,176,4,274,3,3156\0301,178,345,4,274,4,3156\0301,347,370,4,272,1,3156\0301,372,442,4,272,4,3156\0301,447,495,4,274,4,3156\0304,1,26,3,256,1,3156\0304,28,47,3,256,1,3156\0304,49,53,3,256,1,3156\0304,58,88,3,256,1,3156\0304,90,148,3,256,1,3156\0304,150,221,3,256,1,3156\0304,223,307,3,256,1,3156\0304,309,330,3,256,1,3156\0304,332,346,3,256,1,3156\0304,348,365,3,256,1,3156\0313156,2,3,Nartok\0303156,2,5,Nartok\0304949,4,9,Thrall\0304949,3,17,Thrall\0312,0,0,5,Nartok\0302,0,0,5,Valley of Trials\0303,0,0,19,Nether\031788,19,788,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3091]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Each of us plays a role in our tribe. Each of us must also go through all the same rites. Do not ever let your pride tell you otherwise.$B$BI remain here to train new warriors that seek the glory of battle and who follow the ways of our oldest ancestors. When you feel ready, come back to me and I will do what I can to train you further. Go with the tribe's blessing, $N.\030Just a moment ago a messenger was looking for you, $N. I believe she was sent by the warrior trainer Harutt. If this note is from Harutt, I wouldn't take long in reading it's contents.$B\030Read the Simple Note and speak to Harutt Thunderhorn in Camp Narache.\030Ah, at last, you've arrived, warrior. I did not lie in my note, $n. We are a special breed also, not unlike the druids or shamans of our tribe. You are just as important. We are the ones called upon to defend our borders, to hunt the centaur, and to go to war.\030Simple Note\0312,1,54,2,257,1,2980\0302,56,108,2,257,4,2980\0302,110,184,2,257,4,2980\0303,1,69,2,384,1,2980\0301,1,37,4,272,1,3059\0301,39,89,4,272,1,3059\0301,91,136,4,280,1,3059\0301,141,254,4,278,1,3059\0301,256,338,4,272,3,3059\0301,340,372,4,272,1,3059\0304,1,37,3,256,1,3059\0304,39,67,3,256,1,3059\0304,69,143,3,256,1,3059\0304,145,170,3,256,1,3059\0304,172,260,3,270,1,3059\0313059,2,4,Harutt Thunderhorn\03093,3,15,Centaur\0312,0,0,3,Harutt\0302,0,0,4,Harutt Thunderhorn\0302,0,0,4,Camp Narache\031747,19,747,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3092]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031And it is my job to make sure you are prepared by teaching you the basics of our profession--how to tame your pet, how to fire your rifle, and many other skills that will become necessary.$B$BHunters are a strong part of our tradition and history, $N. You would do well to remember how important you are to the tribe. You will be respected and revered if you serve our people well.\030Just a moment ago a messenger was looking for you, $N. I believe she was sent by the hunter trainer Lanka. If this note is from Lanka, I wouldn't take long in reading it's contents.$B\030Read the Etched Note and speak to Lanka Farshot in Red Cloud Mesa.\030Welcome to Camp Narache, $N. I hear good things about you. Your bloodline is strong, and many of the elders consider you skilled already. But that we will test.$B$BThe plains of Mulgore will be your home for sometime--you should do your best to learn it very well. One day you will travel to unfamilar lands to master greater skills. You must be ready.\030Etched Note\0312,1,54,2,257,1,2980\0302,56,106,2,257,4,2980\0302,108,181,2,257,4,2980\0303,1,66,2,384,1,2980\0301,1,188,4,272,3,3061\0301,193,251,4,336,1,3061\0301,253,317,4,272,4,3061\0301,319,381,4,272,4,3061\0304,1,28,3,256,1,3061\0304,30,58,3,256,1,3061\0304,60,137,3,256,1,3061\0304,139,160,3,256,3,3061\0304,165,264,3,256,3,3061\0304,266,333,3,256,3,3061\0304,335,352,3,256,1,3061\0313061,2,4,Lanka Farshot\0312,0,0,3,Lanka\0302,0,0,4,Lanka Farshot\0302,0,0,4,Red Cloud Mesa\0303,0,0,9,Camp Narache\031747,19,747,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3093]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031We will meet many times in the days to come. Each time you will hopefully leave my company a little more powerful... a little more prepared. Like the Eternal Flame, your spirit will burn bright and hot.$B$BGo now, $N. Go and test yourself. I will be here for you when you need.\030Just a moment ago a messenger was looking for you, $N. I believe she was sent by the shaman trainer Meela. If this note is from Meela, I wouldn't take long in reading it's contents.$B\030Read the Rune-Inscribed Note and speak to Meela Dawnstrider in Camp Narache.\030As quickly as water falls from the sky, here you are before me. I am pleased by your haste. It means you realize both the importance of our meeting and you being here. I am no leader, but I do understand the elements, and I can speak to the spirits of our people. I will teach you to do the same.\030Rune-Inscribed Note\0312,1,54,2,257,1,2980\0302,56,106,2,257,4,2980\0302,108,181,2,257,4,2980\0303,1,76,2,384,1,2980\0301,1,44,4,272,3,3062\0301,46,116,4,272,3,3062\0301,118,140,4,272,1,3062\0301,142,202,4,272,3,3062\0301,207,217,4,272,1,3062\0301,219,239,4,272,1,3062\0301,241,277,4,274,3,3062\0304,1,63,3,256,1,3062\0304,65,91,3,256,1,3062\0304,93,167,3,256,1,3062\0304,169,263,3,256,1,3062\0304,265,296,3,256,3,3062\0313062,2,4,Meela Dawnstrider\0312,0,0,3,Meela\0302,0,0,4,Meela Dawnstrider\0302,0,0,4,Camp Narache\031747,19,747,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3094]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Though we share a common bond, do not expect much welcome from the night elves. Their pride still limits their sight, but that is none of our concern. The teachings of the Earthmother are all you must concern yourself with, and I will teach you what I know as you grow in wisdom.$B$BReturn to me often, $N. You will find that the Earthmother grants incredible abilities to those who are most dedicated.\030Just a moment ago a messenger was looking for you, $N. I believe she was sent by the druid trainer Gart. If this note is from Gart, I wouldn't take long in reading its contents.$B\030Read the Verdant Note and speak to Gart Mistrunner in Camp Narache.\030You have arrived. This is good. Our ancestors' spirits have become restless throughout Mulgore and beyond, but I cannot tell why. It will forever be your duty to learn to listen to nature's spirits, and act as their avatar. Be mindful of that.\030Verdant Note\0312,1,54,2,257,1,2980\0302,56,104,2,257,4,2980\0302,106,177,2,257,4,2980\0303,1,67,2,384,1,2980\0301,1,79,4,272,1,3060\0301,81,150,4,272,1,3060\0301,152,279,4,272,3,3060\0301,284,306,4,272,1,3060\0301,308,402,4,272,3,3060\0304,1,17,3,256,1,3060\0304,19,31,3,256,1,3060\0304,33,129,3,256,1,3060\0304,131,223,3,256,3,3060\0304,225,243,3,256,1,3060\0313060,2,4,Gart Mistrunner\0304245,2,4,Mistrunner\0312,0,0,3,Gart\0302,0,0,4,Gart Mistrunner\0302,0,0,4,Camp Narache\031747,19,747,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3095]="PARTIAL\031consequences\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I will be here to train you as you grow in experience... find me as often as you like. I charge a minimal fee, but you'll find everything I can teach you to be worthwhile.$B$BGo now and test your skill. Many more things will become known to you as you gain experience, some of which I am unable to discuss with you here. Just know that Sylvanas will need warriors with your type of strength in the future. You will be the backbone of our salvation. Do not forget it.\030Ah, while you were off dealing with the mindless Scourge, this scroll arrived for you. I would think it's some matter of importance as it seems it bears the seal of the warrior trainer Dannal. I would take some time to read it before heading out again.\030Read the Simple Scroll and speak to Dannal Stern in Deathknell.\030Ah, so you've arrived. Good. I overheard that a few others were able to escape \"death\" and were heading into town. Perhaps that resilence will pay off in the future also.$B$BYou may thank Sylvanas for your freedom... freedom of mind and body. Though you still remain tortured by the plague and its effects, you are now free to come and go as you see fit.\030Simple Scroll\0312,1,86,2,321,1,1569\0302,88,192,2,257,4,1569\0302,194,252,2,257,4,1569\0303,1,63,2,384,1,1569\0301,1,56,4,272,3,2119\0301,58,86,4,272,1,2119\0301,88,171,4,272,1,2119\0301,176,202,4,272,1,2119\0301,204,320,4,272,3,2119\0301,322,405,4,274,3,2119\0301,407,448,4,272,3,2119\0301,450,466,4,272,1,2119\0304,1,22,3,256,1,2119\0304,24,28,3,256,1,2119\0304,30,114,3,256,1,2119\0304,116,170,3,256,4,2119\0304,175,216,3,264,1,2119\0304,218,242,3,264,1,2119\0304,244,354,3,260,1,2119\0312119,2,4,Dannal Stern\0312,0,0,4,Dannal Stern\0302,0,0,4,Deathknell\031364,19,364,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3096]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I spend most of my time here in the inn keeping an eye out for new faces and just keeping tabs on up-and-coming prospects. Keep your nose clean and I'll do what I can to teach you a few things. Just come back to me whenever you want, and we'll see if you're ready for a new skill or two.\030Ah, while you were off dealing with the mindless Scourge, this scroll arrived for you. I would think it's some matter of importance as it seems it bears the seal of the rogue trainer David Trias. I would take some time to read it before heading out again.\030Read the Encrypted Scroll and speak to David Trias in Deathknell.\030So you've made it? Good, we'll have need of more rogues as time goes on. The Shadowstalkers will probably wind up finding you when they think the time's right, so don't go and slip up or do anything you might regret. They need talented agents... not pickpockets and fools.\030Encrypted Scroll\0312,1,86,2,321,1,1569\0302,88,195,2,257,4,1569\0302,197,255,2,257,4,1569\0303,1,65,2,384,1,1569\0301,1,122,4,272,1,2122\0301,124,193,4,272,1,2122\0301,195,287,4,274,4,2122\0304,1,18,3,256,2,2122\0304,20,72,3,258,1,2122\0304,74,216,3,256,4,2122\0304,218,245,3,258,1,2122\0304,247,272,3,256,1,2122\0312122,2,2,David Trias\0302122,2,4,David Trias\0312,0,0,4,David Trias\0302,0,0,4,Deathknell\031364,19,364,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3097]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031There is only one thing you must know: we have survived through will alone. It is faith in ourselves that separates us from others, and with our powers, we will cause great change in all of Azeroth. The weak will come to lean on you. The lepers will call you Lord. And the ignorant will look to you for guidance. It is my duty to make sure you have the necessary tools so when the time comes, you are prepared. As you grow in experience, seek me out. I will teach you greater powers if you are ready.\030Ah, while you were off dealing with the mindless Scourge, this scroll arrived for you. I would think it's some matter of importance as it seems it bears the seal of the priest trainer Duesten. I would take some time to read it before heading out again.\030Read the Hallowed Scroll and speak to Dark Cleric Duesten in the church in Deathknell.\030Ah, so between fire, plague, rioting, and much worse, one more of the \"faithful\" comes to my door. Well, let me bid you welcome, $C. And allow me a moment to explain a thing or two before you decide it's time for you to seek whatever drives you forward: the Holy Light no longer concerns you, the spirits of your forefathers are fairy tales, and creatures from the Nether don't want you.$B$BDo you understand me so far?\030Hallowed Scroll\0312,1,86,2,321,1,1569\0302,88,192,2,257,4,1569\0302,194,252,2,257,4,1569\0303,1,86,2,384,1,1569\0301,1,75,4,272,3,2123\0301,77,198,4,272,3,2123\0301,200,233,4,272,3,2123\0301,235,264,4,272,3,2123\0301,266,312,4,272,3,2123\0301,314,410,4,272,1,2123\0301,412,450,4,272,1,2123\0301,452,500,4,272,4,2123\0304,1,98,3,260,1,2123\0304,100,132,3,256,1,2123\0304,134,387,3,256,1,2123\0304,392,419,3,256,2,2123\031111,2,2,Priest\0302123,2,4,Dark Cleric Duesten\0312,0,0,4,Dark Cleric Duesten\0302,0,0,4,Deathknell\0303,0,0,15,Nether\031364,19,364,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3098]="PARTIAL\031consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You must return to me often if you are to become powerful enough to destroy those who would oppose us. The rules of magic still apply to you, $N. You will still find corruption follows you like hungry wolves in the night. You will find its caress is not unlike an addiction, an old lover still wanting to be by your side. But these things can be staved off. These things will only control you if you allow them to.$B$BGo now, return to me when you've grown more powerful.\030Ah, while you were off dealing with the mindless Scourge, this scroll arrived for you. I would think it's some matter of importance as it seems it bears the seal of the mage trainer Isabella. I would take some time to read it before heading out again.\030Read the Glyphic Scroll and speak to Isabella in the church in Deathknell.\030I knew you would come to me, $N. Not because you do not have the will to follow your own path, but because we are kindred spirits. We both have felt pain. We have both suffered. And now we want the power to take back what we know is ours: this land, our lives, our destinies. But there is much for you to learn still.\030Glyphic Scroll\0312,1,86,2,321,1,1569\0302,88,191,2,257,4,1569\0302,193,251,2,257,4,1569\0303,1,74,2,384,1,1569\0301,1,102,4,276,4,2124\0301,104,145,4,272,1,2124\0301,147,221,4,276,3,2124\0301,223,321,4,272,3,2124\0301,323,357,4,272,1,2124\0301,359,414,4,272,4,2124\0301,419,471,4,272,1,2124\0304,1,32,3,256,4,2124\0304,34,130,3,258,3,2124\0304,132,154,3,256,1,2124\0304,156,177,3,256,1,2124\0304,179,275,3,258,1,2124\0304,277,317,3,256,1,2124\0312124,2,2,Isabella\0302124,2,4,Isabella\0312,0,0,4,Isabella\0302,0,0,4,Deathknell\031364,19,364,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3099]="PARTIAL\031conflict\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I mentioned a slave still being a slave, no matter the master. Do you remember? We both know that it is that type of control--that type of power--that now drives us. We seek to have creatures serve us. We know we are more powerful and deserve more respect than others give us ... and so now we look to take it.$B$BI will be your ally in this struggle--the struggle for our own freedom. Freedom to seek our own allegiances. When you feel ready, return to me and I will teach you all I know.\030Ah, while you were off dealing with the mindless Scourge, this scroll arrived for you. I would think it's some matter of importance as it seems it bears the seal of the warlock trainer Maximillion. I would take some time to read it before heading out again.\030Read the Tainted Scroll and speak to Maximillion in Deathknell.\030I bid you welcome, $gbrother:sister;. I knew you would come. It was only a matter of time.$B$BWhat I said interested you, didn't it? I hit a chord... something inside you knew what I claimed was truth. Good.$B$BKnow this though: I am no traitor to Sylvanas. If anything, she would appreciate my claims considering it was her own beliefs that has put the Forsaken in the position it is now.\030Tainted Scroll\0312,1,86,2,321,1,1569\0302,88,197,2,257,4,1569\0302,199,257,2,257,4,1569\0303,1,63,2,384,1,1569\0301,1,62,4,272,1,2126\0301,64,79,4,272,2,2126\0301,81,165,4,272,1,2126\0301,167,201,4,274,1,2126\0301,203,279,4,272,1,2126\0301,281,310,4,304,1,2126\0301,315,385,4,280,3,2126\0301,387,422,4,282,1,2126\0301,424,489,4,272,3,2126\0304,1,37,3,256,1,2126\0304,39,60,3,256,4,2126\0304,62,90,3,256,1,2126\0304,95,132,3,256,2,2126\0304,134,149,3,256,1,2126\0304,151,201,3,256,1,2126\0304,203,207,3,256,1,2126\0304,212,257,3,256,1,2126\0304,259,389,3,256,4,2126\0312126,2,2,Maximillion\0302126,2,4,Maximillion\03010116,4,5,Slave\0312,0,0,4,Maximillion\0302,0,0,4,Deathknell\0303,0,0,21,Sylvanas\031364,19,364,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[31]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Very impressive, $N. Your ancestors would be pleased with your progress! You're ready to learn your aquatic form, and it is my pleasure to teach it to you.$B$BAlso, in recognition of your achievement during the two trials, I give you this item. I hope you'll find it to be a welcome addition to your gear as a protector of nature and a keeper of the balance.\030You have completed the necessary lessons all young druids are taught before they can adopt an aquatic aspect.  Go now back to your trainer, Turak Runetotem, in Thunder Bluff.  Show him your pendant and prove to him you are ready to learn what he has to teach you.  He will complete your training, allowing you to become one with the water.$B$BGoodbye, young druid.  We shall speak again.\030Return to Thunder Bluff and show Turak Runetotem the Pendant of the Sea Lion.\030Your return to Thunder Bluff is not without heralding, though I will need proof of your lessons learned in Moonglade before I will teach you your aquatic form.$B$BDo you have the Pendant of the Sea Lion?\030Aquatic Form\0312,1,109,2,265,1,11802\0302,112,174,2,257,1,11802\0302,177,263,2,257,1,11802\0302,266,339,2,257,3,11802\0302,344,364,2,257,1,11802\0302,367,387,2,257,3,11802\0303,1,77,2,384,1,11802\0301,1,20,4,272,1,3033\0301,22,72,4,272,4,3033\0301,74,155,4,272,1,3033\0301,160,244,4,272,1,3033\0301,246,358,4,282,3,3033\0304,1,159,3,258,3,3033\0304,164,203,3,256,2,3033\0313033,2,2,Turak Runetotem\0303033,2,7,Turak Runetotem\0312,0,0,2,Thunder Bluff\0302,0,0,7,Thunder Bluff\0303,0,0,13,Thunder Bluff\0303,0,0,13,Moonglade\03130,19,30,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[310]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You quickly place Marleth's barrel of Barleybrew Scalder among the Thunderbrew barrels.\030I have to admit, those Thunderbrews make some good drinks.  But they need to learn that theirs isn't the only decent brew!  Maybe you can help me teach them that lesson...$B$BHere, take this barrel of Barleybrew Scalder.  Sneak into the basement of the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos and switch it with one of their barrels of Thunder Ale.  Then we'll see how their patrons like my brew over theirs!$B$BAnd if the barrels are guarded, then you might have to distract the guard ...\030In the basement of the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos, replace a barrel of Thunder Ale with a Barrel of Barleybrew Scalder.\030The date on this barrel shows that it'll soon be tapped.\030Bitter Rivals\0312,1,58,2,257,1,1375\0302,61,122,2,259,1,1375\0302,125,171,2,257,4,1375\0302,176,220,2,257,1,1375\0302,223,343,2,257,1,1375\0302,346,403,2,257,1,1375\0302,408,484,2,257,4,1375\0303,1,127,2,384,1,1375\0301,1,87,4,272,1,0\0304,1,56,3,256,1,0\031\0312,1,1426,0,\0302,0,0,5,Kharanos\0302,0,0,8,Kharanos\031311,23,311,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,270,FINISHER,?,12,Unguarded Thunder Ale Barrel",[3100]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Get yourself squared away, learn the layout of the land, and come back to me whenever you need training. I'll be here night or day.$B$BThe Knights of the Silver Hand have done well in making this place fairly safe, but as you meet the other citizens, I think you'll find they all have problems they could use some help with--help a warrior can give them. Good luck.\030I was asked to bring this to your attention as soon as you returned from the kobold camps, $N. It appears to be a letter sealed with the insignia of Llane, our local warrior trainer. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you go about any other business here in the Abbey.\030Read the Simple Letter and speak to Llane Beshere in Northshire Abbey.\030Ah, you got my letter, $N... good.$B$BThere's been an influx of warriors in Elwynn recently - which is good for Stormwind, but bad for the kobolds and Defias in the area.\030Simple Letter\0312,1,94,2,257,1,197\0302,96,182,2,257,1,197\0302,184,271,2,257,1,197\0303,1,70,2,384,1,197\0301,1,104,4,274,1,911\0301,106,131,4,272,1,911\0301,136,354,4,272,4,911\0301,356,365,4,272,1,911\0304,1,28,3,256,1,911\0304,30,34,3,256,1,911\0304,39,170,3,256,1,911\031911,2,4,Llane Beshere\0312,0,0,3,Abbey\0302,0,0,4,Llane Beshere\0302,0,0,4,Northshire Abbey\0303,0,0,11,Elwynn\0317,19,7,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3101]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031In the meantime, you should know one or two other things. You are a symbol to many here in this land--act accordingly. The Holy Light shines within you, and it will be obvious to both your allies and your enemies.$B$BAlso, as you gain in wisdom and power, you will need to train to learn new abilities. That's where I come in. When you feel you've gained some experience here in Northshire, come back to me and I will teach you what I feel you are ready to learn. Good luck... $C!\030I was asked to bring this to your attention as soon as you returned from the kobold camps, $N. It appears to be a letter sealed with the insignia of Brother Sammuel, our local paladin trainer. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you go about any other business here in the Abbey.\030Read the Consecrated Letter and speak to Brother Sammuel in Northshire Abbey.\030Finally! We meet face to face, brother to brother. I welcome you to Northshire. This will be your home for a short time while you learn the ins and outs of how things are done, but know that Stormwind is not far off, and sooner or later, your path will take you there. But until then, be patient... Knight of the Silver Hand.\030Consecrated Letter\0312,1,94,2,257,1,197\0302,96,192,2,257,1,197\0302,194,281,2,257,1,197\0303,1,77,2,384,1,197\0301,1,57,4,272,1,925\0301,59,118,4,272,1,925\0301,120,213,4,276,3,925\0301,218,302,4,274,3,925\0301,304,326,4,272,1,925\0301,328,463,4,272,3,925\0301,465,476,4,272,1,925\0304,1,8,3,256,1,925\0304,10,50,3,256,1,925\0304,52,79,3,256,1,925\0304,81,268,3,256,3,925\0304,270,298,3,256,1,925\0304,300,325,3,256,1,925\031925,2,2,Brother Sammuel\030925,2,4,Brother Sammuel\0312,0,0,3,Abbey\0302,0,0,4,Brother Sammuel\0302,0,0,4,Northshire Abbey\0304,0,0,10,Northshire\0303,0,0,14,Northshire\0317,19,7,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3102]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You're gonna find that there a number of outfits that'll covet our skills, $N. Adventurers, SI:7... heck, even the Defias Brotherhood wouldn't mind a spy or two inside Stormwind. But you remember this, you're your own man. Don't let nobody bully you into doing something you don't wanna do! Besides, we hold all the cards... at least, we do before the game's done. Know what I mean?$B$BAnyway, just wanted to introduce myself and let you know that I'm here if you need any training. Come by anytime.\030I was asked to bring this to your attention as soon as you returned from the kobold camps, $N. It appears to be a letter sealed with the insignia of Jorik, one of our local trainers. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you go about any other business here in the Abbey.\030Read the Encrypted Letter and speak to Jorik Kerridan in the stable behind Northshire Abbey.\030You made it here in one piece, and it doesn't look like too many people saw you. Good enough for me. I don't like to have much attention drawn to me back here... nice and quiet. I'm sure you can understand.$B$BHave any trouble yet? I'm glad to hear not. That'll change soon enough.\030Encrypted Letter\0312,1,94,2,257,1,197\0302,96,182,2,257,1,197\0302,184,271,2,257,1,197\0303,1,92,2,384,1,197\0301,1,78,4,272,1,915\0301,80,99,4,272,1,915\0301,101,178,4,272,1,915\0301,180,222,4,272,1,915\0301,224,290,4,272,1,915\0301,292,324,4,272,1,915\0301,326,364,4,272,1,915\0301,366,382,4,272,2,915\0301,387,482,4,274,4,915\0301,484,499,4,272,1,915\0304,1,80,3,256,1,915\0304,82,100,3,256,1,915\0304,102,161,3,256,1,915\0304,163,177,3,256,1,915\0304,179,206,3,256,1,915\0304,211,231,3,256,2,915\0304,233,253,3,256,1,915\0304,255,281,3,256,1,915\031915,2,4,Jorik Kerridan\0312,0,0,3,Abbey\0302,0,0,4,Jorik Kerridan\0317,19,7,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3103]="PARTIAL\031consequences\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031As you grow in experience, return to me and I will do what I can to impart my knowledge upon you. Until then, go with compassion in your heart, and let wisdom be your guide. Remember, the world only becomes a better place if you make it so.\030I was asked to bring this to your attention as soon as you returned from the kobold camps, $N. It appears to be a letter sealed with the insignia of Priestess Anetta, our local priest trainer. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you go about any other business here in the Abbey.\030Read the Hallowed Letter and speak to Priestess Anetta in Northshire Abbey.\030Ah, at last you've come. I knew you would find your way to me. The Holy Light shines upon you, and the path you've chosen. These times are harsh--the Burning Legion still has a presence upon Azeroth, the entirety of Kalimdor seeks new ways to defend itself from its own tribulations, and it is up to you to aid as many as you can.\030Hallowed Letter\0312,1,94,2,257,1,197\0302,96,192,2,257,1,197\0302,194,281,2,257,1,197\0303,1,75,2,384,1,197\0301,1,97,4,272,3,375\0301,99,173,4,272,1,375\0301,175,240,4,272,4,375\0304,1,24,3,256,1,375\0304,26,62,3,256,4,375\0304,64,122,3,256,1,375\0304,124,330,3,334,1,375\031375,2,2,Priestess Anetta\030111,2,2,Priest\030375,2,4,Priestess Anetta\0312,0,0,3,Abbey\0302,0,0,4,Priestess Anetta\0302,0,0,4,Northshire Abbey\0317,19,7,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3104]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Haha, I knew my note would not dissuade you from your path. So, you're prepared then, are you? Prepared to accept your fate? Prepared to challenge the gods and any other forces that stand before you in the pursuit of knowledge and power?$B$BI will not lie, $N, you will be feared as much as respected. But also know this, I will be here for you when you need training. Simply seek me out as you grow more powerful.\030I was asked to bring this to your attention as soon as you returned from the kobold camps, $N. It appears to be a letter sealed with the insignia of Khelden, our local mage trainer. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you go about any other business here in the Abbey.\030Read the Glyphic Letter and speak to Khelden Bremen inside Northshire Abbey.\030Hello, $N. I am Khelden. Is there something I can do for you?\030Glyphic Letter\0312,1,94,2,257,1,197\0302,96,181,2,257,1,197\0302,183,270,2,257,1,197\0303,1,76,2,384,1,197\0301,1,59,4,272,4,198\0301,61,94,4,272,2,198\0301,96,124,4,272,2,198\0301,126,237,4,272,2,198\0301,242,301,4,272,3,198\0301,303,368,4,274,3,198\0301,370,414,4,274,1,198\0304,1,10,3,256,1,198\0304,12,24,3,256,1,198\0304,26,61,3,256,2,198\031198,2,4,Khelden Bremen\0312,0,0,3,Abbey\0302,0,0,4,Khelden Bremen\0317,19,7,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3105]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031As you grow in power, you will be tempted--you must always remember to control yourself. I will not lie--corruption can come to any practitioner of the arcane; especially one who deals with creatures from the Twisting Nether. Be patient, and be prudent... but do not let that repress your ambition.$B$BAs you grow more powerful, return to me and I will teach you more about our ways.\030I was asked to bring this to your attention as soon as you returned from the kobold camps, $N. It appears to be a letter sealed with the insignia of Drusilla, one of our local trainers. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you go about any other business here in the Abbey.\030Read the Tainted Letter and speak to Drusilla La Salle next to Northshire Abbey.\030Ah, so you've arrived, and not a moment too soon, $N. Some of the guards were over here a moment ago and were giving me curious looks... pathetic mundanes.\030Tainted Letter\0312,1,94,2,257,1,197\0302,96,185,2,257,1,197\0302,187,274,2,257,1,197\0303,1,80,2,384,1,197\0301,1,88,4,272,3,459\0301,90,225,4,276,3,459\0301,227,255,4,272,1,459\0301,257,298,4,272,1,459\0301,303,383,4,272,3,459\0304,1,53,3,256,1,459\0304,55,136,3,256,1,459\0304,138,155,3,256,1,459\031459,2,4,Drusilla La Salle\0312,0,0,3,Abbey\0302,0,0,4,Drusilla La Salle\0302,0,0,4,Northshire Abbey\0304,0,0,6,Twisting Nether\0317,19,7,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3106]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Other things you'll probably see too, just so yer in the know: dwarves usin' magic in a fight 'stead of a rifle. Some of us takin' to worshippin' the Holy Light like some of the humans, and, last but not least, troggs. You'll learn more 'bout them later, but what you need to know now is that I'm here to help ya.$B$BI be here to teach ya how to be a real warrior. Anytime ya think ya need more trainin', come back to me and I'll see what I can do.\030While you were helping me out, this rune was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the warrior trainer Thran. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance.\030Read the Simple Rune and speak to Thran Khorman in Coldridge Valley.\030Blast it's cold today, aint it? It's like the snow never goes away, $N.$B$BYou've probably noticed already, but there are gnomes now living in our city. That's because they went and got themselves blown out of their own home. Don't go spreadin' this 'round, but I can hardly blame them--I think I woulda resorted to explosives too if Ironforge were infested with Dark Irons or the like.\030Simple Rune\0312,1,75,2,257,1,658\0302,77,125,2,257,1,658\0302,127,178,2,257,1,658\0302,180,252,2,257,1,658\0303,1,68,2,384,1,658\0301,1,112,4,276,1,912\0301,114,218,4,272,1,912\0301,220,313,4,274,1,912\0301,318,364,4,272,1,912\0301,366,448,4,274,1,912\0304,1,31,3,256,2,912\0304,33,71,3,256,1,912\0304,76,152,3,256,1,912\0304,154,225,3,258,1,912\0304,227,386,3,256,4,912\031912,2,5,Thran Khorman\0312,0,0,5,Thran Khorman\0302,0,0,5,Coldridge Valley\031179,19,179,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3107]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The humans have taught us a great deal about the Holy Light and how important their order is to them... and to protecting all of Azeroth. We have a great respect for how stepped in tradition it is, and how just one figure, one sacrifice, can make the difference between pain and salvation.$B$BThe two of us are gonna be working together for a bit. Any time you think you're ready, come back to me and we'll see about getting you some training. Can't have you go out into the world unprepared, now, can we?\030While you were helping me out, this rune was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the paladin trainer Bromos. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance.\030Read the Consecrated Rune and speak to Bromos Grummner in Coldridge Valley.\030So, you've made it! And not a second too soon. There's much to be done in Coldridge Valley and beyond. I'm gonna need your help as much as you're gonna need mine!$B$BYou're a Knight of the Silver Hand now, be ready to play the part.\030Consecrated Rune\0312,1,75,2,257,1,658\0302,77,125,2,257,1,658\0302,127,179,2,257,1,658\0302,181,253,2,257,1,658\0303,1,75,2,384,1,658\0301,1,103,4,272,1,926\0301,105,137,4,272,1,926\0301,139,289,4,272,1,926\0301,294,347,4,272,1,926\0301,349,443,4,272,1,926\0301,445,505,4,272,2,926\0304,1,19,3,256,1,926\0304,21,46,3,256,1,926\0304,48,102,3,256,1,926\0304,104,162,3,258,1,926\0304,167,232,3,256,1,926\031926,2,5,Bromos Grummner\0312,0,0,5,Bromos Grummner\0302,0,0,5,Coldridge Valley\0303,0,0,14,Coldridge Valley\031179,19,179,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3108]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031One thing you should always remember is that you gotta respect the world you're livin' in. The beasts that choose to fight along side you; the shine of your weapon; the weight of your ammo; the bite of a bitter wind; all these things you need to know intimately.$B$BI'll do what I can to help you, but most of the work's up to you. Anytime you think you're ready, come back and talk to me. I'll train you when I can.\030While you were helping me out, this rune was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the hunter trainer Thorgas. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance.\030Read the Etched Rune and speak to Thorgas Grimson in Coldridge Valley.\030Ya made it! Good to hear! Betcha didn't have to track me to find the place either. Haha!$B$BOur profession is pretty steeped in tradition, $N. Learning the ways of the land. Learning to track a bear through the mountains. Even just surviving on wits alone takes a great deal of courage and cunning. Think you're capable?\030Etched Rune\0312,1,75,2,257,1,658\0302,77,125,2,257,1,658\0302,127,179,2,257,1,658\0302,181,253,2,257,1,658\0303,1,70,2,384,1,658\0301,1,90,4,272,1,895\0301,92,262,4,278,1,895\0301,267,331,4,272,1,895\0301,333,389,4,272,1,895\0301,391,416,4,272,1,895\0304,1,11,3,256,1,895\0304,13,25,3,256,1,895\0304,27,82,3,256,1,895\0304,84,88,3,256,1,895\0304,93,142,3,256,1,895\0304,144,173,3,256,1,895\0304,175,221,3,256,1,895\0304,223,298,3,264,1,895\0304,300,320,3,256,2,895\031895,2,5,Thorgas Grimson\0312,0,0,5,Thorgas Grimson\0302,0,0,5,Coldridge Valley\031179,19,179,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3109]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Anyway, as you start peekin' around Coldridge you'll probably have need of training at some point. You just come back to me whenever you feel you need it and I'll teach you what I know--a trick here, a maneuver there. You know, the stuff that keeps you alive and makin' a little extra coin.$B$BKeep an eye out on our gnomish friends too... they kinda got the short end of the stick what with Gnomeregan being... destroyed. They'll need our help to feel welcome.\030While you were helping me out, this rune was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the rogue trainer Solm. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance.\030Read the Encrypted Rune and speak to Solm Hargrin in Coldridge Valley.\030You made it! Great!$B$BWe've got an influx of activity lately, so I'm glad to count another of the Ironforge clan among our numbers. Too many of us are lookin' to the arcane, and divine for my own tastes. Nothin' against them and their beliefs, but there's nothing like a cold blade in your hand and a shadow to keep you from the light, know what I mean?\030Encrypted Rune\0312,1,75,2,257,1,658\0302,77,125,2,257,1,658\0302,127,175,2,257,1,658\0302,177,249,2,257,1,658\0303,1,70,2,384,1,658\0301,1,98,4,274,1,916\0301,100,217,4,274,1,916\0301,219,290,4,272,1,916\0301,295,339,4,272,1,916\0301,341,411,4,272,1,916\0301,413,422,4,276,1,916\0301,424,461,4,274,1,916\0304,1,12,3,256,1,916\0304,14,19,3,256,1,916\0304,24,132,3,256,1,916\0304,134,204,3,256,1,916\0304,206,354,3,256,2,916\031916,2,5,Solm Hargrin\0304244,3,17,Shadow\0312,0,0,5,Solm Hargrin\0302,0,0,5,Coldridge Valley\031179,19,179,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[311]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Not bad, $N! Did you have a hard time getting past their guard?$B$BNo matter - many thanks, and if you're ever in need of stout with a kick, don't forget the Barleybrews!\030Having inserted a barrel of Marleth's Scalder in the Kharanos Distillery's cellar, you grab a barrel of Thunder Ale as proof of the deed...\030Bring the barrel of Thunder Ale to Marleth Barleybrew at the Brewnall Village.\030Did you make the switch?\030Return to Marleth\0312,1,139,2,257,1,0\0303,1,78,2,384,1,0\0301,1,12,4,272,1,1375\0301,14,63,4,272,2,1375\0301,68,170,4,274,4,1375\0304,1,24,3,256,2,1375\0311375,2,2,Marleth Barleybrew\0312,1,1426,0,\0302,0,0,1,Kharanos Distillery's\0302,0,0,2,Marleth Barleybrew\0302,0,0,2,Brewnall Village\031310,19,310,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,270,GIVER,?,9,Unguarded Thunder Ale Barrel",[3110]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I'm the one who can train ya as you start to find your way around Coldridge Valley. When ya feel yer ready, come back to me and we'll see about maybe teaching you a new spell or two to fend off the valley from them blasted troggs.$B$BYa got the Light on yer side, along with all of Ironforge, $N... no pressure on ya to become somethin' special.\030While you were helping me out, this rune was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the priest trainer Branstock. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance.\030Read the Hallowed Rune and speak to Branstock Khalder in Anvilmar.\030Ach! Ya made it, $N! Wonderful!$B$BI was gonna say, I was about to lose faith that ye'd arrive at all... get it, lose faith? It's a joke, lass... aww, nevermind. Ya didn't come here for me bad jokes anyway.\030Hallowed Rune\0312,1,75,2,257,1,658\0302,77,125,2,257,1,658\0302,127,181,2,257,1,658\0302,183,255,2,257,1,658\0303,1,66,2,384,1,658\0301,1,83,4,272,1,837\0301,85,230,4,272,4,837\0301,235,298,4,272,1,837\0301,300,345,4,272,1,837\0304,1,4,3,256,1,837\0304,6,20,3,256,1,837\0304,22,31,3,256,1,837\0304,36,104,3,256,1,837\0304,106,124,3,256,2,837\0304,126,145,3,256,1,837\0304,147,161,3,256,1,837\0304,163,206,3,256,1,837\031111,2,3,Priest\030837,2,5,Branstock Khalder\0312,0,0,5,Branstock Khalder\0302,0,0,5,Anvilmar\031179,19,179,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3112]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Well, seein' how this is your prime directive, or whatever yer callin' it these days, I gave my word I'd do whatever I can to make sure you and yours were ready to take back your home... and that's just what I'm gonna do.$B$BAny time you feel yer ready, come back to good ol' Thran and I'll be happy to share my knowledge wit ya. There's some cost to me trainin' ya, but it won't be too expensive. Good luck.\030While you were helping me out, this memorandum was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the warrior trainer Thran. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance.\030Read the Simple Memorandum and speak to Thran Khorman in Coldridge Valley.\030Ah, well, another memorandum from a gnome on a mission... isn't this quaint.$B$BNo, no, I ain't teasin' ya, little one. Gotta respect your tenacity, that much is fer sure. I'd be just as peeved if Ironforge was taken by Dark Iron dwarves, so don't be thinkin' I don't feel for your plight...\030Simple Memorandum\0312,1,81,2,257,1,658\0302,83,131,2,257,1,658\0302,133,184,2,257,1,658\0302,186,258,2,257,1,658\0303,1,74,2,384,1,658\0301,1,186,4,272,1,912\0301,188,221,4,272,1,912\0301,226,329,4,272,1,912\0301,331,397,4,272,1,912\0301,399,408,4,272,1,912\0304,1,57,3,256,1,912\0304,59,76,3,256,1,912\0304,81,119,3,256,1,912\0304,121,171,3,256,1,912\0304,173,291,3,256,4,912\031912,2,5,Thran Khorman\0312,0,0,5,Thran Khorman\0302,0,0,5,Coldridge Valley\031179,19,179,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3113]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I pretty much keep to myself around here so we don't get a bad wrap for things gone missing, but if you need anything, some training or somethin', just come back anytime.$B$BYou and me got an understandin'. We know when it comes down to it you can only trust family... and that's just what we got going on here, isn't it? Regardless of Gnomeregan being... overrun, and whatever else is thrown our way, we got one another to back each other up. Right?\030While you were helping me out, this memorandum was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the rogue trainer Solm. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance.\030Read the Encrypted Memorandum and speak to Solm Hargrin in Coldridge Valley.\030Glad to see you got my note and came over. Sorry about pretendin' it was a memorandum from your higher-ups... no offense intended. I just knew the two of us, along with others of our kind, gotta stick together.$B$BNot many think it's the best thing in the world to have your kind and my kind holed up in the same city, but I think we can work things out just fine. What do you think?\030Encrypted Memorandum\0312,1,81,2,257,1,658\0302,83,131,2,257,1,658\0302,133,181,2,257,1,658\0302,183,255,2,257,1,658\0303,1,76,2,384,1,658\0301,1,170,4,278,4,916\0301,175,206,4,272,1,916\0301,208,268,4,272,1,916\0301,270,321,4,272,2,916\0301,323,355,4,272,1,916\0301,357,443,4,272,1,916\0301,445,450,4,272,2,916\0304,1,42,3,256,1,916\0304,44,109,3,256,1,916\0304,111,130,3,256,1,916\0304,132,210,3,256,1,916\0304,215,364,3,256,1,916\0304,366,383,3,256,2,916\031916,2,5,Solm Hargrin\0312,0,0,5,Solm Hargrin\0302,0,0,5,Coldridge Valley\031179,19,179,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3114]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Oh, yeah! Arcane Arts... of course.$B$BHere's what you need to know, $N: Don't get into too much trouble. Save some coin to buy me an ale... or any spells ya might want. And stay the heck away from Gnomeregan. Other than that, have a good day! I'll be here if you need me or want to train... or whatever.\030While you were helping me out, this memorandum was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the mage trainer Marryk. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance.\030Read the Glyphic Memorandum and speak to Marryk Nurribit inside Anvilmar above Coldridge Valley.\030Yeah, what's that, gnome? Speak up, if you don't mind. I don't hear so good after a few ales.\030Glyphic Memorandum\0312,1,81,2,257,1,658\0302,83,131,2,257,1,658\0302,133,182,2,257,1,658\0302,184,256,2,257,1,658\0303,1,96,2,384,1,658\0301,1,9,4,272,1,944\0301,11,24,4,272,1,944\0301,26,35,4,272,1,944\0301,40,105,4,274,1,944\0301,107,140,4,280,1,944\0301,142,169,4,274,4,944\0301,171,209,4,272,1,944\0301,211,243,4,272,1,944\0301,245,291,4,274,4,944\0301,293,304,4,272,1,944\0304,1,25,3,256,2,944\0304,27,54,3,256,4,944\0304,56,93,3,256,1,944\031944,2,5,Marryk Nurribit\0312,0,0,5,Marryk Nurribit\0304,0,0,12,Gnomeregan\031179,19,179,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3115]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031But none of that matters. What matters is that you've seen your own Holy Light! You know where power truly comes from. You realize that having our own allies is much more... prudent. Special allies. Allies that, no matter the task, will obey till their last breath.$B$BAnd that's where I come in, $n. I can train you in the beginnings of those special powers. Seek me out often and I will do what I can to teach you more spells.\030While you were helping me out, this memorandum was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the warlock trainer Alamar. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance.$B$BAnd watch yerself, $N, your kind ain't too trusted 'round these parts.\030Read the Tainted Memorandum and speak to Alamar Grimm inside Anvilmar above Coldridge Valley.\030Wonderful! You got my memorandum obviously.$B$BIgnore the fools around you, $n. The Holy Light?! The sword and shield?! These aren't paths for ones as open minded as us. Look at what \"normal\" magic did to our home. Coupled with  those damned tinkerers, our race almost became extinct. And now we have to rely on the dwarves-- they'd rather spend time allying with humans than help us rebuild our own home. We're like second-class citizens. Have you seen the way they look at us?\030Tainted Memorandum\0312,1,81,2,257,1,658\0302,83,131,2,257,1,658\0302,133,185,2,257,1,658\0302,187,259,2,257,1,658\0302,264,333,2,257,1,658\0303,1,93,2,384,1,658\0301,1,25,4,272,1,460\0301,27,79,4,272,1,460\0301,81,118,4,272,1,460\0301,120,173,4,272,1,460\0301,175,182,4,272,1,460\0301,184,198,4,272,1,460\0301,200,265,4,272,3,460\0301,270,300,4,272,1,460\0301,302,359,4,272,1,460\0301,361,428,4,272,3,460\0304,1,10,3,256,1,460\0304,12,43,3,256,1,460\0304,48,79,3,256,1,460\0304,81,96,3,256,2,460\0304,98,119,3,256,2,460\0304,121,169,3,256,1,460\0304,171,214,3,256,1,460\0304,216,284,3,256,1,460\0304,286,405,3,320,1,460\0304,407,439,3,256,1,460\0304,441,478,3,256,2,460\031460,2,6,Alamar Grimm\0312,0,0,6,Alamar Grimm\031179,19,179,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3116]="PARTIAL\031loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Soon you will see others from different races in the boughs of our home--do not let it cause any prejudice within you. They are welcome. They will aid us when they can. Not all of them will be altruistic, but they should be granted some amount of trust.$B$BBut none of this matters now. Now we must focus on you, and how you can aid our people. I am here for that very purpose. I will train you in the ways of a warrior as you become stronger. Return to me whenever you wish and I will do what I can to aid you.\030This sigil was given to me by a messenger from our warrior trainer, Alyissia. It seems Alyissia would have words with you when you have a moment. Read it and bring it to her afterwards.\030Read the Simple Sigil and speak to Alyissia in Shadowglen.\030You made it. I'm so glad.$b$bMuch has happened over the last few years, $n: the creation of Teldrassil, the corruption of many of the forest creatures here and abroad, discovery of lands we thought lost to us like Feralas... so much, in so little time. But those are just some of the reasons we are here, the most important being to protect our kind from further evil.\030Simple Sigil\0312,1,77,2,257,1,2079\0302,79,145,2,257,4,2079\0302,147,185,2,257,1,2079\0303,1,58,2,384,1,2079\0301,1,118,4,272,3,3593\0301,120,136,4,272,1,3593\0301,138,168,4,272,3,3593\0301,170,253,4,272,3,3593\0301,258,286,4,272,1,3593\0301,288,344,4,304,1,3593\0301,346,377,4,272,1,3593\0301,379,443,4,272,3,3593\0301,445,511,4,274,3,3593\0304,1,12,3,256,1,3593\0304,14,25,3,256,1,3593\0304,30,224,3,260,1,3593\0304,226,252,3,256,1,3593\0304,254,368,3,270,1,3593\0313593,2,1,Alyissia\0303593,2,2,Alyissia\0303593,2,4,Alyissia\0312,0,0,4,Alyissia\0302,0,0,4,Shadowglen\031456,19,456,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3117]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031As you experience what Shadowglen has to teach you, come see me--I will be able to help you understand more about your role as a $C and what you are capable of.$B$BThese are dangerous times, $N, do not take for granted the skill of your pets--there are things in this world more dangerous than you can imagine. Go with Elune and return to me again.\030This sigil was given to me by a messenger from our hunter trainer, Ayanna. It seems Ayanna would have words with you when you have a moment. Read it and bring it to her afterwards.\030Read the Etched Sigil and speak to Ayanna Everstride at the top of Aldrassil in Shadowglen.\030You've arrived, and none too soon, $N. Welcome to Shadowglen.$B$BI trust my sigil found you in good spirits and health?$B$BAs I said previously, I am here to train you as a $C; to tame beasts to aid you in battle; to use a bow with unerring accuracy; to respect the lands which we call home and also the lands beyond.\030Etched Sigil\0312,1,74,2,257,1,2079\0302,76,140,2,257,4,2079\0302,142,180,2,257,1,2079\0303,1,91,2,384,1,2079\0301,1,160,4,272,3,3596\0301,165,310,4,272,1,3596\0301,312,348,4,272,1,3596\0304,1,38,3,256,1,3596\0304,40,61,3,256,1,3596\0304,66,119,3,256,2,3596\0304,124,317,3,260,1,3596\0313596,2,4,Ayanna Everstride\0312,0,0,4,Ayanna Everstride\0302,0,0,4,Shadowglen\0303,0,0,9,Shadowglen\031456,19,456,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3118]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Until then, know that our kind are needed more than ever in this tenuous time. Peace with the other races can fail at any moment, and there is much talk about members of the Horde looking to sow even greater seeds of distrust. Remember that.$B$BAs you gain in power and feel more prepared, come back to me here and I will see about getting you some training. It's important that you know how to handle your weapon of choice, among other things.\030This sigil was given to me by a messenger from our rogue trainer, Frahun. It seems Frahun would have words with you when you have a moment. Read it and bring it to him afterwards.\030Read the Encrypted Sigil and speak to Frahun Shadewhisper in Shadowglen.\030Hello, Ferlis. I'm glad you found me. I was thinking that perhaps you got lost on the way here.$B$BNothing really new has happened in Shadowglen since I sent you my sigil, but I'll leave all the information gathering to you. Speak to the rest of the people around Aldrassil if you'd like.\030Encrypted Sigil\0312,1,73,2,257,1,2079\0302,75,139,2,257,4,2079\0302,141,179,2,257,1,2079\0303,1,72,2,384,1,2079\0301,1,78,4,272,1,3594\0301,80,226,4,280,1,3594\0301,228,241,4,272,1,3594\0301,246,358,4,272,3,3594\0301,360,444,4,272,1,3594\0304,1,14,3,256,1,3594\0304,16,37,3,256,1,3594\0304,39,95,3,260,4,3594\0304,100,224,3,256,1,3594\0304,226,288,3,256,4,3594\0313594,2,4,Frahun Shadewhisper\0312,0,0,4,Frahun Shadewhisper\0302,0,0,4,Shadowglen\0303,0,0,13,Shadowglen\031456,19,456,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3119]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Do not concern yourself with the world below Teldrassil for now. There will be time for that later. Go now and speak to the others in Shadowglen--they can tell you more about what events have transpired. Help them in any way you can, and anytime you feel you need more training, come back to me and I will teach you what I can.\030This sigil was given to me by a messenger from our priest trainer, Shanda. It seems Shanda would have words with you when you have a moment. Read it and bring it to her afterwards.\030Read the Hallowed Sigil and speak to Shanda in Aldrassil.\030It pleases me to see you've arrived so quickly, $N. Welcome.$B$BAs you've probably heard, all of Teldrassil is stirring with the comings and goings of travelers. Even members of the Alliance have even been allowed access onto Teldrassil's boughs in order to meet with other Kaldorei who prepare for the adventures ahead.\030Hallowed Sigil\0312,1,74,2,257,1,2079\0302,76,140,2,257,4,2079\0302,142,180,2,257,1,2079\0303,1,57,2,384,1,2079\0301,1,64,4,272,1,3595\0301,66,99,4,272,3,3595\0301,101,203,4,272,1,3595\0301,205,327,4,274,3,3595\0304,1,51,3,256,1,3595\0304,53,60,3,256,1,3595\0304,65,161,3,256,1,3595\0304,163,320,3,258,1,3595\031111,2,1,Priest\0303595,2,1,Shanda\0303595,2,2,Shanda\0303595,2,4,Shanda\0312,0,0,4,Shanda\0302,0,0,4,Aldrassil\0304,0,0,7,Shadowglen--they\031456,19,456,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[312]="PARTIAL\031loreConnections,motivations,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031What a kind soul you are, $N! Thanks to your bravery I won't find myself starving when the cold season flurries blow in.\030I had a month's worth of dried meats salted and locked away for the cold season.  Kept it locked so the bears wouldn't get it!  But while I was off hunting deer, that beast, Old Icebeard, made off with the meat locker.  He won't be able to smash through that Thorium though.  But I'll starve if I can't get my meats back.$B$BYou seem a bit more stealthy than me.  Perhaps you can retrieve my stash?  I'll never make it in and out of that cave fast enough with this bum leg of mine.\030Retrieve Tundra MacGrann's dried meats from the stolen meat locker in Old Icebeard's cave.\030Were you able to get into my meat locker, $N?\030Tundra MacGrann's Stolen Stash\0312,1,80,2,257,1,1266\0302,83,126,2,257,1,1266\0302,129,218,2,257,1,1266\0302,221,274,2,257,1,1266\0302,277,321,2,269,4,1266\0302,326,362,2,257,4,1266\0302,365,398,2,257,4,1266\0302,401,481,2,257,1,1266\0303,1,90,2,388,1,1266\0301,1,29,4,272,1,1266\0301,31,120,4,316,1,1266\0304,1,45,3,256,2,1266\031883,2,3,Deer\0301271,2,3,Old Icebeard\0301266,2,9,Tundra MacGrann\0301271,2,9,Old Icebeard\0312,1,1426,0,\0302,0,0,9,Old Icebeard's\031\031ITEM,2667,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[3120]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I will be your mentor and guide for now. It is my duty to teach you how to interpret not only what the spirits communicate to us, but also the complexities and secrets of the Emerald Dream.$B$BAs you learn and grow in power, you will learn more of our sleeping trance. But until then, return to me as often as you like and I will teach you what I can in the ways of our kind.\030This sigil was given to me by a messenger from our druid trainer, Mardant. It seems Mardant would have words with you when you have a moment. Read it and bring it to him afterwards.\030Read the Verdant Sigil and speak to Mardant Strongoak, in the tree Aldrassil in Shadowglen.\030Ah, young $C. I see you're eager to continue your studies. Good.$B$BI wonder, have you spent much time in the Emerald Dream already? Perhaps you're not prepared for that yet... In time, I'm sure.$B$BBut until then, we should discuss other matters.\030Verdant Sigil\0312,1,74,2,257,1,2079\0302,76,141,2,257,4,2079\0302,143,181,2,257,1,2079\0303,1,91,2,384,1,2079\0301,1,40,4,272,3,3597\0301,42,189,4,272,1,3597\0301,194,268,4,272,3,3597\0301,270,375,4,272,3,3597\0304,1,13,3,256,1,3597\0304,15,58,3,256,1,3597\0304,60,64,3,256,1,3597\0304,69,132,3,256,2,3597\0304,134,176,3,256,4,3597\0304,178,195,3,256,1,3597\0304,200,247,3,256,1,3597\0313597,2,4,Mardant Strongoak\0312,0,0,4,Mardant Strongoak\0302,0,0,4,Shadowglen\0303,0,0,12,Emerald Dream\031456,19,456,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3121]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I have been waiting for Uzer'i to deliver this...$B$BLet me give you the herb mixture I prepared for his... well, experiments...\030Neeru Fireblade in Orgrimmar has what I need to get started here! He has mixed up a concoction that I need for my... well, you'll see.$B$BOff with you now -- to Orgrimmar. Here, take this with you. It's a shrunken head that I promised Neeru in exchange for the herbs. It's the head of some poor dwarf I ventured across in the forest. I'm sure Neeru will be pleased.$B$BYou'll find Neeru in the Cleft of Shadow.\030Take the Shrunken Head to Neeru Fireblade in Orgrimmar.\030Yes?\030A Strange Request\0312,1,65,2,259,1,8115\0302,67,116,2,259,1,8115\0302,118,134,2,257,1,8115\0302,139,171,2,257,1,8115\0302,173,197,2,257,1,8115\0302,199,267,2,257,1,8115\0302,269,333,2,257,1,8115\0302,335,365,2,257,3,8115\0302,370,410,2,257,1,8115\0303,1,55,2,384,1,8115\0301,1,49,4,272,1,3216\0301,54,107,4,272,1,3216\0301,109,128,4,272,1,3216\0304,1,4,3,256,2,3216\0313216,2,1,Neeru Fireblade\0304244,2,9,Shadow\0303216,2,10,Neeru Fireblade\0312,357,1444,0,\0302,0,0,1,Orgrimmar\0302,0,0,4,Orgrimmar\0302,0,0,9,Cleft of Shadow\0302,0,0,10,Neeru Fireblade\0302,0,0,10,Orgrimmar\0313122,23,3122,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3122]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This is just what I need to prepare the muisek vessel, $N. Soon we will see if my latest incantations prove to be as powerful as I had hoped.$B$BPlease, a moment. I must perform the ritual and apply the herbs.\030Here are the herbs, $N. Take them to Witch Doctor Uzer'i.$B$BPlease let him know that I am satisfied with the shrunken head.\030Deliver Neeru's Herb Pouch to Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Feralas.\030Have you spoken to Neeru?\030Return to Witch Doctor Uzer'i\0312,1,23,2,257,1,3216\0302,25,57,2,257,1,3216\0302,62,124,2,257,1,3216\0303,1,61,2,384,1,3216\0301,1,58,4,274,1,8115\0301,60,141,4,272,4,8115\0301,146,162,4,272,1,8115\0301,164,209,4,272,1,8115\0304,1,25,3,256,2,8115\0318115,2,2,Witch Doctor Uzer'i\0308115,2,4,Witch Doctor Uzer'i\0312,357,1444,0,\0302,0,0,2,Witch Doctor Uzer'i\0302,0,0,4,Witch Doctor Uzer'i\0302,0,0,4,Feralas\0303,0,0,9,Neeru\0313121,19,3121,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0303123,23,3123,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3123]="PARTIAL\031conflict,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Upon a violent death, the muisek of a creature may escape and seek revenge. Shrinking the creatures, as you did, $N, prevents the muisek from escaping. Now we may use it as we please!\030This will be a test; both of the ritual I performed, and of your abilities. Take this vessel, $N. With it, you will have the power to shrink and capture a creature inside of it.$B$BTravel to the Hinterlands and look for creatures known as Wildkin that were once pets of the night elf goddess Elune. The vicious, primitive, or savage owlbeasts are your targets, $N. Kill 10, and use the muisek vessel to shrink and capture them before their spirits can escape.\030Travel to the Hinterlands, and locate the Wildkin. Kill 10, and use the Muisek Vessel to shrink and capture the fallen Wildkin.$B$BBring 10 Wildkin Muiseks and the Muisek Vessel to Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Feralas.\030Were you able to capture the wildkin?$B$BIf you succeed, we will be ready to shrink and capture the muisek of creatures of Feralas.\030Testing the Vessel\0312,1,75,2,257,3,8115\0302,77,97,2,257,1,8115\0302,99,177,2,257,3,8115\0302,182,298,2,257,1,8115\0302,300,364,2,257,1,8115\0302,366,459,2,257,1,8115\0303,1,50,2,384,1,8115\0303,52,127,2,384,1,8115\0303,132,212,2,384,1,8115\0301,1,75,4,274,1,8115\0301,77,151,4,272,1,8115\0301,153,183,4,304,1,8115\0304,1,37,3,256,2,8115\0304,42,131,3,256,4,8115\0318115,2,9,Witch Doctor Uzer'i\0312,357,1444,0,\0302,0,0,4,Hinterlands\0302,0,0,7,Hinterlands\0302,0,0,9,Witch Doctor Uzer'i\0302,0,0,9,Feralas\0313122,19,3122,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0303124,23,3124,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,9594,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[3124]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031After killing an animal, if we allowed the muisek to escape, it may take the form of an even greater creature. We would never be safe from its vengeance.$B$BThis is a dangerous job I have given you, $N. Again, you have completed it well.\030Since you have proven that you are both trustworthy and gifted with the ability to use the muisek vessel, I now wish you to capture another creature.$B$BHippogryphs have been loyal companions to the night elves for many years; their spirits are loyal and steadfast.$B$BYour task is to kill 10 frayfeather hippogryphs, and quickly, shrink and capture them with the vessel, so that their muisek may be preserved. You will find the hippogryphs in the High Wilderness, to the south of here.\030Kill 10 Frayfeather Hippogryphs of any type, then use the Muisek Vessel to shrink and capture them.\030Were you able to capture the hippogryphs?\030Hippogryph Muisek\0312,1,149,2,259,3,8115\0302,154,265,2,257,1,8115\0302,270,410,2,259,1,8115\0302,412,486,2,257,3,8115\0303,1,99,2,384,1,8115\0301,1,110,4,272,4,8115\0301,112,153,4,274,4,8115\0301,158,202,4,272,1,8115\0301,204,237,4,272,1,8115\0304,1,41,3,256,2,8115\031\0312,357,1444,0,\0302,0,0,4,High Wilderness\0313123,19,3123,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0303125,23,3125,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,9595,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[3125]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you, $N. Now the spiritual powers of the faerie dragon will be available to us.$B$BI hope you willing to perform another task for me.\030$N, next I must have you capture a creature that in appearance, may look quite fragile, yet its powerful spirit is what we are truly after. The faerie dragons that I speak of have served the night elves as their allies. We must capture one so that the horde may benefit from this strength of spirit as well.$B$BHere is the muisek, $N. Kill 8 sprite darters or sprite dragons, and capture their muisek. They may be found to the west of here.\030Kill 8 Sprite Darters or Sprite Dragons. Use the Muisek Vessel to shrink and capture the fallen Faerie Dragons.\030Were you able to capture the muisek of the faerie dragons?\030Faerie Dragon Muisek\0312,1,139,2,257,1,8115\0302,141,219,2,257,1,8115\0302,221,307,2,259,1,8115\0302,312,334,2,257,1,8115\0302,336,401,2,257,1,8115\0302,403,440,2,257,1,8115\0303,1,40,2,384,1,8115\0303,42,111,2,384,1,8115\0301,1,14,4,272,1,8115\0301,16,85,4,272,3,8115\0301,90,139,4,274,3,8115\0304,1,58,3,256,2,8115\031\0312,357,1444,0,\0313124,19,3124,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0303126,23,3126,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,9596,OBJECTIVE,8,15,",[3126]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you, $N. Our muisek collection is almost complete.\030The wandering forest walkers that can be found meandering through the forest are our next target, $N. Night elves have enlisted treants as allies to fight against the horde. Their movement may be slow, but their role as protectors is undeniable.$B$BSoon we will be able to use this power for our own benefit.$B$BFind 3 wandering forest walkers; kill them, and use the muisek vessel to shrink and capture them.\030Kill 3 Wandering Forest Walkers. Use the Muisek Vessel to shrink and capture the fallen Treants.\030Were you able to capture the wandering forest walkers?\030Treant Muisek\0312,1,101,2,257,1,8115\0302,103,173,2,261,1,8115\0302,175,245,2,257,1,8115\0302,250,308,2,257,3,8115\0302,313,409,2,257,1,8115\0303,1,32,2,384,1,8115\0303,34,96,2,384,1,8115\0301,1,14,4,272,1,8115\0301,16,56,4,272,1,8115\0304,1,54,3,256,2,8115\031\0312,357,1444,0,\0313125,19,3125,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0303127,23,3127,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,9593,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[3127]="PARTIAL\031consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Just imagine the possibilities of what we now possess, $N. Along with the materials that you have collected, I will be able to forever trap the muisek of these creatures into whatever I wish.\030The last task I will require of you is to travel to the northwest and find the final enemy.$B$BThe mountain giants left the mountains to aid the night elves when the burning legion appeared in the world. You will know them by their massive size and the way the ground begins to shake as you travel along their rocky terrain.$B$BI am eager to harness power of that size. Kill 7 mountain giants, then use the muisek vessel to capture their powerful muisek.\030Kill 7 Land Walkers or Cliff Giants. Use the Muisek Vessel to shrink and capture the fallen Mountain Giants.\030Were you able to capture the mountain giants?\030Mountain Giant Muisek\0312,1,91,2,261,3,8115\0302,96,203,2,321,1,8115\0302,205,324,2,257,3,8115\0302,329,369,2,257,1,8115\0302,371,454,2,257,1,8115\0303,1,36,2,384,1,8115\0303,38,108,2,384,1,8115\0301,1,58,4,272,1,8115\0301,60,191,4,274,3,8115\0304,1,45,3,256,2,8115\031\0312,357,1444,0,\0313126,19,3126,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,9597,OBJECTIVE,7,15,",[3128]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent! These materials, combined with the muisek, should yield just the results we've been wanting.\030I will need certain materials to complete my endeavor... You may do this alongside the other tasks I will give you.$B$BI'll need a splintered log from a treant of Feralas. Encrusted minerals, these can be found on the mountain giants and faerie dragons to the west. Also, find me some resilient sinew from the owlbeasts of the Hinterlands or hippogryphs of Feralas. Finally, I'll need a large amount of metallic fragments from any of these creatures I mentioned.\030Bring 2 Splintered Logs, 6 Encrusted Minerals, 20 pieces of Resilient Sinew, and 40 Metallic Fragments to Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Camp Mojache.\030Were you able to collect the materials I need?\030Natural Materials\0312,1,56,2,259,3,8115\0302,58,115,2,257,3,8115\0302,120,171,2,259,1,8115\0302,173,265,2,257,1,8115\0302,267,365,2,257,1,8115\0302,367,462,2,259,1,8115\0303,1,142,2,384,1,8115\0301,1,10,4,272,1,8115\0301,12,103,4,272,1,8115\0304,1,46,3,258,2,8115\0311964,2,3,Treant\0308115,2,7,Witch Doctor Uzer'i\0312,357,1444,0,\0302,0,0,7,Witch Doctor Uzer'i\0302,0,0,7,Camp Mojache\031\031ITEM,9590,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,9589,OBJECTIVE,6,15,\030ITEM,9591,OBJECTIVE,20,15,\030ITEM,9592,OBJECTIVE,40,15,",[3129]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031As promised, you have your choice, $N. The muisek of the creatures has been forever sealed into the power of these weapons.$B$BYou may now wield their energy as your own. Use it well.\030Imbuing the muisek into the weapons is a difficult process. Now that I have all of the required materials and the muisek of the creatures that you captured, I may begin. Please wait; I will return in a moment.\030Witch Doctor Uzer'i wants you to wait for a moment while he prepares the weapons.\030\030Weapons of Spirit\0312,1,59,2,257,1,8115\0302,61,169,2,257,1,8115\0302,171,209,2,257,3,8115\0303,1,81,2,386,1,8115\0301,1,38,4,272,1,8115\0301,40,123,4,272,1,8115\0301,128,170,4,272,1,8115\0301,172,183,4,272,1,8115\0318115,2,4,Witch Doctor Uzer'i\0312,357,1444,0,\0313127,21,3127,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0303128,21,3128,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[313]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah yes, these manes will work great! You show a lot of grit, $C - I wager we'll see great things from you.\030Driving a Siege Engine isn't for everyone.  It takes an iron grip and nerves of steel...lucky I have both!  How about you?  How's your mettle?  Want to prove it to me?$B$BWell...I'm looking to make my engine, Trollplow, a little more cozy.  How about you get me a heap of Wendigo Manes from the Grizzled Den, west of Kharanos.  Those manes would make a great rug for Trollplow's inside deck!\030Gather 8 Wendigo Manes and bring them to Pilot Stonegear.\030Hey, $N. Been to the Grizzled Den yet? Those Wendigos can be fierce.\030The Grizzled Den\0312,1,42,2,257,1,1377\0302,45,106,2,257,1,1377\0302,109,122,2,257,2,1377\0302,125,142,2,257,2,1377\0302,145,167,2,257,2,1377\0302,172,239,2,257,1,1377\0302,242,326,2,257,1,1377\0302,329,391,2,257,4,1377\0303,1,57,2,384,1,1377\0301,1,36,4,272,3,1377\0301,38,106,4,272,1,1377\0304,1,8,3,256,1,1377\0304,10,38,3,256,2,1377\0304,40,68,3,256,1,1377\0311135,2,7,Wendigo\0301135,2,9,Wendigo\0301377,2,9,Pilot Stonegear\0312,1,1426,0,\0302,0,0,7,Grizzled Den\0302,0,0,7,Kharanos\0302,0,0,9,Pilot Stonegear\0303,0,0,13,Grizzled Den\031\031ITEM,2671,OBJECTIVE,8,15,",[3130]="PARTIAL\031consequences\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent, $N - I value a \"can do\" attitude in those who I work with.$B$BI've been tasked by General Feathermoon to address the naga in a direct manner.  My plans are two fold: one, we will weaken their forces both in number and in command, and two, we will uncover what they are up to in the ruins.  With your help, we'll counter the naga presence without sacrificing the general security of the stronghold.\030At this point, I am going to direct you to my second, Latronicus.  He's been keeping a close eye on the naga forces to date.  I'll assess the general situation here in regards to the naga; as much as I want to commit a full force to move against them, leaving the stronghold open to direct attack from the Horde - or worse - seems less than optimal.$B$BAnyway, Latronicus awaits.  Good work thus far, $n.  Keep it up.$B$BYou're dismissed.\030Report to Latronicus Moonspear in Feathermoon Stronghold.\030\030Against the Hatecrest\0312,1,65,2,257,3,3936\0302,68,124,2,257,1,3936\0302,127,349,2,263,4,3936\0302,354,379,2,257,1,3936\0302,382,404,2,257,1,3936\0302,407,417,2,257,1,3936\0302,422,438,2,257,1,3936\0303,1,57,2,384,1,3936\0301,1,69,4,272,1,7877\0301,74,152,4,272,1,7877\0301,155,299,4,336,3,7877\0301,302,408,4,280,1,7877\0317877,2,8,Latronicus Moonspear\0312,357,1444,0,\0302,0,0,3,Horde\0302,0,0,8,Latronicus Moonspear\0302,0,0,8,Feathermoon Stronghold\0312867,19,2867,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0302869,23,2869,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[314]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Very well done! Veron will be so happy when he hears the good news. To kill Vagash is no easy task. I imagine one day you'll be fighting alongside King Magni's men on the Alliance Front.\030We heard the cries in the middle of the night.  Then this morning, sure enough, the herd was missing two rams.  That dastardly beast known as Vagash has been preying on our livelihood.  With most of King Magni's army off in distant lands fighting with the Alliance, there is no one to keep Vagash at bay.$B$BPerhaps you are brave enough to seek out the beast and slay him.  Bring me one of his fangs and I will reward you.  Vagash lurks just above the ranch here, but be warned, he is deadly.\030Rudra Amberstill wants you to slay Vagash and bring his fang to her at the Ram ranch.\030Vagash still terrorizes the herd! Please help us by killing the wretched beast.\030Protecting the Herd\0312,1,46,2,257,1,1265\0302,49,110,2,261,1,1265\0302,113,184,2,257,1,1265\0302,187,304,2,261,1,1265\0302,309,372,2,259,4,1265\0302,375,422,2,257,3,1265\0302,425,492,2,257,1,1265\0303,1,85,2,386,1,1265\0301,1,15,4,272,1,1265\0301,17,67,4,272,3,1265\0301,69,99,4,272,1,1265\0301,101,186,4,276,1,1265\0304,1,33,3,256,1,1265\0304,35,79,3,256,1,1265\0311388,2,3,Vagash\0301388,2,4,Vagash\03010430,2,5,The Beast\0301388,2,7,Vagash\0301265,2,8,Rudra Amberstill\0301388,2,8,Vagash\03014892,2,8,Fang\0301388,4,11,Vagash\0301388,3,13,Vagash\0312,1,1426,0,\0302,0,0,8,Ram\031\031ITEM,3627,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[3141]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030requestItems\030title\031So be it...\030So you wish to battle demons? You would do well to listen to my tale.\030Listen to Loramus Thalipedes tell his story.\030Loramus' Story\030Do not interrupt me, $r.\030Loramus\0312,1,29,2,263,2,7783\0302,31,69,2,257,4,7783\0303,1,44,2,384,1,7783\0305,1,24,3,256,1,7783\0304,1,14,3,384,1,7783\0317783,2,3,Loramus Thalipedes\0312,16,1447,0,\0302,0,0,3,Loramus Thalipedes\0312744,19,2744,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0303508,23,3508,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[315]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Great! I can't wait to use these in some of my recipes. There's one in particular I think it'll work great in...\030I'm on a quest, a quest to make the perfect stout.  I know I can do it -- brewing's in my blood.  I just need to find the right recipe...$B$BThe Frostmane trolls grow a plant, shimmerweed, high up in the hills to the east.  They use it in their strange, tribal rituals.  We dwarves haven't found much use for it, but it has a unique taste...and I want to experiment with it in my brews!$B$BGet me some shimmerweed from Frostmane seers, or swipe it from the trolls' shimmerweed baskets.\030Bring 6 Shimmerweeds to Rejold Barleybrew in the Brewnall Village.\030Do you have that Shimmerweed? I almost have a batch of stout ready to brew, and I want to try throwing the weed in with this mixture.\030The Perfect Stout\0312,1,50,2,257,1,1374\0302,53,96,2,257,1,1374\0302,99,137,2,259,1,1374\0302,142,222,2,257,1,1374\0302,225,269,2,257,1,1374\0302,272,386,2,259,1,1374\0302,391,485,2,257,1,1374\0303,1,66,2,384,1,1374\0301,1,6,4,272,1,1374\0301,8,55,4,272,1,1374\0301,57,112,4,272,1,1374\0304,1,29,3,256,2,1374\0304,31,133,3,258,1,1374\0311374,2,8,Rejold Barleybrew\0312,1,1426,0,\0302,0,0,7,Frostmane\0302,0,0,8,Rejold Barleybrew\0302,0,0,8,Brewnall Village\031413,23,413,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,2676,OBJECTIVE,6,15,",[3161]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Perfect; these ornaments are perfect for my studies. Thanks so much for the help, $N.$B$BOh, can I get my helmet back?\030$N, I'm a scientist, but also a treasure hunter at heart!$B$BLong ago, when trolls used to occupy this land, they created large amounts of ornaments modeled after Gahz'rilla, a hydra they worshipped as a deity. These ornaments are carved out of an element that I call \"Gahz'ridian\", after the hydra god.$B$BI did find some myself, but I'd like to have some more to study -- maybe you can find some?$B$BI even invented a detector that makes finding the Gahz'ridian a snap! Just put it on, and the search begins!\030Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris wants you to collect 30 Gahz'ridian Ornaments.\030Are you having any trouble?$B$BYou can find Gahz'ridian just about anywhere in Tanaris, $N, so keep looking!\030Gahz'ridian\0312,1,57,2,257,1,7771\0302,62,210,2,321,1,7771\0302,212,303,2,257,1,7771\0302,308,398,2,259,4,7771\0302,403,471,2,257,1,7771\0302,473,510,2,257,1,7771\0303,1,76,2,386,1,7771\0301,1,52,4,272,1,7771\0301,54,85,4,272,1,7771\0301,90,118,4,272,2,7771\0304,1,27,3,256,2,7771\0304,32,108,3,256,1,7771\0317273,2,2,Gahz'rilla\0307771,2,7,Marvon Rivetseeker\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,7,Tanaris\0303,0,0,12,Tanaris\031\031ITEM,8443,OBJECTIVE,30,15,",[317]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031By Magni's beard, you sure did a lot of hunting!! Thank you, $N.\030I'm preparing to start a mission for the Siege Brigade.  It's a long one, and I need to stock Jetsteam with a month's worth of supplies.  So while Steelgrill is working on my tank, can you do some hunting for me?$B$BI'll need some fur for bedding, and boar meat for food.  You can get meat from boars and fur from the bears... you can find them both in the snow fields south of the Grizzled Den.\030Gather 4 Chunks of Boar Meat and 2 Thick Bear Furs, and deliver them to Pilot Bellowfiz at Steelgrill's Depot.\030Preparations are going well. How goes your hunting?\030Stocking Jetsteam\0312,1,55,2,257,1,1378\0302,58,136,2,259,1,1378\0302,139,212,2,257,2,1378\0302,217,271,2,259,1,1378\0302,274,326,2,257,1,1378\0302,328,395,2,257,1,1378\0303,1,110,2,384,1,1378\0301,1,49,4,272,1,1378\0301,51,64,4,272,1,1378\0304,1,28,3,256,1,1378\0304,30,51,3,256,2,1378\0312809,2,4,Boar\0302809,2,7,Boar\0301378,2,7,Pilot Bellowfiz\0312,1,1426,0,\0302,0,0,6,Grizzled Den\0302,0,0,7,Pilot Bellowfiz\0302,0,0,7,Steelgrill's Depot\031318,23,318,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,769,OBJECTIVE,4,15,\030ITEM,6952,OBJECTIVE,2,15,",[318]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Bellowfiz needs some of my Evershine? Hm...all right.\030Rejold Barleybrew experiments with his brews.  Some of them taste good, some bad, and some...well, some will lay all but the stoutest dwarf flat.$B$BHe lives at Brewnall Village, west of Kharanos, and one of his drinks, Evershine, is what I want.  It'll help keep me warm while I'm on the cold road.$B$BAnd...the blessed stuff burns so hot I can throw it in Jetsteam's furnace for a burst of power!  That little tactic has gotten me out of more than one tight spot.\030Get a cask of Evershine from Rejold Barleybrew in Brewnall Village.\030\030Evershine\0312,1,45,2,257,1,1378\0302,48,145,2,257,3,1378\0302,150,246,2,259,1,1378\0302,249,299,2,257,1,1378\0302,304,398,2,257,1,1378\0302,401,465,2,257,1,1378\0303,1,67,2,384,1,1378\0301,1,37,4,274,2,1374\0301,39,53,4,272,1,1374\0311374,2,1,Rejold Barleybrew\03011045,2,5,Burns\0304950,2,6,Spot\0301374,2,7,Rejold Barleybrew\0312,1,1426,0,\0302,0,0,3,Brewnall Village\0302,0,0,3,Kharanos\0302,0,0,5,Jetsteam's\0302,0,0,7,Rejold Barleybrew\0302,0,0,7,Brewnall Village\031317,19,317,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030319,23,319,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3181]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031What have you got there? A fake obviously!$B$BI've been face to face with Margol and I know for a fact that her horn is at least eight times larger than the one you've got in your hands, $N. You probably got that off of a stormsnout in the Barrens. No ma'am, you can't fool Pebblebitty!\030The gigantic horn has numerous scratches and cracks. An unusual metal object is lodged into the rough surface.$B$BUpon further examination, you notice that the metal is actually a broken axe head. On the metal, the following words are etched:$B$BProperty of Mountaineer Pebblebitty.$B$BWhen you try and dislodge the broken axe head, it shatters into a million pieces.$B$BWoops!\030Take Margol's Gigantic Horn to Mountaineer Pebblebitty.$B\030No, I will not open the gate.\030The Horn of the Beast\0312,1,52,2,257,1,0\0302,54,110,2,257,1,0\0302,115,196,2,257,1,0\0302,198,242,2,257,1,0\0302,247,282,2,257,1,0\0302,287,367,2,257,1,0\0302,372,377,2,257,1,0\0303,1,55,2,384,1,0\0301,1,24,4,272,2,3836\0301,26,42,4,272,1,3836\0301,47,190,4,272,1,3836\0301,192,248,4,272,1,3836\0301,250,286,4,272,1,3836\0304,1,29,3,256,3,3836\0313836,2,5,Mountaineer Pebblebitty\0303836,2,8,Mountaineer Pebblebitty\0303240,4,12,Stormsnout\0312,51,1427,0,\0302,0,0,8,Mountaineer Pebblebitty\0304,0,0,12,Barrens\0313182,23,3182,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,10000,STARTER,?,10,",[3182]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031What's this?$B$BOh my, I don't believe it! Do you realize what you've got here, $R? This is the horn of Margol the Rager! Margol, the bane of every archaeologist that ever set foot in the Searing Gorge.$B$BMay I keep it?\030You expect me to believe a story like that? The real horn would have had my broken axe head still lodged into its surface.$B$BListen, take that obvious fake to Curator Thorius in Ironforge. If he can validate your claim, you will receive a proof of deed. Bring that proof back to me and I'll give you the key to the Searing Gorge.$B$BGet going!\030Take Margol's Gigantic Horn to Curator Thorius in Ironforge.\030Why hello there young lady. Would you like a tour of the museum?\030Proof of Deed\0312,1,43,2,257,4,3836\0302,45,122,2,257,4,3836\0302,127,189,2,257,1,3836\0302,191,254,2,257,4,3836\0302,256,330,2,257,1,3836\0302,335,344,2,257,1,3836\0303,1,60,2,384,1,3836\0301,1,12,4,272,2,8256\0301,17,42,4,272,4,8256\0301,44,83,4,272,2,8256\0301,85,121,4,272,1,8256\0301,123,202,4,272,1,8256\0301,207,220,4,272,2,8256\0304,1,27,3,256,1,8256\0304,29,64,3,256,4,8256\0318256,2,3,Curator Thorius\0308256,2,7,Curator Thorius\0305833,4,11,Margol the Rager\03015065,3,14,Lady\0312,38,1432,0,\0302,0,0,3,Curator Thorius\0302,0,0,3,Ironforge\0302,0,0,5,Searing Gorge\0302,0,0,7,Curator Thorius\0302,0,0,7,Ironforge\0304,0,0,12,Searing Gorge\0313181,19,3181,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0303201,23,3201,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[319]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you, $N. It'll be nice to work our crafts without hearing so many growls and snorts outside the village.\030I have a cask of Evershine handy, but...can you do me a favor?  Brewnall village could use a hand against the wild animals that wander the nearby snows.  Sometimes they wander close.$B$BWe're not afraid of these bears and cats and boars - no self respecting dwarf would be - but if you can take care of those animals for us, then we'd have more time for our crafting and brewing.\030Kill 6 Ice Claw Bears, 8 Elder Crag Boars, and 8 Snow Leopards, and then return to Rejold Barleybrew in Brewnall Village.\030Have you taken care of those wild animals?\030A Favor for Evershine\0312,1,62,2,257,2,1374\0302,65,152,2,257,4,1374\0302,155,182,2,257,1,1374\0302,187,379,2,257,4,1374\0303,1,121,2,384,1,1374\0301,1,14,4,272,1,1374\0301,16,110,4,272,1,1374\0304,1,42,3,256,2,1374\0311374,2,5,Rejold Barleybrew\0312,1,1426,0,\0302,0,0,5,Rejold Barleybrew\0302,0,0,5,Brewnall Village\031318,19,318,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030320,23,320,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,1196,OBJECTIVE,6,13,Ice Claw Bear\030NPC,1127,OBJECTIVE,8,13,Elder Crag Boar\030NPC,1201,OBJECTIVE,8,13,Snow Leopard",[32]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This report... I've dealt with these beasts before. Fizzledowser was wise to send this. and you, to me.$B$BThese creatures will consume the Tanaris desert rapidly; they are nothing short of one of the greatest menaces we all will ever face. Familiarize yourself with this name, $N: silithid. The insects mentioned here are the silithid, and they are the tools of one of the greatest threats that both the Horde and Alliance face.$B$BIf only we were smart enough to see that before.\030Here's your report.  I urge you to take it to someone who might have working knowledge in this kind of thing.$B$BI know this troll scholar named Zilzibin Drumlore.  He's spent a lot of time studying life forms that are unique to the ecology of Azeroth; he's a historian to boot!  If you want someone to help figure out what exactly this threat is and how to stop it, give this report to him.  We're going to need all the help we can get.$B$BZil lives in a house on the second tier of the Drag in Orgrimmar.\030Take the report to Zilzibin Drumlore in Orgrimmar.\030I'm sorry. I don't know you... but from the look of things you have at least heard something of me. Now, what can I help you with? Do you have something for me?\030Rise of the Silithid\0312,1,19,2,257,1,7724\0302,22,109,2,257,4,7724\0302,114,163,2,257,1,7724\0302,166,278,2,257,1,7724\0302,281,391,2,263,4,7724\0302,394,437,2,259,3,7724\0302,442,506,2,257,1,7724\0303,1,50,2,384,1,7724\0301,1,14,4,272,1,7010\0301,16,51,4,272,1,7