ss schemata, you'll need to bring your dues out of arrears.\030\030\030In order to renew your membership card, you will need to pay the renewal fee of two gold pieces.\030Membership Card Renewal\0311,1,152,4,272,1,7406\0301,154,219,4,272,3,7406\0301,221,301,4,272,3,7406\0301,306,415,4,272,3,7406\0301,417,494,4,274,4,7406\0304,1,96,3,258,3,7406\031\0314,0,0,3,Gnomish\0313643,19,3643,SOURCE_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[365]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You have performed your bidding well, young $C. You are proving yourself to be quite an asset to The Dark Lady's army.\030What have we here?  You look like a fledgling $c.  If you hope to prove yourself to The Dark Lady, you need to learn the ways of The Forsaken.$B$BTo the west you'll find a farm.  Humans infest the land like mold on a rotting corpse.  And worse yet, the Scarlet Crusade patrols nearby from their tower.  Teach those scum a lesson and steal 10 of their precious pumpkins.$B$BOnce you have 10, take them to Apothecary Johaan in Brill.\030Steal 10 pumpkins from the farm to the west, just north of Deathknell and take them to Apothecary Johaan in Brill.\030Deathguard Simmer sent word that you were going to provide me with some much needed reagents. Were you able to gather 10 pumpkins yet, $N?\030Fields of Grief\0312,1,18,2,257,2,1519\0302,21,49,2,257,1,1519\0302,52,142,2,259,4,1519\0302,147,177,2,257,1,1519\0302,180,232,2,257,1,1519\0302,235,301,2,257,1,1519\0302,304,369,2,261,1,1519\0302,374,431,2,257,1,1519\0303,1,114,2,388,1,1519\0301,1,47,4,272,1,1518\0301,49,118,4,272,1,1518\0304,1,93,3,256,3,1518\0304,95,138,3,256,2,1518\03115065,2,3,Lady\03014528,2,7,Precious\0301518,2,8,Apothecary Johaan\0301518,2,9,Apothecary Johaan\0301519,3,12,Deathguard Simmer\0312,85,1420,0,\0302,0,0,3,The Dark Lady\0302,0,0,8,Apothecary Johaan\0302,0,0,8,Brill\0302,0,0,9,Deathknell\0302,0,0,9,Apothecary Johaan\0302,0,0,9,Brill\0304,0,0,11,The Dark Lady's\031407,23,407,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,2846,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[366]="PARTIAL\031consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031My book?!? So you were the thief who stole it!$B$BBut...what is this new enchantment upon it...Bethor? He is in Lordaeron?$B$BIf he still exists, then perhaps he too escaped from the Lich King's grasp...\030Long ago Gunther and I, along with the now Scourge Necromancer Thule Ravenclaw, were friends and students within the Kirin Tor - a society of mages in Dalaran.$B$BGunther and I both fell to the Plague, but I thought he either remained dead, or was raised into the ranks of the Lich King.  It is good to know he is free.$B$BWe must have him.  I have placed a spell on his book that, when he sees it, will show him that I too am free of the Lich King.  After knowing this, it is my hope that he will join us.\030Return Gunther's Spellbook to him, on the island of Gunther's Retreat.\030Your masters are fools to send you here, for I will never again be a Scourge slave!\030Return the Book\0312,1,159,2,321,1,1498\0302,164,287,2,325,1,1498\0302,290,319,2,257,1,1498\0302,324,340,2,257,1,1498\0302,343,449,2,321,3,1498\0302,452,506,2,259,3,1498\0303,1,70,2,384,1,1498\0301,1,10,4,272,2,1497\0301,12,46,4,272,1,1497\0301,51,102,4,272,2,1497\0301,104,122,4,272,2,1497\0301,127,203,4,336,4,1497\0304,1,83,3,320,3,1497\0318553,2,1,Necromancer\0301947,2,1,Thule Ravenclaw\03016980,2,2,The Lich King\03016980,2,5,The Lich King\03016980,4,12,The Lich King\03010116,3,13,Slave\0312,85,1420,0,\0302,0,0,1,Kirin Tor\0302,0,0,1,Dalaran\0302,0,0,2,Plague\0304,0,0,11,Lordaeron\0304,0,0,12,Lich King's\031357,19,357,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030409,23,409,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[3661]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you for bringing these to me, $N.$B$BWhat did you learn of the Wildkin?$B$BPerhaps these feathers will tell us more. Ferocious monsters, or simply misguided pets? One day I'd like to know the truth...$B$BI am going to continue my research -- please come back and talk to me again after some time has passed.\030Wildkin are quite unpredictable creatures, $N. Capable of incredible gentleness, these creatures will show extreme ferocity if something they deem important is threatened.$B$BThese beasts are rumored to have been created by Elune, and I am interested in finding if this is really the truth.$B$BRecently, I heard about a population of wildkin living in the Hinterlands -- Vicious, Primitive, and Savage Owlbeasts. They can be found amongst the wildlife there. Will you gather some wildkin feathers for me?\030Collect 15 Wildkin Feathers from the Hinterlands for Erelas Ambersky in Rut'theran Village.\030Try to avoid them if you can, $N. The Wildkin may misread your interest as an intent to do them harm...\030Favored of Elune?\0312,1,46,2,257,1,7916\0302,48,171,2,261,4,7916\0302,176,290,2,257,4,7916\0302,295,412,2,257,1,7916\0302,414,458,2,257,1,7916\0302,460,504,2,257,2,7916\0303,1,91,2,384,1,7916\0301,1,39,4,272,1,7916\0301,44,77,4,272,2,7916\0301,82,122,4,272,4,7916\0301,124,168,4,272,2,7916\0301,170,206,4,274,1,7916\0301,211,313,4,272,3,7916\0304,1,33,3,256,4,7916\0304,35,103,3,256,1,7916\0317916,2,7,Erelas Ambersky\0312,702,1438,0,\0302,0,0,4,Hinterlands\0302,0,0,7,Hinterlands\0302,0,0,7,Rut'theran Village\031978,23,978,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,10819,OBJECTIVE,15,15,",[367]="PARTIAL\031consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You have done well, $N and I thank you for your efforts.\030Lady Sylvanas has called upon the Royal Apothecary Society. The Dark Lady believes our knowledge coupled with the newfound magic will provide the key to Arthas's demise.  She has challenged us to concoct a new plague, a plague deadlier than any ailment on Azeroth. This new disease will bring Arthas's Scourge Army to ruin.$B$BMy studies show that the blood of beasts might prove to be the key. Bring to me 5 vials of darkhound blood so I can test my theory.\030Apothecary Johaan in the town of Brill wants you to collect 5 Vials of Darkhound Blood.\030Have you collected 5 vials of darkhound blood yet, $N? Time is fleeting!\030A New Plague\0312,1,59,2,257,1,1518\0302,61,169,2,257,3,1518\0302,172,264,2,261,1,1518\0302,266,323,2,321,3,1518\0302,328,394,2,257,4,1518\0302,396,458,2,257,1,1518\0303,1,87,2,386,1,1518\0301,1,56,4,272,1,1518\0304,1,54,3,256,2,1518\0304,56,72,3,256,1,1518\03115065,2,1,Lady\03015065,2,2,Lady\0301518,2,7,Apothecary Johaan\0312,85,1420,0,\0302,0,0,2,Arthas's\031368,23,368,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,2858,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[368]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The scales are perfect, $N. Exactly what I needed for this concoction.\030While you were collecting samples for me, my experiments led me to realize that more reagents will be required for this new disease to spread properly. Poisoning some hapless victim is child's play. Plaguing an entire world proves to be a bit more complicated.$B$BI will need 5 Vile Fin Scales from Murlocs in the vicinity.  You will find the creatures along the coast to the north or to the west.\030Apothecary Johaan of the town of Brill needs 5 Vile Fin Scales from Murlocs in Tirisfal Glades.\030$N, were you able to obtain 5 Vile Fin Scales from the Murlocs?\030A New Plague\0312,1,151,2,257,3,1518\0302,153,198,2,257,1,1518\0302,200,260,2,257,1,1518\0302,265,323,2,259,3,1518\0302,326,397,2,257,3,1518\0303,1,95,2,386,1,1518\0301,1,27,4,272,1,1518\0301,29,70,4,272,1,1518\0304,1,63,3,256,2,1518\0311518,2,6,Apothecary Johaan\0312,85,1420,0,\0302,0,0,4,Murlocs\0302,0,0,6,Murlocs\0302,0,0,6,Tirisfal Glades\0303,0,0,9,Murlocs\031367,19,367,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030369,23,369,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,2859,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[3681]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Welcome to the Cathedral of Light, $C.\030Sorry to interrupt your travels, $r, but I thought you should know that word was sent from Stormwind recently asking that paladins report there for training.$B$BIf I didn't know any better, I'd say your close to reaching a special time and it's time you started studying the Tomes.$B$BLook for Duthorian Rall in Stormwind. He usually trains paladins in the Cathedral of Light.\030Speak with Duthorian Rall in Stormwind.\030\030Tome of Divinity\0312,1,157,2,257,1,5149\0302,162,281,2,257,4,5149\0302,286,322,2,257,1,5149\0302,324,376,2,257,1,5149\0303,1,39,2,384,1,5149\0301,1,38,4,272,1,6171\0316171,2,3,Duthorian Rall\0306171,2,5,Duthorian Rall\0312,0,0,1,Stormwind\0302,0,0,3,Stormwind\0302,0,0,4,Cathedral of Light\0302,0,0,5,Stormwind\0304,0,0,6,Cathedral of Light\0312998,22,2998,UNKNOWN\0301641,23,1641,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[369]="PARTIAL\031consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, this venom will do perfectly, $N. Everything else has been added to my concoction and boiled down. Finally, I am ready to try this new deadly agent!\030While you were out gathering, I uncovered some old text in one of my tomes that indicates that an ancient plague wiped out thousands of innocent victims.  Later it was discovered that the deadly agent in the plague was preserved through the venom of Night Web Spiders.$B$BBring me some venom from a Vicious Night Web Spider to complete this experiment.  I want to see if the contagious element from the venom will work with my new concoction.  Rumor has it the spiders can be found in Eastern Tirisfal Glades.\030Apothecary Johaan in the town of Brill wants you to bring him 4 samples of venom from a Vicious Night Web Spider.\030Do you have some venom from a Vicious Night Web Spider yet, $N? It's the final component I need in order to test 