ron Dwarves\0312,1,76,2,257,1,0\0302,81,167,2,257,1,0\0302,172,299,2,261,1,0\0302,301,376,2,257,1,0\0302,381,494,2,257,3,0\0303,1,60,2,388,1,0\0303,65,169,2,386,1,0\0303,171,211,2,384,1,0\0301,1,60,4,272,1,9077\0301,62,85,4,272,1,9077\0301,87,145,4,276,1,9077\0301,150,186,4,272,1,9077\0304,1,15,3,256,2,9077\0304,17,58,3,256,2,9077\0319077,2,1,Warlord Goretooth\0309033,2,2,General Angerforge\0309033,2,5,General Angerforge\0309077,2,7,Warlord Goretooth\0312,1584,0,0,\0302,0,0,2,Blackrock Depths\0302,0,0,5,Blackrock Depths\0302,0,0,6,Blackrock Depths\0304,0,0,9,Angerforge's\0314082,23,4082,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,164867,GIVER,?,9,WANTED\030NPC,8891,OBJECTIVE,15,13,Anvilrage Guardsman\030NPC,8890,OBJECTIVE,10,13,Anvilrage Warden\030NPC,8892,OBJECTIVE,5,13,Anvilrage Footman",[4082]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Angerforge is undoubtedly... angry. Return to me when you receive a third tribute and we shall proceed with Operation: Death to Angerforge. I cannot go into any detail of what this entails, but rest assured, it involves somebody dying.\030By order of Warlord Goretooth, commander of the Kargath Expeditionary Force:$B$BHead of the K.E.F. reconnaissance division, Grandmaster Lexlort, has returned with news of the whereabouts of high ranking Dark Iron officials. Through locked gate, near the heart of the city, they train their forces to snuff out our men. Travel to Blackrock Depths and destroy them!$B$BCompletion of this mission will result in a tribute.$B\030Venture to Blackrock Depths and destroy the vile aggressors!$B$BWarlord Goretooth wants you to kill 10 Anvilrage Medics, 10 Anvilrage Soldiers and 10 Anvilrage Officers. Return to him once your task is complete.\030You again? I have to hand it to you, $N, you are tenacious.\030KILL ON SIGHT: High Ranking Dark Iron Officials\0312,1,76,2,257,1,0\0302,81,98,2,257,1,0\0302,100,223,2,257,1,0\0302,225,318,2,257,1,0\0302,3