ey could be found near cactuses.\030Have you finished collecting cactus apples?\030Galgar's Cactus Apple Surprise\0312,1,50,2,257,1,9796\0302,55,78,2,257,1,9796\0302,83,161,2,257,4,9796\0302,163,228,2,257,1,9796\0302,233,255,2,257,1,9796\0302,257,380,2,257,4,9796\0302,382,473,2,257,4,9796\0303,1,30,2,384,1,9796\0303,32,94,2,384,4,9796\0301,1,14,4,272,1,9796\0301,16,93,4,272,1,9796\0304,1,43,3,256,2,9796\0319796,2,2,Galgar\0309796,2,8,Galgar\0312,363,1411,0,\0302,0,0,1,Valley of Trials\031788,19,788,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,11583,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[4403]="PARTIAL\031characters,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You apply two Cenarion plant salves to the windblossom. It immediately begins to shed its corrupted form, blossoming into a vibrant and healthy plant.\030\030\030You have found a sickly, corrupted version of what appears to be a windblossom plant. The berries that hang from the plant appear rotten and poisonous. It desperately needs some sort of attention if it is to be turned back to normal.\030Corrupted Windblossom\0311,1,55,4,272,1,0\0301,57,150,4,276,1,0\0304,1,85,3,260,1,0\0304,87,151,3,256,1,0\0304,153,233,3,258,4,0\031\0312,361,1448,0,\031\031OBJECT,174601,GIVER,?,9,Corrupted Windblossom\030OBJECT,174601,FINISHER,?,12,Corrupted Windblossom\030ITEM,11516,OBJECTIVE,2,15,",[441]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Yes, this ring was my wife's. Her fate was the fate of all who fail to endure these harsh times. I feel nothing for her death, nor for the story you tell of her body's abduction.$B$BSuch feelings have long since grown cold within me. But desire does still burn in my dead heart, $N.$B$BDesire for revenge.\030Deliah had a husband, Raleigh, who now dwells in the Undercity.  If the Deliah who lived in Brill is the one who owned this ring, then Raleigh will know.$B$BRaleigh is in the Trade Quarter of the Undercity.\030Bring Deliah's Ring to Raleigh.\030Do I know you?\030Raleigh and the Undercity\0312,1,63,2,257,1,1499\0302,66,153,2,257,4,1499\0302,158,206,2,257,1,1499\0303,1,31,2,384,1,1499\0301,1,29,4,272,1,2050\0301,31,96,4,272,1,2050\0301,98,178,4,272,1,2050\0301,183,233,4,272,1,2050\0301,235,282,4,274,1,2050\0301,287,305,4,274,1,2050\0304,1,14,3,256,2,2050\031\0312,130,1421,0,\0302,0,0,1,Undercity\0302,0,0,2,Brill\0302,0,0,3,Trade Quarter of the Undercity\0302,0,0,4,Raleigh\031440,19,440,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030530,23,530,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[442]="PARTIAL\031consequences\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The death of Thule Ravenclaw was no small event, $N. Renferrel tells me that the energies released when you destroyed Thule were felt even as far as the Sepulcher.$B$BYour actions ring through the ranks of the Forsaken. Your value to us grows.\030Now is the time to assault the Scourge's place of strength in Silverpine: Fenris Isle.$B$BYou must again go to the Isle and destroy Thule Ravenclaw.  I want his head!$B$BThis mission is as dangerous as it is vital, $N.  You must not fail.\030Bring Thule's Head to High Executor Hadrec at the Sepulcher.\030The Scourge cannot be allowed to remain in Silverpine, $N. Come back to me when you have proof of Thule's death.\030Assault on Fenris Isle\0312,1,86,2,321,1,1952\0302,91,148,2,261,1,1952\0302,151,166,2,259,1,1952\0302,171,218,2,257,1,1952\0302,221,238,2,265,1,1952\0303,1,60,2,384,1,1952\0301,1,52,4,272,1,1952\0301,54,163,4,276,1,1952\0301,168,219,4,272,1,1952\0301,221,243,4,272,1,1952\0304,1,58,3,320,1,1952\0304,60,112,3,256,1,1952\0311947,2,2,Thule Ravenclaw\0301952,2,6,High Executor Hadrec\0301947,4,7,Thule Ravenclaw\0312,130,1421,0,\0302,0,0,1,Silverpine\0302,0,0,2,Isle\0302,0,0,6,High Executor Hadrec\0302,0,0,6,Sepulcher\0303,0,0,11,Silverpine\031448,19,448,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,3623,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[4421]="PARTIAL\031consequences\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ridding Felwood of Xavathras is only the first step in a long process. It will take much work to repair the damage that has been done here.$B$BI sense that there is something much larger than just the satyrs at work here, but we will only know the truth with time...\030Not many seek adventure here... Felwood's corruption is widespread and indiscriminate.$B$BAs part of the Emerald Circle, I seek to heal this land, but there are some that wish it to fester.$B$BThe ones I speak of are the Jadefire satyrs that dwell to the northwest of here, at the Ruins of Constellas. Led by a particularly cruel satyr named Xavathras, they continue to spread the disease to any creatures they encounter.$B$BWe must defend this land that was once ours. Defeat Xavathras and destroy his minions.\030Kill 11 Jadefire Felsworns, 9 Jadefire Shadowstalkers, 9 Jadefire Rogues, and Xavathras. Return to Eridan Bluewind in Felwood when the task has been completed.\030The corruption here drives the creatures into madness...\030The Corruption of the Jadefire\0312,1,31,2,259,1,9116\0302,33,86,2,261,1,9116\0302,91,189,2,259,3,9116\0302,194,301,2,321,1,9116\0302,303,421,2,257,1,9116\0302,426,469,2,269,1,9116\0302,471,511,2,261,1,9116\0303,1,88,2,384,1,9116\0303,90,159,2,384,1,9116\0301,1,70,4,272,1,9116\0301,72,139,4,272,3,9116\0301,144,266,4,272,3,9116\0304,1,56,3,260,1,9116\0319454,2,5,Xavathras\0309454,2,7,Xavathras\0309454,2,8,Xavathras\0309116,2,9,Eridan Bluewind\0309454,4,10,Xavathras\0312,361,1448,0,\0302,0,0,4,Ruins of Constellas\0302,0,0,9,Eridan Bluewind\0302,0,0,9,Felwood\0314906,23,4906,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,7109,OBJECTIVE,11,13,Jadefire Felsworn\030NPC,7110,OBJECTIVE,9,13,Jadefire Shadowstalker\030NPC,7106,OBJECTIVE,9,13,Jadefire Rogue\030NPC,9454,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Xavathras",[443]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Very good. This ichor will help us understand the nature of the rot hides, and may show us their weakness...$B$B...if they have one.\030Before we launch an assault on Fenris Isle, we must determine who is behind the rot hide gnolls.  Our apothecaries believe their origin lies within the strange fluid that flows through their bodies.$B$BGo to Fenris Isle, east of the Decrepit Ferry, and collect rot hide ichor from the gnolls you find there.  Bring it to Apothecary Renferrel, stationed outside the Sepulcher.\030Bring 8 bottles of rot hide ichor to Apothecary Renferrel at the Sepulcher.\030Do you have the rot hide ichor, $N?\030Rot Hide Ichor\0312,1,96,2,265,1,1952\0302,99,198,2,257,4,1952\0302,203,307,2,257,1,1952\0302,310,375,2,257,1,1952\0303,1,75,2,384,1,1952\0301,1,10,4,272,1,1937\0301,12,108,4,272,3,1937\0301,113,132,4,272,4,1937\0304,1,35,3,256,2,1937\03114235,2,1,The Rot\0301937,2,4,Apothecary Renferrel\0301937,2,5,Apothecary Renferrel\03014235,4,7,The Rot\03014235,3,9,The Rot\0312,130,1421,0,\0302,0,0,3,Fenris Isle\0302,0,0,3,Decrepit Ferry\0302,0,0,4,Apothecary Renferrel\0302,0,0,4,Sepulcher\0302,0,0,5,Apothecary Renferrel\0302,0,0,5,Sepulcher\031438,19,438,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030444,23,444,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,3236,OBJECTIVE,8,15,",[444]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This substance is laced with powerful spells, some of which I have not seen for a long, long time...$B$BOne moment -- I must invoke a spell of divination...\030I have reduced the ichor you brought me and separated it into its base components.  My findings are not conclusive, but I have determined that warlock and necromantic magics were used in the ichor's creation.$B$BWhile I continue to study the ichor, I want you to take a sample to Bethor Iceshard in the Undercity.  Bethor is not an apothecary, but his knowledge of magic may help to unravel the mystery of the rot hides.$B$BGo.  You will find Bethor in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity.\030Bring the Sample Ichor to Bethor Iceshard in the Undercity.\030My studies require great concentration. So I hope your visit is not a frivolous one.\030Rot Hide Origins\0312,1,82,2,257,1,1937\0302,85,208,2,257,1,1937\0302,213,313,2,259,1,1937\0302,316,420,2,257,1,1937\0302,430,488,2,257,3,1937\0303,1,59,2,384,1,1937\0301,1,100,4,272,1,1498\0301,105,156,4,272,1,1498\0304,1,39,3,256,1,1498\0304,41,84,3,258,3,1498\0311498,2,3,Bethor Iceshard\03014235,2,4,The Rot\0301498,2,6,Bethor Iceshard\0312,130,1421,0,\0302,0,0,3,Bethor Iceshard\0302,0,0,3,Undercity\0302,0,0,5,Magic Quarter of the Undercity\0302,0,0,6,Bethor Iceshard\0302,0,0,6,Undercity\031443,19,443,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030446,23,446,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[4441]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you, $N. Now, we must pray that we can undo the damage that has been done...\030The flute you found was carved from an ancient protector, the treant allies that have faithfully protected the night elves.$B$BThe satyrs have been able to corrupt anything they come in contact with, which includes the ancients that made Felwood their home. By the use of the fel, the spirit of the ancient has been bound and tortured, never completely released. The felbind you found is no doubt related.$B$BWe must try to purify the flute, $N. Bring me blessed water from the Temple of the Moon in Darnassus.\030Travel to Darnassus and use Eridan's Vial to collect a Vial of Blessed Water from the Temple of the Moon. Return to Eridan with the filled vial.\030The water will hopefully release the spirit of the ancient, and allow it to be at peace.\030Felbound Ancients\0312,1,123,2,321,1,9116\0302,128,257,2,261,1,9116\0302,259,362,2,325,1,9116\0302,364,405,2,257,1,9116\0302,410,445,2,257,1,9116\0302,447,510,2,257,1,9116\0303,1,105,2,384,1,9116\0303,107,144,2,384,1,9116\0301,1,14,