JECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,6265,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[4785]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Here you go, $N. And please tell Menara we say hello.$B$BWe expect great things of you. Perhaps when the Legion falls to its knees, your name will be spoken aloud and in praise of your power. I can't wait!\030\030\030\030Fine Gold Thread\0311,1,16,4,272,1,2670\0301,18,53,4,272,1,2670\0301,58,87,4,272,1,2670\0301,89,191,4,272,4,2670\0301,193,205,4,272,1,2670\031\031\0314784,20,4784,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[4786]="PARTIAL\031consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030requestItems\030title\031It is done, $N. Here you are. Wear it with pride.$B$BYou've worked hard and I see great things in your future. Remember, to defy the corruption that comes with our path takes great will and fortitude. As long as your will is your own, then you shall have great success.\030I will put the robe together for you now. It will take but a few moments. Do not go far.\030Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete your robe and then speak to her again.\030Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete your item\030A moment, $n...\030The Completed Robe\0312,1,41,2,257,3,6266\0302,43,73,2,257,3,6266\0302,75,88,2,257,1,6266\0303,1,77,2,384,1,6266\0301,1,15,4,272,1,6266\0301,17,29,4,272,1,6266\0301,31,49,4,272,1,6266\0301,54,110,4,272,1,6266\0301,112,200,4,276,3,6266\0301,202,269,4,272,3,6266\0305,1,15,3,256,1,6266\0304,1,48,3,384,1,6266\0316266,2,4,Menara Voidrender\0306266,3,12,Menara Voidrender\031\0314784,19,4784,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[4787]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, you have the egg! I bow to you, $N. Your strength and bravery will be long remembered.\030The Prophecy of Mosh'aru speaks of an ancient egg.  It is a relic of a time when trolls ruled vast empires, and it has the power to hold the essence of Hakkar.  It may be the only way to keep our world safe from his evil.$B$BBring me the ancient egg, $N.  It is said to lay hidden deep within Jintha'Alor in the Hinterlands, in a cave behind the amphitheater at the top of the city.\030Bring the Ancient Egg to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris.\030Do you have the ancient egg? I sense great forces stirring, and I fear that time grows short.\030The Ancient Egg\0312,1,50,2,321,1,8579\0302,53,159,2,257,1,8579\0302,162,221,2,257,1,8579\0302,226,254,2,321,1,8579\0302,257,382,2,257,1,8579\0303,1,46,2,448,1,8579\0301,1,21,4,272,1,8579\0301,23,39,4,272,1,8579\0301,41,90,4,272,3,8579\0304,1,28,3,320,2,8579\0304,30,93,3,256,1,8579\03114834,2,2,Hakkar\0308579,2,6,Yeh'kinya\0312,47,1425,0,\0302,0,0,5,Jintha'Alor\0302,0,0,5,Hinterlands\0302,0,0,6,Yeh'kinya\0302,0,0,6,Tanaris\0313527,19,3527,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0303528,23,3528,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,12402,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[4788]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Unbelievable!  You found them!  You truly are a hero, $N!$B$BThat's a good thing, because I've been reading the tablets you brought me before, and from what I gathered... we're going to need a hero to stop what's coming...\030While I look over the third and fourth tablets of Mosh'aru, you must find the fifth and sixth!  It will not be easy, for they are held by the Smolderthorn trolls within Blackrock Spire.  The spire is a dark mountain of fire between the Burning Steppes and the Searing Gorge.$B$BGood luck, $N.  Blackrock Spire is no place for decent folk...\030Bring the Fifth and Sixth Mosh'aru Tablets to Prospector Ironboot in Tanaris.\030Have you been to the spire, $N? Do you have the fifth and sixth tables?\030The Final Tablets\0312,1,94,2,257,1,10460\0302,97,185,2,257,3,10460\0302,188,274,2,257,1,10460\0302,279,292,2,2