important mission against Southshore.\"\030Bring the Foreboding Plans to Magistrate Maleb in Southshore.\030$N, you look anxious. Is there something you wish to tell me?\030Foreboding Plans\0312,1,54,2,257,1,0\0302,57,159,2,261,1,0\0302,164,353,2,259,1,0\0303,1,61,2,384,1,0\0301,1,28,4,272,1,2276\0301,33,61,4,272,1,2276\0301,63,216,4,276,4,2276\0304,1,21,3,256,1,2276\0304,23,61,3,258,2,2276\031\0312,36,1416,0,\0302,0,0,4,Magistrate Maleb\0302,0,0,4,Southshore\0304,0,0,7,Syndicate's\031512,23,512,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,1740,GIVER,?,9,Syndicate Documents\030OBJECT,186420,GIVER,?,9,Syndicate Documents",[5102]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Surely, we will strike against their dragon lords next. Well done, brave soldier of the Alliance! Well done, indeed.\030We battle against these beasts on two fronts: From our capital of Stormwind we fight them from the inside out and here, in the Burning Steppes, we take the battle to their doorstep. We must be vigilant, $N. None should be spared our wrath as none of our own were spared when they struck at our homes and families.$B$BFind this General Drakkisath and destroy him!$B$BThe task certainly will not be a simple one, but the rewards shall be extravagant.\030Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy General Drakkisath. Return to Marshal Maxwell when the job is done.$B\030Is it done?\030General Drakkisath's Demise\0312,1,181,2,261,1,9560\0302,183,206,2,257,1,9560\0302,208,313,2,257,1,9560\0302,318,362,2,261,1,9560\0302,367,448,2,257,3,9560\0303,1,57,2,388,1,9560\0303,59,105,2,384,1,9560\0301,1,55,4,272,3,9560\0301,57,97,4,272,1,9560\0301,99,116,4,272,1,9560\0304,1,11,3,256,2,9560\03110363,2,4,General Drakkisath\03010363,2,6,General Drakkisath\0309560,2,7,Marshal Maxwell\0312,1583,0,0,\0302,0,0,1,Burning Steppes\0302,0,0,6,Blackrock Spire\0302,0,0,7,Marshal Maxwell\0315089,19,5089,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,10363,OBJEC