large, but a small piece of that which I had hoped beyond hope has come to pass.$B$BYou have done the impossible, and your deeds will forever live in the legends of Duskwood.$B$BGo, $N. And perhaps, one day, fate may bring you back to me...\030Morbent Fel hides in his lair, the house perched atop the hill to the east overlooking the Raven Hill cemetery.  His time in this land is drawing to an end...$B$BUse Morbent's Bane against him.  It will render his protective magics powerless.$B$BSlay him.  Slay him, and save us from his wickedness.  Be the instrument of my revenge, and a hero of Duskwood!\030Use Morbent's Bane on Morbent Fel, kill Morbent Fel, then return Morbent's Bane to Sven at his camp.\030Is Morbent Fel defeated?!\030Morbent Fel\0312,1,111,2,257,1,311\0302,114,158,2,257,1,311\0302,163,193,2,257,1,311\0302,196,242,2,257,3,311\0302,247,255,2,257,1,311\0302,258,299,2,265,1,311\0302,302,357,2,259,1,311\0303,1,100,2,384,1,311\0301,1,30,4,272,1,311\0301,32,140,4,274,3,311\0301,145,234,4,272,3,311\0301,247,300,4,272,4,311\0304,1,25,3,256,2,311\0311200,2,1,Morbent Fel\0307605,2,1,Raven\0301200,2,8,Morbent Fel\0301200,4,9,Morbent Fel\0301200,3,13,Morbent Fel\0312,10,1431,0,\0302,0,0,8,Sven\031325,19,325,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,1200,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Morbent Fel",[550]="PARTIAL\031consequences\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031So you are the infamous $C who struck such a decisive blow against the Alliance forces in the Hillsbrad Foothills? Word of your glorious exploits traveled quickly to the Undercity.$B$BYou have quite a future in the Dark Lady's ranks if you continue to show such leadership and expertise in battle.$B$BWhile our primary threat is the Lich King's Scourge army descending from the north, the human \"problem\" continues to impede our battle plans. You, however, have shown that the humans can and will fall.\030Because you fought with such valor and perseverance in the Battle of Hillsbrad, I have written this commendation, extolling your heroics in combat for the high command to recognize.$B$BTake this sealed commendation to Varimathras in the Undercity.  Go with pride, $c.\030Take Darthalia's Sealed Commendation to Varimathras in the Undercity.\030What brings a $C all the way to the Undercity from the battlefield?\030Battle of Hillsbrad\0312,1,181,2,263,1,2215\0302,186,247,2,257,1,2215\0302,250,267,2,257,1,2215\0303,1,69,2,384,1,2215\0301,1,114,4,272,2,2425\0301,116,180,4,272,1,2425\0301,185,297,4,276,4,2425\0301,302,442,4,340,1,2425\0301,444,502,4,280,3,2425\0304,1,67,3,256,2,2425\0312425,2,2,Varimathras\0302425,2,4,Varimathras\03016980,4,8,The Lich King\0312,267,1424,0,\0302,0,0,1,Battle of Hillsbrad\0302,0,0,2,Varimathras\0302,0,0,2,Undercity\0302,0,0,4,Varimathras\0302,0,0,4,Undercity\0304,0,0,5,Hillsbrad Foothills\0304,0,0,6,Undercity\0304,0,0,7,Dark Lady's\0303,0,0,10,Undercity\031541,19,541,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[5501]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, goodie!  My bones!$B$BI can't wait till the chaps at home see my face on the front cover of Goblin'preneur.  I'll be the richest goblin in the world... and my physical education teacher said I would never amount to anything.\030We're sitting on a goldmine here, I tell you - a goldmine!  Kodo bones will change the world forever... I have customers making furniture, music instruments, and even blasting powder out of them.$B$BThere's a caravan that comes by and picks up my kodo bones and then sells them at Shadowprey Village.  If you can travel to the kodo graveyard south of here and bring me ten kodo bones, I'll give you something in return.  Is it a deal?\030Bring 10 Kodo Bones from the Kodo Graveyard to Bibbly F'utzbuckle at Kormek's Hut.\030Do you have the bones?  The caravan will be here any moment.  I need just ten more kodo bones to reach a career high.  A career high, I tell you!\030Bone Collector\0312,1,58,2,257,1,11438\0302,61,103,2,257,3,11438\0302,105,195,2,257,1,11438\0302,200,300,2,257,1,11438\0302,303,419,2,257,4,11438\0302,422,434,2,257,2,11438\0303,1,82,2,384,1,11438\0301,1,11,4,272,1,11438\0301,14,22,4,272,1,11438\0301,27,111,4,272,1,11438\0301,114,155,4,272,1,11438\0301,157,228,4,272,4,11438\0304,1,22,3,256,2,11438\0304,25,60,3,256,3,11438\0304,63,117,3,258,1,11438\0304,120,145,3,256,1,11438\03111438,2,7,Bibbly F'utzbuckle\0312,405,1443,0,\0302,0,0,4,Shadowprey Village\0302,0,0,7,Kodo Graveyard\0302,0,0,7,Bibbly F'utzbuckle\0302,0,0,7,Kormek's Hut\031\031ITEM,13703,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[5502]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031May the spirits bless you, $N. You've done more for Grunth than most would ever think of doing for him. Thank you - you're the epitome of what it means to be a hero of the Horde.$B$BPlease - if you can spare the time, come back and visit us. I know that Grunth would like that, as would I.\030You have been so very kind to me, $N.  I never dreamed that I'd have so much fun during Children's Week.  Thank you.  I won't be sad about what's happened to me - my parents always told me to rise above anything bad that happens.  I'll be a hero... just like you.$B$BI'm sad to say this, but it's time for me to go home.  Let's go back and I'll tell the matron what an awesome person you are!\030Return your ward to the Orgrimmar orphanage by handing in the Orcish Orphan Whistle to Orphan Matron Battlewail in the Valley of Honor.\030It is a pleasure to see you again, $N. Have you attended to the duties you've volunteered for during Children's Week?\030A Warden of the Horde\0312,1,37,2,257,1,14444\0302,40,104,2,257,1,14444\0302,107,116,2,257,1,14444\0302,119,229,2,257,1,14444\0302,232,248,2,257,1,14444\0302,250,263,2,257,1,14444\0302,268,320,2,257,1,14444\0302,323,392,2,257,1,14444\0303,1,135,2,384,1,14444\0301,1,30,4,272,1,14451\0301,32,103,4,272,4,14451\0301,105,178,4,272,1,14451\0301,183,241,4,272,4,14451\0301,243,289,4,272,4,14451\0304,1,38,3,256,1,14451\0304,40,117,3,256,2,14451\03114444,2,9,Orcish Orphan\03014451,2,9,Orphan Matron Battlewail\03015394,4,12,Hero of the Horde\0312,0,0,9,Orgrimmar\0302,0,0,9,Orcish Orphan Whistle\0302,0,0,9,Orphan Matron Battlewail\0302,0,0,9,Valley of Honor\031915,21,915,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030925,21,925,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,18597,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[5503]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031All who fight evil on behalf of the Argent Dawn must don our commission. Wearing such will earn your right to claim rewards our quartermasters have to offer.$B$BWhile under commission, you'll be able to acquire Scourgestones from slain Scourge; these are marks of insignia that they sometimes possess. Procure these insignia and bring them to me. For each set you turn in, you will receive our marker of heroism - the Argent Dawn Valor Token.$B$BAchieve your destiny, $C join the fight today!\030\030\030\030Argent Dawn Commission\0311,1,72,4,276,1,11039\0301,74,157,4,272,3,11039\0301,162,301,4,340,1,11039\0301,303,346,4,272,1,11039\0301,348,442,4,272,3,11039\0301,447,492,4,276,1,11039\031\0312,139,1423,0,\0315401,22,5401,UNKNOWN\0305405,22,5405,UNKNOWN\031",[5504]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Outstanding - your tribute to the Dawn is duly noted, $N. With this accomplished, I am delighted to make our mantles available to you for purchase. So long as you maintain your current status with us, these mantles will be purchasable from any authorized quartermaster of the Argent Dawn.$B$BFor the Dawn, my $Gbrother:sister;!\030Your service to the Argent Dawn is to be commended, $N.  You are truly revered amongst us.  I have been authorized to make available for you to purchase one of the Dawn's most valued items - our magic resistance mantles.$B$BApplication of a mantle to your existing shoulder piece will enhance your resistance to the powers of magic in one of five potential ways.  As a sign of continued dedication to our cause, I ask for no less than ten of our valor tokens in exchange for access to these mantles.\030Bring 10 Argent Dawn Valor Tokens to Quartermaster Hasana at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands.\030Ah, noble $C! Have you brought the valor tokens requested of you? Once you hand them to me, I will make our various mantles available to you for purchase.\030Mantles of the Dawn\0312,1,55,2,257,1,10856\0302,58,90,2,257,1,10856\0302,93,220,2,257,1,10856\0302,225,362,2,257,3,10856\0302,365,499,2,259,1,10856\0303,1,94,2,384,1,10856\0301,1,57,4,272,1,10856\0301,59,147,4,272,1,10856\0301,149,288,4,272,3,10856\0301,293,327,4,272,1,10856\0304,1,13,3,256,1,10856\0304,15,65,3,256,2,10856\0304,67,154,3,256,3,10856\031\0312,28,1422,0,\0302,0,0,1,Argent Dawn\0302,0,0,6,Quartermaster Hasana\0302,0,0,6,Bulwark\0304,0,0,7,Dawn\0315507,22,5507,UNKNOWN\0305513,22,5513,UNKNOWN\031ITEM,12844,OBJECTIVE,10,15,\030REPUTATION,529,OBJECTIVE,21000,16,",[5505]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Well, here you are, $n - the completed Skeleton Key.  I am certain as I can be that this key will allow you within the confines of the Scholomance.  There's only one way to be absolutely sure it works, though.  Waste no time in trying it out, I say.$b$bGood luck, mighty hero.  May you continue to bring light unto the darkness!\030\030\030\030The Key to Scholomance\0311,1,52,4,272,1,11056\0301,55,147,4,272,3,11056\0301,150,209,4,272,1,11056\0301,212,249,4,272,1,11056\0301,254,276,4,272,1,11056\0301,279,328,4,272,1,11056\0316412,4,1,Skeleton\0312,28,1422,0,\0315803,19,5803,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[5507]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Outstanding - your tribute to the Dawn is duly noted, $N. With this accomplished, I am delighted to make our mantles available to you for purchase. So long as you maintain your current status with us, these mantles will be purchasable from any authorized quartermaster of the Argent Dawn.$B$BFor the Dawn, my $Gbrother:sister;!\030Your service to the Argent Dawn is to be commended, $N.  You are truly revered amongst us.  I have been authorized to make available for you to purchase one of the Dawn's most valued items - our magic resistance mantles.$B$BApplication of a mantle to your existing shoulder piece will enhance your resistance to the powers of magic in one of five potential ways.  As a sign of continued dedication to our cause, I ask for no less than ten of our valor tokens in exchange for access to these mantles.\030Bring 10 Argent Dawn Valor Tokens to Quartermaster Lightspark at Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.\030Ah, noble $C! Have you brought the valor tokens requested of you? Once you hand them to me, I will make our various mantles available to you for purchase.\030Mantles of the Dawn\0312,1,55,2,257,1,10857\0302,58,90,2,257,1,10857\0302,93,220,2,257,1,10857\0302,225,362,2,257,3,10857\0302,365,499,2,259,1,10857\0303,1,101,2,384,1,10857\0301,1,57,4,272,1,10857\0301,59,147,4,272,1,10857\0301,149,288,4,272,3,10857\0301,293,327,4,272,1,10857\0304,1,13,3,256,1,10857\0304,15,65,3,256,2,10857\0304,67,154,3,256,3,10857\031\0312,28,1422,0,\0302,0,0,1,Argent Dawn\0302,0,0,6,Quartermaster Lightspark\0302,0,0,6,Chillwind Camp\0304,0,0,7,Dawn\0315504,22,5504,UNKNOWN\0305513,22,5513,UNKNOWN\031ITEM,12844,OBJECTIVE,10,15,\030REPUTATION,529,OBJECTIVE,21000,16,",[5508]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Congratulations, $N - I am pleased to award you with an Argent Dawn valor token!$B$BTo acquire a valor token in such a manner indicates that you are a true hero in the cause of good. We value all effort brought to bear against the Scourge, but to take down one of their leaders is to truly deliver onto them a crushing defeat!$B$BFor the Dawn, my $Gbrother:sister;!\030\030\030A Corruptor's Scourgestone is the insignia of the Scourge's overlords.  A powerful being that holds a position of authority over the Scourge will always possess one.  To slay such a malevolent creature would surely advance the cause of the Argent Dawn, and all good causes!$B$BOn behalf of the Argent Dawn, I will give you a valor token in exchange for just a single one of these insignia.  Use caution in acquiring one, $N - such powerful beings are not to be trifled with.\030Corruptor's Scourgestones\0311,1,80,4,272,1,11039\0301,85,182,4,272,1,11039\0301,184,326,4,336,1,11039\0301,331,365,4,272,1,11039\0304,1,70,3,320,1,11039\0304,73,165,3,320,3,11039\0304,168,273,3,256,4,11039\0304,278,389,3,256,3,11039\0304,392,474,3,256,1,11039\031\0312,139,1423,0,\031\031ITEM,12843,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[5509]="PARTIAL\031consequences,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Congratulations, $N - I am pleased to award you with an Argent Dawn valor token!$B$BEach valor token handed out to worthy recipients is a sign of the tide turning against the Scourge. With more and more heroes fighting the Scourge in their own lands, the Argent Dawn will assuredly be at the forefront when the time comes to wage war on the ultimate evil of the Scourge. I hope that the valor you've shown what it took to acquiring your token will carry the day then as well!\030\030\030An Invader's Scourgestone is the insignia of the Scourge's elite troops.  These are sometimes found on the stronger of the troops positioned in the Plaguelands.  Slaying such a creature is indeed a challenge, but one that should be relished with a commission to vanquish evil.$B$BThe Argent Dawn currently offers a valor token in exchange for ten of these insignia.  Bring them to me here, and I will make sure you receive your just reward.\030Invader's Scourgestones\0311,1,80,4,272,1,11039\0301,85,183,4,336,1,11039\0301,185,370,4,340,3,11039\0301,372,475,4,274,3,11039\0304,1,72,3,320,1,11039\0304,75,160,3,256,1,11039\0304,163,276,3,256,1,11039\0304,281,365,3,256,1,11039\0304,368,440,3,256,3,11039\031\0312,139,1423,0,\0303,0,0,6,Plaguelands\031\031ITEM,12841,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[551]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031More encrypted notes?$B$BI wish I had the talents to decrypt all the strange bits of writing that trickle down from Alterac. But I'm afraid I lack the knowledge.\030This parchment is enchanted with a spell, rendering it indecipherable.  But one word at the top of the paper can be read:$B$B$B      Nagaz$B$B\030Take the Ensorcelled Parchment to Loremaster Dibbs in Southshore.\030Oh. You have something you'd like me to look at? Some scrap of lore gathered from up in the mountains, I hope...\030The Ensorcelled Parchment\0312,1,70,2,257,1,0\0302,73,121,2,257,1,0\0302,128,138,2,257,1,0\0303,1,65,2,384,1,0\0301,1,21,4,272,2,2277\0301,26,124,4,274,3,2277\0301,126,161,4,272,1,2277\0304,5,48,3,256,2,2277\0304,50,112,3,258,3,2277\0312320,2,3,Nagaz\0302277,2,4,Loremaster Dibbs\0312,36,1416,0,\0302,0,0,4,Loremaster Dibbs\0302,0,0,4,Southshore\0304,0,0,6,Alterac\031554,23,554,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,3706,STARTER,?,10,",[5510]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Congratulations, $N - I am pleased to award you with an Argent Dawn valor token!$B$BThe tokens serve two purposes. One - they can be used to further your standing within the Argent Dawn; to do so may avail you options and rewards that are reserved for our honored and revered allies. Two - they can be given to our quartermasters, along with coin, as payment for some of the Dawn's more prized items.$B$BWhatever you decide, know that you are earning your commission. Well done!\030\030\030A Minion's Scourgestone is the insignia of the Scourge rank and file.  These are sometimes found on the weaker of their troops positioned in the Plaguelands, though the term \"weaker\" is certainly to be considered in context.  The Scourge, no matter where they are, should never be underestimated.$B$BThe Argent Dawn currently offers a valor token in exchange for twenty of these insignia - an exchange I'm happy to do, provided you have earned enough scourgestones!\030Minion's Scourgestones\0311,1,80,4,272,1,11039\0301,85,114,4,272,1,11039\0301,116,283,4,272,1,11039\0301,285,400,4,272,1,11039\0301,405,467,4,272,1,11039\0301,469,478,4,272,1,11039\0304,1,69,3,320,1,11039\0304,72,224,3,256,1,11039\0304,227,296,3,320,1,11039\0304,301,465,3,256,1,11039\031\0312,139,1423,0,\0304,0,0,3,Argent Dawn\0303,0,0,8,Plaguelands\031\031ITEM,12840,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[5511]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Well, here you are, $n - the completed Skeleton Key.  I am certain as I can be that this key will allow you within the confines of the Scholomance.  There's only one way to be absolutely sure it works, though.  Waste no time in trying it out, I say.$b$bGood luck, mighty hero.  May your victories continue to bring you fame and power as you lay waste to Scholomance!\030\030\030\030The Key to Scholomance\0311,1,52,4,272,1,10837\0301,55,147,4,272,3,10837\0301,150,209,4,272,1,10837\0301,212,249,4,272,1,10837\0301,254,276,4,272,1,10837\0301,279,366,4,272,1,10837\0316412,4,1,Skeleton\0312,28,1422,0,\0304,0,0,6,Scholomance\0315804,19,5804,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[5513]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Outstanding - your tribute to the Dawn is duly noted, $N. With this accomplished, I am delighted to make our mantles available to you for purchase. So long as you maintain your current status with us, these mantles will be purchasable from any authorized quartermaster of the Argent Dawn.$B$BFor the Dawn, my $Gbrother:sister;!\030Your service to the Argent Dawn is to be commended, $N.  You are truly revered amongst us.  I have been authorized to make available for you to purchase one of the Dawn's most valued items - our magic resistance mantles.$B$BApplication of a mantle to your existing shoulder piece will enhance your resistance to the powers of magic in one of five potential ways.  As a sign of continued dedication to our cause, I ask for no less than ten of our valor tokens in exchange for access to these mantles.\030Bring 10 Argent Dawn Valor Tokens to Quartermaster Breechlock at Light's Hope Chapel, Eastern Plaguelands.\030Ah, noble $C! Have you brought the valor tokens requested of you? Once you hand them to me, I will make our various mantles available to you for purchase.\030Mantles of the Dawn\0312,1,55,2,257,1,11536\0302,58,90,2,257,1,11536\0302,93,220,2,257,1,11536\0302,225,362,2,257,3,11536\0302,365,499,2,259,1,11536\0303,1,106,2,384,3,11536\0301,1,57,4,272,1,11536\0301,59,147,4,272,1,11536\0301,149,288,4,272,3,11536\0301,293,327,4,272,1,11536\0304,1,13,3,256,1,11536\0304,15,65,3,256,2,11536\0304,67,154,3,256,3,11536\031\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,1,Argent Dawn\0302,0,0,6,Quartermaster Breechlock\0302,0,0,6,Light's Hope Chapel\0304,0,0,7,Dawn\0315504,22,5504,UNKNOWN\0305507,22,5507,UNKNOWN\031ITEM,12844,OBJECTIVE,10,15,\030REPUTATION,529,OBJECTIVE,21000,16,",[5514]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Dithers said you'd deliver the goods, and deliver you have! A deal is a deal; let me pack the fragments into the mold for you.$B$BDid Dithers imbue them already? Excellent... otherwise, it would have been a long trip back to the Bulwark for you.\030The goblin you will need to speak with is Krinkle Goodsteel.  He peddles his skills to the highest bidder in Gadgetzan, within the Tanaris desert.  He'll likely be the only one who can produce the mold we need, and his services won't come cheap.  We now ask for you to dig deep by footing whatever fee he will charge.$B$BI'm an apothecary, not a banker.  If I had gold lying around, I certainly wouldn't be here.$B$BI guess I said the quiet part out loud again.  Oops.$B$BGadgetzan awaits you!  Good luck!\030Bring the Imbued Skeletal Fragments and 15 gold coins to Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan.\030Yeah, I know who you are, and I know why you're here. Dithers sent word to me before you arrived. Let's cut to deal at hand, now shall we?$B$BI've got a mold you can use for the skeleton key, but it will cost you - fifteen gold, up front, no negotiation. I'll pack the skeletal fragments into the mold for you, and I'll also teach you on how to forge the stem of the key without any knowledge of blacksmithing... all free of charge no less.$B$BWho says mercenaries don't offer competitive deals!\030Mold Rhymes With...\0312,1,60,2,259,3,11057\0302,63,146,2,257,1,11057\0302,149,245,2,259,1,11057\0302,248,317,2,257,3,11057\0302,322,353,2,257,1,11057\0302,356,412,2,257,4,11057\0302,417,461,2,257,1,11057\0302,464,468,2,257,1,11057\0302,473,493,2,257,1,11057\0302,496,505,2,257,1,11057\0303,1,88,2,384,1,11057\0301,1,59,4,272,1,5411\0301,61,126,4,272,1,5411\0301,131,161,4,272,2,5411\0301,163,174,4,272,1,5411\0301,176,245,4,280,4,5411\0304,1,53,3,256,1,5411\0304,55,97,3,256,1,5411\0304,99,138,3,256,2,5411\0304,143,254,3,256,3,5411\0304,256,412,3,256,1,5411\0304,414,440,3,256,1,5411\0304,445,495,3,256,1,5411\0315411,2,1,Krinkle Goodsteel\0305411,2,11,Krinkle Goodsteel\0306412,3,20,Skeleton\0312,28,1422,0,\0302,0,0,2,Gadgetzan\0302,0,0,2,Tanaris\0302,0,0,11,Krinkle Goodsteel\0302,0,0,11,Gadgetzan\0304,0,0,16,Bulwark\031964,19,964,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0305802,23,5802,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[5515]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The bag of horrors!\030A great weight has been lifted from our hearts, $N, but your task is not yet complete. Krastinov's master, Kirtonos, still lives.$B$BBefore you may face Kirtonos, however, you must first secure a method in which to summon him.$B$BIt is said that Jandice Barov stewards the blood of innocents from Krastinov to Kirtonos.$B$BFind her in the sunken catacombs of Scholomance and strike her down. Bring back any clues that you may find.\030Locate Jandice Barov in the Scholomance and destroy her. From her corpse recover Krastinov's Bag of Horrors. Return the bag to Eva Sarkhoff.\030<Eva fades in and out of focus.>\030Krastinov's Bag of Horrors\0312,1,86,2,257,1,11216\0302,88,129,2,257,1,11216\0302,134,226,2,257,1,11216\0302,231,319,2,257,1,11216\0302,324,391,2,257,1,11216\0302,393,431,2,257,1,11216\0303,1,56,2,388,1,11216\0303,58,108,2,384,1,11216\0303,110,140,2,384,1,11216\0301,1,19,4,272,1,11216\0304,1,32,3,256,1,11216\03110503,2,4,Jandice Barov\03010503,2,7,Jandice Barov\03011216,2,9,Eva Sarkhoff\0312,2057,0,0,\0302,0,0,4,Krastinov\0302,0,0,4,Kirtonos\0302,0,0,7,Scholomance\0302,0,0,9,Eva Sarkhoff\0315382,19,5382,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0305384,23,5384,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,13725,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[5517]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Most impressive, $N - the Chromatic Mantle of the Dawn is now yours!$B$BAs long as you maintain Exalted status with the Argent Dawn, you will be able to purchase additional Chromatic Mantles. They will be made available to you immediately from any of the Dawn's quartermasters.\030$G Brother : Sister; $N - your deeds on behalf of the Argent Dawn are far too numerous to be recounted easily.  As a fitting tribute, I'll part with one of our special Chromatic Mantles of the Dawn - a version that protects the wearer from all forms of resistible magic simultaneously.  Chromatic Mantles of the Dawn are reserved for only the mightiest of the Dawn's heroes!$B$BBring to me twenty-five valor tokens as a sign of tribute, and I'll give you the finest of all our mantles.\030Bring 25 Argent Dawn Valor Tokens to Quartermaster Breechlock at Light's Hope Chapel, Eastern Plaguelands.\030Salutations, mighty priest! Have you brought the valor tokens I asked of you? Once you hand them to me, I will issue you your own Chromatic Mantle of the Dawn.\030Chromatic Mantle of the Dawn\0312,1,110,2,257,1,11536\0302,113,285,2,257,1,11536\0302,288,374,2,257,1,11536\0302,379,485,2,257,1,11536\0303,1,106,2,384,3,11536\0301,1,68,4,272,1,11536\0301,73,191,4,272,3,11536\0301,193,277,4,272,3,11536\0304,1,27,3,256,1,11536\0304,29,77,3,256,2,11536\0304,79,159,3,256,3,11536\031111,3,9,Priest\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,5,Quartermaster Breechlock\0302,0,0,5,Light's Hope Chapel\0315521,22,5521,UNKNOWN\0305524,22,5524,UNKNOWN\031ITEM,12844,OBJECTIVE,25,15,\030REPUTATION,529,OBJECTIVE,42000,16,",[5518]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Yeah, this will do the trick.  Just a slip here, and tuck here... heh - this is going to work out just fine!  <A broad smile beams from the chained goblin's face.>$B$BHere you go, you're all set.  Remember- this isn't the most securely fashioned item in the world.  You'll have ten minutes of use before it falls apart, and then you're not going to fool anybody!  Try using it just before you approach him, and remember... it only will make him think that YOU are an ally - not your group mates!\030If you're going to fight the king of this dump - and I think that's what you're bound to do - then you're going to need to get by Captain Kromcrush.  Now, you can get by him by killing him, sure.  You might actually want to leave him alive.$B$BHow, you ask?  Since I've been here, I think I know how to make an ogre suit that will last just long enough to fool these bozos.  The only problem is stability - ten minutes tops.  Bring me what I need, and I'll make you one.  I'm not going anywhere...\030Bring 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 8 Rugged Leather, 2 Rune Threads, and Ogre Tannin to Knot Thimblejack.  He is currently chained inside the Gordok wing of Dire Maul.\030The Ogre Tannin is probably the toughest thing to find for what I need to make the suit - I think they have some upstairs?  It's hard to tell, since this ball and chain doesn't make movement that easy to do...$B$BAnyway, bring me the things I need, and I'll whip you up an ogre suit that will fool Captain Kromcrush into thinking you're one of his men.\030The Gordok Ogre Suit\0312,1,148,2,263,4,14338\0302,151,195,2,257,1,14338\0302,198,240,2,259,4,14338\0302,245,257,2,257,2,14338\0302,260,373,2,257,3,14338\0302,376,424,2,261,1,14338\0302,427,470,2,259,1,14338\0302,473,497,2,257,1,14338\0303,1,98,2,384,1,14338\0303,101,160,2,384,1,14338\0301,1,29,4,272,3,14338\0301,32,65,4,272,1,14338\0301,67,108,4,272,3,14338\0301,111,163,4,272,1,14338\0301,168,195,4,272,1,14338\0301,198,264,4,272,1,14338\0301,267,362,4,272,3,14338\0301,365,422,4,272,1,14338\0301,424,495,4,272,3,14338\0304,1,122,3,258,2,14338\0304,125,209,3,256,1,14338\0304,214,352,3,258,3,14338\03114325,2,1,Captain Kromcrush\030211,2,5,Ogre\030211,2,9,Ogre\03014338,2,9,Knot Thimblejack\030211,3,20,Ogre\030211,3,22,Ogre\03014325,3,22,Captain Kromcrush\0312,2557,0,0,\0302,0,0,9,Knot Thimblejack\0315519,23,5519,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,14048,OBJECTIVE,4,15,\030ITEM,8170,OBJECTIVE,8,15,\030ITEM,14341,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,18240,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[5519]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Here ya go $N - put this thing on, and you'll have ten minutes to do whatever.  Good luck!$B$BOh, and if you happen to find a key to get me out of here, BY ALL MEANS LET ME KNOW!!!\030\030\030Need another suit, do ya? Well, I'm not going anywhere soon it seems - bring me the same things I asked for from before, and I'll make you another ogre suit.\030The Gordok Ogre Suit\0311,1,78,4,272,1,14338\0301,81,90,4,272,1,14338\0301,95,180,4,272,4,14338\0304,1,25,3,256,2,14338\0304,27,157,3,256,4,14338\031211,3,5,Ogre\0312,2557,0,0,\0315518,19,5518,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,14048,OBJECTIVE,4,15,\030ITEM,8170,OBJECTIVE,8,15,\030ITEM,14341,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,18240,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[552]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You found it! Most excellent, $N!\030Master Helcular was almost complete with his transformation into a Lich when a human lynch mob discovered his ritual lair in the hills and brutally killed him.  To make matters worse they buried his corpse in the Southshore cemetery.$B$BSuch disregard for the great wizard is unacceptable.  As his apprentice I shall see to it that the rains of vengeance fall upon the town of Southshore.$B$BWe will need Helcular's Rod first.  Yeti overtook his ritual lair.  Undoubtedly one of the beasts has it.\030Retrieve Helcular's Rod from the Yeti and bring it back to Novice Thaivand in Tarren Mill.\030Have you recovered Helcular's Rod yet? There are so many Yeti in this region, it will be very difficult to locate. But we must have it in order to proceed.\030Helcular's Revenge\0312,1,159,2,257,1,2429\0302,162,233,2,257,1,2429\0302,238,289,2,257,1,2429\0302,292,388,2,259,3,2429\0302,393,426,2,259,3,2429\0302,429,458,2,257,1,2429\0302,461,497,2,257,1,2429\0303,1,90,2,384,1,2429\0301,1,13,4,272,1,2429\0301,15,33,4,272,1,2429\0304,1,38,3,256,2,2429\0304,40,114,3,256,3,2429\0304,116,155,3,258,1,2429\0312429,2,8,Novice Thaivand\0312,267,1424,