n discussing some of those now.\030You're needed in Stormwind, $N. The High Priestess there, Laurena, says it's time for you to prove you're worthy of the next level of your training. Don't waste too much time finding your way there. You can find her in the Cathedral of Light in the center of the city. Give her my regards, and prove how worthy you are of such a calling. The Light be with you, $N.\030Speak to High Priestess Laurena in Stormwind.\030\030Desperate Prayer\0312,1,31,2,257,1,11406\0302,33,148,2,257,1,11406\0302,150,198,2,257,1,11406\0302,200,268,2,257,1,11406\0302,270,337,2,257,1,11406\0302,339,364,2,257,1,11406\0303,1,45,2,384,1,11406\0301,1,28,4,272,1,376\0301,30,139,4,272,3,376\0301,144,198,4,272,1,376\0301,200,258,4,272,4,376\031112,2,2,Priestess\030376,2,7,High Priestess Laurena\030112,2,7,Priestess\0312,0,0,1,Stormwind\0302,0,0,4,Cathedral of Light\0302,0,0,7,High Priestess Laurena\0302,0,0,7,Stormwind\0315634,22,5634,UNKNOWN\0305635,22,5635,UNKNOWN\0305636,22,5636,UNKNOWN\0305637,22,5637,UNKNOWN\0305638,22,5638,UNKNOWN\031",[564]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ain't that great news! Should-a gone and found me a regular ol' war hero from day one to take care of them beasts. You'd-a made your pappy proud, $N.\030Ain't nothin' that irks me more than losin' these here beautiful horses.  And believe me, we've lost quite a few between them pesky undead creeps, the dang Syndicate gang and all the other good-for-nothin' scoundrels pokin' about these parts.$B$BBut I swear on my ol' grand-daddy's grave there ain't no bigger menace to our horses here than them Mountain Lions up in Alterac.  Always comin' down from the hills and makin' my life difficult!$B$BYou fancy yourself a hero?  Go and do somethin' about it then!\030Darren Malvew of Southshore wants you to kill 8 Mountain Lions and 10 Hulking Mountain Lions.\030Mountain Lions killin' off our horses left and right and here you are wantin' to jibber-jabber about the weather and what not.$B$BOught to go and find myself a real hero. More killin' and less talkin'.\030Costly Menace\0312,1,72,2,257,1,2382\0302,75,242,2,261,4,2382\0302,247,375,2,257,1,2382\0302,378,440,2,257,1,2382\0302,445,470,2,257,2,2382\0302,473,506,2,257,1,2382\0303,1,93,2,386,1,2382\0301,1,22,4,272,1,2382\0301,24,114,4,276,1,2382\0301,116,149,4,272,1,2382\0304,1,126,3,256,1,2382\0304,131,170,3,256,1,2382\0304,172,201,3,256,1,2382\0312382,2,7,Darren Malvew\0312,267,1424,0,\0302,0,0,3,Alterac\031\031NPC,2406,OBJECTIVE,8,13,Mountain Lion\030NPC,2407,OBJECTIVE,10,13,Hulking Mountain Lion",[5640]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Speak to High Priest Rohan in Stormwind.\030\030Desperate Prayer\0313,1,40,2,384,1,0\03111406,2,1,High Priest Rohan\030111,2,1,Priest\0312,0,0,1,High Priest Rohan\0302,0,0,1,Stormwind\031\031",[5641]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've got the makings of a great $C, $N. Keep up the good work!$B$BYou've already shown you're ready for battle. Perhaps it's time we taught ya a little somethin' more.\030$N, your High Priest Rohan would have an audience with you in Ironforge. Make haste, my strong friend, your next test quickly approaches. Although I wish I could bear witness to your race's own special rites, my place is here. But may the Light go with you in your travels. Rohan should still be in the Mystic Ward once you reach the city. He will be waiting.\030Speak to High Priest Rohan in Ironforge.\030\030A Lack of Fear\0312,1,72,2,257,4,376\0302,74,137,2,257,1,376\0302,139,226,2,259,4,376\0302,228,273,2,257,1,376\0302,275,339,2,257,1,376\0302,341,359,2,257,3,376\0303,1,40,2,384,1,376\0301,1,41,4,272,1,11406\0301,43,64,4,272,1,11406\0301,69,113,4,276,1,11406\0