peak about the path you travel.$B$BGo to the Valley of Spirits in the great Horde city of Orgrimmar. You will find him there.\030Speak to Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar.\030\030Hex of Weakness\0312,1,5,2,257,1,3707\0302,7,28,2,257,1,3707\0302,33,123,2,257,1,3707\0302,128,192,2,257,1,3707\0302,194,217,2,257,3,3707\0303,1,29,2,384,1,3707\0301,1,56,4,272,4,6018\0301,58,115,4,276,3,6018\0301,117,202,4,272,3,6018\0316018,2,3,Ur'kyo\0306018,2,6,Ur'kyo\0312,0,0,4,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,6,Ur'kyo\0302,0,0,6,Orgrimmar\0315652,22,5652,UNKNOWN\0305654,22,5654,UNKNOWN\0305655,22,5655,UNKNOWN\0305656,22,5656,UNKNOWN\031",[5658]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, young $c, I am glad you have returned here. I would teach you a lesson you would do well to not forget. Are you prepared?\030You be far from home, $C. You be needed there, back in your city under the ground. Your mistress, the one you be callin' Aelthalyste be needin' you back there. Like my tribe, there things you must learn only from her. Don't be stayin' here too long. You should be headin' to the War Quarter as fast as a zeppelin can carry you.\030Speak to Aelthalyste in the Undercity.\030\030Touch of Weakness\0312,1,25,2,257,1,4607\0302,27,82,2,257,1,4607\0302,84,159,2,257,1,4607\0302,161,217,2,257,1,4607\0302,219,249,2,257,1,4607\0302,251,327,2,261,1,4607\0303,1,38,2,384,1,4607\0301,1,47,4,272,1,4606\0301,49,107,4,272,4,4606\0301,109,125,4,272,2,4606\0314606,2,3,Aelthalyste\0304606,2,7,Aelthalyste\0312,0,0,6,War Quarter\0302,0,0,7,Aelthalyste\0302,0,0,7,Undercity\0315660,22,5660,UNKNOWN\0305661,22,5661,UNKNOWN\0305662,22,5662,UNKNOWN\0305663,22,5663,UNKNOWN\031",[566]="PARTIAL\031conflict,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Productive work you do, $N. With Baron Vardus dead, the number of Syndicate leaders grows smaller. Their resistance and irri