elthalyste in the Undercity.\030\030Touch of Weakness\0312,1,25,2,257,1,3706\0302,27,82,2,257,1,3706\0302,84,159,2,257,1,3706\0302,161,217,2,257,1,3706\0302,219,249,2,257,1,3706\0302,251,327,2,261,1,3706\0303,1,38,2,384,1,3706\0301,1,30,4,272,1,4606\0301,32,90,4,272,1,4606\0301,92,160,4,274,3,4606\0301,162,194,4,272,1,4606\0301,196,238,4,272,3,4606\0314606,2,3,Aelthalyste\0304606,2,7,Aelthalyste\0312,0,0,6,War Quarter\0302,0,0,7,Aelthalyste\0302,0,0,7,Undercity\0315658,22,5658,UNKNOWN\0305661,22,5661,UNKNOWN\0305662,22,5662,UNKNOWN\0305663,22,5663,UNKNOWN\031",[5661]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, good, another has arrived. Time may not matter to me, but to you it is of the essence. There is much for you to learn and there is much I wish to teach you. You simply must prove your worth. Do that, and you shall be greatly rewarded.\030You be far from home out here in the Bloodhoof Village, $N. I be sent here to find priests of my own tribe to send back to speak to our leaders, but that not mean I cannot help you too.$B$BI hear word that your head priestess spirit want all Forsaken to come to her--there are things you must learn.$B$BGo to meet Aelthalyste in the War Quarter in that city of yours.\030Speak to Aelthalyste in the Undercity.\030\030Touch of Weakness\0312,1,59,2,257,1,3044\0302,61,185,2,257,1,3044\0302,190,299,2,259,1,3044\0302,304,367,2,261,1,3044\0303,1,38,2,384,1,3044\0301,1,30,4,272,1,4606\0301,32,90,4,272,1,4606\0301,92,160,4,274,3,4606\0301,162,194,4,272,1,4606\0301,196,238,4,272,3,4606\031112,2,3,Priestess\0304606,2,4,Aelthalyste\0304606,2,5,Aelthalyste\0312,0,0,1,Bloodhoof Village\0302,0,0,4,War Quarter\0302,0,0,5,Aelthalyste\0302,0,0,5,Undercity\0315658,22,5658,UNKNOWN\0305660,22,5660,UNKNOWN\0305662,22,5662,UNKNOWN\0305663,22,5663,UNKNOWN\031",[5662]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, good, another has arrived. Time may not matter to me, but to you it is of the essence. There is much for you to learn and there is much I wish to teach you. You simply must prove your worth. Do that, and you shall be greatly rewarded.\030My respect to you and your kind, $N. I normally teach only those of my own tribe. Your lessons come from Aelthalyste in the city once called Lordaeron.$B$BYou should return to her if you're to learn those abilities that set you apart from other faiths.$B$BGo to the War Quarter in the Undercity and find your mistress there.\030Speak to Aelthalyste in the Undercity.\030\030Touch of Weakness\0312,1,36,2,257,1,6018\0302,38,81,2,257,1,6018\0302,83,151,2,257,1,6018\0302,156,252,2,257,4,6018\0302,257,324,2,261,1,6018\0303,1,38,2,384,1,6018\0301,1,30,4,272,1,4606\0301,32,90,4,272,1,4606\0301,92,160,4,274,3,4606\0301,162,194,4,272,1,4606\0301,196,238,4,272,3,4606\0314606,2,3,Aelthalyste\0304606,2,6,Aelthalyste\0312,0,0,3,Aelthalyste\0302,0,0,5,War Quarter\0302,0,0,5,Undercity\0302,0,0,6,Aelthalyste\0302,0,0,6,Undercity\0315658,22,5658,UNKNOWN\0305660,22,5660,UNKNOWN\0305661,22,5661,UNKNOWN\0305663,22,5663,UNKNOWN\031",[5663]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, good, another has arrived. Time may not matter to me, but to you it is of the essence. There is much for you to learn and there is much I wish to teach you. You simply must prove your worth. Do that, and you shall be greatly rewarded.\030Aelthalyste sent word out to all her priests. We're to direct the younger of our order to the Undercity for more training. If you truly count yourself among our faithful, then you should return there also.$B$BYou can find Aelthalyste in the War Quarter deep in the Undercity.\030Speak to Aelthalyste in the Undercity.\030\030Touch of Weakness\0312,1,45,2,257,1,2129\0302,47,122,2,257,1,2129\0302,124,205,2,257,4,2129\0302,210,275,2,261,1,2129\0303,1,38,2,384,1,