time, $N, but there are some things that we cannot pass on to you. One of those things are the teachings of your goddess Elune. She gives special abilities to her faithful, and if I'm not mistaken, it is time for you to return home to your Temple of the Moon to be tested.$B$BReturn there when you can and speak to Priestess Alathea.\030Speak to Priestess Alathea in Darnassus.\030\030Elune's Grace\0312,1,121,2,257,1,376\0302,123,182,2,257,1,376\0302,184,327,2,257,4,376\0302,332,388,2,257,1,376\0303,1,40,2,384,1,376\0301,1,47,4,272,1,11401\0301,49,145,4,272,1,11401\0301,147,209,4,272,1,11401\0301,211,303,4,272,3,11401\03111401,2,4,Priestess Alathea\03011401,2,5,Priestess Alathea\0312,0,0,4,Priestess Alathea\0302,0,0,5,Priestess Alathea\0302,0,0,5,Darnassus\0315672,22,5672,UNKNOWN\0305674,22,5674,UNKNOWN\0305675,22,5675,UNKNOWN\031",[5674]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031By devoting yourself to Elune and our people, you have attained a state that not all of us can achieve. It is tradition that you then be taught even greater abilities for your devotion. Do you accept?\030A wonderful day has come, $N. You've reached the age in which our $gpriests:priestesses; are trained in abilities only Night elves know. But it is not for me to train you. You must return to the Temple of the Moon and speak to Priestess Alathea as soon as your business here is concluded. She will test you to ensure you're prepared, and only then will she teach you Elune's Grace.\030Speak to Priestess Alathea in Darnassus.\030\030Elune's Grace\0312,1,29,2,257,1,4090\0302,31,136,2,257,1,4090\0302,138,171,2,257,1,4090\0302,173,288,2,257,1,4090\0302,290,381,2,259,3,4090\0303,1,40,2,384,1,4090\0301,1,103,4,272,1,11401\0301,105,185,4,272,1,11401\0301,187,200,4,272,2,11401\03111401,2,4,Priestess Alathea\03011401,2,6,Priestess Alathea\0312,0,0,4,Temple of the Moon\0302,0,0,4,Priestess Alathea\0302,0,0,6,Priestess Alathea\0302,0,0,6,Darnassus\0304,0,0,7,Elune\0315672,22,5672,UNKNOWN\0305673,22,5673,UNKNOWN\0305675,22,5675,UNKNOWN\031",[5675]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Elune bless you for returning so quickly to us. This is an important time in your training, and a time that all of our order take very seriously. When you've rested from your journey here, please, let me know. We can then discuss the continuation of your training and where your path will lead you next.\030Time's a wastin', $glad:lass;. It's time for you to return home to Darnassus. Priestess Alathea's sent word here that you're to return there for training. Seems they feel you're ready to be tested much like those who serve the Light. You should head out whenever you can. Alathea's message said that she'd be waitin' for you in the Temple of the Moon. Good luck.\030Speak to Priestess Alathea in Darnassus.\030\030Elune's Grace\0312,1,30,2,257,1,11406\0302,32,77,2,257,1,11406\0302,79,154,2,257,1,11406\0302,156,233,2,257,4,11406\0302,235,271,2,257,1,11406\0302,273,351,2,257,1,11406\0302,353,362,2,257,1,11406\0303,1,40,2,384,1,11406\0301,1,47,4,272,1,11401\0301,49,145,4,272,1,11401\0301,147,209,4,272,1,11401\0301,211,303,4,272,3,11401\03111401,2,3,Priestess Alathea\03011401,2,8,Priestess Alathea\0312,0,0,2,Darnassus\0302,0,0,6,Temple of the Moon\0302,0,0,8,Priestess Alathea\0302,0,0,8,Darnassus\0315672,22,5672,UNKNOWN\0305673,22,5673,UNKNOWN\0305674,22,5674,UNKNOWN\031",[5676]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031We were forced to learn some magics to protect us from what is commonly called our greatest enemy: the arcane.$B$BI would teach you a spell to help you defend yourself and your companions from those who would wield such power.\030It is time for you to return to Stormwind, young one. Your superiors there have called you back for more training. And although it disturbs me some, your race and mine are allies and I would not betray that.$B$B I do not mean to be so coy with you--my distrust of arcane magics, be they divine inspired or not, is still strong within me.$B$B You will know of what I speak after you return to your Cathedral of Light. Speak to High Priestess Laurena when you arrive.\030Speak to High Priestess Laurena in Stormwind.\030\030Arcane Feedback\0312,1,53,2,257,1,5489\0302,55,114,2,257,1,5489\0302,116,207,2,257,4,5489\0302,212,337,2,257,1,5489\0302,342,416,2,257,3,5489\0302,418,465,2,257,1,5489\0303,1,45,2,384,1,5489\0301,1,110,4,286,1,376\0301,115,226,4,284,4,376\031376,2,6,High Priestess Laurena\030112,2,6,Priestess\030376,2,7,High Priestess Laurena\030112,2,7,Priestess\0312,0,0,1,Stormwind\0302,0,0,6,High Priestess Laurena\0302,0,0,7,High Priestess Laurena\0302,0,0,7,Stormwind\0315677,22,5677,UNKNOWN\031",[5677]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031We were forced to learn some magics to protect us from what is commonly called our greatest enemy: the arcane.$B$BI would teach you a spell to help you defend yourself and your companions from those who would wield such power.\030As much as I'd like to show you our own special teachings of the Light, it is not our place. Your place is back in Stormwind with your own kind, $N... for now. Believe me, I mean no offense. When you return to High Priestess Laurena in the Cathedral of Light you'll understand what I'm talking about--the time has come for your race to prepare you for the future; to separate yourself from others that follow a similar path.\030Speak to High Priestess Laurena in Stormwind.\030\030Arcane Feedback\0312,1,92,2,259,1,11406\0302,94,150,2,257,1,11406\0302,152,159,2,257,1,11406\0302,161,190,2,257,4,11406\0302,192,424,2,257,1,11406\0303,1,45,2,384,1,11406\0301,1,110,4,286,1,376\0301,115,226,4,284,4,376\031376,2,5,High Priestess Laurena\030112,2,