22,6074,UNKNOWN\0306075,22,6075,UNKNOWN\0306064,23,6064,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[608]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, what a great day for the Blackwater Raiders! Three cheers to you, $N!\030Blast the nerve of Firallon!  He couldn't sail a skiff through Crystal Lake let alone lead an entire fleet against us.$B$BThe Bloodsail Buccaneers will pay for their carelessness.  Now that we know their plan of attack, we can counter before they know what hit them.$B$BBut why send the entire fleet to do the work of one brave adventuring party?  $n, take some of your most skilled comrades out to Firallon's landing spot and assassinate the Bloodsail leadership.  Their fleet will sink soon after....\030Fleet-Master Seahorn in Booty Bay wants you to kill Captain Stillwater, Captain Keelhaul and Fleet Master Firallon.\030What's the problem, $N? We need to attack before the Bloodsail Buccaneers do!\030The Bloodsail Buccaneers\0312,1,28,2,257,1,2487\0302,31,118,2,257,1,2487\0302,123,179,2,257,3,2487\0302,182,266,2,269,1,2487\0302,271,346,2,257,2,2487\0302,349,464,2,257,1,2487\0302,467,502,2,257,3,2487\0303,1,115,2,386,1,2487\0301,1,48,4,272,1,2487\0301,50,73,4,272,1,2487\0304,1,23,3,260,2,2487\0304,25,77,3,262,1,2487\0314950,2,6,Spot\0302550,2,8,Captain Stillwater\0302548,2,8,Captain Keelhaul\0302546,2,8,Fleet Master Firallon\0312,33,1434,0,\0302,0,0,6,Firallon's\0302,0,0,8,Booty Bay\031604,19,604,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,2550,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Captain Stillwater\030NPC,2548,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Captain Keelhaul\030NPC,2546,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Fleet Master Firallon",[6081]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031A young $C, I see. Yes, I will grant you the skills you need to train and guide your pet. Not only will you be able to teach your pet new abilities, you will now be able to feed your pet, as well as revive it, should it fall in battle.$B$BNow, go, $C. We will speak again, at a later date.\030You now have the power to tame a pet, but you must also gain the skills to train it.$B$BTravel to Orgrimmar. There you must speak to one of our most revered hunters, Ormak Grimshot. He will give you the ability to train your new pet. You will find him in the Valley of Honor.$B$BGood luck, $N.\030Speak with Ormak Grimshot in Orgrimmar.\030\030Training the Beast\0312,1,84,2,257,1,3171\0302,89,108,2,257,1,3171\0302,110,181,2,257,1,3171\0302,183,233,2,257,3,3171\0302,235,275,2,257,3,3171\0302,280,293,2,257,1,3171\0303,1,39,2,384,1,3171\0301,1,18,4,272,1,3352\0301,20,89,4,274,3,3352\0301,91,235,4,276,3,3352\0301,240,251,4,272,1,3352\0301,253,289,4,272,3,3352\0313352,2,3,Ormak Grimshot\0303352,2,7,Ormak Grimshot\0312,0,0,2,Orgrimmar\0302,0,0,5,Valley of Honor\0302,0,0,7,Orgrimmar\0316082,19,6082,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[6082]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030requestItems\030title\031You have learned all I can teach you, $N. It is time for you to take what you have learned here and choose a pet of your own.$B$BHere you are, $N. I will now give you the power to tame a beast, as well as call it and dismiss it as you see fit. Use your new skills with pride; you have earned them.\030The final creature you need to tame is one you should strive to emulate; the armored scorpid. It strikes quickly and confidently; to control a force such as this is your fate as a hunter.$B$BWhen you return, I will bestow you with the skills you will need to tame an animal of your choosing; this creature will be yours to command. Under your control, your pet will gain experience alongside you. I will also show you how to call it and dismiss it as you wish.$B\030Use the Taming Rod to tame an Armored Scorpid. Practice your skills, then return to Thotar at Razor Hill.\030Tame an Armored Scorpid\030Were you able to tame the scorpid?\030Taming the Beast\0312,1,93,2,259,1,3171\0302,95,187,2,257,1,3171\0302,192,331,2,259,3,3171\0302,333,396,2,257,3,3171\0302,398,460,2,259,3,3171\0303,1,46,2,384,1,3171\0303,48,105,2,384,1,3171\0301,1,41,4,272,1,3171\0301,43,125,4,272,1,3171\0301,130,146,4,272,1,3171\0301,148,243,4,272,3,3171\0301,245,297,4,272,1,3171\0305,1,34,3,256,2,3171\0304,1,23,3,384,1,3171\0313126,2,1,Armored Scorpid\0303126,2,6,Armored Scorpid\0303171,2,7,Thotar\0303126,3,14,Armored Scorpid\0312,0,0,7,Thotar\0302,0,0,7,Razor Hill\0316083,19,6083,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0306081,23,6081,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[6083]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030requestItems\030title\031You are a swift learner, $N. You have done well.\030The advantage a pet affords you against your rivals is duly noted, $N. When you gain control over another creature, you are adding to your own strength. Your pet must become an extension of yourself.$B$BThe next task requires you to turn from the land; you will find the next creature in the waters off the coast. Across from Sen'jin Village, near the Echo Isles. look for a spirited crab called the surf crawler. Use the taming rod to tame it, then practice your skills.\030Use the Taming Rod to tame a Surf Crawler. Practice your skills, then return the Taming Rod to Thotar at Razor Hill.\030Tame a Surf Crawler\030You need to practice in order to gain the skills you need to effectively control your pet. Have you tamed a surf crawler?\030Taming the Beast\0312,1,70,2,257,1,3171\0302,72,152,2,257,1,3171\0302,154,199,2,257,1,3171\0302,204,313,2,257,3,3171\0302,315,363,2,257,1,3171\0302,365,413,2,257,1,3171\0302,415,471,2,257,1,3171\0303,1,42,2,384,1,3171\0303,44,116,2,384,1,3171\0301,1,28,4,272,1,3171\0301,30,48,4,272,1,3171\0305,1,90,3,258,1,3171\0305,92,121,3,256,2,3171\0304,1,19,3,384,1,3171\0316827,2,6,Crab\0303107,2,6,Surf Crawler\0306250,2,6,Crawler\0303107,2,8,Surf Crawler\0306250,2,8