or get outta my face.$B$BHuh? Bloads sent ya, huh? Well, whaddaya got for me?$B$B<Privateer Groy looks over the bundle carefully.>$B$BNot bad, not bad at all. Another bundle will make my client quite happy.$B$BI suppose yer next question's gonna be about money, huh, $C? Of course it is!$B$BHere, take this coin and some advice: get off my docks.\030$N, since I have you here, I got a message from Groy while you were gone. He mentioned bein' satisfied with the last shipment that arrived and has a client that wants some more of the stuff right away.$B$BI won't be headin' to Theramore for a week, but if you're willin' to make the journey, there's no reason you can't take the stuff for me.$B$BFeeling adventurous? You do know where Dustwallow Marsh is, doncha? I'd be careful though, Theramore can be dangerous if you're the wrong kind of crowd.\030Bring a Bundle of Akiris Reeds to Privateer Groy in Theramore.\030Yeah?\030Akiris by the Bundle\0312,1,73,2,257,1,2494\0302,75,201,2,259,1,2494\0302,206,342,2,257,4,2494\0302,347,366,2,257,2,2494\0302,368,413,2,257,2,2494\0302,415,498,2,257,4,2494\0303,1,62,2,384,1,2494\0301,1,6,4,272,2,2616\0301,8,73,4,272,1,2616\0301,75,118,4,272,1,2616\0301,123,126,4,272,2,2616\0301,128,147,4,272,2,2616\0301,149,174,4,272,2,2616\0301,179,227,4,272,1,2616\0301,232,255,4,272,1,2616\0301,257,303,4,272,3,2616\0301,308,367,4,272,2,2616\0301,369,384,4,272,1,2616\0301,389,443,4,272,1,2616\0304,1,5,3,256,2,2616\0312616,2,7,Privateer Groy\0302616,4,14,Privateer Groy\0312,33,1434,0,\0302,0,0,1,Groy\0302,0,0,3,Theramore\0302,0,0,7,Privateer Groy\0302,0,0,7,Theramore\031617,19,617,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[624]="PARTIAL\031characters,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The soggy parchment contains the next clue....\030There is an ornate, well-traveled bridge$BEast of Deadwind and south of Redridge$BUnderneath there waits something for you$BSome call it a hint, others a clue$BThere it will lie for endless tomorrows$BBiding its time in the Swamp of Sorrows\030Solve the riddle!\030\030Cortello's Riddle\0312,1,40,2,257,1,0\0302,43,80,2,257,1,0\0302,83,122,2,257,1,0\0302,125,158,2,257,1,0\0302,161,199,2,257,3,0\0302,202,240,2,257,1,0\0303,1,17,2,384,1,0\0301,1,46,4,272,1,0\031\0312,33,1434,0,\0302,0,0,2,Redridge\0302,0,0,6,Swamp of Sorrows\031625,23,625,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4056,STARTER,?,10,\030OBJECT,2553,FINISHER,?,12,A Soggy Scroll",[625]="PARTIAL\031characters,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You find a musty scroll.\030A far off land in Kalimdor awaits$BWhere peril has dashed hopes and fates$BEast of Barrens the weather is harsh$BGloom and danger pock Dustwallow Marsh$BBut there lies a clue for those up to the test$BWaiting to be found in a cave in the southwest\030Solve the riddle!\030\030Cortello's Riddle\0312,1,33,2,257,1,0\0302,36,73,2,259,1,0\0302,76,111,2,257,1,0\0302,114,151,2,261,1,0\0302,154,199,2,257,1,0\0302,202,247,2,257,1,0\0303,1,17,2,384,1,0\0301,1,24,4,272,1,0\031\0312,33,1434,0,\0302,0,0,1,Kalimdor\031624,19,624,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030626,23,626,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,2553,GIVER,?,9,A Soggy Scroll\030OBJECT,2555,FINISHER,?,12,Musty Scroll",[626]="PARTIAL\031characters,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You open the chest to discover....\030To Lordaeron! The great land of turmoil$BWhere brave soldiers with death do toil$BFind your way through the great unrest$BThere you will find the end to this quest$BAlong the coast of the Hinterlands, at the base of the great falls$BUnderneath the water there does your treasure call!\030Solve the riddle!\030\030Cortello's Riddle\0312,1,13,2,257,1,0\0302,15,39,2,257,1,0\0302,42,80,2,257,1,0\0302,83,120,2,257,1,0\0302,123,163,2,257,3,0\0302,166,231,2,257,1,0\0302,234,284,2,257,1,0\0303,1,17,2,384,1,0\0301,1,34,4,272,1,0\031\0312,33,1434,0,\031625,19,625,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,2555,GIVER,?,9,Musty Scroll\030OBJECT,2556,FINISHER,?,12,Cortello's Treasure",[6261]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031A crate for Westfall, eh? Have you been to Westall before? If so, then it's no problem, my friend. I have plenty of gryphons trained to fly that route!\030$N, I gathered into this crate everything Lewis asked for.  Can you take it to him?$B$BIf you've already spoken to Thor in Westfall, then you can take a gryphon back to him.  Dungar Longdrink is our gryphon master, over in the trade district.$B$BSpeak with Dungar, then get this crate to Lewis as fast as you can.  We don't want our fighting men and women in Westfall to go without fresh equipment!\030Bring Osric's Crate to Dungar Longdrink the gryphon master.\030Is that sweat on your brow, lad? You've been running too much. Next time, take a gryphon!\030Dungar Longdrink\0312,1,58,2,257,1,1323\0302,61,83,2,257,2,1323\0302,88,173,2,257,4,1323\0302,176,242,2,257,1,1323\0302,247,313,2,257,1,1323\0302,316,398,2,261,1,1323\0303,1,59,2,384,1,1323\0301,1,25,4,272,2,352\0301,27,58,4,272,2,352\0301,60,98,4,276,4,352\0301,100,151,4,272,1,352\0304,1,32,3,256,2,352\0304,34,62,3,256,1,352\0304,64,89,3,256,1,352\031523,2,3,Thor\030352,2,4,Dungar Longdrink\030352,2,7,Dungar Longdrink\0312,40,1436,0,\0302,0,0,3,Thor\0302,0,0,3,Westfall\0302,0,0,5,Lewis\0302,0,0,6,Westfall\0302,0,0,7,Dungar Longdrink the\0304,0,0,9,Westall\0316281,19,6281,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0306285,23,6285,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[627]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, splendid! That was a big favor you did for me.$B$BHere is your payment...\030There is a mountain cave in Drywhisker Gorge, far to the north in the Arathi Highlands.  In that cave is rare ore: bloodstone.  The bloodstone in this cave is not of the highest grade, but even low-quality bloodstone is valuable... to those with the knowledge to use it.$B$BI would like some.$B$BI will fix your crock pot, but while I work on it... bring me samples of bloodstone.  Bring me enough, and I'll even give you a bonus.$B$BOh, and if you don't have the skill to mine it... find someone who does!\030Bring 4 loads of Lesser Bloodstone Ore to Krazek in Booty Bay.\030Hello, $N. Did you have luck getting the bloodstone?\030Favor for Krazek\0312,1,87,2,257,1,773\0302,90,126,2,257,1,773\0302,129,231,2,257,1,773\0302,233,270,2,257,1,773\0302,275,292,2,259,4,773\0302,297,348,2,257,3,773\0302,350,380,2,257,1,773\0302,383,430,2,257,1,773\0302,435,483,2,257,4,773\0302,485,506,2,257,1,773\0303,1,62,2,384,1,773\0301,1,13,4,272,1,773\0301,15,50,4,272,1,773\0301,55,77,4,272,1,773\0304,1,10,3,256,1,773\0304,12,52,3,256,2,773\031773,2,11,Krazek\0312,33,1434,0,\0302,0,0,1,Drywhisker Gorge\0302,0,0,1,Arathi Highlands\0302,0,0,11,Krazek\0302,0,0,11,Booty Bay\031210,19,210,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030622,23,622,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4278,OBJECTIVE,4,15,",[628]="PARTIAL\031loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Great! Thanks to your help I'll have this order filled and sent off to Director Riddlevox on the next boat to Undermine. Ahead of schedule, even!$B$BFor all your hard work, here, I made some extras, so take a pair. It's on Drizzlik.$B$BAnd remember, there's no boot so fine as one of Drizzlik's Excelsior line!\030With the inside finished, all that's left is to add the outer layer. For this, I use only the best elder croc skins. They are more durable and a better canvas--if you will--for adding the designs and accents that make Drizzlik's Excelsior line.$B$BIt's hard to find that perfect skin though, the only one that fits my plan is the skin of an elder saltwater crocolisk. The elders only come out to defend the other saltwater crocs, so you might need to kill a few to draw one out.\030Bring an Elder Crocolisk Skin to Drizzlik in Booty Bay.\030I read somewhere that the saltwater crocilisks are slowly dying out... bad news for my business, isn't it?$B$BAnyways, I hope you have that elder saltwater crocolisk skin for me!\030Excelsior\0312,1,68,2,257,1,2495\0302,70,116,2,257,1,2495\0302,118,244,2,257,4,2495\0302,249,367,2,257,1,2495\0302,369,478,2,271,4,2495\0303,1,55,2,384,1,2495\0301,1,6,4,272,1,2495\0301,8,120,4,304,1,2495\0301,122,145,4,272,1,2495\0301,150,214,4,272,1,2495\0301,216,232,4,272,1,2495\0301,237,310,4,272,1,2495\0304,1,70,3,256,1,2495\0304,72,106,3,256,2,2495\0304,111,178,3,258,3,2495\0312635,2,4,Elder Saltwater Crocolisk\0301151,2,4,Saltwater Crocolisk\0302495,2,6,Drizzlik\0302495,4,11,Drizzlik\0302635,3,15,Elder Saltwater Crocolisk\0301151,3,15,Saltwater Crocolisk\0312,33,1434,0,\0302,0,0,6,Drizzlik\0302,0,0,6,Booty Bay\0304,0,0,8,Director Riddlevox\0304,0,0,8,Undermine\031577,19,577,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4105,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[6281]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, a note from Quartermaster Lewis? I'm not surprised he needs more gear. Sentinel Hill is far away, in a land Stormwind has all but forgotten.$B$BWell thank you, $N. Here's some money to cover your travel costs.\030For a small fee, you can take a gryphon to Stormwind, so you can deliver Lewis' note to Osric.  You won't get there faster any other way.$B$BIf that sounds acceptable, then just speak to me again when you're ready for the ride.  I'll charge you a little, but trust me; it'll be worth it!\030Buy a gryphon ride from the gryphon master Thor, then bring Lewis' Note to Osric Strang, in the shop Limited Immunity, in the Old Town of Stormwind.\030You've been traveling, eh? Have you been anywhere interesting?\030Continue to Stormwind\0312,1,94,2,257,1,523\0302,97,137,2,257,1,523\0302,142,227,2,257,4,523\0302,230,287,2,257,1,523\0303,1,148,2,384,1,523\0301,1,36,4,272,2,1323\0301,38,74,4,274,1,1323\0301,76,144,4,272,1,1323\0301,149,167,4,272,1,1323\0301,169,213,4,272,1,1323\0304,1,26,3,256,2,1323\0304,28,62,3,256,2,1323\031523,2,5,Thor\0301323,2,5,Osric Strang\030491,4,6,Quartermaster Lewis\0312,40,1436,0,\0302,0,0,1,Stormwind\0302,0,0,1,Osric\0302,0,0,5,Osric Strang\0302,0,0,5,Old Town of Stormwind\0304,0,0,6,Quartermaster Lewis\0316181,19,6181,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0306261,23,6261,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[6282]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This is most excellent news! Tell me again how you cast fear into the cold hearts of those vile harpies. The Bloodfuries have been dealt a serious blow!\030Tauren take pride as the protector of these lands. Undoubtedly you can guess why I am alarmed with the number of harpies that dwell here in Stonetalon.$B$BThe Bloodfuries are the source of the increasing number of harpies in Kalimdor; they encroach upon all likes of life preventing the innocent from leaving their boundaries.$B$BI need you to cull the harpies, $N!\030Maggran Earthbinder in Sun Rock Retreat wants you to slay 7 Bloodfury Harpies, 7 Bloodfury Ambushers, 7 Bloodfury Slayers and 7 Bloodfury Roguefeathers.\030Do not be weary of Charred Vale; many evil creatures reside in those hills. Stay strong $N, and you shall prevail over this threat to our people. Go now and strike hard - our children shall never know of the evil of what was.\030Harpies Threaten\0312,1,50,2,257,1,11860\0302,52,151,2,257,1,11860\0302,156,326,2,257,1,11860\0302,331,365,2,259,1,11860\0303,1,152,2,386,1,11860\0301,1,28,4,272,1,11860\0301,30,104,4,272,1,11860\0301,106,152,4,272,1,11860\0304,1,75,3,256,1,11860\0304,77,145,3,260,3,11860\0304,147,225,3,256,3,11860\03111860,2,5,Maggran Earthbinder\0312,406,1442,0,\0302,0,0,2,Stonetalon\0302,0,0,3,Kalimdor\0302,0,0,5,Sun Rock Retreat\0316283,23,6283,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,4022,OBJECTIVE,7,13,Bloodfury Harpy\030NPC,4025,OBJECTIVE,7,13,Bloodfury Ambusher\030NPC,4024,OBJECTIVE,7,13,Bloodfury Slayer\030NPC,4023,OBJECTIVE,7,13,Bloodfury Roguefeather",[6283]="PARTIAL\031conflict,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Already I feel the anger leave me. What will I do with my time? Knowing evil moves near my land kept my thoughts moving, though now they are silent. Perhaps this is a good thing... maybe now I can focus on the good, as all Tauren should.$B$BPlease accept this as a reward for your troubles.\030Limiting the number of Bloodfury Harpies will not be enough. The only true cure for their disease would be to slay their leader, Bloodfury Ripper!$B$BShe is all but a queen to those filthy creatures. Slay her and their numbers will surely diminish.$B$BGo back into the Charred Vale and you will find her along the western hills. She will not be easy to vanquish, but the reward will be great.\030Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat wishes you to slay Bloodfury Ripper and bring her remains as proof of your deed.\030Bloodfury Ripper is a nasty creature! You will have success finding her along the western hill line in the Charred Vale.$B$BThe bloodfuries will be helpless with out... surely we can vanquish them forever!\030Bloodfury Bloodline\0312,1,60,2,257,3,11860\0302,62,146,2,257,4,11860\0302,151,199,2,257,1,11860\0302,201,248,2,257,3,11860\0302,253,328,2,257,3,11860\0302,330,392,2,257,3,11860\0303,1,108,2,386,1,11860\0301,1,34,4,272,1,11860\0301,36,63,4,272,2,11860\0301,65,148,4,304,1,11860\0301,150,180,4,272,4,11860\0301,182,237,4,272,4,11860\0301,242,290,4,272,1,11860\0304,1,37,3,256,1,11860\0304,39,120,3,256,3,11860\0304,125,168,3,256,3,11860\0304,170,205,3,256,1,11860\03112579,2,2,Bloodfury Ripper\03012579,2,7,Bloodfury Ripper\03012579,3,14,Bloodfury Ripper\0312,406,1442,0,\0302,0,0,7,Sun Rock Retreat\0303,0,0,15,Charred Vale\0316282,19,6282,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,16190,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[6284]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Good hunting, $N! Besseleth is an old predator in these parts... I will miss her not. Take this reward as a token for being the forest champion.$B$B<Maggran rubs the wound caused by Besseleth.>$B$BPerhaps now many more will travel to Sun Rock Retreat without fearing what lurks in the dark.\030Warning: Proceed into Sishir Canyon west of here at your own risk.$B$BBesseleth and her eight-legged children of the forest have claimed this canyon as their webbed lair.$B$BMaggran Earthbinder in Sun Rock Retreat has placed a bounty on Besseleth. Slay her and bring proof of your killing to Maggran; there you will receive your reward for disposing this eight-legged menace.\030Kill Besseleth and bring Besseleth's Fang to Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat.\030Besseleth is a ruthless predator... I fear for those that travel Webwinder Path at night. It's then that she and her children prey upon innocent travelers. I myself fell prey to her two-foot fang of death, but luckily I was able to fend her off and get to safety. I would give anything to see that monster destroyed.\030Arachnophobia\0312,1,66,2,265,1,0\0302,71,170,2,257,1,0\0302,175,247,2,257,1,0\0302,249,375,2,257,3,0\0303,1,73,2,384,1,0\0301,1,17,4,272,1,11860\0301,19,64,4,272,1,11860\0301,66,85,4,272,3,11860\0301,87,144,4,272,1,11860\0301,149,193,4,272,1,11860\0301,198,290,4,272,4,11860\0304,1,35,3,256,1,11860\0304,37,89,3,256,1,11860\0304,91,155,3,256,1,11860\0304,157,263,3,264,1,11860\0304,265,316,3,260,4,11860\03111921,2,2,Besseleth\03011860,2,3,Maggran Earthbinder\03011921,2,3,Besseleth\03011921,2,5,Besseleth\03014892,2,5,Fang\03011921,4,7,Besseleth\03011921,4,10,Besseleth\03011921,3,12,Besseleth\03014892,3,15,Fang\0312,406,1442,0,\0302,0,0,3,Sun Rock Retreat\0302,0,0,4,Maggran\0302,0,0,5,Maggran\0302,0,0,5,Sun Rock Retreat\0304,0,0,11,Sun Rock Retreat\031\031OBJECT,177904,GIVER,?,9,Wanted Poster: Besseleth\030ITEM,16192,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[6285]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Great, you brought the armor! We'll get this divvied to those who need it immediately.$B$BThank you, $N. Your efforts have been a great help to us. And now that you're no stranger to gryphons, I hope you'll come and lend your aid to Sentinel Hill often!\030The gryphon master in Westfall is Thor.  If you've spoken to him before, then you can take one of my gryphons to him.$B$BThat's a good lesson to know: gryphons are always trained to fly to their capital city, but they'll only take you to a remote gryphon master after you've already been there.$B$BYou've already been to Thor, so just speak with me again when you're ready to take a gryphon to Westfall.  Once there, you can deliver Osric's Crate to Quartermaster Lewis.\030Buy a gryphon ride to Sentinel Hill from the gryphon master Dungar Longdrink, then take Osric's Crate to Lewis at Sentinel Hill.\030You're back from Stormwind? Did Osric send the armor?\030Return to Lewis\0312,1,39,2,257,1,352\0302,42,117,2,257,4,352\0302,122,294,2,257,1,352\0302,299,403,2,257,1,352\0302,406,470,2,257,1,352\0303,1,128,2,384,1,352\0301,1,29,4,272,1,491\0301,31,86,4,274,1,491\0301,91,104,4,272,1,491\0301,106,147,4,272,1,491\0301,149,253,4,274,3,491\0304,1,27,3,256,2,491\0304,29,53,3,256,2,491\031523,2,1,Thor\030523,2,4,Thor\030491,2,5,Quartermaster Lewis\030352,2,6,Dungar Longdrink\0312,40,1436,0,\0302,0,0,1,Westfall\0302,0,0,4,Thor\0302,0,0,4,Westfall\0302,0,0,5,Quartermaster Lewis\0302,0,0,6,Sentinel Hill\0302,0,0,6,Lewis\0302,0,0,6,Sentinel Hill\0304,0,0,11,Sentinel Hill of\0303,0,0,12,Stormwind\0316261,19,6261,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[629]="PARTIAL\031consequences,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This is good. When I return to Orgrimmar I will place this shard in a sacred place. It will remind us of the might and honor of Gri'lek.$B$BThank you, $N. Your deeds mark a growing friendship with the Darkspear tribe.\030Long ago, a great shudder of the earth sunk an old troll city beneath the waters of the Savage Coast to the northwest.  We call that place the Vile Reef, for murlocs now reside in the ruins of the city, attacking any who draw close.$B$BThere is an old tablet among those ruins that tells the ancient tale of Gri'lek, a hero of troll legends.  The tale is sacred to the Darkspear tribe, and although the tablet is too large to move, I want a shard of it to enshrine in our new home in Orgrimmar.\030Bring a Tablet Shard to Kin'weelay at the Grom'gol Base Camp.\030I await the Tablet Shard, $N.\030The Vile Reef\0312,1,118,2,321,1,2519\0302,121,232,2,325,1,2519\0302,237,341,2,321,1,2519\0302,344,494,2,259,1,2519\0303,1,61,2,384,1,2519\0301,1,13,4,272,1,2519\0301,15,83,4,272,3,2519\0301,85,136,4,272,4,2519\0301,141,154,4,272,1,2519\0301,156,217,4,272,1,2519\0304,1,29,3,256,1,2519\0310,2,3,Gri'lek\0302519,2,5,Kin'weelay\0300,4,8,Gri'lek\030795,4,10,Mark\0312,33,1434,0,\0302,0,0,4,Darkspear\0302,0,0,4,Orgrimmar\0302,0,0,5,Kin'weelay\0302,0,0,5,Grom'gol Base Camp\0304,0,0,7,Orgrimmar\031\031ITEM,4094,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[63]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You place the bracers atop the brazier and then pour the remaining drops of Brine's potion into the flame. The drops crackle as they hit the flame and you begin to incant the simple words Islen taught you....\030Along the coast of Silverpine, west of the Sepulcher, you will find a shrine that has become tainted by the plague. The spirits there no longer speak to our people and it will be up to you to defeat the manifestation and cleanse the pool.$B$BTake the elemental's bracers, along with the remaining drops of Brine's potion, and place them on the brazier. The ritual should be enough to summon a pure spirit for you to communicate with.$B$BBring me proof the task is done, and I will reward you with your totem.\030Defeat the Corrupt Manifestation of Water and place the Corrupted Manifestation's Bracers along with the Remaining Drops of Purest Water on the Brazier of Everfount in Silverpine Forest.\030The brazier still reflects the ambient light from the area, and the flame shifts slightly as you move closer.$B$BThe corruption along the hills seems to have kept its distance, and besides the missing components, the brazier looks prepared for the ritual to summon a cleansed manifestation of water.\030Call of Water\0312,1,115,2,261,3,5901\0302,117,238,2,257,3,5901\0302,243,352,2,257,1,5901\0302,354,433,2,257,1,5901\0302,438,508,2,257,3,5901\0303,1,186,2,388,1,5901\0301,1,106,4,272,1,0\0301,108,208,4,272,1,0\0304,1,109,3,256,1,0\0304,114,299,3,260,4,0\03111256,2,6,Manifestation of Water\03011256,3,10,Manifestation of Water\0312,0,0,1,Sepulcher\0302,0,0,6,Silverpine Forest\031220,19,220,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030100,23,100,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,113791,FINISHER,?,12,Brazier of Everfount\030ITEM,7812,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[630]="PARTIAL\031loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031$N, you have saved me from a great dishonor. If it was within my power, I would offer you a place among my tribe. But for now, all I can only offer you is this token for the courage and nobility you have shown.\030$N, I put my faith in you and anyone you can muster to help free me. The great Skymane King Mukla is my captor. He commands the beasts of this island, and they keep me here against my will with the aid of this chain. If you can slay him and find the key to this shackle, I shall be indebted to you greatly.$B$BI often hear him to the southeast side of the island, but please be careful: he is not to be trifled with.\030Slay King Mukla and return to Princess Poobah with the Key to free her.\030I thank my ancestors someone has come to aid me. Do you have the key that will free me?\030Message in a Bottle\0312,1,68,2,257,1,2634\0302,70,111,2,261,1,2634\0302,113,216,2,257,3,2634\0302,218,306,2,257,4,2634\0302,311,416,2,257,1,2634\0303,1,71,2,384,1,2634\0301,1,44,4,304,1,2634\0301,46,113,4,272,4,2634\0301,115,210,4,272,1,2634\0304,1,48,3,256,1,2634\0304,50,87,3,256,2,2634\0311559,2,2,King Mukla\0301559,2,6,King Mukla\0302634,2,6,Princess Poobah\0312,33,1434,0,\0302,0,0,6,Princess Poobah\031594,19,594,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4103,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[6301]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah? $N, you have the Gaea seeds. Watch and you shall see the power that these seeds will do for the land. Only those pure and true can heal the land?$B$B<Tammra begins to chant.>\030Industrial greed and continuous war have wrecked the lands of Stonetalon. Only the blessings of the Earthmother can cure such injury.$B$B$N, I will require you to seek a special seed, the Gaea seed. They are only found here in Stonetalon Mountain, north of Sun Rock Retreat at Mirkfallon Lake, near the water's edge.$B$BOnce you bring me the seeds I will imbue them with shamanistic power to speed their growth.\030Tammra Windfield at Sun Rock Retreat wants you to gather 10 Gaea Seeds.\030The continuous destruction caused by war and those that seek a profit from lumber pains me deeply. The least I can do is perform the cycle of rebirth and sow the Gaea seeds to replenish the lands with a new forest. Do you have the required Gaea seeds, $C?\030Cycle of Rebirth\0312,1,73,2,261,1,11864\0302,75,133,2,257,1,11864\0302,138,198,2,259,3,11864\0302,200,316,2,257,1,11864\0302,321,411,2,257,3,11864\0303,1,71,2,386,1,11864\0301,5,32,4,272,1,11864\0301,34,105,4,272,3,11864\0301,107,149,4,272,2,11864\0301,154,178,4,272,1,11864\0304,1,98,3,262,1,11864\0304,100,214,3,256,1,11864\0304,216,255,3,256,2,11864\03111864,2,6,Tammra Windfield\0312,406,1442,0,\0302,0,0,4,Stonetalon Mountain\0302,0,0,4,Sun Rock Retreat\0302,0,0,4,Mirkfallon Lake\0302,0,0,6,Sun Rock Retreat\0316381,23,6381,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,16205,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[631]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You search the tiny, dwarven corpse. Engraved into the helmet you can clearly read: Ebenezer Rustlocke.\030A tremendous explosion roared through the hills.  'Twas horrible, I tell you!$B$BGood soldiers died defending the Thandol Span.  Longbraid says we'll take revenge on the Dark Irons before all is said and done.$B$BWe're in a world of hurt though and I don't see any reinforcements in sight.  Longbraid sent Ol' Rustlocke to scout the eastern bridge to see if we could secure it.$B$BThat was days ago.  We haven't the manpower to search for him with Dun Modr under siege.$B$BPerhaps you can find him...\030Rhag Garmason wants you to locate Ol' Rustlocke.\030\030The Thandol Span\0312,1,48,2,257,1,1075\0302,51,77,2,257,1,1075\0302,82,127,2,257,1,1075\0302,130,209,2,259,1,1075\0302,214,289,2,257,1,1075\0302,292,377,2,257,4,1075\0302,382,399,2,257,1,1075\0302,402,469,2,257,1,1075\0302,474,500,2,257,4,1075\0303,1,48,2,386,1,1075\0301,1,36,4,272,1,0\0301,38,103,4,272,1,0\0311075,2,10,Rhag Garmason\0312,11,1437,0,\031632,23,632,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,2652,FINISHER,?,12,Ebenezer Rustlocke's Corpse",[632]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Oh my, the news is grave....\030It seems as though poor Ol' Rustlocke ran into a Dark Iron ambush.  You notice a parchment next to his clenched fist.$B$BReport the grim news to Rhag Garmason and show him what you found.\030Report back to Rhag Garmason and show him the parchment you found on Rustlocke's corpse.\030Any sign of Ol' Rustlocke, $N?\030The Thandol Span\0312,1,66,2,261,4,0\0302,69,117,2,257,1,0\0302,122,187,2,257,1,0\0303,1,88,2,384,1,0\0301,1,28,4,272,1,1075\0304,1,30,3,256,2,1075\0311075,2,3,Rhag Garmason\0301075,2,4,Rhag Garmason\0312,11,1437,0,\0302,0,0,3,Rhag Garmason\0302,0,0,4,Rhag Garmason\031631,19,631,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030633,23,633,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,2652,GIVER,?,9,Ebenezer Rustlocke's Corpse",[6321]="PARTIAL\031consequences\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, an order for supplies.  You will want to take this to the Undercity, no doubt.  And quickly, for the Sepulcher must not be left under stocked.\030Executor Hadrec asked me to take stock of our equipment at the Sepulcher.  With the Scourge, and worse, lurking in the woods, he doesn't want the Deathguards to lack gear they might need.$B$BI found that we are, in general, well stocked, but we do need more weapons to replace those lost in the field.$B$BHere is a requisition order of what is needed, for the weapon dealer Gordon Wendham in the Undercity.  Take the order to our bat master, Karos Razok, and speak with him about transport to the Undercity.\030Bring Podrig's Order to Karos Razok.\030You appear to be on official business...\030Supplying the Sepulcher\0312,1,73,2,257,1,6389\0302,76,187,2,323,4,6389\0302,192,301,2,263,1,6389\0302,306,406,2,257,1,6389\0302,409,507,2,257,1,6389\0303,1,36,2,384,1,6389\0301,1,26,4,272,1,2226\0301,29,82,4,274,3,2226\0301,85,146,4,280,1,2226\0304,1,40,3,256,1,2226\0314556,2,4,Gordon Wendham\0302226,2,5,Karos Razok\0302226,2,6,Karos Razok\0312,130,1421,0,\0302,0,0,1,Sepulcher\0302,0,0,4,Undercity\0302,0,0,5,Undercity\0302,0,0,6,Karos Razok\0304,0,0,8,Undercity\0316323,23,6323,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[6322]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This crate must reach the Sepulcher in Silverpine? That is easily done; our bats fly there daily.\030I have placed the Sepulcher's supplies into this crate.  If you have already visited the Sepulcher and spoken with their bat master, then you may ride a bat back to him.$B$BSpeak with the Undercity's bat master, Michael Garrett.  He can provide you with a bat to the Sepulcher.\030Bring Gordon's Crate to Michael Garrett.\030If you must travel a long distance, then a bat is your best option.\030Michael Garrett\0312,1,55,2,257,1,4556\0302,58,169,2,257,4,4556\0302,174,228,2,257,1,4556\0302,231,277,2,257,1,4556\0303,1,40,2,384,1,4556\0301,1,50,4,272,2,4551\0301,52,97,4,272,1,4551\0304,1,67,3,256,4,4551\0314551,2,3,Michael Garrett\0304551,2,5,Michael Garrett\0312,130,1421,0,\0302,0,0,4,Sepulcher\0302,0,0,5,Michael Garrett\0304,0,0,6,Silverpine\0316323,19,6323,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0306324,23,6324,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[6323]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031An order from the Sepulcher? Very well. It is an honor to serve those who serve our Dark Lady.\030One of my bats can take you to the Undercity, for a small fee.  Speak with me again when you are ready so that we may arrange your transport.$B$BYou will find Gordon Wendham in the Trade Quarter of the Undercity.  That is the same quarter where my bat will land.\030Buy a bat ride to the Undercity from the bat master Karos Razok, then take Podrig's Order to Gordon Wendham in the Undercity.\030I keep my weapons in top condition. They are cleaned and ready for use.\030Ride to the Undercity\0312,1,62,2,257,1,2226\0302,65,141,2,259,1,2226\0302,146,212,2,257,3,2226\0302,215,262,2,257,3,2226\0303,1,125,2,384,1,2226\0301,1,28,4,272,2,4556\0301,30,39,4,272,1,4556\0301,41,94,4,272,1,4556\0304,1,35,3,256,1,4556\0304,37,71,3,256,1,4556\0314556,2,3,Gordon Wendham\0302226,2,5,Karos Razok\0304556,2,5,Gordon Wendham\03015065,4,8,Lady\0312,130,1421,0,\0302,0,0,1,Undercity\0302,0,0,3,Trade Quarter of the Undercity\0302,0,0,5,Undercity\0302,0,0,5,Gordon Wendham\0302,0,0,5,Undercity\0304,0,0,6,Sepulcher\0316321,19,6321,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0306322,23,6322,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[6324]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Good work, $N. These weapons will ensure our Deathguards don't get caught unprepared.$B$BYou have done a valuable service for our Dark Lady.\030The bat master in the Sepulcher is Karos Razok.  If you have already met him, then I can give you a bat to fly back to him.$B$BOur bats will always fly to the Undercity, but to travel to more remote locales their rider must first visit the area and speak with its bat master.$B$BYou have met Karos in the Sepulcher, so you may now fly bats there.  Speak with me again when you are ready.\030Buy a bat ride to the Sepulcher from the bat master Michael Garrett, then bring Gordon's Crate to Deathguard Podrig in the Sepulcher.\030$N, you return. Do you have our supplies from the Undercity?\030Return to Podrig\0312,1,47,2,257,1,4551\0302,50,123,2,257,4,4551\0302,128,275,2,257,3,4551\0302,280,346,2,257,1,4551\0302,349,387,2,257,1,4551\0303,1,133,2,384,1,4551\0301,1,14,4,272,1,6389\0301,16,85,4,272,3,6389\0301,90,140,4,272,1,6389\0304,1,15,3,256,1,6389\0304,17,60,3,256,2,6389\0312226,2,1,Karos Razok\0304551,2,6,Michael Garrett\0306389,2,6,Deathguard Podrig\03015065,4,9,Lady\0312,130,1421,0,\0302,0,0,1,Sepulcher\0302,0,0,3,Undercity\0302,0,0,4,Sepulcher\0302,0,0,6,Sepulcher\0302,0,0,6,Deathguard Podrig\0302,0,0,6,Sepulcher\0303,0,0,11,Undercity\0316322,19,6322,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[633]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031The remaining bridge is saved! You have done a great service to King Magni and the people of Khaz Modan.$B$BNow if we can only hold out long enough for reinforcements to show...\030Heavens no!  Poor Rustlocke.  'Tis quite a tragedy indeed.$B$BWe must not let his death pass in vain.  This parchment you discovered indicates that Kam Deepfury, the mastermind behind the original attack, arranged for a cache of explosives to be stashed just across the Thandol Span, in Arathi Highlands.$B$BIf those explosives make it to the bridge, our major supply line to the north will be severed!  The cache must be destroyed, $n!  Return to me when your mission is complete.$B$BYou're our only hope.\030Destroy the cache of explosives.\030\030Cache of Explosives Destroyed\030The cache of explosives must be destroyed!\030The Thandol Span\0312,1,11,2,257,1,1075\0302,14,28,2,257,1,1075\0302,31,58,2,257,1,1075\0302,63,101,2,265,1,1075\0302,104,304,2,261,1,1075\0302,309,402,2,257,4,1075\0302,405,436,2,261,1,1075\0302,439,481,2,257,1,1075\0302,486,506,2,259,3,1075\0303,1,32,2,388,1,1075\0301,1,30,4,272,1,1075\0301,32,104,4,272,1,1075\0301,109,177,4,272,4,1075\0306,1,42,3,260,1,1075\0305,1,29,3,388,1,1075\0311666,2,5,Kam Deepfury\0312,11,1437,0,\0302,0,0,5,Arathi Highlands\0304,0,0,12,King Magni\031632,19,632,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030634,23,634,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,2704,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Cache of Explosives",[634]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031My condolences go out to Longbraid and his brave soldiers. The news of the Thandol Span tragedy and the fall of Dun Modr hangs heavy in my heart.$B$BBut Stromgarde has fallen! Hence our presence here at Refuge Pointe. We are faced with retaking our own great city.$B$BHonor and duty require that we do not leave the Highlands until Stromgarde raises the mighty banner of the King once again. I will send word to Longbraid that he is on his own...\030I ask of you one more small favor, $c.  We await the reserves of Ironforge.  However, Roggo has knowledge of an Alliance camp to the north in Arathi Highlands at Refuge Pointe.$B$BTravel there and seek out Captain Nials.  Ask the good Captain if the Alliance can spare some soldiers to help us reclaim Dun Modr and the Thandol Span.\030Seek out Captain Nials at Refuge Pointe.\030\030Plea To The Alliance\0312,1,38,2,259,1,1075\0302,41,75,2,257,1,1075\0302,78,176,2,257,1,1075\0302,181,220,2,259,1,1075\0302,223,332,2,257,4,1075\0303,1,40,2,384,1,1075\0301,1,58,4,272,1,2700\0301,60,145,4,272,1,2700\0301,150,175,4,272,1,2700\0301,177,217,4,272,1,2700\0301,219,264,4,272,1,2700\0301,269,391,4,272,1,2700\0301,393,446,4,272,3,2700\0312700,2,4,Captain Nials\0302700,2,6,Captain Nials\0312,11,1437,0,\0302,0,0,3,Arathi Highlands\0302,0,0,3,Refuge Pointe\0302,0,0,6,Refuge Pointe\0304,0,0,7,Longbraid\0304,0,0,10,Refuge Pointe\0304,0,0,13,Longbraid\031633,19,633,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[6341]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, you wish to get this to Auberdine? Very well...\030The fishermen of Rut'theran village do very well, for the fish here are extremely large and abundant.  I would like to compare the bounty here with that of the mainland.$B$BI have a collection of fish bones and scales that I would like taken to a colleague of mine in Darkshore.  His name is Laird, he is a fish vendor in the village of Auberdine.$B$BBring my collection to our hippogryph master, Vesprystus, and speak to him about traveling to Auberdine.\030Bring Nessa's Collection to Vesprystus.\030How may I help you? Are you in need of transport?\030The Bounty of Teldrassil\0312,1,101,2,257,1,10118\0302,104,169,2,259,4,10118\0302,174,278,2,259,4,10118\0302,281,347,2,257,1,10118\0302,352,455,2,257,1,10118\0303,1,39,2,384,1,10118\0301,1,38,4,274,2,3838\0301,40,51,4,272,1,3838\0304,1,19,3,256,2,3838\0304,21,49,3,258,2,3838\0314200,2,4,Laird\0303838,2,5,Vesprystus\0303838,2,6,Vesprystus\0312,148,1439,0,\0302,0,0,3,Darkshore\0302,0,0,5,Auberdine\0302,0,0,6,Vesprystus\0304,0,0,7,Auberdine\0316344,19,6344,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0306342,23,6342,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[6342]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031A package from Nessa? Thank you, $N! She told me she would send me samples of the fish caught near Rut'theran village. She thinks they may be very different from the fish caught here...$B$BMy! This jawbone is nearly twice the size of the same fish found here. And these scales are as big as a closed fist! Amazing!\030From Rut'theran, there are two methods of travel to Auberdine: by ferry and by hippogryph.  Both are quick and reliable, but if you have not yet flown to Auberdine by hippogryph, then I suggest you do.$B$BIt is sound advice to speak with the hippogryph master in every town that has one.  Once you speak to the master, you can then fly there from other towns.$B$BHere is Nessa's collection.  Speak with me again when you are ready to fly to Auberdine and deliver Nessa's collection to Laird.\030Ride a hippogryph to Auberdine from the hippogryph master Vesprystus, then bring Nessa's Collection to Laird.\030Have you come from Teldrassil? Tell me, how is the fishing there?\030Flight to Auberdine\0312,1,90,2,257,1,3838\0302,93,201,2,257,4,3838\0302,206,287,2,257,1,3838\0302,290,359,2,257,1,3838\0302,364,390,2,257,1,3838\0302,393,491,2,257,1,3838\0303,1,109,2,384,1,3838\0301,1,21,4,272,2,4200\0301,23,36,4,272,1,4200\0301,38,118,4,272,4,4200\0301,120,185,4,272,1,4200\0301,194,259,4,272,1,4200\0301,261,305,4,272,1,4200\0301,307,314,4,272,1,4200\0304,1,30,3,256,2,4200\0304,32,65,3,256,2,4200\0314200,2,6,Laird\0303838,2,7,Vesprystus\0304200,2,7,Laird\0312,148,1439,0,\0302,0,0,1,Auberdine\0302,0,0,2,Auberdine\0302,0,0,6,Auberdine\0302,0,0,6,Laird\0302,0,0,7,Auberdine\0302,0,0,7,Laird\0304,0,0,8,Nessa\0304,0,0,10,Rut'theran\0303,0,0,15,Teldrassil\0316341,19,6341,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0306343,23,6343,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[6343]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This is very interesting. The fish here are large, but I didn't think the difference in bounties between here and the mainland was so great. There must be a reason for this...$B$BWell thank you, $N. I will discuss with the villagers the news you brought. Perhaps, one day, we will find the root of this oddity. But until then, we shall reap its benefits!\030I must send a response to Nessa.  She'll be very interested to know how different the fish here are from those along Teldrassil's coastline.  We can only guess the cause, but it is my suspicion that the world tree itself is affecting the wildlife around it!$B$BPlease, take this response to Nessa.  If you wish to take a hippogryph back to Rut'theran then speak with the hippogryph master Caylais Moonfeather.  If you wish to take the ferry, then one regularly departs from the dock to the northwest.\030Bring Laird's Response to Nessa Shadowsong.\030$N, you're back from Auberdine? Did you speak with Laird?\030Return to Nessa\0312,1,32,2,257,1,4200\0302,35,140,2,257,1,4200\0302,143,257,2,321,1,4200\0302,262,297,2,257,1,4200\0302,300,409,2,259,4,4200\0302,412,500,2,259,4,4200\0303,1,43,2,384,1,4200\0301,1,25,4,272,1,10118\0301,27,140,4,272,1,10118\0301,142,175,4,272,1,10118\0301,180,198,4,272,1,10118\0301,200,254,4,272,3,10118\0301,256,310,4,272,4,10118\0301,312,354,4,272,3,10118\0304,1,31,3,256,2,10118\0304,33,57,3,256,2,10118\0313841,2,5,Caylais Moonfeather\03010118,2,7,Nessa Shadowsong\0304200,3,16,Laird\0312,148,1439,0,\0302,0,0,1,Nessa\0302,0,0,4,Nessa\0302,0,0,5,Rut'theran the\0302,0,0,7,Nessa Shadowsong\0303,0,0,15,Auberdine\0316342,19,6342,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[6344]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Yes, I have need of a courier who will take a package to Darkshore. Will you help me?\030A friend of mine, Nessa Shadowsong, is a fishing merchant in Rut'theran Village.  She needs a parcel taken to Darkshore, and is looking for someone to help her.$B$BIf you're interested, then to reach Nessa you must take the portal in Darnassus to Rut'theran Village.  You will find the portal west of the Temple Gardens.\030Speak with Nessa Shadowsong.\030\030Nessa Shadowsong\0312,1,80,2,257,1,4241\0302,83,160,2,259,1,4241\0302,165,266,2,257,4,4241\0302,269,320,2,257,3,4241\0303,1,28,2,384,1,4241\0301,1,67,4,274,3,10118\0301,69,85,4,272,2,10118\03110118,2,1,Nessa Shadowsong\03010118,2,5,Nessa Shadowsong\0312,1657,1457,0,\0302,0,0,1,Rut'theran Village\0302,0,0,2,Darkshore\0302,0,0,3,Darnassus\0302,0,0,3,Rut'theran Village\0302,0,0,4,Temple Gardens\0304,0,0,6,Darkshore\0316341,23,6341,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[635]="PARTIAL\031characters,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This crystal pulses, as if a living force is trapped within it.\030This shard pulses as you hold it...$B$BYou feel a sense of pleading coming from the shard, as if someone is trying to communicate, someone who desperately needs your help.$B$BA vision appears in your mind - of the northern mountains of Arathi, and of a brilliant crystal jutting from the earth there.$B$BYou feel drawn to that place.\030Find the crystal from your vision.\030\030Crystal in the Mountains\0312,1,35,2,257,1,0\0302,40,171,2,259,4,0\0302,176,300,2,257,1,0\0302,305,333,2,257,1,0\0303,1,34,2,384,1,0\0301,1,63,4,272,4,0\031\0312,45,1417,0,\031\031ITEM,4614,STARTER,?,10,\030OBJECT,138492,FINISHER,?,12,Shards of Myzrael",[636]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030This book tells the tale of an elemental princess, Myzrael, and of her imprisonment deep underneath the Arathi Highlands.$B$BIt also tells of a secret outcropping of crystals in the highlands.  These crystals, the Shards of Myzrael, are a window to the princess' prison.$B$BIf a brave soul found the Shards of Myzrael, the perhaps $ghe:she; could speak with her...\030Find the Shards of Myzrael.\030\030Legends of the Earth\0312,1,121,2,261,1,0\0302,126,192,2,257,1,0\0302,195,270,2,257,1,0\0302,275,364,2,257,4,0\0303,1,27,2,384,1,0\031330,2,1,Princess\0302755,2,1,Myzrael\0302755,2,3,Myzrael\0302755,2,4,Myzrael\0302755,2,5,Myzrael\0312,45,1417,0,\031\031",[6361]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031If you must take these hides to Thunder Bluff, then you are speaking to the right orc!\030I have a bundle of hides from the animals of the Barrens, and must get them to Thunder Bluff.  A colleague there, Ahanu, will use the hides to create leather goods.$B$BWill you take the hides to him for me?$B$BThe quickest way to Thunder Bluff is on the back of a wind rider.  Bring the bundle of hides to Devrak, our wind rider master in the Crossroads, and speak to him about transport to Thunder Bluff.\030Bring the Bundle of Hides to the wind rider master Devrak in the Crossroads.\030Are you here for a wind rider? You have something to transport?\030A Bundle of Hides\0312,1,93,2,257,1,3483\0302,96,164,2,257,3,3483\0302,169,206,2,257,2,3483\0302,211,275,2,257,1,3483\0302,278,405,2,257,1,3483\0303,1,76,2,384,1,3483\0301,1,86,4,272,4,3615\0304,1,30,3,256,2,3615\0304,32,63,3,256,2,3615\0318359,2,2,Ahanu\0302224,2,4,Wind Rider\0303615,2,5,Devrak\0302224,2,5,Wind Rider\0302224,2,6,Wind Rider\0303615,2,6,Devrak\0302224,3,8,Wind Rider\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,1,Thunder Bluff\0302,0,0,4,Thunder Bluff\0302,0,0,5,Devrak\0302,0,0,5,Crossroads\0302,0,0,5,Thunder Bluff\0302,0,0,6,Crossroads\0304,0,0,7,Thunder Bluff\0316362,23,6362,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[6362]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, a new bundle of hides. I will get to work on these immediately!$B$BThank you, brother. You have done me a great service. Here are some coins to pay for your time and travel costs.\030For a small fee, I will give you a wind rider to Thunder Bluff.  There's no faster way to the city!$B$BIf that is acceptable, speak to me again when you are ready to go.$B$BIf you're taking those hides to Ahanu, then I think he's at Hewa's Armory, at the base of the wind rider tower in Thunder Bluff.  And that's right where you'll land!\030Buy a wind rider to Thunder Bluff from the wind rider master Devrak, then bring the Bundle of Hides to Ahanu in Thunder Bluff.\030There is dust on your shoulders that must be from the Barrens. You have spoken with my friend Jahan?\030Ride to Thunder Bluff\0312,1,63,2,257,3,3615\0302,66,99,2,257,1,3615\0302,104,169,2,257,4,3615\0302,174,301,2,257,4,3615\0302,304,338,2,257,1,3615\0303,1,126,2,384,1,3615\0301,1,26,4,272,1,8359\0301,28,67,4,272,3,8359\0301,72,90,4,272,1,8359\0301,92,124,4,272,1,8359\0301,126,183,4,272,1,8359\0304,1,62,3,256,1,8359\0304,64,100,3,256,2,8359\0312224,2,1,Wind Rider\0308359,2,4,Ahanu\0302224,2,4,Wind Rider\0302224,2,6,Wind Rider\0303615,2,6,Devrak\0308359,2,6,Ahanu\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,1,Thunder Bluff\0302,0,0,4,Ahanu\0302,0,0,4,Hewa's Armory\0302,0,0,4,Thunder Bluff\0302,0,0,6,Thunder Bluff\0302,0,0,6,Ahanu\0302,0,0,6,Thunder Bluff\0303,0,0,12,Barrens\0316361,19,6361,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0306363,23,6363,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[6363]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You need to take this to the Crossroads, eh? That's not a problem. If you've already been there and spoken to Devrak, then you can take one of my wind riders back to him.\030I have prepared leather goods for Jahan to sell at the Crossroads.  Will you bring them to him?$B$BIf you have already been to the Crossroads and spoken to their wind rider master, then you can fly one of our Thunder Bluff wind riders back to him.$B$BTake the leather goods to Tal, our wind rider master in Thunder Bluff, and speak with him to arrange transport to the Crossroads.\030Bring Ahanu's Leather Goods to Tal in Thunder Bluff.\030Greetings, $C. What can I do for you?\030Tal the Wind Rider Master\0312,1,66,2,257,1,8359\0302,69,95,2,257,2,8359\0302,100,247,2,257,4,8359\0302,252,380,2,257,1,8359\0303,1,52,2,384,1,8359\0301,1,44,4,274,2,2995\0301,46,66,4,276,1,2995\0301,68,170,4,272,4,2995\0304,1,14,3,256,1,2995\0304,16,37,3,256,2,2995\0312224,2,3,Wind Rider\0302224,2,4,Wind Rider\0303615,4,8,Devrak\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,1,Crossroads\0302,0,0,3,Crossroads\0302,0,0,4,Tal\0302,0,0,4,Thunder Bluff\0302,0,0,4,Crossroads\0302,0,0,5,Tal\0302,0,0,5,Thunder Bluff\0304,0,0,6,Crossroads\0304,0,0,8,Devrak\0316362,19,6362,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0306364,23,6364,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[6364]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ahanu sent me finished products? Very good. There are many hunters and adventurers in the Crossroads now and business is lively. I am sure I'll sell these goods very soon.$B$BThank you for all your efforts, $N. I am in your debt.\030In order to fly to a town, you must have already been there and spoken with the wind rider master of that town.  You have been to the Crossroads and spoken to their wind rider master Devrak, so for a small fee you can take a wind rider to him from here.$B$BSpeak with me again when you are ready.  Once at the Crossroads, you can then deliver the leather goods to Jahan Hawkwing.\030Buy a wind rider to the Crossroads from the wind rider master Tal, then bring Ahanu's Leather Goods to Jahan Hawkwing.\030$N, you are back from Thunder Bluff? Did you deliver the hides to Ahanu?\030Return to Jahan\0312,1,111,2,259,1,2995\0302,114,253,2,257,1,2995\0302,258,296,2,257,1,2995\0302,299,379,2,257,1,2995\0303,1,118,2,384,1,2995\0301,1,32,4,272,2,3483\0301,34,43,4,272