s\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, it is good to see a $C heed my summons. I have need of your services, $N, and fear they will take you down a dangerous path...$B$BA path into Dire Maul.\030Talo Thornhoof, a Tauren elder in Feralas, sends a request for aid.  He offered few details, but he did say that he needs agents for a matter both delicate... and dire.$B$BServe the Horde, $N.  Go to Camp Mojache in Feralas and speak with Talo.\030Speak with Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache in Feralas.\030\030Camp Mojache\0312,1,67,2,257,1,10880\0302,70,158,2,259,1,10880\0302,160,168,2,257,1,10880\0302,173,192,2,257,1,10880\0302,195,244,2,257,1,10880\0303,1,53,2,384,1,10880\0301,1,43,4,272,1,7776\0301,45,130,4,274,3,7776\0301,135,156,4,272,1,7776\0317776,2,1,Talo Thornhoof\0307776,2,6,Talo Thornhoof\0312,2557,0,0,\0302,0,0,1,Feralas\0302,0,0,5,Camp Mojache\0302,0,0,5,Feralas\0302,0,0,6,Camp Mojache\0302,0,0,6,Feralas\0317489,23,7489,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307489,24,7489,UNKNOWN\031",[7493]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031A dragon slayer and a seasoned leatherworker? You do not cease to astonish, hero. I am humbled.$B$BPlease accept what I am about to teach you. This knowledge will prove to be invaluable if you are to destroy what remains of the Black Dragonflight.$B$BCreate the cloak from the scales of the brood mother. It will protect you and your allies against the incendiary breath of the Lord of Blackrock... Nefarian.\030\030\030\030The Journey Has Just Begun\0311,1,45,4,272,2,14392\0301,47,81,4,272,1,14392\0301,83,95,4,272,1,14392\0301,100,142,4,272,1,14392\0301,144,247,4,276,4,14392\0301,252,304,4,272,1,14392\0301,306,398,4,284,3,14392\0301,400,408,4,272,1,14392\03111583,4,8,Nefarian\0312,1637,1454,0,\0317491,19,7491,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[7494]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Hail, $N.  I am pleased to see you, but regret that our meeting is not under more pleasant conditions.$B$BListen close, for I have a vital task for you...\030$N!  Your aid is needed in Feralas!$B$BAn outlaw mage, Lethtendris, has fled to the ancient elven ruins Eldre'thalas, now called Dire Maul.  It is believed she has an item of dangerous magical energy which must be recovered.$B$BLatronicus Moonspear requests agents to enter Dire Maul and retrieve the item from Lethtendris.$B$BServe the Alliance!  Seek out Latronicus at the Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.\030Speak with Latronicus Moonspear at the Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.\030\030Feathermoon Stronghold\0312,6,35,2,257,1,0\0302,40,139,2,321,1,0\0302,142,224,2,257,1,0\0302,229,323,2,257,1,0\0302,328,346,2,257,1,0\0302,349,409,2,257,1,0\0303,1,73,2,384,1,0\0301,1,9,4,272,1,7877\0301,12,102,4,272,1,7877\0301,107,154,4,272,1,7877\03114327,2,2,Lethtendris\0307877,2,4,Latronicus Moonspear\03014327,2,4,Lethtendris\0307877,2,7,Latronicus Moonspear\0312,2557,0,0,\0302,0,0,1,Feralas\0302,0,0,4,Lethtendris\0302,0,0,6,Feathermoon Stronghold\0302,0,0,6,Feralas\0302,0,0,7,Feathermoon Stronghold\0302,0,0,7,Feralas\0317488,23,7488,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307488,24,7488,UNKNOWN\031",[7495]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031For so many years I was held under her captivating gaze. Finally, to see justice meted and the honor of Stormwind restored! Today, we celebrate this glorious victory!\030You have accomplished the impossible. The brood mother of the Black Dragonflight lies dead at your feet. Take her head and present it to the Highlord.\030Take the Head of Onyxia to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind.\030By Uther's beard!\030Victory for the Alliance\0312,1,37,2,257,1,0\0302,39,104,2,257,1,0\0302,106,150,2,257,1,0\0303,1,66,2,384,1,0\0301,1,56,4,272,1,1748\0301,