ns,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent work, $R. Should you find any more tomes, do not hesitate to return them to us.$B$BAs time passes, we tend to change around and even add new rewards for the return of missing tomes.\030The tome carries the mark of the Athenaeum.\030Return the book to its rightful owners.\030You have recovered a tome!\030Garona: A Study on Stealth and Treachery\0312,1,43,2,257,1,0\0303,1,39,2,384,1,0\0301,1,19,4,272,1,14383\0301,21,89,4,272,1,14383\0301,94,191,4,276,1,14383\0304,1,26,3,256,1,14383\031795,2,1,Mark\0312,2557,0,0,\031\031ITEM,18356,STARTER,?,10,",[7499]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent work, $R. Should you find any more tomes, do not hesitate to return them to us.$B$BAs time passes, we tend to change around and even add new rewards for the return of missing tomes.\030The tome carries the mark of the Athenaeum.\030Return the book to its rightful owners.\030You have recovered a tome!\030Codex of Defense\0312,1,43,2,257,1,0\0303,1,39,2,384,1,0\0301,1,19,4,272,1,14383\0301,21,89,4,272,1,14383\0301,94,191,4,276,1,14383\0304,1,26,3,256,1,14383\031795,2,1,Mark\0312,2557,0,0,\031\031ITEM,18357,STARTER,?,10,",[75]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You found it!\030There was a bundle of parchments in the chest upstairs when I moved into this place.  I looked at them once when I first arrived but I gave up once the fog hazed over my peepers. $B$BDo an old, nearly-blind man a favor and check the chest upstairs for anything that might help you in your quest to discover more about this Stalvan character.  I'm pretty sure there's a faded journal page that might be of interest to you.  Bring it to me and I'll help in anyway I can.\030Marshal Haggard wants you to check the chest upstairs for the Faded Journal Page.\030Did you find that page I mentioned, $N?\030The Legend of Stalvan\0312,1,84,2,257,1,294\0302,87,178,2,257,1,294\0302,184,341,2,257,4,294\0302,344,421,2,257,4,294\0302,424,468,2,257,1,294\0303,1,81,2,386,1,294\0301,1,13,4,272,1,294\0304,1,39,3,256,2,294\031294,2,6,Marshal Haggard\0312,10,1431,0,\03174,19,74,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\03078,23,78,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,921,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[750]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The Tauren of Narache thank you for these provisions, $N. With your skill in the ways of the hunt you will surely be revered in Thunder Bluff someday.\030A tauren skilled in the ways of the hunt knows that his prey is not for mere trophy. The beasts of the plains provide us with a means of survival. You will make quite an impression on the elders if you can bring back some highly valued Mountain Cougar Pelts. You can find the beasts lurking in the hills to the south.$B$BOur children need clothing and our tents need mending.\030Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 10 Mountain Cougar Pelts.\030If you can provide pelts for the tribe I will pass word along to my father, Chief Hawkwind, of your generous deeds.\030The Hunt Continues\0312,1,84,2,257,1,2980\0302,86,146,2,265,1,2980\0302,148,258,2,257,4,2980\0302,260,317,2,257,1,2980\0302,322,375,2,259,1,2980\0303,1,79,2,386,1,2980\0301,1,57,4,272,1,2980\0301,59,150,4,272,3,2980\0304,1,115,3,256,4,2980\0312961,2,3,Mountain Cougar\0302980,2,6,Grull Hawkwind\0302961,2,6,Mountain Cougar\0302981,3,9,Chief Hawkwind\0312,220,1412,0,\0302,0,0,6,Camp Narache\0304,0,0,8,Thunder Bluff\031747,19,747,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030780,23,780,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4742,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[7500]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent work, $R. Should you find an