ainted Scar when this is done.$B\030Only the blood of Wildspawn satyr will suffice.\030The Prison's Bindings\0312,1,78,2,257,1,14463\0302,83,154,2,257,1,14463\0302,156,235,2,257,3,14463\0303,1,117,2,384,1,14463\0303,119,171,2,384,1,14463\0301,1,30,4,272,1,14463\0301,32,88,4,272,3,14463\0304,1,47,3,256,3,14463\03111859,2,1,Doomguard\03011451,2,2,Wildspawn Satyr\03011451,2,4,Wildspawn Satyr\03011451,3,8,Wildspawn Satyr\0312,0,0,4,Dire Maul\0302,0,0,4,Feralas\0302,0,0,4,Wildspawn Satyr\0302,0,0,5,Daio\0302,0,0,5,Tainted Scar\0317583,23,7583,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,18603,OBJECTIVE,15,15,",[7582]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I merely need to combine the blood of the Wildspawn with these crystals and the prison shall be ready for use.\030The Hederine demons that occupy the foothills of Mount Hyjal secrete powerful fel poisons, which if left to mature, harden into a dense anti-magic crystal. These crystals have come to be known as Tears of the Hederine.$B$BNot even the immense power of a Doomguard could break the walls of a prison constructed from this material.$B$BTravel to Darkwhisper Gorge in Winterspring and recover the Tears.\030Travel to Darkwhisper Gorge in Winterspring and recover 5 Tears of the Hederine from the Hederine demons that occupy the gorge. Return to Daio in the Tainted Scar when you have completed this task.\030The Hederine will not give up their precious gems without a fight, $N.\030The Prison's Casing\0312,1,155,2,257,4,14463\0302,157,218,2,257,1,14463\0302,223,329,2,257,4,14463\0302,334,399,2,257,1,14463\0303,1,127,2,384,1,14463\0303,129,197,2,384,1,14463\0301,1,110,4,274,3,14463\0304,1,70,3,260,3,14463\03111859,2,3,Doomguard\03014528,3,8,Precious\0312,0,0,4,Darkwhisper Gorge\0302,0,0,4,Winterspring\0302,0,0,5,Darkwhisper Gorge\0302,0,0,5,Winterspring\0302,0,0,5,Hederine\0302,0,0,6,Daio\0302,0,0,6,Tainted Scar\0317583,23,7583,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,18604,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[7583]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You have done as I have asked. You are ready to be given the knowledge to conjure and control the beast.\030The prison is ready. Now for the most difficult portion of this task.$B$BYou must find and capture a Doomguard Commander within the Tainted Scar using this crystal prison.$B$BBe warned! A Doomguard is a cunning and lethal adversary and will seek to destroy you as you begin the ritual of imprisonment. It will flail wildly in its attempts to escape imprisonment.$B$BIt will focus on nothing but you, $N. Because of this, I must recommend that you take companions capable of keeping you alive!\030Venture forth into the Tainted Scar and locate a Doomguard Commander.$B$BUse the Glowing Crystal Prison on the Doomguard Commander. Be prepared for a ferocious onslaught of attacks, as the demon attempts to escape capture.$B$BShould you succeed, return the Imprisoned Doomguard to Daio in the Tainted Scar.\030Hrm? Well?\030Suppression\0312,1,20,2,257,1,14463\0302,22,69,2,257,1,14463\0302,74,171,2,257,1,14463\0302,176,185,2,257,1,14463\0302,187,301,2,263,3,14463\0302,303,362,2,261,3,14463\0302,367,403,2,257,3,14463\0302,405,492,2,259,1,14463\0303,1,69,2,384,1,14463\0303,74,131,2,384,1,14463\0303,133,222,2,388,1,14463\0303,227,306,2,388,1,14463\0301,1,30,4,272,1,14463\0301,32,104,4,272,1,14463\0304,1,4,3,256,2,14463\0304,6,10,3,256,2,14463\03112396,2,3,Doomguard Commander\03011859,2,5,Doomguard\03012396,2,9,Doomguard Commander\03012396,2,10,Doomguard Commander\03011859,2,12,Doomguard\03010430,4,14,The Beast\0312,0,0,3,Tainted Scar\0302,0,0,12,Daio\0302,0,0,12,Tainted Scar\0317581,21,7581,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307582,21,7582,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,18605,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[759]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Very good, $N. I can feel the sacrifice of the land in this offering, and my spirit swells with sadness, and pride.\030There is but one water well left to cleanse, named after the Wildmane clan.  For this well to be pure, the land must offer the teeth of a fierce predator, the prairie wolf alpha.  Find the alphas to the north, then return to me when your hunt is finished.$B$BAlphas often wander around the base of our mighty city, Thunder Bluff.\030Bring 8 Prairie Alpha Teeth to Mull Thunderhorn in Bloodhoof Village.\030$N. Do you have the teeth I asked for?\030Wildmane Totem\0312,1,75,2,257,1,2948\0302,78,178,2,257,1,2948\0302,181,255,2,257,1,2948\0302,260,329,2,257,1,2948\0303,1,69,2,384,1,2948\0301,1,14,4,272,1,2948\0301,16,115,4,272,1,2948\0304,5,38,3,256,2,2948\0312960,2,2,Prairie Wolf Alpha\0302948,2,5,Mull Thunderhorn\0312,215,1412,0,\0302,0,0,5,Mull Thunderhorn\0302,0,0,5,Bloodhoof Village\031758,19,758,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030760,23,760,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4803,OBJECTIVE,8,15,",[76]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030requestItems\030title\031Kobolds at the Jasperlode Mine, you say? Curses! The situation is worsening by the minute!$B$BThank you for the report, $N. But I wish that the news you brought was good news.\030Thanks to you we know the Fargodeep Mine is infested with kobolds.  Now we need a scout to investigate the more distant Jasperlode Mine.$B$BExplore Jasperlode and confirm any kobold presence.  To reach the mine, travel east along the road until you reach the Tower of Azora.  From the tower, head north and you'll find the mine in the foothills.\030Explore the Jasperlode Mine, then report back to Marshal Dughan in Goldshire.\030Scout through the Jasperlode Mine\030Hail, $N. What do you have to report? Have you scouted the Jasperlode Mine?\030The Jasperlode Mine\0312,1,66,2,257,1,240\0302,69,136,2,259,1,240\0302,141,191,2,257,1,240\0302,194,274,2,2