030title\031Oh boy, here we go again.\030If I am to teach you the secrets of summoning an infernal servant, you must destroy Kroshius and bring me the infernal core from his burning remains. This, however, is not as easy as it sounds. Kroshius has all but burned out completely. You must reignite his corpse and raise him from the rubble. To do this, however, you must gather some components from other demonic entities.$B$BMy imp, Impsy, shall set you on your way.\030Speak with Impsy in Felwood.\030\030What Niby Commands\0312,1,149,2,261,4,14469\0302,151,193,2,257,1,14469\0302,195,237,2,257,1,14469\0302,239,297,2,257,1,14469\0302,299,379,2,257,1,14469\0302,384,424,2,257,3,14469\0303,1,28,2,384,1,14469\0301,1,25,4,272,1,14470\0318616,2,1,Infernal Servant\03014467,2,1,Kroshius\03089,2,1,Infernal\03014467,2,3,Kroshius\03014470,2,6,Impsy\03014470,2,7,Impsy\0312,0,0,7,Felwood\0317602,23,7602,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[7602]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Give me a minute and I'll combine the essences into Fel fire.\030If you're going to reanimate Kroshius, you're going to need Fel fire. I can make Fel fire but it's going to require some components.$B$BYou need to bring me flawless Fel essences from three distinct regions of the world.$B$BThe Legashi Satyrs of Azshara will have the first essence type; the Jaedenar legionnaires of Jaedenar the second type and the felguard sentries of the Blasted Lands the third.$B$BBring me back one of each essence type and I will create the Fel fire, allowing you to reanimate Kroshius.\030Impsy in Felwood has asked that you bring him three Flawless Fel Essences originating from three distinct locations.$B$BThe Legashi Satyrs of Azshara hold the Flawless Fel Essence of their region. The Jaedenar Legionnaires of Jaedenar hold the Flawless Fel Essence of their region. The Felguard Sentries of the Blasted Lands hold the Flawless Fel Essence of their region.$B$BRecover the Flawless Fel Essences and return  to Impsy in Felwood.\030Don't tell anyone this but Niby is daft.\030Flawless Fel Essence\0312,1,69,2,259,4,14470\0302,71,132,2,257,3,14470\0302,137,220,2,259,1,14470\0302,225,399,2,257,3,14470\0302,404,509,2,257,3,14470\0303,1,116,2,384,1,14470\0303,121,196,2,384,1,14470\0303,198,281,2,384,1,14470\0303,283,371,2,384,1,14470\0303,376,441,2,384,1,14470\0301,1,61,4,272,1,14470\0304,1,40,3,256,1,14470\03114467,2,1,Kroshius\0300,2,4,Felguard\03014467,2,5,Kroshius\03014470,2,6,Impsy\0300,2,9,Felguard\03014470,2,10,Impsy\0312,0,0,6,Felwood\0302,0,0,10,Impsy\0302,0,0,10,Felwood\0317601,19,7601,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307603,23,7603,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,18624,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,18622,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,18623,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[7603]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031A deal is a deal! Quickly, take this and write this down. I don't have time! My greatest conjuration is upon us!\030Kroshius lays in a heap to the northeast, in the Shatter Scar Vale. Take this Fel fire and use it on his remains. The fire should reanimate the fallen infernal.$B$BAt this point, I fully expect him to kill you and your minion.$B$BIf by some miracle you happen to kill Kroshius, take his infernal core and return it to Niby.\030Search Shatter Scar Vale in Felwood for the remains of Kroshius. When you locate the remains, use the Fel Fire near them and await Kroshius' return. When the infernal has awoken, slay him and take from his corpse Kroshius' Infernal Core.$B$BReturn Kroshius' Infernal Core to Niby the Almighty in Felwood.\030Did you get lost?\030Kroshius' Infernal Core\0312,1,67,2,257,1,14470\0302,69,113,2,257,1,14470\0302,115,160,2,257,1,14470\0302,165,226,2,257,1,14470\0302,231,323,2,257,4,14470\0303,1,64,2,384,1,14470\0303,66,148,2,384,1,14470\0303,150,237,2,384,1,14470\0303,242,304,2,384,1,14470\0301,1,17,4,272,1,1446