031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031A pleasure doin' business with ya.$B$BAnd $N, wipe that look of disgust off yer face.\030\030\030For the shoulder plans, I'll be needin' 20 thorium bars.\030Imperial Plate Shoulders\0311,1,34,4,272,1,14567\0301,39,85,4,272,1,14567\0304,1,56,3,256,1,14567\031\031\0317652,19,7652,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,12359,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[766]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, thank you, $N. Using the items you brought me, I will be able to create the remedy I need to stop the spread of the infection and, eventually, cure it completely. I owe you my life in thanks.$B$BBut I'll never forget that screeching call when Mazzranache came upon me, the blaze of color as its beak descended...$B$BBe wary on your travels.\030My grandfather told me stories about his battles with a strider named Mazzranache. He told me of its demonic red eyes, razor-sharp talons and venomous bite.$B$BAs fortune would have it, while traveling across the plains, I encountered it, and it took a nasty bite from my shoulder. He was as terrible as my grandfather described. I will need some hard-to-find animal parts to clean the infection from his bite: a wolf heart, cougar femur, plainstrider scale and swoop gizzard.$B$BHurry, time is of the essence.\030Bring a Prairie Wolf Heart, Flatland Cougar Femur, Plainstrider Scale and Swoop Gizzard to Maur Raincaller at Bloodhoof Village.\030My fever grows worse and I find my mind drifting into delirious nightmares... I should have known that I wouldn't be able to handle a beast my grandfather was unable to defeat...$B$BDo you have the ingredients for the remedy? I fear if I do not clean the infection soon, it will be the death of me.\030Mazzranache\0312,1,82,2,257,1,3055\0302,84,156,2,257,1,3055\0302,1