12330,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[7662]="UNRESOLVED\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030If you bring me your aging kodo, I will trade it in for one from the new herd.   The new kodo will be just as fast as your old one, but have a different look to it.   You can look at the great kodos we already have around the yard here to see what you will have to choose from.\030New Kodo - Teal\0314,1,78,3,256,4,3685\0304,82,164,3,256,3,3685\0304,168,277,3,256,3,3685\031\0312,1638,1456,0,\031\031ITEM,15293,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[7663]="UNRESOLVED\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030If you bring me your aging kodo, I will trade it in for one from the new herd.   The new kodo will be just as fast as your old one, but have a different look to it.   You can look at the great kodos we already have around the yard here to see what you will have to choose from.\030New Kodo - Green\0314,1,78,3,256,4,3685\0304,82,164,3,256,3,3685\0304,168,277,3,256,3,3685\031\0312,1638,1456,0,\031\031ITEM,15292,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[7664]="UNRESOLVED\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030You bring me your old raptor, I give you new one with freshly sharpened claws!  The new raptor will be just as fast as your old one, but with a new look to him.   You can look at the swift raptors here to see what you will have to choose from.\030Ivory Raptor Replacement\0314,1,78,3,256,1,7952\0304,81,160,3,256,3,7952\0304,164,243,3,256,3,7952\031107,3,1,Raptor\030107,3,2,Raptor\0312,14,1411,0,\031\031ITEM,13317,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[7665]="UNRESOLVED\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030You bring me your old raptor, I give you new one with freshly sharpened claws!  The new raptor will be just as fast as your old one, but with a new look to him.   You can look at the swift raptors here to see what you will have to choose from.\030Red Raptor Replacement\0314,1,78,3,256,1,7952\0304,81,160,3,256,3,7952\0304,164,243,3,256,3,7952\031107,3,1,Raptor\030107,3,2,Raptor\0312,14,1411,0,\031\031ITEM,8586,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[7666]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Are you headed back into the Scholomance, $n? You've already paid such a great price for the use of the Divination Scryer - perhaps you'd like to take another one with you. With it, you'd be able to face the perils of the Great Ossuary once more.$B$BBy all means, have it. You've certainly earned it.\030\030\030\030Again Into the Great Ossuary\0311,1,45,4,272,2,928\0301,47,172,4,272,4,928\0301,174,246,4,272,1,928\0301,251,272,4,272,1,928\0301,274,300,4,272,1,928\03110664,4,2,Scryer\031\0317647,19,7647,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[7667]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your generosity is unrivaled, $N. I thank you for your kindness.$B$BI will be able to finish my divination scryer now, and I should be able to fashion more without further need of diamonds... perhaps you would be interested in helping me in its use? It is for a most important task, I assure you... one that left unchecked could spell unmitigated disaster for the spirit realm!\030$N, there is a pressing matter I hope you can help with... both materially and spiritually.  Allow me to explain.$B$BWithin the depths of the Scholomance in Lordaeron is a chamber called the Great Ossuary.  I need to complete a device that would pierce the shadows of this horrid room.  To finish what I have started, I need two diamonds: an Azerothian and a Pristine Black.  These are not trivial items, I know - I just don't have the resources myself.$B$BCould you provide me with one of each?\030If you are interested in helping Sagorne Crestrider in Orgrimmar's Valley of Wisdom, bring him an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond.\030I feel awkward asking for material assistance, but my divination scryer - the device I hope to finish - requires one of each. If you cannot help me, I'd certainly understand.\030Material Assistance\0312,1,58,2,259,3,13417\0302,60,91,2,257,1,13417\0302,94,113,2,257,1,13417\0302,118,205,2,257,1,13417\0302,208,285,2,259,4,13417\0302,288,374,2,259,1,13417\0302,377,453,2,257,1,13417\0302,458,495,2,257,4,13417\0303,1,146,2,384,4,13417\0301,1,33,4,272,1,13417\0301,35,64,4,272,1,13417\0301,69,191,4,274,3,13417\0301,193,249,4,272,4,13417\0301,251,298,4,272,1,13417\0301,300,377,4,272,4,13417\0304,1,125,3,258,3,13417\0304,127,174,3,256,4,13417\03110664,4,12,Scryer\03010664,3,16,Scryer\0312,0,0,4,Lordaeron\0302,0,0,9,Orgrimmar's Valley of Wisdom\0318258,23,8258,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,12800,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,18335,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[767]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I sensed you would be coming to me, $c. I can always recognize one who is trying to pass the Rites of the Earthmother.\030The Rite of Vision, one of the Rites of the Earthmother, will help guide you toward earning the respect of the elders of Thunder Bluff.$B$BOur people have learned that the land is our most holy provider. In order to take part in the ritualistic vision, you must speak with the spiritual leader of the village, Zarlman Two-Moons.\030Speak with Zarlman Two-Moons in Bloodhoof Village.\030\030Rite of Vision\0312,1,135,2,257,3,2993\0302,140,203,2,257,1,2993\0302,205,328,2,259,1,299