31characters,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031As you place the Runestones into the matching recesses, a violent rumbling shakes the earth as the Seal is broken.\030\030\030The Seal of the Earth lies here, with three recessed alcoves for the Amethyst Runestone, the Opal Runestone, and the Diamond Runestone.\030Seal of the Earth\0311,1,114,4,272,1,0\0304,1,135,3,256,1,0\031\0312,3,1418,0,\031717,20,717,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,2933,GIVER,?,9,Seal of the Earth\030OBJECT,2933,FINISHER,?,12,Seal of the Earth\030ITEM,4845,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,4844,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,4843,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[7791]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, $N!\030\030\030We are currently accepting donations for wool cloth. A donation of sixty pieces of wool cloth will net you full recognition by Stormwind for your generous actions. Our stores are such on wool that we would only need sixty pieces from you total; we should be able to acquire enough from others in the realm to support our drive.$B$BIf you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.\030A Donation of Wool\0311,1,10,4,272,1,14722\0301,12,55,4,272,1,14722\0304,1,52,3,256,1,14722\0304,54,163,3,256,3,14722\0304,165,327,3,258,4,14722\0304,332,446,3,256,4,14722\031\0312,1519,1453,0,\031\031ITEM,2592,OBJECTIVE,60,15,",[7792]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, $N!\030\030\030We are currently gathering wool. A donation of sixty pieces of wool cloth will net you full recognition by our people for your generous actions.$B$BIf you currently have sixty pieces, you may donate them now.\030A Donation of Wool\0311,1,10,4,272,1,14725\0301,12,55,4,272,1,14725\0304,1,32,3,256,1,14725\0304,34,144,3,256,3,14725\0304,149,208,3,256,4,14725\031\0312,1657,1457,0,\031\031ITEM,2592,OBJECTIVE,60,15,",[7793]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, $N!\030\030\030As with most other fabrics, our stocks of silk are at an all-time low. Our stores are such that we'd only need sixty pieces of silk from you total; we should be able to reach our goal with the support of others.$B$BA benevolent gift such as silk, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community! If you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.\030A Donation of Silk\0311,1,10,4,272,1,14722\0301,12,55,4,272,1,14722\0304,1,70,3,256,1,14722\0304,72,211,3,258,1,14722\0304,216,322,3,256,4,14722\0304,324,438,3,256,4,14722\031\0312,1519,1453,0,\031\031ITEM,4306,OBJECTIVE,60,15,",[7794]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, $N!\030\030\030Mageweave is running low, and we could use your help to replenish our stocks! By counting on the community as a whole, we would only need a donation of 60 pieces of mageweave cloth from you to enable us to reach our goal. Such generosity would not go unnoticed by Stormwind, I assure you!$B$BIf you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.\030A Donation of Mageweave\0311,1,10,4,272,1,14722\0301,12,55,4,272,1,14722\0304,1,77,3,256,4,14722\0304,79,221,3,258,4,14722\0304,223,288,3,256,4,14722\0304,293,412,3,256,4