e recognized for your continuing efforts on behalf of Stormwind.$B$BWhenever you are ready to hand in the stack of runecloth, I'll accept it.\030Additional Runecloth\0311,1,80,4,276,1,14722\0301,82,118,4,272,1,14722\0304,1,25,3,256,1,14722\0304,27,142,3,258,4,14722\0304,144,280,3,256,3,14722\0304,285,357,3,256,1,14722\031\0312,1519,1453,0,\0317795,19,7795,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,14047,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[7798]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, $N!\030\030\030We are currently gathering silk. A donation of sixty pieces of silk cloth will net you full recognition by our people for your generous actions$B$BIf you currently have sixty pieces, you may donate them now.\030A Donation of Silk\0311,1,10,4,272,1,14725\0301,12,55,4,272,1,14725\0304,1,32,3,256,1,14725\0304,34,143,3,256,3,14725\0304,148,207,3,256,4,14725\031\0312,1657,1457,0,\031\031ITEM,4306,OBJECTIVE,60,15,",[7799]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, $N!\030\030\030Mageweave is running low, and we could use your help to replenish our stocks! By counting on the community as a whole, we would only need a donation of 60 pieces of mageweave cloth from you to enable us to reach our goal. Such generosity would not go unnoticed Darnassus, I assure you!$B$BIf you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.\030A Donation of Mageweave\0311,1,10,4,272,1,14725\0301,12,55,4,272,1,14725\0304,1,77,3,256,4,14725\0304,79,221,3,258,4,14725\0304,223,285,3,256,4,14725\0304,290,409,3,256,4,14725\031\0312,1657,1457,0,\031\031ITEM,4338,OBJECTIVE,60,15,",[78]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031By the Light! You bet I recognize that handwriting.\030I know of someone who might be able to assist you.  Back when I was leading the Stormwind Guard, we used to get drinks at the Scarlet Raven Tavern in Darkshire.  The Innkeeper there, Smitts, was quite an expert on the local lore.  Show him this page and see what he has to say about it.\030Take the Faded Journal Page to Tavernkeep Smitts.\030Marshal Haggard sent you? Why didn't you say so?$B$BAh, good ol' Haggard. Poor chap is going to be completely blind before long. Anyway, let me see what you've got there.\030The Legend of Stalvan\0312,1,50,2,257,4,294\0302,53,160,2,257,1,294\0302,163,229,2,257,1,294\0302,232,286,2,257,1,294\0303,1,49,2,384,1,294\0301,1,13,4,272,1,273\0301,15,51,4,272,1,273\0304,1,25,3,256,2,273\0304,27,48,3,256,2,273\0304,53,73,3,256,1,273\0304,75,128,3,256,3,273\0304,130,170,3,256,1,273\0311423,2,2,Stormwind Guard\0307605,2,2,Raven\030273,2,5,Tavernkeep Smitts\030294,3,8,Marshal Haggard\0312,10,1431,0,\0302,0,0,2,Scarlet Raven Tavern\0302,0,0,2,Darkshire\0302,0,0,5,Tavernkeep Smitts\03175,19,75,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\03079,23,79,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[780]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Most excellent. These ingredients will make a fine stew and the loss of those boars should be a fair lesson to those vile Bristlebacks.\030The Battleboars of Brambleblade Ravine to the east are encroaching on our tribal hunting grounds. They are trained to be malicious by the Bristleback Quilboars with whom we are at war.$B$BGo and slay the vile creatures and bring back some snouts and flanks so that we can make stew for our young.\030Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to kill Battleboars and bring back 8 Battleboar Snouts and 8 Battleboar Flanks.\030The aggression of the Battleboars is increasing. Have you sent them a clear message and brought back some snouts and flanks yet?\030The Battleboars\0312,1,97,2,257,1,2980\0302,99,184,2,261,1,2980\0302,189,296,2,259,1,2980\0303,1,120,2,386,1,2980\0301,1,15,4,272,1,2980\0301,17,135,4,272,3,2980\0304,1,48,3,256,1,2980\0304,50,128,3,256,2,2980\0312980,2,4,Grull Hawkwind\0302966,2,4,Battleboar\0312,220,1412,0,\0302,0,0,4,Camp Narache\031750,19,750,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4848,OBJECTIVE,8,15,\030ITEM,4849,OBJECTIVE,8,15,",[7800]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Fantastic - these will go right to use, I assure you. Thank you again for your assistance! We'd certainly be lost without you.$B$BWith all the donations you've made, I would certainly process any additional runecloth donations you care to make in the future. Just be sure to check in with me, and I'll personally make sure that your good deeds won't go unrecognized!\030\030\030$n, you've been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive. As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth. We are in absolutely dire need of runecloth, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past.$B$BIf you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare. We'll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we'll go from there.\030A Donation of Runecloth\0311,1,53,4,272,3,14725\0301,55,90,4,272,1,14725\0301,92,126,4,276,1,14725\0301,131,258,4,272,4,14725\0301,260,366,4,272,1,14725\0304,1,60,3,256,1,14725\0304,62,157,3,256,1,14725\0304,159,272,3,258,3,14725\0304,277,341,3,256,4,14725\0304,343,422,3,256,1,14725\031\0312,1657,1457,0,\0317792,21,7792,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307798,21,7798,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307799,21,7799,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307801,23,7801,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,14047,OBJECTIVE,60,15,",[7801]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030d