ent at Gurubashi will know!\030Speak with Short John Mithril in the Stranglethorn Arena.\030\030Arena Master\0312,1,60,2,257,1,0\0302,64,124,2,257,4,0\0303,1,57,2,384,1,0\0301,1,14,4,272,1,14508\0301,16,80,4,272,1,14508\0301,82,124,4,272,1,14508\03115047,2,2,Gurubashi\03014508,2,3,Short John Mithril\030806,2,3,John\0312,33,1434,0,\0302,0,0,2,Gurubashi\0302,0,0,3,Stranglethorn Arena\0317838,23,7838,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,18706,STARTER,?,10,",[7811]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Fantastic - these will go right to use, I assure you. Thank you again for your assistance! We'd certainly be lost without you.$B$BWith all the donations you've made, I would certainly process any additional runecloth donations you care to make in the future. Just be sure to check in with me, and I'll personally make sure that your good deeds won't go unrecognized!\030\030\030$n, you've been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive. As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth. We are in absolutely dire need of runecloth, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past.$B$BIf you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare. We'll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we'll go from there.\030A Donation of Runecloth\0311,1,53,4,272,3,14724\0301,55,90,4,272,1,14724\0301,92,126,4,276,1,14724\0301,131,258,4,272,4,14724\0301,260,366,4,272,1,14724\0304,1,60,3,256,1,14724\0304,62,157,3,256,1,14724\0304,159,272,3,258,3,14724\0304,277,341,3,256,4,14724\0304,343,422,3,256,1,14724\031\0312,1537,1455,0,\0317807,21,7807,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307808,21,7808,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307809,21,7809,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307812,23,7812,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,14047,OBJECTIVE,60,15,",[7812]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031$N - without heroes like you working on behalf of the gnomes, we'd surely suffer. Thank you for your continued efforts!\030\030\030Greetings once again, $N! Our need for runecloth is constant, and we can always use additional resources if you are willing to part with them. For an additional stack of twenty runecloth, I will make sure that you are recognized for your continuing efforts on behalf of the Gnomeregan Exiles.$B$BWhenever you are ready to hand in the stack of runecloth, I'll accept it.\030Additional Runecloth\0311,1,81,4,276,1,14724\0301,83,119,4,272,1,14724\0304,1,25,3,256,1,14724\0304,27,142,3,258,4,14724\0304,144,292,3,256,3,14724\0304,297,369,3,256,1,14724\031\0312,1537,1455,0,\0317811,19,7811,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,14047,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[78124]="UNRESOLVED\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Nar'thalas Almanac\031\031\031\031\031",[78127]="UNRESOLVED\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030The Dalaran Digest\031\031\031\031\031",[7813]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, $N!\030\030\030We are currently accepting donations for wool cloth. A donation of sixty pieces of wool cloth will net you full recognition by the Undercity for your generous actions. Our stores are such on wool that we would only need sixty pieces from you total; we should be able to acquire enough from others in the realm to support our drive.$B$BIf you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.\030A Donation of Wool\0311,1,10,4,272,1,14729\0301,12,55,4,272,1,14729\0304,1,52,3,256,1,14729\0304,54,167,3,256,3,14729\0304,169,331,3,258,4,14729\0304,336,450,3,256,4,14729\031\0312,1497,1458,0,\031\031ITEM,2592,OBJECTIVE,60,15,",[7814]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, $N!\030\030\030As with most other fabrics, our stocks of silk are at an all-time low. Our stores are such that we'd only need sixty pieces of silk from you total; we should be able to reach our goal with the support of others.$B$BA benevolent gift such as silk, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community! If you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.\030A Donation of Silk\0311,1,10,4,272,1,14729\0301,12,55,4,272,1,14729\0304,1,70,3,256,1,14729\0304,72,211,3,258,1,14729\0304,216,322,3,256,4,14729\0304,324,438,3,256,4,14729\031\0312,1497,1458,0,\031\031ITEM,4306,OBJECTIVE,60,15,",[78142]="UNRESOLVED\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Bewitchments and Glamours\031\031\031\031\031",[78143]="UNRESOLVED\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Secrets of the Dreamers\031\031\031\031\031",[78145]="UNRESOLVED\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030r