or Ravine far to the east. We must silence our depraved allies of old to restore honor to the Horde!$B$BWe hired Tho'grun and his band of ogre mercenaries to help us obtain the Sign of the Earth, a key needed to unlock the drakes' prison. Tho'grun betrayed us though, overwhelming us and taking it for himself. Go to Camp Boff and take it back!\030Kill Boss Tho'grun and bring the Sign of the Earth to Gorn in Kargath.\030Tho'grun's betrayal... is there any wonder why the ogres are part of the Horde no longer? I will be glad to see him dead, and the Sign of the Earth returned.$B$BIf you've not dispatched him yet, then waste no time going to Camp Boff.  It is to the southeast of Kargath.\030Broken Alliances\0312,1,189,2,325,1,1068\0302,191,263,2,259,1,1068\0302,268,401,2,257,1,1068\0302,403,473,2,257,1,1068\0302,475,507,2,257,1,1068\0303,1,70,2,384,1,1068\0301,1,125,4,272,3,1068\0301,127,185,4,272,3,1068\0301,190,289,4,272,1,1068\0301,292,358,4,276,3,1068\0304,1,22,3,256,1,1068\0304,24,89,3,256,2,1068\0304,91,157,3,256,3,1068\0304,162,233,3,256,4,1068\0304,236,269,3,256,1,1068\0312757,2,1,Blacklash\0302759,2,1,Hematus\030211,2,3,Ogre\0302944,2,6,Boss Tho'grun\0301068,2,6,Gorn\0312,3,1418,0,\0302,0,0,1,Lethlor Ravine\0302,0,0,2,Horde\0302,0,0,5,Camp Boff\0302,0,0,6,Gorn\0302,0,0,6,Kargath\0304,0,0,9,Lethlor\0303,0,0,14,Camp Boff\031793,23,793,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4640,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[7820]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, $N!\030\030\030We are currently accepting donations for wool cloth.  A donation of sixty pieces of wool cloth will net you full recognition by Thunder Bluff for your generous actions.  Our stores are such on wool that we would only need sixty pieces from you total; we should be able to acquire enough from others in the realm to support our drive.$B$BIf you have the six