 and I'll personally make sure that your good deeds won't go unrecognized!\030\030\030$n, you've been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive. As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth. We are in absolutely dire need of runecloth, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past.$B$BIf you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare. We'll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we'll go from there.\030A Donation of Runecloth\0311,1,53,4,272,3,14726\0301,55,90,4,272,1,14726\0301,92,126,4,276,1,14726\0301,131,258,4,272,4,14726\0301,260,366,4,272,1,14726\0304,1,60,3,256,1,14726\0304,62,157,3,256,1,14726\0304,159,272,3,258,3,14726\0304,277,341,3,256,4,14726\0304,343,422,3,256,1,14726\031\0312,1637,1454,0,\0317826,21,7826,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307827,21,7827,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307831,21,7831,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307832,23,7832,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,14047,OBJECTIVE,60,15,",[7825]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031$N - without heroes like you working on behalf of Thunder Bluff, we'd surely suffer. Thank you for your continued efforts!\030\030\030Greetings once again, $N! Our need for runecloth is constant, and we can always use additional resources if you are willing to part with them. For an additional stack of twenty runecloth, I will make sure that you are recognized for your continuing efforts on behalf of Thunder Bluff.$B$BWhenever you are ready to hand in the stack of runecloth, I'll accept it.\030Additional Runecloth\0311,1,84,4,276,1,14728\0301,86,122,4,272,1,14728\0304,1,25,3,256,1,14728\0304,27,142,3,258,4,14728\0304,144,284,3,256,3,14728\0304,289,361,3,256,1,14728\031\0312,1638,1456,0,\0317823,19,7823,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,14047,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[7826]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, $N!\030\030\030If you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.\030A Donation of Wool\0311,1,10,4,272,1,14726\0301,12,55,4,272,1,14726\0304,1,115,3,256,4,14726\031\0312,1637,1454,0,\031\031ITEM,2592,OBJECTIVE,60,15,",[78261]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030objectiveLabel3\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Find The Horn of Xelthos inside of Shadowfang Keep. Then, return it to C's dead drop near Pyrewood Village. You must complete the job alone.\030\030\030Find Veenix (Optional)\030\030The Horn of Xelthos\0313,1,51,2,384,1,0\0303,53,107,2,384,1,0\0303,109,140,2,384,1,0\0306,1,22,3,384,1,0\0314086,3,4,Veenix\0312,0,0,2,C's\0302,0,0,2,Pyrewood Village\031\031",[7827]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wonderful! We thank you for your generous donation, $N!\030\030\030As with most other fabrics, our stocks of silk are at an all-time low.  Our stores are such that we'd only need sixty pieces of silk from you total; we should be able to reach our goal with the support of others.$B$BA benevolent gift such as silk, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community!  If you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.\030A Donation of Silk\0311,1,10,4,272,1,14726\0301,12,55,4,272,1,14726\0304,1,70,3,256,1,14726\0304,73,212,3,258,1,14726\0304,217,323,3,256,4,14726\0304,326,440,3,256,4,14726\031\0312,1637,1454,0,\031\031ITEM,4306,OBJECTIVE,60,15,",[7828]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031A job well done, $R. The Revantusk thank you for your contribution.\030Many brave trolls have been lost to the harsh wilds of the Hinterlands, $r. The Silvermane wolves are one of the biggest threats to our hunters. They lay in wait, hiding amongst the bushes and landscape, then strike out when the opportunity presents itself.$B$BThis type of ferocity will not go unchecked!$B$BYou must think like the Silvermane. Stalk the stalkers! Slay them all!\030Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 10 Silvermane Stalkers and 10 Silvermane Howlers. Return to him once the task is complete.$B$BMarkhor mentioned that the wolves hide in the wilds of the Hinterlands.\030Show them the might of Revantusk!\030Stalking the Stalkers\0312,1,75,2,261,1,14741\0302,77,144,2,257,1,14741\0302,146,257,2,257,1,14741\0302,262,305,2,257,3,14741\0302,310,344,2,257,1,14741\0302,346,364,2,257,1,14741\0302,366,379,2,257,1,14741\0303,1,124,2,386,1,14741\0303,126,165,2,384,1,14741\0303,170,240,2,384,1,14741\0301,1,20,4,272,1,14741\0301,22,67,4,272,1,14741\0304,1,33,3,256,4,14741\03114741,2,8,Huntsman Markhor\0312,47,1425,0,\0302,0,0,8,Revantusk Village\0302,0,0,8,Hinterlands\031\031NPC,2926,OBJECTIVE,10,13,Silvermane Stalker\030NPC,2925,OBJECTIVE,10,13,Silvermane Howler",[7829]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You have proven a worthy ally to the Revantusk, $N. Well done.\030Among the more ornery of the wildlife of the Hinterlands are the savage owlbeasts. Many a good Revantusk warrior has been lost to the ferocious claws and beak of the beasts.$B$BKill every savage owlbeast you see, $r. Return to me when you can stand no more bloodshed. Your contribution will then be weighed, measured, and judged.\030Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 20 Savage Owlbeasts. Return to him once the task is complete.$B$BMarkhor mentioned that the Savage Owlbeasts occupy the wilds of the Hinterlands.\030Clear your head of impure thoughts, $r. Become one with the wilds!\030Hunt the Savages\0312,1,82,2,257,1,14741\0302,84,173,2,261,1,14741\0302,178,216,2,257,1,14741\0302,218,267,2,257,1,14741\0302,269,329,2,257,3,14741\0303,1,95,2,386,1,14741\0303,97,136,2,384,1,14741\0303,141,220,2,384,1,14741\0301,1,51,4,272,1,14741\0301,53,62,4,272,1,14741\0304,1,39,3,256,1,14741\0304,41,66,3,256,1,14741\0312929,2,3,Savage Owlbeast\03014741,2,6,Huntsman Markhor\0312,47,1425,0,\0302,0,0,6,Revantusk Village\0302,0,0,6,Hinterlands\0304,0,0,9,Revantusk\031\031NPC,2929,OBJECTIVE,20,13,Savage Owlbeast",[783]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, good.  Another volunteer.  We're getting a lot of you these days.$B$BI hope it's enough.$B$BThe human lands are threatened from without, and so many of our forces have been marshaled abroad.  This, in turn, leaves room for corrupt and lawless groups to thrive within our borders.$B$BIt is a many-fronted battle we wage, $N.  Gird yourself for a long campaign.\030I hope you strapped your belt on tight, young $c, because there is work to do here in Northshire.$B$BAnd I don't mean farming.$B$BThe Stormwind guards are hard pressed to keep the peace here, with so many of us in distant lands and so many threats pressing close.  And so we're enlisting the aid of anyone willing to defend their home.  And their alliance.$B$BIf you're here to answer the call, then speak with my superior, Marshal McBride.  He's inside the abbey behind me.\030Speak with Marshal McBride.\030\030A Threat Within\0312,1,97,2,259,3,823\0302,102,126,2,257,1,823\0302,131,263,2,265,1,823\0302,266,335,2,271,1,823\0302,338,356,2,257,1,823\0302,361,440,2,257,4,823\0302,443,474,2,257,1,823\0303,1,27,2,384,1,823\0301,1,9,4,272,1,197\0301,12,29,4,272,1,197\0301,32,69,4,272,1,197\0301,74,92,4