 Hexx\030NPC,2648,OBJECTIVE,20,13,Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guard",[7862]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You are indeed a worthy candidate for the new position, $N. Accept this trinket as a token of our appreciation for your hard work. I will be reviewing all applications next year.\030With the loss of Guard Captain Malkhor, the position of Guard Captain of Revantusk is once again open. If you are interested in becoming Captain of the Guard for Revantusk, complete the following tasks and submit your application to Primal Torntusk:$B$BExterminate Vilebranch Berserkers.$B$BExterminate Vilebranch Shadow Hunters.$B$BExterminate Vilebranch Blood Drinkers.$B$BExterminate Vilebranch Soul Eaters.\030You have been tasked with the decimation of 20 Vilebranch Berserkers, 20 Vilebranch Shadow Hunters, 20 Vilebranch Blood Drinkers, and 20 Vilebranch Soul Eaters.$B$BShould you complete this task, return to Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands.\030Are you here about the job opening?\030Job Opening: Guard Captain of Revantusk Village\0312,1,102,2,257,1,0\0302,104,249,2,257,4,0\0302,254,287,2,257,1,0\0302,292,329,2,257,1,0\0302,334,371,2,257,1,0\0302,376,410,2,257,1,0\0303,1,160,2,384,1,0\0303,165,261,2,384,1,0\0301,1,59,4,272,1,14736\0301,61,130,4,272,1,14736\0301,132,178,4,272,3,14736\0304,1,35,3,256,2,14736\03114736,2,2,Primal Torntusk\0304244,2,4,Shadow\0304244,2,7,Shadow\03014736,2,8,Primal Torntusk\0312,47,1425,0,\0302,0,0,2,Primal Torntusk\0302,0,0,8,Primal Torntusk\0302,0,0,8,Revantusk Village\0302,0,0,8,Hinterlands\031\031OBJECT,179913,GIVER,?,9,Call to Arms!\030NPC,2643,OBJECTIVE,20,13,Vilebranch Berserker\030NPC,2645,OBJECTIVE,20,13,Vilebranch Shadow Hunter\030NPC,2646,OBJECTIVE,20,13,Vilebranch Blood Drinker\030NPC,2647,OBJECTIVE,20,13,Vilebranch Soul Eater",[7863]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,se