for purchase. Rations become available when you are Friendly with us, and bandages when you are Honored.\030\030\030\030Sentinel Advanced Care Package\0311,1,51,4,272,1,14753\0301,53,95,4,272,1,14753\0301,97,181,4,272,1,14753\0301,187,309,4,272,3,14753\0301,311,400,4,272,1,14753\031\0312,331,1440,0,\0317863,22,7863,UNKNOWN\0307864,22,7864,UNKNOWN\031",[7866]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've certainly begun to prove yourself to us, $N. As a reward, please take this care package! Inside it you'll find rations and bandages that are usable only inside Warsong Gulch. $B$BAs you continue to prove yourself inside the Gulch, you'll find that these items will become available to you for purchase. Rations become available when you are Friendly with us, and bandages when you are Honored.\030\030\030\030Outrider Basic Care Package\0311,1,51,4,272,1,14754\0301,53,95,4,272,1,14754\0301,97,181,4,272,1,14754\0301,187,309,4,272,3,14754\0301,311,400,4,272,1,14754\031\0312,331,1440,0,\0317867,22,7867,UNKNOWN\0307868,22,7868,UNKNOWN\031",[7867]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've certainly begun to prove yourself to us, $N. As a reward, please take this care package! Inside it you'll find rations and bandages that are usable only inside Warsong Gulch. $B$BAs you continue to prove yourself inside the Gulch, you'll find that these items will become available to you for purchase. Rations become available when you are Friendly with us, and bandages when you are Honored.\030\030\030\030Outrider Standard Care Package\0311,1,51,4,272,1,14754\0301,53,95,4,272,1,14754\0301,97,181,4,272,1,14754\0301,187,309,4,272,3,14754\0301,311,400,4,272,1,14754\031\0312,331,1440,0,\0317866,22,7866,UNKNOWN\0307868,22,7868,UNKNOWN\031",[7868]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've certainly begun to prove yourself to us, $N. As a reward, please take this care package! Inside it you'll find rations and bandages that are usable only inside Warsong Gulch. $B$BAs you continue to prove yourself inside the Gulch, you'll find that these items will become available to you for purchase. Rations become available when you are Friendly with us, and bandages when you are Honored.\030\030\030\030Outrider Advanced Care Package\0311,1,51,4,272,1,14754\0301,53,95,4,272,1,14754\0301,97,181,4,272,1,14754\0301,187,309,4,272,3,14754\0301,311,400,4,272,1,14754\031\0312,331,1440,0,\0317866,22,7866,UNKNOWN\0307867,22,7867,UNKNOWN\031",[787]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Another one of Eitrigg's recruits, hm?$B$BA sorry state of affairs we find ourselves in if this is the best the Horde can produce.  No matter.  By the time we think you're ready to leave the Valley, you'll be a proud warrior of the Horde.\030Throm'ka, $c. I am Eitrigg, charged by Thrall to oversee the training of recruits.$B$BThe Horde has changed from what it once was. There was a time where I left the Horde, disillusioned by the growing influence of the power-hungry pawns of the Burning Legion. During my exile, I was taken prisoner by a group of humans, but was rescued by the Warchief. Hearing his vision of the Horde free of demonic influence, guided by the shamans, I returned.$B$BGornek will have further instructions for you.\030Report to Gornek in the Den.\030\030The New Horde\0312,1,13,2,257,1,3144\0302,15,82,2,257,1,3144\0302,87,130,2,321,1,3144\0302,132,259,2,321,1,3144\0302,261,352,2,257,1,3144\0302,354,446,2,257,1,3144\0302,451,496,2,257,3,3144\0303,1,28,2,384,1,3144\0301,1,38,4,272,2,3143\0301,43,130,4,272,4,3143\0301,133,142,4,272,1,3143\0301,145,238,4,272,1,3143\0313144,2,2,Eitrigg\0304949,2,2,Thrall\0303143,2,7,Gornek\0303143,2,8,Gornek\0312,363,1411,0,\0302,0,0,8,Gornek\0302,0,0,8,Den\031788,23,788,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030788,24,788,UNKNOWN\031",[7871]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,consequences,loreConnections,motivations\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030Beyond this tunnel you will find a field of strife and turmoil, young $c. The Horde continue to decimate our sacred forest, cutting down the evergreen foliage to power their machines of war.$B$BEnter Warsong Gulch and defend Silverwing Hold. Push back the invading Horde forces!$B$BDo this, and earn a talisman of merit.  Bring me such a talisman, $N, and I shall reward you.\030Enter Warsong Gulch and defeat the Horde, obtain a Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor, and return to Sentinel Farsong at the Silverwing Grove.\030\030Vanquish the Invaders!\0312,1,73,2,257,3,0\0302,75,190,2,261,1,0\0302,195,241,2,269,1,0\0302,243,278,2,261,1,0\0302,283,320,2,257,1,0\0302,323,375,2,257,3,0\0303,1,135,2,384,1,0\031795,2,7,Mark\03014733,2,7,Sentinel Farsong\0312,3277,1460,0,\0302,0,0,7,Sentinel Farsong\0302,0,0,7,Silverwing Grove\0317788,22,7788,UNKNOWN\0307872,22,7872,UNKNOWN\0307873,22,7873,UNKNOWN\0307886,22,7886,UNKNOWN\0307887,22,7887,UNKNOWN\0307888,22,7888,UNKNOWN\0307921,22,7921,UNKNOWN\0308290,22,8290,UNKNOWN\0308291,22,8291,UNKNOWN\0308292,22,8292,UNKNOWN\0307887,23,7887,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20558,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[7872]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,consequences,loreConnections,motivations\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030Beyond this tunnel you will find a field of strife and turmoil, young $c. The Horde continue to decimate our sacred forest, cutting down the evergreen foliage to power their machines of war.$B$BEnter Warsong Gulch and defend Silverwing Hold. Push back the invading Horde forces!$B$BDo this, and earn a talisman of merit.  Bring me such a talisman, $N, and I shall reward you.