e tickets, you'll want to speak to me about redeeming them for valuable prizes.  The more tickets you get, the more prizes you can win.  Huzzah!\030The Darkmoon Faire is coming!  Be sure to experience all the wonders and excitement of it when it comes to town!$B$BIf you act right now, you can redeem this voucher for free prize tickets!  Just hand your voucher to Gelvas Grimgate located inside the carnival.$B$BRight now, the Faire is just outside Thunder Bluff, in Mulgore.  Don't miss out!  Go today!\030Deliver the Free Ticket Voucher to Gelvas Grimgate, located inside the Darkmoon Faire carnival.\030Yes friend, may I help you?  Do you have a voucher that needs redeeming?\030The Darkmoon Faire\0312,1,29,2,257,1,14843\0302,32,112,2,257,1,14843\0302,117,189,2,257,4,14843\0302,192,261,2,257,1,14843\0302,266,328,2,257,1,14843\0302,331,345,2,257,1,14843\0302,348,356,2,257,1,14843\0303,1,95,2,384,1,14843\0301,1,30,4,272,1,14828\0301,33,87,4,272,1,14828\0301,92,194,4,274,1,14828\0301,197,250,4,272,1,14828\0301,253,259,4,272,1,14828\0304,1,27,3,256,2,14828\0304,30,72,3,258,2,14828\031\0312,1637,1454,0,\0302,0,0,4,Gelvas Grimgate\0302,0,0,5,Thunder Bluff\0302,0,0,5,Mulgore\0302,0,0,8,Gelvas Grimgate\0304,0,0,9,Darkmoon Faire\031\031",[7927]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031So you have put together a deck of Portals. Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten. Allow me to present you with one of the greater darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation.\030Now that you have gathered all of the Portal cards together into a deck, a ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight.   On this card is inscribed, \"Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded.\"   You have heard that this faire alternately stops at Mulgore and Goldshire every few months, so you will have to wait until they are here next.\030Return the Portals Deck to the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town.\030I see that you have managed to complete a deck of portals! Congratulations!\030Darkmoon Portals Deck\0312,1,148,2,257,1,0\0302,152,382,2,257,3,0\0303,1,68,2,384,1,0\0301,1,43,4,272,1,14847\0301,45,158,4,272,3,14847\0301,160,259,4,272,1,14847\0304,1,58,3,256,1,14847\0304,60,75,3,256,1,14847\031\0312,0,0,2,Darkmoon Faire\0302,0,0,2,Mulgore\0302,0,0,3,Darkmoon Faire\031\031ITEM,19277,STARTER,?,10,\030ITEM,19277,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[7928]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031So you have put together a deck of Warlords.   Your gesture of returning it to us will create a tie between you and the Darkmoon that will not soon be forgotten.   Allow me to present you with one of the greater darkmoon cards as a small token of our appreciation.\030Now that you have gathered all of the Warlord cards together into a deck, a ninth card mysteriously appears with the same backing as the first eight.   On this card is inscribed, \"Return these cards to the Darkmoon Faire and be rewarded.\"   You have heard that this faire alternately stops at Mulgore and Goldshire every few months, so you will have to wait until they are here next.\030Return the Warlords Deck to the Darkmoon Faire when it comes to town.\030I see that you have managed to complete a deck of warlords!   Congratulations!\030Darkmoon Warlords Deck\0312,1,149,2,257,1,0\0302,153,383,2,257,3,0\0303,1,69,2,384,1,0\0301,1,44,4,272,1,14847\0301,48,161,4,272,3,14847\0301,165,264,4,272,1,14847\0304,1,59,3,256,1,14847\0304,63,78,3,256,1,14847\031\0312,0,0,2,Darkmoon Faire\0302,0,0,2,Mulgore\0302,0,0,3,Darkmoon Faire\031\031ITEM,19257,STARTER,?,10,\030ITEM,19257,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[7929]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objec