 tickets from the Darkmoon Faire you'd like redeemed, then just say so! You can redeem tickets in various denominations for wondrous and fantastic prizes. Don't be shy, give it a try!\0301200 Tickets - Amulet of the Darkmoon\0311,1,25,4,272,1,14828\0301,27,58,4,272,1,14828\0301,60,93,4,272,1,14828\0301,98,169,4,272,4,14828\0301,171,238,4,272,1,14828\0304,1,29,3,256,1,14828\0304,31,112,3,256,4,14828\0304,114,195,3,256,1,14828\0304,197,224,3,256,1,14828\031\0313,0,0,7,Darkmoon Faire\031\031ITEM,19182,OBJECTIVE,1200,15,",[79947]="UNRESOLVED\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Geomancy: The Stone-Cold Truth\031\031\031\031\031",[79948]="UNRESOLVED\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Defensive Magics 101\031\031\031\031\031",[79949]="UNRESOLVED\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030A Web of Lies: Debunking Myths and Legends\031\031\031\031\031",[79950]="UNRESOLVED\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Demons and You\031\031\031\031\031",[79951]="UNRESOLVED\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Mummies: A Guide to the Unsavory Undead\031\031\031\031\031",[79952]="UNRESOLVED\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030RwlRwlRwlRwl!\031\031\031\031\031",[79974]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Dusting off a messenger bag emerging from the soil, you find a parchment nestled among the supplies.\030\030Wet Job\0313,1,100,2,384,1,0\031\031\031\031",[79975]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Water spray dampens the air, the view is incredible.\030\030Eagle's Fist\0313,1,52,2,384,1,0\031\031\031\031",[79976]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Whoever was here, you just missed them.\030\030This Must Be The Place\0313,1,39,2,384,1,0\031\031\031\031",[79980]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Find what awaits you.\030\030Scramble\0313,1,21,2,384,1,0\031\031\031\031",[8]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Oh? A letter? Wonderful news! I've been waiting on word from my dear old mother in Deathknell. Such a saint, she is. I wonder how she's holding up.$B$BWhat? Too cheery? Not buying it, are you?$B$BWell, get lost then... it's really no business who the letter's from anyway. Go on! Get lost!$B$BCome back when you've got some coin to spend... loafer.$B$BNext thing you know, you'll be coming back to rest after a long days adventure or some stupid thing like that.\030Hey, mate! Do a favor for a young man who's been fighting more than his fair share of mindless zombies and spiders?$B$BI got this here letter that needs to go to Brill... to an innkeeper named Renee something-or-other. Don't really matter none what her last name is.$B$BAnyway, it's a nice cozy little place full of victims of the plague trying to make their way in the world. And it be a great spot for you to rest too if the need arises. You should check it out... you do and I'll pay you well.\030Deliver the Nondescript Letter to Innkeeper Renee in Tirisfal Glades.\030Yes? Yes? What is it?$B$BThe forsaken; they certainly do have huge appetites. Make yourself at home... yes, rest those weary bones. My name's Renee if you need anything at all.\030A Rogue's Deal\0312,1,10,2,257,1,6784\0302,12,115,2,261,2,6784\0302,120,170,2,259,1,6784\0302,172,218,2,257,1,6784\0302,220,266,2,257,1,6784\0302,271,376,2,261,1,6784\0302,378,439,2,259,4,6784\0302,441,466,2,257,1,6784\0302,468,496,2,257,1,6784\0303,1,69,2,384,1,6784\0301,5,13,4,272,2,5688\0301,15,29,4,272,1,5688\0301,31,94,4,272,1,5688\0301,96,116,4,272,1,5688\0301,118,147,4,272,1,5688\0301,152,156,4,272,2,5688\0301,158,168,4,272,2,5688\0301,170,192,4,272,2,5688\0301,197,218,4,276,1,5688\0301,220,272,4,272,1,5688\0301,281,289,4,276,1,5688\0301,294,340,4,272,1,5688\0301,342,348,4,272,1,5688\0301,353,462,4,272,1,5688\0304,1,4,3,256,2,5688\0304,6,9,3,256,2,5688\0304,11,21,3,256,2,5688\0304,26,77,3,256,1,5688\0304,79,102,3,256,1,5688\0304,104,131,3,256,1,5688\0304,133,176,3,258,4,5688\0314950,2,7,Spot\0305688,2,10,Innkeeper Renee\0312,154,1420,0,\0302,0,0,3,Brill\0302,0,0,10,Innkeeper Renee\0302,0,0,10,Tirisfal Glades\0304,0,0,13,Deathknell\031590,23,590,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[80]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Why yes! The writing on this page does in fact match that of the registry signatures.\030I have had my eye on that creep, Stalvan, for quite sometime.  But if this page was written by the same hand it proves his guilt beyond a shadow of a doubt.$B$BIn all his days keeping the Town Registry, Clerk Daltry has become an expert at identifying handwriting.  Show him this page and see if the writing matches that of the registry signature.\030Show Clerk Daltry the Bloodstained Journal Page.\030Back again, $N? What do you have this time?\030The Legend of Stalvan\0312,1,61,2,257,1,264\0302,64,156,2,257,4,264\0302,161,264,2,257,1,264\0302,267,347,2,257,4,264\0303,1,48,2,384,1,264\0301,1,8,4,272,1,267\0301,10,85,4,272,1,267\0304,1,15,3,256,2,267\0304,17,43,3,256,2,267\0314244,2,2,Shadow\030267,2,3,Clerk Daltry\030267,2,5,Clerk Daltry\0312,10,1431,0,\03179,19,79,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\03097,23,97,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[804]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031From your description of the beast, I believe you must be speaking of Sarkoth! It is no wonder that Hana'zua was overtaken by it. Aid will be dispatched to him immediately, trouble yourself no more with Hana'zua's plight.$B$BHowever, I must say, I am most impressed to hear that you brought Sarkoth to death. It is a feat to be proud of, $N. And that you would fight for a stranger's honor, while other tasks occupied your time, your own honor is heightened.\030Seeing the deed you have done for me steels my heart. I cannot fall so easily! I must endure!$B$BBut it remains that I cannot make the trek back to the Den unassisted. Please, $n, return to the Den and tell Gornek of my situation. Perhaps he can help me.\030Bring the news of Hana'zua's plight to Gornek at the Den.\030\030Sarkoth\0312,1,53,2,257,1,3287\0302,55,78,2,257,1,3287\0302,80,93,2,257,1,3287\0302,98,167,2,257,1,3287\03