objective\030requestItems\030title\031A fair trade, my friend - please enjoy the blessings of Zanza with our compliments!\030\030\030With your increased status amongst the tribe comes access to some of our more potent potables. Behold... these brews are strong in the mojo - blessed by Zanza and fit for adventurers from all walks of life!$b$bI will allow you to choose one from the three I offer; in exchange, I require three Zandalar Honor Tokens. Note that only the effects of a single one may course through your spirit at any given time.\030Zanza's Potent Potables\0311,1,83,4,272,1,14921\0304,1,94,3,256,1,14921\0304,96,104,3,256,1,14921\0304,106,206,3,256,1,14921\0304,211,316,3,256,3,14921\0304,318,409,3,256,1,14921\031\0312,19,1434,0,\031\031ITEM,19858,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030REPUTATION,270,OBJECTIVE,21000,16,",[8246]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031A fair trade, my friend - please accept your signet with the blessing of the tribe!\030\030\030$n - for someone as exalted among the Zandalar as you are, I have something very special for you. Direct from our home in the South Seas... the Signets of the Zandalar! These signets are used to enhance any shoulder item you may possess. Should you seek might, mojo, or serenity - I have what you need!$b$bI ask for fifteen Zandalar Honor Tokens in exchange for your choice of one signet. If you have the tokens ready, then I'm ready to make a deal!\030Signets of the Zandalar\0311,1,83,4,272,1,14921\0304,1,97,3,256,1,14921\0304,99,139,3,256,1,14921\0304,141,168,3,256,1,14921\0304,170,237,3,256,1,14921\0304,239,302,3,258,4,14921\0304,307,388,3,258,1,14921\0304,390,449,3,256,4,14921\031\0312,19,1434,0,\0303,0,0,3,South Seas\031\031ITEM,19858,OBJECTIVE,15,15,\030REPUTATION,270,OBJECTIVE,42000,16,",[8249]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031May these knives find a place in someone's heart.$B$BLiterally.\030\030\030My rogues need to hone their lockpicking skills, and I need locks of adequate difficulty -- the stuff Zan makes us is unfit for all but the lowliest neophytes.$B$BTell ya what, if you bring me 5 Heavy Junkboxes, I'll provide you with some of the finest throwing knives known to roguekind.$B$BYou can unlock the boxes and rifle through them, but you'll have to leave at least a few coins in them... even a rogue in training needs motivation.\030Junkboxes Needed\0311,1,49,4,272,1,6707\0301,54,63,4,272,1,6707\0304,1,159,3,258,1,6707\0304,164,288,3,256,4,6707\0304,293,397,3,256,1,6707\0304,399,440,3,258,1,6707\031\031\031\031ITEM,16885,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[825]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your recovery mission was a success, $C. I will see to it that these tools get to Orgrimmar with the next caravan.$B$BNicely done.\030One of my most observant scouts brings back word that the wreckage of Proudmoore's fleet still remains off the coast of Durotar, just east of Tiragarde Keep.$B$BIt is no secret that the humans, in alliance with those foul little creatures known as gnomes, have an advanced knowledge of mechanics. We must have a complete understanding of all our potential enemies. And our people will benefit from this new knowledge as well.$B$BSwim through the wreckage, $n, and retrieve for me the tools of the Alliance.\030Gar'Thok of Razor Hill wants you to retrieve 3 Gnomish Tools from the wreckage off the coast.\030Once we learn how the humans operate their strange machinery, we will stand a greater chance of defeating them in future battles.$B$BWith our new gained knowledge, the Horde only stands to grow in strength.\030From The Wreckage....\0312,1,157,2,257,1,3139\0302,162,296,2,257,1,3139\0302,298,364,2,261,1,3139\0302,366,425,2,257,3,3139\0302,430,506,2,257,1,3139\0303,1,93,2,386,1,3139\0301,1,40,4,272,1,3139\0301,42,114,4,272,3,3139\0301,119,130,4,272,1,3139\0304,1,129,3,256,3,3139\0304,134,206,3,256,1,3139\0313139,2,6,Gar'Thok\0312,14,1411,0,\0302,0,0,1,Tiragarde Keep\0304,0,0,8,Orgrimmar\031784,19,784,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4863,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8250]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031<Sanath sneers at you.>$B$BArchmage Xylem awaits your arrival.\030Archmage Xylem has been asking around lately... for someone of your experience.$B$BIf you wish to seek him out, you can find him in Azshara.  His tower is built high atop the cliffs, and the only way up is a teleport spell invoked by his arrogant servant, Sanath Lim-yo.$B$BSanath makes camp below his master's tower.  To find him, travel to where Azshara's main road forks at the entrance to the Ruins of Eldarath.  From that spot, head directly north until you reach the cliffs.\030Seek out Sanath Lim-yo and gain passage to see Archmage Xylem.\030\030Magecraft\0312,1,47,2,257,1,0\0302,49,79,2,257,1,0\0302,84,140,2,259,4,0\0302,143,270,2,257,1,0\0302,275,317,2,257,1,0\0302,320,415,2,321,1,0\0302,418,480,2,257,1,0\0303,1,62,2,384,1,0\0301,1,23,4,272,1,8395\0301,28,62,4,272,1,8395\0318379,2,1,Archmage Xylem\0308395,2,4,Sanath Lim-yo\0304950,2,7,Spot\0308395,2,8,Sanath Lim-yo\0308379,2,8,Archmage Xylem\0308379,4,10,Archmage Xylem\0312,0,0,3,Azshara\0302,0,0,6,Ruins of Eldarath\0318251,23,8251,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8251]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Well done, $N!  It never ceases to amaze me how persuasive a volley of arcane missiles can be.\030The blood elves in Azshara have developed a method for pulverizing the magical items they acquire.  This glittering dust they produce differs from the components normally acquired by a disenchantment spell.$B$BWhen I sent my apprentice to trade for the dust, he was killed without hesitation.  For that, they must pay.$B$BThe time for talk is over, $N.  Find the blood elves along the cliffs of Azshara and use more \"persuasive\" methods to acquire their glittering dust.\030Bring 10 Glittering Dust to Archmage Xylem.\030Have you the dust?\030Magic Dust\0312,1,98,2,257,1,8379\0302,101,206,2,257,1,8379\0302,211,292,2,257,1,8379\0302,295,318,2,257,1,8379\0302,323,352,2,257,1,8379\0302,355,470,2,257,1,8379\0303,1,43,2,384,1,8379\0301,1,14,4,272,1,8379\0301,17,94,4,272,1,8379\0304,1,18,3,256,2,8379\0318379,2,7,Archmage Xylem\0312,0,0,1,Azshara\0302,0,0,7,Archmage Xylem\0318250,19,8250,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308252,23,8252,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20028,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8252]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This is a superb specimen of coral, $N.  Your skills are unquestionably precise and deadly.$B$BDo not think your efforts have gone unnoticed.  Perhaps you are worthy of a true test of your skill...\030Take a look around you.  The ruins and beaches are overrun with spitelash.  Recently, the wretched creatures have learned to recognize the rare components indigenous to Azshara.$B$BSpecifically, I speak of enchanted coral -- they are drawn to it by reasons unknown to me.  Now there is little coral left in the bay, and it is vital to my research.  I need you to separate some enchanted coral from the spitelash sirens and bring it to me.\030Collect 6 Enchanted Coral and return them to Archmage Xylem.\030The spitelash sirens are surprisingly adept mages.  Not as adept as you, I hope?\030The Siren's Coral\0312,1,23,2,257,1,8379\0302,26,74,2,321,1,8379\0302,77,177,2,257,1,8379\0302,182,271,2,257,1,8379\0302,274,347,2,257,1,8379\0302,350,438,2,259,1,8379\0303,1,60,2,384,1,8379\0301,1,39,4,272,1,8379\0301,42,91,4,272,1,8379\0301,96,141,4,272,1,8379\0301,144,197,4,272,4,8379\0304,1,50,3,256,1,8379\0304,53,80,3,258,2,8379\0318379,2,7,Archmage Xylem\0312,0,0,3,Azshara\0302,0,0,7,Archmage Xylem\0318251,19,8251,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308253,23,8253,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20029,OBJECTIVE,6,15,",[8253]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Incredible.  The shard has grown as it absorbed the drake's energy over the long years.$B$BThere is no more I can ask of you now.  My full ability to forge the arcane has returned with this shard.  My first creation is yours, $N, and you have but to choose...\030There is a green drake deep in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar by the name of Morphaz.$B$BYears ago, he overwhelmed me in a bold ambush and consumed my apprentice whole.  While the loss of an apprentice is not unknown to me, this particular one carried an arcane shard of unsurpassed size and quality.$B$BYou must gather powerful allies and delve into the temple.  Destroy Morphaz and recover the arcane shard from his ageless stomach.\030Retrieve the Arcane Shard from Morphaz and return to Archmage Xylem.\030Have you slain my old nemesis?\030Destroy Morphaz\0312,1,87,2,257,1,8379\0302,92,170,2,325,1,8379\0302,173,302,2,257,1,8379\0302,307,364,2,257,1,8379\0302,367,436,2,261,1,8379\0303,1,68,2,384,1,8379\0301,1,11,4,272,1,8379\0301,14,87,4,272,1,8379\0301,92,129,4,272,1,8379\0301,132,196,4,272,1,8379\0301,199,259,4,272,1,8379\0304,1,30,3,260,2,8379\0315719,2,1,Morphaz\0305719,2,5,Morphaz\0305719,2,6,Morphaz\0308379,2,6,Archmage Xylem\0312,0,0,6,Morphaz\0302,0,0,6,Archmage Xylem\0318252,19,8252,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20085,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8254]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your arrival has lifted a weight from my shoulders.  We have much to do.\030It is the way of the divine to help those in need.  The how is insignificant -- only the why matters.$B$BThe Cenarion Circle has such a need.  Speak with Ogtinc to lend aid to their plight.  He resides atop the cliffs to the northeast of the Ruins of Eldarath in Azshara.\030Seek out Ogtinc in Azshara.\030\030Cenarion Aid\0312,1,50,2,259,1,0\0302,53,101,2,257,1,0\0302,106,141,2,321,1,0\0302,144,189,2,257,1,0\0302,192,271,2,321,1,0\0303,1,27,2,384,1,0\0301,1,51,4,272,1,8405\0301,54,72,4,272,1,8405\0318405,2,4,Ogtinc\0308405,2,6,Ogtinc\0312,0,0,5,Azshara\0302,0,0,6,Azshara\0318255,23,8255,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8255]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031It is good the divine path has led you to us, $N. Your beliefs do not interfere with the tasks involved in creating this salve.$B$BYou see, the courser is sacred to the Cenarion Circle, and killing them for any reason, no matter how necessary, weakens their spirit.\030The mosshoof coursers of Azshara are magnificent animals who once lived in Felwood.  They naturally resist disease and poison, and were unaffected by the corruption there.  In their ancestral wisdom, they simply chose to leave that sickened place.$B$BIt saddens my heart, but I must ask you to hunt these mighty beasts for me.  Gather four courser glands as the first ingredient for a restorative salve -- a salve we will use to heal Felwood.\030Acquire 4 Healthy Courser Glands and bring them to Ogtinc in Azshara.  Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.\030You have returned. Were you successful?\030Of Coursers We Know\0312,1,83,2,257,1,8405\0302,86,171,2,261,1,8405\0302,174,247,2,257,1,8405\0302,252,326,2,257,1,8405\0302,329,442,2,257,3,8405\0303,1,69,2,384,1,8405\0303,72,134,2,448,1,8405\0301,1,49,4,272,1,8405\0301,51,127,4,272,1,8405\0301,132,265,4,336,1,8405\0304,1,18,3,256,1,8405\0304,20,39,3,256,2,8405\0318405,2,6,Ogtinc\0308405,2,7,Ogtinc\0312,0,0,1,Felwood\0302,0,0,6,Ogtinc\0302,0,0,6,Azshara\0304,0,0,10,Cenarion Circle\0318254,19,8254,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308256,23,8256,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20027,OBJECTIVE,4,15,",[8256]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I cannot say I'm pleased to receive such a wretched substance, but it is a necessary evil. Thank you, $N.\030For this restorative salve, you must use a simple formula: one part poison, two parts cure.  You have acquired one cure, now you must gather the poison.$B$BPowerful undead, such as the lingering highborne who wander the Ruins of Eldarath, are sometimes so infused with evil that it coalesces into a sickly greenish goo.  To the living, this substance is known as ichor of undeath.$B$BDue to the potency of this vile element, I require only a single ichor.\030Acquire an Ichor of Undeath for Ogtinc in Azshara.  Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath.\030We must obtain the ichor quickly. Have you found it?\030The Ichor of Undeath\0312,1,91,2,261,1,8405\0302,94,152,2,261,1,8405\0302,157,319,2,321,1,8405\0302,322,380,2,257,1,8405\0302,385,455,2,257,1,8405\0303,1,50,2,384,1,8405\0303,53,115,2,448,1,8405\0301,1,90,4,272,1,8405\0301,92,105,4,272,1,8405\0304,1,33,3,256,1,8405\0304,35,52,3,256,2,8405\0317864,2,3,Lingering Highborne\0308405,2,6,Ogtinc\0308405,2,7,Ogtinc\0312,0,0,6,Azshara\0318255,19,8255,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308257,23,8257,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,7972,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8257]="PARTIAL\031consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You have slain Morphaz and carried his blood to us... I can hardly believe this good news!$B$BWe will combine the ingredients at once and begin healing the trees and creatures of Felwood. It will take a lifetime to undo what has happened here, but you have given us the means to do it.\030Now the last part, the second cure.$B$BThe green drake Morphaz is known to be immune to all forms of poison and disease -- many druids died to bring us this information.  There is no doubt his blood is potent for our needs.$B$BA courier from the Cenarion Circle will take the parts you have already collected while you gather the last.  Summon your allies and seek out the drake's lair in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar.  Bring his blood to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.\030Kill Morphaz in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar, and return his blood to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.  The entrance to the sunken temple can be found in the Swamp of Sorrows.\030Do you have the blood of Morphaz?\030Blood of Morphaz\0312,1,35,2,257,1,8405\0302,40,169,2,261,1,8405\0302,172,223,2,259,1,8405\0302,228,335,2,321,3,8405\0302,338,422,2,259,1,8405\0302,425,469,2,257,1,8405\0303,1,100,2,384,1,8405\0303,103,173,2,384,1,8405\0301,1,53,4,276,1,10922\0301,55,90,4,272,4,10922\0301,95,187,4,272,3,10922\0301,189,285,4,272,3,10922\0304,1,33,3,256,2,10922\0315719,2,2,Morphaz\03010922,2,6,Greta Mosshoof\0305719,2,7,Morphaz\03010922,2,7,Greta Mosshoof\0305719,4,9,Morphaz\0305719,3,13,Morphaz\0312,0,0,4,Cenarion Circle\0302,0,0,6,Greta Mosshoof\0302,0,0,6,Felwood\0302,0,0,7,Greta Mosshoof\0302,0,0,7,Felwood\0302,0,0,8,Swamp of Sorrows\0318256,19,8256,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20025,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8258]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This is a victory to savor, $N! The demise of Darkreaver should restore the fragile fetters that anchor the spirit realm.$B$BYou have far exceeded what was asked of you, even when you had no notion of reward or compensation. You are truly a $C of worth, my friend.$B$BI know that acting to preserve the spirit realm should be thanks enough, but please - accept this simple gift with my thanks.\030Death Knight Darkreaver lords over the Great Ossuary in the Scholomance.  He threatens to twist the spirit realm to do his own bidding, and he must be stopped!  This is where the scryer you helped make comes into play.$B$BUse the divination scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement to call forth Darkreaver's spirit minions.  Defeat the spirits and the death knight himself will appear.  $N, bring me his head!  Only his demise will reverse the damage done to the spirit realm!\030Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance.  Doing so will bring forth spirits you must fight.  Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver; defeat him.$B$BBring Darkreaver's Head to Sagorne Creststrider in the Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar.\030Time is critical, $N - have you succeeded in stopping Death Knight Darkreaver's threat?\030The Darkreaver Menace\0312,1,72,2,257,1,13417\0302,75,159,2,261,1,13417\0302,162,218,2,257,1,13417\0302,223,335,2,257,1,13417\0302,338,397,2,257,3,13417\0302,400,421,2,257,1,13417\0302,424,488,2,257,3,13417\0303,1,90,2,384,1,13417\0303,93,141,2,388,3,13417\0303,144,221,2,384,3,13417\0303,226,308,2,384,1,13417\0301,1,31,4,272,1,13417\0301,33,121,4,272,1,13417\0301,126,224,4,272,1,13417\0301,226,264,4,272,1,13417\0301,269,393,4,272,1,13417\0304,1,87,3,260,2,13417\03114516,2,1,Death Knight Darkreaver\03010664,2,3,Scryer\03010664,2,4,Scryer\03010664,2,8,Scryer\03014516,2,10,Death Knight Darkreaver\03013417,2,11,Sagorne Creststrider\03014516,3,17,Death Knight Darkreaver\0312,0,0,1,Scholomance\0302,0,0,8,Scholomance\0302,0,0,11,Sagorne Creststrider\0302,0,0,11,Valley of Wisdom\0317667,19,7667,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,18880,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[826]="PARTIAL\031loreConnections,motivations,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031With Zalazane gone, our tribe can again sleep in peace.$B$BThank you, $N. The Darkspear tribe owes you much. If you suffer from an ailment, visit my assistant Bom'bay, behind me. His voodoo is strong...\030The witchdoctor Zalazane dwells on the Echo Isles to the east.  They are the isles we once called home.$B$BFrom there he sends his trolls to the mainland, to hex our people and drag more of them under his sway.$B$BHe must be stopped.$B$BDefeat Zalazane and his minions -- former Darkspear trolls, now lost to us.  Bring me his head and I will know his reign of evil is over.\030Defeat Zalazane.$B$BKill 8 Voodoo Trolls and 8 Hexed Trolls.$B$BBring Zalazane's Head to Gadrin.\030Is Zalazane defeated, $N?\030Zalazane\0312,1,62,2,257,1,3188\0302,65,103,2,257,1,3188\0302,108,210,2,257,1,3188\0302,215,233,2,257,1,3188\0302,238,312,2,261,1,3188\0302,315,374,2,257,3,3188\0303,1,16,2,384,1,3188\0303,21,60,2,384,1,3188\0303,65,96,2,384,1,3188\0301,1,55,4,312,1,3188\0301,60,73,4,272,1,3188\0301,75,108,4,272,1,3188\0301,110,178,4,276,4,3188\0301,180,202,4,272,1,3188\0304,1,25,3,256,2,3188\0313205,2,1,Zalazane\0303205,2,5,Zalazane\0303205,2,7,Zalazane\0303205,4,10,Zalazane\03010578,4,13,Bom'bay\0303205,3,15,Zalazane\0312,14,1411,0,\0302,0,0,9,Gadrin\031\031NPC,3207,OBJECTIVE,8,13,Hexed Troll\030NPC,3206,OBJECTIVE,8,13,Voodoo Troll\030ITEM,4866,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8260]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've certainly begun to prove yourself to us, $N. As a reward, please take this care package! Inside it you'll find rations and bandages that are usable only inside Arathi Basin. $B$BAs you continue to prove yourself inside the Basin, you'll find that these items will become available to you for purchase. Rations become available when you are Honored with us, and bandages when you are Revered.\030\030\030\030Arathor Basic Care Package\0311,1,51,4,272,1,15127\0301,53,95,4,272,1,15127\0301,97,180,4,272,1,15127\0301,186,308,4,272,3,15127\0301,310,398,4,272,1,15127\031\0312,3358,1461,0,\0318261,22,8261,UNKNOWN\0308262,22,8262,UNKNOWN\031",[8261]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've certainly begun to prove yourself to us, $N. As a reward, please take this care package! Insi