 forces!$B$BDo this, and earn a talisman of merit.  Bring me such a talisman, $N, and I shall reward you.\030Enter Warsong Gulch and defeat the Horde, obtain a Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor, and return to Sentinel Farsong at the Silverwing Grove.\030\030Vanquish the Invaders!\0312,1,73,2,257,3,0\0302,75,190,2,261,1,0\0302,195,241,2,269,1,0\0302,243,278,2,261,1,0\0302,283,320,2,257,1,0\0302,323,375,2,257,3,0\0303,1,135,2,384,1,0\031795,2,7,Mark\03014733,2,7,Sentinel Farsong\0312,3277,1460,0,\0302,0,0,7,Sentinel Farsong\0302,0,0,7,Silverwing Grove\0317788,22,7788,UNKNOWN\0307871,22,7871,UNKNOWN\0307872,22,7872,UNKNOWN\0307873,22,7873,UNKNOWN\0307886,22,7886,UNKNOWN\0307887,22,7887,UNKNOWN\0307888,22,7888,UNKNOWN\0307921,22,7921,UNKNOWN\0308290,22,8290,UNKNOWN\0308292,22,8292,UNKNOWN\0308292,23,8292,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20558,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8292]="PARTIAL\031characters,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you, $N. Your exploits in Warsong Gulch ring throughout Ashenvale Forest.\030You have proven your value to our efforts in Warsong Gulch. Continue to aid the cause and bring me more talismans of merit. Do this, and you will earn even more of our trust.\030You obtained a Silverwing Talisman of Merit for your last task, talk to me again, and you gain your reward.\030\030Talismans of Merit\0312,1,59,2,257,1,0\0302,61,123,2,257,1,0\0302,125,174,2,257,3,0\0303,1,107,2,384,1,0\0301,1,14,4,272,1,0\0301,16,79,4,272,1,0\031\0312,3277,1460,0,\0302,0,0,1,Warsong Gulch\0304,0,0,6,Warsong Gulch\0318291,19,8291,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307788,22,7788,UNKNOWN\0307871,22,7871,UNKNOWN\0307872,22,7872,UNKNOWN\0307873,22,7873,UNKNOWN\0307886,22,7886,UNKNOWN\0307887,22,7887,UNKNOWN\0307888,22,7888,UNKNOWN\0307921,22,7921,UNKNOWN\0308290,22,8290,UNKNOWN\0308291,22,8291,UNKNOWN\031ITEM,19213,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8293]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The night elves and their allies must tremble at even the whisper of your name! For the Horde!\030You have proven your value to our efforts in Warsong Gulch. Continue to rage against the Silverwing Sentinels! Bring me more marks of honor!\030You obtained a Warsong Mark of Honor for your last task, talk to me again, and you gain your reward.\030\030Mark of Honor\0312,1,59,2,257,1,0\0302,61,110,2,257,1,0\0302,112,140,2,257,1,0\0303,1,100,2,384,1,0\0301,1,79,4,272,1,0\0301,81,94,4,272,1,0\031795,2,4,Mark\0312,3277,1460,0,\0302,0,0,1,Warsong Gulch\0318294,19,8294,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307922,22,7922,UNKNOWN\0307923,22,7923,UNKNOWN\0307924,22,7924,UNKNOWN\0307925,22,7925,UNKNOWN\031ITEM,19322,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8294]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031<Captain Shatterskull roars in triumph.>$B$BHow much more can they withstand? How many more Alliance filth must perish at the hands of the Horde for them to retreat? Only time will tell, $R.\030The wilds of the Ashenvale forest will succumb to the might of the Horde, $r. Nothing the Silverwing say or do can stop our sovereign imperative. Kalimdor belongs to the Horde. How dare they attempt to prevent us from harvesting what is rightfully ours!$B$BLet the pride swell in your chest as you cut down their weak attempts at slowing our progress. Destroy the Silverwing Sentinels, and earn a Warsong mark of honor.  Return to me with such a mark, $N, and you will be rewarded.\030Enter Warsong Gulch and defeat the Alliance, gain a Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor, and bring it to Captain Shatterskull at the Mor'shan Base Camp.\030The blood of our enemies is a mark of honor. Do you have such a mark?\030Quell the Silverwing Usurpers\0312,1,77,2,257,4,0\0302,79,145,2,257,1,0\0302,147,176,2,257,1,0\0302,178,253,2,267,1,0\0302,258,351,2,257,1,0\0302,353,419,2,261,1,0\0302,422,481,2,257,3,0\0303,1