030title\031Hah! You did it, $N! The Twilight's Hammer will soon be crushed!\030We've seen the Twilight's Hammer cultists performing rituals to summon powerful elemental nobles.  We don't know if these are the beings the cultists worship or if they act as intermediaries to even more powerful forces.  One thing is for sure: they are receiving orders from these elementals.$B$BI want you to find a way to contact an Abyssal Templar and give it a proper beating!  Nothing throws the troops in disarray like taking out the chain of command.  Bring back proof while you're at it.\030Bor Wildmane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to destroy an Abyssal Templar and bring him an Abyssal Crest as proof of the deed.\030Did you finish the job?\030Abyssal Contacts\0312,1,97,2,257,1,15306\0302,100,220,2,257,4,15306\0302,223,293,2,257,1,15306\0302,298,381,2,259,1,15306\0302,384,458,2,257,1,15306\0302,461,496,2,257,1,15306\0303,1,134,2,390,1,15306\0301,1,4,4,272,1,15306\0301,6,20,4,272,1,15306\0301,22,64,4,272,3,15306\0304,1,23,3,256,2,15306\03115306,2,7,Bor Wildmane\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,7,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,7,Silithus\0318362,23,8362,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20513,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8362]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've done well! That's less Templars for me to worry about.$B$BHere you go, $N. Hope there's something useful in there for you.\030\030\030You've proved you can handle yourself in a fight, $N. Let's keep the pressure up on the Twilight's Hammer. Go fight some more Abyssal Templars, I'll reward you with some of the stuff Huum and I have found in battle.\030Abyssal Crests\0311,1,17,4,272,1,15306\0301,19,61,4,272,1,15306\0301,66,81,4,272,1,15306\0301,83,129,4,272,3,15306\0304,1,53,3,260,1,15306\0304,55,106,3,256,1,15306\0304,108,215,3,260,1,15306\031\0312,1377,1451,0,\0318361,19,8361,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20513,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8363]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent, $N!  Defeating those Dukes will leave the Twilight's Hammer reeling for a while. As promised, here's your reward. It's some of the better stuff Huum and I have found.\030\030\030You've shown you're more than capable of taking on an Abyssal Duke, $N. I'm always one to promote good habits. Bring me more signets and I'll give you a reward.\030Abyssal Signets\0311,1,14,4,272,1,15306\0301,17,91,4,272,3,15306\0301,93,124,4,272,1,15306\0301,126,177,4,272,1,15306\0304,1,71,3,256,1,15306\0304,73,110,3,256,1,15306\0304,112,160,3,256,1,15306\031\0312,1377,1451,0,\0318348,19,8348,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20514,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8364]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I knew you'd come through, $N! Here's your reward.\030\030\030You've truly exceeded all my expectations, $N. You've been taking on opponents that Huum and I would think long and hard before engaging.$B$BAt this point the best I can do is to continue rewarding your efforts in the fight against the Twilight's Hammer and their overlords.$B$BBring me more abyssal scepters and I'll do my best to give you a suitable reward.\030Abyssal Scepters\0311,1,30,4,272,1,15306\0301,32,50,4,272,1,15306\0304,1,46,3,256,1,15306\0304,48,137,3,256,4,15306\0304,142,274,3,260,1,15306\0304,279,359,3,256,1,15306\031\0312,1377,1451,0,\0318352,19,8352,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20515,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8365]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Oh you're a darling, even if it did take you longer than I am accustomed to. This shipment should make me quite a bit of money once I've cleaned and personalized these hats. And seeing as I'm always willing to reward work that's well done, here's a little something for you. I suggest that you spend some of it on a bath sweetie.\030You're the help the Cartel sent? I suppose you'll do. Listen carefully $c. As you know, I am a procurer of fashionable apparel for the elite of Azerothian society.  Kings and Queens, Warchiefs and, well whatever the Horde calls their queens, all wear what I choose is in style.  And they pay through the nose for it, which is the best part.$B$BSo here's what's going to happen. You head down to Lost Rigger Cove and acquire a lot of pirate hats by whatever means. Do you think you can handle that?\030Haughty Modiste wants you to collect 20 Southsea Pirate Hats and return them to her at Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris.\030Do you have all 20 hats? I don't believe you, let me see them. They better be in pristine condition!\030Pirate Hats Ahoy!\0312,1,32,2,257,2,15165\0302,34,53,2,257,1,15165\0302,55,74,2,257,1,15165\0302,76,163,2,257,1,15165\0302,166,277,2,257,1,15165\0302,280,340,2,257,1,15165\0302,345,377,2,257,3,15165\0302,379,463,2,261,1,15165\0302,465,497,2,257,2,15165\0303,1,116,2,386,1,15165\0301,1,76,4,272,4,15165\0301,78,173,4,272,1,15165\0301,175,274,4,272,1,15165\0301,276,329,4,272,1,15165\0304,1,24,3,256,2,15165\0304,26,62,3,256,4,15165\0304,64,100,3,256,1,15165\03115165,2,10,Haughty Modiste\0307855,2,10,Southsea Pirate\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,8,Lost Rigger Cove\0302,0,0,10,Steamwheedle Port\0302,0,0,10,Tanaris\031\031ITEM,20519,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8366]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031$N! You are the man!!!$B$BI'm sure that the Cartel will ease up on me now that you've dealt with those Southsea scum. Let's see, what can I give you as a reward? How about a little coin and you choose from one of these for your trouble?\030Argh! They want the impossible from me!$B$BThe Steamwheedle Cartel wants me to teach the Southsea pirates a lesson.  The problem is that I can't be in two places at once; I need to stay here to keep the peace.$B$BOf late, the pirates have been disregarding the protection money that the cartel regularly forks over. So I'd like to temporarily deputize you to go down there and show them what for.$B$BYou'll find them at Lost Rigger Cove, which is not too far to the south.  Thanks $N, I'll owe you one!\030Security Chief Bilgewhizzle of Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris wants you to kill 10 Southsea Pirates, 10 Southsea Freebooters, 10 Southsea Dock Workers and 10 Southsea Swashbucklers.\030Back so soon? I hope you taught those Southsea hoodlums a lesson they won't soon forget.\030Southsea Shakedown\0312,1,5,2,257,1,7882\0302,7,39,2,259,1,7882\0302,44,115,2,259,1,7882\0302,118,209,2,271,1,7882\0302,214,315,2,257,1,7882\0302,317,396,2,259,1,7882\0302,401,472,2,261,1,7882\0302,475,502,2,257,1,7882\0303,1,179,2,394,1,7882\0301,5,22,4,272,1,7882\0301,27,117,4,272,3,7882\0301,119,161,4,272,2,7882\0301,163,236,4,272,2,7882\0304,1,13,3,256,2,7882\0304,15,88,3,258,3,7882\0317882,2,9,Security Chief Bilgewhizzle\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,7,Lost Rigger Cove\0302,0,0,9,Tanaris\031\031NPC,7855,OBJECTIVE,10,13,Southsea Pirate\030NPC,7856,OBJECTIVE,10,13,Southsea Freebooter\030NPC,7857,OBJECTIVE,10,13,Southsea Dock Worker\030NPC,7858,OBJECTIVE,10,13,Southsea Swashbuckler",[8367]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your trials have not been easy, but your courage did not escape you and your strength did not fail. Part with past tokens of victory, $C. None shall need them as a reminder of your worth. Stand up straight, $N. Today you will walk with great pride for you are a hero!\030Serving the Horde in one of the great battles against the Alliance is a source of great honor! The few however, that have served the Horde in ALL of our active battlefronts are our truly great fighters. We shall vanquish our opponents, not by fighting isolated skirmishes, but by waging a well-coordinated war.$B$BGo forth and crush the Alliance in Arathi Basin, Alterac Valley, Eye of the Storm and Warsong Gulch! For Honor! For the Horde!\030Bring 3 Alterac Valley Marks of Honor, 3 Arathi Basin Marks of Honor and 3 Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor to a Horde Warbringer outside the battlegrounds.\030Arathi is still wet with the blood of great warriors and the clash of steel still rings throughout Alterac.  Do not waste my time unless you bring news from the front!\030For Great Honor\0312,1,94,2,257,1,15350\0302,96,202,2,257,1,15350\0302,204,310,2,261,3,15350\0302,315,414,2,257,1,15350\0302,416,425,2,257,1,15350\0302,427,440,2,257,1,15350\0303,1,152,2,384,1,15350\0301,1,99,4,272,1,15350\0301,101,137,4,272,1,15350\0301,139,187,4,274,3,15350\0301,189,210,4,272,1,15350\0301,212,267,4,272,3,15350\0304,1,107,3,256,1,15350\0304,110,167,3,264,4,15350\03115350,2,7,Horde Warbringer\0312,1637,1454,0,\0302,0,0,2,ALL of\0302,0,0,4,Arathi Basin\0318388,23,8388,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20558,OBJECTIVE,3,15,\030ITEM,20559,OBJECTIVE,3,15,\030ITEM,20560,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8368]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent! You've shown your worth by defending our operations in Warsong Gulch! May word of your honor spread far and wide across our lands.\030The battle in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels is of great importance.  Under the guise of protecting a forest that doesn't belong to them, the Alliance seeks to deny the Horde one of our largest sources for lumber.$B$BDo not let this happen, $N!  Come back to me with proof of serving the Horde in a worthy manner!\030Bring 3 Warsong Marks of Honor to a Horde Warbringer outside the battlegrounds.\030The battle in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels is of great importance. Under the guise of protecting a forest that doesn't belong to them, the Alliance seeks to deny the Horde one of our largest sources for lumber.$B$BDo not let this happen, $N! Come back to me with proof of serving the Horde in a worthy manner!\030Battle of Warsong Gulch\0312,1,84,2,261,1,15350\0302,87,229,2,259,1,15350\0302,234,260,2,257,1,15350\0302,263,329,2,257,1,15350\0303,1,79,2,384,1,15350\0301,1,10,4,272,1,15350\0301,12,80,4,272,1,15350\0301,82,141,4,272,1,15350\0304,1,84,3,260,1,15350\0304,86,228,3,258,1,15350\0304,233,259,3,256,1,15350\0304,261,327,3,256,1,15350\03115350,2,5,Horde Warbringer\0312,3277,1460,0,\0302,0,0,1,Warsong Gulch\0304,0,0,7,Warsong Gulch\0303,0,0,9,Warsong Gulch\0318389,23,8389,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20558,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8369]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've shown great bravery in protecting our lands in Alterac Valley! I will tell my superiors of your deeds.\030Listen up, $N.  No matter what you might have heard about the battle raging in Alterac Valley, one thing remains true: the Stormpike Expedition invaded Frostwolf Territory.  The day we allow the Alliance to invade Horde lands without a forceful response is the day I hang up my axe and live the rest of my life in shame.  Go forth and expel the invaders!\030Bring 3 Alterac Valley Marks of Honor to a Horde Warbringer outside the battlegrounds.\030What news do you bring from the lands of the Frostwolves? How does the battle for Alterac Valley fare?\030Invaders of Alterac Valley\0312,1,14,2,257,1,15350\0302,17,172,2,261,4,15350\0302,175,320,2,261,1,15350\0302,323,354,2,261,1,15350\0303,1,86,2,384,1,15350\0301,1,69,4,272,1,15350\0301,71,109,4,272,3,15350\0304,1,57,3,256,2,15350\0304,59,102,3,260,2,15350\03110981,2,2,Frostwolf\03015350,2,5,Horde Warbringer\0312,2597,1459,0,\0302,0,0,2,Alterac Valley\0304,0,0,6,Alterac Valley\0318387,23,8387,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20560,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[837]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I will pass along word that the quilboars have been removed from their lairs, and that their structures may be set to fire. The removal of the Razormane from Durotar brings us closer to fully securing the borders of our new homeland.\030When we arrived, the Razormane quilboars possessed much of the land, and proved a thorn in our sides. Through our efforts we have driven out the largest part of their numbers, but still they remain well-fortified in some areas.$B$BIt has gone on long enough, however. For our own protection, we cannot allow the Razormane any hold in our lands. Their camps can be found to the west of here. Look for the brambles and you will find them. Today we drive them from Durotar, tomorrow, perhaps from all of Kalimdor.\030Kill 4 Razormane Quilboars, 4 Razormane Scouts, 4 Razormane Dustrunners and 4 Razormane Battleguards for Gar'Thok at Razor Hill.\030Though they do possess some intelligence and some organization, I find it constantly amazing that the quilboars were able to capture and hold so much territory in Kalimdor. Perhaps they are more crafty an enemy than I give them credit for...\030Encroachment\0312,1,101,2,257,1,3139\0302,103,227,2,257,1,3139\0302,232,267,2,257,1,3139\0302,269,344,2,265,1,3139\0302,346,390,2,257,1,3139\0302,392,436,2,257,3,3139\0302,438,510,2,257,4,3139\0303,1,128,2,384,1,3139\0301,1,123,4,272,3,3139\0301,125,233,4,272,1,3139\0304,1,172,3,256,1,3139\0304,174,241,3,260,4,3139\0313139,2,8,Gar'Thok\0312,14,1411,0,\0302,0,0,7,Durotar\0302,0,0,8,Razor Hill\0304,0,0,10,Durotar\0303,0,0,11,Kalimdor\031\031NPC,3111,OBJECTIVE,4,13,Razormane Quilboar\030NPC,3112,OBJECTIVE,4,13,Razormane Scout\030NPC,3113,OBJECTIVE,4,13,Razormane Dustrunner\030NPC,3114,OBJECTIVE,4,13,Razormane Battleguard",[8370]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Securing our resources in Arathi is an important task! You've done well, $N.\030Our conflict with the Alliance has escalated to a true war.  No longer are false pretenses to enter into battle used or expected by either side at this point.$B$BThe battle for the Arathi Basin is one of resources, plain and simple.  Either the Alliance gets the resources and uses them against us or we get them and use them to keep our war efforts going.  Help the Defilers maintain the flow of resources we need, $N!\030Bring 3 Arathi Basin Mark of Honor to a Horde Warbringer outside the battlegrounds.\030You've come back with news from Arathi, $C?\030Conquering Arathi Basin\0312,1,59,2,261,1,15350\0302,62,158,2,261,1,15350\0302,163,232,2,261,1,15350\0302,235,356,2,261,1,15350\0302,359,419,2,259,1,15350\0303,1,83,2,384,1,15350\0301,1,54,4,272,1,15350\0301,56,76,4,272,1,15350\0304,1,43,3,256,2,15350\031795,2,6,Mark\03015350,2,6,Horde Warbringer\0312,3358,1461,0,\0304,0,0,7,Arathi\0303,0,0,9,Arathi\0318390,23,8390,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20559,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8371]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You're not one to disappoint, $N! What you've learned goes beyond petty medals and commendations. What you've learned is what can only come with experience and the hardening of one's temper in the field of battle.$B$BYou've done well, $C. You're a true hero of the Alliance!\030We're not fighting isolated battles against the Horde anymore, $g lad:lass;.$B$BVictory in one front means denying the Horde resources they'd use against us in a different battle.  By the same token, losing any given battle could give the advantage to our opponent somewhere else around the world.$B$BThe Alliance is in need of more combatants with this sort of worldly understanding... truly seasoned veterans!  $N, come back to me after you've served against the Horde at all of our active battlegrounds.\030Bring 3 Alterac Valley Mark of Honor, 3 Arathi Basin Mark of Honor and 3 Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds.\030How are yer travels faring laddie?\030Concerted Efforts\0312,1,76,2,261,1,15351\0302,81,179,2,261,1,15351\0302,182,297,2,261,4,15351\0302,302,386,2,259,1,15351\0302,388,411,2,257,1,15351\0302,414,506,2,257,1,15351\0303,1,160,2,384,1,15351\0301,1,33,4,272,1,15351\0301,35,97,4,272,1,15351\0301,99,213,4,276,1,15351\0301,218,238,4,272,1,15351\0301,240,274,4,272,1,15351\0304,1,34,3,256,2,15351\031795,2,7,Mark\03015351,2,7,Alliance Brigadier General\0312,1537,1455,0,\0318385,23,8385,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20560,OBJECTIVE,3,15,\030ITEM,20559,OBJECTIVE,3,15,\030ITEM,20558,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8372]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Well done, $N! You've served the Alliance well.\030The Silverwing Sentinels are at war with the Warsong Outriders due to the destruction the Orcs are causing to the forest.  There are, however, more reasons to defend this particular forest than plain love for nature.$B$BThe forest forms a strategic barrier that makes Ashenvale defendable against a large-scale attack.  Without it, Astranaar would last a day or two before being annexed to the Barrens.$B$BDo your part in fighting the Warsong Outriders, $N!  For the Alliance!\030Bring 3 Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds.\030You've come back with news from the front, $N?\030Fight for Warsong Gulch\0312,1,121,2,261,1,15351\0302,124,216,2,271,1,15351\0302,221,318,2,261,1,15351\0302,321,402,2,257,4,15351\0302,407,457,2,261,1,15351\0302,460,476,2,257,1,15351\0303,1,96,2,384,1,15351\0301,1,14,4,272,1,15351\0301,16,47,4,272,1,15351\0304,1,46,3,256,2,15351\03115351,2,7,Alliance Brigadier General\0312,3277,1460,0,\0302,0,0,4,Barrens\0318386,23,8386,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20558,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8373]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, it almost smells better around here already. Almost.$B$BThanks to you, $N, Southshore just might make it through another Hallow's End. Here's your treats, with my thanks! If you run out of candy, I think there's a gnome named Katrina Shimmerstar in Ironforge who can sell you more; she's only around during Hallow's End, I believe.\030The thing I hate the most about Hallow's End are the stink bombs the Forsaken use on Southshore.  Who knew that celebrating liberation would have to involve such a smelly mess?$B$BDuring Hallow's End, use this cleaner to remove any nasty stink bombs the Horde may drop here in the village.  It uses the power of pine to fight funky smells.$B$BDo your part to keep Southshore clean, and I'll give you some Hallow's End treats I'm sure you'll enjoy.  We have a deal?\030Use a Stink Bomb Cleaner to remove any Forsaken Stink Bomb that's been dropped on Southshore.  Return to Sergeant Hartman in Southshore when you're done.\030Clean up a stink bomb that's been dropped on Southshore!\030\030The Power of Pine\0312,1,96,2,257,1,15199\0302,99,176,2,257,4,15199\0302,181,289,2,257,1,15199\0302,292,339,2,261,1,15199\0302,344,447,2,257,1,15199\0302,450,464,2,257,2,15199\0303,1,93,2,384,1,15199\0303,96,153,2,384,1,15199\0301,1,48,4,272,1,15199\0301,50,56,4,272,1,15199\0301,61,138,4,272,4,15199\0301,140,174,4,272,1,15199\0301,176,335,4,272,4,15199\0304,1,56,3,384,1,15199\03115199,2,8,Sergeant Hartman\03015353,4,13,Katrina Shimmerstar\0312,0,0,8,Sergeant Hartman\0302,0,0,8,Southshore\0304,0,0,13,Ironforge\031\031",[8374]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Good work, soldier! Keep it up and we'll have the Horde running all the way back to Orgrimmar.\030Winning a war is about more than just outsmarting and outfighting your opponent.  Victory often comes down to simply producing more than your enemy.$B$BWhat we have in Arathi Basin is a sizeable supply of resources for whichever side manages to claim it first.$B$BIf the Alliance comes out victorious, it'll mean more swords and pikes for our troops.  If the Horde were to win, those swords and pikes would still get made, they'd just be pointed at us!  Now is the time to help the Alliance in Arathi Basin, $N.\030Bring 3 Arathi Basin Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds.\030Tell me, what are the news from the front?\030Claiming Arathi Basin\0312,1,80,2,261,1,15351\0302,83,148,2,261,1,15351\0302,153,260,2,257,1,15351\0302,265,350,2,257,4,15351\0302,353,452,2,257,4,15351\0302,455,511,2,257,1,15351\0303,1,95,2,384,1,15351\0301,1,19,4,272,1,15351\0301,21,94,4,272,1,15351\0304,1,42,3,256,2,15351\03115351,2,7,Alliance Brigadier General\0312,3358,1461,0,\0302,0,0,3,Arathi Basin\0302,0,0,6,Arathi Basin\0304,0,0,9,Orgrimmar\0318384,23,8384,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20559,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8375]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've shown great bravery in protecting our lands in Alterac Valley! I will tell my superiors of your deeds.\030Make no mistake about it, $N.  The Horde is quite right when they say Alterac Valley is Frostwolf Territory.$B$BYou see, the Stormpike Expedition arrived as peaceful visitors to the area in search of ore and relics.  The Frostwolves reacted with the most brutal and uncivilized act of aggression the Alliance has experienced.$B$BLet us never forget the brave dwarves that perished in that cowardly unannounced attack.  Go now, $c, do your part in the battle for Alterac Valley.  For the Alliance!\030Bring 3 Alterac Valley Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds.\030What news do you bring from the lands of the Stormpikes? How does the battle for Alterac Valley fare?\030Remember Alterac Valley!\0312,1,29,2,257,1,15351\0302,32,108,2,257,1,15351\0302,113,215,2,257,1,15351\0302,218,325,2,257,1,15351\0302,330,417,2,261,1,15351\0302,420,477,2,261,1,15351\0302,480,496,2,257,1,15351\0303,1,97,2,384,1,15351\0301,1,69,4,272,1,15351\0301,71,109,4,272,3,15351\0304,1,56,3,256,2,15351\0304,58,101,3,260,2,15351\03110981,2,2,Frostwolf\03015351,2,8,Alliance Brigadier General\0312,2839,1416,0,\0304,0,0,9,Alterac Valley\0318383,23,8383,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20560,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8376]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031War comes, $N, and with it comes untold horrors. You have done all that could be asked of you and for that you should be rewarded.$B$BShould this... this prophecy ever come to pass...$B$B<Geologist Larksbane turns pale.>$B$BThe future of us all could be at an end.$B$BThese armaments will prove invaluable to your campaign in this desert.\030\030\030\030Armaments of War\0311,1,48,4,276,1,15183\0301,50,130,4,272,4,15183\0301,135,148,4,272,1,15183\0301,150,183,4,272,1,15183\0301,188,220,4,272,1,15183\0301,225,264,4,272,4,15183\0301,269,338,4,272,3,15183\03115183,4,5,Geologist Larksbane\0312,1377,1451,0,\0318315,19,8315,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8377]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031War comes, $N, and with it comes untold horrors. You have done all that could be asked of you and for that you should be rewarded.$B$BShould this... this prophecy ever come to pass...$B$B<Geologist Larksbane turns pale.>$B$BThe future of us all could be at an end.$B$BThese armaments will prove invaluable to your campaign in this desert.\030\030\030\030Armaments of War\0311,1,48,4,276,1,15183\0301,50,130,4,272,4,15183\0301,135,148,4,272,1,15183\0301,150,183,4,272,1,15183\0301,188,220,4,272,1,15183\0301,225,264,4,272,4,15183\0301,269,338,4,272,3,15183\03115183,4,5,Geologist Larksbane\0312,137