s of late, $N?\030Bring 3 Alterac Valley Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds.\030\030Remember Alterac Valley!\0312,1,42,2,261,1,15351\0302,44,82,2,257,2,15351\0303,1,97,2,384,1,15351\0301,1,39,4,272,1,15351\0301,41,104,4,272,4,15351\03115351,2,3,Alliance Brigadier General\0312,2839,1416,0,\0302,0,0,1,Alterac Valley\0318375,19,8375,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20560,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8384]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Good work, soldier! Keep it up and we'll have the Horde running all the way back to Orgrimmar.\030Winning a war is about more than just outsmarting and outfighting your opponent. Victory often comes down to simply producing more than your enemy.$B$BWhat we have in Arathi Basin is a sizeable supply of resources for whichever side manages to claim it first.$B$BIf the Alliance comes out victorious, it'll mean more swords and pikes for our troops. If the Horde were to win, those swords and pikes would still get made, they'd just be pointed at us! Now is the time to help the Alliance in Arathi Basin, $N.\030Bring 3 Arathi Basin Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds.\030Tell me, what are the news from the front?\030Claiming Arathi Basin\0312,1,80,2,261,1,15351\0302,82,147,2,261,1,15351\0302,152,259,2,257,1,15351\0302,264,349,2,257,4,15351\0302,351,450,2,257,4,15351\0302,452,508,2,257,1,15351\0303,1,95,2,384,1,15351\0301,1,19,4,272,1,15351\0301,21,94,4,272,1,15351\0304,1,42,3,256,2,15351\03115351,2,7,Alliance Brigadier General\0312,3358,1461,0,\0302,0,0,3,Arathi Basin\0302,0,0,6,Arathi Basin\0304,0,0,9,Orgrimmar\0318374,19,8374,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20559,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8385]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You live up to yer reputation, $N. Without people like you, the Alliance wouldn't stand a chance against the savage forces of the Horde.\030Ah, $N. I hope you continue to lend your experience to the different battlefronts. A lot of our lads and lasses in the field look up to seasoned veterans like you.\030Bring 3 Alterac Valley Mark of Honor, 3 Arathi Basin Mark of Honor and 3 Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds.\030Ah, $N. I hope you continue to lend your experience to the different battlefronts. A lot of our lads and lasses in the field look up to seasoned veterans like you.\030Concerted Efforts\0312,9,82,2,259,3,15351\0302,84,163,2,257,1,15351\0303,1,160,2,384,1,15351\0301,1,34,4,272,1,15351\0301,36,136,4,272,1,15351\0304,9,82,3,258,3,15351\0304,84,163,3,256,1,15351\031795,2,3,Mark\03015351,2,3,Alliance Brigadier General\0312,1537,1455,0,\0318371,19,8371,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20560,OBJECTIVE,3,15,\030ITEM,20559,OBJECTIVE,3,15,\030ITEM,20558,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8386]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Well done, $N! You've served the Alliance well.\030The Silverwing Sentinels are at war with the Warsong Outriders due to the destruction the Orcs are causing to the forest. There are, however, more reasons to defend this particular forest than plain love for nature.$B$BThe forest forms a strategic barrier that makes Ashenvale defendable against a large-scale attack. Without it, Astranaar would last a day or two before being annexed to the Barrens.$B$BDo your part in fighting the Warsong Outriders, $N! For the Alliance!\030Bring 3 Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General outside the battlegrounds.\030You've come back with news from the front, $N?\030Fight for Warsong Gulch\0312,1,121,2,261,1,15351\0302,123,215,2,271,1,15351\0302,220,317,2,261,1,15351\0302,319,400,2,257,4,15351\0302,405,455,2,261,1,15351\0302,457,473,2,257,1,15351\0303,1,96,2,384,1,15351\0301,1,14,4,272,1,15351\0301,1