of each of the elements to show you are ready.$B$BTo find Bath'rah, go to the river east of Tarren Mill.  Follow the river north until you come across the ruins where Bath'rah resides.\030Collect a sample of air, fire, earth and water for Bath'rah the Windwatcher.\030What you got for me, $C?\030Elemental Mastery\0312,1,76,2,257,1,0\0302,79,155,2,257,1,0\0302,160,213,2,257,1,0\0302,216,293,2,321,1,0\0303,1,76,2,384,1,0\0301,1,15,4,272,1,6176\0301,17,34,4,304,1,6176\0304,1,24,3,256,2,6176\0316176,2,1,Bath'rah the Windwatcher\0306176,2,5,Bath'rah the Windwatcher\0312,0,0,3,Tarren Mill\0318412,23,8412,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,7069,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,7068,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,7067,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,7070,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8411]="PARTIAL\031conflict,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031These be the elements I need. Now we talk.\030Welcome, $c.  You bring me the elements and then we do the talkin'.$B$BThe fire, the air, the water, and the earth I be needin' before I trust ya, mon.  I gots to know you be knowledgeable.\030Bring the elements earth, air, fire and water to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.\030Where's the elements, mon?\030Mastering the Elements\0312,1,12,2,257,1,6176\0302,15,67,2,257,1,6176\0302,72,151,2,257,1,6176\0302,154,189,2,257,1,6176\0303,1,74,2,384,1,6176\0301,1,29,4,274,1,6176\0301,31,42,4,304,1,6176\0304,1,26,3,256,2,6176\0316176,2,5,Bath'rah the Windwatcher\0312,0,0,5,Bath'rah the Windwatcher\0318412,23,8412,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,7069,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,7067,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,7068,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,7070,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8412]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Great, mon! Let's try it out...\030The elemental spirits of this place don't be likin' me any more.$B$BYou know about the totems more than any, and I be needin' a spirit totem to protect me.  We already got the elements, now we need somethin' more with more nature.  More primal.$B$BIn the Western Plaguelands you can kill bears for claws and spiders for their eyes.  The carrion birds eat everything, so they might have either one.\030Bring the pieces for the spirit totem to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.\030The spirits know what we're up to, and they been tryin' to kill me! I hope you got the parts.\030Spirit Totem\0312,1,64,2,257,1,6176\0302,69,155,2,271,1,6176\0302,158,230,2,259,1,6176\0302,233,244,2,257,1,6176\0302,249,331,2,257,1,6176\0302,334,397,2,257,4,6176\0303,1,66,2,384,1,6176\0301,1,11,4,272,1,6176\0301,13,31,4,272,1,6176\0304,1,67,3,256,1,6176\0304,69,93,3,258,3,6176\03115363,2,2,Spirit Totem\03015363,2,7,Spirit Totem\0306176,2,7,Bath'rah the Windwatcher\0312,0,0,7,Bath'rah the Windwatcher\0318410,19,8410,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308413,23,8413,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20610,OBJECTIVE,8,15,\030ITEM,20611,OBJECTIVE,8,15,",[8413]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031It's about time this troll got a full night's rest! The spirit totem will watch over me.$B$BI been a long time collectin' things, maybe you want somethin' for all your trouble?\030The spirit totem just isn't enough.  We be needin' some voodoo magic to make it work jus' right.$B$BThe trolls in the sunken temple have feathers strong with voodoo magics.  Go there and kill Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro.  Then we have magic enough for a real spirit totem.\030Bring the voodoo feathers to Bath'rah the Windwatcher.\030Where's the feathers, mon?\030Da Voodoo\0312,1,35,2,257,1,6176\0302,38,96,2,257,1,6176\0302,101,172,2,257,1,6176\0302,175,238,2,257,1,6176\0302,241,290,2,257,1,6176\0303,1,54,2,384,1,6176\0301,1,51,4,272,1,6176\0301,53,88,4,272,3,6176\0301,93,176,4,274,4,6176\0304,1,26,3,256,2,6176\03115363,2,1,Spirit Totem\0305713,2,4,Gasher\0305717,2,4,Mijan\0305712,2,4,Zolo\0305715,2,4,Hukku\0305716,2,4,Zul'Lor\03