ou're made of.\030Commander Ashlam Valorfist has sent out a call for a paladin of your purity and valor, $n.  You can find him at Chillwind Camp in the southern part of the Western Plaguelands.  Seek him and aid in his cause for the Light!\030Speak to Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp.\030\030Chillwind Point\0312,1,90,2,257,1,928\0302,93,175,2,257,1,928\0302,178,221,2,257,1,928\0303,1,54,2,384,1,928\0301,1,14,4,272,1,10838\0301,16,45,4,272,1,10838\03110838,2,1,Commander Ashlam Valorfist\03010838,2,4,Commander Ashlam Valorfist\0312,0,0,2,Chillwind Camp\0302,0,0,4,Commander Ashlam Valorfist\0302,0,0,4,Chillwind Camp\0318414,23,8414,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308414,24,8414,UNKNOWN\031",[8416]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You have done as I asked without question, $N.$B$BTrust is achieved, it seems. Perhaps I can reveal our plan in more detail to you now.\030The evil has been purged from the stones, $n.$B$BI am aware of Commander Ashlam's plans, and he will require only a single inert stone.  Bring it to him so we may bathe the Scourge in righteous fire.\030Bring the Inert Scourgestone to Commander Ashlan Valorfist in Chillwind Point.\030Was Thal'danis able to cleanse the scourgestones?\030Inert Scourgestones\0312,1,45,2,257,1,1854\0302,50,135,2,257,3,1854\0302,138,199,2,321,1,1854\0303,1,78,2,384,1,1854\0301,1,46,4,272,1,10838\0301,51,78,4,272,4,10838\0301,80,135,4,272,4,10838\0304,1,49,3,256,2,10838\031\0312,0,0,4,Commander Ashlan Valorfist\0302,0,0,4,Chillwind Point\0318414,19,8414,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308418,23,8418,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8417]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031So, you have come to alleviate my pain. I wish you could simply strike me down, but it is not that simple...\030In the Blasted Lands, there is a troubled spirit who was once a great hero of the horde.  A warrior's honor does not die with the body, and it would serve you well to speak with him.\030Speak with the Fallen Hero of the Horde at the entrance to the Blasted Lands.\030Did Stoley cough up my booze?\030A Troubled Spirit\0312,1,88,2,257,1,0\0302,91,182,2,257,4,0\0303,1,77,2,384,1,0\0301,1,39,4,272,1,7572\0301,41,108,4,274,4,7572\0304,1,29,3,256,2,7572\03115394,2,1,Hero of the Horde\0307572,2,3,Fallen Hero of the Horde\03015394,2,3,Hero of the Horde\0307881,3,6,Stoley\0312,0,0,3,Blasted Lands\0318423,23,8423,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8418]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This is excellent, $N. I would say I am surprised, but I knew without question that you wouldn't let us down.$B$BIt is my honor to bestow one of the Holy Mightstones to you. Use it well.\030Now we must combine the inert scourgestones and create a weapon to shatter the ranks of undead.  This is no trivial task, $n.  Only the trolls of the sunken temple carry the kind of rare magic able to turn the evil of something against itself.$B$BIn the temple, the trolls are known as Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro.  Do not feel remorse for their corrupt souls... they are not without evil.\030Bring the voodoo feathers to Ashlam Valorfist.\030Have you slain the wretched trolls?\030Forging the Mightstone\0312,1,95,2,257,1,10838\0302,98,125,2,257,1,10838\0302,128,243,2,257,1,10838\0302,248,332,2,257,1,10838\0302,335,380,2,261,1,10838\0302,382,407,2,257,1,10838\0303,1,46,2,384,1,10838\0301,1,22,4,272,1,10838\0301,24,109,4,272,4,10838\0301,114,173,4,272,1,10838\0301,175,186,4,272,1,10838\0304,1,35,3,260,2,10838\0315713,2,4,Gasher\0305717,2,4,Mijan\0305712,2,4,Zolo\0305715,2,4,Hukku\0305716,2,4,Zul'Lor\0305714,2,4,Loro\0312,0,0,7,Ashlam Valorfist\0318416,19,8416,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20606,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20607,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20608,OBJECTIVE,2,15,",[8419]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031What a splendid warlock you are!$B$B<Impsy holds the felcloth to his face.>$B$BOh how I love the feel of it, the way it burns your skin and weaves evil thoughts through the mind...\030$n, an imp in Felwood by the name of Impsy has requested your presence.  It is somewhat strange, as he has asked that you bring a piece of felcloth as a sign of good faith.  Considering the power you already wield as a warlock, I can only assume you know the satyrs of Felwood carry this felcloth.$B$BYou can find Impsy just north of the Bloodvenom Falls, which I've heard is quite lovely this time of year.\030Bring a piece of felcloth to Impsy in Felwood.\030Do you have my felcloth?\030An Imp's Request\0312,1,71,2,257,1,0\0302,74,172,2,257,1,0\0302,175,297,2,257,4,0\0302,302,407,2,257,1,0\0303,1,46,2,384,1,0\0301,1,32,4,272,1,14470\0301,37,75,4,272,1,14470\0301,80,180,4,272,1,14470\0304,1,24,3,256,2,14470\03114470,2,1,Impsy\03014470,2,4,Impsy\03014470,2,5,Impsy\03014470,4,7,Impsy\03011045,4,8,Burns\0312,0,0,1,Felwood\0302,0,0,4,Bloodvenom Falls\0302,0,0,5,Impsy\0302,0,0,5,Felwood\0318420,22,8420,UNKNOWN\0308421,23,8421,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,14256,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[842]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Alright, $N. You want to earn your keep with the Horde? Well there's plenty to do here, so listen close and do what you're told.$B$B$GI see that look in your eyes, do not think I will tolerate any insolence. Thrall himself has declared the Hordes females to be on equal footing with you men. Disrespect me in the slightest, and you will know true pain.:I'm happy to have met you. Thrall will be glad to know that more females like you and I are taking the initiative to push forward in the Barrens.;\030Take this signed recruitment letter to the Crossroads.$B$BSergra Darkthorn, curse her hide, is in charge there. She's a nasty shaman who will talk your head in circles before she lets you do anything useful. Thrall is convinced she's something special, but I'm not so sure.$B$BYou'll just have to decide for yourself, pup...\030Follow the western road from Kargal's Far Watch Outpost.$B$BAt the T intersection, turn left and follow the road south. $B$BFind Sergra Darkthorn at the crossing of roads within the Crossroads.\030Well well well, what do we have here? Has Kargal deemed me worthy of another recruit?\030Crossroads Conscription\0312,1,54,2,257,1,3337\0302,59,111,2,261,1,3337\0302,113,207,2,265,3,3337\0302,209,273,2,257,1,3337\0302,278,324,2,257,1,3337\0303,1,56,2,384,1,3337\0303,61,119,2,384,1,3337\0303,125,193,2,384,1,3337\0301,1,12,4,272,1,3338\0301,14,55,4,274,2,3338\0301,57,128,4,272,1,3338\0301,133,207,4,272,3,3338\0301,209,291,4,272,1,3338\0301,293,379,4,272,3,3338\0301,381,499,4,272,3,3338\0304,1,37,3,256,2,3338\0304,39,85,3,256,2,3338\0313338,2,2,Sergra Darkthorn\0304949,2,4,Thrall\0303338,2,8,Sergra Darkthorn\0304949,4,13,Thrall\0304949,4,15,Thrall\0312,14,1411,0,\0302,0,0,1,Crossroads\0302,0,0,6,Kargal's Far Watch Outpost\0302,0,0,8,Crossroads\0304,0,0,15,Barrens\031840,19,840,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8420]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wow! You are too kind. Especially for a warlock!$B$B<Impsy holds the felcloth to his face.>$B$BOh how I love the feel of it, the way it burns your skin and weaves evil thoughts through the mind...\030Maybe this sounds strange coming from an imp, but I'd like a pet of my own.  I really would.  It's just not fair that Niby gets me and I get nothing!$B$BIn fact, it doesn't even need to be a living pet.  I'd need something to start making it with, like some felcloth.  The satyrs here in Felwood sometimes have felcloth, so you'd just have to kill enough of them until you find some.  That doesn't sound so bad, does it?\030Bring a piece of felcloth to Impsy in Felwood.\030Do you have my felcloth?\030Hot and Itchy\0312,1,75,2,259,4,14470\0302,78,92,2,257,4,14470\0302,95,149,2,257,1,14470\0302,154,202,2,259,1,14470\0302,205,267,2,257,1,14470\0302,270,383,2,257,1,14470\0302,386,420,2,257,2,14470\0303,1,46,2,384,1,14470\0301,1,4,4,272,1,14470\0301,6,22,4,272,1,14470\0301,24,48,4,272,1,14470\0301,53,91,4,272,1,14470\0301,96,196,4,272,1,14470\0304,1,24,3,256,2,14470\03114470,2,8,Impsy\03014470,4,12,Impsy\03011045,4,13,Burns\0312,0,0,6,Felwood\0302,0,0,8,Impsy\0302,0,0,8,Felwood\0318419,22,8419,UNKNOWN\0308421,23,8421,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,14256,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8421]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This will work so very well.\030Now that I have my felcloth, I can really begin making *my* pet.$B$BIt's going to need some eyes though.  Perhaps you could rip some rotting wood from the irontree folk for me, so I can carve out some lovely eyes.  They're up north in the Irontree Woods.$B$BI'll also need some bloodvenom essence to give it that new demon smell.  The tainted oozes carry the essence, and they hang out right here near Niby and me.\030Bring 10 Rotting Wood and 4 Bloodvenom Essence to Impsy in Felwood.\030Do you have the goods?\030The Wrong Stuff\0312,1,64,2,257,1,14470\0302,69,104,2,259,3,14470\0302,107,213,2,257,4,14470\0302,216,254,2,257,1,14470\0302,259,329,2,259,1,14470\0302,332,414,2,257,1,14470\0303,1,67,2,384,1,14470\0301,1,28,4,272,3,14470\0304,1,22,3,256,2,14470\03114470,2,7,Impsy\0312,0,0,4,Irontree Woods\0302,0,0,6,Niby\0302,0,0,7,Impsy\0302,0,0,7,Felwood\0318422,23,8422,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20613,OBJECTIVE,10,15,\030ITEM,20614,OBJECTIVE,4,15,",[8422]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wonderful, now my pet is complete!$B$B<Impsy quickly stuffs the doll and gives it a demonic hug.>$B$BOh, what an odd side effect these voodoo feathers have...\030My pet is almost done.  Now I just need something to stuff it with.$B$BOnly the voodoo feathers from the trolls in the sunken temple will do.  They go by the names Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro.  Kill them.  Kill them all.$B$BThis is no trivial task $n, so I'll make it worth your while by giving you something of Niby's -- he probably doesn't need it anyhow.\030Bring a total of 6 Voodoo Feathers from the trolls in sunken temple.\030Did you bring the feathers? This doll needs stuffed!\030Trolls of a Feather\0312,1,22,2,257,1,14470\0302,25,67,2,259,1,14470\0302,72,141,2,257,3,14470\0302,144,210,2,257,1,14470\0302,213,222,2,257,1,14470\0302,225,238,2,257,1,14470\0302,243,375,2,257,1,14470\0303,1,68,2,384,1,14470\0301,1,34,4,272,1,14470\0301,39,97,4,272,1,14470\0301,102,158,4,272,1,14470\0304,1,27,3,256,2,14470\0304,29,52,3,258,1,14470\0315713,2,4,Gasher\0305717,2,4,Mijan\0305712,2,4,Zolo\0305715,2,4,Hukku\0305716,2,4,Zul'Lor\0305714,2,4,Loro\03014470,4,10,Impsy\031\0318421,19,8421,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20606,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20607,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20608,OBJECTIVE,2,15,",[8423]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I need no proof to know what you have done, warrior.  I can see the determination etched in your expression.\030<The Hero looks you over.>$B$BYou are a $c, no doubt.  I would ask an honorable task of you, but I must test your strength.$B$BIt is said that Rexxar would measure the sharpness of his blades by killing a helboar with a single, swift strike.  Now I will measure your strength by killing them.\030Kill 7 Helboar in the Blasted Lands and return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.\030The burning spines of the helboar leave horrific scars. Do not fear the pain and disfigurement, warrior, they are nothing compared to the prison to which I am bound.\030Warrior Kinship\0312,1,26,2,257,1,7572\0302,31,53,2,257,1,7572\0302,56,123,2,257,4,7572\0302,128,241,2,257,4,7572\0302,244,292,2,257,3,7572\0303,1,79,2,384,1,7572\0301,1,52,4,274,1,7572\0301,55,108,4,272,1,7572\0304,1,55,3,256,1,7572\0304,57,165,3,260,1,7572\03110182,2,4,Rexxar\0305993,2,4,Helboar\0305993,2,6,Helboar\0307572,2,6,Fallen Hero of the Horde\03015394,2,6,Hero of the Horde\0305993,3,9,Helboar\0312,0,0,6,Blasted Lands\0302,0,0,6,Fallen Hero of the Horde\0318424,23,8424,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,5993,OBJECTIVE,7,13,Helboar",[8424]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Already you have subdued my pain and honored me.  Thank you, warrior.\030The continued presence of the shadowsworn in the Blasted Lands bring great pain to me.  Their dark rituals and spells cause agony unlike any I felt while alive.$B$BThrough you I can deliver my own message of pain.  Go forth and deliver my wrath.\030Slaughter the Shadowsworn in the Blasted Lands and return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.\030The shadowsworn are not easily defeated, are they? But you are a warrior, and you will triumph or perish trying.\030War on the Shadowsworn\0312,1,86,2,257,1,7572\0302,89,160,2,257,1,7572\0302,165,213,2,257,1,7572\0302,216,245,2,257,1,7572\0303,1,90,2,384,1,7572\0301,1,48,4,272,1,7572\0301,51,69,4,272,1,7572\0304,1,50,3,256,2,7572\0304,52,112,3,256,3,7572\0317572,2,5,Fallen Hero of the Horde\03015394,2,5,Hero of the Horde\0312,0,0,1,Blasted Lands\0302,0,0,5,Blasted Lands\0302,0,0,5,Fallen Hero of the Horde\0318423,19,8423,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308425,23,8425,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,6006,OBJECTIVE,20,13,Shadowsworn Adept\030NPC,6004,OBJECTIVE,10,13,Shadowsworn Cultist\030NPC,6005,OBJECTIVE,20,13,Shadowsworn Thug",[8425]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031At last I can feel the cold touch of steel again, even if only for a moment.\030Your honor has brought some peace to me.  It is only right that I offer you something in return.$B$BMy weapons and armor were splendid in life, and yet they are of no use to me now.  They would be better served in your possession.$B$BTravel to the sunken temple and destroy the troll guardians Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro.  They carry magic feathers that can reform my physical body long enough to grant you a reward.\030Bring the Voodoo Feathers from the trolls in the Sunken Temple to the Fallen Hero of the Horde.\030Are you back so soon? Time is not the same to me any more, perhaps it has indeed been a long journey for you...\030Voodoo Feathers\0312,1,40,2,265,1,7572\0302,43,96,2,257,1,7572\0302,101,181,2,257,1,7572\0302,184,230,2,257,4,7572\0302,235,340,2,261,1,7572\0302,343,435,2,257,1,7572\0303,1,95,2,384,1,7572\0301,1,76,4,272,4,7572\0304,1,21,3,256,2,7572\0304,23,111,3,256,4,7572\0315713,2,5,Gasher\0305717,2,5,Mijan\0305712,2,5,Zolo\0305715,2,5,Hukku\0305716,2,5,Zul'Lor\0305714,2,5,Loro\0307572,2,7,Fallen Hero of the Horde\03015394,2,7,Hero of the Horde\0312,0,0,7,Sunken Temple\0302,0,0,7,Fallen Hero of the Horde\0318424,19,8424,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20606,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20607,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20608,OBJECTIVE,2,15,",[8426]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent! You've shown your worth by defending our operations in Warsong Gulch! May word of your honor spread far and wide across our lands.\030The battle in Warsong Gulch against the Silverwing Sentinels is of great importance.  Under the guise of protecting a forest that doesn't belong to them, the Alliance seeks to deny the Horde one of our largest sources for lumber.$B$BDo not let this happen, $N!  Come back to me with proof of serving the Horde in a worthy manner!\030Bring 3 Warsong Marks of Honor to