'Ashi Stingers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Combat Task Briefing XII in order to complete this quest.$B\030You wish to tell me something, $N?\030Target: Hive'Ashi Stingers\0312,1,113,2,261,1,0\0302,116,248,2,257,3,0\0302,253,316,2,257,1,0\0303,1,95,2,384,1,0\0303,98,174,2,386,1,0\0301,1,19,4,272,1,15181\0301,21,72,4,276,1,15181\0304,1,34,3,258,2,15181\03115181,2,3,Commander Mar'alith\03015181,2,4,Commander Mar'alith\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,3,Commander Mar'alith\0302,0,0,4,Commander Mar'alith\0302,0,0,4,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,4,Silithus\031\031ITEM,20941,STARTER,?,10,\030NPC,11698,OBJECTIVE,30,13,Hive'Ashi Stinger",[8502]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent work, $N. Without their workers, the silithid will have a hard time repairing any damage inflicted to their hive's structure.\030As the war effort mounts, the silithid presence in the area presents an ever increasing threat to our operations.  You've been selected to partake on an assault on Hive'Ashi where your primary target will consist of Hive'Ashi workers.$B$BReport back to Commander Mar'alith after your task is completed.\030Slay 30 Hive'Ashi Workers and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Combat Task Briefing III in order to complete this quest.\030You have something to tell me, $C?\030Target: Hive'Ashi Workers\0312,1,113,2,261,1,0\0302,116,234,2,257,3,0\0302,239,302,2,257,1,0\0303,1,94,2,384,1,0\0303,97,173,2,386,1,0\0301,1,19,4,272,1,15181\0301,21,135,4,272,3,15181\0304,1,34,3,256,2,15181\03115181,2,3,Commander Mar'alith\03015181,2,4,Commander Mar'alith\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,3,Commander Mar'alith\0302,0,0,4,Commander Mar'alith\0302,0,0,4,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,4,Silithus\031\031ITEM,20942,STARTER,?,10,\030NPC,11721,OBJECTIVE,30,13,Hive'Ashi Worker",[8503]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Hooray! That's another twenty down. You're the best. I suppose that I should get these all packed away before they wither. So much stranglekelp, so little time!$B$BThanks again, $C!\030So, $c, did I already tell you about all of the fabulous uses stranglekelp has? I did? Oh well... in any case we need a lot of it, and when I say a lot, I mean A LOT! Do you think that you could help us out? I know that it means going without all of those wonderful things that you can make with it, but it's for a good cause!\030Bring 20 Stranglekelp to Private Draxlegauge at the Military Ward in Ironforge.\030It's not true! I'd never skim any stranglekelp off the top of the stacks here. One might be tempted to though considering that it's practically a panacea of utilitarian usefulness. *cough* You don't happen to have that stranglekelp we discussed earlier?\030The Alliance Needs Stranglekelp!\0312,1,79,2,257,2,15434\0302,81,86,2,257,2,15434\0302,88,97,2,257,1,15434\0302,99,166,2,267,1,15434\0302,168,207,2,257,4,15434\0302,209,326,2,257,1,15434\0303,1,79,2,384,1,15434\0301,1,7,4,272,1,15434\0301,9,35,4,272,1,15434\0301,37,52,4,272,1,15434\0301,54,122,4,280,1,15434\0301,124,160,4,272,1,15434\0301,165,181,4,272,1,15434\0304,1,14,3,256,1,15434\0304,16,78,3,256,1,15434\0304,80,180,3,256,4,15434\0304,182,253,3,256,2,15434\03115434,2,7,Private Draxlegauge\0312,0,0,7,Private Draxlegauge\0302,0,0,7,Military Ward\0302,0,0,7,Ironforge\0318504,23,8504,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,3820,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8504]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030Well hello again there... what was it? Ah yes, $N! Come to see if I still need more stranglekelp have you? Well, it's your lucky day, because the answer to that very important question is a very affirmative YES! Think you could gather up twenty more?\030Bring 20 stranglekelp to Private Draxlegauge at the airfield in Dun Morogh.\030\030The Alliance Needs More Stranglekelp!\0312,1,25,2,257,1,15434\0302,27,38,2,257,2,15434\0302,40,50,2,257,1,15434\0302,52,106,2,259,4,15434\0302,108,211,2,259,1,15434\0302,213,250,2,257,4,15434\0303,1,75,2,384,1,15434\03115434,2,7,Private Draxlegauge\0312,0,0,7,Private Draxlegauge\0302,0,0,7,Dun Morogh\0318503,19,8503,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,3820,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8505]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your contribution is greatly appreciated, $c. It is only through the combined efforts of all that we shall be able to repel the ruthless advance of the silithid and whatever force is driving them forth. Even the Horde is amassing their own collection of purple lotus. Should you come across more, please return to me here.\030$C, the purple lotus is a flower with a plentitude of uses. I am here at the request of the Alliance as an authority on those applications, to preserve the herbs collected and to ensure that their war effort acquires enough purple lotus to sustain whatever function they plan for it.$B$BI would like for you to travel out into the world and return to me with some of these flowers. Is that something that you can do?\030Bring 20 Purple Lotus to Master Nightsong at the Military Ward in Ironforge.\030Do you have the purple lotus herbs that I requested?\030The Alliance Needs Purple Lotus!\0312,1,59,2,257,1,15437\0302,61,283,2,263,1,15437\0302,288,381,2,259,4,15437\0302,383,416,2,257,2,15437\0303,1,76,2,384,1,15437\0301,1,45,4,272,1,15437\0301,47,202,4,272,3,15437\0301,204,267,4,272,1,15437\0301,269,322,4,272,1,15437\0304,1,52,3,256,2,15437\03115437,2,5,Master Nightsong\0312,0,0,5,Master Nightsong\0302,0,0,5,Military Ward\0302,0,0,5,Ironforge\0318506,23,8506,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,8831,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8506]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030Welcome back $c. Our collection grows, but even now we have a need for additional purple lotus. If it is still within your power to gather more of the herb, I entreat you to do so and return them to me here.\030Bring 20 purple lotus to Master Nightsong at the airfield in Dun Morogh.\030\030The Alliance Needs More Purple Lotus!\0312,1,16,2,257,1,15437\0302,18,95,2,257,1,15437\0302,97,207,2,257,4,15437\0303,1,72,2,384,1,15437\03115437,2,4,Master Nightsong\0312,0,0,4,Master Nightsong\0302,0,0,4,Dun Morogh\0318505,19,8505,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,8831,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8507]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Very well, $N  I've prepared a set of tasks that should make optimal use of your skills.$B$BWith the continued efforts of you and people like you, our enemy will soon be vanquished once and for all!$B$BShould you require a new mission briefing, return to Captain Blackanvil.\030Greetings, $N.  Before I assign you to more involved tasks in the war, you'll need to do your share of field duty.  $B$BYou will find Captain Blackanvil's Ironforge Brigade outside Hive'Zora.$B$BReport to him or his lieutenant, Janela Stouthammer and come back to me.  I shall have a more advanced assignment for you ready.$B$BOh and please do us a favor and stay away from the Orgrimmar Legion.  We've been forced to keep the two forces well apart from one another due to mutual animosity.\030Report for duty at the Ironforge Brigade post near Hive'Zora.  Prepare your Unsigned Field Duty Papers and obtain Signed Field Duty Papers from Captain Blackanvil and return to Windcaller Kaldon at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.$B$BNote: Healing or casting beneficial spells on a member of the Ironforge Brigade will flag you for PvP.\030You'll find Captain Blackanvil's force stationed outside Hive'Zora.  Talk to his lieutenant, 