need anymore of those plants.\030I'll keep it simple and to the point, $c. The Alliance needs to collect a large quantity of Arthas' Tears for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. Don't ask me what for; I'm just following orders. But I'd like you to gather up as many of the herbs as you can and bring them back to me here. Are you willing to do that?\030Bring 20 Arthas' Tears to Sergeant Major Germaine at the Military Ward in Ironforge.\030What's that? Speak up, $C! Have you got that shipment of Arthas' Tears I asked for?\030The Alliance Needs Arthas' Tears!\0312,1,41,2,257,1,15445\0302,43,135,2,263,1,15445\0302,137,185,2,257,1,15445\0302,187,279,2,259,1,15445\0302,281,307,2,257,2,15445\0303,1,84,2,384,1,15445\0301,1,14,4,272,1,15445\0301,16,56,4,272,1,15445\0301,58,157,4,272,4,15445\0301,159,299,4,274,1,15445\0304,1,12,3,256,2,15445\0304,14,26,3,256,1,15445\0304,28,83,3,256,2,15445\03115445,2,6,Sergeant Major Germaine\0312,0,0,6,Sergeant Major Germaine\0302,0,0,6,Military Ward\0302,0,0,6,Ironforge\0318510,23,8510,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,8836,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[851]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Very good. You must have really stirred up those centaur -- our guards spotted activity down near the Stagnant Oasis, which was probably you.$B$BYou should be proud of your deed, $N. There is much bravery in you.\030The centaur Verog the Dervish wanders the Barrens, and will be difficult to find.  But he is based at the centaur command tent at the Stagnant Oasis to the southeast.  It may be possible to draw him to you.$B$BTravel to the Stagnant Oasis to the southeast and attack centaur near the command tent.  It will be dangerous, but if you can kill enough centaur then they should raise an alarm.  And Verog will come.$B$BBring me his head and I will place it with Barak Kodobane's.\030Bring Verog's Head to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.\030Did you find Verog, $N?\030Verog the Dervish\0312,1,81,2,257,3,3389\0302,84,166,2,257,1,3389\0302,169,206,2,257,1,3389\0302,211,297,2,261,1,3389\0302,300,388,2,257,4,3389\0302,391,410,2,257,3,3389\0302,415,474,2,257,3,3389\0303,1,64,2,384,1,3389\0301,1,10,4,272,1,3389\0301,12,141,4,272,1,3389\0301,146,182,4,272,1,3389\0301,184,212,4,272,1,3389\0304,1,23,3,256,2,3389\03193,2,1,Centaur\0303395,2,1,Verog the Dervish\03093,2,2,Centaur\03093,2,4,Centaur\03093,2,5,Centaur\0303394,2,7,Barak Kodobane\0303389,2,8,Regthar Deathgate\03093,4,10,Centaur\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,2,Stagnant Oasis\0302,0,0,4,Stagnant Oasis\0302,0,0,8,Regthar Deathgate\0302,0,0,8,Crossroads\0304,0,0,10,Stagnant Oasis\031850,19,850,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030852,23,852,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5023,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8510]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030Ok, so it looks like I still need more Arthas' Tears. I would imagine that you will be able to find them in the general location that you gathered them up for me last time. The quicker we get these, the faster we can start up the offensive against the forces at Ahn'Qiraj.$B$BYou gonna help us out again $c?\030Bring 20 Arthas' Tears to Sergeant Major Germaine at the airfield in Dun Morogh.\030\030The Alliance Needs More Arthas' Tears!\0312,1,53,2,259,1,15445\0302,55,172,2,257,4,15445\0302,174,272,2,257,1,15445\0302,277,307,2,257,2,15445\0303,1,80,2,384,1,15445\03115445,2,5,Sergeant Major Germaine\0312,0,0,3,Ahn'Qiraj\0302,0,0,5,Sergeant Major Germaine\0302,0,0,5,Dun Morogh\0318509,19,8509,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,8836,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8511]="PARTIAL\031consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I dare say the Alliance is going to be very happy with your skins here, $C. I'll make sure that not a one goes to waste. Thank you, and make sure that you check back in with me once I've counted them up to see if we need more.\030We Stoneflayers have a long history of being skinners, $c. That's why the Alliance has asked my family to help out with the collection of light leather for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. I'm here to see to it that the leather is tanned correctly for whatever they want to put it to use for. But we need your help.$B$BSince I have to be here doing that, I need you to go out and collect the skins, returning them to me here. What do you say, $g lad : lass;, will you give it a go?\030Bring 10 Light Leather to Bonnie Stoneflayer at the Military Ward in Ironforge.\030$C, I do so hope that's the light leather you promised.\030The Alliance Needs Light Leather!\0312,1,58,2,321,1,15446\0302,60,181,2,261,1,15446\0302,183,285,2,259,1,15446\0302,287,308,2,259,1,15446\0302,313,418,2,259,1,15446\0302,420,474,2,257,2,15446\0303,1,79,2,384,1,15446\0301,1,75,4,272,3,15446\0301,77,120,4,272,1,15446\0301,122,226,4,274,4,15446\0304,1,55,3,258,3,15446\03115446,2,7,Bonnie Stoneflayer\0312,0,0,7,Bonnie Stoneflayer\0302,0,0,7,Military Ward\0302,0,0,7,Ironforge\0318512,23,8512,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,2318,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8512]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you for your generous donation, $N. I'm going to get those onto the pile right now, and in no time I'm sure that they'll get changed into a nice set of armor, some leather patches, or used for something else in our preparations. Seems like we're always in need of more light leather. Come back and visit me soon.\030Good to see you again $N. It does appear that we need more light leather for the creation of the various war materiel. If you could bring me a stack of ten that would be just perfect.\030Bring 10 light leather to Bonnie Stoneflayer at the airfield in Dun Morogh.\030Good to see you again, $N. It does appear that we need more light leather for the creation of the various war materiels. If you would bring me a stack of ten, that would be just perfect.\030The Alliance Needs Light Leather!\0312,1,25,2,257,1,15446\0302,27,118,2,263,1,15446\0302,120,183,2,257,4,15446\0303,1,75,2,384,1,15446\0301,1,41,4,272,1,15446\0301,43,234,4,272,3,15446\0301,236,289,4,274,4,15446\0301,291,318,4,272,1,15446\0304,1,26,3,256,1,15446\0304,28,120,3,262,1,15446\0304,122,186,3,256,4,15446\03115446,2,4,Bonnie Stoneflayer\0312,0,0,4,Bonnie Stoneflayer\0302,0,0,4,Dun Morogh\0318511,19,8511,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,2318,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8513]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wow! Seems like you were just here volunteering to help. Thank you very much for the donation. I'll just get those all packed up and counted. You sure do know how to brighten a fella's day.\030Yes $g sir : ma'am;, I have been charged with collecting and tracking all of the medium leather gathered for the war effort. If you have the wherewithal to gather medium leather, from whatever source, then please bring them to me here. I sure would appreciate a hand with this if you can spare the time.\030Bring 10 Medium Leather to Private Porter at the Military Ward in Ironforge.\030Yes sir, I remember you. Is that the medium leather you have with you there?\030The Alliance Needs Medium Leather!\0312,1,124,2,261,1,15448\0302,126,235,2,257,4,15448\0302,237,303,2,257,4,15448\0303,1,76,2,384,1,15448\0301,1,4,4,272,1,15448\0301,6,56,4,272,4,15448\0301,58,94,4,272,1,15448\0301,96,141,4,272,1,15448\0301,143,189,4,272,1,15448\0304,1,24,3,256,1,15448\0304,26,76,3,256,2,15448\03115448,2,4,Private Porter\0312,0,0,4,Private Porter\0302,0,0,4,Military Ward\0302,0,0,4,Ironforge\0318514,23,8514,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,2319,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8514]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Golly, that sure is a lot of medium leather that you've brought round, sir! I'm gonna make sure that all of that gets put to proper use, yes indeed. With your help we'll have filled our estimation for medium leather in no time!$B$BThanks, $N!\030Yes $g sir : ma'am;, looks like we've collected $2063w pieces of medium leather to date. I know it's a lot to ask, but if you're still willing, I could use your help in attempting to put a dent in the rest of my quota.\030Bring 10 medium leather to Private Porter at the airfield in Dun Morogh.\030Yes sir, looks like we've collected many pieces of medium leather, but we need more. I can assure you that it will all be put to good use; not one piece will get wasted. I know it's a lot to ask, but if you're still willing, I could use your help in attempting to put a dent in the rest of my quota.\030The Alliance Needs More Medium Leather!\0312,1,88,2,257,1,15448\0302,90,218,2,257,4,15448\0303,1,72,2,384,1,15448\0301,1,75,4,272,1,15448\0301,77,148,4,272,1,15448\0301,150,227,4,272,1,15448\0301,232,242,4,272,1,15448\0304,1,84,3,258,1,15448\0304,86,169,3,256,3,15448\0304,171,299,3,256,4,15448\03115448,2,3,Private Porter\0312,0,0,3,Private Porter\0302,0,0,3,Dun Morogh\0318513,19,8513,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,2319,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8515]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Oh, I knew you could do it, $C, I just knew it! I'll get these into the right hands as soon as I can. Now, let's see here. Hmm, looks like our tally is coming along rather nicely. You should check back with me in just a moment once I'm done counting to see if we need more.  Cuz if we do, you're the one I want out there gathering it up for me!\030Oh boy, this is going to be great! $C, the Ahn'Qiraj war effort is in full swing, and I've been put in charge of keeping track of all of the thick leather that comes in. We'll make tons of things with it, but first we need to get a ton of it. And I mean that literally! That's where you come in.$B$BSo, do you think you can go out there and bring me back a nice, fat stack of thick leather? Do yah, do yah?!\030Bring 10 Thick Leather to Marta Finespindle at the Military Ward in Ironforge.\030Is that the thick leather you have there in your pack, $C? Is it? I can't wait for you to hand it over! Everyone is going to be so pleased with us don't you think?\030The Alliance Needs Thick Leather!\0312,1,34,2,257,3,15450\0302,36,169,2,261,1,15450\0302,171,242,2,259,1,15450\0302,244,269,2,257,1,15450\0302,271,295,2,257,1,15450\0302,300,390,2,257,2,15450\0302,392,407,2,257,2,15450\0303,1,78,2,384,1,15450\0301,1,47,4,272,4,15450\0301,49,101,4,272,1,15450\0301,103,122,4,272,1,15450\0301,124,179,4,272,1,15450\0301,181,273,4,274,4,15450\0301,276,344,4,274,4,15450\0304,1,58,3,256,2,15450\0304,67,103,3,256,1,15450\0304,105,163,3,256,2,15450\03115450,2,8,Marta Finespindle\0312,0,0,8,Marta Finespindle\0302,0,0,8,Military Ward\0302,0,0,8,Ironforge\0318516,23,8516,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4304,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8516]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You did it again! That is simply amazing how you go out there, collect all of this stuff, and then bring it back here and hand it over. I tell ya, when they find out how much you've been helping out around here you're not going to be able to walk down the street without people asking you for your autograph!$B$BThanks again for your very generous donation of thick leather, $N.\030Yep, the stack's still not high enough. $N, we still haven't reached our goal of $2071w thick leather. Just think of all the things that we can make with all of that leather! All kinds of armor and weapons. Stuff for inside the steam tanks and rifle scopes! Engineering goggles, and I bet if it ends up that we collect too much we could give the rest to the Horde for their zeppelins!$B$BYou gonna bring me back some more thick leather?\030Bring 10 thick leather to Marta Finespindle 