ages are the least difficult to create. Are you with us, $c?\030Bring 20 Linen Bandages to Sentinel Silversky at the Military Ward in Ironforge.\030Do you have the twenty linen bandages that I require, $C?\030The Alliance Needs Linen Bandages!\0312,1,52,2,261,3,15451\0302,54,227,2,257,1,15451\0302,232,385,2,263,3,15451\0302,387,475,2,257,1,15451\0302,477,496,2,257,2,15451\0303,1,80,2,384,1,15451\0301,1,78,4,272,3,15451\0301,80,156,4,272,3,15451\0301,158,299,4,274,4,15451\0301,304,345,4,272,1,15451\0304,1,57,3,256,2,15451\03115451,2,6,Sentinel Silversky\0312,0,0,1,Ahn'Qiraj\0302,0,0,6,Sentinel Silversky\0302,0,0,6,Military Ward\0302,0,0,6,Ironforge\0318518,23,8518,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,1251,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8518]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You are to be commended, $N. While there are those that would take advantage of the economics of our war footing to line their pockets in a fervor of greed, you have proven time and again that your devotion to the Alliance, and indeed to all of Azeroth, comes first.$B$BBlessings of Elune be with you always!\030Ever am I amazed by the selflessness exhibited when so many would instead turn to selfishness instead. $C, I am still in need of a number of linen bandages before my assignment here is fulfilled. Will you aid me once more in the collection of those bandages?\030Bring 20 linen bandages to Sentinel Silversky at the airfield in Dun Morogh.\030Ever am I amazed by the selflessness exhibited when so many would instead turn to selfishness instead. $C, I am still in need of a number of linen bandages before my assignment here is fulfilled. Will you aid me once more in the collection of those bandages?\030The Alliance Needs More Linen Bandages!\0312,1,102,2,257,4,15451\0302,104,195,2,259,1,15451\0302,197,258,2,257,2,15451\0303,1,76,2,384,1,15451\0301,1,28,4,272,1,15451\0301,30,266,4,276,4,15451\0301,271,308,4,272,1,15451\0304,1,102,3,256,4,15451\0304,104,195,3,258,1,15451\0304,197,258,3,256,2,15451\03115451,2,4,Sentinel Silversky\0312,0,0,4,Sentinel Silversky\0302,0,0,4,Dun Morogh\0304,0,0,6,Alliance\0318517,19,8517,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,1251,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8519]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030requestItems\030title\031After Staghelm's betrayal, I gathered the shattered pieces of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands and returned here. I had every intention of protecting the scepter from those that would seek to use it to cause harm to our world - thus was born the charge of the Dragonflights.$B$BA scepter divided amongst the four mighty Aspects would prove to be nearly impossible to restore for those willfully seeking chaos... or so I thought. What a fool I was. Even now I am hunted by that cursed flight.\030As you regain your composure and focus your gaze, you notice that something stirs within the crystal. Upon closer inspection, you realize that you are looking into the past... a memory... long forgotten.\030Learn all that you can of the past, then speak with Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris.$B\030The War of the Shifting Sands\030\030A Pawn on the Eternal Board\0312,1,101,2,257,1,0\0302,103,175,2,257,1,0\0302,177,187,2,257,1,0\0302,189,203,2,257,1,0\0303,1,97,2,384,1,0\0301,1,114,4,272,1,15192\0301,116,275,4,274,4,15192\0301,280,412,4,274,4,15192\0301,414,429,4,272,1,15192\0301,431,448,4,272,1,15192\0301,450,492,4,276,1,15192\0304,1,29,3,388,1,0\03115192,2,5,Anachronos\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,5,Caverns of Time\0302,0,0,5,Tanaris\0318305,19,8305,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308555,23,8555,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,180633,GIVER,?,9,Crystalline Tear",[852]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I commend you, $N. These centaur are undisciplined and cannot focus their rage as the orcs can, but they are fierce nonetheless. In defeating them, your valor is proven.\030Hezrul Bloodmark is the leader of the Kolkar centaurs in the Barrens.  He is fierce, brutal and cunning.  Defeating him would disrupt and fracture the Kolkars, greatly reducing their threat to us.$B$BSo kill him.  As with Barak and Verog, bring me Hezrul's Head.$B$BHe leads his people from the Lushwater Oasis, to the south.\030Bring Hezrul's Head to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.\030Is Hezrul defeated, $N?\030Hezrul Bloodmark\0312,1,69,2,257,1,3389\0302,72,104,2,257,1,3389\0302,107,196,2,261,4,3389\0302,201,212,2,257,1,3389\0302,215,262,2,257,1,3389\0302,267,325,2,257,1,3389\0303,1,65,2,384,1,3389\0301,1,18,4,272,1,3389\0301,20,128,4,272,1,3389\0301,130,169,4,272,1,3389\0304,1,23,3,256,2,3389\0313396,2,1,Hezrul Bloodmark\0303389,2,7,Regthar Deathgate\03093,4,9,Centaur\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,1,Barrens\0302,0,0,6,Lushwater Oasis\0302,0,0,7,Regthar Deathgate\0302,0,0,7,Crossroads\031851,19,851,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0304021,23,4021,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5025,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8520]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This Nightscape equipment you have supplied fills the order perfectly, $N. I expect no less from a leatherworker of your caliber.$B$BYou have definitely earned this pattern. I give it to you freely, and hope you will profit from it accordingly.\030With the Ahn'Qiraj War looming we need to do everything that we can to see to it that our soldiers have everything that they need. We're doing just that right here. For my part I've been placed in charge of seeing to it that we collect enough silk bandages.$B$BDo you think you can help me out, $c?\030Bring 20 Silk Bandages to Nurse Stonefield at the Military Ward in Ironforge.\030I need those tunics and headbands made, and I also need that piece of wildvine before I will share with you the knowledge of Wild Leather helmets.$B$BHead gear is highly coveted amongst adventurers, whether it be a disarmingly simple headband or a full-covering helmet. The fundamentals of creating valued head gear remain constant, no matter what the cosmetic appearance of the gear is.\030The Alliance Needs Silk Bandages!\0312,1,130,2,263,1,15452\0302,132,164,2,257,1,15452\0302,166,257,2,257,1,15452\0302,262,298,2,257,2,15452\0303,1,77,2,384,1,15452\0301,1,74,4,272,1,15452\0301,76,129,4,272,1,15452\0301,134,173,4,272,1,15452\0301,175,244,4,274,3,15452\0304,1,146,3,258,3,15452\0304,151,269,3,256,1,15452\0304,271,387,3,256,1,15452\03115452,2,5,Nurse Stonefield\0312,0,0,5,Nurse Stonefield\0302,0,0,5,Military Ward\0302,0,0,5,Ironforge\0318521,23,8521,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,6450,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8521]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You are such a selfless person. Thank you very much for your contribution to the war effort. It's people like you that are going to make the difference between success and failure at Ahn'Qiraj. I just hope that all of this will be enough.$B$BThanks again, $N.\030It is very kind of you to offer to help me again $c. It looks like we've collected $2082w silk bandages, so we'll need more.\030Bring 20 silk bandages to Nurse Stonefield at the airfield in Dun Morogh.\030It is very kind of you to offer to help me again, $c. It looks like we've collected a goodly number of the silk bandages we've been tasked with, but we still need more. $N, is there any way that you could see fit to put together another bundle and return them to me here? The Alliance and I will be most grateful.\030The Alliance Needs More Silk Bandages!\0312,1,52,2,257,1,15452\0302,54,124,2,259,1,15452\0303,1,73,2,384,1,15452\0301,1,31,4,272,1,15452\0301,33,92,4,276,1,15452\0301,94,193,4,272,3,15452\0301,195,238,4,274,3,15452\0301,243,259,4,272,1,15452\0304,1,53,3,256,1,15452\0304,55,168,3,258,1,15452\0304,170,271,3,256,4,15452\0304,273,313,3,256,3,15452\03115452,2,3,Nurse Stonefield\0312,0,0,3,Nurse Stonefield\0302,0,0,3,Dun Morogh\0304,0,0,6,Ahn'Qiraj\0318520,19,8520,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,6450,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8522]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You are to be commended, $C, for your perseverance in this task. I shall put these bandages away, and then I should like to talk to you again about the possibility of your collecting even more runecloth bandages.\030Argue the merits of the war if you will, $c, but it has already been set in motion. Look around you at your family and friends, and then ask yourself what it is that you can do to see to it that if they are involved, they will have every advantage to survive the conflagration.$B$BTo that end, I am collecting runecloth bandages here from whatever source. Would you like to make a donation?\030Bring 20 Runecloth Bandages to Keeper Moonshade at the Military Ward in Ironforge.\030The days pass one after the other, and still we go on. $C, have you those runecloth bandages?\030The Alliance Needs Runecloth Bandages!\0312,1,83,2,261,4,15453\0302,85,277,2,265,4,15453\0302,282,355,2,257,1,15453\0302,357,390,2,257,4,15453\0303,1,82,2,384,1,15453\0301,1,64,4,272,1,15453\0301,66,212,4,272,3,15453\0304,1,54,3,256,1,15453\0304,56,93,3,256,2,15453\03115453,2,5,Keeper Moonshade\0312,0,0,5,Keeper Moonshade\0302,0,0,5,Military Ward\0302,0,0,5,Ironforge\0318523,23,8523,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,14529,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8523]="PARTIAL\031conflict,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This is a fine road we are traveling together, $N. You make an excellent working companion. Once more do I give thanks to you for your efforts on behalf of the entire Alliance. Come and talk again with me soon.\030So it is that we come to discuss pressing matters yet again $c. Once more I thank you for your previous efforts; it is not everyone who would give so selflessly. But there is still more work to do.$B$B$N, will you once more collect runecloth bandages and return them to me here?\030Bring 20 runecloth bandages to Keeper Moonshade at the airfield in Dun Morogh.\030So it is that we come to discuss pressing matters yet again, $C. Once more I thank you for your previous efforts; it is not everyone who would give so selflessly. But there is still more work to do.$B$B$N, will you once more collect runecloth bandages and return them to me here?\030The Alliance Needs More Runecloth Bandages!\0312,1,63,2,257,1,15453\0302,65,161,2,257,4,15453\0302,163,197,2,257,1,15453\0302,202,278,2,257,2,15453\0303,1,78,2,384,1,15453\0301,1,50,4,272,1,15453\0301,52,91,4,272,1,15453\0301,93,176,4,304,1,15453\0301,178,210,4,272,1,15453\0304,1,64,3,256,1,15453\0304,66,162,3,256,4,15453\0304,164,198,3,256,1,15453\0304,203,279,3,256,2,15453\03115453,2,5,Keeper Moonshade\0312,0,0,5,Keeper Moonshade\0302,0,0,5,Dun Morogh\0318522,19,8522,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,14529,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8524]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Two for the Alliance, one for me, two for the Alliance, one for me. Hey there, fishmonger, excellent work. I can see that you're going to be a real credit to the club. Looks to me like we probably need more of that albacore though. Why don't you head on out and rustle up a mite more. I can hear my stomach rumbling already.\030Hey there, friend! If I were to say to you, 'Don't you think that soldiers should have food to eat like anyone else?', you would of course reply, 'yes'. I agree with you 110%! I'm glad we're in accord. All I need for you to do is to head out there, fish up a whole bunch of raw rainbow fin albacore, and then cook it all up and bring it back to me right here. Mmm, mmm, I can taste it already.\030Bring 20 Rainbow Fin Albacore to Slicky Gastronome at the Military Ward in Ironforge.\030I'm willing to lay odds that you've returned with all of that rainbow fin albacore we were talking about before, right, $C?\030The Alliance Needs Rainbow Fin Albacore!\0312,1,18,2,257,1,15455\0302,20,152,2,257,4,15455\0302,154,175,2,257,1,15455\0302,177,201,2,257,1,15455\0302,203,359,2,259,1,15455\0302,361,393,2,257,1,15455\0303,1,85,2,384,1,15455\0301,1,67,4,272,1,15455\0301,69,106,4,272,1,15455\0301,108,167,4,272,3,15455\0301,169,231,4,274,1,15455\0301,233,284,4,272,1,15455\0301,286,324,4,272,1,15455\0304,1,123,3,256,2,15455\03115455,2,7,Slicky Gastronome\0312,0,0,7,Slicky Gastronome\0302,0,0,7,Military Ward\0302,0,0,7,Ironforge\0318525,23,8525,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5095,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8525]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I knew that you had it in you, kid. You've got the look of someone who knows what she likes. Specifically that you like pleasing me and the powers that be. And that you have, I guarantee.$B$BHaha, ok, I'll just get these fish properly stashed away, and then you and I can have a little talk concerning you collecting another twenty albacore.\030What! You again? Well I'll be a monkey's uncle... except that I'm a gnome. Slicky Gastronome to be precise! So you're back to help out again eh? Well, I can't say as I blame you. Don't you just love the smell of all of that food? <drool>$B$BEnough loitering! Get out there and bring me back more rainbow fin albacore!\030Bring 20 rainbow fin albacore to Slicky Gastronome at the airfield in Dun Morogh.\030What! You again? Well I'll be a monkey's uncle... except that I'm a gnome. Slicky Gastronome to be precise! So you're back to help out again, eh? Well, I can't say as I blame you. Don't you just love the smell of all of that food? <drool>$B$BEnough loitering! Get out there and bring me back more rainbow fin albacore!\030The Alliance Needs More Rainbow Fin Albacore!\0312,1,5,2,257,1,15455\0302,7,16,2,257,2,15455\0302,18,49,2,257,1,15455\0302,51,74,2,257,1,15455\0302,76,107,2,257,1,15455\0302,109,144,2,257,2,15455\0302,146,178,2,257,1,15455\0302,180,229,2,257,2,15455\0302,231,237,2,257,1,15455\0302,242,258,2,257,1,15455\0302,260,317,2,257,1,15455\0303,1,81,2,384,1,15455\0301,1,35,4,272,1,15455\0301,37,92,4,272,1,15455\0301,94,155,4,272,1,15455\0301,157,187,4,272,1,15455\0301,192,341,4,272,1,15455\0304,1,5,3,256,1,15455\0304,7,16,3,256,2,15455\0304,18,49,3,256,1,15455\0304,51,74,3,256,1,15455\0304,76,107,3,256,1,15455\0304,109,145,3,256,2,15455\0304,147,179,3,256,1,15455\0304,181,230,3,256,2,15455\0304,232,238,3,256,1,15455\0304,243,259,3,256,1,15455\0304,261,318,3,256,1,15455\03115455,2,5,Slicky Gastronome\03015455,2,12,Slicky Gastronome\03015455,3,22,Slicky Gastronome\0312,0,0,12,Slicky Gastronome\0302,0,0,12,Dun Morogh\0318524,19,8524,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5095,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8526]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Gee, that's swell. Thanks for bringing me all of this burnt animal flesh, $C. I'll just put it onto the pile over there. I'm sure that someone will take care of it. I suppose if you have some time on your hands that you might want to bring me more?\030Oh, how's it going, $c? I see that you're interested in maybe gathering up food for the coming war at Ahn'Qiraj? Somehow my dad thought that it would be a good learning experience for me if I were to volunteer to help out here. Big mistake. I don't even like to eat meat.$B$BAnyway, if you feel like it, you could bring me back a lot of roast raptor. Apparently that's what all of the soldiers are going to want.\030Bring 20 Roast Raptor to Sarah Sadwhistle at the Military Ward in Ironforge.\030So do you have all of that roast raptor yet?\030The Alliance Needs Roast Raptor!\0312,1,23,2,257,2,15456\0302,25,112,2,261,4,15456\0302,114,227,2,257,4,15456\0302,229,240,2,257,1,15456\0302,242,271,2,257,1,15456\0302,276,350,2,257,4,15456\0302,352,412,2,259,4,15456\0303,1,76,2,384,1,15456\0301,1,18,4,272,1,15456\0301,20,77,4,272,1,15456\0301,79,120,4,272,1,15456\0301,122,164,4,272,3,15456\0301,166,248,4,274,4,15456\0304,1,44,3,256,2,15456\031107,2,6,Raptor\030107,2,8,Raptor\03015456,2,8,Sarah Sadwhistle\030107,3,14,Raptor\0312,0,0,2,Ahn'Qiraj\0302,0,0,8,Sarah Sadwhistle\0302,0,0,8,Military Ward\0302,0,0,8,Ironforge\0318527,23,8527,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,12210,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8527]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030Hi again $c. I can tell you're very excited about all of this. So I suppose you want to bring me another twenty roast raptor. Great. Well you do that. I guess I'll see you when you get back.\030Bring 20 roast raptor to Sarah Sadwhistle at the airfield in Dun Morogh.\030\030The Alliance Needs More Roast Raptor!\0312,1,12,2,257,1,15456\0302,14,62,2,257,1,15456\0302,64,125,2,259,1,15456\0302,127,132,2,257,1,15456\0302,134,150,2,257,1,15456\0302,152,190,2,257,1,15456\0303,1,72,2,384,1,15456\031107,2,3,Raptor\030107,2,7,Raptor\03015456,2,7,Sarah Sadwhistle\0312,0,0,7,Sarah Sadwhistle\0302,0,0,7,Dun Morogh\0318526,19,8526,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,12210,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8528]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you for this gift, $C, and in such a timely manner as well. Our soldiers will surely not lack for something to eat. Just let me get these fish stored away properly and then you and I can discuss a second haul if you're willing.\030It may not seem heroic to gather up cooked fish, but do not underestimate the value of preparation, young $c. Soldiers need to eat like anyone else, and we're here to do our part to make sure they have what they need once the war in Ahn'Qiraj commences.$B$BAccordingly, I am stockpiling spotted yellowtail, a versatile source of sustenance that stores well and can be used in many different dishes. It also doesn't have the odor of some other saltwater fish. Are you willing to aid me in this endeavor?\030Bring 20 Spotted Yellowtail to Huntress Swiftriver at the Military Ward in Ironforge.\030I am confident that you are returning so soon with the spotted yellowtail we discussed.\030The Alliance Needs Spotted Yellowtail!\0312,1,109,2,257,4,15457\0302,111,253,2,263,1,15457\0302,258,398,2,257,1,15457\0302,400,458,2,257,1,15457\0302,460,502,2,257,2,15457\0303,1,85,2,384,1,15457\0301,1,65,4,272,1,15457\0301,67,121,4,272,3,15457\0301,123,233,4,272,4,15457\0304,1,87,3,256,1,15457\03115457,2,6,Huntress Swiftriver\0312,0,0,2,Ahn'Qiraj\0302,0,0,6,Huntress Swiftriver\0302,0,0,6,Military Ward\0302,0,0,6,Ironforge\0318529,23,8529,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,6887,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8529]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You are a true member of the Alliance, $N. Your efforts shall not go unnoticed, or unappreciated. And thank you for cooking up the fish as well. I will see to it that they are stored away properly, and then I'll need to update my count. Every one brings us that much closer to catching our goal.\030If you're still willing I'd like to send you back out to bring in another haul of spotted yellowtail, $N. I'd imagine with the expertise you gained the first time out that this catch should be much faster and easier. Are you game?\030Bring 20 spotted yellowtail to Huntress Swiftriver at the airfield in Dun Morogh.\030If you're still willing I'd like to send you back out to bring in another haul of spotted yellowtail, $N. I'd imagine with the expertise you gained the first time out that this catch should be much faster and easier. Are you game?\030The Alliance Needs More Spotted Yellowtail!\0312,1,105,2,259,4,15457\0302,107,216,2,257,1,15457\0302,218,230,2,257,2,15457\0303,1,81,2,384,1,15457\0301,1,42,4,272,1,15457\0301,44,97,4,272,3,15457\0301,99,144,4,272,1,15457\0301,146,236,4,274,3,15457\0301,238,295,4,274,1,15457\0304,1,105,3,258,4,15457\0304,107,216,3,256,1,15457\0304,218,230,3,256,2,15457\03115457,2,4,Huntress Swiftriver\0312,0,0,4,Huntress Swiftriver\0302,0,0,4,Dun Morogh\0318528,19,8528,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,6887,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[853]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, the spores from the Barrens that Helbrim was gathering. He garnered your aid in delivering them? Good.$B$BAnd the emulsion is still potent, so you must have wasted no time in the delivery. Well done, $C.\030I have rendered the spores you gave me into an emulsion.  I must now send it to my associate, Apothecary Zamah.  If you were to carry this to her, she can offer you something from our stores of alchemical goods.$B$BShe is in the Pools of Vision, a cave beneath the shamans of Thunder Bluff.  The path to this cave is well hidden, but you may find it on the Spirit Rise bluff.$B$BDo hurry.  This emulsion will maintain its potency for only a short time, and must be resealed and processed before then.\030Bring the Rendered Spores to Apothecary Zamah in Thunder Bluff, before the time limit is up.\030You have something from Apothecary Helbrim?\030Apothecary Zamah\0312,1,56,2,257,1,3390\0302,59,111,2,257,1,3390\0302,114,211,2,257,4,3390\0302,216,290,2,257,1,3390\0302,293,375,2,257,1,3390\0302,380,388,2,257,1,3390\0302,391,500,2,257,3,3390\0303,1,92,2,384,1,3390\0301,1,59,4,272,1,3419\0301,61,100,4,272,2,3419\0301,102,106,4,272,1,3419\0301,111,192,4,272,1,3419\0301,194,207,4,272,1,3419\0304,1,43,3,256,2,3419\0313419,2,2,Apothecary Zamah\0303419,2,8,Apothecary Zamah\0303390,3,14,Apothecary Helbrim\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,4,Pools of Vision\0302,0,0,8,Apothecary Zamah\0302,0,0,8,Thunder Bluff\0304,0,0,9,Barrens\0303,0,0,14,Apothecary Helbrim\031848,19,848,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8530]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Bring 50 singed corestones to Commander Stronghammer at the airfield in Dun Morogh.\030\030The Alliance Needs Singed Corestones!\0313,1,83,2,384,1,0\03115458,2,1,Commander Stronghammer\0312,0,0,1,Commander Stronghammer\0302,0,0,1,Dun Morogh\031\031",[8532]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031These bars will do, and thanks for not shining them. No sense in making them pretty when they're going to be mangled for whatever materiel needs to be built for the war. I'll take care of putting them on the stacks, and I'll make sure that they are put to proper use. Speak to me again if you're interested in bringing in another twenty.\030So glad that you've decided to help out here. Not everyone would, so I need to make sure you understand what it is that I need. Copper bars, not copper ore. We don't have the time or people to do all of the smelting ourselves, so if you would be so kind as to take care of that, your efforts will be duly noted. Is that something that you can handle, $c?\030Bring 20 Copper Bars to Miner Cromwell at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030I hope that's the twenty copper bars you have there with you, $C.\030The Horde Needs Copper Bars!\0312,1,45,2,257,1,15459\0302,47,127,2,259,4,15459\0302,129,156,2,257,1,15459\0302,158,311,2,257,4,15459\0302,313,354,2,257,2,15459\0303,1,77,2,384,1,15459\0301,1,52,4,272,3,15459\0301,54,169,4,278,3,15459\0301,171,267,4,272,1,15459\0301,269,337,4,272,4,15459\0304,1,65,3,258,3,15459\03115459,2,6,Miner Cromwell\0312,0,0,6,Miner Cromwell\0302,0,0,6,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,6,Orgrimmar\0318533,23,8533,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,2840,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8533]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've proven yourself to me yet again, $C. I will see to it that this copper is used in due time. For now though, I need to get these copper bars onto the pallet and tallied. If you still feel inclined, I could probably use your help in gathering even more copper bars.\030Back so soon? You'll be a real miner in no time $c. So, you already know the drill; I need you to go out, mine up a mess of copper ore, smelt it into bars and bring it back to me here. I know that's something you're capable of, the question is, are you willing?\030Bring 20 copper bars to Miner Cromwell in Durotar.\030Back so soon? You'll be a real miner in no time, $C. So, you already know the drill; I need you to go out, mine up a mess of copper ore, smelt it into bars and bring it back to me here. I know that's something you're capable of, the question is, are you willing?\030The Horde Needs More Copper Bars!\0312,1,13,2,257,2,15459\0302,15,51,2,257,1,15459\0302,53,184,2,259,1,15459\0302,186,261,2,257,2,15459\0303,1,50,2,384,1,15459\0301,1,43,4,272,1,15459\0301,45,98,4,272,3,15459\0301,100,175,4,274,1,15459\0301,177,270,4,272,4,15459\0304,1,13,3,256,2,15459\0304,15,52,3,256,1,15459\0304,54,185,3,258,1,15459\0304,187,262,3,256,2,15459\03115459,2,5,Miner Cromwell\0312,0,0,5,Miner Cromwell\0302,0,0,5,Durotar\0318532,19,8532,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,2840,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8534]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your efforts are greatly appreciated, $N. I'll read these scouting reports right away, feel free to go over your next assignment.\030We've sent our best scouts deep into the silithid hives to gather intelligence.  Scout Azenel has been watching the silithid movements at Hive'Zora for several days now.  Find her and obtain a written report.  We need to be able to act on that information as soon as possible, $N.\030Contact Cenarion Scout Azenel inside Hive'Zora and return the Hive'Zora Scout Report to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold.  You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing VI in order to complete this quest.\030You'll find Scout Azenel inside Hive'Zora. Hurry, $N! Time is of the essence.\030Hive'Zora Scout Report\0312,1,79,2,257,1,0\0302,82,169,2,257,1,0\0302,172,208,2,257,1,0\0302,211,280,2,259,1,0\0303,1,126,2,384,1,0\0303,129,206,2,386,1,0\0301,1,41,4,272,1,15191\0301,43,129,4,272,1,15191\0304,1,42,3,256,1,15191\0304,44,53,3,256,1,15191\0304,55,77,3,256,1,15191\03115610,2,5,Cenarion Scout Azenel\03015191,2,5,Windcaller Proudhorn\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,2,Hive'Zora\0302,0,0,5,Windcaller Proudhorn\0302,0,0,5,Cenarion Hold\031\031ITEM,21165,STARTER,?,10,\030ITEM,21158,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8535]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Good job, $N. Here's your next assignment.\030The Twilight's Hammer and the elemental nobles they worship present a formidable threat to our operations in Silithus.  With the new enemies we're facing inside Ahn'Qiraj, we cannot afford to lower our guard to our enemies outside.$B$BFind a way to summon and destroy a Hoary Templar and report to Bor Wildmane.$B\030Summon and slay a Hoary Templar and report back to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.  You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing IV in order to complete this quest.\030Is your task done yet, $N?\030Hoary Templar\0312,1,118,2,261,1,0\0302,121,231,2,261,1,0\0302,236,311,2,261,1,0\0303,1,81,2,384,1,0\0303,84,161,2,386,1,0\0301,1,13,4,272,1,15306\0301,15,42,4,272,1,15306\0304,1,26,3,256,2,15306\03115212,2,3,Hoary Templar\03015306,2,3,Bor Wildmane\03015212,2,4,Hoary Templar\03015306,2,4,Bor Wildmane\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,1,Silithus\0302,0,0,3,Bor Wildmane\0302,0,0,4,Bor Wildmane\0302,0,0,4,Cenarion Hold\031\031ITEM,20947,STARTER,?,10,\030NPC,15212,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Hoary Templar",[8536]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Good job, $N.  Here's your next assignment.\030The Twilight's Hammer and the elemental nobles they worship present a formidable threat to our operations in Silithus.  With the new enemies we're facing inside Ahn'Qiraj, we cannot afford to lower our guard to our enemies outside.$B$BFind a way to summon and destroy an Earthen Templar and report to Bor Wildmane.\030Summon and slay an Earthen Templar and report back to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.  You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing III in order to complete this quest.\030Is your task done yet, $N?\030Earthen Templar\0312,1,118,2,261,1,0\0302,121,231,2,261,1,0\0302,236,314,2,261,1,0\0303,1,84,2,384,1,0\0303,87,165,2,386,1,0\0301,1,13,4,272,1,15306\0301,16,43,4,272,1,15306\0304,1,26,3,256,2,15306\03115307,2,3,Earthen Templar\03015306,2,3,Bor Wildmane\03015307,2,4,Earthen Templar\03015306,2,4,Bor Wildmane\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,1,Silithus\0302,0,0,3,Bor Wildmane\0302,0,0,4,Bor Wildmane\0302,0,0,4,Cenarion Hold\031\031ITEM,21751,STARTER,?,10,\030NPC,15307,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Earthen Templar",[8537]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Good job, $N. Here's your next assignment.\030The Twilight's Hammer and the elemental nobles they worship present a formidable threat to our operations in Silithus.  With the new enemies we're facing inside Ahn'Qiraj, we cannot afford to lower our guard to our enemies outside.$B$BFind a way to summon and destroy a Crimson Templar and report to Bor Wildmane.\030Summon and slay a Crimson Templar and report back to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.  You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing II in order to complete this quest.\030Is your task done yet, $N?\030Crimson Templar\0312,1,118,2,261,1,0\0302,121,231,2,261,1,0\0302,236,313,2,261,1,0\0303,1,83,2,384,1,0\0303,86,163,2,386,1,0\0301,1,13,4,272,1,15306\0301,15,42,4,272,1,15306\0304,1,26,3,256,2,15306\03115209,2,3,Crimson Templar\03015306,2,3,Bor Wildmane\03015209,2,4,Crimson Templar\03015306,2,4,Bor Wildmane\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,1,Silithus\0302,0,0,3,Bor Wildmane\0302,0,0,4,Bor Wildmane\0302,0,0,4,Cenarion Hold\031\031ITEM,20945,STARTER,?,10,\030NPC,15209,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Crimson Templar",[8538]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You have achieved a great accomplishment for our cause today, $N. You've vanquished some of our most powerful enemies. For that I greatly commend you.\030The links between the Twilight's Hammer and the Abyssal Council are proving to be more important than we had expected.$B$BWe believe the elemental nobles known as the Abyssal Dukes are one of the primary force organizing the Twilight's Hammer cultists.  Find a way to lure the four Abyssal Dukes into our plane of existence and destroy them!$B$BYour dedication and prowess in past assignments have led us to choose you for this particular assignment.  We are certain you will succeed in this endeavor.\030Find a way to summon and slay the Duke of Cynders, the Duke of Fathoms, the Duke of Zephyrs and the Duke of Shards and report back to Commander Mar'alith in Cenarion Hold.  You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing V in order to complete this quest.\030Is your task done yet, $N?\030The Four Dukes\0312,1,118,2,257,1,0\0302,123,252,2,257,4,0\0302,255,341,2,261,1,0\0302,346,450,2,257,1,0\0302,453,501,2,257,3,0\0303,1,171,2,384,1,0\0303,174,250,2,386,1,0\0301,1,65,4,272,1,15181\0301,67,118,4,276,1,15181\0301,120,150,4,272,1,15181\0304,1,26,3,256,2,15181\03115206,2,6,The Duke of Cynders\03015207,2,6,The Duke of Fathoms\03015220,2,6,The Duke of Zephyrs\03015208,2,6,The Duke of Shards\03015181,2,6,Commander Mar'alith\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,6,Commander Mar'alith\0302,0,0,6,Cenarion Hold\031\031ITEM,20948,STARTER,?,10,\030NPC,15206,OBJECTIVE,1,13,The Duke of Cynders\030NPC,15207,OBJECTIVE,1,13,The Duke of Fathoms\030NPC,15220,OBJECTIVE,1,13,The Duke of Zephyrs\030NPC,15208,OBJECTIVE,1,13,The Duke of Shards",[8539]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent work, $N. You're a worthy ally.\030Reinforcements have been called on to join the assault on Hive'Zora.  You have been selected to target Hive'Zora hive sisters.  Report back to Commander Mar'alith after completing your task.\030Slay 30 Hive'Zora Hive Sisters and report back to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Combat Task Briefing V in order to complete this quest.\030You have something to tell me, $C?\030Target: Hive'Zora Hive Sisters\0312,1,68,2,257,1,0\0302,71,126,2,257,1,0\0302,129,190,2,257,1,0\0303,1,99,2,384,1,0\0303,102,176,2,386,1,0\0301,1,19,4,272,1,15181\0301,21,41,4,272,1,15181\0304,1,34,3,256,2,15181\03115181,2,3,Commander Mar'alith\03015181,2,4,Commander Mar'alith\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,3,Commander Mar'alith\0302,0,0,4,Commander Mar'alith\0302,0,0,4,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,4,Silithus\031\031ITEM,21249,STARTER,?,10,\030NPC,11729,OBJECTIVE,30,13,Hive'Zora Hive Sister",[854]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031It is good to see that more of our $R allies have come to assist us from as far away as Thunder Bluff. Again, I welcome you.\030I have foreseen your arrival, young $c. Though perhaps you are not so young anymore.$B$BI think that it is time for you to move deeper into this land. I can sense that you are destined for great things.$B$BIt is the Crossroads that you must seek out, for our lives with the orcs have become intertwined and they need assistance. Continue down this road towards the east and follow it north to the Crossroads. Find Thork within its walls, he has the Earthmother's blessing.\030Speak with Thork at the Crossroads in the Barrens.\030\030Journey to the Crossroads\0312,1,39,2,257,1,3418\0302,41,84,2,257,4,3418\0302,89,150,2,257,1,3418\0302,152,202,2,257,1,3418\0302,207,328,2,259,1,3418\0302,330,408,2,257,1,3418\0302,410,472,2,257,1,3418\0303,1,50,2,384,1,3418\0301,1,102,4,272,1,3429\0301,104,124,4,272,1,3429\0313429,2,7,Thork\0303429,2,8,Thork\0312,215,1412,0,\0302,0,0,6,Crossroads\0302,0,0,8,Crossroads\0302,0,0,8,Barrens\031\031",[8540]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030The mounted division of the Cenarion Hold guard is in short supply of ornate mithril boots.  Procure a batch and deliver them immediately to Captain Vish Kozus in Cenarion Hold.\030Bring 3 Ornate Mithril Boots to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing II in order to complete this quest.\030\030Boots for the Guard\0312,1,91,2,257,1,0\0302,94,177,2,257,1,0\0303,1,94,2,384,1,0\0303,97,175,2,386,1,0\03115182,2,2,Vish Kozus\03015182,2,3,Vish Kozus\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,2,Captain Vish Kozus\0302,0,0,2,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,3,Vish Kozus\0302,0,0,3,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,3,Silithus\031\031ITEM,20939,STARTER,?,10,\030ITEM,7936,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8541]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030The Cenarion Hold guard is in short supply of grinding stones.  Procure a batch and deliver them immediately to Captain Vish Kozus in Cenarion Hold.\030Bring 10 Dense Grinding Stones, 10 Solid Grinding Stones and 10 Heavy Grinding Stones to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing III in order to complete this quest.\030\030Grinding Stones for the Guard\0312,1,62,2,257,1,0\0302,65,148,2,257,1,0\0303,1,151,2,384,1,0\0303,154,233,2,386,1,0\03115182,2,2,Vish Kozus\03015182,2,3,Vish Kozus\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,2,Captain Vish Kozus\0302,0,0,2,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,3,Vish Kozus\0302,0,0,3,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,3,Silithus\031\031ITEM,20940,STARTER,?,10,\030ITEM,12644,OBJECTIVE,10,15,\030ITEM,7966,OBJECTIVE,10,15,\030ITEM,3486,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8542]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You have my sincere gratitude. Your efforts in helping Cenarion Hold have shown true courage.\030Lok'tar, $r, I'm sure you already know that we're going to war at Ahn'Qiraj with the insects. But first the Warchief has decided that we're going to do something called 'prepare'. Though I'd rather be sharpening weapons and hammering armor into shape, I'm proud to have been chosen to be in charge of tin bar collection here. But I cannot do that without your help.$B$BSo I need you to go out and make tin bars and bring them back to me here. I think I'm going to need more than I can count.$B\030Bring 20 Tin Bars to Grunt Maug at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030The dredge strikers are a serious threat and must be dealt with quickly!\030The Horde Needs Tin Bars!\0312,1,93,2,261,3,15460\0302,95,179,2,257,3,15460\0302,181,325,2,257,1,15460\0302,327,365,2,257,1,15460\0302,370,442,2,259,1,15460\0302,444,491,2,259,3,15460\0303,1,70,2,384,1,15460\0301,1,30,4,272,1,15460\0301,32,93,4,272,1,15460\0304,1,72,3,260,1,15460\03115460,2,7,Grunt Maug\0312,0,0,1,Ahn'Qiraj\0302,0,0,7,Grunt Maug\0302,0,0,7,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,7,Orgrimmar\0318543,23,8543,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,3576,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8543]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Throm'ka, $N. You honor me and the Horde with your tin bars. I will put them on the stack and then they will come and make things from them. And then when that is all done we will go to war and show the puny Alliance how to fight the bugs.$B$BNow bring me back more tin bars!\030Very good, I see that you are serious about the war. I'm a little edgy waiting for it to start though, which means I'm going to get angry if you don't start bringing in the goods faster. Maybe I can just practice on you instead.$B$BHar! Maybe not, 'cuz then who would bring me back the tin bars?\030Bring 20 tin bars to Grunt Maug in Durotar.\030Very good, I see that you are serious about the war. I'm a little edgy waiting for it to start though, as I'm sure you are as well, $C. It will be glorious when it begins. The Horde running over the sands of the Silithus desert, weapons in hand, charging headlong into the insect masses. Great honor will be had that day by all!$B$BHar! But first we need more tin bars. Funny how such a small thing may make such a huge difference, don't you think?\030The Horde Needs More Tin Bars!\0312,1,52,2,261,1,15460\0302,54,186,2,257,4,15460\0302,188,228,2,257,4,15460\0302,233,236,2,257,1,15460\0302,238,295,2,257,4,15460\0303,1,43,2,384,1,15460\0301,1,13,4,272,1,15460\0301,15,60,4,272,1,15460\0301,62,140,4,272,3,15460\0301,142,239,4,276,3,15460\0301,244,275,4,272,1,15460\0304,1,52,3,260,1,15460\0304,54,135,3,256,1,15460\0304,137,171,3,256,3,15460\0304,173,287,3,256,1,15460\0304,289,328,3,256,3,15460\0304,333,336,3,256,1,15460\0304,338,369,3,258,1,15460\0304,371,448,3,256,2,15460\03115460,2,6,Grunt Maug\0312,0,0,6,Grunt Maug\0302,0,0,6,Durotar\0318542,19,8542,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,3576,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8544]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031From the materials you bring and from the scales of our fallen Qiraji foes I make you these pauldrons, mortal. May they grant you the protection you need and may the sight of them strike fear into our enemies.\030It is said among us that the ornate shoulder armor worn by the mortal races started as an attempt to emulate the wings of a dragon.$B$BBring me the bindings worn by the highest Qiraji leaders and I shall shape them into a set of pauldrons more dreadful than even the wings of Nefarian himself!\030Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of Night, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj.  You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.\030Have you collected the components I require?\030Conqueror's Spaulders\0312,1,131,2,257,1,15502\0302,136,293,2,257,3,15502\0303,1,116,2,384,1,15502\0303,119,208,2,384,1,15502\0301,1,110,4,272,1,15502\0301,112,209,4,278,1,15502\0304,1,44,3,256,2,15502\03111583,2,2,Nefarian\03015502,2,3,Andorgos\03015185,2,4,Brood of Nozdormu\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,3,Andorgos\0302,0,0,3,Ahn'Qiraj\0318579,19,8579,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20928,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20875,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20863,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20858,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,910,OBJECTIVE,0,16,",[8545]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This be a good start for you an me, $C. That be another twenty mithril bars that I can be puttin' on the stacks an checkin' off of the list. It all gonna be put to good use makin' the war materiel.$B$BBe makin' sure that you check back in with me 'cuz you know it be lookin' like we gonna need even more of those mithril bars.\030$C, the war it is comin' and the only thing we can do is prepare for it. That be where you and I can help each other, mon. Ya see, they put me in charge of collectin' all the mithril bars we be needin' ta build for all the things we gonna need. An I still be needin' more!$B$BSo, I be hopin' that you can get out there an mine us up some mithril, then smelt it into bars. Sound like something you can do for us?\030Bring 20 Mithril Bars to Senior Sergeant T'kelah at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030It sure would be nice to be havin' all of the mithril bars that we be needin' for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort. Is that why you be back, mon? You got my bars?\030The Horde Needs Mithril Bars!\0312,1,72,2,261,1,15469\0302,74,122,2,257,1,15469\0302,124,244,2,259,1,15469\0302,246,272,2,257,1,15469\0302,277,371,2,257,1,15469\0302,373,411,2,257,2,15469\0303,1,87,2,384,1,15469\0301,1,39,4,272,1,15469\0301,41,140,4,272,1,15469\0301,142,197,4,276,1,15469\0301,202,326,4,274,1,15469\0304,1,107,3,260,4,15469\0304,109,137,3,256,2,15469\0304,139,154,3,256,2,15469\03115469,2,7,Senior Sergeant T'kelah\0312,0,0,7,Senior Sergeant T'kelah\0302,0,0,7,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,7,Orgrimmar\0318546,23,8546,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,3860,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8546]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031That be good work $N! Another twenty bars get us that much closer to the goal, and get us more war materiel. I see to it they get put away. And if you get another stack of mithril bars mon, you make sure to be bringin' them here to me.\030Yup, I be glad you're here, mon. You helped me before, and now I need your help again. We still lookin' ta bring in more mithril bars for the war effort; gonna build lots of armor and weapons and things to go squish them bugs at Ahn'Qiraj.$B$BSo if you be a true friend, you bring me back more stacks of mithril bars. I take all you got until we hit our quota. You have some for me now?\030Bring 20 Mithril Bars to Senior Sergeant T'kelah at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030\030The Horde Needs More Mithril Bars!\0312,1,32,2,257,1,15469\0302,34,86,2,259,1,15469\0302,88,239,2,261,1,15469\0302,244,317,2,257,4,15469\0302,319,360,2,257,1,15469\0302,362,386,2,257,2,15469\0303,1,87,2,384,1,15469\0301,1,21,4,272,1,15469\0301,23,108,4,276,1,15469\0301,110,139,4,272,1,15469\0301,141,235,4,272,4,15469\03115469,2,7,Senior Sergeant T'kelah\0312,0,0,3,Ahn'Qiraj\0302,0,0,7,Senior Sergeant T'kelah\0302,0,0,7,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,7,Orgrimmar\0318545,19,8545,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,3860,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8548]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Great work, $N. Please accept this on behalf of the Cenarion Circle. You've certainly earned it, friend!\030The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show, $N.$B$BYou'd be wise to hold on to them.  As you prove your loyalty to our organization I can offer you some of the gear we reserve for our closest allies in exchange for those badges.\030Bring 5 Cenarion Combat Badges, 3 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 7 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also attain Friendly reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.\030It's in our best interest to keep our most loyal allies well geared, $N.\030Volunteer's Battlegear\0312,1,132,2,257,1,15176\0302,137,169,2,257,1,15176\0302,172,313,2,257,1,15176\0303,1,130,2,384,1,15176\0303,133,228,2,448,1,15176\0301,1,15,4,272,1,15176\0301,17,68,4,336,1,15176\0301,70,104,4,272,1,15176\0304,1,72,3,256,1,15176\03115176,2,4,Vargus\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,4,Vargus\0302,0,0,4,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,4,Silithus\031\031ITEM,20802,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20800,OBJECTIVE,3,15,\030ITEM,20801,OBJECTIVE,7,15,\030REPUTATION,609,OBJECTIVE,3000,16,",[8549]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This was no easy task, yet you have excelled. But do not be too quick to think you have impressed me, $N.\030It is said that every generation must face a defining trial. I fear the Ahn'Qiraj War will be the crucible in which our mettle is tested. So we prepare, and in so doing find what we are made of.$B$BI have volunteered to help the Horde by gathering as much peacebloom as possible, so that it can be made into potions for the war. I hope that you are here to lend me your aid. If so, then I need you to bring back to me a good quantity of the herb. Will you assist me, $c?\030Bring 20 Peacebloom to Herbalist Proudfeather at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030Go now, $C. Seek out $N.\030The Horde Needs Peacebloom!\0312,1,60,2,257,1,15477\0302,62,137,2,261,3,15477\0302,139,194,2,257,1,15477\0302,199,328,2,263,1,15477\0302,330,374,2,259,3,15477\0302,376,446,2,259,4,15477\0302,448,470,2,257,2,15477\0303,1,84,2,384,1,15477\0301,1,45,4,272,1,15477\0301,47,105,4,272,1,15477\0304,1,11,3,256,1,15477\0304,13,24,3,256,1,15477\03115477,2,8,Herbalist Proudfeather\0312,0,0,8,Herbalist Proudfeather\0302,0,0,8,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,8,Orgrimmar\0318550,23,8550,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,2447,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[855]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Nicely done. I'm sure you've struck fear into the surviving centaurs, $N. If they have sense, they'll now calm themselves and stop their advances.$B$BBut I don't think they will, and that is unfortunate.$B$BUnfortunate...for them.\030The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops.  And so, I have a bounty task for you.$B$BWhile in Kolkar territories, slay their warriors and collect centaur bracers.  Return when you have a heap of bracers and the Horde will reward you well.\030Bring 15 Centaur Bracers to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads.\030How goes your hunting, $N?\030Centaur Bracers\0312,1,105,2,261,1,3389\0302,108,144,2,257,1,3389\0302,149,225,2,257,1,3389\0302,228,301,2,257,3,3389\0303,1,70,2,384,1,3389\0301,1,12,4,272,1,3389\0301,14,73,4,280,1,3389\0301,75,146,4,272,4,3389\0301,151,203,4,272,3,3389\0301,208,230,4,272,1,3389\0304,1,26,3,256,2,3389\03193,2,3,Centaur\03093,2,5,Centaur\0303389,2,5,Regthar Deathgate\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,1,Horde's\0302,0,0,1,Barrens\0302,0,0,3,Kolkar\0302,0,0,5,Regthar Deathgate\0302,0,0,5,Crossroads\031\031ITEM,5030,OBJECTIVE,15,15,",[8550]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you for your continued efforts, $N. You bring great honor to yourself and your ancestors with your selfless giving, and it will be known to all! I will store these herbs away so that they stay fresh until they are needed. Once again you reveal the truest spirit of the Horde, the struggle to overcome and the promise that we can work together to do so.\030Hello again, Abyssmal. I am glad that you wish to speak to me once more concerning our neverending need for peacebloom. The war effort continues, and with it our production of potions and elixirs to aid in the battles to come. Will you help us again, $C? I am in need of the same amount of peacebloom as before, so if you can gather it up and return it to me here I would be most grateful. Of course, if you already have it on your person, I will be more than happy to accept it from you now\030Bring 20 Peacebloom to Herbalist Proudfeather at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030\030The Horde Needs Peacebloom!\0312,1,22,2,257,1,15477\0302,24,119,2,259,3,15477\0302,121,226,2,261,1,15477\0302,228,254,2,257,2,15477\0302,256,389,2,259,4,15477\0302,391,491,2,257,4,15477\0303,1,84,2,384,1,15477\0301,1,41,4,272,1,15477\0301,43,150,4,272,3,15477\0301,152,227,4,274,3,15477\0301,229,358,4,272,1,15477\03115477,2,7,Herbalist Proudfeather\0312,0,0,7,Herbalist Proudfeather\0302,0,0,7,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,7,Orgrimmar\0318549,19,8549,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,2447,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8551]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You found it! Oh happy day, this is! Thank you, $N. Getting back my chest cools some of the fire in me.$B$BBut my revenge isn't complete...\030I used to sail a ship from here all the way to Ratchet, in Kalimdor.  I was a successful captain with a sterling reputation.$B$BUntil...$B$BThose cursed sea giants ruined me!  They smashed my ship, killed my crew, and set me on a lifeboat to Booty Bay.  And one of the giants, Gorlash, stole my Captain's Chest.  He said he wanted it for a snuffbox.  The nerve!$B$BI hear Gorlash wanders the coast east of here.  Find him and get back my chest!  Do that, and you'll have earned a captain's gratitude.\030Bring Smotts' Chest to Hecklebury Smotts in Booty Bay.\030Ahoy, $N! Did you find Gorlash? That chest was my favorite, and it has a hidden compartment that held my greatest treasures!\030The Captain's Chest\0312,1,68,2,257,1,2500\0302,71,124,2,257,1,2500\0302,129,136,2,257,1,2500\0302,141,174,2,261,1,2500\0302,177,252,2,257,1,2500\0302,255,311,2,257,1,2500\0302,314,349,2,257,1,2500\0302,352,361,2,257,1,2500\0302,366,411,2,257,1,2500\0302,414,444,2,257,1,2500\0302,447,500,2,257,1,2500\0303,1,54,2,384,1,2500\0301,1,13,4,272,1,2500\0301,15,36,4,272,1,2500\0301,38,51,4,272,1,2500\0301,53,103,4,272,1,2500\0301,108,139,4,274,1,2500\0304,1,9,3,256,1,2500\0304,11,31,3,256,2,2500\0304,33,124,3,256,1,2500\0311492,2,6,Gorlash\0301492,2,9,Gorlash\0301492,3,19,Gorlash\0312,33,1434,0,\0302,0,0,1,Ratchet\0302,0,0,1,Kalimdor\0302,0,0,5,Booty Bay\0302,0,0,12,Hecklebury Smotts\0302,0,0,12,Booty Bay\031\031ITEM,3932,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8552]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You recovered my sash? Then... you must have killed Mok'rash the sea giant! Hooray!$B$BI'm glad the scurvy villain's dead - Mok'rash was one of three sea giants who smashed my ships and killed my crew.$B$BThree times.$B$BYou are a $C of worth, $N.\030This fine sash has the letters \"HS\" embroidered along its hem.\030Return the Monogrammed Sash to its owner.\030Hello. Do you have business with me?\030The Monogrammed Sash\0312,1,62,2,257,1,0\0303,1,41,2,384,1,0\0301,1,22,4,272,2,2500\0301,24,30,4,272,1,2500\0301,32,75,4,272,1,2500\0301,77,83,4,272,1,2500\0301,88,201,4,272,1,2500\0301,206,217,4,272,1,2500\0301,222,247,4,272,1,2500\0304,1,6,3,256,1,2500\0304,8,36,3,256,2,2500\0311493,4,5,Mok'rash\03090,4,5,Sea Giant\0301493,4,7,Mok'rash\0312,33,1434,0,\031\031ITEM,3985,STARTER,?,10,",[8553]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Hello hello, $N. Captain told me you're going after Negolash, eh?\030After I lost my first ship to those giants, I bought another.  Named Smotts' Revenge, I filled it with supplies and crew, and set out to find the villains.  I found them, but...they beat me.  They smashed Smotts' Revenge, killed my second crew and set me on another lifeboat.$B$BThis time another of the giants, Negolash, stole my cutlass.$B$BFace Negolash and bring me my cutlass!$B$BSpeak with Sprogger.  He was my cook on the Smotts' Revenge, and survived the last attack.  He can help you find the giant.\030Speak with Sprogger.\030\030The Captain's Cutlass\0312,1,61,2,261,1,2500\0302,64,155,2,259,1,2500\0302,158,190,2,257,1,2500\0302,193,275,2,259,1,2500\0302,280,339,2,257,1,2500\0302,344,381,2,257,1,2500\0302,386,405,2,257,1,2500\0302,408,475,2,263,1,2500\0302,478,508,2,257,1,2500\0303,1,20,2,384,1,2500\0301,1,16,4,272,1,2594\0301,18,65,4,272,2,2594\0311494,2,5,Negolash\0301494,2,6,Negolash\0302594,2,7,Sprogger\0302594,2,10,Sprogger\0301494,4,12,Negolash\0312,33,1434,0,\0318552,19,8552,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308554,23,8554,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8554]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You got my cutlass from Negolash! I can't believe my fortune, $N! Meeting you has turned my luck to the better, make no mistake there!$B$BThank you! And if I ever get a new ship and you're looking to sail the seas, you would be my honored guest.\030Negolash is a hungry giant.$B$BWhen the giants destroyed our ship, Negolash went straight for my kitchen.  He wasn't hungry for crew like the other giants.  Negolash wanted wine...and my Barbecued Buzzard Wings.  They're my specialty, and I had to go all the way to the Badlands for the recipe!$B$BIf you want to lure the giant, then get some wine and a heap of buzzard wings.  Put them in our old lifeboat, southeast of here along the coast.  When Negolash smells all that food, he'll come for sure!\030Bring 10 Barbecued Buzzard Wings and 5 bottles of Junglevine Wine to Captain Smotts' Lifeboat.$B$BKill Negolash, and bring Smotts' Cutlass to Captain Smotts in Stranglethorn.\030Did you get my cutlass, $N?\030Facing Negolash\0312,1,27,2,257,1,2594\0302,32,105,2,261,1,2594\0302,108,155,2,257,1,2594\0302,158,211,2,257,1,2594\0302,214,294,2,257,1,2594\0302,299,376,2,259,4,2594\0302,379,442,2,257,1,2594\0302,445,500,2,257,1,2594\0303,1,94,2,384,1,2594\0303,99,174,2,384,1,2594\0301,1,33,4,272,1,2500\0301,35,65,4,272,4,2500\0301,67,134,4,272,1,2500\0301,139,148,4,272,1,2500\0301,150,245,4,272,4,2500\0304,1,27,3,256,2,2500\0311494,2,1,Negolash\0301494,2,2,Negolash\0301494,2,4,Negolash\0302830,2,4,Buzzard\0302830,2,6,Buzzard\0301494,2,8,Negolash\0302830,2,9,Buzzard\0301494,2,10,Negolash\0301494,4,11,Negolash\0312,33,1434,0,\0302,0,0,5,Badlands\0302,0,0,9,Captain Smotts' Lifeboat\0302,0,0,10,Captain Smotts\0302,0,0,10,Stranglethorn\0304,0,0,11,Negolash\0318553,19,8553,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,3935,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8555]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Eranikus, Vaelastrasz, and Azuregos... No doubt you know of these dragons, mortal. It is no coincidence, then, that they have played such influential roles as watchers of our world.$B$BUnfortunately (and my own naivety is partially to blame) whether by agents of the Old Gods or betrayal by those that would call them friend, each guardian has fallen to tragedy. The extent of which has fueled my own distrust towards your kind.$B$BSeek them out... And $R, prepare yourself for the worst.\030\030\030\030The Charge of the Dragonflights\0311,1,38,4,272,1,15192\0301,40,82,4,272,1,15192\0301,84,181,4,272,1,15192\0301,186,362,4,336,4,15192\0301,364,428,4,272,1,15192\0301,433,448,4,272,1,15192\0301,450,488,4,272,1,15192\03110538,4,1,Vaelastrasz\0306109,4,1,Azuregos\0312,440,1446,0,\0318519,19,8519,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308730,23,8730,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8556]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I will swap the gem on the ring for you. You'll find the effect is much more... agreeable.\030The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities.  The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings.$B$BThe gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior.$B$BBring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you, $c.\030Bring 1 Qiraji Magisterial Ring, 2 Lambent Idols, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Windcaller Yessendra in Silithus.  You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.\030Did you bring me the ring and materials, $N?\030Signet of Unyielding Strength\0312,1,88,2,257,1,15498\0302,91,227,2,261,4,15498\0302,232,316,2,257,4,15498\0302,321,392,2,257,1,15498\0303,1,123,2,384,1,15498\0303,126,209,2,448,1,15498\0301,1,40,4,272,3,15498\0301,42,79,4,272,1,15498\0301,81,90,4,272,1,15498\0304,1,44,3,256,2,15498\03115498,2,5,Windcaller Yessendra\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,5,Windcaller Yessendra\0302,0,0,5,Silithus\031\031ITEM,20884,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20868,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20861,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20865,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,609,OBJECTIVE,9000,16,",[8557]="PARTIAL\031consequences,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah yes... this drape is immaculate.$B$BTake this cloak, $N. May it protect you from the foul magic of the Qiraji.\030I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, $N.  I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, $c.$B$BI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course.  I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.$B$BI promise you won't be disappointed.\030Bring 1 Qiraji Martial Drape, 2 Onyx Idols, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus.  You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.\030Did you bring the materials for the cloak, $N?\030Drape of Unyielding Strength\0312,1,65,2,261,1,15500\0302,68,160,2,261,1,15500\0302,165,229,2,259,3,15500\0302,232,306,2,259,1,15500\0302,311,346,2,257,1,15500\0303,1,110,2,384,1,15500\0303,113,196,2,448,1,15500\0301,1,9,4,272,1,15500\0301,11,35,4,272,1,15500\0301,40,59,4,272,1,15500\0301,61,113,4,284,1,15500\0304,1,46,3,256,2,15500\03115500,2,6,Keyl Swiftclaw\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,6,Keyl Swiftclaw\0302,0,0,6,Silithus\031\031ITEM,20885,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20867,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20864,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20860,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,609,OBJECTIVE,21000,16,",[8558]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've done well, $C. This is a masterwork hilt... the balance is perfect.$B$BTake your weapon, $N. Wield it with great confidence and vanquish our enemies!\030The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong.$B$BJust the sight of Qiraji artifacts fills me with an urge to practice my craft with their shattered and smelted pieces.  Prove your allegiance to the Circle, $N, and I will make you a powerful weapon from the finest Qiraji materials.\030Bring 1 Qiraji Spiked Hilt, 2  Alabaster Idols, 5 Crystal Scarabs and 5 Stone Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus.  You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest.\030Did you bring me the components I require, $N?\030Sickle of Unyielding Strength\0312,1,184,2,321,1,15499\0302,189,306,2,257,1,15499\0302,309,420,2,257,3,15499\0303,1,113,2,384,1,15499\0303,116,199,2,448,1,15499\0301,1,21,4,272,1,15499\0301,23,50,4,272,1,15499\0301,52,74,4,280,1,15499\0301,79,99,4,272,1,15499\0301,101,156,4,276,1,15499\0304,1,46,3,256,2,15499\03115499,2,4,Warden Haro\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,3,Circle\0302,0,0,4,Warden Haro\0302,0,0,4,Silithus\031\031ITEM,20886,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20873,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20862,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20858,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,609,OBJECTIVE,42000,16,",[8559]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've done well, $N. You've proven you're no ordinary mortal.$B$BI give you these with the confidence they'll aid you in crushing the vile qiraji.\030Qiraji magic is strong and ancient.  The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon.$B$BBring me the qiraji bindings of command and other minor components by and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you.$B$BYou will find them useful in the fight against the enemy.\030Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of War, 5 Ivory Scarabs and 5 Gold Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj.  This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.\030You've acquired the items I requested, $N?\030Conqueror's Greaves\0312,1,35,2,321,1,15503\0302,38,124,2,257,4,15503\0302,129,246,2,257,1,15503\0302,251,307,2,261,3,15503\0303,1,118,2,388,1,15503\0303,121,188,2,384,1,15503\0301,1,21,4,272,1,15503\0301,23,62,4,272,1,15503\0301,67,147,4,272,1,15503\0304,1,42,3,256,2,15503\03115503,2,5,Kandrostrasz\03015185,2,6,Brood of Nozdormu\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,5,Kandrostrasz\0302,0,0,5,Ahn'Qiraj\0318579,19,8579,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20928,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20882,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20865,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20859,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,910,OBJECTIVE,0,16,",[8560]="PARTIAL\031stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Yes... the worm's hide will make for an excellent protective layer. Combined with the strongest parts from the Qiraji we've destroyed on our way here, this should make for a formidable piece of armor. May it aid you in facing the unspeakable horrors that await inside!\030You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal?  Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance.$B$BThe ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power.  He is rumored to have been created by the Old God himself as a mockery of life.$B$BHis skin is unnatural... thick, nearly impregnable, yet it's flexible and allows him to move with the speed and grace of a much smaller creature.$B$BBring me a sample of his skin along with other minor components and I shall craft you leggings of great power.\030Bring Ouro's Intact Hide, 2 Idols of Death, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.\030Did you bring the components I require, $N?\030Conqueror's Legguards\0312,1,48,2,259,2,15503\0302,51,100,2,257,4,15503\0302,105,162,2,321,1,15503\0302,165,243,2,257,1,15503\0302,248,271,2,257,1,15503\0302,273,392,2,257,1,15503\0302,397,506,2,257,3,15503\0303,1,114,2,384,1,15503\0303,116,206,2,384,1,15503\0301,1,6,4,272,1,15503\0301,8,67,4,272,3,15503\0301,69,200,4,308,1,15503\0301,202,268,4,272,1,15503\0304,1,43,3,256,2,15503\03117075,2,3,Sandworm\03015517,2,3,Ouro\03015503,2,8,Kandrostrasz\03015185,2,9,Brood of Nozdormu\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,8,Kandrostrasz\0304,0,0,12,Qiraji\0318579,19,8579,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20927,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20876,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20861,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20865,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,910,OBJECTIVE,3000,16,",[8561]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've succeeded! The whispers from the Twin Emperors have ceased.$B$BTake this as a reward. The mere sight of it will strike fear in the hearts of the Qiraji... it shall remind them of their fallen leaders and of the mortal that slew them.\030The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity.  They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos.$B$BIn my visions I see their monstrous faces adorned by powerful crowns.  But I will have my revenge... I will transmute these symbols of Qiraji power to ones better suited to our needs.$B$BBring me the components I require, $N.  I will give you a headpiece of unmatched power.\030Bring Vek'nilash's Circlet, 2 Idols of the Sun, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj.  You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.\030Did you bring me the components I asked for, $N?\030Conqueror's Crown\0312,1,20,2,257,1,15502\0302,22,84,2,257,1,15502\0302,87,174,2,267,1,15502\0302,179,247,2,257,1,15502\0302,250,278,2,259,3,15502\0302,280,361,2,259,3,15502\0302,366,403,2,257,1,15502\0302,406,452,2,257,3,15502\0303,1,111,2,384,1,15502\0303,114,204,2,384,1,15502\0301,1,17,4,272,1,15502\0301,19,66,4,272,1,15502\0301,71,92,4,272,1,15502\0301,94,161,4,272,3,15502\0301,163,240,4,272,3,15502\0304,1,48,3,256,2,15502\03115380,2,3,Arygos\03015502,2,9,Andorgos\03015185,2,10,Brood of Nozdormu\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,9,Andorgos\0302,0,0,9,Ahn'Qiraj\0304,0,0,12,Twin Emperors\0318579,19,8579,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20926,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20874,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20862,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20858,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,910,OBJECTIVE,3000,16,",[8562]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I did not expect you to return from your attempt, $N.$B$BYou've fulfilled a destiny greater than that of most immortal beings.$B$BBy slaying C'Thun you've not only saved all of Azeroth, you've also tipped the scales of cosmic events beyond your comprehension.$B$BAccept this breastplate as a symbol of the glory and burden that will come as a consequence of your actions.$B$BMay its power aid you in the challenges that await you, god-slayer!\030The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj.  The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power.$B$BWhen the stars are favorable, he will lash out against all living beings with terrible wrath.  You must find him before then and find a way to bring his existence to an end.$B$BDo this and bring me a piece of his husk.  I shall grant you armor no mortal has ever worn... armor fit for one who has slain a god!\030Bring the the Carapace of the Old God, 2 Idols of War, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj.  You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.\030At his dwelling in Ahn'Qiraj, dread C'Thun awaits in slumber.\030Conqueror's Breastplate\0312,1,76,2,257,1,15504\0302,79,189,2,257,4,15504\0302,194,286,2,257,3,15504\0302,289,366,2,257,1,15504\0302,371,411,2,257,1,15504\0302,414,463,2,257,3,15504\0302,465,502,2,261,1,15504\0303,1,120,2,388,1,15504\0303,123,212,2,384,1,15504\0301,1,53,4,272,1,15504\0301,58,126,4,272,1,15504\0301,131,259,4,272,1,15504\0301,264,371,4,272,3,15504\0301,376,442,4,272,1,15504\0304,1,61,3,256,1,15504\03115504,2,8,Vethsera\03015185,2,9,Brood of Nozdormu\03015727,4,12,C'Thun\03015727,3,15,C'Thun\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,8,Vethsera\0303,0,0,15,Ahn'Qiraj\0318579,19,8579,N