flict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030Ah, yes! Of course we wouldn't forget about your past accomplishments in Warsong Gulch.\030\030\030Past Efforts in Warsong Gulch\0312,1,8,2,257,1,0\0302,10,87,2,257,1,0\031\0312,3277,1460,0,\0302,0,0,2,Warsong Gulch\031\031ITEM,20256,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[857]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031At last, the power is mine again! Mine I say!\030The power was mine! In my very hands! And I want it back! Back I say!$B$BThose dirty excavators uncovered it... so beautiful it was. Deemed the Tear of the Moons, it was the first great discovery we made at Bael Modan.$B$BIt should have been mine! Mine I say!$B$BGeneral Twinbraid grew jealous of the power it gave me. He locked it away in the Keep. Called it cursed, he did! The fool!$B$BOthers wanted it and they had to be stopped! That bastard Twinbraid drove me off.$B$BNow I want it back. Back I say!\030Feegly the Exiled wants you to retrieve for him the Tear of the Moons.\030Where is the Tear of the Moons? I need it now! Need I say!\030The Tear of the Moons\0312,1,19,2,257,1,3421\0302,21,37,2,257,1,3421\0302,39,57,2,259,1,3421\0302,59,69,2,257,1,3421\0302,74,111,2,257,1,3421\0302,113,132,2,257,1,3421\0302,134,218,2,257,1,3421\0302,223,247,2,257,1,3421\0302,249,259,2,257,1,3421\0302,264,318,2,257,1,3421\0302,320,349,2,257,1,3421\0302,351,375,2,261,1,3421\0302,377,385,2,257,1,3421\0302,390,433,2,257,1,3421\0302,435,470,2,257,1,3421\0302,475,493,2,259,1,3421\0302,495,505,2,257,1,3421\0303,1,70,2,386,1,3421\0301,1,33,4,272,1,3421\0301,35,45,4,272,1,3421\0304,1,31,3,256,2,3421\0304,33,46,3,258,1,3421\0304,48,58,3,256,1,3421\0313414,2,10,General Twinbraid\0303421,2,18,Feegly the Exiled\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,7,Bael Modan\0302,0,0,11,Keep\031\031ITEM,5038,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8570]="PARTIAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030Ah, yes! Of course we wouldn't forget about your past accomplishments in Warsong Gulch.\030\030\030Past Efforts in Warsong Gulch\0312,1,8,2,257,1,0\0302,10,87,2,257,1,0\031\0312,3277,1460,0,\0302,0,0,2,Warsong Gulch\031\031ITEM,20256,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8572]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Great work, $n. Please accept this on behalf of the Cenarion Circle. You've certainly earned it, friend!\030The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show, $N.$B$BYou'd be wise to hold on to them.  As you prove your loyalty to our organization I can offer you some of the gear we reserve for our closest allies in exchange for those badges.\030Bring 7 Cenarion Combat Badges, 4 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 4 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also attain Honored reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.$B\030It's in our best interest to keep our most loyal allies well geared, $N.$B\030Veteran's Battlegear\0312,1,132,2,257,1,15176\0302,137,169,2,257,1,15176\0302,172,313,2,257,1,15176\0303,1,130,2,384,1,15176\0303,133,227,2,448,1,15176\0301,1,15,4,272,1,15176\0301,17,68,4,336,1,15176\0301,70,104,4,272,1,15176\0304,1,72,3,256,1,15176\03115176,2,4,Vargus\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,4,Vargus\0302,0,0,4,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,4,Silithus\031\031ITEM,20802,OBJECTIVE,7,15,\030ITEM,20800,OBJECTIVE,4,15,\030ITEM,20801,OBJECTIVE,4,15,\030REPUTATION,609,OBJECTIVE,9000,16,",[8573]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Great work, $N. Please accept this on behalf of the Cenarion Circle. You've certainly earned it, friend!\030The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show, $N.$B$BYou'd be wise to hold on to them.  As you prove your loyalty to our organization I can offer you some of the gear we reserve for our closest allies in exchange for those badges.\030Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 20 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Cenarius to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.$B\030It's in our best interest to keep our most loyal allies well geared, $N.\030Champion's Battlegear\0312,1,132,2,257,1,15176\0302,137,169,2,257,1,15176\0302,172,313,2,257,1,15176\0303,1,153,2,384,1,15176\0303,156,250,2,448,1,15176\0301,1,15,4,272,1,15176\0301,17,68,4,336,1,15176\0301,70,104,4,272,1,15176\0304,1,72,3,256,1,15176\031795,2,4,Mark\03015176,2,4,Vargus\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,4,Vargus\0302,0,0,4,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,4,Silithus\031\031ITEM,20802,OBJECTIVE,15,15,\030ITEM,20800,OBJECTIVE,20,15,\030ITEM,20801,OBJECTIVE,20,15,\030ITEM,21508,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030REPUTATION,609,OBJECTIVE,42000,16,",[8574]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Great work, $n. Please accept this on behalf of the Cenarion Circle. You've certainly earned it, friend!\030The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Windcaller Proudhorn are more than just for show, $N.$B$BYou'd be wise to hold on to them.  As you prove your loyalty to our organization I can offer you some of the gear we reserve for our closest allies in exchange for those badges.\030Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 17 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Remulos to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also attain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest.\030It's in our best interest to keep our most loyal allies well geared, $N.\030Stalwart's Battlegear\0312,1,139,2,257,1,15176\0302,144,176,2,257,1,15176\0302,179,320,2,257,1,15176\0303,1,152,2,384,1,15176\0303,155,249,2,448,1,15176\0301,1,15,4,272,1,15176\0301,17,68,4,336,1,15176\0301,70,104,4,272,1,15176\0304,1,72,3,256,1,15176\03115191,2,1,Windcaller Proudhorn\030795,2,4,Mark\03015176,2,4,Vargus\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,4,Vargus\0302,0,0,4,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,4,Silithus\0318800,19,8800,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20802,OBJECTIVE,15,15,\030ITEM,20800,OBJECTIVE,20,15,\030ITEM,20801,OBJECTIVE,17,15,\030ITEM,21515,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030REPUTATION,609,OBJECTIVE,21000,16,",[8575]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031<Narain eagerly examines the letter.>$B$BOutstanding, $R! What is it? I can't read a lick of Draconic.\030You cannot understand a single word on this ledger. You don't even know what language it is written in!\030Deliver Azuregos's Magical Ledger to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.\030Ooooh! Magical pulsing thingy! For me?\030Azuregos's Magical Ledger\0312,1,51,2,257,1,0\0302,53,103,2,257,1,0\0303,1,66,2,384,1,0\0301,1,37,4,272,1,11811\0301,42,57,4,272,1,11811\0301,59,69,4,272,2,11811\0301,71,102,4,272,1,11811\0304,1,6,3,256,1,11811\0304,8,30,3,256,1,11811\0304,32,38,3,256,2,11811\03111811,2,3,Narain Soothfancy\0312,16,1447,0,\0302,0,0,3,Narain Soothfancy\0302,0,0,3,Tanaris\0318576,23,8576,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20949,STARTER,?,10,",[8576]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031First things first, $N! We need to figure out what Azuregos wrote in this ledger.$B$BYou say that he's told you to make an arcanite buoy and that this is the schematic? Strange that he would write this in Draconic. That old goat knows I can't read this nonsense.$B$BIf this is going to work, I'm going to need my scrying goggles, a five hundred pound chicken and volume II of \"Draconic for Dummies.\" Not necessarily in that order.\030\030\030\030Translating the Ledger\0311,1,23,4,272,1,11811\0301,25,81,4,274,1,11811\0301,86,168,4,272,2,11811\0301,170,214,4,272,4,11811\0301,216,262,4,272,1,11811\0301,267,430,4,274,4,11811\0316109,4,2,Azuregos\030620,4,6,Chicken\0312,440,1446,0,\0304,0,0,4,Draconic\0318575,19,8575,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8577]="PARTIAL\031consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I can't believe he found me. I thought for sure that I'd lost him when I was in the Outland. I'm not going back there, $R! No way, no how! I'm through being his part time best friend forever and full time slave.\030If I am to translate anything, I will need my scrying goggles. Unfortunately, those were stolen quite some time ago by my ex-best friend forever, Stewvul. He broke my heart in five places and then left me here to rot.$B$BWith the help of my trusty crystal ball, I've isolated his whereabouts to either the Greymane Wall in Silverpine or what appears to be a portal world in the Outland that is currently being overrun by the Burning Legion. You're going to have to track him down and get my goggles back, $N!\030Narain Soothfancy wants you to find his ex-best friend forever (BFF), Stewvul, and take back the scrying goggles that Stewvul stole from him.\030\030Stewvul, Ex-B.F.F.\0312,1,62,2,259,4,11811\0302,64,154,2,261,1,11811\0302,156,217,2,257,1,11811\0302,222,440,2,321,1,11811\0302,442,508,2,257,3,11811\0303,1,141,2,386,1,11811\0301,1,28,4,272,4,0\0301,30,92,4,276,1,0\0301,94,122,4,272,1,0\0301,124,138,4,272,1,0\0301,140,211,4,272,1,0\03115506,2,2,Stewvul\03011811,2,6,Narain Soothfancy\03015506,2,6,Stewvul\03010116,4,11,Slave\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,4,Silverpine\0302,0,0,4,Outland\0304,0,0,8,Outland\0318576,19,8576,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308578,23,8578,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,180642,FINISHER,?,12,Inconspicuous Crate",[8578]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Outstanding! Now where did I put that 500 pound chicken and Volume II of \"Draconic For Dummies???\" Oh, and here's a little something for all your hard work!\030<You hear a sigh of relief escape the crate.>$B$BYou just want his scrying goggles? Great! That will be no problem... Just give me a minute to... Hey! Where the... Dagnabbit!$B$BWell, there's some bad news and some worse news. The bad news is that I lost the goggles. The worse news is that I lost them when I was nosing around in the Molten Core last month. Yep, the Molten Core... I guess that concludes our business! Bye!\030Find Narain's Scrying Goggles and return them to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.\030The Molten Core, eh? I hope my goggles are still in one piece!\030Scrying Goggles? No Problem!\0312,1,45,2,257,1,0\0302,50,83,2,259,2,0\0302,85,90,2,257,1,0\0302,92,117,2,261,3,0\0302,119,145,2,257,1,0\0302,147,150,2,257,1,0\0302,152,163,2,257,1,0\0302,165,174,2,257,1,0\0302,179,226,2,257,1,0\0302,228,267,2,261,1,0\0302,269,358,2,261,1,0\0302,360,382,2,257,1,0\0302,384,419,2,257,1,0\0302,421,424,2,257,1,0\0303,1,78,2,384,1,0\0301,1,12,4,272,1,11811\0301,14,156,4,272,2,11811\0304,1,20,3,256,2,11811\0304,22,62,3,258,3,11811\03111811,2,15,Narain Soothfancy\030620,4,17,Chicken\0312,2717,0,0,\0302,0,0,11,Molten Core\0302,0,0,15,Narain Soothfancy\0302,0,0,15,Tanaris\0318577,19,8577,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,180642,GIVER,?,9,Inconspicuous Crate\030ITEM,20951,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8579]="PARTIAL\031consequences,objectives,questChains,setup\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I see that you're no ordinary mortal, $n. Your chances against the Old God, however infinitely small, are greater than ours at this point. After all, while he expects dragons at his doorstep, he is not prepared for someone like you.$b$bJust as Anachronos and Staghelm defeated the Qiraji a thousand years ago through the alliance of mortal and dragon races, we too shall form a pact. Gain the trust of the Bronze Dragonflight and you'll gain our trust. Only then we shall make a true champion out of you.\030\030\030We sense the presence of our enslaved brethren deeper inside Ahn'Qiraj; yet not even an army of dragons would be enough to rescue them, $r.$b$bThe same spell that imprisoned them would place us firmly under C'Thun's control should we come any closer to him.$b$bThe Old God has foreseen our arrival. All hope is lost. What difference could a mere mortal like you possibly make?\030Mortal Champions\0311,1,41,4,272,1,15503\0301,43,138,4,272,1,15503\0301,140,232,4,272,1,15503\0301,237,383,4,336,3,15503\0301,385,452,4,272,1,15503\0301,454,504,4,272,3,15503\0304,1,139,3,266,4,15503\0304,144,257,3,260,4,15503\0304,262,298,3,256,1,15503\0304,300,316,3,262,3,15503\0304,318,376,3,256,4,15503\03115192,4,4,Anachronos\0312,3428,0,0,\031\031ITEM,21229,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[858]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Yep, this looks like the right key. Let me just make sure I know how to work this thing...$B$BHmm... rotation control... This regulates speed and stability... fine arm movement control. Just look at this! I can't believe the Venture Company could design something this much better than ours. I've got to get this back to Ratchet!\030I don't suppose Sputtervalve sent you? I'm in a bind here. I hopped in without realizing that I need a key to unlock the shredder's movement column. One of the other shredder operators asked me if everything was okay, and I panicked! Instead of telling him that I was missing my key, I told him there was some sort of mechanical problem.$B$BWe need to get out of here on the double! Go up to the control room at the top of the derrick, the supervisor should have a key for this shredder.$B$BHelp me out here!\030Get the Ignition Key and bring it to Wizzlecrank.\030Quick, we need to get out of here before someone gets suspicious!\030Ignition\0312,1,38,2,257,2,3439\0302,40,58,2,257,1,3439\0302,60,148,2,259,1,3439\0302,150,233,2,257,4,3439\0302,235,337,2,261,1,3439\0302,342,382,2,259,1,3439\0302,384,487,2,257,1,3439\0302,492,508,2,257,1,3439\0303,1,49,2,384,1,3439\0301,1,35,4,272,1,3439\0301,37,90,4,272,1,3439\0301,95,100,4,272,1,3439\0301,102,120,4,272,1,3439\0301,122,158,4,272,1,3439\0301,160,185,4,272,1,3439\0301,187,204,4,272,1,3439\0301,206,291,4,272,4,3439\0301,293,329,4,272,1,3439\0304,1,65,3,258,1,3439\0313442,2,1,Sputtervalve\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,9,Wizzlecrank\0304,0,0,18,Ratchet\031863,23,863,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5050,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8580]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Cross your fingers, friend! Here's to hoping we can save Noggle!\030Hey, $c. Ya you, mon! There be a whole mess of firebloom the Horde thinkin' they need for this Ahn'Qiraj war effort. Maybe they put it in nice things that go boom? Maybe they give it to the Alliance as fuel for their steam tanks? Who knows? Not Pele'keiki!$B$BPele'keiki know this though... he know you gonna help him out and bring back lots of the firebloom, right, mon?\030Bring 20 Firebloom to Batrider Pele'keiki at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030Are you done collecting those samples? We could lose Noggle any minute now!\030The Horde Needs Firebloom!\0312,1,8,2,257,1,15508\0302,10,21,2,257,1,15508\0302,23,116,2,263,1,15508\0302,118,163,2,257,4,15508\0302,165,229,2,257,4,15508\0302,231,240,2,257,2,15508\0302,242,256,2,257,1,15508\0302,261,290,2,257,1,15508\0302,292,371,2,257,2,15508\0303,1,80,2,384,1,15508\0301,1,27,4,272,1,15508\0301,29,64,4,280,1,15508\0304,1,38,3,256,2,15508\0304,40,75,3,256,4,15508\03115508,2,10,Batrider Pele'keiki\0312,0,0,5,Alliance\0302,0,0,10,Batrider Pele'keiki\0302,0,0,10,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,10,Orgrimmar\0318581,23,8581,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4625,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8581]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This no joke, $C? You bring Pele'keiki firebloom that fast? Pele'keiki count them up right now, mon! You makin' Pele'keiki so happy, he be tellin' everyone, $N best firebloom collector ever! Pele'keiki can't wait for war to start. Now we really light up the sky over Silithus, right, bruddah?!\030Pele'keiki know you come to help. Bring many firebloom and make him very happy. Pele'keiki might make big bombs with firebloom. Drop them on insects from his bat over Ahn'Qiraj when war come. But Pele'keiki need more firebloom, $C!$B$BYou gonna bring Pele'keiki that firebloom, real quick now. Come back with at least as much as last time, and Pele'keiki be pleased.\030Bring 20 Firebloom to Batrider Pele'keiki at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030\030The Horde Needs More Firebloom!\0312,1,33,2,257,1,15508\0302,35,79,2,257,1,15508\0302,81,127,2,257,4,15508\0302,129,191,2,261,1,15508\0302,193,231,2,259,1,15508\0302,236,293,2,257,1,15508\0302,295,366,2,257,1,15508\0303,1,80,2,384,1,15508\0301,1,17,4,272,2,15508\0301,19,59,4,272,2,15508\0301,61,100,4,272,1,15508\0301,102,190,4,272,1,15508\0301,192,230,4,276,1,15508\0301,232,293,4,272,2,15508\03115508,2,8,Batrider Pele'keiki\0312,0,0,8,Batrider Pele'keiki\0302,0,0,8,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,8,Orgrimmar\0318580,19,8580,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4625,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8582]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031A commendable effort, $c. I will measure these specimens for their appropriate usage and note your contribution. The purple lotus will then need to be properly stored until I am ready for them. As for you, if you are still available I should imagine that I'll still need more purple lotus. Please check back with me in a moment.\030The purple lotus, $c, is a reagent in a great many potions, elixirs and oils, some of which will be of use to us at Ahn'Qiraj. We're going to need to create an immense number of those potions for the war effort. And I'm going to experiment to find more uses for the lotus as well. But to do all of that I'm going to need a great quantity of the flower.$B$BThat's where you come in. Go out into the field and collect up as many purple lotuses as you can. Is this something that you are willing to do for us?\030Bring 20 Purple Lotus to Apothecary Jezel at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030Returned already with the purple lotus that I have requested, $c? It is critical that you do so in as timely as fashion as possible lest all that I am attempting here come to naught.\030The Horde Needs Purple Lotus!\0312,1,126,2,257,3,15512\0302,128,211,2,263,3,15512\0302,213,280,2,257,3,15512\0302,282,352,2,259,3,15512\0302,357,381,2,257,1,15512\0302,383,453,2,257,1,15512\0302,455,506,2,257,2,15512\0303,1,80,2,384,1,15512\0301,1,25,4,272,1,15512\0301,27,112,4,272,3,15512\0301,114,193,4,274,3,15512\0301,195,289,4,274,4,15512\0301,291,328,4,272,1,15512\0304,1,65,3,256,2,15512\0304,67,182,3,256,1,15512\03115512,2,8,Apothecary Jezel\0312,0,0,1,Ahn'Qiraj\0302,0,0,8,Apothecary Jezel\0302,0,0,8,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,8,Orgrimmar\0318583,23,8583,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,8831,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8583]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent and precise work, $N. Your diligence is to be commended, as is your celerity. I will personally see to it that none of these purple lotus go to waste.$B$BThank you again, and should you come by more purple lotus do not hesitate to bring them to me with utmost haste.\030In fact it does appear that we are in need of even more purple lotus, $C. While my own studies have yet to determine a new useful application for the herb, there are tried and true methodologies yet to be employed.$B$BI need you to once again go out into the field and collect at least twenty purple lotus samples. Return them to me here.\030Bring 20 Purple Lotus to Apothecary Jezel at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030\030The Horde Needs More Purple Lotus!\0312,1,73,2,259,1,15512\0302,75,214,2,257,1,15512\0302,219,314,2,259,1,15512\0302,316,338,2,257,1,15512\0303,1,80,2,384,1,15512\0301,1,31,4,272,1,15512\0301,33,87,4,272,1,15512\0301,89,160,4,272,3,15512\0301,165,276,4,272,1,15512\03115512,2,5,Apothecary Jezel\0312,0,0,5,Apothecary Jezel\0302,0,0,5,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,5,Orgrimmar\0318582,19,8582,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,8831,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8584]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031<Dirge scratches his head.>$B$BA 500 pound chicken? There's no such thing! Not anymore, at least. I knew of such a chicken... The Black Chicken of Death...$B$B<Dirge's voice trails off.>$B$BBut yes, nobody ever saw that chicken and lived to tell the tale. I've got an idea that could benefit the both of us, kid.\030If there is one thing that you should know about me, it is this: NEVER ask me about my business! I work with things you simply cannot understand. Like for example: Do you know what a psychotronic muzzledorf is? Of course you don't! And that's why we leave the planning to me and the fetching to you.$B$BAs I said earlier, if this is going to work, we're going to need a 500 pound chicken.$B$BHead to Gadgetzan and speak with Dirge Quikcleave - he'll get you started on finding a suitable specimen.$B\030Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris wants you to speak with Dirge Quikcleave in Gadgetzan.\030\030Never Ask Me About My Business\0312,1,96,2,257,4,11811\0302,98,145,2,257,1,11811\0302,147,210,2,257,2,11811\0302,212,231,2,257,1,11811\0302,233,299,2,257,1,11811\0302,304,388,2,259,4,11811\0302,393,497,2,257,1,11811\0303,1,83,2,386,1,11811\0301,1,27,4,272,1,8125\0301,32,51,4,272,2,8125\0301,53,74,4,272,1,8125\0301,76,97,4,272,1,8125\0301,99,125,4,272,1,8125\0301,127,155,4,272,1,8125\0301,160,186,4,272,1,8125\0301,191,255,4,272,1,8125\0301,257,312,4,272,4,8125\031620,2,6,Chicken\0308125,2,7,Dirge Quikcleave\03011811,2,8,Narain Soothfancy\0308125,2,8,Dirge Quikcleave\030620,4,10,Chicken\030620,4,13,Chicken\030620,4,14,Chicken\030620,4,16,Chicken\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,7,Gadgetzan\0302,0,0,8,Tanaris\0302,0,0,8,Gadgetzan\0318576,19,8576,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308585,23,8585,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8585]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Look at the marbleization on those tenderloins! Fantastic!$B$BNow about that chicken... Hrm, let me see. I'm going to need a few minutes to devise the recipe.\030Legend has it that the chimaerok of the Isle of Dread in Feralas have the most succulent and tender vittles in existence! Now these chimaerok also have a daddy who, with proper preparation, may or may not look like a 500 pound chicken.$B$BHead to the Isle of Dread and kill Lord Lakmaeran and bring me his fresh carcass. That should satisfy the gnome. To satisfy me, you'll need to get your hands on some chimaerok tenderloin.$B$BDo this and you'll have your 500 pound chicken and a little something extra.$B\030Recover Lakmaeran's Carcass and 20 Chimaerok Tenderloins for Dirge Quikcleave in Tanaris.\030Mmmmm... Chimaerok...\030The Isle of Dread!\0312,1,121,2,257,1,8125\0302,123,235,2,257,1,8125\0302,240,320,2,257,1,8125\0302,322,351,2,257,1,8125\0302,353,426,2,259,1,8125\0302,431,506,2,257,1,8125\0303,1,89,2,384,1,8125\0301,1,47,4,272,1,8125\0301,49,58,4,272,1,8125\0301,63,87,4,272,1,8125\0301,89,104,4,272,1,8125\0301,106,158,4,274,3,8125\0304,1,8,3,256,1,8125\0304,10,21,3,256,1,8125\03112800,2,1,Chimaerok\03012800,2,2,Chimaerok\030620,2,2,Chicken\03012803,2,3,Lord Lakmaeran\03012800,2,5,Chimaerok\030620,2,6,Chicken\03012800,2,7,Chimaerok\0308125,2,7,Dirge Quikcleave\030620,4,10,Chicken\03012800,3,14,Chimaerok\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,1,Feralas\0302,0,0,3,Isle of Dread\0302,0,0,7,Tanaris\0318584,19,8584,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308586,23,8586,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21027,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,21024,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8586]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031It's ready! I present to you my greatest creation: Dirge's Kickin' Chimaerok Chops!\030My recipe is complete! What I need from you now is some rocket fuel and deeprock salt. I'll handle the spices and the meat you brought me will cover the rest.$B$BAfter you bring me what I asked for, the chicken will be ready to take back to Narain.\030Dirge Quikcleave in Gadgetzan wants you to bring him 20 Goblin Rocket Fuel and 20 Deeprock Salt.\030Hurry it up, kid. We don't want this meat to go bad.\030Dirge's Kickin' Chimaerok Chops\0312,1,22,2,257,1,8125\0302,24,86,2,259,1,8125\0302,88,158,2,257,3,8125\0302,163,248,2,257,3,8125\0303,1,96,2,386,1,8125\0301,1,11,4,272,1,8125\0301,13,83,4,272,1,8125\0304,1,17,3,256,1,8125\0304,19,52,3,256,1,8125\031620,2,4,Chicken\0308125,2,5,Dirge Quikcleave\03012800,4,7,Chimaerok\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,4,Narain\0302,0,0,5,Gadgetzan\0318585,19,8585,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308587,23,8587,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,9061,OBJECTIVE,20,15,\030ITEM,8150,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8587]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031<Narain mashes two fists into the huge chicken, stuffing his face full of Dirge's delicious delicacy.>$B$BMMmmm... This is unbelievable! Best chicken I've ever had!\030I'm a goblin of my word, kid. Here's your 500 pound chicken.$B$BWhat a gnome wants with a 500 pound chicken, I'll never know...$B$B<Dirge grumbles something unintelligible.>$B$BProbably to sleep in it... Dirty gnomes...\030Deliver the 500 Pound Chicken to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.\030What is that scrumptious smell?\030Return to Narain\0312,1,29,2,257,1,8125\0302,31,60,2,257,1,8125\0302,65,127,2,259,1,8125\0302,132,173,2,257,1,8125\0302,178,203,2,257,1,8125\0302,205,219,2,257,1,8125\0303,1,62,2,384,1,8125\0301,1,102,4,272,1,11811\0301,107,114,4,272,1,11811\0301,116,136,4,272,1,11811\0301,138,164,4,272,1,11811\0304,1,31,3,256,2,11811\031620,2,2,Chicken\030620,2,3,Chicken\030620,2,7,Chicken\03011811,2,7,Narain Soothfancy\030620,4,8,Chicken\030620,4,11,Chicken\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,7,Narain Soothfancy\0302,0,0,7,Tanaris\0318586,19,8586,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8588]="PARTIAL\031consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Simply amazing... look at the purity of these samples. Hmm, I wonder what it could mean. They seem to be elemental in nature, but... something more. They remind me of... of the Old Gods. We've found traces of them throughout Azeroth, and now I wonder if these creatures aren't related to them somehow.$B$BWe shall have to test further.\030Since we're preparing for war, it might be best if we get all of the goods we need first, don't you think, mon? One of the staples of the war materiel that we're producing is heavy leather. We'll use it for just about everything, from reinforcement to armor, and good old plain tarps too.$B$BBut first we need to get our hands on more of it. That's your job, $c. Sharpen your knife and bring me back a bundle. Then we'll talk further.\030Bring 10 Heavy Leather to Skinner Jamani at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030I've got no time for games if you're just here to jibber-jabber, $C. There are too many stacks of heavy leather that need curing. Come back when you have at least ten for me.\030The Horde Needs Heavy Leather!\0312,1,111,2,263,4,15515\0302,113,189,2,261,1,15515\0302,191,288,2,257,1,15515\0302,293,341,2,259,1,15515\0302,343,362,2,257,1,15515\0302,364,409,2,257,1,15515\0302,411,434,2,257,1,15515\0303,1,79,2,384,1,15515\0301,1,17,4,272,1,15515\0301,19,54,4,272,1,15515\0301,56,88,4,272,4,15515\0301,90,132,4,272,4,15515\0301,134,148,4,272,1,15515\0301,150,169,4,272,1,15515\0301,171,186,4,336,1,15515\0301,188,301,4,272,4,15515\0301,306,335,4,272,3,15515\0304,1,68,3,256,4,15515\0304,70,129,3,258,1,15515\0304,131,174,3,256,1,15515\03115515,2,8,Skinner Jamani\0312,0,0,8,Skinner Jamani\0302,0,0,8,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,8,Orgrimmar\0318589,23,8589,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4234,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8589]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You da mon, mon! Thank you so much for the heavy leather. Every little bit gets us that much closer. I'll just get these onto a pile so that the other leatherworkers can get to work on them.$B$BThanks again, $N, and if you come across more stacks of heavy leather, you know where you can find me.\030It's true, $C, I still need more heavy leather. The requests from the generals and their quartermasters seem endless. And that's nothing compared to what the zeppelin masters are asking for!$B$BI need to get my quota collected on the double. Baekun, bring me more stacks of heavy leather as soon as you can!\030Bring 10 Heavy Leather to Skinner Jamani at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030\030The Horde Needs More Heavy Leather!\0312,1,47,2,259,1,15515\0302,49,117,2,257,4,15515\0302,119,190,2,257,1,15515\0302,195,241,2,259,1,15515\0302,243,307,2,257,1,15515\0303,1,79,2,384,1,15515\0301,1,16,4,272,1,15515\0301,18,57,4,272,1,15515\0301,59,100,4,272,1,15515\0301,102,190,4,274,1,15515\0301,195,296,4,272,4,15515\03115515,2,6,Skinner Jamani\0312,0,0,6,Skinner Jamani\0302,0,0,6,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,6,Orgrimmar\0318588,19,8588,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4234,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8590]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Good work, $C. I'm sure that these thick leather skins will be put to use reinforcing zeppelins and making all manner of armor and weaponry. You have my thanks, and that of the Horde. Come back again if you come across more thick leather in your travels, and luck be with you.\030I'm glad that you decided to speak to me about this, $c. It looks like the Horde's preparations for the upcoming Ahn'Qiraj War are in full swing. But you and I still need to do our part.$B$BI've been asked to collect a great number of thick leather skins for use in all manner of war materiel, and I need you to help me by going out there and gathering them up. There's honor and the gratitude of the Horde in it for you should you decide to help. Will you?\030Bring 10 Thick Leather to Sergeant Umala at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030$C, have you returned so soon with the ten thick leather that we discussed?\030The Horde Needs Thick Leather!\0312,1,56,2,257,1,15522\0302,58,145,2,261,1,15522\0302,147,186,2,259,1,15522\0302,191,361,2,263,1,15522\0302,363,447,2,257,1,15522\0302,449,457,2,257,2,15522\0303,1,79,2,384,1,15522\0301,1,14,4,272,1,15522\0301,16,140,4,272,3,15522\0301,142,183,4,272,1,15522\0301,185,276,4,272,4,15522\0304,1,75,3,256,2,15522\03115522,2,7,Sergeant Umala\0312,0,0,7,Sergeant Umala\0302,0,0,7,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,7,Orgrimmar\0318591,23,8591,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4304,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8591]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You did it, $N, I knew that you would! Once again, thank you on behalf of the entire Horde. Your efforts have been noted and are greatly appreciated. And if you find yourself with more thick leather that you'd like to donate, bring them to me here.$B$BLok'tar Ogar, $C!\030Druid, as you can see I still need to gather up more thick leather. Once again I ask your help with this task, and promise that if you complete it, you will be recognized for your efforts.$B$BTime is of the essence! Return to me with the thick leather so that we can finish our preparations and go to war, hero!\030Bring 10 Thick Leather to Sergeant Umala at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030\030The Horde Needs More Thick Leather!\0312,1,67,2,259,1,15522\0302,69,188,2,259,4,15522\0302,193,215,2,257,1,15522\0302,217,311,2,263,1,15522\0303,1,79,2,384,1,15522\0301,1,38,4,272,4,15522\0301,40,91,4,272,1,15522\0301,93,149,4,272,1,15522\0301,151,248,4,272,4,15522\0301,253,269,4,272,1,15522\03115522,2,5,Sergeant Umala\0312,0,0,5,Sergeant Umala\0302,0,0,5,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,5,Orgrimmar\0318590,19,8590,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,4304,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8592]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've succeeded! The whispers from the Twin Emperors have ceased.$B$BTake this as a reward. The mere sight of it will strike fear in the hearts of the Qiraji... it shall remind them of their fallen leaders and of the mortal that slew them.\030The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity.  They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos.$B$BIn my visions I see their monstrous faces adorned by powerful crowns.  But I will have my revenge... I will transmute these symbols of Qiraji power to ones better suited to our needs.$B$BBring me the components I require, $N.  I will give you a headpiece of unmatched power.\030Bring Vek'nilash's Circlet, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj.  You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.\030Did you bring me the components I asked for, $N?\030Tiara of the Oracle\0312,1,20,2,257,1,15502\0302,22,84,2,257,1,15502\0302,87,174,2,267,1,15502\0302,179,247,2,257,1,15502\0302,250,278,2,259,3,15502\0302,280,361,2,259,3,15502\0302,366,403,2,257,1,15502\0302,406,452,2,257,3,15502\0303,1,110,2,384,1,15502\0303,113,203,2,384,1,15502\0301,1,17,4,272,1,15502\0301,19,66,4,272,1,15502\0301,71,92,4,272,1,15502\0301,94,161,4,272,3,15502\0301,163,240,4,272,3,15502\0304,1,48,3,256,2,15502\03115380,2,3,Arygos\03015502,2,9,Andorgos\03015185,2,10,Brood of Nozdormu\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,9,Andorgos\0302,0,0,9,Ahn'Qiraj\0304,0,0,12,Twin Emperors\0318579,19,8579,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20926,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20877,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20860,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20864,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,910,OBJECTIVE,3000,16,",[8593]="PARTIAL\031stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Yes... the worm's skin will make for an excellent protective layer.  Combined with the strongest parts from the Qiraji we've destroyed on our way here, this should make for a formidable piece of armor.  May it aid you in facing the unspeakable horrors that await inside!\030You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal?  Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance.$B$BThe ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power.  He is rumored to have been created by the Old God himself as a mockery of life.$B$BHis skin is unnatural... thick, nearly impregnable, yet it's flexible and allows him to move with the speed and grace of a much smaller creature.$B$BBring me a sample of his skin along with other minor components and I shall craft you leggings of great power.\030Bring Ouro's Intact Hide, 2 Idols of Life, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.\030Did you bring the components I require, $N?\030Trousers of the Oracle\0312,1,48,2,259,2,15503\0302,51,100,2,257,4,15503\0302,105,162,2,321,1,15503\0302,165,243,2,257,1,15503\0302,248,271,2,257,1,15503\0302,273,392,2,257,1,15503\0302,397,506,2,257,3,15503\0303,1,110,2,384,1,15503\0303,112,202,2,384,1,15503\0301,1,6,4,272,1,15503\0301,8,67,4,272,3,15503\0301,70,201,4,308,1,15503\0301,204,270,4,272,1,15503\0304,1,43,3,256,2,15503\03117075,2,3,Sandworm\03015517,2,3,Ouro\03015503,2,8,Kandrostrasz\03015185,2,9,Brood of Nozdormu\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,8,Kandrostrasz\0304,0,0,12,Qiraji\0318579,19,8579,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20927,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20879,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20859,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20863,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,910,OBJECTIVE,3000,16,",[8594]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031From the materials you bring and from the scales of our fallen Qiraji foes I make you these pauldrons, mortal. May they grant you the protection you need and may the sight of them strike fear into our enemies.\030It is said among us that the ornate shoulder armor worn by the mortal races started as an attempt to emulate the wings of a dragon.$B$BBring me the bindings worn by the highest Qiraji leaders and I shall shape them into a set of pauldrons more dreadful than even the wings of Nefarian himself!\030Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of Rebirth, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj.  You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.\030Have you collected the components I require?\030Mantle of the Oracle\0312,1,131,2,257,1,15502\0302,136,293,2,257,3,15502\0303,1,120,2,384,1,15502\0303,123,212,2,384,1,15502\0301,1,110,4,272,1,15502\0301,112,209,4,278,1,15502\0304,1,44,3,256,2,15502\03111583,2,2,Nefarian\03015502,2,3,Andorgos\03015185,2,4,Brood of Nozdormu\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,3,Andorgos\0302,0,0,3,Ahn'Qiraj\0318579,19,8579,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20928,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20878,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20860,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20865,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,910,OBJECTIVE,0,16,",[8595]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You continue to serve us well, $n. Our pact remains in place.\030\030\030Killing one Qiraji lord is a notable accomplishment for a mortal, $n. They are however, numerous and powerful. Continue to defeat them to prove your worth as our champion.\030Mortal Champions\0311,1,34,4,272,1,15503\0301,36,61,4,272,1,15503\0304,1,69,3,256,1,15503\0304,71,110,3,256,1,15503\0304,112,171,3,256,1,15503\031\0312,3428,0,0,\0318579,19,8579,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21229,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8596]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've done well, $N. You've proven you're no ordinary mortal.$B$BI give you these with the confidence they'll aid you in crushing the vile qiraji.\030Qiraji magic is strong and ancient.  The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon.$B$BBring me the qiraji bindings of command and other minor components by and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you.$B$BYou will find them useful in the fight against the enemy.\030Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Command, 2 Idols of Death, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Gold Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj.  This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.\030You've acquired the items I requested, $N?\030Footwraps of the Oracle\0312,1,35,2,321,1,15503\0302,38,124,2,257,4,15503\0302,129,246,2,257,1,15503\0302,251,307,2,261,3,15503\0303,1,121,2,384,1,15503\0303,124,191,2,384,1,15503\0301,1,21,4,272,1,15503\0301,23,62,4,272,1,15503\0301,67,147,4,272,1,15503\0304,1,42,3,256,2,15503\03115503,2,5,Kandrostrasz\03015185,2,6,Brood of Nozdormu\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,5,Kandrostrasz\0302,0,0,5,Ahn'Qiraj\0318579,19,8579,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20928,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20876,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20861,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20859,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,910,OBJECTIVE,0,16,",[8597]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The book is gone! On top of the dirt mound is a note.\030I knew that book would come in handy some day! Thankfully, I had the wit and foresight to stow it somewhere safe.$B$BDon't worry, it's in a place that nobody could ever hope to find it! I needed a gyrocopter just to get there the first time. Unfortunately I crashed it on the beach on my way back. It was through that accident that I gained these super-gnomish psychic powers!$B$BLook for my crashed gyrocopter somewhere on Land's End Beach and swim south from there! You'll know the spot when you see it!\030Find Narain Soothfancy's book, buried on an island in the South Seas.\030\030Draconic for Dummies\0312,1,46,2,257,4,11811\0302,48,113,2,257,1,11811\0302,118,185,2,259,4,11811\0302,187,241,2,257,1,11811\0302,243,297,2,257,1,11811\0302,299,376,2,257,1,11811\0302,381,467,2,257,1,11811\0302,469,505,2,257,1,11811\0303,1,69,2,384,1,11811\0301,1,17,4,272,1,0\0301,19,53,4,272,1,0\0314950,2,8,Spot\03011811,2,9,Narain Soothfancy\03015712,4,11,Dirt Mound\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,9,South Seas\0318576,19,8576,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308598,23,8598,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,180652,FINISHER,?,12,Freshly Dug Dirt",[8598]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031<Narain's face glows a bright red.>$B$BBooknap my... book, will they!? I'll teach them what it means to mess with a psychic gnome!\030<The text on this note is made up of various typefaces glued onto the parchment's surface.>$B$BWe've got your precious book, gnome. If you ever want to see it again, you'll do exactly as we ask.$B$B<A detailed set of instructions is listed, spanning 3 pages.>$B$BBring the money and come alone!\030Return the Ransom Letter to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.$B\030Say, what's the matter?\030rAnS0m\0312,1,91,2,257,1,0\0302,96,131,2,257,1,0\0302,133,194,2,259,4,0\0302,199,259,2,257,1,0\0302,264,294,2,257,1,0\0303,1,57,2,384,1,0\0301,1,35,4,272,1,11811\0301,40,52,4,272,1,11811\0301,54,70,4,272,2,11811\0301,72,130,4,272,1,11811\0304,1,23,3,256,2,11811\03114528,2,2,Precious\03011811,2,6,Narain Soothfancy\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,6,Narain Soothfancy\0302,0,0,6,Tanaris\0318597,19,8597,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308606,23,8606,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,180652,GIVER,?,9,Freshly Dug Dirt",[8599]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031What!?$B$B<Narain starts to fidget.>$B$BWell, um... What do you want me to do??? She's a fish! A FISH I tell you! And I'm a gnome. It could never work out.\030It isn't often that I get visitors. As a matter of fact, the last time I had a visitor was when I rescued that dear, sweet gnome from the wreckage of the crashed flying machine.$B$B<Meridith gazes into nothingness, lost in a memory.>$B$BDo you know him? Narain? Narain Soothfancy? Oh it would mean so much to me if somebody would deliver a message to him for me. I must tell him how I feel! I know it's love! I just know it!$B$BCould you possibly deliver a message to Narain? I would be forever indebted to you!\030Take Meridith's Love Letter to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.\030You smell like fish!\030Love Song for Narain\0312,1,35,2,257,1,15526\0302,37,177,2,257,1,15526\0302,182,233,2,261,1,15526\0302,238,253,2,257,2,15526\0302,255,261,2,257,2,15526\0302,263,280,2,257,2,15526\0302,282,362,2,265,4,15526\0302,364,390,2,257,1,15526\0302,392,408,2,257,1,15526\0302,410,424,2,257,1,15526\0302,429,475,2,257,4,15526\0302,477,511,2,257,4,15526\0303,1,60,2,384,1,15526\0301,1,6,4,272,2,11811\0301,11,36,4,272,1,11811\0301,41,51,4,272,1,11811\0301,53,80,4,274,2,11811\0301,82,94,4,272,1,11811\0301,96,113,4,272,1,11811\0301,115,130,4,272,1,11811\0301,132,155,4,272,4,11811\0304,1,20,3,256,1,11811\03111811,2,6,Narain Soothfancy\03011811,2,13,Narain Soothfancy\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,11,Narain\0302,0,0,13,Narain Soothfancy\0302,0,0,13,Tanaris\0318597,20,8597,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[86]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Though this wild boar meat is tough, simmer it enough and it sure does make for some tasty pie!\030Maybe if I got a pie, I could tell you who has that necklace.  And you know, I think that old Bernice lady at that other farm makes great Pork Belly Pies... $B$BMaybe if you gave her some chunks of boar meat from the boars that hang around our farms, and told her what it was for, she'd bake up a pie for you.\030Bring 4 Chunks of Boar Meat to Auntie Bernice Stonefield at the Stonefield's Farm.\030I don't think it's right feeding the boy who stole my necklace in the first place, but if that's what it takes to get back what's mine, then so be it!$B$BDo you have that boar meat?\030Pie for Billy\0312,1,61,2,257,4,247\0302,64,156,2,257,1,247\0302,162,309,2,257,4,247\0303,1,82,2,384,1,247\0301,1,95,4,272,1,246\0304,1,150,3,256,4,246\0304,155,181,3,256,2,246\03115065,2,2,Lady\0302809,2,3,Boar\0302809,2,4,Boar\0302809,4,5,Boar\0302809,3,7,Boar\0312,12,1429,0,\0302,0,0,4,Auntie Bernice Stonefield\0302,0,0,4,Stonefield's Farm\03185,19,85,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\03084,23,84,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,769,OBJECTIVE,4,15,",[860]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You want to hunt in the Barrens?$B$BYour eyes are eager, and young. They're not yet squinted from tracking your prey across this land's dry plains.$B$BBut worry not. We'll toughen your body and your mind. And we'll teach you that there is more to hunting than finding and killing your quarry.$B$BPrepare yourself. Your journey begins. Now.\030If you wish to walk the hunter's path, then your journey leads to the Barrens.  Its beasts are strong-willed and fierce.  You will learn much by hunting there, and your spirit will grow.$B$BSpeak with Sergra Darkthorn.  She will be your first guide in the Barrens.$B$BSergra is at the Crossroads.  To reach her, travel east from Bloodhoof Village into the Barrens, then north as the road forks.  And have care as you travel--the Barrens holds great danger for the unprepared and unwary.\030Speak with Sergra Darkthorn at the Crossroads.\030\030Sergra Darkthorn\0312,1,78,2,259,4,3441\0302,81,120,2,257,1,3441\0302,123,186,2,257,3,3441\0302,191,218,2,257,1,3441\0302,221,264,2,257,3,3441\0302,269,296,2,257,1,3441\0302,299,394,2,257,1,3441\0302,397,486,2,261,1,3441\0303,1,46,2,384,1,3441\0301,1,32,4,274,2,3338\0301,37,67,4,272,1,3338\0301,69,147,4,272,1,3338\0301,152,165,4,272,1,3338\0301,167,204,4,272,1,3338\0301,206,292,4,272,1,3338\0301,297,313,4,272,1,3338\0301,315,334,4,272,1,3338\0301,336,339,4,272,1,3338\0313338,2,4,Sergra Darkthorn\0303338,2,9,Sergra Darkthorn\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,1,Barrens\0302,0,0,5,Barrens\0302,0,0,6,Crossroads\0302,0,0,7,Bloodhoof Village\0302,0,0,9,Crossroads\0304,0,0,10,Barrens\031861,19,861,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030844,23,844,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030844,24,844,UNKNOWN\031",[8600]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Very well, it appears you've done a fairly decent job of it, though some of those skins look a bit ragged about the edges. No matter, the task is completed, and you have earned your reward. Should you come across another stack of rugged leather, be sure to bring them to me posthaste.\030I find that the fit of the knife in your palm is more important than the edge on it. Even the dullest blade can be made to cut if pressure is being properly applied through it, wouldn't you agree, $c? But you and I don't have such problems as we maintain the sharpest of edges, yes? $B$BWell, no matter, I have a task for you. In service to the Horde, and to do your part for the Ahn'Qiraj war effort, I want you to return to me with a number of rugged leather skins. This is something that you will do, no?\030Bring 10 Rugged Leather to Doctor Serratus at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030It couldn't possibly be taking you this long to slice off ten rugged leather for me! Perhaps you should sharpen your skinning knife? Or, perhaps I am mistaken and you have them there in your pack?\030The Horde Needs Rugged Leather!\0312,1,84,2,257,1,15525\0302,86,200,2,257,4,15525\0302,202,282,2,257,2,15525\0302,288,326,2,257,1,15525\0302,328,467,2,263,1,15525\0302,469,507,2,257,2,15525\0303,1,81,2,384,1,15525\0301,1,122,4,272,1,15525\0301,124,189,4,272,1,15525\0301,191,284,4,272,1,15525\0304,1,84,3,256,1,15525\0304,86,132,3,256,4,15525\0304,134,196,3,256,4,15525\03115525,2,7,Doctor Serratus\0312,0,0,5,Horde\0302,0,0,7,Doctor Serratus\0302,0,0,7,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,7,Orgrimmar\0318601,23,8601,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,8170,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8601]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Practice, practice, practice. A well honed knife and the skill to use it will get you far in this world, $N. Looks like the edges on these skins are better than the last. Did you buy a new knife?$B$BIn any case, we thank you for your efforts. Your donation has been noted, and will be put to good use I can assure you. Should you find yourself in the possession of more rugged leather, be sure to come back and speak with me, as I will probably need it.\030Preparations for the impending war at Ahn'Qiraj are proceeding, $C. However, to ensure that we do not fall behind, or at least that I am not the one that causes us to fall behind, I want for you to bring back another stack of rugged leather. Your prompt attention to this matter will be greatly appreciated, $N.\030Bring 10 Rugged Leather to Doctor Serratus at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030\030The Horde Needs More Rugged Leather!\0312,1,67,2,261,1,15525\0302,69,241,2,259,1,15525\0302,243,311,2,257,3,15525\0303,1,81,2,384,1,15525\0301,1,29,4,272,1,15525\0301,31,108,4,272,3,15525\0301,110,170,4,272,1,15525\0301,172,195,4,272,2,15525\0301,200,242,4,272,1,15525\0301,244,318,4,272,3,15525\0301,320,453,4,274,3,15525\03115525,2,4,Doctor Serratus\0312,0,0,1,Ahn'Qiraj\0302,0,0,4,Doctor Serratus\0302,0,0,4,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,4,Orgrimmar\0318600,19,8600,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,8170,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8602]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031From the materials you bring and from the scales of our fallen Qiraji foes I make you these pauldrons, mortal. May they grant you the protection you need and may the sight of them strike fear into our enemies.\030It is said among us that the ornate shoulder armor worn by the mortal races started as an attempt to emulate the wings of a dragon.$B$BBring me the bindings worn by the highest Qiraji leaders and I shall shape them into a set of pauldrons more dreadful than even the wings of Nefarian himself!\030Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of Life, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj.  You must also attain Neutral reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.\030Have you collected the components I require?\030Stormcaller's Pauldrons\0312,1,131,2,257,1,15502\0302,136,293,2,257,3,15502\0303,1,119,2,384,1,15502\0303,122,211,2,384,1,15502\0301,1,110,4,272,1,15502\0301,112,209,4,278,1,15502\0304,1,44,3,256,2,15502\03111583,2,2,Nefarian\03015502,2,3,Andorgos\03015185,2,4,Brood of Nozdormu\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,3,Andorgos\0302,0,0,3,Ahn'Qiraj\0318579,19,8579,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20932,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20879,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20859,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20862,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,910,OBJECTIVE,0,16,",[8603]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I did not expect you to return from your attempt, $N.$B$BYou've fulfilled a destiny greater than that of most immortal beings.$B$BBy slaying C'Thun you've not only saved all of Azeroth, you've also tipped the scales of cosmic events beyond your comprehension.$B$BAccept these vestments as a symbol of the glory and burden that will come as a consequence of your actions.$B$BMay their power aid you in the challenges that await you, god-slayer!\030The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj.  The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power.$B$BWhen the stars are favorable, he will lash out against all living beings with terrible wrath.  You must find him before then and find a way to bring his existence to an end.$B$BDo this and bring me a piece of his husk.  I shall grant you armor no mortal has ever worn... armor fit for one who has slain a god!\030Bring the the Husk of the Old God, 2 Idols of Death, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj.  You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.\030At his dwelling in Ahn'Qiraj, dread C'Thun awaits in slumber.\030Vestments of the Oracle\0312,1,76,2,257,1,15504\0302,79,189,2,257,4,15504\0302,194,286,2,257,3,15504\0302,289,366,2,257,1,15504\0302,371,411,2,257,1,15504\0302,414,463,2,257,3,15504\0302,465,502,2,261,1,15504\0303,1,120,2,384,1,15504\0303,123,212,2,384,1,15504\0301,1,53,4,272,1,15504\0301,58,126,4,272,1,15504\0301,131,259,4,272,1,15504\0301,264,370,4,272,3,15504\0301,375,443,4,272,1,15504\0304,1,61,3,256,1,15504\0311851,2,8,The Husk\03015504,2,8,Vethsera\03015185,2,9,Brood of Nozdormu\03015727,4,12,C'Thun\03015727,3,15,C'Thun\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,8,Vethsera\0303,0,0,15,Ahn'Qiraj\0318579,19,8579,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20933,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20876,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20858,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20862,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,910,OBJECTIVE,9000,16,",[8604]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You have my sincere gratitude. Your efforts in helping Cenarion Hold have shown true courage.\030Greetings, $c. In preparation for the war at Ahn'Qiraj, I am here coordinating the Horde's efforts at gathering wool bandages. Unfortunately, out in the field, our soldiers cannot afford to rely upon the presence of a healer to keep them alive. Trust me, I know first hand. Thus, we're putting together all of these first aid kits for them.$B$BIf you have the time, I need many wool bandages. Return them to me here and I will see to it that you are properly rewarded.\030Bring 20 Wool Bandages to Healer Longrunner at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030The dredge strikers are a serious threat and must be dealt with quickly!\030The Horde Needs Wool Bandages!\0312,1,14,2,257,1,15528\0302,16,126,2,261,1,15528\0302,128,244,2,257,1,15528\0302,246,273,2,257,1,15528\0302,275,340,2,257,1,15528\0302,345,392,2,259,4,15528\0302,394,468,2,257,3,15528\0303,1,82,2,384,1,15528\0301,1,30,4,272,1,15528\0301,32,93,4,272,1,15528\0304,1,72,3,260,1,15528\03115528,2,8,Healer Longrunner\0312,0,0,2,Ahn'Qiraj\0302,0,0,8,Healer Longrunner\0302,0,0,8,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,8,Orgrimmar\0318605,23,8605,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,3530,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8605]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You are an honorable $C, $N! I will see to it that these bandages get into the right hands. You have my thanks, and that of the Horde.$B$BGo in peace, and return to me again should you find yourself with excess wool bandaging. We can use all of the help that we can get here.\030Good to see you again, $C. We are still working on preparations here for the war effort, and I can still use all of the help that you can give in gathering up wool bandaging. Any assistance at all will be greatly appreciated. I only hope that our efforts will be good enough. I've lost too many noble souls on the battlefields of yesterday to not do everything in my power to see to it that doesn't happen again.\030Bring 20 Wool Bandages to Healer Longrunner at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030\030The Horde Needs More Wool Bandages!\0312,1,26,2,257,1,15528\0302,28,174,2,261,1,15528\0302,176,225,2,257,3,15528\0302,227,275,2,259,3,15528\0302,277,412,2,261,1,15528\0303,1,82,2,384,1,15528\0301,1,28,4,272,1,15528\0301,30,91,4,272,3,15528\0301,93,134,4,272,1,15528\0301,139,226,4,280,1,15528\0301,228,275,4,272,1,15528\03115528,2,6,Healer Longrunner\0312,0,0,6,Healer Longrunner\0302,0,0,6,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,6,Orgrimmar\0318604,19,8604,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,3530,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8606]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031I think we may have underestimated these booknappers.\030I've got it! Here's what we're going to do. I'm going to fill a sack up with rocks and you're going to make the drop. I know it said that I should make the delivery and I'm going to - sort of.$B$B<Narain looks you up and down.>$B$BYes, you will do just fine. Take this turban, robe, and sack of rocks and head to the drop off point in Winterspring.$B$BI've included everything you need in this special kit. When they show up to pick up the goods, snuff them out! That will teach them to mess with Narain!$B\030Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris wants you to travel to Winterspring and place the Bag of Gold at the drop off point documented by the booknappers.\030\030Who Does Number Two Work For?\030\030Decoy!\0312,1,12,2,257,1,11811\0302,14,43,2,257,3,11811\0302,45,117,2,257,3,11811\0302,119,192,2,257,3,11811\0302,197,227,2,257,1,11811\0302,232,258,2,257,3,11811\0302,260,348,2,257,1,11811\0302,353,406,2,259,1,11811\0302,408,462,2,257,1,11811\0302,464,504,2,257,3,11811\0303,1,143,2,386,1,11811\0301,1,53,4,272,1,11811\0305,1,29,3,384,2,11811\03111811,2,11,Narain Soothfancy\03015554,3,13,Number Two\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,7,Winterspring\0302,0,0,11,Tanaris\0302,0,0,11,Winterspring\0318598,19,8598,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308620,23,8620,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,15554,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Number Two",[8607]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Surprising, yet acceptable. Perhaps I underestimated your 'abilities', $C. Perhaps. You completed a very simple task, and for doing so you are to be rewarded out of proportion. But don't let it go to your head. If you really want to prove yourself you should get out there and bring me another bundle of mageweave bandages.\030I trust that you are speaking to me because you are going to help with the collection I have been entrusted to? Good! By whatever means, and I do mean whatever, I wish for you to gather up a good number of mageweave bandages. Fresh would be nice, but not absolutely necessary. Return them to me here, $c, and I will personally see to it that you are properly rewarded.\030Bring 20 Mageweave Bandages to Lady Callow at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030Do not fail and make me look bad, $C! Return here as quickly as possible with the mageweave bandages we discussed.\030The Horde Needs Mageweave Bandages!\0312,1,111,2,259,2,15529\0302,113,117,2,257,1,15529\0302,119,225,2,259,3,15529\0302,227,276,2,257,4,15529\0302,278,368,2,257,3,15529\0303,1,81,2,384,1,15529\0301,1,27,4,272,1,15529\0301,29,74,4,272,4,15529\0301,76,83,4,272,4,15529\0301,85,176,4,272,1,15529\0301,178,210,4,272,1,15529\0301,212,323,4,274,4,15529\0304,1,37,3,256,1,15529\0304,39,114,3,256,1,15529\03115529,2,6,Lady Callow\0312,0,0,6,Lady Callow\0302,0,0,6,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,6,Orgrimmar\0318608,23,8608,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,8544,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8608]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Astounding, $C, you actually did it again! Well, they do say that I have good taste in those that I choose to place in my service. Very well, your contribution is noted and you will receive the social benefits that your efforts have afforded. I suggest though that you go back out and gather yet another bundle of mageweave bandages if you truly wish to prove your worth.\030You returned? Interesting. As you can see I am still collecting for the Ahn'Qiraj 'war effort'. Which means that I need you to once again go out and collect a stack of mageweave bandages for me. I look forward to your return, $C.\030Bring 20 Mageweave Bandages to Lady Callow at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030\030The Horde Needs More Mageweave Bandages!\0312,1,13,2,257,2,15529\0302,15,26,2,257,1,15529\0302,28,95,2,261,1,15529\0302,97,194,2,259,1,15529\0302,196,229,2,257,1,15529\0303,1,81,2,384,1,15529\0301,1,42,4,272,1,15529\0301,44,130,4,272,1,15529\0301,132,242,4,272,3,15529\0301,244,371,4,274,4,15529\03115529,2,6,Lady Callow\0312,0,0,6,Lady Callow\0302,0,0,6,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,6,Orgrimmar\0318607,19,8607,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,8544,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8609]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Sweet, you got it!\030It appears inevitable that the Horde and Alliance are on a collision course for war at Ahn'Qiraj. Surprisingly, it is not a war with each other, but rather with the silithid, and whatever force controls them. Also surprisingly, both sides are doing their part to gather the resources necessary to wage a successful war.$B$BI am collecting runecloth bandages to distribute to the soldiers, but I won't be successful without assistance, hopefully yours. Is this something that you can aid me with, $c?$B\030Bring 20 Runecloth Bandages to Stoneguard Clayhoof at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030Did you get the venom?\030The Horde Needs Runecloth Bandages!\0312,1,97,2,261,1,15532\0302,99,208,2,261,1,15532\0302,210,319,2,261,1,15532\0302,324,451,2,257,3,15532\0302,453,499,2,257,2,15532\0303,1,89,2,384,1,15532\0301,1,18,4,272,1,15532\0304,1,22,3,256,2,15532\03115532,2,6,Stoneguard Clayhoof\0312,0,0,1,Ahn'Qiraj\0302,0,0,6,Stoneguard Clayhoof\0302,0,0,6,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,6,Orgrimmar\0318610,23,8610,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,14529,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[861]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Skorn Whitecloud is a wise tauren. He has hunted for years and years, and although his body is old, his spirit burns fiercely. We are honored to have him with us.$B$BIf Skorn sent you to me, then you too must have the hunter's spirit. And to have gathered these claws shows your burgeoning skills.$B$BPerhaps you are ready to walk the path.\030You are eager to explore, I can tell.  I too had the lust to wander, once...$B$BWander, and hunt.  For hunting is a Tauren's greatest honor.$B$BIf you truly wish to follow the ways of the hunter, then Melor Stonehoof can show you the path.  He is in Thunder Bluff, on the Hunter's Rise.$B$BAnd to show him your skill and resolve, bring him the claws of the flatland prowlers of Mulgore.  They are tough and cunning -- fitting prey for a young $c on the hunter's path.\030Bring 4 Flatland Prowler Claws to Melor Stonehoof in Thunder Bluff.\030Greetings. There is an air about you that tells me much. Do we have business, you and I?\030The Hunter's Way\0312,1,37,2,257,1,3052\0302,40,76,2,257,1,3052\0302,81,97,2,257,1,3052\0302,100,140,2,257,1,3052\0302,145,239,2,259,4,3052\0302,242,286,2,257,1,3052\0302,291,386,2,257,1,3052\0302,389,467,2,257,1,3052\0303,1,67,2,384,1,3052\0301,1,34,4,272,1,3441\0301,36,126,4,272,1,3441\0301,128,162,4,272,1,3441\0301,167,234,4,272,4,3441\0301,236,297,4,272,1,3441\0301,302,340,4,272,4,3441\0304,1,10,3,256,1,3441\0304,12,56,3,256,1,3441\0304,58,88,3,256,2,3441\0313441,2,5,Melor Stonehoof\0303566,2,9,Flatland Prowler\030118,2,9,Prowler\0303441,2,9,Melor Stonehoof\0303052,4,10,Skorn Whitecloud\03011045,4,11,Burns\0312,215,1412,0,\0302,0,0,6,Thunder Bluff\0302,0,0,9,Melor Stonehoof\0302,0,0,9,Thunder Bluff\031860,23,860,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5203,OBJECTIVE,4,15,",[8610]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031It is a very selfless act of giving that you perform, $N. One that is likely to save the lives of many combatants at Ahn'Qiraj. Thank you and know that you have the appreciation of the Horde for your donation. Should you create, or come across, more runecloth bandages, please consider bringing them to me here.\030Ever does the time grow nearer when we shall launch ourselves headlong into the conflagration at Ahn'Qiraj, priest. But first we must gather our strength and prepare so that we can survive the onslaught of the insects and their masters.$B$BIf you are here again, then surely you wish to make another contribution of runecloth bandages to the war effort? Please do so as soon as you can and return to me once more.\030Bring 20 Runecloth Bandages to Stoneguard Clayhoof at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030\030The Horde Needs More Runecloth Bandages!\0312,1,115,2,257,3,15532\0302,117,236,2,267,1,15532\0302,241,353,2,263,4,15532\0302,355,413,2,257,1,15532\0303,1,89,2,384,1,15532\0301,1,57,4,272,1,15532\0301,59,127,4,282,1,15532\0301,129,209,4,272,1,15532\0301,211,311,4,272,1,15532\031111,2,1,Priest\03015532,2,5,Stoneguard Clayhoof\0312,0,0,1,Ahn'Qiraj\0302,0,0,5,Stoneguard Clayhoof\0302,0,0,5,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,5,Orgrimmar\0304,0,0,7,Ahn'Qiraj\0318609,19,8609,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,14529,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8611]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wonderful, $C! These will do nicely. There are enough here to make a cloak for Korrin, and possibly even more! Thank you.$B$BI hope the trip wasn't too dangerous? The area of Feralas is not known for being forgiving, but you've obviously done well enough.$B$BThank you again, $C.\030I'm not standing here just to get a nice tan, $c. There are war preparations to be made. If we're going to crush those bugs at Ahn'Qiraj then we need to be ready, and that includes food too!$B$BThey have me gathering and salting lean wolf steaks here for the upcoming war. But since I need to stay here to take care of all of this, I need you to go out, kill some wolves and then cook up the meat into lean wolf steaks and bring them back to me here. You got all that?\030Bring 20 Lean Wolf Steaks to Bloodguard Rawtar at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030The sprite darters can be dangerous critters when provoked. Be careful when dealing with them, $C. And be even more careful of any night elves in the area. The pestering fools tend to hold up in the forests also.$B$BWhen you've gotten enough of the wings, let me know, I'll be sure to reward you well!\030The Horde Needs Lean Wolf Steaks!\0312,1,49,2,257,1,15533\0302,51,88,2,261,1,15533\0302,90,190,2,259,4,15533\0302,195,272,2,261,1,15533\0302,274,450,2,259,1,15533\0302,452,468,2,257,2,15533\0303,1,85,2,384,1,15533\0301,1,14,4,272,1,15533\0301,16,36,4,272,3,15533\0301,38,110,4,272,1,15533\0301,112,121,4,272,1,15533\0301,126,162,4,274,2,15533\0301,164,255,4,272,1,15533\0301,260,279,4,272,1,15533\0304,1,59,3,256,1,15533\0304,61,98,3,256,1,15533\0304,100,155,3,256,1,15533\0304,157,212,3,256,1,15533\0304,217,301,3,256,1,15533\03115533,2,7,Bloodguard Rawtar\0312,0,0,3,Ahn'Qiraj the\0302,0,0,7,Bloodguard Rawtar\0302,0,0,7,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,7,Orgrimmar\0318612,23,8612,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,12209,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8612]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030As you can see, $C, we still need to pack away more food for the soldiers. I don't know if you've ever been in a war before, but once you get past the initial shock of the battlefield, you can get pretty hungry. You did a good job last time, so I expect that you'll do as well, if not a little quicker, in getting me another stack of those lean wolf steaks.\030Bring 20 Lean Wolf Steaks to Bloodguard Rawtar at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030\030The Horde Needs More Lean Wolf Steaks!\0312,1,74,2,259,1,15533\0302,76,211,2,261,4,15533\0302,213,357,2,257,4,15533\0303,1,85,2,384,1,15533\03115533,2,4,Bloodguard Rawtar\0312,0,0,4,Bloodguard Rawtar\0302,0,0,4,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,4,Orgrimmar\0318611,19,8611,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,12209,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8613]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Oh ya, this be the good stuff. I pack it up real nice so it not go to waste. Thanks be to you for helpin' me out like this. I'm thinkin' you an A-number-one fisherman for all this spotted yellowtail. An if you happen to fish up and cook even more, you bring it to me here; I make sure everyone know you did!\030It be a nice day for fishin', don't'cha think mon? Good thing, cuz I be needin' a lot of fish it lookin' like. The Horde, they askin' me to be in charge of collectin' a ton of the spotted yellowtail for them. They say they needin' it for the war they getting' ready for at Ahn'Qiraj. I say to them I do the best I can. So I be needin' to get some help. You gonna be helpin' me, $c?\030Bring 20 Spotted Yellowtail to Fisherman Lin'do at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030Back so soon with the spotted yellowtail, $C? You rememba' to cook it up nice? We not servin' raw fish to the soldiers out in the hot desert sun, to be sure.\030The Horde Needs Spotted Yellowtail!\0312,1,50,2,257,2,15534\0302,52,110,2,257,1,15534\0302,112,208,2,257,1,15534\0302,210,283,2,261,1,15534\0302,285,318,2,257,1,15534\0302,320,352,2,257,1,15534\0302,354,381,2,257,2,15534\0303,1,86,2,384,1,15534\0301,1,30,4,272,1,15534\0301,32,76,4,272,1,15534\0301,78,123,4,272,1,15534\0301,125,199,4,272,1,15534\0301,201,307,4,272,4,15534\0304,1,45,3,256,2,15534\0304,47,78,3,256,2,15534\0304,80,157,3,256,1,15534\03115534,2,8,Fisherman Lin'do\0312,0,0,4,Ahn'Qiraj\0302,0,0,8,Fisherman Lin'do\0302,0,0,8,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,8,Orgrimmar\0318614,23,8614,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,6887,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8614]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031That be the best catch yet, $N! Good, honest work right there. And no bones too! Thanks goin' out to you for this spotted yellowtail here mon. Come back soon if you cookin' up some more!\030So as you can see, we still be needin' a lot of the fishies. The combatants in the upcomin' Ahn'Qiraj War gonna be needin' a lot to eat, so I needin' to get all the spotted yellowtail that I can. You catch 'em, cook 'em, and bringin' 'em back to me here, and I be givin' you thanks, and the thanks of the Horde.\030Bring 20 Spotted Yellowtail to Fisherman Lin'do at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030\030The Horde Needs More Spotted Yellowtail!\0312,1,60,2,257,1,15534\0302,62,195,2,261,1,15534\0302,197,311,2,257,1,15534\0303,1,86,2,384,1,15534\0301,1,31,4,272,1,15534\0301,33,62,4,272,1,15534\0301,64,80,4,272,1,15534\0301,82,142,4,272,1,15534\0301,144,186,4,272,4,15534\03115534,2,4,Fisherman Lin'do\0312,0,0,4,Fisherman Lin'do\0302,0,0,4,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,4,Orgrimmar\0318613,19,8613,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,6887,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8615]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wonderful, $C! These will do nicely. There are enough here to make a cloak for Korrin, and possibly even more! Thank you.$B$BI hope the trip wasn't too dangerous? The area of Feralas is not known for being forgiving, but you've obviously done well enough.$B$BThank you again, $C.\030The Ahn'Qiraj war effort is an immense undertaking, $c. All of the materials being gathered here, whether it is metal for weapons, or food to eat, are all as important as the other. For, if you haven't eaten in days you will not have the strength to lift your axe when it matters.$B$BThus, we gather what food we can. I am collecting baked salmon, a dish that was chosen both for its sustenance and its ability to keep well. Can you aid me with this task, $c?\030Bring 20 Baked Salmon to Chief Sharpclaw at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030The sprite darters can be dangerous critters when provoked. Be careful when dealing with them, $C. And be even more careful of any night elves in the area. The pestering fools tend to hold up in the forests also.$B$BWhen you've gotten enough of the wings, let me know, I'll be sure to reward you well!\030The Horde Needs Baked Salmon!\0312,1,55,2,261,1,15535\0302,57,181,2,257,1,15535\0302,183,280,2,257,4,15535\0302,285,317,2,257,1,15535\0302,319,424,2,257,1,15535\0302,426,459,2,257,2,15535\0303,1,79,2,384,1,15535\0301,1,14,4,272,1,15535\0301,16,36,4,272,3,15535\0301,38,110,4,272,1,15535\0301,112,121,4,272,1,15535\0301,126,162,4,274,2,15535\0301,164,255,4,272,1,15535\0301,260,279,4,272,1,15535\0304,1,59,3,256,1,15535\0304,61,98,3,256,1,15535\0304,100,155,3,256,1,15535\0304,157,212,3,256,1,15535\0304,217,301,3,256,1,15535\03115535,2,7,Chief Sharpclaw\0312,0,0,7,Chief Sharpclaw\0302,0,0,7,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,7,Orgrimmar\0318616,23,8616,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,13935,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8616]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030The last batch of baked salmon that you donated to the war effort looked very delicious, $C. I must admit that I was tempted to take a few for myself. As you can tell, we have not yet reached our quota here. I am hoping you have returned because you have another stack of baked salmon with you\030Bring 20 Baked Salmon to Chief Sharpclaw at the Valley of Spirits in Orgrimmar.\030\030The Horde Needs More Baked Salmon!\0312,1,92,2,261,1,15535\0302,94,150,2,257,1,15535\0302,152,207,2,257,1,15535\0302,209,293,2,259,1,15535\0303,1,79,2,384,1,15535\03115535,2,5,Chief Sharpclaw\0312,0,0,5,Chief Sharpclaw\0302,0,0,5,Valley of Spirits\0302,0,0,5,Orgrimmar\0318615,19,8615,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,13935,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8617]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Bring 50 singed corestones to General Zog in Durotar.\030\030The Horde Needs Singed Corestones!\0313,1,53,2,384,1,0\03115539,2,1,General Zog\0312,0,0,1,General Zog\0302,0,0,1,Durotar\031\031",[8619]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031It is good to know the people of this land still pay homage to the olden races. I bid you well, $N, and offer you this token...\030\030\030\030Morndeep the Elder\0311,1,79,4,272,1,15549\0301,81,127,4,272,1,15549\031\031\031\031",[862]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Normally I don't like to eat these rodents when they're so.... so... ripe. Like to let them rot for a few weeks to really bring out the flavor. But you look so hungry.$B$BLet me fix you some Dig Rat Stew. Ah, there we go.$B$BHere you go!\030A $c like you must get pretty hungry out here in The Barrens. Me, I'm starving all day long.$B$BTell you what, I'll fix you up a nice stew. Just need a few dig rats.$B$BSeems those filthy dwarves at Bael Modan are overrun with everyone's favorite feast. Now head on down south to Bael Modan and bring me back some dig rats.$B$BYou can't call yourself a seasoned adventurer until you've spent some time killing rats! Haw!\030Bring 8 Dig Rats to Grub east of the Crossroads.\030Whack enough dig rats yet, $n?\030Dig Rat Stew\0312,1,61,2,257,1,3443\0302,63,92,2,269,1,3443\0302,97,139,2,257,1,3443\0302,141,165,2,259,1,3443\0302,170,253,2,257,4,3443\0302,255,323,2,257,1,3443\0302,328,415,2,257,1,3443\0302,417,420,2,257,1,3443\0303,1,48,2,384,1,3443\0301,1,62,4,272,1,3443\0301,70,74,4,272,1,3443\0301,76,143,4,272,1,3443\0301,145,167,4,272,1,3443\0301,172,204,4,272,1,3443\0301,206,221,4,272,1,3443\0301,226,237,4,272,1,3443\0304,1,30,3,256,2,3443\0313443,2,9,Grub\0303444,4,14,Dig Rat\0312,0,0,1,The Barrens\0302,0,0,5,Bael Modan\0302,0,0,6,Bael Modan\0302,0,0,9,Grub\0302,0,0,9,Crossroads\031\031ITEM,5051,OBJECTIVE,8,15,",[8620]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Fantastic! I can't believe you went through the hassle! Are you some kind of machine? If it were me, I would have probably just let the world implode.$B$BI tip my turban to you, sir. And no good deed should go unrewarded.\030I should have known. My arch-enemy, Doctor Weavil, up to his old tricks! And now, thanks to your failure in Winterspring, Doctor Weavil has destroyed my book! How are you going to save the world now, hero?$B$BThe note I received stated that the only known copy of \"Draconic for Dummies: Volume II\" was ripped into 8 parts and scattered to the wind! If you somehow manage to find those missing chapters, use this magical binding to put them back together and return to me.\030Recover the 8 lost chapters of Draconic for Dummies and combine them with the Magical Book Binding and return the completed book of Draconic for Dummies: Volume II to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.\030I put my pants on just like you - one leg at a time. Except when my pants are on, I make arcanite buoys. Arcanite buoys, baby!\030The Only Prescription\0312,1,20,2,257,1,11811\0302,22,72,2,261,1,11811\0302,74,158,2,261,1,11811\0302,160,205,2,267,2,11811\0302,210,348,2,257,1,11811\0302,350,471,2,261,4,11811\0303,1,196,2,388,1,11811\0301,1,10,4,272,1,11811\0301,12,55,4,272,4,11811\0301,57,85,4,272,2,11811\0301,87,150,4,272,4,11811\0301,155,182,4,272,1,11811\0301,184,221,4,272,1,11811\0304,1,52,3,256,1,11811\0304,54,104,3,256,1,11811\0304,106,126,3,256,1,11811\03115552,2,2,Doctor Weavil\03015552,2,3,Doctor Weavil\03011811,2,7,Narain Soothfancy\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,3,Winterspring\0302,0,0,7,Narain Soothfancy\0302,0,0,7,Tanaris\0318606,19,8606,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308728,23,8728,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21111,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8621]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030Qiraji magic is strong and ancient.  The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon.$B$BBring me the qiraji bindings of dominance and other minor components and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you.$B$BYou will find them useful in the fight against the enemy.\030Bring the Qiraji Bindings of Dominance, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Kandrostrasz in Ahn'Qiraj.  This quest also requires Neutral faction with the Brood of Nozdormu.\030You've acquired the items I requested, $n?\030Stormcaller's Footguards\0312,1,35,2,321,1,15503\0302,38,124,2,257,4,15503\0302,129,245,2,257,1,15503\0302,250,306,2,261,3,15503\0303,1,126,2,384,1,15503\0303,129,196,2,384,1,15503\0304,1,42,3,256,2,15503\03115503,2,5,Kandrostrasz\03015185,2,6,Brood of Nozdormu\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,5,Kandrostrasz\0302,0,0,5,Ahn'Qiraj\0318579,19,8579,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20932,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20877,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20861,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20863,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,910,OBJECTIVE,0,16,",[8622]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj.  The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power.$B$BWhen the stars are favorable, he will lash out against all living beings with terrible wrath.  You must find him before then and find a way to bring his existence to an end.$B$BDo this and bring me a piece of his husk.  I shall grant you armor no mortal has ever worn... armor fit for one who has slain a god!\030Bring the Carapace of the Old God, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj.  You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.\030You've acquired the items I requested, $n?\030Stormcaller's Hauberk\0312,1,76,2,257,1,15504\0302,79,189,2,257,4,15504\0302,194,286,2,257,3,15504\0302,289,366,2,257,1,15504\0302,371,411,2,257,1,15504\0302,414,463,2,257,3,15504\0302,465,502,2,261,1,15504\0303,1,121,2,384,1,15504\0303,124,213,2,384,1,15504\0304,1,42,3,256,2,15504\03115504,2,8,Vethsera\03015185,2,9,Brood of Nozdormu\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,8,Vethsera\0318579,19,8579,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20929,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20877,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20860,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20864,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,910,OBJECTIVE,9000,16,",[8623]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity.  They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos.$B$BIn my visions I see their monstrous faces adorned by powerful crowns.  But I will have my revenge... I will transmute these symbols of Qiraji power to ones better suited to our needs.$B$BBring me the components I require, $N.  I will give you a headpiece of unmatched power.\030Bring Vek'lor's Diadem, 2 Idols of Rebirth, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Andorgos in Ahn'Qiraj.  You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.\030You've acquired the items I requested, $n?\030Stormcaller's Diadem\0312,1,20,2,257,1,15502\0302,22,84,2,257,1,15502\0302,87,174,2,267,1,15502\0302,179,247,2,257,1,15502\0302,250,278,2,259,3,15502\0302,280,361,2,259,3,15502\0302,366,403,2,257,1,15502\0302,406,452,2,257,3,15502\0303,1,107,2,384,1,15502\0303,110,200,2,384,1,15502\0304,1,42,3,256,2,15502\03115380,2,3,Arygos\03015502,2,9,Andorgos\03015185,2,10,Brood of Nozdormu\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,9,Andorgos\0302,0,0,9,Ahn'Qiraj\0318579,19,8579,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,20930,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20878,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20858,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20862,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030REPUTATION,910,OBJECTIVE,3000,16,",[8624]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal?  Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance.$B$BThe ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power.  He is rumored to have been created by the Old God himself as a mockery of life.$B$BHis skin is unnatural... thick, nearly impregnable, yet it's flexible and allows him to move with the speed and grace of a much smaller creature.$B$BBring me a sample of his skin along with other minor components and I shall craft you leggings of great power.\030Bring the Skin of the Great Sandworm, 2 Idols of Strife, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Kandrostrasz inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Friendly reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest.\030You've acquired the items I requested, $n?\030Stormcaller's Leggings\0312,1,48,2,259,2,15503\0302,51,100,2,257,4,15503\0302,105,162,2,321,1,15503\0302,165,243,2,257,1,15503\0302,248,271,2,257,1,15503\0302,273,392,2,257,1,15503\0302,397,506,2,257,3,15503\0303,1,127,2,384,1,15503\0303,129,219,2,384,1,15503\0304,1,