ured out who leads who. The most devastating attack will destroy a good section of their lower chain of command and then we can work our way to the top.$B$BI'll start you off slow, take out Witchwing Harpies and Witchwing Roguefeathers in the Northwest and bring me 8 Witchwing talons. That should be a good start...\030Collect 8 Witchwing talons.$B$BReturn them to Darsok Swiftdagger at the Crossroads.\030Cut up enough of them yet? Keep slicing and taking trophies. I want 8 Witchwing talons.\030Harpy Raiders\0312,1,73,2,257,1,3449\0302,75,144,2,257,1,3449\0302,149,216,2,257,1,3449\0302,218,345,2,269,3,3449\0302,350,478,2,257,1,3449\0302,480,509,2,257,1,3449\0303,1,27,2,384,1,3449\0303,32,83,2,384,1,3449\0301,1,19,4,272,1,3449\0301,21,32,4,272,1,3449\0301,34,46,4,272,1,3449\0301,48,104,4,272,1,3449\0304,1,26,3,256,2,3449\0304,28,60,3,256,1,3449\0304,62,87,3,258,1,3449\0313449,2,8,Darsok Swiftdagger\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,5,Northwest\0302,0,0,8,Darsok Swiftdagger\0302,0,0,8,Crossroads\031875,23,875,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5064,OBJECTIVE,8,15,",[8670]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your spirit burns with life, young $C. I accept the homage you pay, and offer in return this token...\030\030\030\030Runetotem the Elder\0311,1,38,4,272,1,15572\0301,40,101,4,272,1,15572\03111045,4,1,Burns\031\031\031",[8671]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your spirit burns with life, young $C. I accept the homage you pay, and offer in return this token...\030\030\030\030Ragetotem the Elder\0311,1,38,4,272,1,15573\0301,40,101,4,272,1,15573\03111045,4,1,Burns\031\031\031",[8672]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031complet