le should be proud to count you among them.\030One of my scouts witnessed an attack on a caravan from Durotar, $N. The culprits are indeed the Razormane tribe of quilboars. One of the quilboars in particular is leading the raids: Kreenig Snarlsnout. He was seen northeast of here, just south of the road from Durotar. If the threat is to be ended, then Kreenig must die.$B$BTo be sure the attacks cease, though, I say we add insult to their injury. Kill Kreenig along with more of their tribe, and return to me when you have his tusk.\030Kill 8 Razormane Geomancers, 8 Razormane Defenders, and Kreenig Snarlsnout.$B$BThen bring Kreenig Snarlsnout's Tusk to Thork at the Crossroads.\030Cut off the head of their leader, and chaos ensues, $N. Learn this lesson well. It will aid you in the future.$B$BThe boars will flounder without direction, and we will be able to take back the Barrens.\030The Disruption Ends\0312,1,67,2,261,1,3429\0302,69,125,2,257,1,3429\0302,127,202,2,257,1,3429\0302,204,270,2,257,1,3429\0302,272,323,2,261,4,3429\0302,328,401,2,261,1,3429\0302,403,487,2,257,1,3429\0303,1,75,2,384,1,3429\0303,80,143,2,384,1,3429\0301,1,14,4,272,1,3429\0301,16,101,4,276,3,3429\0301,106,157,4,272,1,3429\0304,1,55,3,256,1,3429\0304,57,79,3,256,1,3429\0304,81,110,3,256,3,3429\0304,115,202,3,256,3,3429\0313438,2,3,Kreenig Snarlsnout\0303438,2,8,Kreenig Snarlsnout\0303438,2,9,Kreenig Snarlsnout\0303429,2,9,Thork\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,1,Durotar\0302,0,0,4,Durotar\0302,0,0,9,Thork\0302,0,0,9,Crossroads\031871,19,871,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,3269,OBJECTIVE,8,13,Razormane Geomancer\030NPC,3266,OBJECTIVE,8,13,Razormane Defender\030ITEM,5063,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8720]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The heavens, in their countless stars, hold answers to earthly mysteries, $N. Might, then, the wise, and the lucky, gaze up and find truth?\