heavens, in their countless stars, hold answers to earthly mysteries, $N. Might, then, the wise, and the lucky, gaze up and find truth?\030\030\030\030Riversong the Elder\0311,1,77,4,272,1,15605\0301,79,139,4,272,4,15605\031\031\031\031",[8726]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The heavens, in their countless stars, hold answers to earthly mysteries, $N. Might, then, the wise, and the lucky, gaze up and find truth?\030\030\030\030Brightspear the Elder\0311,1,77,4,272,1,15606\0301,79,139,4,272,4,15606\031\031\031\031",[8727]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The heavens, in their countless stars, hold answers to earthly mysteries, $N. Might, then, the wise, and the lucky, gaze up and find truth?\030\030\030\030Farwhisper the Elder\0311,1,77,4,272,1,15607\0301,79,139,4,272,4,15607\031\031\031\031",[8728]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031A deal is a deal. I sure hope you know what you are getting yourself into, $N. This is an awful lot of trouble to go through to do some fishing.\030Well that took a little longer than expected. Now let me see what this ledger says.$B$B<Narain silently reads the ledger, periodically mumbling under his breath.>$B$B The good news is that I am 99% certain that I am capable of creating an arcanite buoy that will function to your specifications. This is, of course, wholly dependant on the bad news.$B$BThe bad news is that I'm going to need a lot of arcanite, elementium ore, and rare gemstones.$B$BBring me what I need and I will craft the buoy.\030Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris wants you to bring him 20 Arcanite Bars, 10 Elementium Ore, 10 Azerothian Diamonds, and 10 Blue Sapphires.\030Arcanite buoys don't just make themselves, $N. And NO, you cannot borrow some money.\030The Good News and The Bad News\0312,1,45,2,257,1,11811\0302,47,83,2,257,1,11811\0302,88,162,2,257,1,11811\0302,167,295,2,257,3,11811\0302,297,349,2,257,1,11811\0302,354,446,2,259,3,11811\0302,451,497,2,259,3,11811\0303,1,135,2,386,1,11811\0301,1,17,4,272,1,11811\0301,19,78,4,274,3,11811\0301,80,144,4,272,1,11811\0304,1,46,3,256,1,11811\0304,48,84,3,256,1,11811\03111811,2,8,Narain Soothfancy\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,8,Tanaris\0318620,19,8620,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308729,23,8729,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,12360,OBJECTIVE,20,15,\030ITEM,18562,OBJECTIVE,10,15,\030ITEM,12800,OBJECTIVE,10,15,\030ITEM,12361,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[87288]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Bring 6 Soft Nightsaber Pelts to Aldria.\030\030Soft Nightsaber Pelt\030\030Soft Saber Pelts\0313,1,40,2,384,1,0\0305,1,20,3,384,1,0\0312042,2,1,Nightsaber\0302042,3,2,Nightsaber\0312,0,0,1,Aldria\031\031",[8729]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Well done, $N. I will be able to reform the Scepter of the Shifting Sands soon.\030Did I mention the bad news yet? Its name is Maws: 100 feet of death and destruction. I guess I may have forgotten that little tidbit.$B$BAccording to my superior psycho-psionic clairvoyance, you'll find that the best spot to cast this buoy is off the coast of Azshara, in the Bay of Storms.$B$BLook for a swirling maelstrom, most likely cluttered with wreckage.$B$BBy the by, I hope you have friends.$B$BNow if you somehow miraculously succeed, take the scepter shard to Anachronos.\030Use the Arcanite Buoy at the Swirling Maelstrom at the Bay of Storms in Azshara.\030Time is running out, champion.\030The Wrath of Neptulon\0312,1,31,2,257,2,11811\0302,33,84,2,257,1,11811\0302,86,133,2,257,1,11811\0302,138,290,2,257,1,11811\0302,295,361,2,257,1,11811\0302,366,400,2,259,3,11811\0302,405,482,2,257,4,11811\0303,1,80,2,384,1,11811\0301,1,14,4,272,1,15192\0301,16,79,4,272,3,15192\0304,1,30,3,256,1,15192\03115571,2,2,Maws\0304950,2,4,Spot\03015192,2,7,Anachronos\0312,16,1447,0,\0302,0,0,4,Bay of Storms\0302,0,0,7,Anachronos\0302,0,0,8,Swirling Maelstrom\0302,0,0,8,Bay of Storms\0302,0,0,8,Azshara\0318728,19,8728,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21137,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[873]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You now are one with Isha Awak, $N. His spirit is with you. He lurks in your eyes...$B$BEyes that, one day, will learn to see.\030The grand Isha Awak is lord of these waters.  Great is his strength, and solemn his pride.  The humans on the coast fear him, for he has consumed many of their number.$B$BBut I do not fear him.  I am grateful he is here.  He is a worthy challenge, and honorable prey.$B$BIf you are ready, then swim out and search for Isha Awak, the Deep Doom.$B$BHis spirit dwells in his heart, and to hear its beat is to know your fate.\030Bring the Heart of Isha Awak to Mahren Skyseer.\030Fear not the waters, $R.\030Isha Awak\0312,1,44,2,257,1,3388\0302,47,90,2,257,1,3388\0302,93,167,2,257,1,3388\0302,172,193,2,257,1,3388\0302,196,220,2,257,1,3388\0302,223,267,2,257,1,3388\0302,272,343,2,257,4,3388\0302,348,421,2,257,1,3388\0303,1,47,2,384,1,3388\0301,1,35,4,272,1,3388\0301,37,59,4,272,1,3388\0301,61,84,4,272,1,3388\0301,89,126,4,272,3,3388\0304,1,24,3,256,1,3388\0313476,2,1,Isha Awak\0303476,2,7,Isha Awak\0303476,2,9,Isha Awak\0303388,2,9,Mahren Skyseer\0303476,4,10,Isha Awak\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,9,Mahren Skyseer\031874,19,874,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5104,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8730]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Vaelastrasz's soul is at ease, champion. The Aspects all watch your progress with great interest. Know that you have powerful allies.$B$BI was commanded to grant you something to aid you in this struggle. Use it well...\030Champion, is it you? A thousand years it has been since I was entrusted the shard and it is at my darkest hour that one should rise to relieve me of it... But what would tragedy be without cruelty?$B$B<Vaelastrasz coughs weakly.>$B$BNe... Nefarius now holds the scepter shard.$B$BTime is of the essence. Nefarius plans to destroy the shard. You must hurry!\030Slay Nefarian and recover the Red Scepter Shard. Return the Red Scepter Shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris. You have 5 hours to complete this task.\030Another of our heroes lost to the spawn of Deathwing. We will be cursed with this suffering forever...\030Nefarius's Corruption\0312,1,20,2,257,2,13020\0302,22,154,2,257,1,13020\0302,156,197,2,257,4,13020\0302,202,229,2,257,1,13020\0302,240,276,2,257,1,13020\0302,281,303,2,257,1,13020\0302,305,340,2,261,1,13020\0302,342,356,2,257,1,13020\0303,1,48,2,384,1,13020\0303,50,126,2,384,1,13020\0303,128,166,2,384,1,13020\0301,1,40,4,272,1,15192\0301,42,97,4,272,1,15192\0301,99,133,4,272,1,15192\0301,138,204,4,272,1,15192\0301,206,219,4,272,1,15192\0304,1,53,3,260,1,15192\0304,55,102,3,260,3,15192\03110538,2,4,Vaelastrasz\03011583,2,9,Nefarian\03015192,2,10,Anachronos\0312,2677,0,0,\0302,0,0,10,Anachronos\0302,0,0,10,Caverns of Time\0302,0,0,10,Tanaris\0318555,19,8555,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21138,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8731]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I can tell that Krug has little use for paperwork. He signed this in silithid blood!$B$BVery well, $N. I've prepared a set of tasks that should make good use of your skills as a $c.$B$BWith the continued efforts of you and people like you, our enemy will soon be crushed!\030Greetings, $N.  Before I assign you to more involved tasks in the war, you'll need to do your share of field duty.  $B$BYou will find Captain Skullsplit's Orgrimmar Legion outside Hive'Regal.$B$BReport to him and come back to me with proof of your field service.  I shall have a more advanced assignment ready for you.$B$BOh, please do your best to stay away from the Ironforge Brigade.  Tensions are high among our Alliance and Horde volunteers.\030Report to Krug Skullsplit at the Orgrimmar Legion post in front of Hive'Regal.  Prepare your Unsigned Field Duty Papers, obtain Signed Field Duty Papers and bring them to Windcaller Kaldon in Cenarion Hold.$B$BNote: Healing or casting beneficial spells on a member of the Orgrimmar Legion will flag you for PvP.\030You've completed your field duty, $N?  Captain Skullsplit can be found outside of Hive'Regal.\030Field Duty\0312,1,14,2,257,1,15540\0302,17,114,2,263,1,15540\0302,121,191,2,257,3,15540\0302,196,262,2,257,1,15540\0302,265,318,2,257,3,15540\0302,323,386,2,257,1,15540\0302,389,446,2,257,1,15540\0303,1,78,2,384,1,15540\0303,81,206,2,384,1,15540\0303,211,311,2,384,3,15540\0301,1,50,4,272,1,15540\0301,52,84,4,272,1,15540\0301,89,102,4,272,1,15540\0301,104,181,4,272,1,15540\0301,186,271,4,276,3,15540\0304,1,37,3,256,2,15540\0304,40,93,3,256,1,15540\03115612,2,8,Krug Skullsplit\03015540,2,9,Windcaller Kaldon\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,3,Hive'Regal\0302,0,0,6,Ironforge Brigade\0302,0,0,8,Krug Skullsplit\0302,0,0,8,Orgrimmar Legion\0302,0,0,9,Windcaller Kaldon\0302,0,0,9,Cenarion Hold\031\031ITEM,20810,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8732]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Yes, I suppose that little skirmish will pass as field duty nowadays. Take these back to Cenarion Hold, I'm sure they'll have a cushy job ready for you.$B$BOff you go!\030\030\030I take it you want those papers signed, $Gboy:girl;?\030Field Duty Papers\0311,1,69,4,272,3,15612\0301,71,152,4,272,1,15612\0301,157,167,4,272,1,15612\0304,1,52,3,258,2,15612\031371,3,4,Girl\0312,1377,1451,0,\0304,0,0,2,Cenarion Hold\0318731,20,8731,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,23024,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8733]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The wisp is silent except for a low humming sound. Oddly enough, it is able to communicate with you through thoughts.\030This is a journey of redemption, hero. Would it be that I was slain today, I would have died for a just and righteous cause. You must recover the green scepter shard. You must cleanse Eranikus of the taint placed upon him by the Old Gods.$B$BTravel to Darnassus. Just outside the city walls you will find one of my agents. This agent will set things in motion for us and inform Tyrande of our plans without alerting Staghelm.$B$B<Malfurion sighs.>$B$BA fall from grace a thousand years in the making...\030Travel to the continent of Teldrassil and find Malfurion's agent somewhere outside the walls of Darnassus.$B\030\030Eranikus, Tyrant of the Dream\0312,1,38,2,257,1,15362\0302,40,124,2,261,4,15362\0302,126,166,2,257,1,15362\0302,168,238,2,321,1,15362\0302,243,262,2,257,1,15362\0302,264,322,2,257,3,15362\0302,324,425,2,257,3,15362\0302,430,447,2,257,1,15362\0302,452,502,2,257,1,15362\0303,1,106,2,384,1,15362\0301,1,50,4,272,1,15624\0301,52,117,4,272,1,15624\03115633,2,7,Tyrande\0303681,4,11,Wisp\0312,1417,0,0,\0302,0,0,5,Darnassus\0318734,23,8734,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8734]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031It would be impossible to pull Eranikus from the Dream should he refuse. His intentions, however, require him to enter our world. He seeks to destroy the living manifestation of Malfurion. To do this successfully would mean an end to one of the most powerful allies of the Dream. The Nightmare would wholly consume all that would remain should Malfurion fall...\030Tyrande will be notifed, mortal. Shan'do Stormrage has prepared me for this contingency.$B$BNow you must venture to the Moonglade and speak with Remulos. He will have further instruction as to the summoning of Eranikus.$B$BWe all wish you great luck.\030Travel to the Moonglade and speak to Keeper Remulos.\030\030Tyrande and Remulos\0312,1,32,2,257,3,15624\0302,34,88,2,257,1,15624\0302,93,153,2,257,1,15624\0302,155,219,2,257,3,15624\0302,224,250,2,259,3,15624\0303,1,52,2,384,1,15624\0301,1,72,4,272,4,11832\0301,74,129,4,272,1,11832\0301,131,188,4,278,1,11832\0301,190,279,4,280,4,11832\0301,281,361,4,272,4,11832\03115633,2,1,Tyrande\03011832,2,6,Keeper Remulos\0305407,4,11,Nightmare\0312,141,1438,0,\0302,0,0,3,Moonglade\0302,0,0,6,Moonglade\0302,0,0,6,Keeper Remulos\0304,0,0,7,Dream\0318733,19,8733,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308735,23,8735,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8735]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Are you prepared? Is the world prepared for what we are about to invoke? I do not know... I am bound by duty to Malfurion. Duty and honor...\030You must travel to the four dream portals of Azeroth. From each you must draw a fragment of the Nightmare's corruption. The dragonkin that inhabit these areas will hold such fragments. Return to me when you have gathered these fragments.\030Travel to the four Emerald Dream portals in Azeroth and collect a Fragment of the Nightmare's Corruption from each. Return to Keeper Remulos in the Moonglade when you have completed this task.$B\030<Remulos is lost deep in thought.>\030The Nightmare's Corruption\0312,1,53,2,257,1,11832\0302,55,119,2,261,1,11832\0302,121,184,2,257,3,11832\0302,186,237,2,257,1,11832\0303,1,115,2,388,1,11832\0303,117,192,2,384,1,11832\0301,1,17,4,272,2,11832\0301,19,72,4,272,2,11832\0301,74,89,4,272,1,11832\0301,91,122,4,276,1,11832\0301,124,140,4,272,1,11832\0304,1,34,3,260,1,11832\03111832,2,6,Keeper Remulos\0312,493,1450,0,\0302,0,0,5,Azeroth\0302,0,0,6,Keeper Remulos\0302,0,0,6,Moonglade\0304,0,0,10,Malfurion\0318734,19,8734,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308736,23,8736,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21147,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,21149,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,21148,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,21146,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8736]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030requestItems\030title\031He is redeemed, $n. He now returns to the Dream to right what he alone has done wrong. Eranikus will be a powerful ally to Malfurion and my father.$B$BThese armaments are for you, $n; given to me by Ysera herself. You would do well to make use of them in your battles against the Qiraji.\030We must use restraint against Eranikus. We are to redeem him not destroy him.$B$BTyrande is already en route to assist us in this task. We must weather the dragon's blows and save Nighthaven from certain destruction.$B$BBe on guard! You and your allies are our only hope.$B\030Defend Nighthaven from Eranikus. Do not let Keeper Remulos perish. Do not slay Eranikus. Defend yourself. Await Tyrande.$B\030The Redemption of Eranikus\030\030The Nightmare Manifests\0312,1,39,2,257,1,11832\0302,41,77,2,261,1,11832\0302,82,135,2,257,1,11832\0302,137,216,2,265,1,11832\0302,221,232,2,257,1,11832\0302,234,271,2,259,3,11832\0303,1,32,2,396,1,11832\0303,34,66,2,384,1,11832\0303,68,88,2,384,1,11832\0303,90,105,2,396,1,11832\0303,107,120,2,384,1,11832\0301,1,19,4,272,1,11832\0301,21,86,4,272,1,11832\0301,88,147,4,272,3,11832\0301,152,213,4,272,1,11832\0301,215,287,4,272,4,11832\0304,1,26,3,384,1,11832\03115633,2,3,Tyrande\03011832,2,8,Keeper Remulos\03015633,2,11,Tyrande\0312,493,1450,0,\0302,0,0,7,Eranikus\0304,0,0,13,Dream\0304,0,0,14,Malfurion\0318735,19,8735,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308741,23,8741,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8737]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Good job, $N. Here's your next assignment.\030The Twilight's Hammer and the elemental nobles they worship present a formidable threat to our operations in Silithus.  With the new enemies we're facing inside Ahn'Qiraj, we cannot afford to lower our guard to our enemies outside.$B$BFind a way to summon and destroy an Azure Templar and report to Bor Wildmane.\030Summon and slay an Azure Templar and report back to Bor Wildmane in Cenarion Hold.  You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing I in order to complete this quest.\030Is your task done yet, $N?\030Azure Templar\0312,1,118,2,261,1,0\0302,121,231,2,261,1,0\0302,236,312,2,261,1,0\0303,1,82,2,384,1,0\0303,85,161,2,386,1,0\0301,1,13,4,272,1,15306\0301,15,42,4,272,1,15306\0304,1,26,3,256,2,15306\03115211,2,3,Azure Templar\03015306,2,3,Bor Wildmane\03015211,2,4,Azure Templar\03015306,2,4,Bor Wildmane\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,1,Silithus\0302,0,0,3,Bor Wildmane\0302,0,0,4,Bor Wildmane\0302,0,0,4,Cenarion Hold\031\031ITEM,21245,STARTER,?,10,\030NPC,15211,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Azure Templar",[8738]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your efforts are greatly appreciated, $N. I'll read these scouting reports right away, feel free to go over your next assignment.\030We've sent our best scouts deep into the silithid hives to gather intelligence.  Scout Landion has been watching the silithid movements at Hive'Regal for several days now.  Find him and obtain a written report.  We need to be able to act on that information as soon as possible, $N.\030Contact Cenarion Scout Landion inside Hive'Regal and return the Hive'Regal Scout Report to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold.  You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing VII in order to complete this quest.\030You'll find Scout Landion inside Hive'regal. Hurry, $N! Time is of the essence.\030Hive'Regal Scout Report\0312,1,79,2,257,1,0\0302,82,171,2,257,1,0\0302,174,210,2,257,1,0\0302,213,282,2,259,1,0\0303,1,129,2,384,1,0\0303,132,210,2,386,1,0\0301,1,41,4,272,1,15191\0301,43,129,4,272,1,15191\0304,1,44,3,256,1,15191\0304,46,55,3,256,1,15191\0304,57,79,3,256,1,15191\03115609,2,5,Cenarion Scout Landion\03015191,2,5,Windcaller Proudhorn\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,2,Hive'Regal\0302,0,0,5,Windcaller Proudhorn\0302,0,0,5,Cenarion Hold\031\031ITEM,21166,STARTER,?,10,\030ITEM,21160,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8739]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your efforts are greatly appreciated, $N. I'll read these scouting reports right away, feel free to go over your next assignment.\030We've sent our best scouts deep into the silithid hives to gather intelligence.  Scout Jalia has been watching the silithid movements at Hive'Ashi for several days now.  Find her and obtain a written report.  We need to be able to act on that information as soon as possible, $N.\030Contact Cenarion Scout Jalia inside Hive'Ashi and return the Hive'Ashi Scout Report to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold.  You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing VIII in order to complete this quest.\030You'll find Scout Jalia inside Hive'Ashi.  Hurry, $N!  Time is of the essence.\030Hive'Ashi Scout Report\0312,1,79,2,257,1,0\0302,82,168,2,257,1,0\0302,171,207,2,257,1,0\0302,210,279,2,259,1,0\0303,1,125,2,384,1,0\0303,128,207,2,386,1,0\0301,1,41,4,272,1,15191\0301,43,129,4,272,1,15191\0304,1,41,3,256,1,15191\0304,44,53,3,256,1,15191\0304,56,78,3,256,1,15191\03115611,2,5,Cenarion Scout Jalia\03015191,2,5,Windcaller Proudhorn\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,2,Hive'Ashi\0302,0,0,5,Windcaller Proudhorn\0302,0,0,5,Cenarion Hold\031\031ITEM,21167,STARTER,?,10,\030ITEM,21161,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[874]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031My brother sent you, did he? Then you must have proven yourself to him. If you have earned the respect of Jorn, then you have my respect as well.$B$BAre you ready to tread farther down the hunter's path?\030You have hunted the beasts of the Barrens.  Your spirit is strong.  But a hunter must always be prepared.  A true hunter can stalk prey down any path.  Mountains and swamps will not sway $ghim:her;.$B$BNot even the sea.$B$BFind my sister, Mahren.  She hunts the great water beasts along the coast.  She will be your teacher in their ways.$B$BBut be wary in your search for her, for the Barrens' coast is held by humans.\030Speak with Mahren Skyseer.\030\030Mahren Skyseer\0312,1,42,2,257,1,3387\0302,45,66,2,257,1,3387\0302,69,105,2,257,1,3387\0302,108,150,2,257,1,3387\0302,153,198,2,257,3,3387\0302,203,219,2,257,1,3387\0302,224,246,2,257,1,3387\0302,249,297,2,257,1,3387\0302,300,338,2,257,3,3387\0302,343,419,2,257,1,3387\0303,1,26,2,384,1,3387\0301,1,28,4,272,2,3388\0301,30,71,4,272,1,3388\0301,73,145,4,272,4,3388\0301,150,203,4,272,2,3388\0313388,2,11,Mahren Skyseer\0312,17,1413,0,\031913,19,913,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030873,23,873,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8740]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Well done, $N. The twilight marauders were inflicting an unacceptable number of casualties on our patrols. Here's your next assignment.\030Bands of mounted Twilight's Hammer cultists have been spotted riding outside the reach of our forces in Cenarion Hold, picking off our smaller patrols and caravans.$B$BFind and defeat the twilight marauders along with their leader, a terrible warrior by the name of Morna.  Report to Windcaller Proudhorn after completing the task.\030Slay Twilight Marauder Morna and 5 Twilight Marauders.  Report to Windcaller Proudhorn when your task is finished.  You must also bring Tactical Task Briefing IX in order to complete this quest.\030Is your task done yet, $N?\030Twilight Marauders\0312,1,164,2,257,1,0\0302,169,272,2,257,1,0\0302,275,331,2,257,1,0\0303,1,54,2,384,1,0\0303,57,114,2,384,1,0\0303,117,194,2,386,1,0\0301,1,14,4,272,1,15191\0301,16,106,4,272,1,15191\0301,108,135,4,272,1,15191\0304,1,26,3,256,2,15191\03115191,2,3,Windcaller Proudhorn\03015541,2,4,Twilight Marauder Morna\03015191,2,5,Windcaller Proudhorn\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,1,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,3,Windcaller Proudhorn\0302,0,0,5,Windcaller Proudhorn\031\031ITEM,20944,STARTER,?,10,\030NPC,15541,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Twilight Marauder Morna\030NPC,15542,OBJECTIVE,5,13,Twilight Marauder",[8741]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your deeds will be known to all, champion. They will sing your praises from Orgrimmar to the far reaches of the South Seas. All will know of the champion of the Bronze Flight, $N.\030The keeper awaits your return, $N. Take the green scepter shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.$B\030Take the Green Scepter Shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris.$B\030\030The Champion Returns\0312,1,34,2,257,1,11832\0302,36,101,2,257,1,11832\0303,1,77,2,384,1,11832\0301,1,42,4,272,3,15192\0301,44,123,4,272,3,15192\0301,125,179,4,272,3,15192\03115192,2,2,Anachronos\03015192,2,3,Anachronos\0312,493,1450,0,\0302,0,0,2,Anachronos\0302,0,0,2,Caverns of Time\0302,0,0,3,Anachronos\0302,0,0,3,Caverns of Time\0302,0,0,3,Tanaris\0304,0,0,5,Orgrimmar\0318736,19,8736,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8742]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The Scepter of the Shifting Sands is whole once more, $N.$B$BIt must be you who uses the scepter. It must be you who heralds the next age of your people. You must wait for the armies of the Horde and the Alliance to arrive in Silithus before you may ring the Scarab Gong.\030A thousand years has passed and just as it was fated, one stands before me. One who shall lead their people to a new age.$B$BThe Old God trembles, $N. Oh yes, it fears your faith. Shatter the prophecy of C'Thun.$B$BIt knows you come, champion - and with you comes the might of Kalimdor. You have only to let me know when you are prepared and I shall grant you The Scepter of the Shifting Sands.\030\030\030The Might of Kalimdor\0312,1,75,2,257,1,15192\0302,77,121,2,257,3,15192\0302,126,150,2,257,1,15192\0302,152,179,2,257,1,15192\0302,181,211,2,257,1,15192\0302,216,286,2,257,4,15192\0302,288,394,2,257,3,15192\0301,1,57,4,272,1,15192\0301,62,97,4,272,1,15192\0301,99,153,4,272,1,15192\0301,155,271,4,272,1,15192\03115727,2,5,C'Thun\0307269,4,11,Scarab\0312,440,1446,0,\0304,0,0,11,Silithus\0318729,21,8729,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308730,21,8730,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308741,21,8741,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8743]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031From the ground near the gong springs a special crystal. Perhaps favor from the Brood.\030\030\030The Scarab Gong looms ominously before you. Steel yourself, $N; for once the Scarab Gong is rung, the gates of Ahn'Qiraj will be opened.$B$BFrom the slackened maw of the beast can only come chaos and destruction. Defend your people!\030Bang a Gong!\0311,1,56,4,272,1,0\0301,58,86,4,272,4,0\0304,1,43,3,256,1,0\0304,45,136,3,256,3,0\0304,141,212,3,256,1,0\0304,214,232,3,268,1,0\0317269,3,3,Scarab\0307269,3,4,Scarab\03010430,3,5,The Beast\0312,1377,1451,0,\0304,0,0,2,Brood\0318742,19,8742,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,180717,GIVER,?,9,The Scarab Gong\030OBJECT,180717,FINISHER,?,12,The Scarab Gong\030ITEM,21175,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8744]="PARTIAL\031characters,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The tag on this present reads:$b$bTo $N,$b$bMay your feast of Great-Winter be merry and bright!\030\030\030\030A Carefully Wrapped Present\0311,1,30,4,272,1,0\0301,45,95,4,272,1,0\031\031\031\031OBJECT,180743,GIVER,?,9,Carefully Wrapped Present\030OBJECT,180743,FINISHER,?,12,Carefully Wrapped Present",[8745]="UNRESOLVED\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Treasure of the Timeless One\031\031\0312,1377,1451,0,\0318742,19,8742,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8746]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031You did it!  Huzzah!$B$BMetzen flew back into Great-father Winter's stables - yes Metzen can really fly - just a little while ago!  The dust worked like a charm; I knew it would.  You've saved the Feast of Winter Veil as well as Smokywood Pastures from disaster.  Thank you, $N.$B$BListen... because of what you've done here, I want you to have this.  It's something VERY special; if you have a mount, I think you'll get a kick out of it.  Happy Winter Veil!\030DISASTER has struck!  Metzen the Reindeer has been kidnapped!$B$BMetzen is one of Great-father Winter's eight reindeer - and property of Smokywood Pastures.  We've received not one but TWO ransom letters from groups claiming to have Metzen.  With the holiday season well under way, we're strapped to the coin box here!  Please - find Metzen and return him to us!$B$BCheck out the ransom letters for clues, and sprinkle this reindeer dust on him - it will free him from any of his bonds!$B$BPlease, hurry!\030Find Metzen the Reindeer.  Use the notes provided to you for clues as to where he is being held.$B$BWhen you find Metzen, have the Pouch of Reindeer Dust in your possession so you can sprinkle some of the dust on him; this should free Metzen from his bonds of captivity.$B$BReturn the Pouch of Reindeer Dust to Kaymard Copperpinch in Orgrimmar once Metzen is freed.\030\030Find Metzen the Reindeer and rescue him\030$N!  Did you find him?  Were the notes in the satchel I gave you enough information to locate Metzen?  I hate to think of what those cruel thugs might do to him... but there's no way we can afford to pay such an exorbitant ransom!\030Metzen the Reindeer\0312,1,20,2,257,1,13418\0302,23,61,2,261,1,13418\0302,66,156,2,257,1,13418\0302,159,240,2,257,1,13418\0302,243,318,2,257,1,13418\0302,321,362,2,257,1,13418\0302,367,486,2,257,3,13418\0302,491,504,2,257,1,13418\0303,1,25,2,384,1,13418\0303,28,96,2,384,1,13418\0303,101,270,2,384,1,13418\0303,275,365,2,384,1,13418\0301,1,11,4,272,1,13418\0301,14,20,4,272,1,13418\0301,25,130,4,272,1,13418\0301,133,178,4,272,4,13418\0301,181,262,4,272,1,13418\0301,265,278,4,272,1,13418\0301,283,291,4,272,1,13418\0301,293,350,4,274,1,13418\0301,353,438,4,272,4,13418\0301,441,458,4,272,1,13418\0306,6,22,3,256,2,13418\0306,25,101,3,256,2,13418\0306,104,163,3,256,4,13418\0306,165,230,3,256,1,13418\0305,1,39,3,392,1,13418\03115664,2,2,Metzen the Reindeer\03013445,2,3,Great-father Winter\0307583,2,7,Sprinkle\03015664,2,9,Metzen the Reindeer\0307583,2,11,Sprinkle\03013418,2,12,Kaymard Copperpinch\03013445,4,15,Great-father Winter\03015664,3,27,Metzen the Reindeer\0312,0,0,12,Kaymard Copperpinch\0302,0,0,12,Orgrimmar\0318799,23,8799,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,15664,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Metzen the Reindeer\030ITEM,21211,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8747]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.$b$bThe signet ring of the protector will offer superior protection against the forces of evil.$b$bBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind.\030\030\030\030The Path of the Protector\0311,1,23,4,272,1,15192\0301,25,98,4,272,1,15192\0301,100,124,4,272,1,15192\0301,129,219,4,272,3,15192\0301,224,320,4,272,3,15192\031\0312,440,1446,0,\0318752,22,8752,UNKNOWN\0308757,22,8757,UNKNOWN\0308748,23,8748,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8748]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, $n. May you never stray from the path of the protector!\030\030\030Your continued defense of the children of Kalimdor has been acknowledged. Hand me your signet ring so that I may enhance its powers.\030The Path of the Protector\0311,1,63,4,272,1,15192\0301,65,115,4,272,1,15192\0304,1,73,3,256,1,15192\0304,75,132,3,258,1,15192\031\0312,440,1446,0,\0318747,19,8747,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308753,22,8753,UNKNOWN\0308758,22,8758,UNKNOWN\0308749,23,8749,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21196,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8749]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, $n. May you never stray from the path of the protector!\030\030\030You honor my kind, $N. Strike down the enemies of Kalimdor! Show them what it means to deface the land of eternal starlight.$B$BYou have earned another enhancement. Hand me your signet ring so that I may bolster its power.\030The Path of the Protector\0311,1,63,4,272,1,15192\0301,65,115,4,272,1,15192\0304,1,22,3,256,1,15192\0304,24,59,3,260,1,15192\0304,61,124,3,256,1,15192\0304,129,164,3,256,1,15192\0304,166,222,3,258,1,15192\031\0312,440,1446,0,\0318748,19,8748,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308754,22,8754,UNKNOWN\0308759,22,8759,UNKNOWN\0308750,23,8750,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21197,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[875]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent work my friend. I think you'll go far within the Horde.\030Hahaha, $n. Back for more? Good, I like to hear that.$B$BThis time I want you to assassinate some of the harpy lieutenants in the Dry Hills. Only Witchwing Slayers can be lieutenants, and you can tell them apart by the rings they carry. They are a nasty bunch, but they lead some of the underlings in that area. Taking out 6 of them will be a decisive strike against their matriarchy.$B$BMake sure they die painfully, $n. We want those harpy wenches to know the idiocy of picking fights with the Horde.\030Collect 6 Harpy Lieutenant Rings from Witchwing Slayers and return them to Darsok Swiftdagger at the Crossroads.\030Do you have 6 Harpy Lieutenant Rings yet? Justice must be dealt to them for their vicious attacks on the Horde.\030Harpy Lieutenants\0312,1,11,2,257,1,3449\0302,13,26,2,257,2,3449\0302,28,53,2,257,1,3449\0302,58,140,2,259,1,3449\0302,142,236,2,257,1,3449\0302,238,311,2,257,1,3449\0302,313,384,2,257,3,3449\0302,389,421,2,257,1,3449\0302,423,502,2,259,1,3449\0303,1,112,2,384,1,3449\0301,1,25,4,272,1,3449\0301,27,65,4,272,1,3449\0304,1,41,3,256,2,3449\0304,43,111,3,260,1,3449\0313449,2,10,Darsok Swiftdagger\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,4,Dry Hills\0302,0,0,10,Witchwing Slayers\0302,0,0,10,Darsok Swiftdagger\0302,0,0,10,Crossroads\0304,0,0,12,Horde\031867,19,867,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030876,23,876,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5065,OBJECTIVE,6,15,",[8750]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, $n. May you never stray from the path of the protector!\030\030\030Dedication of this magnitude is a rarity. You have shown that your will is unfaltering, $N. You shall be greatly rewarded for your stalwart watch over our world.$B$BHand me your signet ring so that I may strengthen its enchantment.\