n the Horde caravans are revenge for her sister's death.$B$BI need you to slit her throat and bring me back her head. I want to place it on the next caravan we send out... Give those harpies something to think about.\030Slay Serena Bloodfeather and return her head to Darsok Swiftdagger at the Crossroads.\030You're not getting anything until I see Serena's head.\030Serena Bloodfeather\0312,1,98,2,259,1,3449\0302,103,208,2,261,1,3449\0302,210,292,2,263,4,3449\0302,297,353,2,259,1,3449\0302,355,407,2,259,1,3449\0302,409,452,2,257,1,3449\0303,1,85,2,384,1,3449\0301,5,18,4,272,1,3449\0301,20,36,4,272,1,3449\0301,38,124,4,272,1,3449\0301,126,184,4,272,1,3449\0301,186,218,4,272,1,3449\0304,1,54,3,256,1,3449\0313452,2,2,Serena Bloodfeather\03010182,2,2,Rexxar\0303452,2,7,Serena Bloodfeather\0303449,2,7,Darsok Swiftdagger\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,7,Darsok Swiftdagger\0302,0,0,7,Crossroads\031875,19,875,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0301060,23,1060,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5067,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8760]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, $n. May you never stray from the path of the invoker!\030\030\030Dedication of this magnitude is a rarity. You have shown that your will is unfaltering, $N. You shall be greatly rewarded for your stalwart watch over our world.$B$BHand me your signet ring so that I may strengthen its enchantment.\030The Path of the Invoker\0311,1,63,4,272,1,15192\0301,65,113,4,272,1,15192\0304,1,41,3,256,1,15192\0304,43,91,3,256,3,15192\0304,93,161,3,256,3,15192\0304,166,231,3,258,1,15192\031\0312,440,1446,0,\0318759,19,8759,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308750,22,8750,UNKNOWN\0308755,22,8755,UNKNOWN\0308761,23,8761,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21208,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8761]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Rise, Grand Invoker! Rise and be recognized!\030\030\030Never have I seen such tenacity! The Bronze Flight grants you one final enchantment. The Timeless One himself has requested it so!$b$bHand me your signet ring so that I may make the necessary adjustments.\030The Grand Invoker\0311,1,20,4,272,1,15192\0301,22,44,4,272,1,15192\0304,1,32,3,256,1,15192\0304,34,84,3,256,1,15192\0304,86,130,3,256,1,15192\0304,135,204,3,258,1,15192\031\0312,440,1446,0,\0318760,19,8760,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308751,22,8751,UNKNOWN\0308756,22,8756,UNKNOWN\031ITEM,21209,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8762]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031You did it!  Huzzah!$B$BMetzen flew back into Greatfather Winter's stables - yes Metzen can really fly - just a little while ago!  The dust worked like a charm; I knew it would.  You've saved the Feast of Winter Veil as well as Smokywood Pastures from disaster.  Thank you, $N.$B$BListen... because of what you've done here, I want you to have this.  It's something VERY special; if you have a mount, I think you'll get a kick out of it.  Happy Winter Veil!\030DISASTER has struck!  Metzen the Reindeer has been kidnapped!$B$BMetzen is one of Greatfather Winter's eight reindeer - and property of Smokywood Pastures.  We've received not one but TWO ransom letters from groups claiming to have Metzen.  With the holiday season well under way, we're strapped to the coin box here!  Please - find Metzen and return him to us!$B$BCheck out the ransom letters for clues, and sprinkle this reindeer dust on him - it will free him from any of his bonds!$B$BPlease, hurry!\030Find Metzen the Reindeer.  Use the notes provided to you for clues as to where he is being held.$B$BWhen you find Metzen, have the Pouch of Reindeer Dust in your possession so you can sprinkle some of the dust on him; this should free Metzen from his bonds of captivity.$B$BReturn the Pouch of Reindeer Dust to Wulmort Jinglepocket in Ironforge once Metzen is freed.\030\030Find Metzen the Reindeer and rescue him\030$N!  Were the notes in the satchel I gave you enough information to locate Metzen?  I hate to think of what those cruel thugs might do to him... but there's no way we can afford to pay such an exorbitant ransom!\030Metzen the Reindeer\0312,1,20,2,257,1,13433\0302,23,61,2,261,1,13433\0302,66,155,2,257,1,13433\0302,158,239,2,257,1,13433\0302,242,317,2,257,1,13433\0302,320,361,2,257,1,13433\0302,366,485,2,257,3,13433\0302,490,503,2,257,1,13433\0303,1,25,2,384,1,13433\0303,28,96,2,384,1,13433\0303,101,270,2,384,1,13433\0303,275,366,2,384,1,13433\0301,1,11,4,272,1,13433\0301,14,20,4,272,1,13433\0301,25,129,4,272,1,13433\0301,132,177,4,272,4,13433\0301,180,261,4,272,1,13433\0301,264,277,4,272,1,13433\0301,282,290,4,272,1,13433\0301,292,349,4,274,1,13433\0301,352,437,4,272,4,13433\0301,440,457,4,272,1,13433\0306,6,82,3,256,2,13433\0306,85,144,3,256,4,13433\0306,146,211,3,256,1,13433\0305,1,39,3,392,1,13433\03115664,2,2,Metzen the Reindeer\03013444,2,3,Greatfather Winter\0307583,2,7,Sprinkle\03015664,2,9,Metzen the Reindeer\0307583,2,11,Sprinkle\03013433,2,12,Wulmort Jinglepocket\03013444,4,15,Greatfather Winter\03015664,3,26,Metzen the Reindeer\0312,0,0,12,Wulmort Jinglepocket\0302,0,0,12,Ironforge\0318763,23,8763,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,15664,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Metzen the Reindeer\030ITEM,21211,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8763]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The machine lets off a little rumble and a small amount of steam as it starts working. It is not too long thereafter until it stops, heralded by another small jet of steam erupting from it. A door hatch opens, revealing a batch of preserved holly!\030Listen... I'm not really supposed to be telling you this, but since you're the hero of the day and all...$B$BThere's fresh holly everywhere this time of the year, but it never lasts.  We've got a machine that preserves holly - it never goes bad!  We use it to spice up the holiday... and profits during the summer!$B$BI'll let you use the preserver, but only if you're a master cook.  You'll need some deeprock salt and two, three, oh let's say five gold.  It'll net you a nice batch that's yours to keep.\030Bring 1 Deeprock Salt and 5 gold coins to any Holly Preserver machine, upon which you will receive 5 Preserved Holly.\030The \"Holly Preserver\" machine looks like some sort of still at first, but a careful examination of it reveals some goblin-esque changes to it. Still, your skill at cooking seems to allow you to understand how the machine works. $B$BThere is already fresh holly in the machine - you simply need to provide some deeprock salt and five gold coins to get the machine working.\030The Hero of the Day\0312,1,9,2,257,1,13433\0302,11,105,2,257,1,13433\0302,110,182,2,257,1,13433\0302,185,245,2,257,1,13433\0302,248,283,2,257,1,13433\0302,285,314,2,257,1,13433\0302,319,383,2,257,4,13433\0302,386,455,2,259,1,13433\0302,458,505,2,257,1,13433\0303,1,117,2,384,3,13433\0301,1,86,4,272,1,0\0301,88,189,4,272,1,0\0301,191,247,4,272,1,0\0304,1,142,3,256,1,0\0304,144,227,3,256,4,0\0304,233,371,3,258,1,0\031\031\0318762,19,8762,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,180715,FINISHER,?,12,Holly Preserver\030ITEM,8150,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8764]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Be well, $n. If you change your mind, I shall be here to assist you.\030\030\030Champion, should you decide to walk another path, present me with your signet ring and a mountain of scarabs from our enemies in Ahn'Qiraj.\030The Changing of Paths - Protector No More\0311,1,12,4,272,1,15192\0301,14,68,4,272,4,15192\0304,1,139,3,260,1,15192\031\0312,440,1446,0,\0303,0,0,3,Ahn'Qiraj\031\031ITEM,21200,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM