  She has recently requested scrying materials to be used in her research.$B$BPlease gather these materials and deliver them to her directly so that she may continue her research.\030Bring 1 Large Brilliant Shard, 1 Large Radiant Shard and 1 Huge Emerald to Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing V in order to complete this quest.\030\030Scrying Materials\0312,1,98,2,257,1,0\0302,101,172,2,257,1,0\0302,177,277,2,259,1,0\0303,1,124,2,384,1,0\0303,127,204,2,386,1,0\03115183,2,1,Geologist Larksbane\03015183,2,4,Geologist Larksbane\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,1,Silithus\0302,0,0,4,Geologist Larksbane\0302,0,0,4,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,4,Silithus\031\031ITEM,21259,STARTER,?,10,\030ITEM,14344,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,11178,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,12364,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[878]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Yes, yes... filled with joy because finally <snort> the Bristleback know my tribe's pain, $R. That is how I should feel, but that <snort> is not the case.$B$BYou aid your people and they honor you. Mangletooth aids his people, and what do they do? They turn their backs on him. They forget him and leave him to rot in cage!$B$BI aid them even from locked behind bars and they send no one to save me!\030You must strike my enemies. <snort> You must help Mangletooth and the Razormane by weakening the Bristlebacks. Both tribes are very spiritual--tied to the earth and its power. <snort> It gives us strength in all things... especially war.$B$BIf you want to find out who really causes Thork <snort> and the Horde such anguish, then help Mangletooth! You attack the spiritual leaders of the Bristlebacks to the north; weaken them so the Razormanes can defeat them and rule the Barrens.\030Kill 6 Bristleback Water Seekers, 12 Bristleback Thornweavers and 12 Bristleback Geomancers and return to Mangletooth at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.\030More information <snort> for the Horde when you've killed the Bristleback's wise ones, $R. <snort> Not a moment earlier! Mangletooth is no fool.\030Tribes at War\0312,1,27,2,261,1,3430\0302,29,110,2,257,1,3430\0302,112,175,2,257,1,3430\0302,177,221,2,257,1,3430\0302,223,237,2,261,1,3430\0302,242,347,2,259,4,3430\0302,349,482,2,261,1,3430\0303,1,149,2,384,1,3430\0301,1,11,4,272,1,3430\0301,13,93,4,274,1,3430\0301,95,154,4,272,1,3430\0301,159,197,4,272,1,3430\0301,199,247,4,272,2,3430\0301,249,277,4,272,1,3430\0301,279,323,4,272,1,3430\0301,328,399,4,282,1,3430\0304,1,90,3,256,1,3430\0304,92,120,3,256,1,3430\0304,122,144,3,256,1,3430\0313430,2,2,Mangletooth\0303429,2,6,Thork\0303430,2,6,Mangletooth\0303430,2,8,Mangletooth\0303430,4,13,Mangletooth\0303430,3,19,Mangletooth\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,8,Mangletooth\0302,0,0,8,Camp Taurajo\0302,0,0,8,Barrens\0315052,23,5052,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,3260,OBJECTIVE,6,13,Bristleback Water Seeker\030NPC,3261,OBJECTIVE,12,13,Bristleback Thornweaver\030NPC,3263,OBJECTIVE,12,13,Bristleback Geomancer",[8780]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030The Ironforge Brigade's supply of armor kits in the battlefield is running dangerously low.  Obtain a batch and deliver them to Janela Stouthammer at the Ironforge Brigade's outpost outside Hive'Zora.\030Bring 8 Rugged Armor Kits and 8 Heavy Armor Kits to Janela Stouthammer at the Ironforge Brigade Outpost near Hive'Zora in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VII in order to complete this quest.\030\030Armor Kits for the Field\0312,1,91,2,257,1,0\0302,94,200,2,257,1,0\0303,1,131,2,384,1,0\0303,134,213,2,386,1,0\03115443,2,2,Janela Stouthammer\03015443,2,3,Janela Stouthammer\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,2,Janela Stouthammer\0302,0,0,2,Ironforge Brigade's\0302,0,0,2,Hive'Zora\0302,0,0,3,Janela Stouthammer\0302,0,0,3,Ironforge Brigade Outpost\0302,0,0,3,Hive'Zora\0302,0,0