[8785]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, yes. Just what I needed! I'll make a special concoction with this. The silithid won't like it one bit!\030The Orgrimmar Legion has put in a request for several unusual ingredients.  Given their current performance in Silithus, we'd like to comply with their request as soon as possible.  Gather the materials and bring them to the troll called Shai.\030Bring 6 Powerful Mojo, 6 Flasks of Big Mojo and 8 Oils of Immolation to Shadow Priestess Shai near Hive'Regal in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing IV in order to complete this quest.\030Do you have my materials, $N?\030The Orgrimmar Legion Needs Mojo!\0312,1,74,2,257,1,0\0302,77,180,2,257,1,0\0302,183,243,2,257,1,0\0303,1,122,2,384,1,0\0303,125,203,2,386,1,0\0301,1,8,4,272,1,15615\0301,10,28,4,272,1,15615\0301,30,70,4,272,1,15615\0301,72,106,4,272,1,15615\0304,1,29,3,256,2,15615\03115615,2,4,Shadow Priestess Shai\030112,2,4,Priestess\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,2,Silithus\0302,0,0,4,Shadow Priestess Shai\0302,0,0,4,Hive'Regal\0302,0,0,4,Silithus\031\031ITEM,21258,STARTER,?,10,\030ITEM,8956,OBJECTIVE,8,15,\030ITEM,8152,OBJECTIVE,6,15,\030ITEM,12804,OBJECTIVE,6,15,",[8786]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent work. We were in short supply of these, $N.\030The Orgrimmar Legion has put in a request for additional weapons that we haven't been able to provide at the moment.  Obtain the weapons they've requested and bring them to Merok Longstride outside of Hive'Regal.\030Bring 3 Massive Iron Axes to Merok Longstride at the Orgrimmar Legion camp outside of Hive'Regal.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VI in order to complete this quest.\030You have something for me, $N?\030Arms for the Field\0312,1,116,2,257,1,0\0302,119,212,2,257,1,0\0303,1,97,2,384,1,0\0303,100,178,2,386,1,0\0301,1,15,4,272,1,15613\0301,17,53,4,272,1,15613\0304,1,30,3,256,2,15613\03115613,2,2,Merok Longstride\03015613,2,3,Merok Longstride\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,2,Merok Longstride\0302,0,0,3,Merok Longstride\0302,0,0,3,Orgrimmar Legion\031\031ITEM,21261,STARTER,?,10,\030ITEM,3855,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8787]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, yes... I will distribute these to the troops, $N. The Orgrimmar Legion thanks you!\030The brave volunteers of the Orgrimmar Legion have arrived to Silithus to aid us in our cause.  Their supplies of armor kits were somehow lost in the trip.  Obtain a batch of armor kits and deliver them to Merok Longstride at the location of the Orgrimmar Legion camp.\030Bring 8 Rugged Armor Kits and 8 Heavy Armor Kits to Merok Longstride near Hive'Regal.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VII in order to complete this quest.\030You have something for me, $N?\030Armor Kits for the Field\0312,1,93,2,257,1,0\0302,96,154,2,261,1,0\0302,157,267,2,257,1,0\0303,1,85,2,384,1,0\0303,88,167,2,386,1,0\0301,1,10,4,272,1,15613\0301,12,53,4,272,3,15613\0301,55,86,4,272,1,15613\0304,1,30,3,256,2,15613\03115613,2,3,Merok Longstride\03015613,2,4,Merok Longstride\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,1,Silithus\0302,0,0,3,Merok Longstride\0302,0,0,4,Merok Longstride\0302,0,0,4,Hive'Regal\031\031ITEM,21264,STARTER,?,10,\030ITEM,15564,OBJECTIVE,8,15,\030ITEM,4265,OBJECTIVE,8,15,",[8788]="PARTIAL\031characters,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This present looks like it has been shaken a few times. The tag on it reads:$B$BTo a very special $r $c.\030\030\030\030A Gently Shaken Gift\0311,1,55,4,272,1,0\0301,57,76,4,272,1,0\0301,81,104,4,272,1,0\031\031\031\031OBJECT,180746,GIVER,?,9,Gently Shaken Gift\030OBJECT,180746,FINISHER,?,12,Gently Shaken Gift",[8789]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Infused with Elementium, these weapons will cut through the Qiraji and their God with incredible ease.\030We have not sat idly by for a millennium, $N.$B$BWe have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world. And we have learned of their own internal treachery.$B$BWeaknesses exist and we know how to use those weaknesses to our advantage.$B$BFind and bring me their ceremonial armaments: Combined with the element created from the volatility of their own God, they will become a force of reckoning.\030Arygos in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj will create Elementium Infused Armaments for you should you bring him Imperial Qiraji Armaments and 3 Elementium Ore.\030Seek out what I requested. You will become greater than the sum of your parts, champion.\030Imperial Qiraji Armaments\0312,1,45,2,257,1,15380\0302,50,136,2,257,1,15380\0302,138,208,2,261,1,15380\0302,210,261,2,257,1,15380\0302,266,339,2,257,1,15380\0302,344,499,2,257,3,15380\0303,1,151,2,384,3,15380\0301,1,102,4,272,3,15380\0304,1,26,3,256,1,15380\0304,28,88,3,256,3,15380\03115380,2,7,Arygos\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,7,Temple of Ahn'Qiraj\031\031ITEM,21232,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,18562,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[879]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031It is done then. Better it ends this way, says Mangletooth. <snort> They should have <snort> made sure I was dead when they turned their backs on me instead of leaving <snort> me here in this forsaken cage.$B$BThere is but one task left for you to finish, $R.\030Three of my tribe came out of the Kraul to lead the raids against the Horde, $r. <snort> They are ruthless and cunning, and if you defeat them, then your Crossroads and even most of the Barrens will learn peace... <snort> at least from the Razormane tribe. <snort>$B$BNak, Kuz, and Lok Orcbane are the ones you seek. They are far to the south  of the Barrens. One is a spell caster, another a tracker, and their leader, the one called Orcbane, <snort> a warrior. Kill them, $r, like they have killed me.\030Kill Nak, Kuz, and Lok Orcbane and bring their skulls to Mangletooth at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.\030How goes your hunt, $R? <snort>$B$BThork thinks he knows the truth about who leads the raids against his people, <snort> but he shall learn how wrong he is if you are successful.$B$BMy death is inescapable, but you have caused great pain to my enemies, so Mangletooth regrets nothing. <snort>\030Betrayal from Within\0312,1,80,2,257,1,3430\0302,82,213,2,265,4,3430\0302,215,256,2,257,1,3430\0302,258,264,2,257,1,3430\0302,269,316,2,259,1,3430\0302,318,359,2,257,1,3430\0302,361,462,2,257,1,3430\0302,464,503,2,257,1,3430\0303,1,100,2,384,1,3430\0301,1,16,4,272,1,3430\0301,18,59,4,272,1,3430\0301,61,206,4,272,1,3430\0301,211,259,4,272,1,3430\0304,1,23,3,256,2,3430\0304,25,31,3,256,1,3430\0304,36,178,3,256,4,3430\0304,183,284,3,260,1,3430\0304,286,292,3,256,1,3430\0313435,2,5,Lok Orcbane\0303435,2,9,Lok Orcbane\0303430,2,9,Mangletooth\0303430,4,11,Mangletooth\0303429,3,16,Thork\0303430,3,17,Mangletooth\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,3,Razormane\0302,0,0,9,Mangletooth\0302,0,0,9,Camp Taurajo\0302,0,0,9,Barrens\0315052,19,5052,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030906,23,906,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5074,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,5073,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,5072,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8790]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Use the item well, $N. Let them feel the pain that they so dearly wish to inflict upon others.\030Arygos theorizes that the element which is born of conflicts between the Old Gods and their minions is also extremely deadly to them under the right conditions. I speak of Elementium, mortal.$B$BFind and bring me Imperial Qiraji Regalia and the toxic element and I shall infuse weapons of great power.$B\030Merithra of the Dream in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj will create Elementium Infused Armaments for you should you bring her Imperial Qiraji Regalia and 3 Elementium Ore.$B\030You will strike them down and free us of these bonds.\030Imperial Qiraji Regalia\0312,1,160,2,321,1,15378\0302,162,191,2,257,1,15378\0302,196,301,2,257,3,15378\0303,1,164,2,384,3,15378\0301,1,22,4,272,1,15378\0301,24,94,4,274,3,15378\0304,1,53,3,256,3,15378\03115380,2,1,Arygos\03015378,2,4,Merithra of the Dream\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,4,Temple of Ahn'Qiraj\031\031ITEM,21237,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,18562,OBJECTIVE,3,15,",[8791]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I offer you my highest commendation and your choice of an item of power, $N. You have done the people of Kalimdor a great service.\030A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished.$B$BThe denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory. Take Ossirian's head and present it to Commander Mar'alith of Cenarion Hold.\030Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.$B\030Ah, $N, you have returned! And in one piece, I might add. What news do you bring from Ahn'Qiraj?\030The Fall of Ossirian\0312,1,40,2,257,1,0\0302,42,80,2,257,1,0\0302,85,151,2,257,4,0\0302,153,228,2,257,1,0\0303,1,95,2,384,1,0\0301,1,76,4,272,1,15181\0301,78,130,4,272,1,15181\0304,1,26,3,256,1,15181\0304,28,57,3,256,4,15181\0304,59,96,3,256,2,15181\03115181,2,4,Commander Mar'alith\03015339,2,5,Ossirian the Unscarred\03015181,2,5,Commander Mar'alith\0312,3429,0,0,\0302,0,0,4,Commander Mar'alith of Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,5,Commander Mar'alith\0302,0,0,5,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,5,Silithus\0303,0,0,10,Ahn'Qiraj\031\031ITEM,21220,STARTER,?,10,",[8792]="PARTIAL\031loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Throm'ka, $c! Good to see so many of the Horde, such as yourself, $n, coming out to lend your support in laying the groundwork for the upcoming Ahn'Qiraj War. The effort here will ensure that we are victorious against the Silithid and their evil masters hidden away inside Ahn'Qiraj.$B$BSo now that you are here, be sure to speak with the various collectors and offer your assistance in gathering those materials that you are suited to.\030Hello, I'm glad that you've decided to hear me out. The Horde needs all of the help that it can get to prepare for the Ahn'Qiraj War, and that means that we need you! Even now as we speak, official collectors are gathering the necessary material needed for the upcoming war, but we won't be able to meet our goals without your assistance, $N!$B$BYou should go speak with the guy in charge, Warlord Gorchuk. What do you say, $c? Will you help out with the vital preparations?\030Speak with Warlord Gorchuk in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits.\030\030The Horde Needs Your Help!\0312,1,51,2,257,1,15702\0302,53,166,2,263,1,15702\0302,168,342,2,261,1,15702\0302,347,406,2,257,1,15702\0302,408,427,2,257,2,15702\0302,429,474,2,257,2,15702\0303,1,60,2,384,1,15702\0301,1,13,4,272,1,15700\0301,15,158,4,276,1,15700\0301,160,283,4,272,3,15700\0301,288,436,4,304,1,15700\03115700,2,4,Warlord Gorchuk\03015700,2,7,Warlord Gorchuk\0312,0,0,7,Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits\0318793,22,8793,UNKNOWN\0308794,22,8794,UNKNOWN\031",[8793]="PARTIAL\031loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Throm'ka, $c! Good to see so many of the Horde, such as yourself, $n, coming out to lend your support in laying the groundwork for the upcoming Ahn'Qiraj War. The effort here will ensure that we are victorious against the Silithid and their evil masters hidden away inside Ahn'Qiraj.$B$BSo