what?! You're an engineer too! So, since you helped me teach my friends a lesson, I'm going to teach you how to make your very own mechanical yeti! Now the fun can go on forever and ever, and you can scare whoever you want! Provided that you can scare up the components to make it that is. $B$BWhat do you say, $N? Do you want to learn the secret to making a mechanical yeti?\030\030\030\030A Yeti of Your Own\0311,1,4,4,272,1,10305\0301,6,20,4,272,2,10305\0301,22,44,4,272,1,10305\0301,46,161,4,272,3,10305\0301,163,237,4,306,1,10305\0301,239,303,4,272,1,10305\0301,309,328,4,272,2,10305\0301,330,389,4,274,2,10305\03112257,4,4,Mechanical Yeti\03012257,4,8,Mechanical Yeti\0312,618,1452,0,\0315163,19,5163,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8799]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The machine lets off a little rumble and a small amount of steam as it starts working. It is not too long thereafter until it stops, heralded by another small jet of steam erupting from it. A door hatch opens, revealing a batch of preserved holly!\030Listen... I'm not really supposed to be telling you this, but since you're the hero of the day and all...$B$BThere's fresh holly everywhere this time of the year, but it never lasts.  We've got a machine that preserves holly - it never goes bad!  We use it to spice up the holiday... and profits during the summer!$B$BI'll let you use the preserver, but only if you're a master cook.  You'll need some deeprock salt and two, three, oh let's say five gold.  It'll net you a nice batch that's yours to keep.\030Bring 1 Deeprock Salt and 5 gold coins to the Holly Preserver machine, upon which you will receive 5 Preserved Holly.\030The \"Holly Preserver\" machine looks like some sort of still at first, but a careful examination of it reveals some goblin-esque changes to it. Still, your skill at cooking seems to allow you to understand how the machine works. $B$BThere is already fresh holly in the machine - you simply need to provide some deeprock salt and five gold coins to get the machine working.\030The Hero of the Day\0312,1,9,2,257,1,13418\0302,11,105,2,257,1,13418\0302,110,182,2,257,1,13418\0302,185,245,2,257,1,13418\0302,248,283,2,257,1,13418\0302,285,314,2,257,1,13418\0302,319,383,2,257,4,13418\0302,386,455,2,259,1,13418\0302,458,505,2,257,1,13418\0303,1,117,2,384,3,13418\0301,1,86,4,272,1,0\0301,88,189,4,272,1,0\0301,191,247,4,272,1,0\0304,1,142,3,256,1,0\0304,144,227,3,256,4,0\0304,233,371,3,258,1,0\031\0312,0,0,10,Holly Preserver\0318746,19,8746,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,180715,FINISHER,?,12,Holly Preserver\030ITEM,8150,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[88]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank goodness! That pig was getting so big she'd have eaten our whole crop! Thank you, $N.$B$BNow, do either of these suit you?\030The Brackwells have a prize-winning pig, Princess.  The sow is HUGE, and she got that way from sneaking over here and eating my veggies!$B$BSo before she comes to our fields...Princess must die!  Bring me her collar as proof of the deed and I'll give you something for your time!$B$BPrincess is usually over at the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch, to the east and beyond the Maclure farm.  Get her before she gets hungry and comes back here!\030Kill Princess, grab her collar, then bring it back to Ma Stonefield at the Stonefield Farm.\030Did you see her yet? Did you get her?\030Princess Must Die!\0312,1,50,2,257,1,244\0302,53,136,2,257,1,244\0302,141,194,2,265,1,244\0302,197,279,2,257,1,244\0302,284,380,2,257,1,244\0302,383,433,2,265,1,244\0303,1,91,2,384,1,244\0301,1,15,4,272,1,244\0301,17,76,4,272,1,244\0301,78,91,4,272,1,244\0301,96,128,4,272,2,244\0304,1,20,3,256,2,244\0304,22,37,3,256,2,244\031330,2,1,Princess\030330,2,3,Princess\030330,2,5,Princess\030330,2,7,Princess\030244,2,7,Ma Stonefield\0312,12,1429,0,\0302,0,0,5,Brackwell Pumpkin Patch\0302,0,0,7,Ma Stonefield\0302,0,0,7,Stonefield Farm\031\031ITEM,1006,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[880]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you, $N. Studying the beasts of an area can tell much about the area itself. We shall see what tale these shells tell.$B$BPlease accept my gratitude for your aid ... and perhaps you can use these coins. I find that I do not need them.\030Your findings are incredible, $N.  These oases hold properties that must come from an outside source.  Or perhaps an inside one.$B$BI want to know how these fissures are affecting the beasts who drink from the oases' water.$B$BHunt oasis snapjaws at the Lushwater and Stagnant Oases.  Bring me their shells so I may examine them.\030Bring 8 Altered Snapjaw Shells to Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads.\030How goes your collection? Did you get the shells?\030Altered Beings\0312,1,33,2,257,1,3448\0302,36,101,2,257,1,3448\0302,104,128,2,257,4,3448\0302,133,223,2,259,1,3448\0302,228,283,2,257,1,3448\0302,286,329,2,257,1,3448\0303,1,68,2,384,1,3448\0301,1,14,4,272,1,3448\0301,16,82,4,272,1,3448\0301,84,124,4,272,3,3448\0301,129,171,4,272,1,3448\0301,173,208,4,272,4,3448\0301,210,240,4,274,1,3448\0304,1,25,3,256,2,3448\0304,27,49,3,256,2,3448\0312408,2,7,Snapjaw\0303448,2,7,Tonga Runetotem\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,5,Lushwater\0302,0,0,7,Tonga Runetotem\0302,0,0,7,Crossroads\031877,19,877,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5098,OBJECTIVE,8,15,",[8800]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Kaldon sent you? Very well, let's see what we can do for you.\030As you complete the tasks you're assigned in the war you'll want to talk to Vargus, the blacksmith.  Show him any badges you've earned along the way. He'll provide you with gear to match your level of commitment to our cause.\030Talk to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.\030\030Cenarion Battlegear\0312,1,99,2,263,1,15540\0302,102,149,2,257,1,15540\0302,151,225,2,257,1,15540\0303,1,44,2,384,1,15540\0301,1,16,4,272,2,15176\0301,18,61,4,272,1,15176\03115176,2,1,Vargus\03015176,2,4,Vargus\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,1,Vargus\0302,0,0,4,Vargus\0302,0,0,4,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,4,Silithus\0318574,23,8574,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8801]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031We will leave this place on our own, Lady $N - once we are certain that the evil within has been wholly destroyed. Your journey of legend is almost at an end.\030The walls of Ahn'Qiraj tremble. A force of evil, older than the world itself, has been destroyed.$B$BAs you look at the remnants of the colossal abomination your heart nearly freezes. Even in death you can feel the legacy of C'Thun's evil around you.$B$BYou have done what was thought to be impossible.$B$BYou grab at an eye stalk of the fiend, stowing it safely in your pack.$B$BTake the Eye of C'Thun to the dragons in the next chamber.\030Take the Eye of C'Thun to Caelastrasz in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.\030Lady $N, you have freed us of its grasp.\030C'Thun's Legacy\0312,1,31,2,257,1,0\0302,33,97,2,261,1,0\0302,102,183,2,257,1,0\0302,185,250,2,257,1,0\0302,255,302,2,257,1,0\0302,307,376,2,257,1,0\0302,381,438,2,257,1,0\0303,1,65,2,384,1,0\0301,1,114,4,276,3,15379\0301,116,158,4,272,1,15379\0304,1,40,3,256,1,15379\0318545,2,3,Abomination\03016236,2,6,Eye Stalk\03015589,2,7,Eye of C'Thun\03015727,2,7,C'Thun\03015589,2,8,Eye of C'Thun\03015727,2,8,C'Thun\03015065,4,9,Lady\03015065,3,11,Lady\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,8,Caelastrasz\0302,0,0,8,Temple of Ahn'Qiraj\0318802,23,8802,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21221,STARTER,?,10,",[8802]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The Master has left these for you, champion. From the timeless cache: A collection of artifacts spanning thousands of years - the choice is yours.\030To the Caverns of Time you go, $G Lord:Lady; $N. Anachronos awaits your return. Give him the eye of C'Thun as he will undoubtedly wish to place it in his master's collection.$B\030Take the Eye of C'Thun to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.\030Lord $N! It is over...\030The Savior of Kalimdor\0312,1,48,2,257,1,15379\0302,50,79,2,257,1,15379\0302,81,174,2,259,3,15379\0303,1,60,2,384,1,15379\0301,1,44,4,272,1,15192\0301,46,146,4,272,1,15192\0304,1,8,3,256,1,15192\0304,10,22,3,256,1,15192\03115065,2,1,Lady\03015192,2,2,Anachronos\03015589,2,3,Eye of C'Thun\03015727,2,3,C'Thun\03015589,2,4,Eye of C'Thun\03015727,2,4,C'Thun\03015192,2,4,Anachronos\0312,3428,0,0,\0302,0,0,4,Anachronos\0302,0,0,4,Caverns of Time\0318801,19,8801,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8803]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The note on this present reads:$b$bTo $n,$b$bIn hoping this will help you spread warm tidings and holiday cheer to all of Azeroth.$b$bFrom Greatfather Winter\030\030\030\030A Festive Gift\0311,1,31,4,272,1,0\0301,46,130,4,272,3,0\0301,135,157,4,272,1,0\03113444,4,3,Greatfather Winter\031\031\031OBJECT,180793,GIVER,?,9,Festive Gift\030OBJECT,180793,FINISHER,?,12,Festive Gift",[8804]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,consequences,loreConnections,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030With the arrival of fresh recruits to Cenarion Hold comes the problem of keeping them alive in the desert.  Dehydration as well as numerous poisonous creatures present a serious threat to inexperienced volunteers.  Gather the supplies necessary for a desert survival kit and bring them to Calandrath in Cenarion Hold.\030Bring 4 Globes of Water, 4 Powerful Anti-Venom and 4 Smoked Desert Dumplings to Calandrath at the inn in Cenarion Hold in 