e this quest.\030\030Uniform Supplies\0312,1,66,2,257,1,0\0302,69,144,2,257,1,0\0303,1,119,2,384,1,0\0303,122,202,2,386,1,0\03115191,2,2,Windcaller Proudhorn\03014881,2,3,Spider\03015191,2,3,Windcaller Proudhorn\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,2,Windcaller Proudhorn\0302,0,0,3,Windcaller Proudhorn\0302,0,0,3,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,3,Silithus\031\031ITEM,21384,STARTER,?,10,\030ITEM,14342,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,14048,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,14227,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8809]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030Vargus, Cenarion Hold's blacksmith, has requested enchanted materials to be used in the crafting of powerful weapons for our forces.  Obtain these and bring them directly to Vargus so that Cenarion Hold's troops may continue to be well equipped.\030Bring 2 Enchanted Thorium Bars and 2 Enchanted Leather to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing IX in order to complete this quest.\030\030Extraordinary Materials\0312,1,132,2,257,1,0\0302,135,245,2,259,1,0\0303,1,94,2,384,1,0\0303,97,175,2,386,1,0\03115176,2,1,Vargus\03015176,2,2,Vargus\03015176,2,3,Vargus\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,2,Vargus\0302,0,0,3,Vargus\0302,0,0,3,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,3,Silithus\031\031ITEM,21381,STARTER,?,10,\030ITEM,12655,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,12810,OBJECTIVE,2,15,",[881]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've beaten Echeyakee, and though his days of hunting are over... his spirit is with you. He will show you the strength found in subtlety, and the honor in mercy.$B$BYour path is still long, $C. Let's hope you stride it well.\030Whitemist, Echeyakee in the Tauren tongue, is the king of the savannah cats.  He hunts with such stealth, they say he's like a thin, white mist on the earth.  And he kills so fast his prey have no time for fear, or pain.$B$BThe Tauren say he is both mercy and death.$B$BYou will learn if that's true, for I now set you on the path to hunt Echeyakee.  His lair is northeast of the Crossroads, among the bones of giant Kodo$B$BGo.  Blow this horn when you reach his lair.  Blow the horn, and he will come.\030Bring Echeyakee's Hide to Sergra Darkthorn at the Crossroads.\030The great cat calls to you, $N.\030Echeyakee\0312,1,76,2,257,1,3338\0302,79,157,2,257,1,3338\0302,160,220,2,257,1,3338\0302,225,266,2,257,1,3338\0302,271,349,2,257,4,3338\0302,352,421,2,257,1,3338\0302,431,469,2,257,1,3338\0302,472,503,2,257,3,3338\0303,1,61,2,384,1,3338\0301,1,67,4,272,1,3338\0301,69,91,4,272,1,3338\0301,93,164,4,272,3,3338\0301,169,196,4,272,1,3338\0301,198,227,4,272,3,3338\0304,1,31,3,256,1,3338\0313475,2,1,Echeyakee\0303568,2,2,Mist\0303475,2,5,Echeyakee\0303338,2,9,Sergra Darkthorn\0303475,4,10,Echeyakee\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,1,Tauren\0302,0,0,9,Sergra Darkthorn\0302,0,0,9,Crossroads\031903,19,903,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030905,23,905,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5100,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8810]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030Our supply of bandages in the battlefield is running dangerously low after the recent casualties we have incurred.  Obtain a batch of first-aid supplies and deliver them to Windcaller Proudhorn in Cenarion Hold.\030Bring 30 Heavy Runecloth Bandages, 30 Heavy Silk Bandages and 30 Heavy Mageweave Bandages to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing X in order to complete this quest.\030You have something for me, $N?$b$b\030Bandages for the Field\0312,1,114,2,257,1,0\0302,117,211,2,257,1,0\0303,1,143,2,384,1,0\0303,146,223,2,386,1,0\0304,1,30,3,256,2,15191\03115191,2,2,Windcaller Proudhorn\03015191,2,3,Windcaller Proudhorn\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,2,Windcaller Proudhorn\0302,0,0,2,Cenari