eat-father Winter. He is located near the Smokywood Pastures vendor area in Orgrimmar.\030\030Winter's Presents\0312,1,137,2,257,1,15732\0302,139,213,2,259,4,15732\0302,218,256,2,257,1,15732\0302,258,327,2,257,1,15732\0303,1,31,2,384,1,15732\0303,33,99,2,384,1,15732\0301,1,19,4,272,1,13445\0301,21,91,4,272,1,13445\0301,96,178,4,272,1,13445\0301,180,226,4,272,1,13445\0301,231,356,4,272,4,13445\03113445,2,1,Great-father Winter\03013445,2,4,Great-father Winter\03013445,2,5,Great-father Winter\03013444,4,9,Greatfather Winter\0312,0,0,1,Orgrimmar\0302,0,0,6,Smokywood Pastures\0302,0,0,6,Orgrimmar\031\031",[8829]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030The Twilight's Hammer operates through innumerable layers of secrecy and deceit.  While their actions are carried out in our world, they are planned in a place we have not yet been able to reach.$B$BWe've come to believe that the stones the Twilight's Hammer uses to summon their superiors allow for two-way transportation.  To attempt to use them in this manner, we must replicate - to every last detail - a twilight emissary's robe.$B$BGather the necessary materials and bring them to Aurel Goldleaf, $N.\030Bring a Skin of Shadow, 3 Frayed Abomination Stitchings and 1 Twilight Cultist Robe to Aurel Goldleaf at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing XI in order to complete this quest.$B\030\030The Ultimate Deception\0312,1,80,2,257,1,0\0302,83,195,2,257,1,0\0302,200,323,2,257,4,0\0302,326,434,2,257,1,0\0302,439,506,2,257,1,0\0303,1,131,2,384,1,0\0303,134,212,2,386,1,0\0318913,2,4,Twilight Emissary\03015282,2,5,Aurel Goldleaf\0304244,2,6,Shadow\0308545,2,6,Abomination\03015282,2,6,Aurel Goldleaf\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,5,Aurel Goldleaf\0302,0,0,6,Aurel Goldleaf\0302,0,0,6,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,6,Silithus\031\031ITEM,21514,STARTER,?,10,\030ITEM,12753,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,12735,O