ation Signet\0311,1,104,4,272,1,15766\0301,106,131,4,272,1,15766\0301,136,228,4,272,4,15766\0304,1,131,3,256,1,15766\0304,136,276,3,256,3,15766\0304,278,380,3,256,1,15766\0304,385,479,3,258,4,15766\031\031\0318811,19,8811,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21436,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8831]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent! It is no small sacrifice that you've made to earn these signets, and you will be acknowledged for your service appropriately. It's adventurers like you, $N, that truly make a difference.$B$BLet me know if you have additional signets to hand in; I'll gladly help you out with whatever ones you need exchanged.\030\030\030I accept commendation signets from adventurers who have received them in the line of duty. For each set of ten that you hand to me, I'll make sure that you receive a significant acknowledgement of your deeds with Stormwind. I also accept single tokens, but at a much reduced rate of recognition. We are much more interested in greater feats of duty, though no feat will be ignored.$B$BWith that said, I'll gladly take your signets if you are ready to hand in a set.\030Ten Commendation Signets\0311,1,10,4,272,1,15766\0301,12,136,4,272,3,15766\0301,138,197,4,272,1,15766\0301,202,319,4,274,4,15766\0304,1,90,3,256,1,15766\0304,92,223,3,256,1,15766\0304,225,295,3,256,1,15766\0304,297,381,3,256,3,15766\0304,386,465,3,256,4,15766\031\031\0318819,19,8819,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21436,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8832]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Very well - your deeds have been entered into the records, and you are duly recognized for your efforts. Keep up the good work, $C.$B$BIf you have any more signets to hand in, then I am able to assist you further in that regard.\030\030\030For those adventure