CH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21438,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8846]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,consequences,locations,loreConnections,objectives,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030Ah, here for additional supplies for yourself, are you?  Well, I can certainly understand the need for additional materiel... just take a look around if you need any proof.$B$BI'll issue you some additional supplies, but you'll need to give me an appropriate number of commendation signets in exchange.  You won't receive any recognition for surrendering the signets in this manner, but you might find something useful that will help keep you alive when battle is finally upon us.\030\030\030Five Signets for War Supplies\0312,1,55,2,257,2,15701\0302,58,125,2,259,1,15701\0302,127,172,2,259,4,15701\0302,177,302,2,259,1,15701\0302,305,480,2,261,4,15701\031\031\031\031ITEM,21436,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[8847]="UNRESOLVED\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Ten Signets for War Supplies\031\031\031\031\031ITEM,21436,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8848]="UNRESOLVED\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Fifteen Signets for War Supplies\031\031\031\031\031ITEM,21436,OBJECTIVE,15,15,",[8849]="UNRESOLVED\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Twenty Signets for War Supplies\031\031\031\031\031ITEM,21436,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[885]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The thunderhawk is a rare beast of the Barrens, and its death can portend great fortune, or great doom.$B$BBut Washte Pawne, called Spirit Biter in Taurahe, can bring neither... or both.$B$BThe pain you felt from hunting Spirit Biter is the pang all feel who make great gains at great costs. The sting you felt is the pain of regret.$B$BBut I can see you have conquered this. You have learned that regret turns to wisdom, and that through pain one gains strength.$B$BYou have learned much, $N.\030The feather of Washte Pawne is painful to the touch.\030Bring Washte Pawne's Feather to Jorn Skyseer at Camp Taurajo.\030There is new resolve within you, $N. A resolve born from pain...$B$BAre you burdened with the death of Washte Pawne?\030Washte Pawne\0312,1,52,2,257,1,0\0303,1,61,2,384,1,0\0301,1,103,4,272,1,3387\0301,108,177,4,272,1,3387\0301,179,186,4,272,1,3387\0301,191,291,4,272,1,3387\0301,293,333,4,272,1,3387\0301,338,375,4,272,1,3387\0301,377,463,4,272,1,3387\0301,468,493,4,272,1,3387\0304,1,36,3,256,1,3387\0304,38,64,3,256,1,3387\0304,69,116,3,256,2,3387\0313472,2,1,Washte Pawne\0303472,2,2,Washte Pawne\0303387,2,2,Jorn Skyseer\0303472,4,4,Washte Pawne\0303472,3,13,Washte Pawne\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,2,Jorn Skyseer\0302,0,0,2,Camp Taurajo\0304,0,0,4,Taurahe\031\031ITEM,5103,STARTER,?,10,",[8850]="UNRESOLVED\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Thirty Signets for War Supplies\031\031\031\031\031ITEM,21436,OBJECTIVE,30,15,",[8851]="UNRESOLVED\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Five Signets for War Supplies\031\031\031\031\031ITEM,21438,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[8852]="UNRESOLVED\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Ten Signets for War Supplies\031\031\031\031\031ITEM,21438,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8853]="UNRESOLVED\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Fifteen Signets for War Supplies\031\031\031\031\031ITEM,21438,OBJECTIVE,15,15,",[8854]="UNRESOLVED\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Twenty Signets for War Supplies\031\031\031\031\031ITEM,21438,OBJECTIVE,20,15,",[8855]="UNRESOLVED\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030Thirty Signets for War Supplies\031\031\031\031\031ITEM,21438,OBJECTIVE,30,15,",[8856]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030With the arrival of fresh recruits to Cenarion Hold comes the problem of keeping them alive in the desert.  Dehydration as well as numerous poisonous creatures present a serious threat to inexperienced volunteers.  Gather the supplies necessary for a desert survival kit and bring them to Calandrath in Cenarion Hold.\030Bring 4 Globes of Water, 4 Powerful Anti-Venom and 4 Baked Salmon to Calandrath at the inn in Cenarion Hold in Silithus.\030\030Desert Survival Kits\0312,1,106,2,261,1,0\0302,109,213,2,261,1,0\0302,216,317,2,265,1,0\0303,1,120,2,384,1,0\03115174,2,3,Calandrath\03015174,2,4,Calandrath\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,1,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,3,Calandrath\0302,0,0,3,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,4,Calandrath\0302,0,0,4,Cenarion Hold\0302,0,0,4,Silithus\031\031ITEM,7079,OBJECTIVE,4,15,\030ITEM,19440,OBJECTIVE,4,15,\030ITEM,20452,OBJECTIVE,4,15,",[8857]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Oh the chickens I will craft from this wondrous husk! Well done, my $gboy:girl; !\030I'm looking for battle hardened adventurers willing and able to get a fresh husk sample from the fallen Colossus of Ashi to Oglethorpe in Booty Bay. No, no, I wouldn't want you to go anywhere near that thing's corpse. Just take one of my samples and make it snappy. These things are no good to him rotten!\030Take the Colossus of Ashi's Husk to Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay.$B\030Yes? What have you got there?\030Secrets of the Colossus - Ashi\0312,1,148,2,261,1,15798\0302,150,217,2,257,1,15798\0302,219,265,2,257,1,15798\0302,267,305,2,257,1,15798\0303,1,70,2,384,1,15798\0301,1,53,4,272,3,7406\0301,55,81,4,272,1,7406\0304,1,4,3,256,2,7406\0304,6,29,3,256,2,7406\03115742,2,1,Colossus of Ashi\03015742,2,5,Colossus of Ashi\0307406,2,5,Oglethorpe Obnoticus\030371,4,7,Girl\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,1,Oglethorpe\0302,0,0,1,Booty Bay\0302,0,0,5,Oglethorpe Obnoticus\0302,0,0,5,Booty Bay\031\031",[8858]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent. We could surely devise some incredibly powerful armor from this chitin. Here's the riches you were promised.\030There ain't nothin' I'd like more than to stuff this bug husk down Oilfist's fat face... Cept, I'm stuck here collectin' samples from that overgrown cockroach. I'll be here 'till the wee mornin' hours given the size o' that thing.$B$BTake this here sample to Oilfist fer me and do it fast, $c. He's payin' BIG!$B$BYar, Thorium Point - it be in the Searin' Gorge.\030Take the Colossus of Regal's Husk to Overseer Oilfist in Searing Gorge.$B\030Hmmm...\030Secrets of the Colossus - Regal\0312,1,88,2,259,1,15799\0302,90,159,2,257,1,15799\0302,161,230,2,257,1,15799\0302,235,293,2,257,1,15799\0302,295,310,2,257,1,15799\0302,315,362,2,257,1,15799\0303,1,71,2,384,1,15799\0301,1,10,4,272,1,14625\0301,12,82,4,272,4,14625\0301,84,119,4,272,1,14625\0304,1,7,3,256,1,14625\0317395,2,2,Cockroach\03015741,2,7,Colossus of Regal\03014625,2,7,Overseer Oilfist\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,4,Oilfist\0302,0,0,6,Searin' Gorge\0302,0,0,7,Overseer Oilfist\0302,0,0,7,Searing Gorge\031\031",[8859]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent and timely! Well done, $Glad:lass;.\030My servants were nearly killed in their efforts to recover this sample. You absolutely must hurry! Lord Maxwell Tyrosus eagerly awaits a fresh husk sample. He believes that the secrets of this Colossus could help us in the war against the Scourge!$B$BWhy are you still here!? To Light's Hope! Yes, you will be rewarded handsomely for your efforts...$B\030Take the Colossus of Zora's Husk to Lord Maxwell Tyrosus at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.$B\030You look a bit heavy in the boots, friend.\030Secrets of the Colossus - Zora\0312,1,71,2,257,1,15797\0302,73,98,2,257,1,15797\0302,100,155,2,257,1,15797\0302,157,247,2,325,4,15797\0302,252,275,2,257,2,15797\0302,277,292,2,257,3,15797\0302,294,349,2,257,3,15797\0303,1,107,2,384,3,15797\0301,1,21,4,272,1,11034\0301,23,45,4,272,1,11034\0304,1,42,3,256,1,11034\03111034,2,3,Lord Maxwell Tyrosus\03015740,2,8,Colossus of Zora\03011034,2,8,Lord Maxwell Tyrosus\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,8,Lord Maxwell Tyrosus\0302,0,0,8,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,8,Eastern Plaguelands\031\031",[886]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031My brethren in Thunder Bluff were wise to send you, young $C. For the mystery of the Barrens is one that I alone cannot unravel.$B$BWith your aid, let us hope we can find answers to our questions.\030The druids of Thunder Bluff sense a strange power leaking into the Barrens, east of Mulgore.$B$BTonga Runetotem was sent to discover the source of this power, but we fear he will need aid.$B$BTravel to the Barrens and speak with Tonga.  He will be at the Crossroads.  To reach there, take the road east out of Bloodhoof village.  Enter the Barrens, then turn north when the road forks.  Continue north and  you will find the Crossroads.$B$BAnd do not leave the road, $N, for the Barrens is a harsh land.\030Speak with Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads.\030\030The Barrens Oases\0312,1,92,2,257,1,5769\0302,97,188,2,259,3,5769\0302,193,235,2,257,1,5769\0302,238,266,2,257,3,5769\0302,269,328,2,257,1,5769\0302,331,385,2,257,1,5769\0302,388,436,2,257,3,5769\0302,441,503,2,257,1,5769\0303,1,45,2,384,1,5769\0301,1,61,4,272,1,3448\0301,63,128,4,272,1,3448\0301,133,196,4,274,3,3448\0313448,2,2,Tonga Runetotem\0303448,2,9,Tonga Runetotem\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,1,Mulgore\0302,0,0,3,Barrens\0302,0,0,4,Crossroads\0302,0,0,9,Crossroads\0304,0,0,10,Thunder Bluff\031870,23,870,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030870,24,870,UNKNOWN\031",[8860]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Oh, my Smokywood supplies! Splendid! I'll need these to feed all the people in town for the celebration!$B$BThank you, $N. Please take this as payment, and don't forget to drink and dance with the revelers outside!\030Stormwind is holding a celebration for the new year!  All day long today you can get free booze, and at night they'll put on a firework show!  It should be pretty nice... but Booty Bay is also having a party today; I bet it'll be even better!$B$BWell anyway, Innkeeper Allison in Stormwind needs a supply of Smoky Wood Pasture fare to help feed all the party goers.  Can you do me a favor and deliver it!$B$BThanks, $N!  Innkeeper Allison is in the Gilded Rose, in the Trade District of Stormwind.\030Bring the Smokywood Supplies to Innkeeper Allison in Stormwind.\030Greetings! Are you here for the party! Or perhaps you just need to rest those weary feet of yours...\030New Year Celebrations!\0312,1,52,2,257,1,15732\0302,55,141,2,257,1,15732\0302,144,170,2,257,1,15732\0302,172,242,2,257,1,15732\0302,247,365,2,259,1,15732\0302,368,404,2,257,1,15732\0302,409,419,2,257,1,15732\0302,422,497,2,257,1,15732\0303,1,63,2,384,1,15732\0301,1,26,4,272,1,6740\0301,28,36,4,272,1,6740\0301,38,104,4,274,1,6740\0301,109,122,4,272,1,6740\0301,124,214,4,272,1,6740\0304,1,10,3,256,1,6740\0304,12,38,3,256,1,6740\0304,40,100,3,258,4,6740\0316740,2,5,Innkeeper Allison\0306740,2,8,Innkeeper Allison\0306740,2,9,Innkeeper Allison\0312,0,0,5,Stormwind\0302,0,0,8,Gilded Rose\0302,0,0,8,Trade District of Stormwind\0302,0,0,9,Innkeeper Allison\0302,0,0,9,Stormwind\031\031",[8861]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Oh, very good! These supplies will help feed all our people, here to celebrate the new year!$B$BI thank you, $N. You are in my debt. Please, take these coins... and heed my advice - drink heartily from the kegs outside, and join our revelers in a dance of celebration!\030Thunder Bluff is holding a celebration for the new year!  All day you'll find free booze there, and at night they'll put on a firework show!$B$BIt should be pretty nice... but Booty Bay is also having a party today; I bet it'll be even better!$B$BWell anyway, Innkeeper Pala in Thunder Bluff needs a supply of Smoky Wood Pasture fare to help feed all the party goers.  Can you do me a favor and deliver it!$B$BThanks, $N!  Innkeeper Pala is in the inn near the bridge to Hunter's Rise.\030Bring the Smokywood Supplies to Innkeeper Pala in Thunder Bluff.\030Good day, $C! Did you come to Thunder Bluff for our celebrations?  Or are you here to rest a weary hoof between hunts?\030New Year Celebrations!\0312,1,56,2,257,1,15732\0302,59,140,2,257,1,15732\0302,145,171,2,257,1,15732\0302,173,243,2,257,1,15732\0302,248,367,2,259,1,15732\0302,370,406,2,257,1,15732\0302,411,421,2,257,1,15732\0302,424,485,2,257,1,15732\0303,1,64,2,384,1,15732\0301,1,14,4,272,1,6746\0301,16,92,4,272,3,6746\0301,97,112,4,272,1,6746\0301,114,132,4,272,1,6746\0301,134,160,4,272,1,6746\0301,162,268,4,272,1,6746\0304,1,13,3,256,1,6746\0304,15,65,3,256,2,6746\0304,68,118,3,256,2,6746\0316746,2,5,Innkeeper Pala\0306746,2,8,Innkeeper Pala\0306746,2,9,Innkeeper Pala\0312,0,0,5,Thunder Bluff\0302,0,0,8,Hunter's Rise\0302,0,0,9,Innkeeper Pala\0302,0,0,9,Thunder Bluff\0303,0,0,17,Thunder Bluff\031\031",[8862]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Very well then - I accept these coins of ancestry. Please take Elune's candle with my blessing. Also, please enjoy these complimentary fireworks.$B$BMay your Lunar Festival be joyous and filled with merriment, $N.$B$BAnd if you choose to face Omen and his minions, you will find Elune's candle quite useful...\030\030\030Elune's candle is an artifact of great reverence to the disciples of the Lunar Festival. Stored within the candle is true moonlight, ready to be unleashed!$B$BThis light is harmless to most creatures, but you will find that Omen and his minions are burned and dazzled by it.\030Elune's Candle\0311,1,50,4,272,1,15864\0301,52,95,4,272,1,15864\0301,97,145,4,272,1,15864\0301,150,213,4,272,1,15864\0301,218,309,4,272,4,15864\0304,1,88,3,256,1,15864\0304,90,155,3,256,1,15864\0304,160,274,3,256,3,15864\03115467,4,5,Omen\03015467,3,8,Omen\031\031\031ITEM,21100,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[8863]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent - please enjoy these dumplings with my compliments. While they are but a small token of appreciation for the honor you have brought upon yourself through your actions, I think you will enjoy them all the same.$B$BShould you have any more coins of ancestry, I stand ready to offer you a wide array of items in exchange.\030\030\030If you are hungry, then you have come to the right place my friend! Dumplings are the traditional food of the Lunar Festival; it has been served since the time of the first Lunar Festival, and I am pleased to be able to offer it at this one.  In exchange for just a single coin of ancestry, I will share with you a sampling of one of the tastiest dishes you will ever enjoy!\030Festival Dumplings\0311,1,61,4,272,1,15864\0301,63,219,4,272,3,15864\0301,224,328,4,272,1,15864\0304,1,67,3,256,4,15864\0304,69,241,3,256,1,15864\0304,244,374,3,256,3,15864\031\031\031\031ITEM,21100,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8864]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Very well then - I accept these coins of ancestry. Please take your dress with my blessing. Also, please enjoy these complimentary fireworks.$B$BAs you have honored your elders, you honor me with your mere presence. Thank you, and may your Lunar Festival be joyous.\030\030\030I have a selection of dresses that may be of interest to you.  Such dresses have been worn in times past during the Lunar Festival, and the selection I have today is perhaps the finest I have ever seen.  Each is hand-crafted with only the finest and softest of components.$B$BIn exchange for some coins of ancestry, I will let you choose one of the three styles I have to keep as your own.  Is this acceptable to you?\030Festive Lunar Dresses\0311,1,50,4,272,1,15864\0301,52,91,4,272,1,15864\0301,93,141,4,272,1,15864\0301,146,215,4,272,1,15864\0301,217,265,4,272,1,15864\0304,1,61,3,256,1,15864\0304,64,202,3,256,4,15864\0304,205,272,3,256,1,15864\0304,277,389,3,256,3,15864\0304,392,417,3,256,2,15864\031\031\031\031ITEM,21100,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[8865]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Very well then - I accept these coins of ancestry. Please take your pant suit with my blessing. Also, please enjoy these complimentary fireworks.$B$BShould you have more coins of ancestry to trade, then speak with me again. I will be offering various items throughout the entirety of the Lunar Festival.\030\030\030I am please to inform you that I have a fine selection of festive pant suits available for you to own... but only in trade for coins of ancestry.  If fashion is important to you, then these are what you're looking for!  I assure you that you will not find pant suits like these anywhere else.$B$BIn exchange for some Coins of Ancestry, I will let you choose one of the three styles I have to keep as your own.  Is this acceptable to you?\030Festive Lunar Pant Suits\0311,1,50,4,272,1,15864\0301,52,95,4,272,1,15864\0301,97,145,4,272,1,15864\0301,150,223,4,272,1,15864\0301,225,303,4,272,3,15864\0304,1,104,3,256,1,15864\0304,106,145,3,256,1,15864\0304,148,218,3,256,4,15864\0304,221,292,3,256,3,15864\0304,297,409,3,256,3,15864\0304,412,437,3,256,2,15864\031\031\031\031ITEM,21100,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[8866]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031It is good to know the people of this land still pay homage to the olden races. I bid you well, $N, and offer you this token...\030\030\030\030Bronzebeard the Elder\0311,1,79,4,272,1,15871\0301,81,127,4,272,1,15871\031\031\031\031",[8867]="PARTIAL\031conflict,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030objectiveLabel3\030requestItems\030title\031Well done, $N.$B$BNow that you're in the spirit of things, why don't you take this invitation to the festival in Moonglade.$B$BIt's quite an enjoyable celebration, if you have the time to spare.  We share food, drink, stories and of course... more fireworks!$B$BOpen the invitation while standing inside the circle of greater moonlight and you'll be transported to Moonglade.\030Every year the druids of Moonglade hold a celebration of our city's great triumph over an ancient evil.$B$BWe celebrate the wisdom of our elders, share in magnificent feasts and of course... shoot fireworks!$B$BFor a small donation you can purchase colorful rockets from our vendor.  Try using some of the launchers around here, $N.\030Launch 8 Lunar Fireworks and 2 Cluster Fireworks and return to a Lunar Festival Harbinger at any capital city.\030\030Lunar Fireworks Fired\030Lunar Fireworks Cluster Fired\030Did you find the launchers, $N?\030Lunar Fireworks\0312,1,103,2,321,1,15895\0302,108,190,2,257,1,15895\0302,192,207,2,257,1,15895\0302,212,282,2,257,1,15895\0302,285,332,2,257,1,15895\0303,1,110,2,384,1,15895\0301,1,14,4,272,1,15895\0301,19,123,4,304,1,15895\0301,128,194,4,272,4,15895\0301,197,242,4,272,1,15895\0301,244,258,4,272,1,15895\0301,263,375,4,272,1,15895\0307,1,31,3,256,2,15895\0305,1,21,3,384,1,15895\0306,1,29,3,384,1,15895\03115895,2,6,Lunar Festival Harbinger\0314,0,0,8,Moonglade\0304,0,0,12,Moonglade\0318883,23,8883,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,15893,OBJECTIVE,8,13,Lunar Firework Credit Marker\030NPC,15894,OBJECTIVE,2,13,Lunar Cluster Credit Marker",[8868]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030requestItems\030title\031Very well done, $n.  Defeating Omen sent his spirit back to the waters of Elune'ara.  Although the beast himself is blessed by Elune and so cannot die, his anger will subside for another year.$b$bYour victory is a celebration, $n--a celebration of the might of Omen, of you and your allies, and of the peace you have given this tragic hero of our past.\030The beast Omen was once a hero of this world.  A wolf of great strength and fortune, Omen fought beside the heroes of the War of the Ancients until he succumbed to demonic magics.  Turning against his allies, he raged across Azeroth and carried death and terror in his wake.$B$BFinally defeated here, in Moonglade, Omen now sleeps among the silt of Lake Elune'ara.  But each new year, during the festival, he stirs...$B$BGather cohorts, $N, and summon and defeat the beast Omen.  Earn the blessing of Elune!\030Summon Omen, defeat him and gain Elune's Blessing.  Return to Valadar Starsong in Nighthaven\030Receive Elune's Blessing.\030\030Elune's Blessing\0312,1,45,2,257,1,15864\0302,48,179,2,325,1,15864\0302,182,274,2,257,1,15864\0302,279,364,2,257,1,15864\0302,367,417,2,257,1,15864\0302,422,478,2,257,1,15864\0302,481,507,2,257,1,15864\0303,1,50,2,384,1,15864\0303,53,92,2,384,1,15864\0301,1,19,4,272,1,15864\0301,22,84,4,272,1,15864\0301,87,192,4,272,3,15864\0301,197,352,4,280,4,15864\0304,1,25,3,384,1,15864\03110430,2,1,The Beast\03015467,2,1,Omen\03015467,2,2,Omen\03015467,2,4,Omen\03010430,2,6,The Beast\03015467,2,6,Omen\03015467,2,8,Omen\03015864,2,9,Valadar Starsong\03015467,4,11,Omen\03010430,4,12,The Beast\03015467,4,13,Omen\0312,0,0,4,Moonglade\0302,0,0,9,Valadar Starsong\0302,0,0,9,Nighthaven\031\031",[8869]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030Within the confines of the Scarlet Bastion lies sweet Serenity. The Crimson Hammersmith guards the recipe with his life. Defeat him and bring me his apron. For that, I shall train you to become a hammersmith.$B$BUnderstand this: Once you have chosen the path of the hammersmith, the paths of the swordsmith and axesmith will no longer be available.\030Travel to Stratholme and kill the Crimson Hammersmith. Recover the Crimson Hammersmith's Apron and return to Lilith.\030\030Sweet Serenity\0312,1,63,2,257,1,0\0302,65,120,2,257,1,0\0302,122,155,2,257,1,0\0302,157,208,2,257,3,0\0302,213,348,2,257,3,0\0303,1,54,2,384,1,0\0303,56,116,2,384,1,0\03111120,2,2,Crimson Hammersmith\03011120,2,6,Crimson Hammersmith\03011120,2,7,Crimson Hammersmith\0312,0,0,6,Stratholme\0302,0,0,7,Lilith\031\031ITEM,13351,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[887]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You did good, kid. A little more work like that, and it'll be one less thing I'll have to worry about. Hopefully they'll be convinced that they should relocate their operation elsewhere.$B$BIn the meantime, there is the small matter of getting back the goods they stole from me!\030I sure wish Vice Admiral Grezzlik did a better job of keeping the seas safe for our trading vessels. With all the gold the trade princes have poured into the Trade Fleets, it ticks me off to see so many pirates running willy-nilly, raiding my ships and stealing my goods!$B$BI heard that the Southsea Freebooters have set up a camp just south of here. They've been a real thorn in my side and if Grezzlik won't take care of them, well, maybe you can help me get rid of them.\030Kill 12 Southsea Brigands and 6 Southsea Cannoneers for Gazlowe in Ratchet.\030I don't even want to think about the profits I've lost from pirate raiding, and now they set up camp on my doorstep? It's getting out of hand, Undermine's got to do something about it.\030Southsea Freebooters\0312,1,100,2,259,3,3391\0302,102,271,2,257,1,3391\0302,276,351,2,257,1,3391\0302,353,474,2,257,4,3391\0303,1,75,2,384,1,3391\0301,1,18,4,272,1,3391\0301,20,102,4,272,1,3391\0301,104,186,4,272,3,3391\0301,191,278,4,272,1,3391\0304,1,116,3,262,2,3391\0304,118,184,3,256,1,3391\0313391,2,5,Gazlowe\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,5,Ratchet\031890,23,890,