5909\031\031\031\031ITEM,21100,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[8877]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Here you are, $N. Here is the schematic to create a firework launcher. Place launchers where you wish to celebrate, and then welcome your friends to join you!\030\030\030Although rockets are a wonderful way to celebrate, in order to see their glory... they must be fired from a launcher.$B$BBring me coins of ancestry and I can offer you the knowledge to create rocket launchers like the ones you see in Moonglade.\030Firework Launcher\0311,1,17,4,272,1,15909\0301,19,70,4,272,1,15909\0301,72,158,4,274,3,15909\0304,1,81,3,258,1,15909\0304,83,117,3,256,1,15909\0304,122,244,3,256,1,15909\0319275,4,2,Launcher\0309275,3,5,Launcher\0313,0,0,6,Moonglade\031\031ITEM,21100,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[8878]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Here are the patterns, $N. I am sure you will find the product of this knowledge quite beautiful.\030\030\030The dresses and pant suits you see are traditional clothes from many years past.$B$BThey are worn in honor of old ways and loved ones gone. If you bring me coins of ancestry, <name>, then I will give you the pattern to create traditional red dresses or suits.\030Festive Recipes\0311,1,26,4,272,1,15909\0301,28,97,4,272,3,15909\0304,1,80,3,256,1,15909\0304,85,139,3,256,1,15909\0304,141,259,3,256,4,15909\031\031\031\031ITEM,21100,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[8879]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Very well - I accept these coins of ancestry. Here are your recipes, $N. May you use them to spread Elune's glory!\030\030\030Large Festival rockets light up the sky brilliantly - only the cluster rockets rival their magnificence!$B$BBring me coins of ancestry, <name>, and I shall share the knowledge of their creation.\030Large Rockets\0311,1,45,4,272,1,15909\0301,47,72,4,272,1,15909\0301,74,114,4,272,1,15909\0304,1,104,3,256,1,15909\0304,109,194,3,256,3,15909\031\031\031\031ITEM,21100,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[888]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031It's a relief to get all this stuff back, so thanks for your help, $N. You know, I could use a $R like you to help out with my operation here. If you're ever looking for work, don't forget about how well Gazlowe pays for service!\030While I'd like to recover all my goods, I'm sure that's not possible. Still, there's a few things that I absolutely must have!$B$BAs you see, my observatory is ready to go, but it needs the smaller of the two lenses. The first arrived by caravan from Durotar, but the second was bound by ship, and never arrived. Also, I never got my boot shipment from Drizzlik in Booty Bay!$B$BHead down to the pirate camp and see if you can find them.\030Retrieve the Shipment of Boots and Telescopic Lens for Gazlowe in Ratchet.\030Did you find my things, $N?\030Stolen Booty\0312,1,69,2,259,1,3391\0302,71,126,2,257,1,3391\0302,131,216,2,259,1,3391\0302,218,312,2,261,1,3391\0302,314,375,2,257,1,3391\0302,380,437,2,257,4,3391\0303,1,74,2,384,1,3391\0301,1,70,4,272,1,3391\0301,72,142,4,272,4,3391\0301,144,229,4,272,4,3391\0304,1,27,3,256,2,3391\0312495,2,5,Drizzlik\0303391,2,7,Gazlowe\0303391,4,10,Gazlowe\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,4,Durotar\0302,0,0,5,Drizzlik\0302,0,0,5,Booty Bay\0302,0,0,7,Ratchet\031892,19,892,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5076,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,5077,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8880]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Here you are, $N. Take these recipes and learn their secrets. I bid you fortune, and I look forward to seeing your magnificent creations.\030\030\030Cluster rockets are a collection of individual rockets, and their beauty is awesome!  Bring me coins of ancestry and I will share the knowledge of their creation to you...\030Cluster Rockets\0311,1,17,4,272,1,15909\0301,19,61,4,272,1,15909\0301,63,137,4,272,1,15909\0304,1,84,3,256,1,15909\0304,87,171,3,256,3,15909\031\031\031\031ITEM,21100,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[8881]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you, $N. Here is the recipe for large cluster rockets. May your products bring joy and luck to all those who gaze up them.\030\030\030Large cluster rockets require vast resources and skill to create, but their brilliance and beauty is worth that effort!  Bring me coins of ancestry and I will grant you the knowledge of their crafting.\030Large Cluster Rockets\0311,1,14,4,272,1,15909\0301,16,60,4,272,1,15909\0301,62,128,4,272,1,15909\0304,1,119,3,256,1,15909\0304,122,201,3,256,3,15909\031\031\031\031ITEM,21100,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[8882]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Here is your schematic. Study it closely, and learn...$B$BGood luck, $N. May your celebrations rival that of the Lunar Festival itself!\030\030\030The most splendid fireworks shows must include cluster rockets, and those cluster rockets must be fired from cluster launchers! Is it not then logical for you to learn the secrets of making cluster launchers? Bring me coins of ancestry and I will give this knowledge to you.\030Cluster Launcher\0311,1,23,4,272,1,15909\0301,25,54,4,272,1,15909\0301,59,72,4,272,1,15909\0301,74,135,4,272,1,15909\0304,1,127,3,256,1,15909\0304,129,208,3,256,2,15909\0304,210,274,3,256,3,15909\031\031\031\031ITEM,21100,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[8883]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031$N, welcome to Nighthaven, host of the Lunar Festival!  Although our village is normally remote and sequestered from the peoples of Azeroth, during this time of celebration we open our arms and hearts to all.$B$BEnjoy your visit, $n, and speak with me or my sister again when ready.\030Now that you have your Lunar Festival invitation, you may travel to Moonglade!  There you will find many revelers, and in the village of Nighthaven Valadar Starsong and his sister Fariel await those eager to participate in the celebration.$B$BTravel to Moonglade through the greater moonlight and speak with Valadar Starsong; see what prizes you might gain during the festival!\030Use your Lunar Festival Invitation in the moonlight to travel to Moonglade. Speak with Valadar Starsong in Nighthaven when you arrive.\030\030Valadar Starsong\0312,1,78,2,257,1,15895\0302,81,239,2,257,3,15895\0302,244,377,2,257,4,15895\0303,1,75,2,384,1,15895\0303,77,134,2,384,1,15895\0301,1,54,4,272,1,15864\0301,57,208,4,272,1,15864\0301,213,282,4,272,1,15864\03115864,2,2,Valadar Starsong\03015864,2,3,Valadar Starsong\03015864,2,5,Valadar Starsong\0312,0,0,1,Moonglade\0302,0,0,3,Moonglade\0302,0,0,4,Moonglade\0302,0,0,5,Nighthaven\0304,0,0,6,Nighthaven\0318867,19,8867,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[889]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Good. Go with Agamaggan's spirit as your guide, $R. Return to me if you desire more of Agamaggan's magics.\030\030\030Bring Mangletooth 10 blood shards and I will bless you with great speed. You will run with zhevra and the wind will be jealous of you.$B$BIt will not last long, but it should be enough to help you travel throughout the Barrens.\030Spirit of the Wind\0311,1,5,4,272,1,3430\0301,7,51,4,272,1,3430\0301,53,106,4,274,4,3430\0304,1,72,3,256,3,3430\0304,74,134,3,256,3,3430\0304,139,227,3,256,3,3430\0313430,3,4,Mangletooth\0312,17,1413,0,\0315052,19,5052,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5075,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[8893]="PARTIAL\031conflict,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You place the hippogryph egg into the machine. A series of beeps follows along with some strange mechanical sounds.$B$BIt appears that the Eggometer has weighed, measured, and packaged your egg. Now that's speedy service!\030\030\030The Super Egg-O-Matic is the latest of Curgle Cranklehop's inventions. It is quite an impressive piece of machinery.$B$BThe Super Egg-O-Matic sputters wildly as you approach the control panel.\030The Super Egg-O-Matic\0311,1,46,4,272,1,0\0301,48,115,4,272,1,0\0301,120,194,4,272,1,0\0301,196,221,4,304,1,0\0304,1,70,3,256,1,0\0304,72,116,3,256,1,0\0304,121,192,3,256,1,0\03116547,4,4,Speedy\0307763,3,5,Curgle Cranklehop\0312,440,1446,0,\0312741,19,2741,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,142071,GIVER,?,9,Egg-O-Matic\030OBJECT,142071,FINISHER,?,12,Egg-O-Matic\030ITEM,8564,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8897]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Oh, isn't that sweet! This is the first time he's ever sent me something. Do you suppose he's getting serious?$B$BColara Heldric? I suppose it has a ring to it. Oh, but I'm getting ahead of myself. Thank you.\030I've got to keep watch here at the gate, but I'm always worrying about my sweetheart, Colara. I only get to see her for a few hours, if I'm lucky, and well, just look at me. I've got a minor officer's pay and I could be called to the front any day now.$B$BWould she just forget about me? There are a lot of men in the city. A lot of rich ones.$B$BAnyways, I've scribbled some things down... nothing much, but if you could take it to her for me, that'd be great.\030Deliver Lieutenant Heldric's Carefully Penned Note to Colara Dean outside the bank in Stormwind.\030Hello there, handsome. Something I can help you with?\030Dearest Colara,\0312,1,93,2,257,1,16005\0302,95,173,2,257,4,16005\0302,175,252,2,257,4,16005\0302,257,287,2,257,4,16005\0302,289,323,2,257,1,16005\0302,325,343,2,257,1,16005\0302,348,390,2,257,1,16005\0302,392,461,2,257,4,16005\0303,1,96,2,384,1,16005\0301,1,21,4,272,1,16002\0301,23,73,4,272,1,16002\0301,75,110,4,272,2,16002\0301,115,129,4,272,2,16002\0301,131,160,4,272,1,16002\0301,162,197,4,272,1,16002\0301,199,208,4,272,1,16002\0304,1,22,3,256,1,16002\0304,24,53,3,256,2,16002\03116002,2,9,Colara Dean\0312,0,0,9,Colara Dean\0302,0,0,9,Stormwind\0318898,22,8898,UNKNOWN\0308899,22,8899,UNKNOWN\031",[8898]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Tormek? Oh yes, I do remember him. He had quite a nice beard and smile underneath.$B$BAh, I can't believe he remembered me!\030I met a lass in Stormwind when I was last there on the bank's business. She stole my heart away. Now, I can't stop thinking about her! I'd like to send her this message - I've rewritten it twelve times!$B$BThe mail is so full now, and I want to make sure it gets there.$B$BIf you're heading that way, could you help me?\030Deliver the Creased Letter to Colara Dean outside the bank in Stormwind.\030Hello there, handsome. Something I can help you with?\030Dearest Colara,\0312,1,71,2,257,1,16009\0302,73,96,2,257,1,16009\0302,98,134,2,257,1,16009\0302,136,202,2,259,1,16009\0302,207,269,2,259,1,16009\0302,274,319,2,257,4,16009\0303,1,72,2,384,1,16009\0301,1,7,4,272,2,16002\0301,9,34,4,272,1,16002\0301,36,82,4,272,1,16002\0301,87,123,4,272,4,16002\0304,1,22,3,256,1,16002\0304,24,53,3,256,2,16002\03116002,2,7,Colara Dean\0312,0,0,1,Stormwind\0302,0,0,7,Colara Dean\0302,0,0,7,Stormwind\0318897,22,8897,UNKNOWN\0308899,22,8899,UNKNOWN\031",[8899]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I've never received something like this before. How lovely!\030How to describe her beauty? Thousands of years of words and I am at a loss.$B$BThese mortals confound the mind and leave us babbling fools.$B$BI've stared at these words too long. No more eloquent meaning can I squeeze from them. No, she must have it now, or some other suitor will surely steal her eye.\030Deliver the Immaculate Letter to Colara Dean outside the bank in Stormwind.\030Hello there, handsome. Something I can help you with?\030Dearest Colara,\0312,1,27,2,257,2,16001\0302,29,75,2,257,1,16001\0302,80,139,2,257,1,16001\0302,144,179,2,257,1,16001\0302,181,229,2,257,1,16001\0302,231,303,2,261,3,16001\0303,1,75,2,384,1,16001\0301,1,47,4,272,1,16002\0301,49,59,4,272,1,16002\0304,1,22,3,256,1,16002\0304,24,53,3,256,2,16002\03116002,2,7,Colara Dean\0312,0,0,7,Colara Dean\0302,0,0,7,Stormwind\0318897,22,8897,UNKNOWN\0308898,22,8898,UNKNOWN\031",[89]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Great work, $N. These supplies will help the bridge effort immensely. We'll get this beauty shored up in no time.\030During the last orc invasion we were forced to smelt our iron down to make bullets, swords and armor.  We sent word to Stormwind for a new shipment of materials but a band of Redridge gnolls hijacked the caravan and ran off into the hills behind Lakeshire.$B$BNow we're coming up short on supplies to get this bridge rebuilt.  If you can bring me 5 iron pikes and 5 iron rivets, $N, I'll make sure you're rewarded. $B$BNow let's get to work!\030Bring 5 Iron Pikes and 5 Iron Rivets to Foreman Oslow in Lakeshire.\030This bridge isn't going to build itself! Now where are those iron pikes and iron rivets?\030The Everstill Bridge\0312,1,101,2,261,1,341\0302,104,256,2,257,1,341\0302,261,325,2,257,1,341\0302,328,414,2,257,4,341\0302,420,441,2,257,1,341\0303,1,67,2,384,1,341\0301,1,15,4,272,1,341\0301,17,69,4,272,3,341\0301,71,113,4,272,1,341\0304,1,40,3,256,3,341\0304,42,88,3,256,2,341\031341,2,6,Foreman Oslow\0312,44,1433,0,\0302,0,0,2,Stormwind\0302,0,0,6,Foreman Oslow\0302,0,0,6,Lakeshire\031125,19,125,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,2856,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,1013,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[890]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, Gazlowe sent you, did he? Just a moment, let me take a look here and check my own logs and make sure I didn't have Gazlowe's shipment sent to the wrong place.$B$BBet he's waiting for those boots from Drizzlek...\030I've been waiting forever for my last shipment of goods from Booty Bay! I'm pretty sure that it must have been stolen by the Freebooters, but just to make sure, will you go down to the dockside and ask Dizzywig if my goods were already put into my warehouse without my knowledge?$B$BHere, take my ledger down to Dizzywig and have him double check my inventory records against his logs.\030Bring Gazlowe's Ledger to Wharfmaster Dizzywig.\030Wares to send on the next ship, $N?\030The Missing Shipment\0312,1,71,2,257,1,3391\0302,73,279,2,261,4,3391\0302,284,385,2,257,1,3391\0303,1,47,2,384,1,3391\0301,1,29,4,272,2,3453\0301,31,162,4,272,1,3453\0301,167,215,4,272,1,3453\0304,1,35,3,256,2,3453\0313453,2,4,Wharfmaster Dizzywig\0303391,4,5,Gazlowe\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,1,Booty Bay\0302,0,0,3,Dizzywig\0302,0,0,4,Wharfmaster Dizzywig\0304,0,0,7,Drizzlek\031887,19,887,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030892,23,892,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8900]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You wouldn't expect an orc to be so eloquent. Of course, we never really had a chance to know them before now. Thank you for bringing this to me.\030She was so sad. I could see that, once I saw past her state. I mean, she seemed sad - wouldn't you?$B$BBut after talking to her, there was a connection. I didn't think anyone could understand what I was thinking, but she could.$B$BWhen I told the others, they laughed at me, so I never spoke with her again. But I miss her. Can you take this letter to her for me? I want to be sure it finds her hands.\030Deliver the Slightly Creased Note to Elenia Haydon near the bank in the Undercity.\030Oh, and to what do I owe this pleasure?\030Dearest Elenia,\0312,1,15,2,257,1,16007\0302,17,60,2,257,4,16007\0302,62,99,2,257,2,16007\0302,104,152,2,257,1,16007\0302,154,227,2,257,4,16007\0302,232,307,2,257,1,16007\0302,309,323,2,257,1,16007\0302,325,363,2,257,2,16007\0302,365,401,2,259,1,16007\0303,1,82,2,384,1,16007\0301,1,45,4,272,1,16004\0301,47,110,4,272,1,16004\0301,112,145,4,272,1,16004\0304,1,39,3,256,2,16004\03116004,2,10,Elenia Haydon\0312,0,0,10,Elenia Haydon\0302,0,0,10,Undercity\0318901,22,8901,UNKNOWN\0308902,22,8902,UNKNOWN\031",[8901]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031What kind words Temma writes for me. But, as much as his words move me, I cannot consider the love of a tauren. In thoughts, body and mind we are too different.$B$BIt is good I do not have to receive these thoughts of his in person. I could not bear to break his heart.\030Have you ever known love, young one? It was a thing foreign to me until lately, when I met a girl from the Undercity, Elenia. It is rare enough for one of my kind to look outside our own, let alone one of the Forsaken.$B$BBut now thoughts of her occupy my mind both days and nights.$B$BIf you can, could you take this letter to her? I want her to come here to Mulgore. I hope that she will say yes.\030Deliver the Carefully Written Letter to Elenia Haydon near the bank in the Undercity.\030Oh, and to what do I owe this pleasure?\030Dearest Elenia,\0312,1,36,2,257,2,16008\0302,38,125,2,257,1,16008\0302,127,218,2,257,1,16008\0302,223,282,2,257,1,16008\0302,287,332,2,257,4,16008\0302,334,368,2,259,1,16008\0302,370,398,2,259,3,16008\0303,1,85,2,384,1,16008\0301,1,36,4,272,1,16004\0301,38,111,4,272,1,16004\0301,113,160,4,272,1,16004\0301,165,232,4,272,1,16004\0301,234,269,4,272,4,16004\0304,1,39,3,256,2,16004\031371,2,2,Girl\03016004,2,8,Elenia Haydon\0312,0,0,2,Undercity\0302,0,0,6,Mulgore\0302,0,0,8,Elenia Haydon\0302,0,0,8,Undercity\0318900,22,8900,UNKNOWN\0308902,22,8902,UNKNOWN\031",[8902]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This brings back memories from a lifetime ago, $N. Elenia Tor. That was going to be my name, you know. We would have a beautiful ceremony out on the shores of the lake. When he retired, we'd find a farm to retire to.$B$BSimple dreams, then.$B$BBut if he saw me now, I doubt he'd even see Elenia in me. Only cold flesh and a dead heart...\030A lifetime ago, I was betrothed to marry Elenia, my childhood sweetheart. It's been years since I thought about her last, but of late, she frequently occupies my thoughts.$B$BPerhaps, even with everything that has passed, there can be some room in each other's lives for our love.$B$BI'm sure she has changed, also. Can you deliver this letter to her for me? I am too nervous to give it in person.\030Deliver the Lovingly Composed Letter to Elenia Haydon near the bank in the Undercity.\030Oh, and to what do I owe this pleasure?\030Dearest Elenia,\0312,1,73,2,257,1,16003\0302,75,171,2,257,1,16003\0302,176,280,2,257,4,16003\0302,285,315,2,257,1,16003\0302,317,358,2,257,2,16003\0302,360,397,2,257,1,16003\0303,1,85,2,384,1,16003\0301,1,50,4,272,1,16004\0301,52,62,4,272,1,16004\0301,64,102,4,272,3,16004\0301,104,168,4,272,4,16004\0301,170,216,4,272,1,16004\0301,221,240,4,272,1,16004\0301,245,301,4,272,4,16004\0301,303,337,4,272,1,16004\0304,1,39,3,256,2,16004\03116004,2,7,Elenia Haydon\0312,0,0,7,Elenia Haydon\0302,0,0,7,Undercity\0318900,22,8900,UNKNOWN\0308901,22,8901,UNKNOWN\031",[8903]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031So it is true. This is unbelievable. How could this have happened? Let me think for a moment. There must be a reason behind this.\030There's something unnatural about this epidemic of love. It's not proper, it's an eyesore, and at worst, it could be a threat to the the safety of the Alliance itself.$B$BJust think: what if the guards have been taken in by this strange affliction? Something must be done.$B$BGo to one of the guards here in Stormwind and see if they've been caught up in this foolishness.\030Get a Stormwind Guard's Card and return it to Aristan Mottar in Stormwind.\030Was I right to worry? Are the guards afflicted with this lovesickness?\030Dangerous Love\0312,1,56,2,257,1,16105\0302,58,167,2,269,4,16105\0302,172,248,2,257,4,16105\0302,250,272,2,257,1,16105\0302,277,372,2,257,4,16105\0303,1,74,2,384,1,16105\0301,1,14,4,272,1,16105\0301,16,36,4,272,1,16105\0301,38,66,4,272,4,16105\0301,68,93,4,272,1,16105\0301,95,129,4,272,1,16105\0304,1,21,3,256,2,16105\0304,23,70,3,256,2,16105\0311423,2,6,Stormwind Guard\03016105,2,6,Aristan Mottar\0312,0,0,5,Stormwind\0302,0,0,6,Aristan Mottar\0302,0,0,6,Stormwind\0319024,23,9024,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22143,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8904]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031So it is true. This is unbelievable. How could this have happened? Let me think for a moment. There must be a reason behind this.\030There's something unnatural about this epidemic of love. It's disgusting, and as it lowers our defenses, it could be a threat to the all of us.$B$BIt's bad enough that so many of our people are caught up in this ridiculous behavior. But I think that it has spread even to our guardians, who should be immune to such things.$B$BFind one of our guardians and see if they've been caught up in this foolishness.\030Get a Guardian's Moldy Card and bring it to Fenstad Argyle in the Undercity.\030Was I right to worry? Have our idiot guardians been overcome?\030Dangerous Love\0312,1,56,2,257,1,16108\0302,58,143,2,261,4,16108\0302,148,232,2,257,1,16108\0302,234,323,2,257,1,16108\0302,328,407,2,257,4,16108\0303,1,76,2,384,1,16108\0301,1,14,4,272,1,16108\0301,16,36,4,272,1,16108\0301,38,66,4,272,4,16108\0301,68,93,4,272,1,16108\0301,95,129,4,272,1,16108\0304,1,21,3,256,2,16108\0304,23,61,3,256,2,16108\03116108,2,6,Fenstad Argyle\0312,0,0,6,Fenstad Argyle\0302,0,0,6,Undercity\0318979,23,8979,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22145,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8905]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent! Let's perform the trade then. It's hard to part with this excellent armor, but I'm afraid I won't be needing it any time soon.$B$BIf you're interested in performing more work for me, I might be willing to give up the rest of the pieces.\030Well met, $c.  I've something that might interest you.$B$BI have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality.  I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor.$B$BThe blood of the frostsabers and bears that inhabit Winterspring has properties I'm in need of at the moment.  Bring me a sizeable sample of it along with the bracers and a small amount of gold.  You shall find the effort worth your while.\030Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Wildheart Bracers to Deliana in Ironforge.\030Have you brought me what I requested of you, $N?\030An Earnest Proposition\0312,1,13,2,257,1,16013\0302,16,54,2,257,4,16013\0302,59,176,2,257,1,16013\0302,179,262,2,257,1,16013\0302,267,375,2,259,1,16013\0302,378,