 effort worth your while.\030Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with 1 set of Devout Bracers to Deliana in Ironforge.\030Have you brought me what I requested of you, $N?\030An Earnest Proposition\0312,1,13,2,257,1,16013\0302,16,54,2,257,4,16013\0302,59,176,2,257,1,16013\0302,179,262,2,257,1,16013\0302,267,375,2,259,1,16013\0302,378,460,2,257,1,16013\0302,463,505,2,257,3,16013\0303,1,124,2,384,1,16013\0301,1,10,4,272,1,16013\0301,12,40,4,272,1,16013\0301,42,137,4,272,1,16013\0301,142,247,4,272,4,16013\0304,1,48,3,256,2,16013\03116013,2,8,Deliana\0312,1537,1455,0,\0302,0,0,8,Deliana\0302,0,0,8,Ironforge\031\031ITEM,21928,OBJECTIVE,15,15,\030ITEM,16697,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[891]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Alas, the righteous Alliance guns have been silenced. You shall be rewarded for your aid, $N.$B$BNow to tend to the grim task of recovering the bodies of the dead....\030Yet another ship from my fleet has been lost to those overzealous humans at Northwatch Hold!$B$BThose bastards must be dealt with. Their paranoia has them in a state of frenzy. Trigger happy, reckless louts are shooting at anything in their sights.$B$BTravel south along the Merchant Coast to the Hold and lay siege to their forces. Bring me the medals of their soldiers as proof. And for the love of my fleet, slay Captain Fairmount and her overzealous cannoneers!\030Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun of Ratchet wants you to collect 10 Theramore Medals and slay Captain Fairmount, Cannoneer Whessan and Cannoneer Smythe.\030My fleet is in peril with Captain Fairmount and her damned cannoneers blasting away from Northwatch Hold. I want her soldiers to pay as well. Fill my hand with medals from their dead and I will know that vengeance has been given to my fallen privateers.\030The Guns of Northwatch\0312,1,92,2,261,1,3339\0302,97,130,2,257,1,3339\0302,132,176,2,257,1,3339\0302,178