 to get back, $N. What do you say?\030Everything looks square from my records, $n. Go on back and tell Gazlowe he's out of luck. I wouldn't be surprised if it was the pirates that nabbed his goodies.$B$BNothing else I can do for him. Oh... though you could tell him that I've got some things from Undermine for him, when he has the time to come pick them up.\030Return Gazlowe's Ledger to Gazlowe in Ratchet.\030So, what did Dizzywig have to say?\030The Missing Shipment\0312,1,44,2,257,1,3453\0302,46,90,2,257,1,3453\0302,92,161,2,257,4,3453\0302,166,195,2,257,1,3453\0302,203,320,2,257,4,3453\0303,1,46,2,384,1,3453\0301,1,12,4,272,2,3391\0301,14,62,4,272,1,3391\0301,64,128,4,272,1,3391\0301,130,161,4,272,1,3391\0301,166,212,4,272,1,3391\0301,214,229,4,272,2,3391\0304,1,34,3,256,2,3391\0313391,2,2,Gazlowe\0303391,2,6,Gazlowe\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,5,Undermine\0302,0,0,6,Gazlowe\0302,0,0,6,Ratchet\031890,19,890,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030888,23,888,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8920]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, yes. Mux will be quite happy with this.$B$BThose bracers were part of a larger armor set. If you're interested in providing me with further assistance, I'd be willing to consider parting with the rest of it.\030Hail, $c!  I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world.  Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this.$B$BPerform a small favor for me and I'll be willing to trade it to you for an ordinary set of bracers.$B$BI'm in need of a sizeable sample of venom drawn from the spiders and scorpions that inhabit Silithus.  Bring this to me along with a few gold coins and I'll perform the exchange.\030Acquire 15 Silithus Venom Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Bracers of Valor to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.$B\030Have you obtained the items I require, $N?\030An Earnest Proposition\0312,1,9,2,257,1,16012\0302,12,84,2,257,1,16012\0302,87,155,2,257,1,16012\0302,160,258,2,257,1,16012\0302,263,363,2,259,1,16012\0302,366,440,2,257,1,16012\0303,1,121,2,384,1,16012\0301,1,8,4,272,1,16012\0301,10,43,4,272,3,16012\0301,48,93,4,272,1,16012\0301,95,211,4,272,4,16012\0304,1,42,3,256,2,16012\03116012,2,7,Mokvar\0312,1637,1454,0,\0302,0,0,7,Mokvar\0302,0,0,7,Orgrimmar\031\031ITEM,22381,OBJECTIVE,15,15,\030ITEM,16735,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8921]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031These are precisely the materials I needed. Quite timely too, $N!$B$BIn mere moments I will have your distiller ready to go! In the meantime, take this as a reward for aiding me in my project.\030Ah, you're in need of my latest project... the extra-dimensional ghost revealer!  Unfortunately I've run out of funds and manpower.$B$BYou're willing to help?  Excellent!  Our first task is to build a device to harvest the very fabric of death!  Building an ectoplasmic distiller won't be an easy task, $N.$B$BI'll need you to bring me an arcanite converter, some greater eternal essences and stonescale oil. I'll also need some volcanic ash from the lava pools in the Burning Steppes to build a filter.\030Return to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan with 1 Delicate Arcanite Converter, 4 Greater Eternal Essence, 10 Stonescale Oil, 25 Volcanic Ash and 40 gold.\030I understand the materials are a bit pricey... but I promise you every last one of them shall be necessary!\030The Ectoplasmic Distiller\0312,1,42,2,259,1,16014\0302,44,80,2,257,1,16014\0302,83,131,2,257,1,16014\0302,136,158,2,257,2,16014\0302,161,170,2,257,1,16014\0302,173,244,2,257,1,16014\0302,247,306,2,257,1,16014\0302,311,408,2,259,1,16014\0302,410,503,2,259,1,16014\0303,1,151,2,384,1,16014\0301,1,43,4,272,1,16014\0301,45,65,4,272,1,16014\0301,70,124,4,272,3,16014\0301,126,192,4,272,1,16014\0304,1,46,3,256,1,16014\0304,48,107,3,256,3,16014\03116014,2,10,Mux Manascrambler\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,9,Burning Steppes\0302,0,0,10,Mux Manascrambler\0302,0,0,10,Gadgetzan\0318924,23,8924,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,16006,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,16203,OBJECTIVE,4,15,\030ITEM,13423,OBJECTIVE,10,15,\030ITEM,22338,OBJECTIVE,25,15,",[8922]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent! Just as I was running low!$B$BYou say Deliana sent you?\030I must find a way to speak with Anthion Harmon... or more specifically, his ghost!$B$BI know of an engineer with a queer interest in the supernatural.  He claims he can build a machine that allows him to speak with the dead!$B$BThe blood you collected was intended for him; travel to Gadgetzan and bring it to him as payment for his services!\030Bring the Sealed Blood Container to Mux Manascrambler inside Gadgetzan in Tanaris.\030You've something for me?\030A Supernatural Device\0312,1,49,2,257,1,16013\0302,51,82,2,257,1,16013\0302,87,150,2,257,1,16013\0302,153,224,2,257,1,16013\0302,229,342,2,257,1,16013\0303,1,82,2,384,1,16013\0301,1,10,4,272,1,16014\0301,12,37,4,272,1,16014\0301,42,66,4,272,2,16014\0304,1,24,3,256,2,16014\03116016,2,1,Anthion Harmon\03016014,2,6,Mux Manascrambler\03016013,4,9,Deliana\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,5,Gadgetzan\0302,0,0,6,Mux Manascrambler\0302,0,0,6,Tanaris\0318921,23,8921,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8923]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent! Just as I was running low!$B$BYou say Mokvar sent you?\030You must be quite brave to have stuck around after that.  That or I've piqued your interest with the piece of armor I gave you.  There is more from where that came from, if you're still interested in aiding me.$B$BThe venom samples you collected are for an acquaintance of mine, Mux Manascrambler, an engineer with an interest in the supernatural.  His latest project consists of a device that allows you to communicate with the dead!  My last hope is to contact Anthion and find out more about my situation.\030Take the Sealed Venom Container to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan.\030You wish to speak to me?\030A Supernatural Device\0312,1,56,2,257,1,16012\0302,59,127,2,257,1,16012\0302,130,210,2,257,4,16012\0302,215,347,2,257,1,16012\0302,350,434,2,257,1,16012\0302,437,508,2,259,3,16012\0303,1,66,2,384,1,16012\0301,1,10,4,272,1,16014\0301,12,37,4,272,1,16014\0301,42,65,4,272,2,16014\0304,1,24,3,258,2,16014\03116014,2,4,Mux Manascrambler\03016014,2,7,Mux Manascrambler\03016012,4,10,Mokvar\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,7,Mux Manascrambler\0302,0,0,7,Gadgetzan\0318921,23,8921,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8924]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Yes, these will do great!$B$BBy tapping into the otherworldly energies contained within these substances we'll be able to reach out to those whose souls haven't quite left this world yet!\030A fine piece of engineering, if I do say so myself!  You will need to travel a bit, I'm afraid, in order to find the incorporeal undead we require.$B$BYou see, different climates lend different consistencies to the spectral fabric of the dead.  The tortured night elves of Silithus, the spirits of the highborne from Winterspring and the ghosts and banshees of the Eastern Plaguelands should give us the different types of ectoplasm we need.  Be sure to place the distiller nearby before you harvest them!\030Use the Ectoplasmic Distiller near incorporeal undead to collect 12 Scorched Ectoplasms in Silithus, 12 Frozen Ectoplasms in Winterspring and 12 Stable Ectoplasms in the Eastern Plaguelands.  Bring them along with the Ectoplasmic Distiller back to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan.\030Have you gathered the ectoplasm yet, $R?\030Hunting for Ectoplasm\0312,1,51,2,257,4,16014\0302,54,147,2,259,3,16014\0302,152,243,2,257,1,16014\0302,246,441,2,323,1,16014\0302,444,505,2,257,1,16014\0303,1,190,2,384,1,16014\0303,193,279,2,384,1,16014\0301,1,25,4,272,3,16014\0301,30,187,4,272,1,16014\0304,1,40,3,256,2,16014\03116014,2,7,Mux Manascrambler\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,4,Winterspring\0302,0,0,6,Silithus\0302,0,0,6,Winterspring\0302,0,0,6,Eastern Plaguelands\0302,0,0,7,Mux Manascrambler\0302,0,0,7,Gadgetzan\0318921,19,8921,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308925,23,8925,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21937,OBJECTIVE,12,15,\030ITEM,21936,OBJECTIVE,12,15,\030ITEM,21935,OBJECTIVE,12,15,",[8925]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've done it! This will certainly provide enough energy to power up the extra-dimensional ghost revealer!\030Next we shall need to find a stable and portable source of energy to keep the ectoplasm active.  I've heard rumors of a mighty elemental called Magma Lord Bokk, whose heart is a powerful magma core - an endless supply of heat!$B$BIt's said he can be found in the Burning Steppes, south of Blackrock Mountain.  Bring the magma core to me and we shall have enough juice to power the extra-dimensional ghost revealer!\030Find Magma Lord Bokk in the Burning Steppes, obtain his Magma Core and bring it to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan.\030Have you found the Magma Lord, $N?\030A Portable Power Source\0312,1,95,2,259,3,16014\0302,98,226,2,257,1,16014\0302,231,308,2,257,1,16014\0302,311,414,2,257,3,16014\0303,1,114,2,384,1,16014\0301,1,15,4,272,1,16014\0301,17,107,4,272,3,16014\0304,1,34,3,256,2,16014\03116043,2,2,Magma Lord Bokk\03016043,2,5,Magma Lord Bokk\03016014,2,5,Mux Manascrambler\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,3,Burning Steppes\0302,0,0,3,Blackrock Mountain\0302,0,0,5,Burning Steppes\0302,0,0,5,Mux Manascrambler\0302,0,0,5,Gadgetzan\0318924,19,8924,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308928,23,8928,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21938,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8926]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've kept your end of the bargain, I shall keep mine.$B$BJust remember that I'm holding on to the best pieces until your work is finished.\030You kept your word and brought the device built by Mux.  I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin.  Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade.  I promise the ones I give you in return will be far superior.\030Bring a Wildheart Belt and a set of Wildheart Gloves Deliana in Ironforge.\030You're ready to perform the trade?\030Just Compensation\0312,1,55,2,257,1,16013\0302,58,136,2,257,4,16013\0302,139,199,2,259,3,16013\0302,202,262,2,257,3,16013\0303,1,74,2,384,1,16013\0301,1,55,4,272,3,16013\0301,60,140,4,272,1,16013\0304,1,34,3,256,2,16013\03116013,2,5,Deliana\0312,1537,1455,0,\0302,0,0,5,Ironforge\0318977,19,8977,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308929,23,8929,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,16716,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,16717,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8927]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Our agreement remains in place. Just remember, this is but a taste of what awaits you. Free me of this cursed fate and I will reward you with items of truly great power.\030You've proven to be a very reliable individual, $N.  As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance.$B$BFor now I will exchange your belt and gloves.  If we both see this through I shall make the rest of the pieces available to you.\030Bring a Wildheart Belt and a set of Wildheart Gloves to Mokvar in Orgrimmar.\030You're ready to perform the exchange?\030Just Compensation\0312,1,51,2,257,1,16012\0302,54,185,2,257,4,16012\0302,190,234,2,257,3,16012\0302,237,317,2,257,4,16012\0303,1,76,2,384,1,16012\0301,1,31,4,272,1,16012\0301,33,86,4,272,1,16012\0301,88,169,4,276,3,16012\0304,1,37,3,256,2,16012\03116012,2,5,Mokvar\0312,1637,1454,0,\0302,0,0,5,Mokvar\0302,0,0,5,Orgrimmar\0318978,19,8978,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308930,23,8930,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,16716,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,16717,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8928]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You did it! This rod will do perfectly. Now to put it all together...\030The core will provide us with enough juice to power our device; now we just have to build a rod that can channel that energy without melting.$B$BI met an imp in Winterspring that sold all manner of exotic goods.  He had an elemental rod that would do perfectly.  I'm kicking myself in the head right now for not having bought it.$B$BHe lives inside a cave in the entrance to Darkwhisper Gorge.  Sneak in there and try to find him.$B$BMake sure he only charges you forty gold; that's the price he quoted me!\030Search for an imp inside a cave at the entrance of Darkwhisper Gorge in southern Winterspring, purchase a Fel Elemental Rod and return to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan.\030Have you had any luck finding the imp in Darkwhisper Gorge?\030A Shifty Merchant\0312,1,141,2,257,3,16014\0302,146,211,2,257,1,16014\0302,214,261,2,257,4,16014\0302,264,329,2,257,1,16014\0302,334,393,2,257,1,16014\0302,396,430,2,257,1,16014\0302,435,506,2,257,1,16014\0303,1,169,2,384,1,16014\0301,1,11,4,272,1,16014\0301,13,39,4,272,3,16014\0301,41,69,4,272,1,16014\0304,1,59,3,256,2,16014\03116014,2,8,Mux Manascrambler\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,2,Winterspring\0302,0,0,5,Darkwhisper Gorge\0302,0,0,8,Mux Manascrambler\0302,0,0,8,Gadgetzan\0303,0,0,12,Darkwhisper Gorge\0318925,19,8925,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21939,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8929]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Deliana had you contact me? I'll do my best to help you, but first I must ask a great favor of you.\030Well, nothing left for us to do but try out the goblin's invention.  Word has it that Anthion was mowed down by the undead legions of Stratholme as he tried to enter its gates.$B$BTry using the device there and find out whatever Anthion knew.\030Use the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer at the entrance to Stratholme and speak with the ghost of Anthion Harmon.\030\030In Search of Anthion\0312,1,67,2,257,1,16013\0302,70,176,2,257,1,16013\0302,181,242,2,257,1,16013\0303,1,114,2,384,1,16013\0301,1,27,4,272,2,16016\0301,29,99,4,272,1,16016\03116016,2,4,Anthion Harmon\03016013,4,5,Deliana\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,4,Stratholme\0318945,23,8945,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[893]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent, excellent specimens indeed.$B$BThe quilboar are further along than I had expected.$B$BHere, $C, take this and get out of my way. I'd better take a closer look at these weapons. We may have underestimated our enemy, and that's the kind of mistake we can't afford to make.\030The Razormane quilboars to the south, beyond the Field of Giants, have no skilled blacksmiths from what I am told, but they've apparently started to develop sturdier weapons. I'd like to get my hands on a few different types to learn their techniques if possible.$B$BIf you wish to help bring honor to the Horde, then bring me examples of their weapons. Find me a dagger from their stalkers, a wand from their seers, and a shield from their warfrenzy. That should do nicely!\030Bring a Razormane Backstabber, a Charred Razormane Wand and a Razormane War Shield to Tatternack Steelforge at Camp Taurajo in the Barrens.\030I, too, have doubts that the pathetic quilboars could attain any level of skill in the area of smithing, but I do as the Warchief commands, and I shall learn what I can about the Razormane tribe.$B$BI have had more menial tasks, and I do so willingly if it aids 