57,1,16016\0302,52,89,2,257,1,16016\0302,94,160,2,257,1,16016\0302,165,271,2,257,1,16016\0302,274,366,2,265,1,16016\0303,1,64,2,392,1,16016\0301,1,28,4,272,1,16031\0301,30,50,4,272,1,16031\0301,52,103,4,272,1,16031\0301,108,120,4,272,1,16031\0301,128,141,4,272,1,16031\0305,1,11,3,384,1,16016\03116031,2,6,Ysida Harmon\03010440,2,6,Baron Rivendare\0312,2017,0,0,\0302,0,0,6,Baron Rivendare\0318946,23,8946,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,16031,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Ysida Harmon",[8946]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031That locket... you found her! I can rest in peace at long last.$B$BI shall now answer any questions you might have, $N. But make haste, my time in this world is not long.\030It is the cruelest of fates that my beloved has perished while trying to rescue me.  Yet, you claim to possess the ability to converse with him.$B$BBring him this locket as proof that I am well.  He must not linger in this world; my heart would not be able to bear it.$B$BFarewell, $N.  I shall be in your debt always.\030Bring Ysida's Locket to Anthion Harmon in Eastern Plaguelands.\030Ysida... is she alive?\030Proof of Life\0312,1,83,2,267,1,16031\0302,86,144,2,257,1,16031\0302,149,194,2,257,1,16031\0302,197,268,2,265,4,16031\0302,273,285,2,257,1,16031\0302,288,318,2,257,3,16031\0303,1,62,2,384,1,16031\0301,1,14,4,272,1,16016\0301,16,29,4,272,1,16016\0301,31,63,4,280,1,16016\0301,68,119,4,272,4,16016\0301,121,170,4,272,1,16016\0304,1,8,3,256,1,16016\0304,10,22,3,256,2,16016\03116016,2,7,Anthion Harmon\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,7,Anthion Harmon\0302,0,0,7,Eastern Plaguelands\0318945,19,8945,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308947,23,8947,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8947]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent. I shall transmute these into something more suitable to our needs.\030We didn't realize the importance of Valthalak's medallion, so it was divided along with the rest of the spoils.  The first piece was taken by a dwarf named Theldren.  I tried to retrieve it from him and he beat me within an inch of my life.  You shall have to take the fragment by force.$B$BLast I heard of him, he'd become a gladiator for the Dark Iron dwarves.  Getting him to fight you is going to present a bit of a challenge, though.$B$BGather the following materials for me.  You're going to need them.\030Bring 3 Dark Iron Bars, 20 Enchanted Leather, 3 Mooncloth and 4 Cured Rugged Hides to Anthion Harmon in the Eastern Plaguelands.\030Did you obtain the materials I asked for, $N?\030Anthion's Strange Request\0312,1,111,2,257,1,16016\0302,114,165,2,257,1,16016\0302,168,240,2,257,1,16016\0302,243,287,2,257,3,16016\0302,292,362,2,257,1,16016\0302,365,438,2,261,3,16016\0302,443,480,2,257,1,16016\0302,483,508,2,259,3,16016\0303,1,128,2,384,1,16016\0301,1,10,4,272,1,16016\0301,12,77,4,274,3,16016\0304,1,45,3,256,2,16016\03116059,2,2,Theldren\03016016,2,9,Anthion Harmon\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,9,Anthion Harmon\0302,0,0,9,Eastern Plaguelands\0318946,19,8946,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308948,23,8948,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,11371,OBJECTIVE,3,15,\030ITEM,12810,OBJECTIVE,20,15,\030ITEM,14342,OBJECTIVE,3,15,\030ITEM,15407,OBJECTIVE,4,15,",[8948]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Anthion sent you, you say? I thought he was dead. I guess I've heard stranger things in my life.$B$BVery well, then.  What is it you want me to do with this banner?\030Theldren is not one to willingly participate in a fair fight.  I've shaped this banner to display his family colors.$B$BWith some additional sorcery, this banner shall provoke him in a way he won't be able to resist.$B$BAn old acquaintance of mine named Falrin knows the exact procedure required.  He has a particular way of... aggravating people.  You shall find him at the library in Dire Maul.\030Take the incomplete Banner of Provocation to Falrin Treeshaper at the library in Dire Maul.\030Speak up stranger, can't you see I'm busy?\030Anthion's Old Friend\0312,1,61,2,261,1,16016\0302,64,116,2,257,1,16016\0302,121,216,2,257,3,16016\0302,221,296,2,257,1,16016\0302,299,327,2,257,1,16016\0302,329,347,2,257,1,16016\0302,350,396,2,257,3,16016\0303,1,91,2,384,1,16016\0301,1,26,4,272,2,16032\0301,28,49,4,272,1,16032\0301,51,96,4,272,1,16032\0301,101,116,4,272,1,16032\0301,119,164,4,274,2,16032\0304,1,42,3,256,2,16032\03116059,2,1,Theldren\03016032,2,8,Falrin Treeshaper\0312,2557,0,0,\0302,0,0,7,Dire Maul\0302,0,0,8,Falrin Treeshaper\0302,0,0,8,Dire Maul\0318947,19,8947,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308949,23,8949,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[8949]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Hmmm... strangely enough I don't feel any better about my brother's death at the hands of those brutes.$B$BWell, you held your end of the bargain. Let's see what I can do for you.\030Yes, it is true that I am familiar with this enchantment you require, $c.  Yet I'm not one to give out favors freely, even if you were sent here by an old friend.$B$BI hold nothing but hatred and contempt for our brutish ogre neighbors.  And not only them, I hate the followers of Omokk just as much as I hate those that follow King Gordok.$B$BI want you to kill them.  Kill lots of them!  Bring me the beads they carry around their neck as proof of your work.  Do this and we shall talk about your request.\030Collect 25 Ogre Warbeads from Ogres inside Dire Maul or Blackrock Spire and return to Falrin Treeshaper inside the Athenaeum in Dire Maul.\030Have you performed the favor I asked of you, $N?\030Falrin's Vendetta\0312,1,73,2,257,1,16032\0302,76,162,2,257,4,16032\0302,167,236,2,257,1,16032\0302,239,340,2,257,1,16032\0302,345,368,2,259,1,16032\0302,371,388,2,257,1,16032\0302,391,460,2,257,1,16032\0302,463,507,2,257,3,16032\0303,1,138,2,384,1,16032\0301,1,7,4,272,1,16032\0301,9,103,4,272,1,16032\0301,108,146,4,272,1,16032\0301,148,179,4,272,1,16032\0304,1,48,3,256,2,16032\031211,2,3,Ogre\03011501,2,4,King Gordok\030211,2,9,Ogre\03016032,2,9,Falrin Treeshaper\0312,2557,0,0,\0302,0,0,9,Ogres\0302,0,0,9,Falrin Treeshaper\0302,0,0,9,Dire Maul\0318948,19,8948,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0308950,23,8950,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,21982,OBJECTIVE,25,15,",[895]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ahhhh! That sort of business. You know, I saw the Heedless once on the open seas. Fearsome ship, or was that boat... those sailors are so particular!$B$BAnyways, watching her glide across the water was quite a sight to see. I'm glad her infamous captain will trouble my ships no longer.\030WANTED!$B$BBaron Longshore, Captain of the Heedless$B$BCaptain Longshore of Gilneas leads vessels of the Southsea Freebooters, and is wanted on charges of piracy. Remains must be in identifiable condition!$B$B-- Gazlowe\030Bring the head of Baron Longshore to Gazlowe in Ratchet.\030What's happening? Something I can help you with? Goods to ship, perhaps an engineering job?\030WANTED: Baron Longshore\0312,1,7,2,257,1,0\0302,12,51,2,257,1,0\0302,56,162,2,257,1,0\0302,164,205,2,257,1,0\0302,210,219,2,257,1,0\0303,1,56,2,384,1,0\0301,1,6,4,272,1,3391\0301,8,29,4,272,1,3391\0301,31,81,4,272,1,3391\0301,83,116,4,272,1,3391\0301,118,149,4,272,1,3391\0301,154,223,4,272,1,3391\0301,225,286,4,272,3,3391\0304,1,17,3,256,2,3391\0304,19,48,3,256,2,3391\0304,50,91,3,256,4,3391\0313467,2,2,Baron Longshore\0303391,2,5,Gazlowe\0303467,2,6,Baron Longshore\0303391,2,6,Gazlowe\0312,17,1413,0,\0302,0,0,6,Gazlowe\0302,0,0,6,Ratchet\031\031OBJECT,3972,GIVER,?,9,WANTED\030ITEM,5084,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[8950]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Yes, these will do just fine. After I'm done, no force in the world will be able to stop your victim from accepting your challenge.\030I can place the enchantment you require on the banner quite easily, $N.  Unfortunately I don't have the materials I need as it is very rarely that someone asks for this sort of charm.$B$BI will require the essence of one of the Eldreth ghosts that haunt these halls, a handful of Scholomance dark runes and some large brilliant shards.  Bring me these reagents and I shall perform this task for you.\030Bring the following to Falrin Treeshaper inside Dire Maul: 1 Jeering Spectre's Essence, 4 Dark Runes and 8 Large Brilliant Shards.\030Have you gathered the materials I require, $N?\030The Instigator's Enchantment\0312,1,71,2,257,1,16032\0302,74,183,2,259,1,16032\0302,188,335,2,257,3,16032\0302,338,399,2,257,3,16032\0303,1,130,2,384,1,16032\0301,1,29,4,272,3,16032\0301,31,131,4,272,3,16032\0304,1,46,3,256,2,16032\03116032,2,5,Falrin Treeshaper\0312,2557,0,0,\0302,0,0,5,Falrin Treeshaper\0318949,19,8949,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0309015,23,9015,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22224,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20520,OBJECTIVE,4,15,\030ITEM,14344,OBJECTIVE,8,15,",[8951]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I can't believe our lives are all but forfeit all because of a stupid medallion! And you're sure Anthion mentioned Bodley?$B$BWell, you've done your job so let's get your reward out of the way.\030Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.$B$BThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together.  Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.$B$BI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!\03