\030You got some missing parts for the quest please go and get them all!\030Redemption Wristguards\0312,1,89,2,257,3,16115\0302,91,273,2,261,3,16115\0303,1,234,2,384,4,16115\0301,1,13,4,272,1,16115\0301,16,97,4,272,1,16115\0304,1,68,3,260,1,16115\03116115,2,3,Commander Eligor Dawnbringer\0312,3456,0,0,\0302,0,0,3,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,3,Eastern Plaguelands\0319033,19,9033,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22362,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,22375,OBJECTIVE,6,15,\030ITEM,12360,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,15407,OBJECTIVE,2,15,",[9051]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you, $N.  You are brave and wise.$B$BTell me, how did the devilsaur react to the toxin?\030The toxin you helped me create is for a special purpose.  The great devilsaurs of the crater make it dangerous to hunt and difficult for me to survive.  Even if I possessed the necessary strength, killing a devilsaur simply allows another to move into its territory.$B$BTake this poisoned barb and stab it deep into a living devilsaur.  The toxin should pacify the creature, though I do not know how quickly...\030Stab a Devilsaur with the Devilsaur Barb. Return to Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater when you have completed this task.\030Devilsaur stabbed with barb\030Were you able to pacify the great beast?\030Toxic Test\0312,1,56,2,257,1,9619\0302,59,151,2,265,1,9619\0302,154,266,2,257,4,9619\0302,271,335,2,261,1,9619\0302,338,410,2,257,1,9619\0303,1,41,2,384,1,9619\0303,43,121,2,384,1,9619\0301,1,14,4,272,1,9619\0301,17,39,4,272,1,9619\0301,44,93,4,272,2,9619\0305,1,40,3,256,2,9619\0304,1,27,3,384,1,9619\0316498,2,3,Devilsaur\0306498,2,4,Devilsaur\0306498,2,6,Devilsaur\0309619,2,7,Torwa Pathfinder\0306498,4,10,Devilsaur\0306498,3,12,Devilsaur\0312,0,0,7,Torwa Pathfinder\0302,0,0,7,Un'Goro Crater\0319052,19,9052,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0309053,23,9053,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[9052]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The ingredients at last!$B$BWith the Un'Goro soil I have collected, the toxin is easily concocted...\030I would ask you to help me create a toxin of sorts, to pacify a great creature living here in the crater.  It is not deadly, and only the keen eyes of a $c can hope to collect the ingredients.$B$BYou can find the bloodcap mushrooms growing within the bloodpetal sprouts all across the crater.  Gorishi stings are from the insects inside and around the Slithering Scar, located in the southern part of the crater.\030Collect 8 Bloodcap and 8 Gorishi Stings, and return to Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater.\030Have you met with success?\030Bloodpetal Poison\0312,1,105,2,257,4,9619\0302,108,192,2,259,3,9619\0302,197,292,2,257,1,9619\0302,295,412,2,257,1,9619\0303,1,90,2,384,1,9619\0301,1,24,4,272,1,9619\0301,29,100,4,272,1,9619\0304,1,26,3,256,2,9619\0319619,2,5,Torwa Pathfinder\0312,0,0,5,Torwa Pathfinder\0302,0,0,5,Un'Goro Crater\0319051,23,9051,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22435,OBJECTIVE,8,15,\030ITEM,22434,OBJECTIVE,8,15,",[9053]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031At last, the toxin can be created in full. I dare not require you to inflict it upon the creature again, as I have asked too much already.$B$BYou have my thanks and respect. May you be well in your travels, $N.\030It is as I feared -- the toxin is simply too weak for such a powerful creature.$B$BIf we are to create a toxin of high enough potency, you must venture to the bottom of the Temple of Atal'Hakkar, unlock the secrets of the altar and recover a putrid vine from the guardian there.  The temple is dangerous, and it would behoove you to bring friends.$B$BReturn to me when this is done.\030Retrieve a Putrid Vine from the guardian at the bottom of the Sunken Temple and return to Torwa Pathfinde