,2,2,Girl\03016113,2,5,Father Inigo Montoy\0312,3456,0,0,\0302,0,0,5,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,5,Eastern Plaguelands\0319033,19,9033,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22369,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,22376,OBJECTIVE,6,15,\030ITEM,12363,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20725,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[9120]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030The phylactery is all that remains of the master of Naxxramas. Your better judgment dictates that you destroy the phylactery, preventing the lich from ever reforming. Thankfully, you seldom listen to that internal voice of reason.$B$BSomeone at Light's Hope will pay you hugely for this artifact. Who cares if Kel'Thuzad regenerates to full power?\030Take the Phylactery of Kel'Thuzad to Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\030\030The Fall of Kel'Thuzad\0312,1,62,2,257,1,0\0302,64,166,2,261,1,0\0302,168,230,2,257,1,0\0302,235,296,2,257,3,0\0302,298,347,2,257,4,0\0303,1,84,2,384,3,0\03115990,2,5,Kel'Thuzad\03015990,2,6,Kel'Thuzad\0312,3456,0,0,\0302,0,0,4,Light's Hope\0302,0,0,6,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,6,Eastern Plaguelands\031\031ITEM,22520,STARTER,?,10,",[91208]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Find the Frightened Paladin in Deathknell.\030\030Offer aid to the Frightened Paladin\030\030Coming to Terms\0313,1,42,2,384,1,0\0305,1,35,3,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Deathknell\0303,0,0,2,Frightened Paladin\031\031",[91209]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Follow the road east out of Deathknell to find the town of Brill. Report to Shari Stilwell to continue your training.\030\030Report to Shari Stilwell in Brill\030\030Continue Your Training\0313,1,65,2,384,1,0\0303,67,117,2,384,1,0\0305,1,33,3,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,2,Shari Stilwell\0303,0,0,3,Shari Stilwell\0303,0,0,3,Brill\031\031",[9121]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You will feel a slight tingle, $N. That sensation means it's working. Once complete, you will be able to enter Naxxramas by stepping upon the rune portal in Plaguewood.\030In the thick of Plaguewood lies the entrance to the dread citadel of Naxxramas. Previously, all attempts to enter had been stymied by the magical wards placed upon the rune portal. That is, until now.$B$BWe have devised a way to gain entry via arcane cloaking - an old cantrip of the Kirin Tor with a few modifications of my own. Since your dedication to the cause of the Dawn is somewhat lacking, $N, the price will be high. You may decline and choose to return when you are revered or exalted for a discount.\030Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Arcane Crystals, 2 Nexus Crystals, 1 Righteous Orb and 60 gold pieces. You must also be Honored with the Argent Dawn.$B\030None have entered Naxxramas and lived to tell the tale.\030The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas\0312,1,79,2,257,1,16116\0302,81,180,2,257,1,16116\0302,182,200,2,257,1,16116\0302,205,329,2,257,1,16116\0302,331,425,2,257,3,16116\0302,427,510,2,257,1,16116\0303,1,153,2,386,3,16116\0303,155,200,2,384,1,16116\0301,1,34,4,272,3,16116\0301,36,69,4,272,1,16116\0301,71,168,4,272,3,16116\0304,1,55,3,256,1,16116\03116116,2,7,Archmage Angela Dosantos\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,7,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,7,Eastern Plaguelands\0304,0,0,11,Plaguewood\0319122,22,9122,UNKNOWN\0309123,22,9123,UNKNOWN\031ITEM,12363,OBJECTIVE,5,15,\030ITEM,20725,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,12811,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030REPUTATION,529,OBJECTIVE,9000,16,",[9122]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You will feel a slight tingle, $N. That sensation means it's working. Once complete, you will be able to enter Naxxramas by stepping upon the rune portal in Plaguewood.\030In the thick of Plaguewood lies the entrance to the dread citadel of Naxxramas. Previously, all attempts to enter had been stymied by the magical wards placed upon the rune portal. That is, until now.$B$BWe have devised a way to gain entry via a permanent arcane cloaking of sorts - an old cantrip of the Kirin Tor with a few modifications of my own. With that said, the cloaking is costly. Since your dedication to the cause of the Dawn is admirable, we are willing to incur some of those costs.\030Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 2 Arcane Crystals, 1 Nexus Crystal and 30 gold pieces. You must also be Revered with the Argent Dawn.\030None have entered Naxxramas and lived to tell the tale.\030The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas\0312,1,79,2,257,1,16116\0302,81,180,2,257,1,16116\0302,182,200,2,257,1,16116\0302,205,350,2,257,1,16116\0302,352,390,2,257,1,16116\0302,392,496,2,257,1,16116\0303,1,135,2,386,3,16116\0303,137,182,2,384,1,16116\0301,1,34,4,272,3,16116\0301,36,69,4,272,1,16116\0301,71,168,4,272,3,16116\0304,1,55,3,256,1,16116\03116116,2,7,Archmage Angela Dosantos\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,7,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,7,Eastern Plaguelands\0304,0,0,11,Plaguewood\0319121,22,9121,UNKNOWN\0309123,22,9123,UNKNOWN\031ITEM,12363,OBJECTIVE,2,15,\030ITEM,20725,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030REPUTATION,529,OBJECTIVE,21000,16,",[9123]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You will feel a slight tingle, $N. That sensation means it's working. Once complete, you will be able to enter Naxxramas by stepping upon the rune portal in Plaguewood.\030In the thick of Plaguewood lies the entrance to the dread citadel of Naxxramas. Previously, all attempts to enter had been stymied by the magical wards placed upon the rune portal. That is, until now.$B$BWe have devised a way to gain entry via a permanent arcane cloaking of sorts - an old cantrip of the Kirin Tor with a few modifications of my own. With that said, the cloaking is costly; however, your dedication to the cause of the Dawn is unwavering! We will waive all cost associations.\030Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will grant you Arcane Cloaking at no cost. You must be Exalted with the Argent Dawn.\030None have entered Naxxramas and lived to tell the tale.\030The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas\0312,1,79,2,257,1,16116\0302,81,180,2,257,1,16116\0302,182,200,2,257,1,16116\0302,205,350,2,257,1,16116\0302,352,455,2,257,1,16116\0302,457,492,2,257,3,16116\0303,1,117,2,384,3,16116\0303,119,159,2,384,1,16116\0301,1,34,4,272,3,16116\0301,36,69,4,272,1,16116\0301,71,168,4,272,3,16116\0304,1,55,3,256,1,16116\03116116,2,7,Archmage Angela Dosantos\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,7,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,7,Eastern Plaguelands\0304,0,0,11,Plaguewood\0319121,22,9121,UNKNOWN\0309122,22,9122,UNKNOWN\031REPUTATION,529,OBJECTIVE,42000,16,",[9124]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, that'll do nicely, $N. Remember, I'm always accepting more parts. For every bundle you bring me, I'll reward you with an insignia.\030How would you like to earn yourself one of these shiny coins?$B$B<Leopold holds up an insignia of the Crusade.>$B$BI've got a little problem that you might be able to help me with, $N. You see, I make Cryptstalker armor for those daft enough to venture into Naxxramas. While they supply me with the core material requirements for the armor, I always run out of the crypt fiend parts. Bring me back a bundle of parts and I'll pay you with an insignia - usable at the quartermaster.\030Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 30 Crypt Fiend Parts.\030How goes the hunt?\030Cryptstalker Armor Doesn't Make Itself...\0312,1,61,2,257,4,16132\0302,66,111,2,257,1,16132\0302,116,184,2,261,4,16132\0302,186,268,2,257,1,16132\0302,270,383,2,257,1,16132\0302,385,480,2,257,1,16132\0303,1,94,2,386,3,16132\0301,1,26,4,272,1,16132\0301,28,69,4,272,1,16132\0301,71,134,4,272,1,16132\0304,1,18,3,256,2,16132\0318555,2,5,Crypt Fiend\03016132,2,7,Huntsman Leopold\0308555,2,7,Crypt Fiend\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,7,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,7,Eastern Plaguelands\0319125,23,9125,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22525,OBJECTIVE,30,15,",[9125]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Most excellent, $n! These will definitely come to good use.\030\030\030You did an exemplary job on the first bundle, $n. If you have more, I will take them now. For every bundle that you turn in, I will reward you with another insignia.\030Crypt Fiend Parts\0311,1,19,4,272,1,16132\0301,21,59,4,272,3,16132\0304,1,49,3,256,1,16132\0304,51,89,3,256,4,16132\0304,91,165,3,256,3,16132\031\0312,139,1423,0,\0319124,19,9124,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22525,OBJECTIVE,30,15,",[9126]="PARTIAL\031consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You work fast, $N. Fast like a fox... Say, have I ever told you about the time I was in a barber shop quartet?$B$BRemind me to tell you that story one of these days.\030Don Julio's Bonescythe armor pattern requires bone fragments - a lot of bone fragments. While those crazy enough to venture into Naxxramas provide me with enough of the core materials to make the armor, I'm always looking for more Scourge bone fragments.$B$BSo what do you think? Interested in getting your hands dirty and destroying some Scourge at the same time? It's a win-win situation.\030Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 30 Bone Fragments.$B\030I can direct you to skeleton infested locales, $c.\030Bonescythe Digs\0312,1,87,2,257,1,16131\0302,89,254,2,321,1,16131\0302,259,279,2,257,2,16131\0302,281,364,2,325,2,16131\0302,366,390,2,257,1,16131\0303,1,93,2,386,3,16131\0301,1,18,4,272,1,16131\0301,20,37,4,272,1,16131\0301,39,110,4,272,2,16131\0301,115,165,4,272,1,16131\0304,1,50,3,256,1,16131\03116131,2,6,Rohan the Assassin\0306412,3,11,Skeleton\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,6,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,6,Eastern Plaguelands\0319127,23,9127,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22526,OBJECTIVE,30,15,",[9127]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031My dream of becoming a full-time dancer at the Gadgetzan disco is soon to become a reality! Keep up the good work, $n.\030\030\030A man in my line of work can never have too many bone fragments, $n. Whenever you have a surplus of fragments, bring them to me and I'll reward you with another insignia.\030Bone Fragments\0311,1,91,4,272,1,16131\0301,93,118,4,272,1,16131\0304,1,68,3,256,1,16131\0304,70,170,3,256,1,16131\031\0312,139,1423,0,\0304,0,0,1,Gadgetzan\0319126,19,9126,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22526,OBJECTIVE,30,15,",[9128]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031A job well done, $N! As promised, the INsignia is yours. Just remember, there's more WHERE that came from...\030Greetings, adventurer! Are you interested in some work? I pay those under my employ with insignias. These insignias can be used at the Quartermaster to purchase items of power.$B$BAll I need you to do is bring me as many core of elements as you can carry. The more the better!$B$BYou'll find them on elementals of varying shapes and sizes that exist across our world.\030Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 30 Core of Elements.$B\030I can only steer you in the right direction, $N.\030The Elemental Equation\0312,1,22,2,257,1,16116\0302,24,55,2,257,2,16116\0302,57,99,2,257,1,16116\0302,101,176,2,257,1,16116\0302,181,255,2,259,1,16116\0302,257,276,2,257,1,16116\0302,281,367,2,257,1,16116\0303,1,101,2,386,3,16116\0301,1,20,4,272,1,16116\0301,22,56,4,272,1,16116\0301,58,108,4,272,1,16116\0304,1,48,3,256,1,16116\03116116,2,8,Archmage Angela Dosantos\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,4,Quartermaster\0302,0,0,8,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,8,Eastern Plaguelands\0319129,23,9129,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22527,OBJECTIVE,30,15,",[91282]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Find the fortress of Bandarion Keep and report to Breton Samuels there.\030\030A Second Home\0313,1,71,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Breton Samuels the\031\031",[91285]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Slay 8 Vile Fin Attackers and 8 Vile Fin Seers and report back to Breton Samuels when it is done.\030\030Murlocs at the Gates\0313,1,97,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Breton Samuels\031\031",[9129]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You perform a great service for us, $n. Well done!\030\030\030Truth be told, I use the cores to create Frostfire armor. It is the armor used by the mages battling in Naxxramas. Without you and others like you, we would most definitely be losing this war.$B$BWith that said, bring me more cores and I shall grant you more insignias.\030Core of Elements\0311,1,39,4,272,1,16116\0301,41,50,4,272,1,16116\0304,1,57,3,256,1,16116\0304,59,114,3,256,1,16116\030