1ITEM,5164,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[9131]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This will do, for now. If you get more, you know where to find me.\030Have you ever seen Dreadnaught armor, $c? No, of course you haven't. You're still a $g boy:girl; - a tyke. Let me tell you, it is glorious.$B$BYou're probably asking yourself what any of this has to do with you, right? I'll tell you what, scrub; I need Dark Iron scraps and I'm willing to pay to get my hands on as many as possible.$B$BI need the scraps to put together sets of Dreadnaught for our champions. Bring me scraps and get paid.\030Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 30 Dark Iron Scraps.\030<Korfax growls at you.>$B$BWhat do you want? Directions? I can provide those...\030Binding the Dreadnaught\0312,1,41,2,257,2,16112\0302,43,68,2,257,1,16112\0302,70,106,2,257,1,16112\0302,108,139,2,257,1,16112\0302,144,218,2,257,2,16112\0302,220,332,2,259,1,16112\0302,337,408,2,259,1,16112\0302,410,438,2,257,1,16112\0303,1,83,2,386,3,16112\0301,1,22,4,272,3,16112\0301,24,66,4,272,4,16112\0304,1,23,3,256,1,16112\0304,28,44,3,258,2,16112\0304,46,56,3,256,2,16112\0304,58,79,3,256,1,16112\031371,2,3,Girl\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,9,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,9,Eastern Plaguelands\0319132,23,9132,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22528,OBJECTIVE,30,15,",[91316]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Collect 12 pieces of Sturdy Lumber from Shadowvale in Tirisfal Glades.\030\030Making Repairs\0313,1,70,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Shadowvale\0302,0,0,1,Tirisfal Glades\031\031",[91317]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Slay 8 Tarnished Drudges, 6 Tarnished Zealots, and collect the head of Commander Rudolph Gelhardt in Tirisfal Glades.\030\030The Tarnished\0313,1,117,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Tirisfal Glades\031\031",[9132]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031That's all you brought me? Maybe you didn't hear me the first time. I need MORE!\030\030\030For every armful of the scraps, I'll give you an insignia - the more the better. Now get out of my sight before I split you in two!\030Dark Iron Scraps\0311,1,26,4,272,2,16112\0301,28,67,4,272,4,16112\0301,69,80,4,274,1,16112\0304,1,80,3,256,1,16112\0304,82,131,3,256,1,16112\031\0312,139,1423,0,\0319131,19,9131,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22528,OBJECTIVE,30,15,",[9136]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I am much obliged, $N.$B$B<Rayne bows.>$B$BPlease remember that I am always acceptINg fronds.\030I make a special type of armor for the brave heroes that enter Naxxramas known as Dreamwalker. They are able to provide me with most of the materials I require but I am always looking for those able to retrieve savage fronds from the flora of our world.$B$BYou may think of this job as beneath you, but without the fronds, the armor could not be made.$B$BI am also in a unique position to pay you with an insignia of your choice as both the Dawn and the Crusade supply me with funds.$B\030Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 30 Savage Fronds.\030I have intimate knowledge of the flora in our world. Do you require direction?\030Savage Flora\0312,1,94,2,257,1,16135\0302,96,253,2,257,1,16135\0302,258,351,2,257,4,16135\0302,356,483,2,257,1,16135\0303,1,79,2,386,3,16135\0301,1,22,4,272,1,16135\0301,27,39,4,272,1,16135\0301,44,93,4,272,1,16135\0304,1,52,3,256,1,16135\0304,54,78,3,256,2,16135\03116135,2,5,Rayne\03016135,4,7,Rayne\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,5,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,5,Eastern Plaguelands\0319137,23,9137,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22529,OBJECTIVE,30,15,",[9137]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you, $n. Your work is vital to the success of our campaign against the Scourge.\030\030\030For every bundle of fronds that you deliver to me, I will pay you with your choice of an insignia of the Dawn or the Crusade.$B$BInsignias may be turned in to the Quartermaster for various rewards.\030Savage Fronds\0311,1,14,4,272,1,16135\0301,16,85,4,336,1,16135\0304,1,125,3,256,3,16135\0304,130,197,3,256,1,16135\031\0312,139,1423,0,\0303,0,0,4,Quartermaster\0319136,19,9136,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22529,OBJECTIVE,30,15,",[914]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You have done it, $N. You killed the leaders of the Druids of the Fang. My dreams are now free of their wicked faces, and you have helped save the Barrens from a cursed future.$B$BI thank you, $N. I thank you for myself, for the druids of Thunder Bluff, and for the land.\030The druids in the Wailing Caverns, the Druids of the Fang, are an aberration.  They were part of an order of noble druids whose plan was to heal the Barrens, but now seek to remake that land to match their own, twisted dreams.$B$BThe Druids of the Fang have four leaders, and each possesses a dream gem.  Even now their faces haunt me!  Defeat the leaders and bring me their gems, and the Barrens may again know peace.$B$BGo, $N.  You will find them lurking deep within the Wailing Caverns.\030Bring the Gems of Cobrahn, Anacondra, Pythas and Serpentis to Nara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff.\030Memories of my nightmares haunt me, $N. Have you defeated the leaders of the fang and acquired their gems?\030Leaders of the Fang\0312,1,77,2,257,1,5770\0302,80,226,2,259,1,5770\0302,231,303,2,257,1,5770\0302,306,335,2,257,1,5770\0302,338,418,2,265,1,5770\0302,432,490,2,257,3,5770\0303,1,93,2,384,1,5770\0301,1,21,4,272,1,5770\0301,23,71,4,272,1,5770\0301,73,176,4,284,1,5770\0301,181,196,4,272,1,5770\0301,198,271,4,272,1,5770\0304,1,39,3,256,1,5770\0304,41,106,3,256,2,5770\03114892,2,1,Fang\03014892,2,3,Fang\0305770,2,7,Nara Wildmane\03014892,4,9,Fang\03014892,3,14,Fang\0312,718,0,0,\0302,0,0,1,Wailing Caverns\0302,0,0,6,Wailing Caverns\0302,0,0,7,Nara Wildmane\0302,0,0,7,Thunder Bluff\0311490,19,1490,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,9738,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,9739,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,9740,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,9741,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[9141]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Alright, here's how it works: For every valor token that you turn in, I'll give you another writ. You complete the order on that writ and deliver the order to Packmaster Stonebruiser. Got it? Good. Now get out of here.\030You want a writ? What? Do you expect me to hand you a highly sought after work order just for showing up? I think not, scrub. Crafters from around the world bid for jobs here at the front lines.$B$BIf you want a work order, you'll have to show me that you're willing to bleed for the cause. Bring me a valor token and we'll talk.$B$BAnd there's only one way to get your grubby little scrub mitts on those - get to killin'.\030Dispatch Commander Metz at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants an Argent Dawn Valor Token.$B\030<Commander Metz chews on his cigar.>$B$BWhat is it? I'm a busy man.\030They Call Me \"The Rooster\"\0312,1,16,2,259,2,16212\0302,18,22,2,257,2,16212\0302,24,105,2,257,2,16212\0302,107,125,2,257,1,16212\0302,127,194,2,257,1,16212\0302,199,290,2,259,4,16212\0302,292,329,2,257,1,16212\0302,334,422,2,257,1,16212\0303,1,107,2,386,3,16212\0301,1,97,4,272,1,16212\0301,99,183,4,272,1,16212\0301,185,191,4,272,2,16212\0301,193,197,4,272,1,16212\0301,199,218,4,272,1,16212\0304,1,36,3,256,1,16212\0304,41,51,3,256,2,16212\0304,53,67,3,256,1,16212\03116212,2,9,Dispatch Commander Metz\03016283,4,11,Packmaster Stonebruiser\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,9,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,9,Eastern Plaguelands\0304,0,0,11,Packmaster Stonebruiser\0319142,23,9142,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,12844,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[9142]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You earned this, scrub. Now, don't cry about your orders. Fill 'em or destroy 'em.\030You know the drill, kid. One valor token gets you a craftsman's writ.\030\030\030Craftsman's Writ\0312,1,24,2,257,1,16212\0302,26,69,2,257,1,16212\0301,1,23,4,272,1,16212\0301,25,57,4,272,1,16212\0301,59,82,4,276,1,16212\031\0312,139,1423,0,\0319141,19,9141,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,12844,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[915]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Mmmmmmmmm! I love their strawberry ice cream! If there's one thing Tigule and Foror know to do, it's make ice cream!$B$BThank you very much $N - this is the best treat ever!\030ICE CREAM!  Oh please please please could you get me some ice cream?!  Strawberry is my favorite flavor, and there's no better strawberry ice cream in the world than Tigule and Foror's Strawberry Ice Cream!  It's my favorite ice cream in the whole wide world!$B$BI had it once a long time ago when I was at the Shimmering Flats race track, but I heard that they might be selling them in town now!  Please?  Pretty please?  With Tigule and Foror's Strawberry Ice Cream on top??!?!\030Get some Strawberry Ice Cream for your ward.  The lad seems to prefer Tigule and Foror's brand ice cream.\030I wish they'd make more flavors of ice cream other than strawberry, but I guess I'm lucky that strawberry is my favorite!\030You Scream, I Scream...\0312,1,10,2,257,1,14444\0302,13,69,2,257,4,14444\0302,72,206,2,257,1,14444\0302,209,259,2,257,1,14444\0302,264,396,2,257,4,14444\0302,399,405,2,257,2,14444\0302,408,421,2,257,2,14444\0302,424,479,2,257,2,14444\0303,1,44,2,384,1,14444\0303,47,105,2,384,4,14444\0301,1,10,4,272,1,14444\0301,12,45,4,272,1,14444\0301,47,116,4,272,4,14444\0301,121,173,4,272,1,14444\0304,1,121,3,258,3,14444\031\0312,0,0,5,Shimmering Flats\031\031ITEM,7228,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[9153]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've done well, $N. Through these incremental defeats, we shall prevail against this renewed Scourge threat.$B$BRest and recover, but then you must head out to the front again, lest we lose the ground we have gained today.$B$BTo aid you in your further battles, we will make some of our special items available to you in trade for more necrotic runes.\030The floating necropolises of the Scourge plague the lands of Horde and Alliance alike. Tanaris, the Blasted Lands, Winterspring and the Burning Steppes are blanketed in the shadows of the flying fortresses.$B$BOnly through our combined efforts will they be turned away.$B$BThe necropolises are supported by magical circles at various points in the invaded areas. We have determined that destroying the mindless hordes that surround these circles will destroy their defenses.\030Check your map to find an area under Scourge attack. Go there and damage a necropolis by defeating the Scourge around them. Return 10 of their Necrotic Runes to Commander Thomas Helleran at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\030It will take time to prevail against this threat. How have you fared, $N?\030Under the Shadow\0312,1,86,2,325,1,16361\0302,88,206,2,257,1,16361\0302,211,269,2,257,3,16361\0302,274,362,2,261,1,16361\0302,364,474,2,269,3,16361\0303,1,52,2,452,1,16361\0303,54,123,2,448,1,16361\0303,125,237,2,384,3,16361\0301,1,21,4,272,1,16361\0301,23,110,4,340,3,16361\0301,115,224,4,272,1,16361\0301,229,353,4,272,3,16361\0304,1,49,3,260,3,16361\0304,51,73,3,256,2,16361\03116401,2,7,Necropolis\03016361,2,8,Commander Thomas Helleran\0304982,2,8,Thomas\0312,0,0,8,Commander Thomas Helleran\0302,0,0,8,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,8,Eastern Plaguelands\031\031ITEM,22484,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[9154]="PARTIAL\031consequences,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The Argent Dawn placed the call for aid, and you, among others, have answered. There is no time for us to provide you with training. Our faith is placed in your abilities, and that you will join us in throwing back this Scourge threat.\030The Scourge have returned in greater numbers than we have seen before.  This must be the doing of the Lich King!  The Argent Dawn is recruiting all willing and capable men and women to defend our lands.$B$BIf we share common cause, take this document to the Keeper of the Rolls at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\030Deliver the Call to Arms Announcement to the Keeper of the Rolls at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\030You've come to join our order, have you not?\030Light's Hope Chapel\0312,1,70,2,321,1,0\0302,73,112,2,321,1,0\0302,115,202,2,271,1,0\0302,207,328,2,257,4,0\0303,1,115,2,384,3,0\0301,1,78,4,272,1,16281\0301,80,132,4,272,1,16281\0301,134,235,4,340,3,16281\0304,1,44,3,256,2,16281\03116980,2,2,The Lich King\03016281,2,4,Keeper of the Rolls\03016281,2,5,Keeper of the Rolls\0312,0,0,4,Keeper of the Rolls\0302,0,0,4,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,4,Eastern Plaguelands\0302,0,0,5,Arms Announcement\0302,0,0,5,Keeper of the Rolls\0302,0,0,5,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,5,Eastern Plaguelands\031\031",[916]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you, $N. When I return to Darnassus I will compare the venom within these sacs with the venom of other spiders. It is my belief that it will have properties linked to the recent growth of our new world tree.\030I came to Shadowglen to observe the webwood spiders that dwell in the Shadowthread Cave.  They are cousin to a much smaller variety of spider; I believe the world tree has had a profound effect on them, and I would like specimens to study to confirm this.$B$BFirst, I would like some of their venom.  Gather Webwood venom sacs from the spiders in and around the Shadowthread Cave, to the north.  I can then examine them for similarities with their smaller cousin's venom.\030Bring 10 Webwood Venom Sacs to Gilshalan Windwalker at Aldrassil.\030Did you gather the venom sacs, $N?\030Webwood Venom\0312,1,88,2,257,1,2082\0302,91,255,2,323,4,2082\0302,260,299,2,259,4,2082\0302,302,394,2,257,1,2082\0302,397,471,2,257,1,2082\0303,1,65,2,384,1,2082\0301,1,14,4,272,1,2082\0301,16,117,4,272,3,2082\0301,119,213,4,336,3,2082\0304,1,34,3,256,2,2082\03114881,2,2,Spider\0302082,2,6,Gilshalan Windwalker\0312,188,1438,0,\0302,0,0,1,Shadowglen\0302,0,0,1,Shadowthread Cave\0302,0,0,6,Gilshalan Windwalker\0302,0,0,6,Aldrassil\0304,0,0,8,Darnassus\031917,23,917,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5166,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[9165]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030objectiveLabel3\030requestItems\030title\031<Dispatch Commander Metz takes the writ and signs it.>$B$BExcellent work, $N. Outstanding even! Take this as a token of our appreciation. No pun intended, scrub.\030Without the help of adventurers, my caravan would have never made it! Scourge were coming out of the woodwork to try and stop us from getting here.$B$B<Guard Didier wipes his brow.>$B$BNow we need to wait here for Field Marshal Chambers to arrive. He'll sign your writ of safe passage to take back to Dispatch Commander Metz at Light's Hope Chapel.$B$BAnd $N, watch what you say around Chambers. He's the 'bite off your head and spit down your wind pipe' type of guy - except that he'll actually do it...\030Deliver the signed Writ of Safe Passage to Dispatch Commander Metz at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\030\030\030Writ of Safe Passage Signed\030Name, rank and serial number!\030Writ of Safe Passage\0312,1,69,2,257,4,16226\0302,71,147,2,321,1,16226\0302,152,181,2,257,1,16226\0302,186,247,2,259,1,16226\0302,249,348,2,257,3,16226\0302,353,395,2,257,1,16226\0302,397,504,2,257,1,16226\0303,1,117,2,384,3,16226\0301,1,54,4,272,1,16212\0301,59,77,4,272,1,16212\0301,79,95,4,272,1,16212\0301,97,137,4,272,1,16212\0301,139,161,4,272,1,16212\0307,1,29,3,256,1,16212\0306,1,27,3,384,1,16226\03116226,2,3,Guard Didier\03016254,2,4,Field Marshal Chambers\03016212,2,5,Dispatch Commander Metz\03016212,2,8,Dispatch Commander Metz\03016212,4,9,Dispatch Commander Metz\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,5,Dispatch Commander Metz\0302,0,0,5,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,8,Dispatch Commander Metz\0302,0,0,8,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,8,Eastern Plaguelands\031\031NPC,16254,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Field Marshal Chambers",[917]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, very good. I will have this egg and the venom transported to Darnassus, then return there when my studies are done here. I expect to find out a great deal from these specimens, $N. You have been a great help to me.\030Now that I have the spiders' venom, I'd like some live specimens to study.  Unfortunately, capturing a living, giant spider is more than I can ask of you, young $c.  And a giant spider is more than I could handle myself!$B$BBut if you can find an unhatched egg, then delivering specimens will be much easier, and I can then arrange for the unhatched spiders to be contained.$B$BThere must be a nest deep in the Shadowthread Cave.  Please, search for an egg in the nest and return it to me.\030Bring a Webwood Egg to Gilshalan in Aldrassil.\030Have you been inside the Shadowthread Cave, $N? Did you find a spider egg?\030Webwood Egg\0312,1,74,2,259,1,20