els revere the wells as shrines to Elune, but sorcery is forbidden to all.\030Crown of the Earth\0312,1,55,2,259,1,3514\0302,57,191,2,321,1,3514\0302,196,260,2,261,1,3514\0302,262,384,2,321,1,3514\0302,389,421,2,257,1,3514\0302,423,495,2,257,1,3514\0303,1,77,2,384,1,3514\0301,1,79,4,276,1,3514\0301,81,228,4,272,3,3514\0304,1,131,3,320,1,3514\0304,136,268,3,256,1,3514\0314244,2,4,Shadow\0303514,2,7,Tenaron Stormgrip\0312,188,1438,0,\0302,0,0,6,Aldrassil\0302,0,0,7,Tenaron Stormgrip\0303,0,0,11,Elune\031920,19,920,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030928,23,928,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5184,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[9210]="PARTIAL\031consequences,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The worthless magic in these enchantments fuels my anger. My anger gives me strength.$B$BBring me more and you shall receive another Savage Guard.\030Zanza can create many ancient troll enchantments with proper components! Have you heard of the Savage Guard? No, of course you haven't. Your mind is addled with the inferior elven magic.$B$BBring me an arcanum of elven creation so that I may destroy the aberration. Do this and the Savage Guard will be yours.$B\030Zanza the Restless in Zul'Gurub wants an Arcanum of Focus.\030Do you have the arcanum?\030The Savage Guard - Arcanum of Focus\0312,1,72,2,321,1,15042\0302,74,108,2,257,2,15042\0302,110,135,2,257,1,15042\0302,137,186,2,257,1,15042\0302,191,265,2,263,1,15042\0302,267,309,2,257,3,15042\0303,1,58,2,386,1,15042\0301,1,57,4,272,1,15042\0301,59,85,4,272,1,15042\0301,90,146,4,272,3,15042\0304,1,24,3,256,2,15042\03115042,2,7,Zanza the Restless\0312,1977,0,0,\0302,0,0,7,Zul'Gurub\031\031ITEM,18330,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[92109]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030objectiveLabel3\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Gather 5 Empty Vials, 5 Silverleaf, and 5 Peacebloom to the young, aspiring alchemist inside the barn of Moonbrook in Westfall.\030\030Empty Vial\030Peacebloom\030\030My First Alchemy Set\0313,1,127,2,384,1,0\0305,1,10,3,384,1,0\0306,1,10,3,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Westfall\031\031",[9211]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031<Mataus pockets the gold.>$B$BEnjoy the repair costs, $R. Naxxramas is 'unkind' to the uninitiated.\030Ah, the Ice Guard. It is a thin sheen of protective magic that covers certain pieces of equipment. Those that do battle with creatures of frost and ice will gain increased protection from their attacks by using the Ice Guard.$B$BAs with all things the Wrathcaster creates, there is a price - a price that I will not lower, regardless of how much you whimper. Interested?\030Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 10 Insignia of the Crusade and 30 gold.\030If it were not for these Argent Dawn guards, you would be a stain upon this floor.$B$B\030The Ice Guard\0312,1,18,2,257,1,16133\0302,20,98,2,257,1,16133\0302,100,225,2,261,3,16133\0302,230,358,2,257,3,16133\0302,360,370,2,257,2,16133\0303,1,118,2,386,3,16133\0301,1,26,4,272,1,16133\0301,31,57,4,272,1,16133\0301,59,99,4,272,1,16133\0304,1,82,3,256,4,16133\03116133,2,6,Mataus the Wrathcaster\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,6,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,6,Eastern Plaguelands\031\031ITEM,22524,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[92110]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Gather 3 Murloc Eyes for the young, aspiring alchemist inside the barn of Moonbrook in Westfall.\030\030Murloc Eye\030\030My First Real Potion\0313,1,96,2,384,1,0\0305,1,10,3,384,1,0\031285,2,1,Murloc\030285,3,2,Murloc\0312,0,0,1,Westfall\031\031",[92124]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Speak to Daniel, Brother Paxton's assistant in the library.\030\030Book Inventory\0313,1,59,2,384,1,0\031951,2,1,Brother Paxton\0312,0,0,1,Daniel\031\031",[9213]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031<Mataus stuffs the gold into his robe.>$B$BWhat are you still standing around for, $R? Our business is done.\030A creation of genius! Much like the Ice Guard, the Shadow Guard employs a thin sheen of protective magic that covers certain pieces of equipment. And like the Ice Guard, the Shadow Guard is going to cost you a good amount of money.$B$B<Mataus holds his hand out and rubs his fingers together.>$B$BInterested?\030Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 10 Insignia of the Crusade and 30 gold.\030<Mataus yawns.>$B$BBe gone, insect, lest you have something for me.\030The Shadow Guard\0312,1,21,2,257,1,16133\0302,23,145,2,257,1,16133\0302,147,231,2,257,3,16133\0302,236,293,2,257,1,16133\0302,298,308,2,257,2,16133\0303,1,118,2,386,3,16133\0301,1,39,4,272,1,16133\0301,44,86,4,272,2,16133\0301,88,108,4,272,1,16133\0304,1,15,3,256,1,16133\0304,20,67,3,256,1,16133\0314244,2,2,Shadow\0304244,2,3,Shadow\03016133,2,6,Mataus the Wrathcaster\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,6,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,6,Eastern Plaguelands\031\031ITEM,22524,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[922]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, a timberling seed? I wanted to try growing one of these to help Denalan with his studies.$B$BBut I'm afraid I've discovered that a corruption has grown in many of the timberlings, and seeds from such creatures carry their parent's taint. They are beyond my talents to repair.$B$BDenalan is very skilled with things that grow. He may find a cure for future timberlings. He may be their only hope.\030$N, can you take one of the seeds you brought me to my friend, Rellian Greenspyre?  He is a druid in Darnassus, and when last we spoke he revealed his interest in my work with the Timberlings.  He had some ideas himself, and he will appreciate a specimen seed to work with.$B$BThank you, $N.  You have been a great help to me.  I hope that, some day, you will see the fruit of my labors.$B$BYou will usually find Rellian walking the pathways of the Cenarion Enclave in Darnassus.\030Bring a Timberling Seed to Rellian Greenspyre in Darnassus.\030Hello...$B$BAnd how may I help you?\030Rellian Greenspyre\0312,1,82,2,257,2,2080\0302,85,192,2,257,1,2080\0302,195,273,2,257,3,2080\0302,278,291,2,257,1,2080\0302,294,326,2,257,1,2080\0302,329,387,2,259,3,2080\0302,392,479,2,257,3,2080\0303,1,59,2,384,1,2080\0301,1,22,4,272,2,3517\0301,24,93,4,272,1,3517\0301,98,241,4,276,1,3517\0301,243,279,4,272,1,3517\0301,284,329,4,272,1,3517\0301,331,372,4,272,1,3517\0301,374,399,4,274,3,3517\0304,1,8,3,256,1,3517\0304,13,35,3,256,2,3517\0313517,2,1,Rellian Greenspyre\0302022,2,8,Timberling\0303517,2,8,Rellian Greenspyre\0302022,4,9,Timberling\0302080,4,10,Denalan\0302080,4,13,Denalan\0312,141,1438,0,\0302,0,0,2,Darnassus\0302,0,0,7,Darnassus\0302,0,0,8,Rellian Greenspyre\0302,0,0,8,Darnassus\031918,19,918,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030923,23,923,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[9221]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Good day, $N. It was a pleasure doing business with you.\030Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of power?$B$BI must warn you; purchases made at a friendly reputation with the Dawn come with a hefty surcharge. I would advise that you gain a better reputation with the Dawn before moving forward with your plans.\030For 30 Insignias o