wonder why their toy was broken...$B$BBut regardless of future troubles, I have something for you. Neeru sent it as payment. And he bid me thank you.$B$BSo, thank you.\030The Demon Seed is a powerful tool for the Burning Legion. It rests in a cave on Dreadmist Peak, above a demonic altar of fire.$B$BI have prepared power stones that when placed near the Seed will disrupt its connection to the Legion.$B$BTake a stone from the table and bring it to the altar of fire atop Dreadmist Peak. Travel west, then north when the road forks. The Peak will be to your left. The safest climb to the top is on its northern face.$B$BAnd hurry--the stone's power will consume itself in time.\030Grab a Flawed Power Stone.  Bring it to the Altar of Fire before the stone expires, then return to Ak'Zeloth.\030\030Destroy the Demon Seed\030The Demon Seed still exists. I can sense its power...\030The Demon Seed\0312,1,57,2,321,1,3521\0302,59,126,2,257,1,3521\0302,131,232,2,257,3,3521\0302,237,318,2,257,1,3521\0302,320,363,2,257,1,3521\0302,365,394,2,257,3,3521\0302,396,447,2,257,1,3521\0302,452,508,2,257,3,3521\0303,1,26,2,384,1,3521\0303,29,109,2,384,1,3521\0301,1,22,4,272,1,3521\0301,24,70,4,308,1,3521\0301,72,97,4,272,1,3521\0301,102,200,4,272,1,3521\0301,202,253,4,272,1,3521\0301,255,304,4,272,3,3521\0301,309,368,4,272,1,3521\0301,370,394,4,272,1,3521\0301,396,419,4,272,1,3521\0301,424,437,4,272,1,3521\0306,1,28,3,256,1,3521\0306,30,53,3,256,1,3521\0305,1,22,3,388,1,3521\0313521,2,10,Ak'Zeloth\0312,14,1411,0,\0302,0,0,3,Seed\0302,0,0,3,Legion\0302,0,0,10,Altar of Fire\0302,0,0,10,Ak'Zeloth\031809,19,809,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,3525,OBJECTIVE,1,14,The Altar of Fire",[9240]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Here is your order, $N. Delivered as promised!\030Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create a Glacial vest. All you need to do is bring me the materials and pay