s,loreConnections,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Let us observe a minute of silence for our fallen mates, $N.$B$B<The Bloodsail Traitor grins at you and winks.>$B$BBeing a traitor is one thing, murdering yer own buckos... that'd be just downright despicable, aye!\030\030\030That mangy dog, Revilgaz, has offered to pardon any former Bloodsails willing to turn on their cap'n! That bilge sucker asked me to go an' off me ole' mates and to bring back their bandannas as proof.$B$BI don't have it in me heart to do that, nor will I ask ye to. Bring me some silk cloth and red dye and I'll make suitable replicas. I'll tell the Baron you went turncoat, but be warned... the Bloodsails are not gonna like it!\030Traitor to the Bloodsail\0311,1,60,4,272,1,16399\0301,65,111,4,272,1,16399\0301,116,172,4,272,1,16399\0301,174,214,4,272,1,16399\0304,1,101,3,256,1,16399\0304,103,200,3,256,1,16399\0304,205,265,3,258,3,16399\0304,267,335,3,256,1,16399\0304,337,391,3,256,1,16399\0304,393,429,3,256,1,16399\03116399,4,2,Bloodsail Traitor\0312,33,1434,0,\031\031ITEM,4306,OBJECTIVE,40,15,\030ITEM,2604,OBJECTIVE,4,15,",[92595]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Listen to what Illaya Amberwind has to say.\030\030Listen to Illaya\030\030The Windshapers\0313,1,43,2,384,1,0\0305,1,16,3,384,1,0\031\0313,0,0,2,Illaya\031\031",[92596]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Have a seat and speak with Rathiril Sunlance.\030\030Listen to Rathiril Sunlance\030\030The High Order\0313,1,45,2,384,1,0\0305,1,27,3,384,1,0\031\0313,0,0,2,Rathiril Sunlance\031\031",[925