al, slowly pulsing with necrotic energy.\030Bring the Cracked Necrotic Crystal to Lieutenant Orrin outside the gates of Stormwind.\030Is there something you need?\030Cracked Necrotic Crystal\0312,1,109,2,257,1,16431\0303,1,86,2,384,1,16431\0301,1,70,4,276,2,16478\0301,75,167,4,336,1,16478\0301,169,221,4,272,4,16478\0301,223,261,4,272,1,16478\0304,1,28,3,258,2,16478\0318545,2,1,Abomination\03016431,2,2,Cracked Necrotic Crystal\03016478,2,2,Lieutenant Orrin\03016401,4,4,Necropolis\0312,0,0,2,Lieutenant Orrin\031\031",[92947]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Slay 7 Al'Aketh Guardians, 7 Al'Aketh Spiritcallers, and 7 Al'Aketh Blademasters, then report to Hyusaa Quickbreeze at the Shrine of Akir.\030\030Making Our Move\0313,1,138,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Hyusaa Quickbreeze\0302,0,0,1,Shrine of Akir\031\031",[9295]="PARTIAL\031consequences,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031How tragic. These words, clearly meant for someone the soldier loved, never made it to their destination. The events detailed happened years ago; I'm not sure if the intended recipient still lives.$B$BThere is hope yet, however. With the names and information he gives, I might be able to locate the family! It will take some research, but the librarian in Stormwind owes me a favor...$B$BThank you for bringing this to me. With your help, we may be able to grant someone peace of mind at least.\030You found this letter on one of the many Scourge minions you've slain. From its appearance and smell, it has been with the undead for some time. Perhaps someone at Light's Hope Chapel would be interested in examining it further...\030Take the Torn Letter to the Keeper of the Rolls at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.\030Yes? What do you have there?\030Letter from the Front\0312,1,70,2,325,1,0\0302,72,1