ceived word about the necropolis base camps that are being summoned by the Scourge. I suspect they were trying to create one in the Undercity. We will have to be vigilant in the future.\030On the corpse of the fallen wight, you find a crystal that is faintly radiating necrotic energy.\030Bring the Faint Necrotic Crystal to Lieutenant Rukag in the courtyard of the Undercity.\030Can I help you with something?\030Faint Necrotic Crystal\0312,1,96,2,257,1,16531\0303,1,87,2,384,1,16531\0301,1,55,4,276,2,16494\0301,60,152,4,336,1,16494\0301,154,211,4,272,4,16494\0301,213,254,4,272,3,16494\0304,1,30,3,256,2,16494\03116531,2,2,Faint Necrotic Crystal\03016494,2,2,Lieutenant Rukag\03016401,4,4,Necropolis\0312,0,0,2,Lieutenant Rukag\0304,0,0,5,Undercity\031\031",[93159]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Speak with the Strange Hermit in the Shadowgale Forest and learn more about him.\030\030Learn more about the Strange Hermit\030\030The Strange Hermit\0313,1,80,2,384,1,0\0305,1,35,3,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Shadowgale Forest\031\031",[93160]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Gather 8 Shadowgale Acorns in Shadowgale Forest.\030\030The Forest's Bounty\0313,1,48,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Shadowgale Forest\031\031",[93165]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Collect 10 Al'Aketh Cultist's Ears from the Al'Aketh cultists in Shadowgale Forest, the Shine of Akir, or Gustberry Lowlands.\030\030Mercy Falls on Deaf Ears\0313,1,125,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Al'Aketh\0302,0,0,1,Shadowgale Forest\031\031",[9317