the darkest places, the fires are being lit.$B$BIf you wish to see them for yourself, travel into the depths. Seek out the bonfires burning within Stratholme, Scholomance, among the ogres of Dire Maul, and the halls of Blackrock Spire itself; I will await your return.\030Find and touch the bonfires located within Blackrock Spire, Dire Maul, Scholomance, and Stratholme, then return to the Festival Flamekeeper.\030\030Flame of Dire Maul\030Flame of Blackrock Spire\030Flame of Stratholme\030Flame of the Scholomance\030Have you found your way through the dark?\030A Light in Dark Places\0312,1,56,2,257,1,16788\0302,58,111,2,257,1,16788\0302,113,164,2,257,1,16788\0302,169,229,2,259,4,16788\0302,231,388,2,257,3,16788\0303,1,140,2,384,1,16788\0301,1,58,4,272,1,16788\0309,1,41,3,256,2,16788\0305,1,18,3,384,1,16788\0306,1,24,3,384,1,16788\0307,1,19,3,384,1,16788\0308,1,24,3,384,1,16788\03116788,2,6,Festival Flamekeeper\0312,0,0,5,Stratholme\0302,0,0,6,Blackrock Spire\0302,0,0,6,Festival Flamekeeper\031\031OBJECT,181346,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Dire Maul\030OBJECT,181347,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Blackrock Spire\030OBJECT,181348,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Stratholme\030OBJECT,181349,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of the Scholomance",[932]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031With Lord Melenas laid to rest I can finally move on to other matters. Thank you, $N.\030I must warn you, $n, this matter must stay between us. The satyr are enough of an embarrassment to us already, and this one is much too close to home.$B$BHe is called Lord Melenas. He resides in the nearby cave of Fel Rock where he has gathered a large group of grell warriors. His heart is black as night, and he plots something most foul.$B$BYou must find him within his nearby cave just to the north of here, and bring me his head.\030Kill Lord Melenas and bring his head to Tallonkai Swiftroot in Dolanaar.\030Did you kill Lord Melenas yet? It is vital that he be taken care of quickly and quietly, $N. His continued existence is an embarrassment to us all.\030Twisted Hatred\0312,1,54,2,257,1,3567\0302,56,150,2,257,1,3567\0302,155,180,2,257,1,3567\0302,182,277,2,257,1,3567\0302,279,340,2,257,1,3567\0302,345,434,2,257,1,3567\0303,1,72,2,384,1,3567\0301,1,70,4,272,1,3567\0301,72,85,4,272,1,3567\0304,1,30,3,256,2,3567\0304,32,92,3,256,1,3567\0304,94,147,3,256,1,3567\0312038,2,3,Lord Melenas\0301988,2,4,Grell\0302038,2,7,Lord Melenas\0303567,2,7,Tallonkai Swiftroot\0302038,4,8,Lord Melenas\0302038,3,10,Lord Melenas\0312,141,1438,0,\0302,0,0,7,Tallonkai Swiftroot\0302,0,0,7,Dolanaar\031\031ITEM,5221,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[9320]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Here you are, $N. Be careful out there. Our numbers are not so large we can afford many battlefield casualties.\030\030\030In addition to our other supplies, we also have a number of major mana potions you may find useful. I will give you one in exchange for fifteen necrotic runes.\030Major Mana Potion\0311,1,17,4,272,1,16787\0301,19,39,4,272,1,16787\0301,41,111,4,272,1,16787\0304,1,99,3,256,1,16787\0304,101,159,3,256,3,16787\031\031\0319153,19,9153,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22484,OBJECTIVE,15,15,",[9321]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Here you are, $N. Be careful out there. Our numbers are not so large we can afford many battlefield casualties.\030\030\030In addition to our other supplies, we also have a number of major healing potions you may find useful. I will give you one in exchange for fifteen necrotic runes.\030Major Healing Potion\0311,1,17,4,272,1,16786\0301,19,39,4,272,1,16786\0301,41,111,4,272,1,16786\0304,1,102,3,256,1,16786\0304,104,162,3,256,3,16786\031\031\0319153,19,9153,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22484,OBJECTIVE,15,15,",[9322]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Your spirit glows with the warmth of the Kalimdor fires, friend. Is the heat not invigorating? Once the power fades from you, perhaps these will help rekindle the feeling.\030The Midsummer Fire Festival is celebrated everywhere in Azeroth, and the diverse land of Kalimdor is no exception. You look fit to travel -- perhaps a journey is in order.$B$BMidsummer cannot be truly appreciated unless you've seen the blistering blue fires abroad. The celebrants have lit fires in chilly western Winterspring, northeastern Azshara, near Valor's Rest in the wastes of Silithus, and by the entrance to lush Un'Goro. Return once your journey is complete.\030Visit the Midsummer camps located in Azshara, Silithus, Un'Goro Crater, and Winterspring, then return to the Festival Flamekeeper.\030Are the flames of Kalimdor burning brightly?\030Wild Fires in Kalimdor\0312,1,114,2,257,1,16788\0302,116,171,2,257,4,16788\0302,176,265,2,265,4,16788\0302,267,431,2,257,1,16788\0302,433,469,2,257,1,16788\0303,1,130,2,384,1,16788\0301,1,64,4,272,1,16788\0301,66,94,4,272,2,16788\0301,96,171,4,272,4,16788\0304,1,44,3,256,2,16788\03116788,2,6,Festival Flamekeeper\0312,0,0,1,Azeroth\0302,0,0,4,Valor's Rest\0302,0,0,6,Azshara\0302,0,0,6,Festival Flamekeeper\031\031OBJECT,181342,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Azshara\030OBJECT,181339,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Silithus\030OBJECT,181343,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Un'Goro\030OBJECT,181340,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Winterspring",[9323]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah, here you are. A little wearier, a bit dustier, but enlightened! The heat touches us all during this season and unites us; your very being glows with the power of the fires you touched. Ah, but these days enlightenment is taken as a rather poor reward for being sent on a task, I suppose. Take these, then, and enjoy the celebration.\030Our celebration of the flame is spread throughout the land, $c. Not a single place remains untouched by the heat of this holiday, and the strongest fires burn a brilliant blue. Seek them out.$B$BYou'll find one just north of Blackrock Spire. The others are located deep within the Eastern Plaguelands near a decrepit town, along the road to the cliffs within the mountainous Hinterlands, and on the way to the Dark Portal within the Blasted Lands.$B$B Return once your journey is done.\030Visit the Fire Festival camps located in Blasted Lands, Eastern Plaguelands, the Hinterlands and Searing Gorge, then speak with the Festival Flamekeeper.\030It will take time to prevail against this threat. How have you fared, $N?\030Wild Fires in the Eastern Kingdoms\0312,1,63,2,257,1,16788\0302,65,176,2,257,1,16788\0302,178,191,2,257,1,16788\0302,196,241,2,257,1,16788\0302,243,447,2,257,1,16788\0302,452,485,2,257,1,16788\0303,1,153,2,384,1,16788\0301,1,17,4,272,1,16788\0301,19,67,4,272,1,16788\0301,69,188,4,272,1,16788\0301,190,291,4,272,1,16788\0301,293,336,4,272,1,16788\0304,1,49,3,260,3,16788\0304,51,73,3,256,2,16788\03116788,2,7,Festival Flamekeeper\0312,0,0,4,Blackrock Spire\0302,0,0,5,Eastern Plaguelands\0302,0,0,5,Dark Portal\0302,0,0,5,Blasted Lands\0302,0,0,7,Blasted Lands\031\031OBJECT,181344,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of the Blasted Lands\030OBJECT,181338,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of the Plaguelands\030OBJECT,181345,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of the Hinterlands\030OBJECT,181341,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Searing Gorge",[9324]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031What's this? Unless I'm mistaken, this flame has been taken from the heart of Orgrimmar itself! The fierce hearts of the orcs and trolls are reflected in its searing heat. What a fine addition to our collection--how brave you are, stealing into the enemy's lair to retrieve the sacred flame!\030This flame, stolen from the heart of Orgrimmar itself, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Loremaster might know more...\030Return the Flame of Orgrimmar to the Festival Loremaster.\030You're practically glowing, $R. What do you have there?\030Stealing Orgrimmar's Flame\0312,1,78,2,261,1,0\0302,80,150,2,257,4,0\0303,1,57,2,384,1,0\0301,1,12,4,272,2,16817\0301,14,95,4,280,4,16817\0301,97,171,4,272,1,16817\0301,173,291,4,276,1,16817\0304,1,31,3,256,1,16817\0304,33,55,3,256,2,16817\03116817,2,3,Festival Loremaster\0312,0,0,3,Festival Loremaster\031\031ITEM,23179,STARTER,?,10,",[9325]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Unless I miss my guess, this fire has been taken from the cliffs of Thunder Bluff! How it sings with the power of the spirits! You are quite the thief, $N. Take this as just payment for your skill. Now, if only we had the flames of all three cities...\030This flame, stolen from the shaman of Thunder Bluff, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Loremaster might know more...\030Return the Flame of Thunder Bluff to the Festival Loremaster.\030You're practically glowing, $R. What do you have there?\030Stealing Thunder Bluff's Flame\0312,1,76,2,261,1,0\0302,78,148,2,257,4,0\0303,1,61,2,384,1,0\0301,1,82,4,280,4,16817\0301,84,126,4,272,1,16817\0301,128,155,4,272,1,16817\0301,157,197,4,272,1,16817\0301,199,251,4,272,4,16817\0304,1,31,3,256,1,16817\0304,33,55,3,256,2,16817\03116817,2,3,Festival Loremaster\0312,0,0,3,Festival Loremaster\031\031ITEM,23180,STARTER,?,10,",[9326]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Hm... what a strange fire! It is subdued, nearly smoldering, but the heat is intense. And you received this from the Undercity, you say? Fascinating. With the flames of all three cities, who knows what we could accomplish?\030This flame, stolen from the ruins above the Undercity, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Loremaster might know more...\030Return the Flame of the Undercity to the Festival Loremaster.\030You're practically glowing, $R. What do you have there?\030Stealing the Undercity's Flame\0312,1,78,2,325,1,0\0302,80,150,2,257,4,0\0303,1,61,2,384,1,0\0301,7,26,4,272,1,16817\0301,28,85,4,272,1,16817\0301,87,136,4,272,2,16817\0301,138,149,4,272,1,16817\0301,151,222,4,272,4,16817\0304,1,31,3,256,1,16817\0304,33,55,3,256,2,16817\03116817,2,3,Festival Loremaster\0312,0,0,3,Festival Loremaster\0304,0,0,6,Undercity\031\031ITEM,23181,STARTER,?,10,",[933]="PARTIAL\031consequences\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Shan'do Stormrage never returned, and the druids were in disarray, and to this day we still do not know what became of him. With Malfurion missing, Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm took over the leadership of the druids, convincing the Circle of Ancients in Darkshore that it was time for our people to rebuild, and that it was time for our people to regain their immortality.$B$BWith the approval of the Circle, Staghelm and the most powerful druids grew Teldrassil, the new World Tree.\030There is another moonwell southeast of the entrance to Darnassus, on the shores of the Pools of Arlithrien. The Sentinels are having problems patrolling the area because of attacks and the growing ill-temperedness of the Gnarlpine furbolgs.$B$BBe wary as you seek out the well, and keep your weapons close at hand.\030Fill the Tourmaline Phial and bring it back to Corithras Moonrage in Dolanaar.\030At first the reports of crazed furbolg attacks were dismissed. Who could have thought that the peace-loving bear-men would turn to mindless rage? Yet another of the problems that plagues us here in our new home.\030Crown of the Earth\0312,1,107,2,257,1,3515\0302,109,240,2,263,1,3515\0302,245,314,2,259,1,3515\0303,1,78,2,384,1,3515\0301,1,123,4,272,1,3515\0301,125,371,4,340,1,3515\0301,376,482,4,336,1,3515\0304,1,62,3,260,1,3515\0304,64,145,3,264,4,3515\0304,147,211,3,256,1,3515\0313515,2,4,Corithras Moonrage\0303516,4,6,Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm\03015382,4,6,Fandral Staghelm\03031,3,8,Furbolg\0312,141,1438,0,\0302,0,0,1,Darnassus\0302,0,0,4,Corithras Moonrage\0302,0,0,4,Dolanaar\0304,0,0,6,Darkshore\031929,19,929,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0307383,23,7383,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5645,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[9330]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031And this brightly-burning fire... you say it came from Stormwind? Remarkable! That must have been quite an adventure! I'll pay you for this, of course. If you find anything else like this, be sure to speak with me again.\030This flame, stolen from the heart of Stormwind itself, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Talespinner might know more...\030Return the Flame of Stormwind to the Festival Talespinner.\030You're practically glowing, $R. What do you have there?\030Stealing Stormwind's Flame\0312,1,78,2,261,1,0\0302,80,151,2,257,4,0\0303,1,58,2,384,1,0\0301,1,33,4,272,1,16818\0301,35,65,4,272,2,16818\0301,67,77,4,272,1,16818\0301,79,117,4,272,1,16818\0301,119,151,4,272,1,16818\0301,153,220,4,272,4,16818\0304,1,31,3,256,1,16818\0304,33,55,3,256,2,16818\03116818,2,3,Festival Talespinner\0312,0,0,3,Festival Talespinner\0304,0,0,5,Stormwind\031\031ITEM,23182,STARTER,?,10,",[9331]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This hearty flame must be from the halls of Ironforge; it's as stalwart as the dwarves themselves. A fine catch, $N. If I had the fires of the other cities... ah, but never mind. Here is your payment.\030This flame, stolen from the heart of Ironforge itself, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Talespinner might know more...\030Return the Flame of Ironforge to the Festival Talespinner.\030You're practically glowing, $R. What do you have there?\030Stealing Ironforge's Flame\0312,1,78,2,261,1,0\0302,80,151,2,257,4,0\0303,1,58,2,384,1,0\0301,1,98,4,272,1,16818\0301,100,116,4,272,1,16818\0301,118,158,4,272,4,16818\0301,160,178,4,272,1,16818\0301,180,200,4,272,1,16818\0304,1,31,3,256,1,16818\0304,33,55,3,256,2,16818\03116818,2,3,Festival Talespinner\0312,0,0,3,Festival Talespinner\031\031ITEM,23183,STARTER,?,10,",[93317]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Collect 6 pieces of Windsong Crawler Meat.\030\030Crab Season\0313,1,42,2,384,1,0\0316250,2,1,Crawler\031\031\031",[93318]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Kill Vulgara the Insatiable in the Shen'dar Highlands and bring her head to Danarii Bellowveil.\030\030WANTED: Vulgara the Insatiable\0313,1,95,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Shen'dar Highlands\0302,0,0,1,Danarii Bellowveil\031\031",[93319]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Collect 10 Pilfered Windstones from the Highlands Bandits in the Shen'dar Highlands.\030\030Pilfered Windstones\0313,1,84,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Highlands Bandits\0302,0,0,1,Shen'dar Highlands\031\031",[9332]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031This fire aches of ancient sorrow, $N. You pulled this from the roots of Teldrassil, you say? Fascinating! Here is a reward for your skill. Return to me should you find anything else like this; I may have a use for it.\030This flame, stolen from the shores of Teldrassil, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the Talespinner might know more...\030Return the Flame of Darnassus to the Festival Talespinner.\030You're practically glowing, $R. What do you have there?\030Stealing Darnassus's Flame\0312,1,73,2,261,1,0\0302,75,146,2,257,4,0\0303,1,58,2,384,1,0\0301,1,38,4,336,1,16818\0301,40,93,4,272,2,16818\0301,95,106,4,272,1,16818\0301,108,139,4,272,1,16818\0301,141,218,4,272,1,16818\0304,1,31,3,256,1,16818\0304,33,55,3,256,2,16818\03116818,2,3,Festival Talespinner\0312,0,0,3,Festival Talespinner\031\031ITEM,23184,STARTER,?,10,",[93320]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Report to Yorana Windyreed at the eastern watchtower in the Gustberry Lowlands.\030\030Tower Defense\0313,1,79,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Yorana Windyreed\0302,0,0,1,Gustberry Lowlands\031\031",[9333]="PARTIAL\031consequences,locations,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've done well, $N. Take your pick of hand protection in thanks for your efforts.\030\030\030If you bring me thirty necrotic runes, I will give you your choice of hand protection in return. These should prove valuable in our fight against the undead Scourge.\030Argent Dawn Gloves\0311,1,21,4,272,1,16787\0301,23,83,4,272,1,16787\0304,1,96,3,256,4,16787\0304,98,165,3,324,1,16787\031\031\0319153,19,9153,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22484,OBJECTIVE,30,15,",[9334]="PARTIAL\031consequences,locations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I hope that you will find these items useful in future battles.\030\030\030In exchange for the necrotic runes of the Scourge invaders, the Argent Dawn will give you one vial of blessed wizard oil.\030Blessed Wizard Oil\0311,1,63,4,274,3,16787\0304,1,121,3,324,3,16787\031\031\0319153,19,9153,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22484,OBJECTIVE,8,15,",[9335]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Thank you, $N. Here are your consecrated sharpening stones. Use them prudently.\030\030\030If you bring me eight necrotic runes from the Scourge invaders, I can give you a consecrated sharpening stone. It should be of great help in your battle against the minions of the Lich King.\030Consecrated Sharpening Stones\0311,1,14,4,272,1,16787\0301,16,59,4,272,1,16787\0301,61,79,4,272,1,16787\0304,1,110,3,324,4,16787\0304,112,190,3,324,1,16787\03116980,3,5,The Lich King\0313,0,0,4,Scourge\0319153,19,9153,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22484,OBJECTIVE,8,15,",[9336]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Here you are, $N. Be careful out there. Our numbers are not so large we can afford many battlefield casualties.\030\030\030In addition to our other supplies, we also have a number of major healing potions you may find useful. I will give you one in exchange for fifteen necrotic runes.\030Major Healing Potion\0311,1,17,4,272,1,16787\0301,19,39,4,272,1,16787\0301,41,111,4,272,1,16787\0304,1,102,3,256,1,16787\0304,104,162,3,256,3,16787\031\031\0319153,19,9153,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22484,OBJECTIVE,15,15,",[9337]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Here you are, $N. Be careful out there. Our numbers are not so large we can afford many battlefield casualties.\030\030\030In addition to our other supplies, we also have a number of major mana potions you may find useful. I will give you one in exchange for fifteen necrotic runes.\030Major Mana Potion\0311,1,17,4,272,1,16786\0301,19,39,4,272,1,16786\0301,41,111,4,272,1,16786\0304,1,99,3,256,1,16786\0304,101,159,3,256,3,16786\031\031\0319153,19,9153,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22484,OBJECTIVE,15,15,",[9338]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You honor us, $N. With your continued efforts we will overcome all obstacles.\030\030\030Even if you have no need for the material rewards we offer, these badges still mark our mutual trust and friendship.$B$BBring them to me.  I'll make due note of your service should your performance go above and beyond the call of duty.\030Allegiance to Cenarion Circle\0311,1,17,4,272,1,15540\0301,19,77,4,272,3,15540\0304,1,116,3,258,4,15540\0304,121,137,3,256,1,15540\0304,140,235,3,256,1,15540\031795,3,3,Mark\0312,1377,1451,0,\031\031ITEM,20802,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20800,OBJECTIVE,1,15,\030ITEM,20801,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[9339]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've proven yourself, today, $n.$b$bWhile I have little else to give you, I do have this crown; a fitting gift for a conqueror. May it light your way.\030\030\030\030A Thief's Reward\0311,1,34,4,272,1,16818\0301,39,129,4,272,1,16818\0301,131,152,4,272,1,16818\031\031\0319330,21,9330,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0309331,21,9331,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0309332,21,9332,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[934]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031To be in the presence of the Oracle Tree... it is almost to feel wisdom take form. Let me continue the telling...$B$BWith Teldrassil grown, the Arch Druid approached the dragons for their blessings, as the dragons had placed upon Nordrassil in ancient times. But Nozdormu, Lord of Time, refused to give his blessing, chiding the druid for his arrogance. In agreement with Nozdormu, Alexstrasza also refused Staghelm, and without her blessing, Teldrassil's growth has been flawed and unpredictable...\030All was not well with Teldrassil, however. Staghelm's carefully made plans for the new World Tree had borne out as he had hoped, but there was one small problem, a problem to which many of the troubles on Teldrassil may be attributed.$B$BHowever, I will not get into that yet. You must visit the last moonwell, to the northwest in the Oracle Glade. Under the boughs of the Oracle Tree lies the first and most powerful of our wells. Retrieve a phial of its water and return to me.\030Fill the Amethyst Phial and bring it back to Corithras Moonrage in Dolanaar.\030Along with the druids, the Oracle Tree and the Arch Druid have been carefully monitoring the growth of Teldrassil. But though we have a new home, our immortal lives have not been restored.\030Crown of the Earth\0312,1,42,2,257,1,0\0302,44,234,2,325,1,0\0302,239,276,2,257,3,0\0302,278,348,2,257,1,0\0302,350,431,2,257,1,0\0302,433,479,2,257,1,0\0303,1,76,2,384,1,0\0301,1,43,4,272,1,0\0301,45,82,4,272,1,0\0301,84,113,4,272,1,0\0301,118,258,4,336,1,0\0301,260,353,4,272,1,0\0301,355,499,4,272,1,0\0304,1,114,3,256,1,0\0304,116,188,3,256,1,0\0313515,2,7,Corithras Moonrage\0312,141,1438,0,\0302,0,0,4,Oracle Glade\0302,0,0,7,Corithras Moonrage\0302,0,0,7,Dolanaar\031933,19,933,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030935,23,935,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5646,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[9341]="PARTIAL\031consequences,locations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Take this tabard and wear it proudly. Perhaps your deeds might inspire others to take up arms in support of our fight against the Scourge.\030\030\030You have aided our cause greatly, $N. If you wish, I can make available the tabard of the Argent Dawn. We are proud to have you among our allies.\030Tabard of the Argent Dawn\0311,1,37,4,272,1,16786\0301,39,138,4,340,4,16786\0304,1,37,3,256,1,16786\0304,39,102,3,258,4,16786\0304,104,145,3,256,1,16786\031\031\0319153,19,9153,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22484,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[9343]="PARTIAL\031consequences,locations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Take this tabard and wear it proudly. Perhaps your deeds might inspire others to take up arms in support of our fight against the Scourge.\030\030\030You have aided our cause greatly, $N. If you wish, I can make available the tabard of the Argent Dawn. We are proud to have you among our allies.\030Tabard of the Argent Dawn\0311,1,37,4,272,1,16787\0301,39,138,4,340,4,16787\0304,1,37,3,256,1,16787\0304,39,102,3,258,4,16787\0304,104,145,3,256,1,16787\031\031\0319153,19,9153,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,22484,OBJECTIVE,10,15,",[93461]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030objectiveLabel3\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Speak with Rathiril Sunlance and Coriella Calmbreeze in Shen'dar Village.\030\030Speak with Rathiril Sunlance\030Speak with the Innkeeper\030\030Welcome to Shen'dar Village\0313,1,73,2,384,1,0\0305,1,28,3,384,1,0\0306,1,24,3,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Shen'dar Village\031\031",[935]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ah yes, the water I had requested. Tenaron and Corithras certainly took their time in having it delivered... perhaps not choosing the most reliable of messengers... hmm.$B$BNonetheless, I can finally get back to my work then. The weight of Teldrassil's problems fall upon my shoulders. A yoke I would wish to soon be rid of.$B$BTake this, you may find some use for it.\030Without the blessings of Alexstrasza the Life-Binder and Nozdormu the Timeless, Teldrassil's growth has not been without flaw. Strange beasts have been reported arising from the very ground of the tree, and crazed furbolgs attack passing travelers.$B$BI can only hope that the solution the Arch Druid is looking for will be found quickly. I will pour all the phials you brought into this vessel, for you to deliver to Darnassus.$B$BBring it to Fandral Staghelm, you will find him in the druid grove.\030Bring the Filled Vessel to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.\030I know that I did not summon you, so I cannot help but wonder why it is you have come to speak with me.$B$BWhatever it is, please make it quick.\030Crown of the Earth\0312,1,126,2,257,1,3515\0302,128,248,2,261,1,3515\0302,253,338,2,259,3,3515\0302,340,428,2,257,3,3515\0302,433,499,2,257,3,3515\0303,1,68,2,384,1,3515\0301,1,34,4,272,1,3516\0301,36,108,4,272,1,3516\0301,110,164,4,272,4,3516\0301,166,169,4,272,1,3516\0301,174,225,4,272,1,3516\0301,227,285,4,272,1,3516\0301,287,324,4,274,4,3516\0301,329,368,4,272,1,3516\0304,1,103,3,256,1,3516\0304,108,144,3,256,1,3516\03115382,2,5,Fandral Staghelm\0303516,2,6,Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm\03015382,2,6,Fandral Staghelm\0312,141,1438,0,\0302,0,0,4,Darnassus\0302,0,0,5,Fandral Staghelm\0302,0,0,6,Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm\0302,0,0,6,Darnassus\0317383,19,7383,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[93552]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Collect 15 Windstone Clusters from Raw Windstones in Thendal Grove.\030\030Harvesting Windstones\0313,1,67,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Raw Windstones\0302,0,0,1,Thendal Grove\031\031",[936]="PARTIAL\031consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Greetings, $C; I am glad you are interested in assisting our research. There is much to do, and I would be doing you a disservice if I informed you that the work this entails is not dangerous. Hopefully this will not scare you off... but from the looks of you, I take it that danger is something that you have dealt with before.\030Excuse me $c, but I'd like just a moment of your time if possible.$B$BThe Cenarion Circle in Thunder Bluff is most interested in seasoned adventurers such as yourself to lend them aid in a vital research project.  While I do not know the specifics, I can inform you that none other than Hamuul Runetotem is spearheading this research.$B$BPlease - if you are interested, speak with him directly on the Elder Rise within Thunder Bluff proper.\030Speak with Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem in Thunder Bluff.\030\030Assisting Arch Druid Runetotem\0312,1,66,2,259,4,6929\0302,71,212,2,321,1,6929\0302,215,334,2,257,1,6929\0302,339,440,2,257,4,6929\0303,1,56,2,384,1,6929\0301,1,70,4,272,1,5769\0301,72,192,4,272,4,5769\0301,194,233,4,272,3,5769\0301,235,328,4,276,1,5769\0315769,2,5,Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem\0312,1637,1454,0,\0302,0,0,2,Thunder Bluff\0302,0,0,4,Thunder Bluff\0302,0,0,5,Thunder Bluff\0313762,22,3762,UNKNOWN\0303784,22,3784,UNKNOWN\0303761,23,3761,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0303761,24,3761,UNKNOWN\031",[9362]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I must say, this shell has a strange aura. It seems only fitting that part of your reward for retrieving it would be to test its magical capabilities...\030There isn't much time, $n!  My scrying spells have revealed a powerful source of magic.  I cannot leave the tower, and would ask you to kill the vile creature in possession of this artifact.$B$BThe pathetic little cretin is known as Warlord Krellian, hiding behind his guards in the Temple of Zin-Malor.  Burn him to ashes and take the prismatic shell he covets so dearly.\030Retrieve the Prismatic Shell for Archmage Xylem.  The Archmage resides in a tower atop the cliffs of Azshara.\030There is not time to waste! Have you the shell?\030Warlord Krellian\0312,1,26,2,257,1,8379\0302,29,87,2,257,1,8379\0302,90,190,2,257,4,8379\0302,195,303,2,257,1,8379\0302,306,372,2,257,1,8379\0303,1,48,2,384,1,8379\0303,51,109,2,384,1,8379\0301,1,42,4,272,1,8379\0301,44,152,4,272,4,8379\0304,1,27,3,256,1,8379\0304,29,47,3,256,2,8379\0318408,2,4,Warlord Krellian\0308379,2,6,Archmage Xylem\0312,0,0,4,Temple of Zin-Malor\0319364,23,9364,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,23250,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[9364]="PARTIAL\031loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Splendid! Splendid!$B$BNow we are able to reform this magic into a new spell. Behold!\030My research has revealed a unique purpose for the prismatic shell.$B$BCarry the shell and cast your polymorph spell on the Spitelash in Azshara.  If you wait a few moments, the chaotic aura of the shell will cause them to split into several smaller clones for a few moments.  Kill these clones as quickly as possible, and the shell will collect their essence.$B$BWhen the shell is full, return it to me.\030Polymorph the Spitelash of Azshara and kill the clones that appear several seconds later.  When you have slain 50 Polymorph Clones, return to Archmage Xylem in Azshara.\030Have you collected the magic?\030Fragmented Magic\0312,1,66,2,257,1,8379\0302,71,144,2,257,1,8379\0302,147,274,2,257,4,8379\0302,277,359,2,257,3,8379\0302,364,403,2,257,1,8379\0303,1,89,2,384,1,8379\0303,92,168,2,388,1,8379\0301,1,9,4,272,1,8379\0301,11,19,4,272,1,8379\0301,24,77,4,304,1,8379\0301,79,85,4,272,1,8379\0304,1,29,3,256,2,8379\0318379,2,7,Archmage Xylem\0312,0,0,2,Azshara\0302,0,0,7,Archmage Xylem\0302,0,0,7,Azshara\0319362,19,9362,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,16479,OBJECTIVE,50,13,Polymorph Clone",[9365]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You've proven yourself, today, $n.$b$bWhile I have little else to give you, I do have this crown; a fitting gift for a conqueror. May it light your way.\030\030\030\030A Thief's Reward\0311,1,34,4,272,1,16817\0301,39,129,4,272,1,16817\0301,131,152,4,272,1,16817\031\031\0319324,21,9324,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0309325,21,9325,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\0309326,21,9326,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[9367]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent! It seems we've appointed dutiful Flamekeepers this year if the bonfires are as well-kept as you claim. Thank you for inspecting them for me; here, take this as a small token of my esteem.\030Midsummer is upon us once again!$B$BEach year, as tradition dictates, Flamekeepers are chosen to tend the bonfires within our capitals. While fires are burning throughout Azeroth, it is imperative that ours be the hottest and brightest, to properly pay homage to the season.$B$BIn fact, I have a task for you, if you don't mind. I've not yet heard if the fires in all capitals are properly burning. Travel there yourself and warm yourself by the fires--make sure they're hot!\030Touch the bonfires within Stormwind, Ironforge, and Darnassus, then speak to a Festival Loremaster within the capital cities.\030Are the fires burning?\030The Festival of Fire\0312,1,32,2,257,1,16817\0302,37,135,2,257,1,16817\0302,137,274,2,257,1,16817\0302,279,328,2,257,4,16817\0302,330,398,2,257,4,16817\0302,400,475,2,257,1,16817\0303,1,125,2,384,1,16817\0301,1,10,4,272,1,16817\0301,12,113,4,272,4,16817\0301,115,198,4,272,1,16817\0304,1,22,3,256,2,16817\03116817,2,7,Festival Loremaster\0312,0,0,7,Stormwind\031\031OBJECT,181332,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Stormwind\030OBJECT,181333,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Ironforge\030OBJECT,181334,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Darnassus",[9368]="PARTIAL\031motivations,questChains\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Excellent work, $N. With the shadows destroyed, it can only be a matter of time before the Lich King decides to recall his necropolises and leave us in peace.\030Midsummer is upon us once again!$B$BEach year, as tradition dictates, Flamekeepers are chosen to tend the bonfires within our capitals. While fires are burning throughout Azeroth, it is imperative that ours be the hottest and brightest, to properly pay homage to the season.$B$BIn fact, I have a task for you, if you don't mind. I've not yet heard if the fires in all capitals are properly burning. Travel there yourself and warm yourself by the fires--make sure they're hot!\030Touch the bonfires within Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff, and the Undercity, then speak to a Festival Talespinner within the capital cities.\030Have you had any luck, $N?\030The Festival of Fire\0312,1,32,2,257,1,16818\0302,37,135,2,257,1,16818\0302,137,274,2,257,1,16818\0302,279,328,2,257,4,16818\0302,330,398,2,257,4,16818\0302,400,475,2,257,1,16818\0303,1,134,2,384,1,16818\0301,1,19,4,272,1,16818\0301,21,158,4,380,1,16818\0304,1,26,3,256,2,16818\03116818,2,7,Festival Talespinner\03016980,4,9,The Lich King\0312,0,0,7,Orgrimmar\031\031OBJECT,181336,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Orgrimmar\030OBJECT,181337,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Thunder Bluff\030OBJECT,181335,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of the Undercity",[937]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I am impressed by what you have accomplished here in so short a time, $N. Would that I could ask you to remain here to assist me with my duties... but I know in my heart that greater tasks lie ahead for you.$B$BI have noticed the Oracle Tree has just shed a piece of its bark. No doubt it has a task that it wishes completed. You should speak with it.\030I was dispatched with a small group of Sentinels here to protect the Oracle Tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade. Little by little we are trying to push them back.$B$BWhen the Oracle Tree attempted to send a runner to Darnassus with a report, the messenger was attacked and killed by a group of the harpies.$B$BIf you feel up to the task, go to their nests, slay them, and return their belts to me as proof of your deeds.\030Acquire 6 Bloodfeather Belts and bring them to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak in the Oracle Glade.\030Their slashing talons and piercing beaks may prove a difficult match for your own abilities, $N, but I have faith that you will not fail in this task.\030The Enchanted Glade\0312,1,140,2,271,1,3519\0302,142,190,2,259,1,3519\0302,195,334,2,261,1,3519\0302,339,448,2,257,4,3519\0303,1,95,2,384,1,3519\0301,1,73,4,272,1,3519\0301,75,146,4,272,4,3519\0301,148,207,4,272,1,3519\0301,212,276,4,272,1,3519\0301,278,325,4,274,1,3519\0301,327,351,4,272,1,3519\0304,1,150,3,256,3,3519\0313519,2,5,Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak\0312,141,1438,0,\0302,0,0,3,Darnassus\0302,0,0,5,Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak\0302,0,0,5,Oracle Glade\031940,23,940,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5204,OBJECTIVE,6,15,",[93735]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Find Riaani Nightwind on the west side of Valanaar.\030\030The Broken Construct\0313,1,51,2,384,1,0\031\031\031\031",[93736]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Gather 10 Wind Hollow Essences from Wind Hollows in the Shadowgale Forest.\030\030Unwelcome Spirits\0313,1,74,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Wind Hollows\0302,0,0,1,Shadowgale Forest\031\031",[93737]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030req