ront Belthaan Brightwish along the road to the Shrine of Akir.\030\030Confront Belathaan Brightwish\030\030A Firm Response\0313,1,66,2,384,1,0\0305,1,29,3,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Shrine of Akir\031\031",[9378]="PARTIAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030In the thick of Plaguewood lies the entrance to the dread citadel of Naxxramas. Previously, all attempts to enter had been stymied by the magical wards placed upon the rune portal. That is, until now.$B$BWe have devised a way to gain entry via a permanent arcane cloaking of sorts - an old cantrip of the Kirin Tor with a few modifications of my own. With that said, the cloaking is costly; however, your dedication to the cause of the Dawn is unwavering! We will waive all cost associations.\030Archmage Angela Dosantos at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will grant you Arcane Cloaking at no cost. You must be Exalted with the Argent Dawn.\030\030DND FLAG The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas\0312,1,79,2,257,1,0\0302,81,180,2,257,1,0\0302,182,200,2,257,1,0\0302,205,350,2,257,1,0\0302,352,455,2,257,1,0\0302,457,492,2,257,3,0\0303,1,117,2,384,3,0\0303,119,159,2,384,1,0\03116116,2,7,Archmage Angela Dosantos\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,7,Light's Hope Chapel\0302,0,0,7,Eastern Plaguelands\031\031REPUTATION,529,OBJECTIVE,42000,16,",[93791]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Speak with Belann Windwood in Valanaar.\030\030Speak with Belann\0313,1,39,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Valanaar\031\031",[93797]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Bring a Wind-Infused Bough to Belann Windwood in Valanaar.\030\030Boughs in t