31conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ahhh, so they do still burn. I am glad; it would not do for those fires to burn out before their time. You have done well, $N. Take this with my blessing.\030There are many flames burning throughout the world today, $n. The trickiest fires to tend are those that burn green; they do not stay lit long without supervision. Make certain the emerald fires still burn on Kalimdor for our Flamekeeper, eh?$B$BYou will find them near Ratchet in the Barrens, close to the Master's Glaive in Darkshore, in the forest of Ashenvale by the bridge near Silverwing Outpost, and near the road to Windshear Crag along the main road in Stonetalon Mountains.\030Visit the bonfires within Ashenvale, the Barrens, Darkshore, and Stonetalon Mountains, then speak with the Festival Flamekeeper.\030The fires cannot die until the festival is done!\030Flickering Flames in Kalimdor\0312,1,61,2,257,1,0\0302,63,163,2,257,1,0\0302,165,242,2,257,2,0\0302,247,483,2,257,3,0\0303,1,128,2,384,1,0\0301,1,28,4,272,1,16788\0301,30,102,4,272,4,16788\0301,104,126,4,272,1,16788\0301,128,154,4,272,1,16788\0304,1,48,3,256,1,16788\03116788,2,5,Festival Flamekeeper\0312,0,0,4,Ratchet\0302,0,0,4,Barrens\0302,0,0,4,Master's Glaive\0302,0,0,4,Darkshore\0302,0,0,4,Silverwing Outpost\0302,0,0,4,Windshear Crag\0302,0,0,4,Stonetalon Mountains\0302,0,0,5,Ashenvale\031\031OBJECT,181561,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Ashenvale\030OBJECT,181560,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of the Barrens\030OBJECT,181563,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Darkshore\030OBJECT,181562,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Stonetalon",[9389]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031So you've returned, and you've seen to the emerald flames of the continent. What do you think, mm? A rare and wonderful sight, to be certain. I am aware, however, that tangible rewards are better appreciated... so please, take this for your trouble.\030The Midsummer Fire Festival traditionally lights up the land with a myriad of flames. Some argue that the green fires are the finest, as they are the hardest to maintain and have such a distinctive hue.$B$BMake sure they still burn in the Eastern Kingdoms for our Flamekeeper. They sit near Dun Modr in the Wetlands, close to Pyrewood Village within Silverpine Forest, on the cliffs overlooking the lighthouse in Westfall, and by the ruined tower in Hillsbrad Foothills.\030Visit the bonfires within Hillsbrad Foothills, Silverpine Forest, Westfall, and the Wetlands, then speak with the Festival Flamekeeper.\030Have you seen to your task?\030Flickering Flames in the Eastern Kingdoms\0312,1,85,2,257,1,0\0302,87,202,2,257,1,0\0302,207,276,2,257,1,0\0302,278,470,2,257,1,0\0303,1,135,2,384,1,0\0301,1,75,4,272,1,16788\0301,77,98,4,272,2,16788\0301,100,141,4,272,1,16788\0301,143,210,4,272,1,16788\0301,212,249,4,272,1,16788\0304,1,27,3,256,2,16788\03116788,2,5,Festival Flamekeeper\0312,0,0,3,Eastern Kingdoms\0302,0,0,4,Dun Modr\0302,0,0,4,Wetlands\0302,0,0,4,Pyrewood Village\0302,0,0,4,Silverpine Forest\0302,0,0,4,Westfall\0302,0,0,4,Hillsbrad Foothills\0302,0,0,5,Hillsbrad Foothills\031\031OBJECT,181566,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Hillsbrad\030OBJECT,181564,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Silverpine\030OBJECT,181565,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of Westfall\030OBJECT,181567,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Flame of the Wetlands",[939]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I sense the suffering of ancient ones, $N...$B$BHolding these items is almost unbearable...\030You study the simple wooden flute you picked up after defeating Xavaric.$B$BThe knotted wood feels solid, but it seems as if the spirals and patterns in the surface begin to spin and move as you turn it over in your hands. Suddenly, you feel a sense of dread...$B$BYou shake your head, sure that your mind is playing tricks on you.$B$BIt's possible that other satyrs carry clues as to what you have found. Bring your findings to the druid, Eridan Bluewind, that lives in southern Felwood.\030Bring the Flute of Xavaric and 5 Jadefire Felbind samples to Eridan Bluewind in southern Felwood.\030What is it, $C? You look concerned.\030Flute of Xavaric\0312,1,72,2,257,1,0\0302,77,222,2,257,4,0\0302,224,261,2,257,1,0\0302,266,331,2,257,1,0\0302,336,405,2,257,1,0\0302,407,488,2,257,1,0\0303,1,97,2,384,1,0\0301,1,44,4,340,1,9116\0301,49,91,4,272,1,9116\0304,1,15,3,256,2,9116\0304,17,35,3,256,1,9116\03110648,2,1,Xavaric\0309116,2,6,Eridan Bluewind\03010648,2,7,Xavaric\0309116,2,7,Eridan Bluewind\0312,361,1448,0,\0302,0,0,7,Eridan Bluewind\0314441,23,4441,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,11668,STARTER,?,10,\030ITEM,11674,OBJECTIVE,5,15,",[93926]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Find Peacekeeper Vaaniel at the western watchtower.\030\030Check in on the Western Watchtower in the Shen'dar Highlands\030\030The Western Watch\0313,1,51,2,384,1,0\0305,1,60,3,384,1,0\031\0313,0,0,2,Shen'dar Highlands\031\031",[93927]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Collect the note you found near the dead peacekeeper and read it to determine your next steps.\030\030Collect and read the note\030\030A Last Request\0313,1,94,2,384,1,0\0305,1,25,3,384,1,0\031\031\031\031",[93928]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Get the mouse a cookie.\030\030Of Mice and Milk\03