perwind.\030\030Recieve Instructions from Randal Emerson\030\030Exploring the Alliance\0313,1,76,2,384,1,0\0303,78,205,2,384,1,0\0305,1,40,3,384,1,0\0312784,2,2,King Magni Bronzebeard\0307937,2,2,High Tinker Mekkatorque\0307999,2,2,Tyrande Whisperwind\0312,0,0,1,Stormwind Keep\0303,0,0,3,Randal Emerson\031\031",[94]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You place the Glyph of Azora on the stone. It adheres itself... and you hear from it Theocritus' disembodied voice:$B$BYou have my gratitude, young $N. You may now speak with me through this Glyph, and I might have future tasks for you... after I have probed the thoughts of my rival.\030My rival, Morganth, is a vicious mage of great power who lives in the Tower of Ilgalar in Redridge.  I have developed a means of spying on him, the Eye of Azora, and can now view him from afar.$B$BBut to study his thoughts ... I require further aid.$B$BIf you are willing, then take my Glyph of Azora to the Tower of Ilgalar.  Place it upon the Lion Statue near the Tower.$B$BWhen this is done, the power of Azora will grant visions of Morganth's future plans.\030Take the Glyph of Azora to the Lion Statue near the Tower of Ilgalar in Redridge.\030This Lion Statue has sat here for decades, and keeps a lonely watch over the infamous Tower of Ilgalar.$B$BThere is a depression at the base of the statue, where a gem or glyph might be set...\030A Watchful Eye\0312,1,99,2,257,1,313\0302,102,193,2,257,1,313\0302,198,226,2,257,1,313\0302,228,249,2,257,1,313\0302,254,325,2,257,4,313\0302,328,372,2,257,1,313\0302,377,460,2,257,3,313\0303,1,81,2,384,1,313\0301,1,42,4,272,1,0\0301,44,63,4,272,1,0\0301,65,115,4,272,1,0\0301,120,151,4,272,1,0\0301,153,238,4,272,4,0\0301,240,284,4,272,1,0\0304,1,103,3,256,1,0\0304,108,192,3,256,4,0\031397,2,1,Morganth\0312,44,1433,0,\0302,0,0,1,Tower of Ilgalar\0302,0,0,1,Redridge\0302,0,0,5,Tower of Ilgalar\0302,0,0,6,Tower\0302,0,0,8,Lion Statue\0302,0,0,8,Tower of Ilgalar\0302,0,0,8,Redridge\031248,23,248,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,31,FINISHER,?,12,Old Lion Statue",[940]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031I wondered why the Oracle Tree had not communicated with me for so long... It seems that some problems are lessened while others grow to greater concerns.$B$BI fear my work on Teldrassil shall never be completed, and our immortality never restored.$B$BNonetheless, you have done the Oracle Tree's task well, and should be rewarded for your diligence.\030The forest whispers of your feats of valor, $n. As I felt the harpies forced from their nests, a greater calm spread across the forest, its creatures once again feeling safe. I have feared sending another messenger to the Arch Druid, but I know that you will see my message safely to him.$B$BDeliver this to him and know that the forest will see you safely along its paths to the forest of stone.\030Deliver the Oracle Tree's report to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.\030Hmm... You come with the spirit of the forest strongly within you, $C. What business do you have with the Arch Druid of the Kaldorei?\030Teldrassil\0312,1,47,2,257,1,3519\0302,49,174,2,257,1,3519\0302,176,288,2,257,3,3519\0302,293,396,2,257,3,3519\0303,1,77,2,384,1,3519\0301,1,74,4,272,1,3516\0301,76,154,4,272,4,3516\0301,159,248,4,272,3,3516\0301,253,350,4,272,1,3516\0304,1,6,3,256,1,3516\0304,8,70,3,256,1,3516\0304,72,133,3,256,2,3516\0313516,2,5,Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm\03015382,2,5,Fandral Staghelm\0312,141,1438,0,\0302,0,0,3,Arch Druid\0302,0,0,5,Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm\0302,0,0,5,Darnassus\031937,19,937,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030952,23,952,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[94003]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030request