ion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Speak to Quel'dora Quickgale in Valanaar.\030\030Training the Beast\0313,1,41,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Quel'dora Quickgale\0302,0,0,1,Valanaar\031\031",[941]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031You place the heart within the planter, and it quickly digs itself in!$B$BA few seconds later it wriggles back out, cleansed. It pulses slightly... beckoning for you to take it.\030I have removed that foul moss from the heart, but it remains tainted...$B$BTry placing the heart in my planter.  It is filled with a nutritive soil that may cleanse and heal the heart.\030Plant the Tainted Heart in Denalan's Planter.\030This planter is filled with soil, specially prepared by Denalan.\030Planting the Heart\0312,1,71,2,257,1,2080\0302,76,111,2,257,1,2080\0302,114,184,2,257,1,2080\0303,1,45,2,384,1,2080\0301,1,70,4,272,1,0\0301,75,125,4,272,1,0\0301,127,147,4,272,1,0\0301,149,177,4,272,1,0\0304,1,64,3,256,1,0\0312080,3,9,Denalan\0312,141,1438,0,\0302,0,0,4,Denalan's Planter\031927,19,927,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,7923,FINISHER,?,12,Denalan's Planter",[9415]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031The Alliance needs every able body they can get. The Horde has been receiving a steady supply of reinforcements from the northern part of the continent, and it's been a struggle to keep up.$B$BLet me explain the situation to you.\030Are you Marshal Bluewall's new recruits? Of course you are.$B$BWhat are you waiting for? Good soldiers are dying in the desert. Aren't you excited to join them?$B$BNow, get going and don't dry out on the way.\030Speak with Marshal Bluewall at the Alliance encampment near Hive'Zora.\030\030Report to Marshal Bluewall