out that the Horde has been scavenging the Silithus desert for resources, but paid them little mind. We thought it could not be worth it to station large numbers in this sweltering desert.$B$BHowever, it was discovered the importance of the resources, and now we are scrambling to catch up.$B$BIf I have your assistance, you must go into the desert and recover the silithyst and return it here.\030Find and deliver Silithyst to the Silithyst Extractor, then speak with Marshal Bluewall at the Alliance encampment near Hive'Zora.\030\030Return Silithyst\030Be careful out there, but also be quick. We have no time to lose.\030Scouring the Desert\0312,1,118,2,257,1,17080\0302,120,206,2,257,4,17080\0302,211,308,2,257,1,17080\0302,313,412,2,257,4,17080\0303,1,130,2,384,1,17080\0301,1,36,4,272,1,17080\0301,41,122,4,274,4,17080\0301,124,202,4,272,1,17080\0306,1,40,3,256,1,17080\0306,42,65,3,256,1,17080\0305,1,16,3,384,1,17080\03117080,2,5,Marshal Bluewall\0312,1377,1451,0,\0302,0,0,5,Silithyst Extractor\0302,0,0,5,Alliance\0302,0,0,5,Hive'Zora\0319415,19,9415,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031NPC,17090,OBJECTIVE,1,13,Silithus Dust Turnin Quest Doodad",[942]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Oh my! You say this came from the distant lands of Kalimdor?$B$BAmazing! Simply amazing!\030This fossil bears a striking resemblance to one I once saw in Ironforge. An archaeologist by the name of Flagongut brought it to our annual Explorers' League conference. He believed the fossil had a power which could be unlocked somehow.$B$BLast I heard Flagongut had holed up in the Deepwater Tavern in Menethil Harbor, awaiting escort to the Whelgar Excavation Site. Seek him out and show him Remtravel's fossil. Perhaps he can reveal the secrets of the past.$B$BThe ship to Menethil departs from Auberdine.\030Take the mysterious fossil to Archaeologist Flagongut in Menethil Harbor.\030What ya got there, frie