ore, south of Auberdine.\030Ah. $C. How may Onu assist you?\030Grove of the Ancients\0312,1,195,2,257,4,3516\0302,200,318,2,257,3,3516\0302,320,357,2,321,1,3516\0302,359,441,2,257,1,3516\0303,1,95,2,384,1,3516\0301,5,18,4,272,1,3616\0301,20,41,4,272,1,3616\0301,43,86,4,272,4,3616\0301,88,154,4,272,3,3616\0301,156,189,4,272,1,3616\0304,9,31,3,256,2,3616\0313468,2,3,Ancient of Lore\0312,1657,1457,0,\0302,0,0,1,Grove of the Ancients\0302,0,0,1,Darkshore\0302,0,0,1,Auberdine\0302,0,0,3,Onu\0302,0,0,4,Oracle Glade\0302,0,0,5,Onu\0302,0,0,5,Grove of the Ancients\0302,0,0,5,Darkshore\0302,0,0,5,Auberdine\031940,19,940,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[95204]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Bring the Crest of Lordaeron to Oran Snakewrithe in Undercity.\030\030Crest of Lordaeron\0313,1,62,2,384,1,0\0317825,2,1,Oran Snakewrithe\0312,0,0,1,Oran Snakewrithe\0302,0,0,1,Undercity\031\031",[95212]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Collect 6 Pristine Leopard Pelts and deliver them to Amberstill Ranch.\030\030Never Saddle on Quality\0313,1,70,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Amberstill Ranch\031\031",[95213]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Bring the Empty Powder Keg to Quarrymaster Thesten at Gol'Bolar Quarry.\030\030Stolen Blasting Powder\0313,1,71,2,384,1,0\0311256,2,1,Quarrymaster Thesten\0312,0,0,1,Quarrymaster Thesten\0302,0,0,1,Gol'Bolar Quarry\031\031",[95214]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Recover 16 Stolen Blasting Powder from the troggs east of Gol'Bolar Quarry, then return to Quarrymaster Thesten.\030\030Stolen Blasting Powder\0313,1,112,2,388,1,0\0311256,2,1,Quarrymaster Thesten\0312,0,0,1,Gol'Bolar Quarry\0302,0,0,1,Quarrymaster Thesten\031\031",[95216]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Collect the Highly Toxic Strain from Witherfang in Ruins of Lordaeron for Theodore Griffs in Undercity.\030\030The New Plague\0313,1,103,2,448,1,0\03111835,2,1,Theodore Griffs\0312,0,0,1,Witherfang\0302,0,0,1,Ruins of Lordaeron\0302,0,0,1,Undercity\031\031",[95217]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Collect 12 Copper Bars and 4 Toughened Boar Hides and deliver them to Frast Dokner.\030\030Copper Bar\030\030The Quarry's Smith\0313,1,83,2,384,1,0\0305,1,10,3,384,1,0\0312809,2,1,Boar\0301698,2,1,Frast Dokner\0312,0,0,1,Frast Dokner\031\031",[95250]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Collect the Head of the Baron in the Ruins of Lordaeron and bring it back to Captain Truman.\030\030Abominable Creatures\0313,1,92,2,448,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Ruins of Lordaeron\0302,0,0,1,Captain Truman\031\031",[953]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030objectiveLabel3\030requestItems\030title\031We have few records from the time around the War of the Ancients, especially near the destruction of the Well of Eternity. Given the upheaval and cataclysmic events that were taking place, it is no big surprise.$B$BThank you, $N. With your help, my work here is finished, and I will be able to deliver a full report to the Circle.\030To the east you will find the ruins of Ameth'Aran. It is now inhabited by the restless spirits of the Highborne that once dwelt within its walls, but once it was a place where the servants of Azshara freely practiced their powerful magics.$B$BI was sent to explore the ruins and came across two large tablets, scrawled with the stories of Ameth'Aran and its fall. While I read the runes, I was accosted by the spirits, and fled.$B$BPlease, if you can, venture to the ruins and decipher the tablets in my place.\030Study the tablets which tell of Ameth'Aran and of its fall, then return to Sentinel Tysha Moonblade in Darkshore.\030\030Read the Lay of Ameth'Aran\030Read the Fall of Ameth'Aran\030When you have studied the tablets and learned of Ameth'Aran's fall, I will take the knowledge on to Auberdine, and inform the Circle of Ancients.\030The Fall of Ameth'Aran\0312,1,50,2,321,3,3639\0302,52,239,2,321,1,3639\0302,244,363,2,321,1,3639\0302,365,428,2,257,1,3639\0302,433,510,2,321,4,3639\0303,1,113,2,384,1,3639\0301,1,122,4,340,1,3639\0301,124,211,4,272,1,3639\0301,216,229,4,272,1,3639\0301,231,330,4,272,3,3639\0307,1,145,3,256,3,3639\0305,1,26,3,384,1,3639\0306,1,27,3,384,1,3639\0313639,2,6,Sentinel Tysha Moonblade\0312,148,1439,0,\0302,0,0,6,Sentinel Tysha Moonblade\0302,0,0,6,Darkshore\0304,0,0,10,Circle\0303,0,0,11,Auberdine\031\031OBJECT,17188,OBJECTIVE,1,14,The Lay of Ameth'Aran\030OBJECT,17189,OBJECTIVE,1,14,The Fall of Ameth'Aran",[95314]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Collect 8 Bottles of Whispering Elixir from Shadowvale, then return to Carolai Anise in Brill.\030\030That Shadowvale Green Elixir\0313,1,94,2,384,1,0\0312132,2,1,Carolai Anise\0312,0,0,1,Shadowvale\0302,0,0,1,Carolai Anise\0302,0,0,1,Brill\031\031",[95328]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Deliver Whispering Horror Residue to Father Lankester in the War Quarter of Undercity.\030\030Whispering Horror Residue\0313,1,86,2,388,1,0\0314607,2,1,Father Lankester\0312,0,0,1,Father Lankester\0302,0,0,1,War Quarter of Undercity\031\031",[95349]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Take the skycutter ship from Zephras Isle to Mulgore and speak with Alana Stormwalker when you arrive.\030\030The Earthen Ring\0313,1,102,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Zephras Isle\0302,0,0,1,Mulgore\031\031",[95350]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Travel to Orgrimmar and speak with Thrall in the Valley of Wisdom.\030\030Welcome to Azeroth\0313,1,66,2,384,1,0\0314949,2,1,Thrall\0312,0,0,1,Orgrimmar\0302,0,0,1,Valley of Wisdom\031\031",[954]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Ahh... To what could I possibly owe the exceedingly special honor of a $r such as yourself as company. Truly it says much of my current companions--with no offense to my hosts, the noble grells and satyrs--that your presence could be considered an improvement.$B$BBut please, do not let my uncivil tongue drive you from the place. It has indeed been many years, decades even, since I had civil accompaniment.\030The ruins of Bashal'Aran to the east are overrun with demonic minions. The sprites and satyrs that have taken up residence in the area feed upon the magical energies of the area, their powers growing from continued exposure.$B$BEven with that, I have noticed that there is one shrine they will not approach. On the western side of the ruins, atop a small bluff, a strange blue aura permeates... There must be an explanation to the demons' reluctance.$B$BI would like you to investigate it.\030Find the source of the strange blue aura in the ruins of Bashal'Aran.\030\030Bashal'Aran\0312,1,70,2,321,1,3649\0302,72,224,2,257,1,3649\0302,229,307,2,257,3,3649\0302,309,394,2,321,1,3649\0302,396,450,2,257,1,3649\0302,455,489,2,259,4,3649\0303,1,69,2,448,1,3649\0301,1,6,4,272,1,3650\0301,8,102,4,272,4,3650\0301,104,260,4,272,4,3650\0301,265,330,4,272,1,3650\0301,332,408,4,272,1,3650\031\0312,148,1439,0,\031955,23,955,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[95494]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Collect 6 Savannah Lion Hides from the Savannah Matriarchs and Savannah Patriarchs in the Barrens.\030\030Bruised Pride and Lion Hides\0313,1,98,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Savannah Matriarchs\0302,0,0,1,Barrens\031\031",[95495]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Bring the Bundle of Hides to the hermit on the ridge overlooking the Dry Hills in the Barrens.\030\030The Hermit Tanner\0313,1,94,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Barrens\031\031",[955]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,motivations\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Indeed... The grells of Bashal'Aran do not possess that which I am searching... however they have come into contact with it recently. Recently... I would reckon that by your time, not mine. Recent for me stretches into the veil of the past, almost another Age...\030If I were to relate the story of my life, I have no doubt it would surpass the limits of your patience. Let us say that mine has been a long and painful life, and this spectral form is perhaps the worst torment of all.$B$BI am held here by the means of magic. Though my words may seem disingenuous, I assure you I would be grateful beyond words if you would help me find the means of my imprisonment. A seal binds me, and by examining the earpieces of the sprites and grells, I may find a trace of it.\030Acquire 8 Grell Earrings for Asterion in Bashal'Aran.\030Once I have the earrings, I will cast the spell to search for the whereabouts of the seal that binds me. For centuries I have thought on the freedom destroying the seal would bring to me... Perhaps those centuries have taken a toll upon my mind that I might never recover...\030Bashal'Aran\0312,1,103,2,257,4,3650\0302,105,218,2,257,4,3650\0302,223,259,2,257,1,3650\0302,261,400,2,261,4,3650\0302,402,501,2,257,1,3650\0303,1,53,2,384,1,3650\0301,1,9,4,272,1,3650\0301,11,79,4,272,1,3650\0301,81,133,4,272,1,3650\0301,135,145,4,272,1,3650\0301,147,189,4,272,4,3650\0301,191,262,4,272,1,3650\0304,1,104,3,256,3,3650\0304,106,189,3,268,4,3650\0304,191,274,3,256,4,3650\0311988,2,6,Grell\0303650,2,6,Asterion\0312,148,1439,0,\0302,0,0,6,Bashal'Aran\031954,19,954,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030956,23,956,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5336,OBJECTIVE,8,15,",[95507]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Collect 8 Trapped Game from traps found in Sprung Traps in the Barrens.\030\030Vrang's Game\0313,1,71,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Sprung Traps\0302,0,0,1,Barrens\031\031",[95508]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Help Walton survive the encounter with Terry Longdrink and the Kul Tiras marines.\030\030Assist Walton\030\030Unwelcome Guests\0313,1,81,2,392,1,0\0305,1,13,3,384,1,0\031\031\031\031",[956]="PARTIAL\031consequences,motivations,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031It... it is hard for me to even believe that what I hold now is that which has held me for so long. Let us waste no time, $N. When the seal is destroyed, I might walk the forests of the earth freely again.\030If the grells have come into close contact with the seal that binds my eternal prison, I suspect I know the cause. No doubt the seal has come into the possession of the satyr that lead them.$B$BI feel strongly that this must be true, $n. One of the satyr must surely possess it. If you can obtain it, you would bring me so close to passing the bars of my prison that tears would come to my eyes.\030Obtain the Ancient Moonstone Seal and bring it to Asterion in Bashal'Aran.\030The pillars of this shrine are as the bars of a prison to me, $N. No strength I still possess might break them, and no magic I wield might destroy them...$B$BFor a thousand years and more I have stared at them, wondering if at long last I outlived even the stone, would I be free? Or would it be invisible bars that held me then...\030Bashal'Aran\0312,1,114,2,257,4,3650\0302,116,190,2,257,1,3650\0302,195,237,2,257,1,3650\0302,239,278,2,257,1,3650\0302,280,395,2,257,4,3650\0303,1,74,2,448,1,3650\0301,7,99,4,272,4,3650\0301,101,125,4,272,1,3650\0301,127,205,4,276,4,3650\0304,1,65,3,256,1,3650\0304,67,154,3,260,4,3650\0304,159,280,3,256,4,3650\0304,282,331,3,256,4,3650\0313650,2,6,Asterion\0312,148,1439,0,\0302,0,0,6,Asterion\0302,0,0,6,Bashal'Aran\031955,19,955,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\030957,23,957,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,5338,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[95621]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Travel to the wrecked caravan and learn more about why the Kul Tirans are here.\030\030Learn why the Kul Tirans are here\030\030Trouble in the Valley\0313,1,79,2,384,1,0\0305,1,33,3,384,1,0\031\031\031\031",[957]="PARTIAL\031consequences,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031I am freed, $N! I can now see with my own eyes the changes that have come to our world... Only bits and pieces have I known. To think that when I last walked freely, the Well still stood and the Highborne held court with Azshara, our beloved queen.$B$BI sense that my jailor, my former master, Athrikus, still lives... Already my feelings of hopelessness will give way into thoughts of vengeance.\030It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color. In this flame this seal could be destroyed.$B$BBe wary in the ruins, $n...\030Destroy the Ancient Moonstone Seal at the ancient flame in Ameth'Aran, then return to Asterion in Bashal'Aran.\030\030Destroy the seal at the ancient flame\030In truth, $N, I am afraid... Afraid that your coming--all of this--is merely a figment of a deranged mind. Can you know the torture that this is? I... Please, you must go quickly.\030Bashal'Aran\0312,1,106,2,321,1,3650\0302,108,221,2,321,1,3650\0302,223,265,2,261,4,3650\0302,270,296,2,321,1,3650\0303,1,110,2,452,1,3650\0301,1,15,4,272,1,3650\0301,17,89,4,272,1,3650\0301,91,124,4,272,1,3650\0301,126,248,4,336,1,3650\0301,253,318,4,272,1,3650\0301,320,396,4,274,3,3650\0306,1,28,3,256,1,3650\0306,30,106,3,256,1,3650\0306,108,145,3,256,2,3650\0306,152,179,3,256,1,3650\0305,1,37,3,452,1,3650\0313650,2,5,Asterion\0312,148,1439,0,\0302,0,0,5,Ameth'Aran\0302,0,0,5,Asterion\0302,0,0,5,Bashal'Aran\031956,19,956,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031OBJECT,16393,OBJECTIVE,1,14,Ancient Flame",[95771]="UNRESOLVED\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,objectives,questChains,setup,stakes,storytellingContext\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030\030\030A Taste of Darkness\031\031\031\031\031",[95774]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Slay quilboars and collect 4 of Olgra's Adornments for Mankrik's memorial.\030\030Olgra's Adornments\030\030Her Name Is Olgra\0313,1,74,2,384,1,0\0305,1,18,3,384,1,0\031\031\031\031",[958]="PARTIAL\031consequences,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Though it is surely a figment of my imagination, I feel as though I can almost feel the taint of foul Highborne magic upon them. I will have these destroyed, so that their long dormant evil might never be released again.\030$C. A task I would ask of you.$B$BHave you seen the ruins of Ameth'Aran? If not, you will find them on the eastern side of the main road, some ways to the south. Once they were the home of many powerful Highborne, now they are a testament to the destruction their dabblings produced.$B$BI have been told by the Sentinels that the spirits of the Highborne persist, and that they wield their ancient magical implements. Those relics must be appropriated, so that we might destroy them.\030Retrieve 7 Highborne Relics for Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine.\030If only the tools of their undoing could have been destroyed in the cataclysm that destroyed our world... Nonetheless, we must do what we can to ensure that the horrors of our past are not repeated in the future.\030Tools of the Highborne\0312,5,30,2,257,4,3649\0302,35,72,2,321,2,3649\0302,74,161,2,257,4,3649\0302,163,283,2,321,1,3649\0302,288,417,2,321,1,3649\0302,419,483,2,263,4,3649\0303,1,65,2,448,1,3649\0301,1,128,4,336,1,3649\0301,130,220,4,278,4,3649\0304,1,105,3,260,4,3649\0304,107,212,3,258,1,3649\0313