0Capture Eastwall Tower\030Capture Northpass Tower\030Capture Plaguewood Tower\030When the towers are under our control, we will soon be able to surround the Forsaken. After that, it is only a matter of time before we can crush them.\030Establishing New Outposts\0312,1,31,2,257,1,17069\0302,33,135,2,257,1,17069\0302,137,273,2,261,3,17069\0302,278,373,2,257,1,17069\0302,375,428,2,257,4,17069\0303,1,166,2,384,3,17069\0301,1,14,4,272,1,17069\0301,16,187,4,278,3,17069\0309,1,85,3,256,3,17069\0309,87,151,3,264,1,17069\0305,1,25,3,384,1,17069\0306,1,22,3,384,1,17069\0307,1,23,3,384,1,17069\0308,1,24,3,384,1,17069\03117069,2,6,Emmisary Whitebeard\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,1,Plaguelands\0302,0,0,6,Eastern Plaguelands\0302,0,0,6,Emmisary Whitebeard\0302,0,0,6,Light's Hope Chapel\031\031NPC,17689,OBJECTIVE,1,13,<TXT>Crown Guard Capture Quest Doodad\030NPC,17690,OBJECTIVE,1,13,<TXT>Eastwall Capture Quest Doodad\030NPC,17696,OBJECTIVE,1,13,<TXT>Northpass Capture Quest Doodad\030NPC,17698,OBJECTIVE,1,13,<TXT>Plaguewood Capture Quest Doodad",[96646]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Speak with Zerril Softbreeze in Shen'dar Village to learn to become a cook.\030\030Camping 101: Cooking\0313,1,75,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Shen'dar Village\031\031",[9665]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections,questChains,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030objectiveLabel2\030objectiveLabel3\030objectiveLabel4\030objectiveLabel5\030requestItems\030title\031This is good news, $N. It will be a constant struggle here in the Plaguelands until we have fully driven back the forces of the Alliance.$B$BUntil that day, I hope that we will have your continued assistance.\030Agents of the Forsaken uncovered an Alliance plot to establish new bases here in the Eastern Plaguelands, at abandoned towers throughout the area.$B$BIt is imperative that we not allow them to establish a significant presence on our eastern borders, and so we must stave off this Alliance incursion. Our current plans are to drive them out of any towers they may have already seized, and occupy those that we have under our control against further attacks.\030Capture Crown Guard Tower, Eastwall Tower, Northpass Tower and Plaguewood Tower in the Eastern Plaguelands, then return to Emmisary Gormok at Light's Hope Chapel.\030\030Capture Crown Guard Tower\030Capture Eastwall Tower\030Capture Northpass Tower\030Capture Plaguewood Tower\030They must be fools to think that we would allow them to establish bases so close to one of our capitals.$B$BWe will bleed their numbers until they turn tail and retreat back to the south.\030Bolstering Our Defenses\0312,1,146,2,257,1,17072\0302,151,299,2,257,1,17072\0302,301,456,2,261,1,17072\0303,1,162,2,384,3,17072\0301,1,22,4,272,1,17072\0301,24,137,4,272,3,17072\0301,142,208,4,274,3,17072\0309,1,104,3,256,4,17072\0309,109,187,3,256,3,17072\0305,1,25,3,384,1,17072\0306,1,22,3,384,1,17072\0307,1,23,3,384,1,17072\0308,1,24,3,384,1,17072\03117072,2,4,Emmisary Gormok\0312,139,1423,0,\0302,0,0,1,Eastern Plaguelands\0302,0,0,4,Eastern Plaguelands\0302,0,0,4,Emmisary Gormok\0302,0,0,4,Light's Hope Chapel\0304,0,0,6,Plaguelands\031\031NPC,17689,OBJECTIVE,1,13,<TXT>Crown Guard Capture Quest Doodad\030NPC,17690,OBJECTIVE,1,13,<TXT>Eastwall Capture Quest Doodad\030NPC,17696,OBJECTIVE,1,13,<TXT>Northpass Capture Quest Doodad\030NPC,17698,OBJECTIVE,1,13,<TXT>Plaguewood Capture Quest Doodad",[96652]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Bring the journal to Brakk near Razor Hill.\030\030The Adventurer\0313,1,43,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Brakk\0302,0,0,1,Razor Hill\031\031",[96655]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,qu