r. Some could surely use your aid.\030$N, my mistress, Raene Wolfrunner, awaits you in the city of Astranaar within Ashenvale. With your help, perhaps we can at least ease some of the corruption that's taken hold there.$B$BHead south from here and stay close to the road--you'll find your way there without issue if you follow those directions.\030Find Raene Wolfrunner in Ashenvale.\030\030Trek to Ashenvale\0312,1,88,2,257,1,3694\0302,90,181,2,261,4,3694\0302,186,306,2,257,4,3694\0303,1,35,2,384,1,3694\0301,1,24,4,272,1,3691\0301,26,79,4,272,1,3691\0301,81,132,4,274,3,3691\0301,134,179,4,272,4,3691\0301,184,253,4,272,4,3691\0301,255,285,4,272,4,3691\0313691,2,1,Raene Wolfrunner\0303691,2,4,Raene Wolfrunner\0312,331,1440,0,\0302,0,0,1,Ashenvale\0302,0,0,4,Ashenvale\0304,0,0,5,Darkshore\031\031",[99046]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Search for Sentinel Eralya Leafshadow on the road leading to the Oracle Glade.\030\030The Lost Runner\0313,1,78,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Oracle Glade\031\031",[99047]="MINIMAL\031conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Seek aid from Byancie in Dolaanar for Sentinel Eralya Leafshadow.\030\030Not Dead Yet\0313,1,65,2,384,1,0\0316094,2,1,Byancie\0312,0,0,1,Byancie\0302,0,0,1,Dolaanar\031\031",[99048]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,conflict,consequences,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031\030\030Find Heglan Shadeeye north of Tiragarde Keep.\030\030A Missing Hand\0313,1,45,2,384,1,0\031\0312,0,0,1,Tiragarde Keep\031\031",[99049]="MINIMAL\031characters,conclusion,consequences,locations,loreConnections,motivations,questChains,setup,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030