adgetzan Water Company, if you're interested!$B$BWith the nomads seizing all our wells, we need to exploit more free sources of water!  There is water to be had in the desert, but only to those smart enough to survey them first.$B$BTake this dowsing widget and tap a sample of the water by the pool near Sandsorrow Watch.  It's right in sight of the trolls around there.  Bring the tapped widget back to me when you're done!\030Use the untapped dowsing widget near the pool of water by Sandsorrow Watch.  Once you have collected the sample, return the tapped dowsing widget to Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser in Gadgetzan.\030Welcome back, Junior Surveyor $n!  Have you completed your assignment yet?\030Gadgetzan Water Survey\0312,1,117,2,257,4,7724\0302,122,206,2,259,1,7724\0302,209,300,2,257,1,7724\0302,305,393,2,257,1,7724\0302,396,442,2,257,1,7724\0302,445,496,2,257,1,7724\0303,1,75,2,384,1,7724\0303,78,191,2,384,1,7724\0301,1,12,4,272,2,7724\0301,15,71,4,272,2,7724\0301,74,146,4,272,1,7724\0301,151,294,4,272,1,7724\0301,297,336,4,272,1,7724\0301,339,432,4,272,1,7724\0301,435,461,4,304,1,7724\0304,1,33,3,256,1,7724\0304,36,74,3,256,2,7724\0317724,2,8,Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser\0312,440,1446,0,\0302,0,0,1,Gadgetzan Water Company\0302,0,0,4,Sandsorrow Watch\0302,0,0,8,Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser\0302,0,0,8,Gadgetzan\03182,23,82,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031ITEM,8585,OBJECTIVE,1,15,",[993]="PARTIAL\031conflict,consequences,loreConnections,stakes\031completion\030description\030objective\030requestItems\030title\031Wonderful! Terenthis found someone to help me.$B$BAnd look. a moonstalker cloak...<cough> Oh... that hurts. Thank you, $N.$B$BThe furbolgs wounded me before I managed to evade them. Give me a moment, and I should be fine to talk some more.\030The cloak is complete, $N. The time has come to find Volcor. I can only hope we are in time.$B$BThe cloak's magic, once invoked, will not last long; perhaps five minutes. It will be up to you to know when to use it: I would suggest waiting until you find Grimclaw.$B$BIf what he has told me is true, you will find his master in a cave south of here. Grimclaw will be alongside the road waiting for you. Signal to him by waving when you see him, and he'll point the way towards his master.\030Find Volcor in Darkshore and give him the Enchanted Moonstalker Cloak.\030\030A Lost Master\0312,1,26,2,257,1,3693\0302,28,60,2,257,1,3693\0302,62,92,2,259,3,3693\0302,97,170,2,257,4,3693\0302,172,264,2,257,4,3693\0302,269,349,2,257,4,3693\0302,351,402,2,257,3,3693\0302,404,488,2,257,1,3693\0303,1,70,2,384,1,3693\0301,1,10,4,272,1,3692\0301,12,46,4,272,1,3692\0301,51,59,4,272,1,3692\0301,61,95,4,272,1,3692\0301,97,107,4,272,1,3692\0301,109,122,4,272,1,3692\0301,127,181,4,272,1,3692\0301,183,239,4,272,1,3692\0313692,2,2,Volcor\0303695,2,5,Grimclaw\0303695,2,7,Grimclaw\0303692,2,9,Volcor\0302069,2,9,Moonstalker\0303693,4,11,Terenthis\0302069,4,13,Moonstalker\0312,148,1439,0,\0302,0,0,9,Darkshore\031986,19,986,NO_KNOWN_BRANCH_CONFLICT\031",[994]="PARTIAL\031consequences,loreConnections\031completion\030description\030objective\030objectiveLabel1\030requestItems\030title\031$N! I'm pleased to see you've returned successfully. Your assistance to Volcor has given me faith that we can overcome the challenges facing us here in Darkshore and beyond.\030All right, $N, force it is. Let's get out of here as soon as you're ready. We'll fight our way down to the road--Grimclaw should still be there. Once there, we can part ways.$B$BTerenthis will want to hear your version of the story immediately, so head to Auberdine after we make it out of here.\030Protect Volcor until you reach the road, then speak to Terenthis in Auberdine.\030Help Volcor to the road\030\030Escape Through Force\0312,1,27,2,257,1,3692\0302,29,74,2,257,1,3692\0302,76,144,2,261,1,3692\0302,146,174,2,257,1,3692\0302,179,295,2,259,3,3692\0303,1,78,2,396,1,3692\0301,5,52,4,272,1,3693\0301,54,173,4,272,1,3693\0304,1,23,3,384,1,3692\0313693,2,5,Terenthis\0